00445na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002000007264002400027300002300051500024500074542002800319007E0100aAuto Erase Disc 1bNintendoc2007-2-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe following disc was used within authorized Nintendo repair stores to quickly wipe all of the contents on Wii systems which were brought in for return. A detailed list of instructions on operating the disc appear on the front of the case.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB00415na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264002400040300002300064500016900087542002800256655002100284091E0000aMovie-Ch Install Disc Ver. A 1bNintendoc2008-10-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis disc imports the “Wii + Internet” video on the Wii, which tells you reasons why you should connect your Wii to the Internet. It was used in repair centers.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aSoftware2wiiext00437na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264002500038300002300063500019200086542002800278655002100306410E0100aWii Back Up Disc Ver. 1.31 1bNintendoc2008-10-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Wii Backup Disc is a service disc apparently used inside Official Nintendo Repair shops to transfer personal data like savegames and console settings between Wiis as part of a repair.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aSoftware2wiiext00494na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264002100042300002300063500024900086542002800335655002100363413E0100aDiscUpdate Disc (WiiMenu 3.0U) 1bNintendoc2006--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe DiscUpdate Disc is a disc used at authorized Nintendo repair centres. It installs an update on a Wii console via the Wii System Menu's update mechanism, and verifies that the update has been installed using a special program ("boot-steve").  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aSoftware2wiiext00226na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004800007264002000055300002300075500000500098542002500103D2AJAF00aMinna de Bouken! Family Trainer (Taikenban) 1bNamcoc2011-3-7  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2011kNamcosGameTDB01025na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264004100032300002300073500074800096542004600844655002500890D2SE1800aDeca Sports 2 (Demo) 1bHudson Entertainment, Inc.c2009-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's a top-ten all over again as Deca Sports 2 offers another all-you-can-play buffet of ten games anyone can enjoy. The all-around collection has something for everyone, with tennis, darts, ice hockey, motorcycle racing, synchronized swimming, speed skating, downhill skiing, bocce, kendo, and dodgeball. Multiple single and multiplayer modes offer tournaments, head-to-head matches, skill contests, and league play. Use the Team Editor to customize everything about your squad, including your team's name, logo, and colors, plus the looks and skills of the players themselves. And, just to make sure the playing field is level, beginners can learn the ropes of any of the sports in Tutorial Mode. (The Demo lets you play 4 sports of the 10!)  i2009kHudson Entertainment, Inc.sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00378na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264002600032300002300058500013100081542003100212655002500243D3DE1800aDeca Sports 3 (Demo) 1bHudson Softc2010-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aDeca Sports 3 Demo includes: Volleyball, Lacrosse, Racquetball,  and Air Racing! Can be played with Wii MotionPlus or without.  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext01237na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264003400030300002300064500097400087542003801061655002801099DASE4Q00aEpic Mickey (Demo) 1bDisney Interactivec2010-10-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aDisney Epic Mickey is an action-adventure platforming game for the Wii console that sends Mickey Mouse on an epic journey of creativity and discovery. As Mickey, the player is propelled into Wasteland, an alternate world made up of Disney’s forgotten creative efforts, and is given the power to wield paint and paint thinner to dynamically change the world while determining Mickey’s path to becoming an epic hero. Through the use of this unique paint and paint thinner, the key components of animation and Mickey’s tools for impacting his world, players will have the ability to shape how the story unfolds as they discover the concept of “Playstyle Matters” – an innovative style of gameplay created by Disney Interactive Studios’ Junction Point, led by industry luminary Warren Spector, where players creatively tackle different challenges in the world to explore all the possibilities and storylines – but with consequences for their chosen actions.  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00336na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005300007264002300060300002300083500002700106542002800133655002500161655002800186DAVE0100aMystery Case Files: The Malgrave Incident (Demo) 1bNintendoc2011-6-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIncludes a few levels!  i2011kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01533na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004600007264002400053300002300077500126700100542002801367655002801395DAXE0104aThe Legend of Zelda: Skyward Sword (Demo) 1bNintendoc2011-11-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the chronology of the series, Skyward Sword is a prequel to Ocarina of Time. The incarnation of protagonist Link that appears in the game was born and raised in Skyloft, a group of islands floating above the clouds. Leading an ordinary life there, Link discovers the Skyward Sword one day, which leads him to another, previously unknown land beneath that is ruled by evil forces.Using the sword to travel back and forth between sky and land, the mystery of why the two worlds became separated is gradually revealed to Link. The Skyward Sword becomes the Master Sword at some point in the game, and assumes the form of a female figure while giving Link advice. Producer Eiji Aonuma has stated the game's plot to be comparable to a school drama. Unlike in previous series installments, Zelda is not a princess in Skyward Sword, but a childhood friend of Link. Throughout the course of the game, Zelda disappears and Link has to find her. He is opposed on his quest by the Demon Lord Ghirahim, a mysterious and powerful figure who rules the surface world, who wishes to kidnap Zelda for unknown purposes. Skyward Sword connects to the story of Ocarina of Time, and elaborates on Ganondorf's origins. (Demo version includes Bird Riding, Dungeon, and Boss Battle).  i2011kNintendosGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext01599na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004600007264002400053300002300077500126600100542002801366655002501394655002801419655001801447DAXP0104aThe Legend of Zelda: Skyward Sword (Demo) 1bNintendoc2011-11-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the chronology of the series, Skyward Sword is a prequel to Ocarina of Time. The incarnation of protagonist Link that appears in the game was born and raised in Skyloft, a group of islands floating above the clouds. Leading an ordinary life there, Link discovers the Skyward Sword one day, which leads him to another, previously unknown land beneath that is ruled by evil forces.Using the sword to travel back and forth between sky and land, the mystery of why the two worlds became separated is gradually revealed to Link. The Skyward Sword becomes the Master Sword at some point in the game, and assumes the form of a female figure while giving Link advice. Producer Eiji Aonuma has stated the game's plot to be comparable to a school drama. Unlike in previous series installments, Zelda is not a princess in Skyward Sword, but a childhood friend of Link. Throughout the course of the game, Zelda disappears and Link has to find her. He is opposed on his quest by the Demon Lord Ghirahim, a mysterious and powerful figure who rules the surface world, who wishes to kidnap Zelda for unknown purposes. Skyward Sword connects to the story of Ocarina of Time, and elaborates on Ganondorf's origins. (Demo version includes Bird Riding, Dungeon, and Boss Battle)  i2011kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aDemos2wiiext00985na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005100007264002700058300002300085500067100108542003100779655002500810655002800835DBBE1800aBeyblade: Metal Fusion: Battle Fortress (Demo) 1bHudson Softc2010-11-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake your place among the best Beybladers in the world with this game that puts you inside the popular animated series. Beyblade: Metal Fusion - Battle Fortress features your favorite characters from the show and non-stop Beyblade battle action. When the world's best Beybladers disappear, you'll enter a massive fortress and battle robot bladers in a storyline created just for this game. Use a combination of powerful attacks and sharp strategy to survive Battle Mode, where you'll compete with or against three AI or human opponents. Customize your field of battle, save the blades you've made and take them with you on your Wii Remote, and more. (This is a Demo)  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00677na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264003000028300002300058500038900081542003500470655002500505655002500530DBKE6900aBoom Blox (Demo) 1bElectronic Artsc2008-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aBOOM BLOX is the must-have Wii game for Summer 2008. This action-puzzle game is the first game developed in collaboration between EA and director and producer, Steven Spielberg. This high-energy game features nearly four hundred levels, a variety of activities, a cast of over thirty wacky characters, and an easy-to-use in-game editor that allows players to express their creativity.  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00675na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264002800028300002300056500038900079542003500468655002500503655002500528DBKP6900aBoom Blox (Demo) 1bElectronic Artsc2008--  a1 Wii optical disc  aBOOM BLOX is the must-have Wii game for Summer 2008. This action-puzzle game is the first game developed in collaboration between EA and director and producer, Steven Spielberg. This high-energy game features nearly four hundred levels, a variety of activities, a cast of over thirty wacky characters, and an easy-to-use in-game editor that allows players to express their creativity.  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext01076na  a2200157   4500001000700000245001900007264002600026300002300052500068200075542003100757655002500788655002800813655002500841655003400866655001800900DCAE1800aCalling (Demo) 1bHudson Softc2010-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Calling, players begin by visiting a mysterious "Black Page" website with a simple number counter. Some say it is a bridge to something sinister; the counter indicating the number of people who have died after visiting the page. It is said that people who have visited the site and witness a certain event are drawn into a mysterious space compiled of the memories of the dead - the space between life and death. Someone or something is drawing the living there for a reason, and it is up to the player to discover the horrifying truth. In order to do so, players will use various equipment including flash lights, phones, and other items to navigate and escape the Calling.  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aHorror games2wiiext 7aSurvival horror games2wiiext 7aDemos2wiiext00678na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002000007264002100027300002300048500037500071542002500446655002400471655002400495655002500519DCHEAF00aWe Cheer (Demo) 1bNamcoc2008-9-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aWe Cheer brings the excitement and fun of cheerleading to the Wii. Use your Wii Remote(s) as pom-poms and get ready to show your team spirit while you kick, jump, flip, spin and dance to the rhythm of the hottest music from the past and present. Master your moves with precision and timing, and get ready to beat the other squads to claim the #1spot in the championship.  i2008kNamcosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00671na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004900007264002100056300002300077500037500100542002500475655002400500655002500524DCHJAF00aOha Suta Produce! Gentei Collabo Game Disc!! 1bNamcoc2009-3-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aWe Cheer brings the excitement and fun of cheerleading to the Wii. Use your Wii Remote(s) as pom-poms and get ready to show your team spirit while you kick, jump, flip, spin and dance to the rhythm of the hottest music from the past and present. Master your moves with precision and timing, and get ready to beat the other squads to claim the #1spot in the championship.  i2009kNamcosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00402na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002400007264003700031300002300068500003300091542004200124655002400166655002400190655002400214655001800238DD2P4100aJust Dance 2 (Demo) 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2010-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aDance to your favorite Hits!  i2010kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aDemos2wiiext00506na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002600026300002300052500022600075542003100301655002500332655002700357DDWE1800aLost in Shadow 1bHudson Softc2010-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThere is a Tower that rises above all in an alternate world. No one knows who built this or why it was built. One thing is certain, the Tower both casts a large shadow and at the same time is filled with moving shadows...  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00570na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002600026300002300052500029000075542003100365655002500396655002700421DDWX1800aLost in Shadow 1bHudson Softc2010-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis was used for a demo promotion at Best Buy Stores. It is assumed that the difference between this one and the press version is the inclusion of the warning screen before the demo starts. This one also times out and returns to the title screen if left inactive for a period of time.  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00622na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002400007264002100031300002300052500027500075542002800350655002700378655002700405655002600432655001800458DFNJ0100aWii Fit (Taikenban) 1bNintendoc2008--  a1 Wii optical disc  aExercising while having fun is now possible! The personal experience of Miyamoto becomes a video game and opens the borders to expand its potential to all types of audiences. We can finally say that turning on our Wii can be the start of a tough but fun fitness session.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aCoaching games2wiiext 7aExercise games2wiiext 7aFitness games2wiiext 7aDemos2wiiext00364na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004400007264001800051300002300069500004000092542002500132655002900157655002600186655001800212DFOEAF00aFood Network: Cook or Be Cooked! (Demo) 1bNamcoc2009--  a1 Wii optical disc  aTHE FIRST GAME FROM FOOD NETWORK™  i2009kNamcosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aCooking games2wiiext 7aDemos2wiiext00265na  a2200097   4500001000700000245006600007264003100073300002300104500000500127542003500132DHHJ8J00aHirano Aya Premium Movie Disc from Suzumiya Haruhi no Gekidou 1bKadokawa Shotenc2009-1-22  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kKadokawa ShotensGameTDB00723na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264004200030300002300072500041800095542004600513655002400559655001800583DHKE1800aHelp Wanted (Demo) 1bHudson Entertainment, Inc.c2009-5-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aHelp Wanted allows players to choose from completing over fifty odd jobs, including: Haunted House Monster, Clown, Make-up Artist, Pinch Hitter, Pizza Chef, Stunt Car Driver, Sumo Referee, Action Hero and Sushi Master to name just a few. The game includes multiple difficulty levels that change up the game play elements and a multiplayer feature that allows for head-to-head play on up to fifteen different jobs.  i2009kHudson Entertainment, Inc.sGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aDemos2wiiext00629na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002600041300002300067500033300090542003100423655002800454655002500482DK6E1800aMarble Saga: Kororinpa (Demo) 1bHudson Softc2009-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aSet out on an adventure with Anthony the Ant on his quest through the Ant World. Gather essential items along the way in the ultimate goal to reach the Golden Sunflower and save Anthony's colony. Face treacherous mazes, use awesome gadgets and balance the world (literally) with fun and intuitive controls only available on Wii.  i2009kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00622na  a2200109   4500001000700000245006700007264002600074300002300100500033300123542003100456655002500487DK6J1800aKororinpa 2: Anthony to Kin'iro Himawari no Tane (Otameshiban) 1bHudson Softc2009-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aSet out on an adventure with Anthony the Ant on his quest through the Ant World. Gather essential items along the way in the ultimate goal to reach the Golden Sunflower and save Anthony's colony. Face treacherous mazes, use awesome gadgets and balance the world (literally) with fun and intuitive controls only available on Wii.  i2009kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00795na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002100037300002300058500051000081542002600591655002500617655003100642DMHE0800aMonster Hunter Tri (Demo) 1bCapcomc2010-3-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aMonster Hunter Tri depicts an ecosystem where man co-exists with fantastic beasts that roam both the land and the sea. Featuring both online and offline cooperative modes, players can join online hunting parties with up to four players or play with two players on a single TV for select quests. Players also have the option to face Monster Hunter Tri's quests as a single player experience accompanied by Cha-Cha, an AI hunting partner whose tracking and trapping skills will prove invaluable in the hunt.  i2010kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00804na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002200045300002300067500051000090542002600600655002500626655003100651DMHJ0800aMonster Hunter 3 tri- (Taikenban) 1bCapcomc2009-4-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aMonster Hunter Tri depicts an ecosystem where man co-exists with fantastic beasts that roam both the land and the sea. Featuring both online and offline cooperative modes, players can join online hunting parties with up to four players or play with two players on a single TV for select quests. Players also have the option to face Monster Hunter Tri's quests as a single player experience accompanied by Cha-Cha, an AI hunting partner whose tracking and trapping skills will prove invaluable in the hunt.  i2009kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00655na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002700036300002300063500040400086542003100490655002400521DPIE1800aOops! Prank Party (Demo) 1bHudson Softc2010-10-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aOops! Prank Party even makes losing fun with embarrassing costumes and pranks for the mini-game winner to assign to any losing player, who will be stuck in the silly costume for the duration of the game. With unlockable levels and one of the most robust avatar creators in a party game, players can put their personality directly into the game, including more than 500 avatar customization elements.  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00359na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004700007264004900054300002300103500000500126542005400131655002500185655002700210DQAJK200aAquarius Baseball: Genkai no, Sono Saki e. 1bCoca-Cola (Japan) Company, Limitedc2007-9-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kCoca-Cola (Japan) Company, LimitedsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00714na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002500007264002800032300002300060500038900083542003500472655002500507655003000532655001800562DQGP6900aMySims Racing (Demo) 1bElectronic Artsc2010--  a1 Wii optical disc  aRace into an all-new adventure with the MySims! Start out at the driving school and learn the ways of the road. Work your way up to facing the toughest MySims rival racers and trickiest tracks in the land. The more you win, the more you’ll be able to customise your kart and trick it out with new gadgets and power-ups. When you’re ready, take on your friends in four-player mode!  i2010kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aDemos2wiiext00714na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264004100043300002300084500038600107542004600493655002800539655002500567DRME1800aRooms: The Main Building (Demo) 1bHudson Entertainment, Inc.c2010-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aRooms: The Main Building is a breakthrough gaming experience that blends brain-teasing adventure elements with a wholly unique world to create a journey unlike any other. Your adventure begins when an invitation abruptly arrives at your doorstep and diverts you to an entrance of a world filled with mystic beauty. Getting there is the easy part, coming home will be the adventure.  i2010kHudson Entertainment, Inc.sGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00414na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003700007264003900044300002300083500004800106542004200154655002500196655002800221655003100249DSFE7U00aMuramasa: The Demon Blade (Demo) 1bIgnition Entertainmentc2009-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aDemo version includes the first level only.  i2009kIgnition EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00613na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004100007264002500048300002300073500038900096542003000485DSRJ8P00aSonic to Himitsu no Ring (Taikenban) 1bSega Japanc2007-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aSonic brings his trademark speed and attitude to the Wii™ in his first solo adventure since 1991. In Sonic and the Secret Rings, Sonic finds himself in the colorful and vibrant world of the Arabian Nights tales. There he embarks on his most outrageous journey to date through an expansive 3D world brought to life with realistic water reflections, light bloom, and lifelike physics.  i2007kSega JapansGameTDB00231na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004500007264002300052300002300075500000500098542003000103DTOJ8P00a428: Fuusa Sareta Shibuya de (Taikenban) 1bSega Japanc2017--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2017kSega JapansGameTDB00324na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004800007264002100055300002300076500000500099542002600104655002800130655004400158DTZJ0800aTakarajima Z: Barbaros no Hihou (Taikenban) 1bCapcomc2016-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2016kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPoint-and-click adventure games2wiiext00614na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004700007264001900054300002300073500032000096542002600416655002500442655002500467DWEJA400aWinning Eleven Play Maker 2008 (Taikenban) 1bKonamic2016--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe world’s most popular soccer game is back under a new name, Pro Evolution Soccer 2008. Formerly "Winning Eleven," PES 2008 builds upon the competitive spirit embodied by its predecessor with some major improvements. PES gamers will discover a more immersive, vivid soccer experience than they’ve ever played!  i2016kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00643na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004200007264002100049300002300070500032000093542002600413655002500439655002700464655001800491DWEPA400aPES 2008: Pro Evolution Soccer (Demo) 1bKonamic2008-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe world’s most popular soccer game is back under a new name, Pro Evolution Soccer 2008. Formerly "Winning Eleven," PES 2008 builds upon the competitive spirit embodied by its predecessor with some major improvements. PES gamers will discover a more immersive, vivid soccer experience than they’ve ever played!  i2008kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext 7aDemos2wiiext00413na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264002700030300002300057500016700080542003100247655002500278DXSE1800aDeca Sports (Demo) 1bHudson Softc2008-5-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aChallenge your friends to 4 different sports. 4 of the 10 games can be played on this demo. Badminton, Supercross, Beach Volleyball, and Figure Skating! 4 player!  i2008kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00840na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005000007264002300057300002300080500053400103542002800637655002500665655002800690DZDE0104aThe Legend of Zelda: Twilight Princess (Demo) 1bNintendoc2006-5-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aLink, a young man raised as a wrangler in a small, rural village, is ordered by the mayor to attend the Hyrule Summit. He sets off, oblivious to the dark fate that has descended upon the kingdom. When he enters the Twilight Realm that has covered Hyrule, he transforms into a wolf and is captured. A mysterious figure named Midna helps him break free, and with the aid of her magic, they set off to free the land from the shadows. Link must explore the vast land of Hyrule and uncover the mystery behind its plunge into darkness.  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00870na  a2200133   4500001000700000245005000007264002300057300002300080500053400103542002800637655002500665655002800690655001800718DZDP0104aThe Legend of Zelda: Twilight Princess (Demo) 1bNintendoc2006-5-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aLink, a young man raised as a wrangler in a small, rural village, is ordered by the mayor to attend the Hyrule Summit. He sets off, oblivious to the dark fate that has descended upon the kingdom. When he enters the Twilight Realm that has covered Hyrule, he transforms into a wolf and is captured. A mysterious figure named Midna helps him break free, and with the aid of her magic, they set off to free the land from the shadows. Link must explore the vast land of Hyrule and uncover the mystery behind its plunge into darkness.  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aDemos2wiiext00312na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002400022300002300046500004300069542002800112655002500140655002500165R22E0100aFlingSmash 1bNintendoc2010-11-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aIntroducing a Spherical Smash-Hit Hero  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00303na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004200007264002500049300002300074500004300097542002800140655002500168R22J0100aTataite Hazumu: Super Smash Ball Plus 1bNintendoc2010-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aIntroducing a Spherical Smash-Hit Hero  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00404na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001500007264002500022300002300047500017100070542002800241655002500269R22P0100aFlingSmash 1bNintendoc2010-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet ready for some intense FlingSmashing action! FlingSmash for Wii combines the hands-on fun of tennis with the non-stop action and instant gratification of pinball!  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00808na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003600007264002600043300002300069500047200092542003000564655002500594655002800619655002700647R23E5200aBarbie and the Three Musketeers 1bActivisionc2009-11-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin Barbie™ on the adventure of a lifetime! Play as Corinne™, a girl from the French countryside who dreams of becoming a musketeer. Joined by three other musketeer hopefuls, together the girls will use their unique abilities to tackle obstacles and puzzles across locations from the movie. Ultimately, through the power of friendship and teamwork the girls uncover a plot against the prince and save the day, achieving their dreams and becoming true musketeers!  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00808na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003600007264002600043300002300069500047200092542003000564655002500594655002800619655002700647R23P5200aBarbie and the Three Musketeers 1bActivisionc2009-12-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin Barbie™ on the adventure of a lifetime! Play as Corinne™, a girl from the French countryside who dreams of becoming a musketeer. Joined by three other musketeer hopefuls, together the girls will use their unique abilities to tackle obstacles and puzzles across locations from the movie. Ultimately, through the power of friendship and teamwork the girls uncover a plot against the prince and save the day, achieving their dreams and becoming true musketeers!  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00635na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001600007264002400023300002300047500032300070542002800393655002500421655002800446655002700474R24J0100aChibi-Robo! 1bNintendoc2009-6-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aPart of Nintendo's new play control series Chibi-Robo! is about a small robot of the same name. He is given as a birthday gift to Jenny Sanderson, a girl who wears a frog hat and only speaks in ribbits, by her father, much to the dismay of his wife who is upset over how much he spends on toys despite his unemployment  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext01066na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264005900040300002300099500070600122542006300828655002500891655002800916R25EWR00aLEGO Harry Potter: Years 1-4 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2010-6-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aLEGO Harry Potter Years 1-4 combines two of the most beloved franchises to deliver a magical, fun-filled adventure. Based on Harry’s first four books and films - fans can experience Harry’s first four years at Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry in a new an exciting way. Players will build the adventure from Privet Drive to the Triwizard Tournament in an interactive journey that takes them through some of the most detailed and expansive environments ever created for a LEGO game. Featuring potion-making, spell-casting, puzzle-solving, and more, players of all ages can relive the adventures like never before with the humor and creative customization that is unique to LEGO videogames.  i2010kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00946na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264005900040300002300099500058600122542006300708655002500771655002800796R25PWR00aLEGO Harry Potter: Years 1-4 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2010-6-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aLEGO Harry Potter: Years 1-4 will give gamers the chance to experience the magic and adventure of Harry Potter in a uniquely LEGO way. Playing as Harry Potter, Ron Weasley and Hermione Granger, as well as more than 100 other favorite characters, gamers will have the opportunity to attend lessons, cast spells, mix potions, fly on broomsticks and complete tasks to earn rewards. Throughout the game, players will also have the freedom to explore iconic settings from the wizarding world including Hogwarts™ castle, Diagon Alley, the Forbidden Forest and the village of Hogsmeade.  i2010kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01148na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264003300037300002300070500084600093542003700939655002500976655002501001R26E5G00aData East Arcade Classics 1bMajesco Sales Incc2010-2-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlayers can now enjoy some of the best shooter, sports, puzzle and twitch action video games ever created in one convenient package. Data East Arcade Classics features 15 nostalgic titles, including: BurgerTime and its sequel, Peter Pepper's Ice Cream Factory, Bad Dudes vs. Dragon Ninja, Burnin' Rubber, Heavy Barrel, Caveman Ninja, Magical Drop III, Side Pocket and many more. The collection keeps the classics intact but also includes special updates for the modern gamer: players can link their high scores to their Mii and accomplish 75 different goals across the games that let them unlock a wealth of bonus material, from soundtracks to bezels. Finally, all 15 games support single player and 2-player head-to-head or co-operative multiplayer along with Wii Remote and Nunchuk, Classic Controller or GameCube controller functionality.  i2010kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00289na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264002300042300002300065500003600088542002700124655002800151R27E5400aDora Saves the Crystal Kingdom 1b2K Playc2009-11-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aReady for a colorful adventure?  i2009k2K PlaysGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00388na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003500007264003500042300002300077500003600100542003800136655002500174655002800199655002700227R27X5400aDora Saves the Crystal Kingdom 1bTake 2 Interactivec2009-11-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aReady for a colorful adventure?  i2009kTake 2 InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00944na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264004600022300002300068500063100091542005000722655002500772655002500797R28E5400aTop Spin 4 1bTake 2 Interactive / 2K Sportsc2011-3-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aTop Spin returns for a fourth time, and the tennis franchise has brought a very special guest. Superstar Andre Agassi makes his first video game appearance in a decade in Top Spin 4! Choose from the deepest Top Spin roster yet and take the court with the best in the world. Dig in for grueling battles designed to deliver the same intensity of an epic boxing match. Each point is packed with remarkable detail, from the spin on the ball to the signature actions of your favorite players. Whether you're playing online or off, you can improve by earning experience points or hiring coaches who help you develop specific skills.  i2011kTake 2 Interactive / 2K SportssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aTennis games2wiiext00944na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264004600022300002300068500063100091542005000722655002500772655002500797R28P5400aTop Spin 4 1bTake 2 Interactive / 2K Sportsc2011-3-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aTop Spin returns for a fourth time, and the tennis franchise has brought a very special guest. Superstar Andre Agassi makes his first video game appearance in a decade in Top Spin 4! Choose from the deepest Top Spin roster yet and take the court with the best in the world. Dig in for grueling battles designed to deliver the same intensity of an epic boxing match. Each point is packed with remarkable detail, from the spin on the ball to the signature actions of your favorite players. Whether you're playing online or off, you can improve by earning experience points or hiring coaches who help you develop specific skills.  i2011kTake 2 Interactive / 2K SportssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aTennis games2wiiext00723na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003700007264002700044300002300071500033800094542003000432655002500462655002500487655002600512655003900538R29E5200aNPPL Championship Paintball 2009 1bActivisionc2008-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe intensity of first-person-shooters and extreme sports collide in NPPL's Championship Paintball 2009. Feel the adrenaline of intense tournament and woodsball action like never before as you take your game to the next level. With the most authentic and realistic paintball game to date, you'll feel like you're right in the action.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00674na  a2200121   4500001000700000245007400007264002600081300002300107500033800130542003000468655002500498655002900523R29P5204aThe Millennium European Paintball Series: Championship Paintball 2009 1bActivisionc2009-3-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe intensity of first-person-shooters and extreme sports collide in NPPL's Championship Paintball 2009. Feel the adrenaline of intense tournament and woodsball action like never before as you take your game to the next level. With the most authentic and realistic paintball game to date, you'll feel like you're right in the action.  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00635na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264004200035300002300077500031400100542004600414655002500460655002800485R2AE7D00aIce Age 2: The Meltdown 1bSierra Entertainment, Inc.c2006-12-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aIce Age 2: The Meltdown takes you back in time for a great adventure! The world is melting and your Ice Age pals need help escaping from the rising waters. Swim, splash, scamper and scurry through all the action and adventure from the new Ice Age 2 movie and unearth fun, laughter and surprises along the way!  i2006kSierra Entertainment, Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00595na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002300035300002300058500031400081542002600395655002500421655002700446R2AP7D00aIce Age 2: The Meltdown 1bSierrac2006-12-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aIce Age 2: The Meltdown takes you back in time for a great adventure! The world is melting and your Ice Age pals need help escaping from the rising waters. Swim, splash, scamper and scurry through all the action and adventure from the new Ice Age 2 movie and unearth fun, laughter and surprises along the way!  i2006kSierrasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00595na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002300035300002300058500031400081542002600395655002500421655002700446R2AX7D00aIce Age 2: The Meltdown 1bSierrac2006-12-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aIce Age 2: The Meltdown takes you back in time for a great adventure! The world is melting and your Ice Age pals need help escaping from the rising waters. Swim, splash, scamper and scurry through all the action and adventure from the new Ice Age 2 movie and unearth fun, laughter and surprises along the way!  i2006kSierrasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00821na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002200027300002300049500054700072542002500619655003100644655002400675R2DEEB00aDokapon Kingdom 1bAtlusc2008-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Kingdom of Dokapon is a land of wealth and riches ruled by a gold-loving King and his daughter Princess Penny. One day, monsters begin appearing all over the realm, assaulting the towns and stealing all of the empire's wealth. The King, unable to collect taxes from his impoverished citizens, calls for heroes from across the land to come and rid his monarchy of these monsters. The prize for the hero who is able to free the land: The hand of Princess Penny and rule of the Kingdom itself! Warning : relationship counseling not included!  i2008kAtlussGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext00828na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002100035300002300056500054700079542002500626655003100651655002400682R2DJEP00aDokapon Kingdom for Wii 1bStingc2008-7-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Kingdom of Dokapon is a land of wealth and riches ruled by a gold-loving King and his daughter Princess Penny. One day, monsters begin appearing all over the realm, assaulting the towns and stealing all of the empire's wealth. The King, unable to collect taxes from his impoverished citizens, calls for heroes from across the land to come and rid his monarchy of these monsters. The prize for the hero who is able to free the land: The hand of Princess Penny and rule of the Kingdom itself! Warning : relationship counseling not included!  i2008kStingsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00823na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002200027300002300049500054800072542002600620655003100646655002400677R2DPJW00aDokapon Kingdom 1bBigBenc2010-3-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Kingdom of Dokapon is a land of wealth and riches ruled by a gold-loving King and his daughter Princess Penny. One day, monsters begin appearing all over the realm, assaulting the towns and stealing all of the empire¿s wealth. The King, unable to collect taxes from his impoverished citizens, calls for heroes from across the land to come and rid his monarchy of these monsters. The prize for the hero who is able to free the land: The hand of Princess Penny and rule of the Kingdom itself! Warning : relationship counseling not included!  i2010kBigBensGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00312na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264003900025300002300064500000500087542004300092655002900135655002600164R2EJ9900aFish Eyes Wii 1bMarvelous Entertainmentc2009-4-30  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kMarvelous EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFishing games2wiiext00593na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264003700042300002300079500031200102542004100414655002800455R2FE5G00aFreddi Fish: Kelp Seed Mystery 1bMajesco Entertainmentc2008-8-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrandma Grouper's kelp seeds are missing and, without them, all of the sea creatures will go hungry! Help underwater detective Freddi Fish and her finny friend Luther solve the case. Explore marine caves, deep canyons, and fascinating places like King Crab's Castle in an effort to rescue the colorful reef!  i2008kMajesco EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00603na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005200007264003300059300002300092500031200115542003800427655002800465R2FP7000aFreddi Fish: The Case of the Missing Kelp Seeds 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2009-4-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrandma Grouper's kelp seeds are missing and, without them, all of the sea creatures will go hungry! Help underwater detective Freddi Fish and her finny friend Luther solve the case. Explore marine caves, deep canyons, and fascinating places like King Crab's Castle in an effort to rescue the colorful reef!  i2009kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00934na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004700007264002700054300002300081500060800104542003100712655003100743655003800774R2GEXJ00aFragile Dreams: Farewell Ruins of the Moon 1bXseed Gamesc2010-3-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aFRAGILE DREAMS: FAREWELL RUINS OF THE MOON finds protagonist Seto exploring an eerie and abandoned world, seemingly populated only by haunting ghosts and demons. As this lonely and lost soul, players encounter memorable characters, and discover the back story behind scavenged items that provide insight into the population’s last days before a devastating apocalypse. Amidst this strangely beautiful atmosphere, players utilize the Wii Remote as a flashlight to illuminate Seto’s surroundings, solve puzzles and interact with the bleak, devastated environment, set to a moving, emotional soundtrack  i2010kXseed GamessGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aAction role-playing games2wiiext00297na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002100045300002300066500000500089542002500094655002500119655003100144R2GJAF00aFragile: Sayonara Tsuki no Haikyo 1bNamcoc2009-1-22  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kNamcosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00921na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004700007264002700054300002300081500060800104542003100712655002500743655003100768R2GP9900aFragile Dreams: Farewell Ruins of the Moon 1bRising Starc2010-3-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aFRAGILE DREAMS: FAREWELL RUINS OF THE MOON finds protagonist Seto exploring an eerie and abandoned world, seemingly populated only by haunting ghosts and demons. As this lonely and lost soul, players encounter memorable characters, and discover the back story behind scavenged items that provide insight into the population’s last days before a devastating apocalypse. Amidst this strangely beautiful atmosphere, players utilize the Wii Remote as a flashlight to illuminate Seto’s surroundings, solve puzzles and interact with the bleak, devastated environment, set to a moving, emotional soundtrack  i2010kRising StarsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00671na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264003900028300002300067500035800090542004200448655002900490655003000519R2HE4100aPetz: Horse Club 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2008-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aCan you raise, care, and love your own pet horse? Tame Wild Mustangs: Go on an adventure discovering and caring for wild horses. Ride with a Friend: Collect hidden bonuses with a pal and redeem cool unlockable items. Care for Your Very Own Foal: Gain the trust of your foals and horses as you raise, nurture, and love them. The Ultimate Horse Adventure!  i2008kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00427na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264003100025300002300056500013900079542003500218655002500253655002700278R2IE6900aMadden NFL 10 1bElectronic Artsc2009-8-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aMadden NFL 10 epitomizes what fun looks like on the Wii, delivering the most social and dynamic experience from the franchise to date.  i2009kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00870na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264003100025300002300056500062100079542003500700655002500735R2IP6900aMadden NFL 10 1bElectronic Artsc2009-8-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor more than two decades, the Madden NFL series has delivered an authentic pro football experience steeped in all the aggressive power, strategy and emotion of the NFL. With Madden NFL 10 for the Wii, the legendary franchise roars back into action, combining NFL authenticity with thrilling multiplayer fun that lets you revel in the excitement of pro football. Gather the gang for a cooperative trip down the road to the Super Bowl, or compete in an epic battle to determine who among your circle of friends is the ultimate Madden player as Madden NFL 10 steeps you in the world of the NFL as only John Madden can.  i2009kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00268na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264003500033300002300068500000500091542003800096655002400134R2JJAF00aTaiko no Tatsujin Wii 1bNamco Bandai Gamesc2008-12-11  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kNamco Bandai GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext01318na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002000007264002500027300002300052500100500075542002901080655002501109655002501134655002501159R2KE5400aDon King Boxing 1b2K Sportsc2009-3-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience boxing action both inside and outside the ring. Don King Presents Prizefighter is equal parts sports simulation and true boxing drama. The action within the squared-circle accurately mimics the sport's tactics and hard knocks by letting you create angles and openings using a full arsenal of true 3D motion captured movement and punch mechanics found only in the real world sport? until now. Outside the ring, the drama continues as you are faced with temptations inherent in any professional athletes' life, where you must balance these trappings of notoriety with the hardship of training in order to find the road to glory. As you progress through your career, a live-action documentary tells your story, warts and all. 14 fight gyms and arenas including the renowned Madison Square Garden, Trump's Taj Mahal, and Boardwalk Hall in Atlantic City. Multiplayer lets you go head-to head against your opponents on the same machine or online to see who is the better fighter pound-for-pound.  i2009k2K SportssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext01299na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264003400027300002300061500100500084542003801089655002501127655002501152R2KP5400aDon King Boxing 1bTake 2 Interactivec2009-3-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience boxing action both inside and outside the ring. Don King Presents Prizefighter is equal parts sports simulation and true boxing drama. The action within the squared-circle accurately mimics the sport's tactics and hard knocks by letting you create angles and openings using a full arsenal of true 3D motion captured movement and punch mechanics found only in the real world sport? until now. Outside the ring, the drama continues as you are faced with temptations inherent in any professional athletes' life, where you must balance these trappings of notoriety with the hardship of training in order to find the road to glory. As you progress through your career, a live-action documentary tells your story, warts and all. 14 fight gyms and arenas including the renowned Madison Square Garden, Trump's Taj Mahal, and Boardwalk Hall in Atlantic City. Multiplayer lets you go head-to head against your opponents on the same machine or online to see who is the better fighter pound-for-pound.  i2009kTake 2 InteractivesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext00798na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004600007264004400053300002300097500046000120542004700580655002400627655002500651R2LJMS00aHula Wii: Hula de Hajimeru: Bi to Kenkou! 1bMilestone - UFO Interactivec2008-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aBy utilizing the Wii Balance Board, players can take Hula lessons right in front of the television and learn how to shake, gesticulate, and dance like a native Hawaiian. In addition to the tutorials, the software also includes footage of dancers doing the Hula in the classic style. A video travelogue developed with the participation of the Hawaii Tourism Authority is also included on the Wii DVD which shows off the sights and natural beauty of Hawaii.  i2008kMilestone - UFO InteractivesGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00772na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264002000027300002300047500054400070542002300614655002500637R2ME2000aM&M's Adventure 1bZooc2008-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aYour favorite colorful candy characters are back in their first free-roaming adventure. It's the end of the day at the M&M's Candy Factory, but one packet of candy is missing from the delivery truck. It's your mission to explore each sector of the factory and discover all of the scattered hidden candies in order to make the delivery on time. Run on conveyor belts, jump around packing crates, and sneak your way around the factory - but be prepared for the Bosses that are waiting to thwart the mission and keep the candies from leaving.  i2008kZoosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00727na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264003500030300002300065500042300088542003900511655002500550655003000575R2NE6900aNASCAR Kart Racing 1bElectronic Arts Incc2009-2-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience the thrill of racing with the pack-on and off the track-with NASCAR Kart Racing! Grab the steering wheel as a famed NASCAR driver and speed off through treacherous terrain, wind around rocky cliffs, jump rivers and dodge falling boulders. Invite your family and friends to join the fun! Compete together to see who will be the first to fly across the finish line and enjoy the glory of a coveted NASCAR win!  i2009kElectronic Arts IncsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00920na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002200026300002300048500065200071542002500723655002500748655002500773R2OE6800aMedieval Games 1bVir2Lc2009-10-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen in doubt, get ready to go medieval! Choose from eight different characters, including knights, wizards, princesses, bards, jesters, and goons. Play in 30 unique mini-games, each with a Medieval theme and its own flavor. You'll have to knock the other man off his horse in Jousting. Play as a pig and race through a sloppy pen, trying to avoid capture by your owner. You'll compete in archery competitions and prove your capabilities with a catapult. And show your martial skills when you battle dragons and storm castles. Unlock secret items as you play through each event. And join with friends to have an uproarious time while back in time!  i2009kVir2LsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00898na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264003000026300002300056500065200079542003300731655002400764R2OP6800aMedieval Games 1bVir2L Studiosc2009-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen in doubt, get ready to go medieval! Choose from eight different characters, including knights, wizards, princesses, bards, jesters, and goons. Play in 30 unique mini-games, each with a Medieval theme and its own flavor. You'll have to knock the other man off his horse in Jousting. Play as a pig and race through a sloppy pen, trying to avoid capture by your owner. You'll compete in archery competitions and prove your capabilities with a catapult. And show your martial skills when you battle dragons and storm castles. Unlock secret items as you play through each event. And join with friends to have an uproarious time while back in time!  i2009kVir2L StudiossGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00624na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002200037300002300059500034700082542002500429655002500454655002300479R2PE9B00aSuper Swing Golf Season 2 1bTecmoc2007-12-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aSwing into action with your favorite characters as they return to the island to challenge new courses with all new story and tournament modes. New multiplayer modes have been introduced to keep the party going with friends and family. With completely new customizations, costumes, and secrets, Super Swing Golf Season 2 is a true hole-in-one!  i2007kTecmosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00626na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264002200039300002300061500034700084542002500431655002500456655002300481R2PJ9B00aSwing Golf Pangya 2nd Shot! 1bTecmoc2007-11-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aSwing into action with your favorite characters as they return to the island to challenge new courses with all new story and tournament modes. New multiplayer modes have been introduced to keep the party going with friends and family. With completely new customizations, costumes, and secrets, Super Swing Golf Season 2 is a true hole-in-one!  i2007kTecmosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00637na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264002700039300002300066500034700089542003100436655002500467655002300492R2PKZ400aSwing Golf Pangya 2nd Shot! 1bNtreev Softc2008-4-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aSwing into action with your favorite characters as they return to the island to challenge new courses with all new story and tournament modes. New multiplayer modes have been introduced to keep the party going with friends and family. With completely new customizations, costumes, and secrets, Super Swing Golf Season 2 is a true hole-in-one!  i2008kNtreev SoftsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00802na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264004100028300002300069500049500092542004500587655002500632655002300657R2PP9900aSuper Swing Golf 1bRising Star Games Limitedc2008-9-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first Super Swing Game a.k.a Pangya (in Japan and Korea) similar to Hot Shots Golf but based off the Pangya series from Japan, this version's system has been totally revamped for the Wii's control scheme, utilizing the Wii Remote for swinging and putting. The player has ten different courses to play on, ranging from simple lush and green tees to a wind tunnel no less and can choose from eight different characters, each with their own story-line if the player chooses the Story Mode.  i2008kRising Star Games LimitedsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00307na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004900007264002100056300002300077500000500100542002500105655002900130655002600159R2QJC000aCooking Mama 2: Taihen!! Mama wa Ooisogashi! 1bTaitoc2008-12-4  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kTaitosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aCooking games2wiiext00742na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264003300026300002300059500044200082542003700524655002900561655003000590R2RE4F00aPony Friends 2 1bEidos Interactivec2010-2-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aPony Friends 2 welcomes players back to the stables with all new features that let them become best friends with their perfect pony. As part of a comprehensive pet simulation experience, pony lovers can customize their ponies and explore tricks, trails, quests, racing and much more. Additionally, Pony Friends 2 offers a unique multiplayer experience that allows players to race against a friend and compete in pony trick championships.  i2010kEidos InteractivesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00436na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002200026300002300048500015900071542002500230655002900255655003000284R2RP4F00aPony Friends 2 1bEidosc2009-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aPony Friends 2 is the sequel to the million+ selling Pony Friends and will now be available on the Nintendo Wii and Windows PC as well as the Nintendo DS.  i2009kEidossGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext01091na  a2200157   4500001000700000245001800007264002700025300002300052500070300075542003100778655002500809655002500834655002500859655002500884655002400909R2SE1800aDeca Sports 2 1bHudson Softc2009-9-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's a top-ten all over again as Deca Sports 2 offers another all-you-can-play buffet of ten games anyone can enjoy. The all-around collection has something for everyone, with tennis, darts, ice hockey, motorcycle racing, synchronized swimming, speed skating, downhill skiing, bocce, kendo, and dodgeball. Multiple single and multiplayer modes offer tournaments, head-to-head matches, skill contests, and league play. Use the Team Editor to customize everything about your squad, including your team's name, logo, and colors, plus the looks and skills of the players themselves. And, just to make sure the playing field is level, beginners can learn the ropes of any of the sports in Tutorial Mode.  i2009kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aHockey games2wiiext 7aSkiing games2wiiext 7aTennis games2wiiext 7aDarts games2wiiext00661na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004500007264002700052300002300079500039300102542003100495655002500526R2SJ1800aDeca Sporta 2: Wii de Sports 10 Shumoku! 1bHudson Softc2009-4-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aSports Island 2 introduces new events and modes guaranteed to get everybody playing. Hudson Soft has developed ten new sporting events that are specifically designed to use the Wii controllers to great effect. Each event is built around a unique control system, perfectly designed to reflect the skill it requires, while retaining the immense playability that Hudson Soft is renowned for.  i2009kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00662na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002200027300002300049500039300072542002600465655002500491655002400516R2SP1800aSports Island 2 1bKonamic2009-5-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aSports Island 2 introduces new events and modes guaranteed to get everybody playing. Hudson Soft has developed ten new sporting events that are specifically designed to use the Wii controllers to great effect. Each event is built around a unique control system, perfectly designed to reflect the skill it requires, while retaining the immense playability that Hudson Soft is renowned for.  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00897na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264003800050300002300088500057000111542004200681655002500723655002700748R2TE4100aTeenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Smash-Up 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2009-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis four-player fighting game features the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles, as well as their enemies and friends, in melee battles similar to the Super Smash Bros. franchise. Choose from a wide variety of classic TMNT heroes and villains, each with unique acrobatic moves, weapons and combat skills that will come in handy during the free-for-all brawls. Not only can you immerse yourself in the world of TMNT through the story mode, you can also challenge your friends at home or online in a variety of multiplayer modes including tournament, battle royal, and more!  i2009kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00516na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004300007264003800050300002300088500022600111542004200337655002700379R2TP4100aTeenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Smash-Up 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2009-10-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a* FIGHT AS YOUR FAVORITE TMNT CHARACTERS: Choose from a wide variety of classic TMNT heroes and villains, each with unique acrobatic moves, weapons and combat skills that will come in handy during the free-for-all brawls.  i2009kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext01775na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001400007264003100021300002300052500145800075542003501533655002401568655002401592655002501616R2UE8P00aLet's Tap 1bSega of Americac2009-6-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aLet’s Tap is an innovative gaming experience on the Wii with easy pick-up-and-play controls that will appeal to gamers of all ages. Simply place the Wii Remote on a box or a flat surface and tap! All methods of tapping (light, medium, hard) will allow you to jump hurdles and create environmental effects such as a dazzling fireworks display. There are five multiplayer friendly game modes: Tap Runner: Sprint for the finish line in over 16 courses while avoiding obstacles including hurdles, ice wall and electric fields. (1-4 players) Rhythm Tap: There are a wide range of songs to master in Rhythm Tap. Feel the beat and tap light, medium, hard in sync with the on-screen tap indicators. (1-4 players) Silent Blocks: Different modes using light and hard taps to strategically remove blocks one at a time from the column without causing it to topple over. (1-4 players) Bubble Voyager: Clad in a space suit, solo players tap to keep their character afloat through many levels filled with dangerous objects; a double tap will launch a missile. In multiplayer matches, you will shoot each other a number of times to win. (1-4 players) Visualizer: Everyone will take their turn with several Unique stages including Fireworks, Paint, River, Gem Game and Ink. Tapping with light, medium and hard strokes produces on-screen effects ranging from a fireworks display to undersea bubbles. In special tap sequences, various sea animals will appear. (1 player)  i2009kSega of AmericasGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext01791na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001400007264002100021300002300042500145800065542002401523655002501547655002401572655002401596655002501620R2UJ8P00aLet's Tap 1bSegac2008-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aLet’s Tap is an innovative gaming experience on the Wii with easy pick-up-and-play controls that will appeal to gamers of all ages. Simply place the Wii Remote on a box or a flat surface and tap! All methods of tapping (light, medium, hard) will allow you to jump hurdles and create environmental effects such as a dazzling fireworks display. There are five multiplayer friendly game modes: Tap Runner: Sprint for the finish line in over 16 courses while avoiding obstacles including hurdles, ice wall and electric fields. (1-4 players) Rhythm Tap: There are a wide range of songs to master in Rhythm Tap. Feel the beat and tap light, medium, hard in sync with the on-screen tap indicators. (1-4 players) Silent Blocks: Different modes using light and hard taps to strategically remove blocks one at a time from the column without causing it to topple over. (1-4 players) Bubble Voyager: Clad in a space suit, solo players tap to keep their character afloat through many levels filled with dangerous objects; a double tap will launch a missile. In multiplayer matches, you will shoot each other a number of times to win. (1-4 players) Visualizer: Everyone will take their turn with several Unique stages including Fireworks, Paint, River, Gem Game and Ink. Tapping with light, medium and hard strokes produces on-screen effects ranging from a fireworks display to undersea bubbles. In special tap sequences, various sea animals will appear. (1 player)  i2008kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00710na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001400007264002000021300002300041500041500064542002400479655002400503655002400527655002500551R2UP8P00aLet's Tap 1bSegac2009-6-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aLets TAP™ is a completely innovative gaming experience on the Wii™ with easy pick-up-and-play controls that will appeal to gamers of all ages. Players simply place the Wii Remote™ on a box or a flat surface and tap! All methods of tapping (light, medium, hard) will render a variety of unique results within each game mode, allowing players to jump hurdles, create a dazzling fi reworks display and more.  i2009kSegasGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext01229na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003700007264002400044300002300068500089400091542002800985655002501013655002601038655003101064R2VE0100aSin & Punishment: Star Successor 1bNintendoc2010-6-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aSin & Punishment: Star Successor is an arcade style rail shooter that allows for a range of movement around the immediate level as the player is funneled along their path. Players can assume the role of either the male or female character, Isa and Kachi. Each can fight on the ground or in the sky with the right equipment, and utilize a diverse mix of evasive maneuvers, melee attacks in close quarters and unique special attacks. The world of Sin & Punishment: Star Successor is packed with enemies ranging from swarms of low to mid-level enemies to over-the-top bosses. In battling all these, players must use their particular mix of offensive and defensive skills to continually build point multiplier bonuses as they cash in on the enemies that they conquer. The game supports a variety of controller/controller configurations, two-player play and an online international leaderboard.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aRail shooter games2wiiext00972na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002500045300002300070500067300093542002800766655002500794655003100819R2VJ0100aTsumi to Batsu: Sora no Koukeisha 1bNintendoc2009-10-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aSin and Punishment: Star Successor is a Rail Shooting game, developed by Treasure and published by Nintendo. The game can be controlled using one of four control methods: Wii Remote with Nunchuk, Wii Zapper, Classic Controller (as well as the Classic Controller Pro) and the Nintendo GameCube Controller. Playing as either Isa or Kachi, the player traverses through on-rail levels, moving and shooting independently. Attacking enemies can either be shot at from afar, or melee attacked when they are close enough. Some missiles can be melee attacked to turn them against enemies. Getting successive enemy hits whilst remaining unscathed increases the score multiplier.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRail shooter games2wiiext01017na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004700007264002300054300002300077500067300100542002800773655002500801655002600826655003100852R2VP0100aSin and Punishment: Successor of the Skies 1bNintendoc2010-5-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aSin and Punishment: Star Successor is a Rail Shooting game, developed by Treasure and published by Nintendo. The game can be controlled using one of four control methods: Wii Remote with Nunchuk, Wii Zapper, Classic Controller (as well as the Classic Controller Pro) and the Nintendo GameCube Controller. Playing as either Isa or Kachi, the player traverses through on-rail levels, moving and shooting independently. Attacking enemies can either be shot at from afar, or melee attacked when they are close enough. Some missiles can be melee attacked to turn them against enemies. Getting successive enemy hits whilst remaining unscathed increases the score multiplier.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aRail shooter games2wiiext01232na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500094700087542002601034655002501060655002501085R2WEA400aPES 2009: Pro Evolution Soccer 1bKonamic2009-3-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aNew Look, New Content, Same Passion! Pro Evolution Soccer is back for 2009! The terms "PES" and "Winning Eleven" have always been synonymous with realism and superior gameplay, but this year PES will further narrow the gap between the game, and the real thing! New stadiums, player motions and gameplay modes will bolster a game already focused on providing the most exciting soccer experience next to actually being on the field. The 2009 installment of the award-winning sports franchise brings a raft of extensive new additions that will further bridge the gap between PES and the real thing. Improvements to the fan-favorite Master League Mode - Play as one player just like in real life mastering your own ball handling and your off-the-ball support Updated rosters from your favorite club and national teams Great improvements in ball control, passing and your teammates reactions are more in tune with how teammates react in real life.  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00736na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500045100087542002600538655002500564655002500589R2WJA400aWinning Eleven Play Maker 2009 1bKonamic2009-5-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aPES 2009 for Wii boasts three control methods, with the intuitive 'point and drag' interface of last year's game enhanced to make defending and shooting more instinctive. Players use the Nunchuck or the Wii Remote to control the player on the ball, while they pick the player to pass to, or send them on runs into space. The system has been further refined, so that close control is improved, but two new control ideas have also been implemented.  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00738na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500045100087542002600538655002500564655002700589R2WPA400aPES 2009: Pro Evolution Soccer 1bKonamic2009-3-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aPES 2009 for Wii boasts three control methods, with the intuitive 'point and drag' interface of last year's game enhanced to make defending and shooting more instinctive. Players use the Nunchuck or the Wii Remote to control the player on the ball, while they pick the player to pass to, or send them on runs into space. The system has been further refined, so that close control is improved, but two new control ideas have also been implemented.  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00699na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500045100087542002600538655002500564R2WXA400aPES 2009: Pro Evolution Soccer 1bKonamic2009-3-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aPES 2009 for Wii boasts three control methods, with the intuitive 'point and drag' interface of last year's game enhanced to make defending and shooting more instinctive. Players use the Nunchuck or the Wii Remote to control the player on the ball, while they pick the player to pass to, or send them on runs into space. The system has been further refined, so that close control is improved, but two new control ideas have also been implemented.  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00625na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264002300031300002300054500038700077542002700464655002400491R2YE5400aBirthday Party Bash 1b2K Playc2009-7-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aUp to 12 partygoers can whack, roll, splash, pop, and shimmy their way through over 20 birthday games, including twists on classic favorites like Piñata Blast, Duncan Hines Cake Stacker, and Birthday Blowout. Ten party theme rooms set the scene for an unforgettable bash, from “Pirates” to “Princess”. When it’s cake time, everyone can sing along to “Happy Birthday”.  i2009k2K PlaysGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00830na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264004500028300002300073500051400096542004900610655002400659655002500683R2YP5400aIt's My Birthday 1bTake 2 Interactive / 2K Gamesc2009-6-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aNew from the developers of ‘Carnival Funfair Games™’ comes ‘It’s My Birthday™’, the modern day birthday party experience like no other! This new game includes over 20 fully interactive classic birthday party games, and a set of fun accessories that will make your party go with a swing! Offering child-friendly action and entertainment the whole family can enjoy, It’s My Birthday includes everything you need to bring the party to your home! Just set up the game and let the party run itself!  i2009kTake 2 Interactive / 2K GamessGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00685na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003300007264002400040300002300064500034400087542002800431655002500459655002800484655003900512R32J0100aMetroid Prime 2: Dark Echoes 1bNintendoc2009-6-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn this first-person adventure, become the bounty hunter behind the visor once more and travel to a planet torn into light and darkness. Hunted by a mysterious entity and a warring race called the Ing, Samus Aran must explore the light and dark worlds of this doomed planet to discover secrets and augment her suit's weapons and abilities.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00646na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264004400044300002300088500031700111542004700428655002400475655002500499R33E6900aAC/DC Live: Rock Band Track Pack 1bElectronic Arts / MTV Gamesc2008-11-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aHarmonix, developers of the blockbuster Guitar Hero and Rock Band franchises, are delivering AC/DC LIVE, a continuation of the Rock Band platform that lets audiences of all ages interact with music in an all-new way - collaboratively, competitively, or in single-player to experience the majestic power of AC/DC.  i2008kElectronic Arts / MTV GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00534na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264003100033300002300064500024100087542003500328655002400363655002500387R33P6900aAC/DC Live: Rock Band 1bElectronic Artsc2009-1-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is a track pack for Rock Band. The original game is not required to play, 18 songs from the album Live at Donington by rock band AC/DC. Does not include many of the regular game features such as avatar customization or online play.  i2009kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00596na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264003100041300002300072500029500095542003500390655002400425655002500449R34E6900aRock Band: Country Track Pack 1bElectronic Artsc2009-7-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aRock Band Country Track Pack is a standalone software product from the creators of Rock Band and Rock Band 2. The Rock Band platform lets you and your friends form your own band and live out your rock and roll fantasies to music’s greatest soundtrack—now with a down-home country twang!  i2009kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00650na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264002000043300002300063500034700086542002400433655003100457655004000488R35JC800aSangokushi 11 with Power-Up Kit 1bKoeic2007-3-21  a1 Wii optical disc  a《三國志》是 KOEI 取材自古典小說名作「三國演義」所製作的策略模擬遊戲，以中國東漢末年三國割據的歷史題材為主題，融合國政經營與謀略戰爭的要素，玩家將扮演活躍於三國時代割據一方的諸侯或各勢力麾下的謀臣武將，為了統一天下成就霸業而努力。  i2007kKoeisGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aTactical role-playing games2wiiext00665na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002400032300002300056500038600079542002900465655002400494655002500518R36E6900aGreen Day: Rock Band 1bMTV Gamesc2010-6-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing the likenesses of Green Day members Billie Joe Armstrong, Mike Dirnt and Tré Cool, Green Day: Rock Band covers everything from the band's earliest punk hits to the epic scope of their latest albums, giving players the unique chance to experience the music of this pioneering band in a whole new environment featuring select venues and art specific to the band's history.  i2010kMTV GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00665na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002400032300002300056500038600079542002900465655002400494655002500518R36P6900aGreen Day: Rock Band 1bMTV Gamesc2010-6-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing the likenesses of Green Day members Billie Joe Armstrong, Mike Dirnt and Tré Cool, Green Day: Rock Band covers everything from the band's earliest punk hits to the epic scope of their latest albums, giving players the unique chance to experience the music of this pioneering band in a whole new environment featuring select venues and art specific to the band's history.  i2010kMTV GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00616na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264002500039300002300064500036600087542002900453655002400482R37E6900aRock Band: Metal Track Pack 1bMTV Gamesc2009-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aRock Band Track Pack: Metal is a standalone software product that allows owners of Rock Band and Rock Band 2 to keep on rocking with more hit songs from the pantheon of rock music. In addition, Rock Band Track Pack: Metal, like all Rock Band software, is compatible with all Rock Band instrument controllers and other current music-based video game peripherals.  i2009kMTV GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext00495na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264002000035300002300055500025900078542002300337655002500360R38E7800aMarvel Super Hero Squad 1bTHQc2009-10-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Super Hero City! Assemble your squad and fight your way to victory to save the citizens of Super Hero City from the evil schemes of the super villains in this multi-player adventure game inspired by the action-packed animated Marvel TV series.  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00495na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264002000035300002300055500025900078542002300337655002500360R38P7800aMarvel Super Hero Squad 1bTHQc2009-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Super Hero City! Assemble your squad and fight your way to victory to save the citizens of Super Hero City from the evil schemes of the super villains in this multi-player adventure game inspired by the action-packed animated Marvel TV series.  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00505na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264002000045300002300065500025900088542002300347655002500370R38X7800aMarvel Super Hero Squad (Walmart) 1bTHQc2009-10-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Super Hero City! Assemble your squad and fight your way to victory to save the citizens of Super Hero City from the evil schemes of the super villains in this multi-player adventure game inspired by the action-packed animated Marvel TV series.  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00495na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264002000035300002300055500025900078542002300337655002500360R38Y7800aMarvel Super Hero Squad 1bTHQc2009-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Super Hero City! Assemble your squad and fight your way to victory to save the citizens of Super Hero City from the evil schemes of the super villains in this multi-player adventure game inspired by the action-packed animated Marvel TV series.  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00699na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264002400034300002300058500037700081542002700458655002500485655002900510655002600539R39EFP00aShimano Xtreme Fishing 1bMastiffc2009-10-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aGo after more than fifty varieties of fish and fend off hungry predators like sharks, alligators and piranhas. Swim and boat through exotic environments ranging from the cold, dark waters of a North American lake to a roaring Amazon waterfall. Experience eerie submerged Mayan ruins, the hidden lagoons of a southern island and the shark-infested waters of a tropical sea.  i2009kMastiffsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFishing games2wiiext00759na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264003400035300002300069500045200092542003800544655002900582655002600611R39PNK00aShimano Extreme Fishing 1bNeko Entertainmentc2010-6-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aEmbracing the wilder side of sport fishing, Shimano Xtreme Fishing is the only videogame to let players take the fight to the fish with bow and speargun in addition to the traditional rod and reel. Featuring cutting-edge fishing gear like Shimano Voltaeus fishing rods, Hoyt bows, AMS Bowfishing reels and accessories, and Muzzy arrow points, players hunt for a legendary catch from the deck of a free-roaming boat or underwater in full SCUBA gear  i2010kNeko EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFishing games2wiiext00975na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264002500034300002300059500068200082542002900764655002800793655003200821R3AE2000aStory Hour: Adventures 1bZoo Gamesc2009-12-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aClassic fairy tales and fables had been passed down from generation to generation verbally and in books. Those traditions are now getting an interactive twist in the Story Hour series. A modern take on such beloved tales as Cinderella, Snow White, Jack and the Beanstalk, and Paul Bunyan, these tales offer four different stories that incorporate motion sensitive controls so that parents and preschoolers can tell stories together. Story Hour: Adventures features four classic stories: Paul Bunyan (illustrated by Stan Chow), Jack & The Beanstalk (illustrated by Simon Scales), Aladdin (illustrated by David Gordon) and The Three Brothers (illustrated by Constanza Basaluzzo.)  i2009kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aInteractive fiction2wiiext00975na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264002500034300002300059500068200082542002900764655002800793655003200821R3AP7J00aStory Hour: Adventures 1bZoo Gamesc2009-1-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aClassic fairy tales and fables had been passed down from generation to generation verbally and in books. Those traditions are now getting an interactive twist in the Story Hour series. A modern take on such beloved tales as Cinderella, Snow White, Jack and the Beanstalk, and Paul Bunyan, these tales offer four different stories that incorporate motion sensitive controls so that parents and preschoolers can tell stories together. Story Hour: Adventures features four classic stories: Paul Bunyan (illustrated by Stan Chow), Jack & The Beanstalk (illustrated by Simon Scales), Aladdin (illustrated by David Gordon) and The Three Brothers (illustrated by Constanza Basaluzzo.)  i2009kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aInteractive fiction2wiiext00872na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264003100026300002300057500058600080542003500666655002400701655002500725R3BE8P00aSamba de Amigo 1bSega of Americac2008-9-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe samba-inspired rhythm music game made popular in the arcades is shaking its way onto the Wii! Keeping the beat with over 40 songs on a Samba-inspired sound track, players shake the Wii Remote and Nunchuk like maracas, and compete with friends to see who has the best moves. Throughout the dynamic songs there will be opportunities to strike a pose for extra points. Friends and family will be thoroughly entertained cheering each other on as they anxiously await their next turn. Special Modes expand gameplay with Quick Play, Classic, Battle, Survival, Hustle, and Mini-games.  i2008kSega of AmericasGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00752na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002100026300002300047500048700070542002400557655002400581655002500605R3BJ8P00aSamba de Amigo 1bSegac2008-12-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe samba-inspired rhythm music game made popular in the arcades is shaking its way onto the Wii! Keeping the beat with over 40 songs on a Samba-inspired sound track, players shake the Wii Remote and Nunchuk like maracas and compete with friends to see who has the best moves. Throughout the dynamic songs there will be opportunities to strike a pose for extra points. Friends and family will be thoroughly entertained cheering each other on as they anxiously await their next turn.  i2008kSegasGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00751na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002000026300002300046500048700069542002400556655002400580655002500604R3BP8P00aSamba de Amigo 1bSegac2008-9-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe samba-inspired rhythm music game made popular in the arcades is shaking its way onto the Wii! Keeping the beat with over 40 songs on a Samba-inspired sound track, players shake the Wii Remote and Nunchuk like maracas and compete with friends to see who has the best moves. Throughout the dynamic songs there will be opportunities to strike a pose for extra points. Friends and family will be thoroughly entertained cheering each other on as they anxiously await their next turn.  i2008kSegasGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00958na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264004900035300002300084500066400107542005200771655002500823R3CE2000aChrysler Classic Racing 1bDestination Software / Zoo Gamesc2008-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou're about to become the coolest cat out there. Chrysler Classic Racing is set in America during the car-crazed era of 1950s and 1960s, and you're on a mission to become the "King of Cool" by redefining not only your own style, but creating the hippest racing vehicle on the road! With just enough dough in your pocket to buy an entry-level Chrysler, take part in "after-hours" races. Win some cash and buy new cars, better engines sweet decals, or faster tires. Or make yourself look cooler with a sleek new haircut, more fashionable threads, and swankier sunglasses. If your car looks hot and your style is slick, you could just become the "King of Cool."  i2008kDestination Software / Zoo GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext01000na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264004800035300002300083500070700106542005200813655002500865R3CP7J00aChrysler Classic Racing 1bDestination Software / Zoo Gamesc2009-3-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou might be a nerdy wallflower, but you're about to become the coolest cat out there.  Chrysler Classic Racing is set in America during the car-crazed era of 1950s and 1960s, and you're on a mission to become the "King of Cool" by redefining not only your own style, but creating the hippest racing vehicle on the road!  With just enough dough in your pocket to buy an entry-level Chrysler, take part in "after-hours" races.  Win some cash and buy new cars, better engines sweet decals, and faster tires.  Or make yourself look cooler with a sleek new haircut, more fashionable threads, and swankier sunglasses.  If your car looks hot and your style is slick, you could just become the "King of Cool."  i2009kDestination Software / Zoo GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00620na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264003700028300002300065500031700088542004200405655002500447655002600472R3DES500aDream Pinball 3D 1bSouth Peak Interactivec2008-6-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aA great pinball game should not only be amazing from the start, but should continue to be entertaining every time you play it. This was the thinking behind the development of the newest pinball sensation to hit the market, Dream Pinball 3D, with its 6 cutting edge tables that are beckoning you to try your luck.  i2008kSouth Peak InteractivesGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPinball games2wiiext00580na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264003600028300002300064500031600087542004100403655002600444R3DPS500aDream Pinball 3D 1bSouthpeak Interactivec2008-4-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aA great pinball game should not only be amazing from the start, but should continue to be entertaining every time you play it. This was the thinking behind the development of the newest pinball sensation to hit the PC - Dream Pinball 3D - with its' 6 cutting edge tables that are beckoning you to try your luck.  i2008kSouthpeak InteractivesGameTDB 7aPinball games2wiiext01117na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001700007264005900024300002300083500070200106542006300808655002500871655002400896655002800920655002300948R3EEWR00aGame Party 3 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2009-10-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aGame Party throws another can't-miss bash with this collection of 19 favorite games. The eight new games include Mini-Golf, Bocce, Croquet, Racquetball, Pool, Bumper Pool, Smack-a-Troll, and a remake of arcade classic Rootbeer Tapper. Returning Game Party events include Darts, Shuffleboard, Beanbags, Horseshoes, Trivia, Skill Ball, Hoop Shoot, Ping Cup, Puck Bowling, QB Challenge, and Lawn Darts. Each of the 11 returning games has been updated with new layouts and new levels. Round up four friends for multiplayer fun or set bracketed tournaments for 16 players. Customize your character, play righty or lefty, track your high scores, and earn game tickets to unlock special items and skills.  i2009kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBilliards games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext01116na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001700007264005900024300002300083500070200106542006300808655002500871655002500896655002400921655002500945R3EPWR00aGame Party 3 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2009-12-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aGame Party throws another can't-miss bash with this collection of 19 favorite games. The eight new games include Mini-Golf, Bocce, Croquet, Racquetball, Pool, Bumper Pool, Smack-a-Troll, and a remake of arcade classic Rootbeer Tapper. Returning Game Party events include Darts, Shuffleboard, Beanbags, Horseshoes, Trivia, Skill Ball, Hoop Shoot, Ping Cup, Puck Bowling, QB Challenge, and Lawn Darts. Each of the 11 returning games has been updated with new layouts and new levels. Round up four friends for multiplayer fun or set bracketed tournaments for 16 players. Customize your character, play righty or lefty, track your high scores, and earn game tickets to unlock special items and skills.  i2009kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00293na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264002200043300002300065500000500088542002600093655002500119655002700144R3FJA400aJikkyou Powerful Major League 3 1bKonamic2008-10-2  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00424na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264003100039300002300070500012700093542003400220655002500254655002300279R3GXUG00aKidz Sports Crazy Mini Golf 1bPopcorn Arcadec2008-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aCrazy Mini Golf uses the Wii MotionPlus to great effect to bring this all-time family favourite game into the living room.  i2008kPopcorn ArcadesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00628na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264002000036300002300056500035200079542002300431655002500454655002700479R3HP6Z00aAgent Hugo: Hula Holiday 1bNDSc2008-12-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aHe has created a force of robotized trash cans that pollute the islands in order to feed an army of fly-like creatures. All beauty has been spoiled by the flies and the local flower-like inhabitants have gone underground. Hugo accidently bumps into this situation and decides to clean up and turn the islands into a colorful and happy place again.  i2008kNDSsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00640na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264002600036300002300062500035200085542002900437655002500466655002700491R3HX6Z00aAgent Hugo: Hula Holiday 1bITE Mediac2010-12-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aHe has created a force of robotized trash cans that pollute the islands in order to feed an army of fly-like creatures. All beauty has been spoiled by the flies and the local flower-like inhabitants have gone underground. Hugo accidently bumps into this situation and decides to clean up and turn the islands into a colorful and happy place again.  i2010kITE MediasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00549na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001800007264002400025300002300049500023600072542002800308655002500336655002800361655002600389R3IJ0100aMetroid Prime 1bNintendoc2009-2-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aSamus first stopped the evil Space Pirates and Mother Brain from amassing an army of Metroids on the planet Zebes.Then she was called on to finish the job on SR388, ultimately ridding the universe of all but a single Metroid larva.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00619na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002200032300002300054500034400077542002700421655002500448655002400473R3JE5G00aGo Play: Circus Star 1bMajescoc2009-6-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe circus is in town, and you’re the star! Go Play Circus Star lets you step into the shoes of a circus performer whose job is to wow the crowd with death defying stunts, animal tricks and sleight of hand. As part of Majesco’s new Go Play line, Circus Star delivers a motion-based experience that the entire family can enjoy together!  i2009kMajescosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00689na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001500007264004600022300002300068500041200091542005100503655002500554R3KP6N00aSkyscraper 1bMidas Interactive Entertainmentc2009-8-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aWednesday night at Tigra Group: Chemical Researcher Chris Wilson finds himself walking out of the lift after it bizarrely stops at the 20th floor. Exiting the lift he finds the security guard lying dead in front of him. Panic enters his body and his vision narrows. Chris is left with a seemingly impossible mission ahead of him - survive and save his girlfriend and colleagues, by attacking his aggressors.  i2009kMidas Interactive EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00848na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004200007264005800049300002300107500048000130542006300610655002500673655002800698R3LEWR00aGreen Lantern: Rise of the Manhunters 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2011-6-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aGreen Lantern: Rise of the Manhunters is inspired by the feature film, which brings the enduringly popular DC hero to the big screen. Playing as gifted pilot Hal Jordan, the first human Green Lantern. Gamers create an arsenal of ring constructs and take flight in outer space and beyond to restore intergalactic order. Use the Power Ring to build an array of weapons from green energy to defeat the Manhunters, an evil android race bent on destroying the Green Lantern Corps.  i2011kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00848na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004200007264005800049300002300107500048000130542006300610655002500673655002800698R3LPWR00aGreen Lantern: Rise of the Manhunters 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2011-6-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aGreen Lantern: Rise of the Manhunters is inspired by the feature film, which brings the enduringly popular DC hero to the big screen. Playing as gifted pilot Hal Jordan, the first human Green Lantern. Gamers create an arsenal of ring constructs and take flight in outer space and beyond to restore intergalactic order. Use the Power Ring to build an array of weapons from green energy to defeat the Manhunters, an evil android race bent on destroying the Green Lantern Corps.  i2011kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00943na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002600007264002400033300002300057500057200080542002800652655002500680655002800705655003900733655002500772R3ME0100aMetroid Prime Trilogy 1bNintendoc2009-8-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aMetroid Prime 3: Corruption set a new standard for first-person motion controls in video games. Now it's bringing those controls to the rest of the celebrated series, allowing players to experience the entire Metroid Prime story arc with the peerless precision of the Wii Remote. Nintendo announces Metroid Prime Trilogy, a new premium three-game collection for the Wii console that bundles all three landmark Metroid Prime games onto one disc and revamps the first two installments with intuitive Wii Remote controls, wide-screen presentation and other enhancements.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext01349na  a2200157   4500001000700000245002600007264002300033300002300056500094100079542002801020655002501048655002801073655002601101655003901127655002501166R3MP0100aMetroid Prime Trilogy 1bNintendoc2009-9-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aMetroid Prime 3: Corruption set a new standard for first-person motion controls in video games. Now it's bringing those controls to the rest of the celebrated series, allowing players to experience the entire Metroid Prime story arc with the peerless precision of the Wii Remote. Nintendo announces Metroid Prime Trilogy, a new premium three-game collection for the Wii console that bundles all three landmark Metroid Prime games onto one disc and revamps the first two installments with intuitive Wii Remote controls, wide-screen presentation and other enhancements. Each game maintains its original storyline and settings, but now Metroid Prime and Metroid Prime 2: Echoes lets you use your Wii Remote to aim with precision as heroine Samus Aran. Based on the breakthrough control system that debuted in Metroid Prime 3: Corruption, these new Wii controls bring an entirely new level of immersion and freedom to these milestone games.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00585na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264002700043300002300070500032400093542003100417655002700448R3NEXS00aGuilty Gear XX Accent Core Plus 1bAksys Gamesc2009-5-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe fighting franchise that launched an entirely new style of fighting games is celebrating its 10th anniversary with the most complete and definitive version of the game on the Nintendo Wii. Follow the stories of the 25 crazy combatants and dish out a mind-numbing amount of insane combos that the series is known for.  i2009kAksys GamessGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00582na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264002500043300002300068500032400091542003000415655002700445R3NPH300aGuilty Gear XX Accent Core Plus 1bZen Unitedc2011-5-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe fighting franchise that launched an entirely new style of fighting games is celebrating its 10th anniversary with the most complete and definitive version of the game on the Nintendo Wii. Follow the stories of the 25 crazy combatants and dish out a mind-numbing amount of insane combos that the series is known for.  i2011kZen UnitedsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00554na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264002400028300002300052500027800075542002800353655002500381655002600406R3OE0100aMetroid: Other M 1bNintendoc2010-8-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aMetroid: Other M is reminiscent of 2-D side-scrollers, but players can switch the perspective into 3-D at any time as they explore the twisting passages of a derelict space station and delve deep into a cinematic, never-before-told story of bounty hunter Samus Aran's past.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00593na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002100007264002300028300002300051500027800074542002800352655002500380655002800405655002600433R3OJ0100aMetroid: Other M 1bNintendoc2010-9-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aMetroid: Other M is reminiscent of 2-D side-scrollers, but players can switch the perspective into 3-D at any time as they explore the twisting passages of a derelict space station and delve deep into a cinematic, never-before-told story of bounty hunter Samus Aran's past.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00593na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002100007264002300028300002300051500027800074542002800352655002500380655002800405655002600433R3OP0100aMetroid: Other M 1bNintendoc2010-9-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aMetroid: Other M is reminiscent of 2-D side-scrollers, but players can switch the perspective into 3-D at any time as they explore the twisting passages of a derelict space station and delve deep into a cinematic, never-before-told story of bounty hunter Samus Aran's past.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01139na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264005800038300002300096500078500119542006300904655002500967655002500992R3PEWR00aSpeed Racer: The Videogame 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2008-5-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake the wheel and GO! It's a fight to the finish as you compete at amazing speeds, racing as your favorite Speed Racer characters. Perform tricks and pull off insane stunts through incredible, twisting stadium tracks, all while fighting against rival racers with incredible Car-Fu action! Play more than 19 characters from the film featuring the voices of Emile Hirsch as Speed Racer, Matthew Fox as Racer X, and Christina Ricci as Trixie. High-speed action going over 400 MPH as you race through amazing stadiums tracks featuring loops, corkscrews, jumps and more. Master Car-Fu combat and fight your way to the finish by smashing, jumping, flipping and spinning other cars off the track Split-screen multi-player racing on the Wii lets you take on…or take out…your friends.  i2008kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext01022na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001600007264002600023300002300049500078500072542003000857655002500887R3PJ5200aSpeed Racer 1bActivisionc2008-7-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake the wheel and GO! It's a fight to the finish as you compete at amazing speeds, racing as your favorite Speed Racer characters. Perform tricks and pull off insane stunts through incredible, twisting stadium tracks, all while fighting against rival racers with incredible Car-Fu action! Play more than 19 characters from the film featuring the voices of Emile Hirsch as Speed Racer, Matthew Fox as Racer X, and Christina Ricci as Trixie. High-speed action going over 400 MPH as you race through amazing stadiums tracks featuring loops, corkscrews, jumps and more. Master Car-Fu combat and fight your way to the finish by smashing, jumping, flipping and spinning other cars off the track Split-screen multi-player racing on the Wii lets you take on…or take out…your friends.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext01102na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264005900038300002300097500078400120542006300904655002500967R3PPWR00aSpeed Racer: The Videogame 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2008-6-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake the wheel and GO! It's a fight to the finish as you compete at amazing speeds, racing as your favorite Speed Racer characters. Perform tricks and pull off insane stunts through incredible, twisting stadium tracks, all while fighting against rival racers with incredible Car-Fu action! Play more than 19 characters from the film featuring the voices of Emile Hirsch as Speed Racer, Matthew Fox as Racer X, and Christina Ricci as Trixie. High-speed action going over 400 MPH as you race through amazing stadiums tracks featuring loops, corkscrews, jumps and more. Master Car-Fu combat and fight your way to the finish by smashing, jumping, flipping and spinning other cars off the track Split-screen multi-player racing on the Wii lets you take on…or take out…your friends  i2008kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00345na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264003100041300002300072500008000095542003500175655002500210R3RE8P00aSonic & Sega All-Stars Racing 1bSega of Americac2010-2-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake part in a frantic battle to the checkered flag with Sonic and friends!  i2010kSega of AmericasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00365na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002000041300002300061500008000084542002400164655002500188655003000213R3RP8P00aSonic & SEGA All-Stars Racing 1bSegac2010-2-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake part in a frantic battle to the checkered flag with Sonic and friends!  i2010kSegasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00835na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003600038300002300074500056400097542003900661655002500700R3SE5200aSpider-Man: Web of Shadows 1bActivision Blizzardc2008-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aA deadly symbiote invasion brings devastation to New York City. In Spider-Man: Web of Shadows, the game is set in an apocalyptic vision of the city. You'll have complete control over New York City's salvation and the fate of Spider-man. It also features an all-new combat system that allows for three-dimensional battles that can start on the street and end up on rooftops. You can also switch between the red and black Spider-Man suits, choose to ally with Marvel's heroes or villains and decide what missions to undertake to save Manhattan from destruction.  i2008kActivision BlizzardsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00568na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002700038300002300065500027500088542003000363655002500393655002800418R3SP5200aSpider-Man: Web of Shadows 1bActivisionc2008-10-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen a deadly symbiote invasion devastates the streets of New York City, only Spider-Man can seize control and bring the city salvation. From the game's direction and outcome through to Spider-Man's destiny, Spider-Man: Web Of Shadows puts control in the player's hands.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00783na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002500022300002300047500051200070542002900582655002500611655002500636R3TE5400aTop Spin 3 1b2K Sportsc2008-6-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aCompete against the pros with Top Spin 3. Play online or offline to rise in the ranks against current top ranked professional players. This is a visually and physically realistic tennis experience. Using next generation technology, gameplay and graphics, Top Spin 3 features dynamic weather changes, evolutionary player visuals and comprehensive online offerings. With a unique user-generated component, you can also use new player creator features that include free-form body sculpting, makeup and tattoos.  i2008k2K SportssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aTennis games2wiiext00281na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002700022300002300049500000500072542003200077655002500109655002500134R3TJG900aTop Spin 3 1bD3 Publisherc2009-9-3  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aTennis games2wiiext00677na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264003400022300002300056500038800079542003800467655002500505655002500530R3TP5400aTop Spin 3 1bTake 2 Interactivec2008-6-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the 1st time ever on the Wii, play with or against 16 of the world's top tennis pros at 10 real-life courts. Take advantage of complete Wii Remote™ functionality to perform forehands, backhands and serves exactly as you would swing a real racquet. Compete in addictively fun multi-player mini-games or rise through the ranks in Career Mode to become the #1 player in the world.  i2008kTake 2 InteractivesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aTennis games2wiiext00276na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264002700047300002300074500000500097542003100102655003300133R3UJGD00aOyako de Asobo: Miffy no Omochabako 1bSquare Enixc2010-3-18  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00676na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002400022300002300046500040300069542002700472655002900499655002600528R3VEFP00aDeer Drive 1bMastiffc2008-12-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aDeer Drive meshes hunting simulation with arcade style pick-up-and-play action and pacing for an exciting gaming experience. Deer Drive is the first deer hunting game that features two-player simultaneous play. Additionally, Deer Drive features a multitude of game play modes, including four player party mode, true-to-life sound effects, passive and aggressive prey, and a slew of hunting weapons.  i2008kMastiffsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00840na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264005800022300002300080500050200103542006200605655002500667655002600692R3VPNK00aDeer Drive 1bNeko Entertainment / Diffusion / Naps teamc2010-9-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aDeer Drive brings arcade-style multiplayer hunting action to the Wii. With an intense one-player Challenge Mode, an exciting Party Mode for up to four players, and a new two-player simultaneous Competition Mode, Deer Drive is an intense hunting experience for parties full of people. Target scores of magnificent animals in over 30 stages. Animals can gallop, leap and swerve to dodge your shot, and animals such as wolves and mountain lions can rampage against you if you put them in your sights.  i2010kNeko Entertainment / Diffusion / Naps teamsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00950na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264003500033300002300068500068300091542003800774655002800812R3XE6U00aSam & Max: Season One 1bDreamCatcher Gamesc2008-10-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's a vile world out there. Get too complacent and all sorts of weirdos start coming out of the woodwork. Good thing Sam & Max are here to hose down the sleaze and keep some kind of peace. Violently, if possible. Who are these irreverent crime fighters? Sam's a six-foot tall canine shamus with a love of justice. Max is a hyperkinetic rabbity-thing with a taste for mayhem. Together, they're a team of freelance police officers, on a mission to take down a bizarre mind-control conspiracy. Get ready to meet some off-kilter characters and to puzzle through some brain-tickling conundrums. Grab your Wii Remote, sit back on the sofa and get ready for some side-splitting humor!  i2008kDreamCatcher GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00515na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264003400033300002300067500025000090542003700340655002800377R3XP6V00aSam & Max: Season One 1bJoWood Produtionsc2008-11-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aAll six episodes of the famous Sam & Max series for Nintendo's genius console, the Wii! You will need a lot of cleverness to solve the funny puzzles in this game. Use the one-of-a-kind Wii Remote to accompany Sam & Max on their funny adventures!  i2008kJoWood ProdutionssGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00763na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003700007264003300044300002300077500048700100542003800587655002800625R3YE7000aSam & Max: Beyond Time and Space 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2010-3-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aSam & Max: Beyond Time and Space is the second release in the single player adventure series following the animated adventures of canine shamus Sam and his hyperkinetic rabbity-thing partner Max. The game consists of five episodes, each with its own self-contained plots contributing clues to solving the season-wide mystery. Additional features include a driving mini-game with achievements, a built-in hint system and bonus content, including character bios, concept art and more.  i2010kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00764na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003700007264003400044300002300078500048700101542003800588655002800626R3YP7000aSam & Max: Beyond Time and Space 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2010-3-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aSam & Max: Beyond Time and Space is the second release in the single player adventure series following the animated adventures of canine shamus Sam and his hyperkinetic rabbity-thing partner Max. The game consists of five episodes, each with its own self-contained plots contributing clues to solving the season-wide mystery. Additional features include a driving mini-game with achievements, a built-in hint system and bonus content, including character bios, concept art and more.  i2010kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00850na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264003100046300002300077500054400100542003500644655002400679655002500703R3ZE6900aRock Band Track Pack: Classic Rock 1bElectronic Artsc2009-5-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aRock Band Track Pack: Classic Rock is a standalone software product that allows owners of Rock Band and Rock Band 2 to keep the party going with more hit songs from the pantheon of rock music. In addition, Rock Band Track Pack: Classic Rock, like all Rock Band software, is compatible with all Rock Band instrument controllers and other current music-based video game peripherals. The 20-song pack features an outstanding mix of Rock Band fans’ favorite classic rock hits including songs by mega artists The Who, Rush, Boston and Police.  i2009kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext01187na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264003600032300002300068500087200091542003900963655002901002655003401031R42E6904aThe Sims 2: Castaway 1bElectronic Arts Incc2007-10-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aHelp your Sims build a life from scratch after washing ashore on a deserted tropical island. Overcome the forces of nature to help them become the ultimate survivors and thrive in this undiscovered paradise while unearthing clues that will lead them back to civilization. Build shelters, craft unique items, and discover many useful treasures and ancient mysteries hidden deep within a diverse jungle environment filled with plants, fruits, and even wildlife. Your Sims change as they take on the challenges of island life and learn to survive in style. Create a new life for your Sims on an uncharted island in The Sims 2 Castaway. Choose from a wide range of Sims - Auto Mechanic, Chef, Doctor, Musician, Teacher, Executive, or Park Ranger. Each one brings a unique Sim humor and quirkiness to your crew. Reunite members of your crew and build a thriving community.  i2007kElectronic Arts IncsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aLife simulation games2wiiext01179na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264003200032300002300064500087200087542003500959655002900994655003401023R42P6904aThe Sims 2: Castaway 1bElectronic Artsc2007-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aHelp your Sims build a life from scratch after washing ashore on a deserted tropical island. Overcome the forces of nature to help them become the ultimate survivors and thrive in this undiscovered paradise while unearthing clues that will lead them back to civilization. Build shelters, craft unique items, and discover many useful treasures and ancient mysteries hidden deep within a diverse jungle environment filled with plants, fruits, and even wildlife. Your Sims change as they take on the challenges of island life and learn to survive in style. Create a new life for your Sims on an uncharted island in The Sims 2 Castaway. Choose from a wide range of Sims - Auto Mechanic, Chef, Doctor, Musician, Teacher, Executive, or Park Ranger. Each one brings a unique Sim humor and quirkiness to your crew. Reunite members of your crew and build a thriving community.  i2007kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aLife simulation games2wiiext00756na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264002500046300002300071500049700094542002900591655002600620R43E6900aEA Sports Active: Personal Trainer 1bEA Sportsc2009-5-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aRevolutionize your workout regimen with EA SPORTS Active, the ultimate interactive fitness program that's designed for you. Get fit with a holistic approach to fitness that combines nutrition and lifestyle factors, with a variety of activities, all from the convenience of your living room. From customized routines that target upper body, lower body, and cardio to a guided 30-day challenge that tests muscle endurance, coordination and agility, stay in shape with fitness made fun and easy.  i2009kEA SportssGameTDB 7aFitness games2wiiext00817na  a2200109   4500001000700000245007700007264003600084300002300120500049700143542004100640655002600681R43J1300aEA Sports Active: Personal Trainer Wii: 30-nichi Seikatsu Kaizen Program 1bElectronic Arts Japanc2009-8-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aRevolutionize your workout regimen with EA SPORTS Active, the ultimate interactive fitness program that's designed for you. Get fit with a holistic approach to fitness that combines nutrition and lifestyle factors, with a variety of activities, all from the convenience of your living room. From customized routines that target upper body, lower body, and cardio to a guided 30-day challenge that tests muscle endurance, coordination and agility, stay in shape with fitness made fun and easy.  i2009kElectronic Arts JapansGameTDB 7aFitness games2wiiext00846na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003900007264003100046300002300077500049700100542003500597655002700632655002700659655002600686R43P6900aEA Sports Active: Personal Trainer 1bElectronic Artsc2009-5-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aRevolutionize your workout regimen with EA SPORTS Active, the ultimate interactive fitness program that's designed for you. Get fit with a holistic approach to fitness that combines nutrition and lifestyle factors, with a variety of activities, all from the convenience of your living room. From customized routines that target upper body, lower body, and cardio to a guided 30-day challenge that tests muscle endurance, coordination and agility, stay in shape with fitness made fun and easy.  i2009kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aCoaching games2wiiext 7aExercise games2wiiext 7aFitness games2wiiext00249na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264002000039300002300059500000500082542002400087655002800111R44J8P00aSuzumiya Haruhi no Heiretsu 1bSegac2009-3-26  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kSegasGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext01526na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264003200040300002300072500125400095542003601349655003101385R46ENS00aPhantom Brave: We Meet Again 1bNIS America Inc.c2009-8-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aReleased in 2004 Phantom Brave revolutionized the strategy RPG genre with its unique free roaming battle fields and a unit summoning system called "CONFINE". Now Phantom Brave returns to a new console with added features and extra chapter stories. Everything from the original game will be carried over, so gamers who haven't played Phantom Brave can fully enjoy this title. The Story: A world of vast seas and small island continents, Ivoire existed in peace and harmony. Ancient mystic forces with forgotten powers now threaten the existence of man kind. Islands, once flourishing with life, now lie as empty waste lands. Remaining decadent cities are corrupted by unnatural events and violence. The shadow of darkness is slowly, but surely, engulfing the world of Ivoir. In the year of 921, in a world called Ivoire, lives Marona, a 13 year old orphaned girl with a special ability to communicate with phantoms. Her ability brings resentment from others, but cheerful and optimistic Marona is not bothered. Marona believes in her parents' teachings that people will one day come to like her as long as she stays compassionate and kind. Now Marona travels throughout Ivoire with her guardian, Ash the Phantom, to resolve disputes around the world.  i2009kNIS America Inc.sGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00363na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002200007264003600029300002300065500000500088542004000093655002500133655003100158655004000189R46JKB00aPhantom Brave Wii 1bNippon Ichi Softwarec2009-3-12  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kNippon Ichi SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aTactical role-playing games2wiiext00898na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002500026300002300051500061400074542002900688655002500717655003400742R47E2000aATV Quad Kings 1bZoo Gamesc2009-8-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aSpeed may earn you victories, but to wear the crown in ATV Quad Kings, you'll need to show some style! Travel across the globe to compete in nine locations. Pick your four-wheeler from an array of quad bikes and dune buggys, each with different performance specs, then cash in your winnings to improve your ride. Rise to the top in four skill levels and master all the right moves in four game modes: World Tour, Arcade, Time Trial, and Freestyle. Being first to the finish in hard-fought races is good, but to be Number One you'll need to catch air and perform some serious tricks in freestyle contests, too.  i2009kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aOff-road racing games2wiiext00885na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264001800026300002300044500061400067542002300681655002500704655003400729R47P2000aATV Quad Kings 1bZooc2009-8-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aSpeed may earn you victories, but to wear the crown in ATV Quad Kings, you'll need to show some style! Travel across the globe to compete in nine locations. Pick your four-wheeler from an array of quad bikes and dune buggys, each with different performance specs, then cash in your winnings to improve your ride. Rise to the top in four skill levels and master all the right moves in four game modes: World Tour, Arcade, Time Trial, and Freestyle. Being first to the finish in hard-fought races is good, but to be Number One you'll need to catch air and perform some serious tricks in freestyle contests, too.  i2009kZoosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aOff-road racing games2wiiext00544na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264004100037300002300078500022200101542004600323655002500369655002800394R48E7D04aThe Spiderwick Chronicles 1bSierra Entertainment, Inc.c2008-2-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aUnlock and explore the hidden world of the seen and unseen from the Spiderwick Chronicles movie. Battle strange and enchanted creatures in this spellbound world of eerie adventures, as you fight to stop a rising evil.  i2008kSierra Entertainment, Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00504na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002100037300002300058500022200081542002600303655002500329655002800354R48P7D04aThe Spiderwick Chronicles 1bSierrac2008-4-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aUnlock and explore the hidden world of the seen and unseen from the Spiderwick Chronicles movie. Battle strange and enchanted creatures in this spellbound world of eerie adventures, as you fight to stop a rising evil.  i2008kSierrasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01124na  a2200157   4500001000700000245002800007264002300035300002300058500072600081542002800807655002500835655002400860655002700884655003000911655002500941R49E0100aDonkey Kong Jungle Beat 1bNintendoc2009-5-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aSwing through the jungle in DK’s craziest adventure ever! You’ll run, jump, backflip, and punch your way to greatness—now with new controls on Wii. You’ll use the buttons and Control Stick on the Wii Remote and Nunchuk controllers to move DK, and you’ll swing the Wii Remote controller to grab objects and clap with devastating power. When it comes time to box, you’ll punch with both hands! Explore one of the most imaginative worlds ever seen in a game, now with many areas partially redesigned to take full advantage of the new Wii controls. Newcomers will enjoy its fantastic jungles, dazzling caverns and wondrous seas for the first time, and fans of the original will discover new thrills along the way!  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a2D platform games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext01011na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002500035300002300060500072600083542002800809655002500837655002700862R49J0100aDonkey Kong Jungle Beat 1bNintendoc2008-12-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aSwing through the jungle in DK’s craziest adventure ever! You’ll run, jump, backflip, and punch your way to greatness—now with new controls on Wii. You’ll use the buttons and Control Stick on the Wii Remote and Nunchuk controllers to move DK, and you’ll swing the Wii Remote controller to grab objects and clap with devastating power. When it comes time to box, you’ll punch with both hands! Explore one of the most imaginative worlds ever seen in a game, now with many areas partially redesigned to take full advantage of the new Wii controls. Newcomers will enjoy its fantastic jungles, dazzling caverns and wondrous seas for the first time, and fans of the original will discover new thrills along the way!  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext01009na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002300035300002300058500072600081542002800807655002500835655002700860R49P0100aDonkey Kong Jungle Beat 1bNintendoc2009-6-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aSwing through the jungle in DK’s craziest adventure ever! You’ll run, jump, backflip, and punch your way to greatness—now with new controls on Wii. You’ll use the buttons and Control Stick on the Wii Remote and Nunchuk controllers to move DK, and you’ll swing the Wii Remote controller to grab objects and clap with devastating power. When it comes time to box, you’ll punch with both hands! Explore one of the most imaginative worlds ever seen in a game, now with many areas partially redesigned to take full advantage of the new Wii controls. Newcomers will enjoy its fantastic jungles, dazzling caverns and wondrous seas for the first time, and fans of the original will discover new thrills along the way!  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00914na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001500007264003500022300002300057500065600080542003900736655002900775R4AE6900aSimAnimals 1bElectronic Arts Incc2009-1-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aSimAnimals, take the wild world of animals into your hands. Embrace all the adventure, fun, and mischief that await you in the vast forest. Feed a bear what he craves. Pick up a rabbit or hedgehog, and bring him to his friends. Discover what other creatures lurk in the wild. You have the power to reach out and touch, pick up and move everything in the forest from squirrels and foxes to trees and flowers. Make your wild animals happy and maintain a forest that lets them flourish as you venture further into the forest than you've ever been before. Engage wild animals, experience life in the forest, and let your creativity run wild in SimAnimals.  i2009kElectronic Arts IncsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext01005na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001500007264003700022300002300059500065600082542004100738655002900779655003000808655003300838R4AJ1300aSimAnimals 1bElectronic Arts Japanc2009-2-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aSimAnimals, take the wild world of animals into your hands. Embrace all the adventure, fun, and mischief that await you in the vast forest. Feed a bear what he craves. Pick up a rabbit or hedgehog, and bring him to his friends. Discover what other creatures lurk in the wild. You have the power to reach out and touch, pick up and move everything in the forest from squirrels and foxes to trees and flowers. Make your wild animals happy and maintain a forest that lets them flourish as you venture further into the forest than you've ever been before. Engage wild animals, experience life in the forest, and let your creativity run wild in SimAnimals.  i2009kElectronic Arts JapansGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00358na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001500007264003100022300002300053500010800076542003500184655002900219R4AP6900aSimAnimals 1bElectronic Artsc2009-1-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aVenture into the wild world of animals like never before.  Embrace all the adventure, fun, and mischief  i2009kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00856na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002600033300002300059500057300082542002900655655002500684655002500709R4BEJZ00aChampionship Foosball 1b505 Gamesc2008-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aJump into the fast-paced action and fun of foosball in your own living room! Using motion-sensing technology in the Wii Remote, Championship Foosball creates a realistic gaming experience so you will feel like you are playing at a real table! Create your own team of players and choose to play using official foosball rules or create custom rules to suit your game. Challenge your friends in 4-player action or rise throughout the ranks in single-player mode and play on a host of official tables designed in partnership with the International Table Soccer Federation.  i2008k505 GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00475na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002400026300002300050500020100073542002900274655002500303655002500328R4BPGT00aTable Football 1b505 Gamesc2008-8-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aTable Football uses the motion-sensing technology in the Wii remote to create a realistic feeling table football game – players will feel like they are actually playing at a real foosball table!  i2008k505 GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00987na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264003500027300002300062500067000085542003900755655002900794655004200823R4CE6900aSimCity Creator 1bElectronic Arts Incc2008-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aBe a powerful mayor and build your ultimate city—constructing homes, businesses, factories, skyscrapers, freeways, railroads, and much more. Try different city styles, including American, European, Asian, Futuristic and many others. Hire assistants and advisors with unique personalities to help you manage your town and build new neighborhoods. When you want to check out what you’ve built, fly over it in your plane to see all the detail of your design. If you want to give your city a little excitement, send in a giant monster or set off an earthquake to wreck it—you built it, you can destroy it. The fate of your city and your citizens is in your hands!  i2008kElectronic Arts IncsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aConstruction simulation games2wiiext00899na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002000007264003700027300002300064500053900087542004100626655002900667655002700696655004200723R4CJ1300aSimCity Creator 1bElectronic Arts Japanc2008-9-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aBe a powerful mayor -- create, enjoy and destroy your ultimate city. Start by zoning your city, constructing homes, businesses, factories, skyscrapers, freeways, railroads, and much more. SimCity Creator is a visually exciting experience with a completely new user interface, designed specifically for the Wii and the Wii remote. You’ll discover many ways to customize your city, including 13 city styles to explore, such as American, European and Asian themes. More city styles will be revealed, so stay tuned for more information!  i2008kElectronic Arts JapansGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aConstruction simulation games2wiiext00853na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264003100032300002300063500053900086542003500625655002900660655004200689R4CK6900aSimCity Namanui Dosi 1bElectronic Artsc2008-9-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aBe a powerful mayor -- create, enjoy and destroy your ultimate city. Start by zoning your city, constructing homes, businesses, factories, skyscrapers, freeways, railroads, and much more. SimCity Creator is a visually exciting experience with a completely new user interface, designed specifically for the Wii and the Wii remote. You’ll discover many ways to customize your city, including 13 city styles to explore, such as American, European and Asian themes. More city styles will be revealed, so stay tuned for more information!  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aConstruction simulation games2wiiext01018na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002000007264003100027300002300058500067000081542003500751655002900786655002700815655004200842R4CP6900aSimCity Creator 1bElectronic Artsc2008-10-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aBe a powerful mayor and build your ultimate city—constructing homes, businesses, factories, skyscrapers, freeways, railroads, and much more. Try different city styles, including American, European, Asian, Futuristic and many others. Hire assistants and advisors with unique personalities to help you manage your town and build new neighborhoods. When you want to check out what you’ve built, fly over it in your plane to see all the detail of your design. If you want to give your city a little excitement, send in a giant monster or set off an earthquake to wreck it—you built it, you can destroy it. The fate of your city and your citizens is in your hands!  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aConstruction simulation games2wiiext00256na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264001900048300002300067500000500090542002300095655002800118R4DDUS00aDie drei ???: Das verfluchte Schloss 1bUSMc2009-4-30  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kUSMsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00782na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002400037300002300061500049100084542002800575655002800603655002900631R4EE0100aEndless Ocean: Blue World 1bNintendoc2010-2-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aEndless Ocean: Blue World builds on the ocean experience first introduced with Endless Ocean™. While the last game emphasized relaxation, this one is designed with more adventure in mind. Divers might find themselves escaping from or calming down attacking sharks, exploring shipwrecks or finding treasure. Endless Ocean: Blue World also has more creatures and improved graphics designed to fully immerse players in an ocean environment that they can freely explore at their own pace.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00584na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264002400040300002300064500033000087542002800417655002900445R4EJ0100aForever Blue: Umi no Yobigoe 1bNintendoc2009-9-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe beauty of Endless Ocean is that players can do as much or as little as they like. The relaxed and calm atmosphere of the game gives divers the freedom to explore special locations such as shipwrecks and underwater ruins, discover and interact with sea-life, complete fish logs or simply relax in the soothing environment.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00771na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004400007264002300051300002300074500046800097542002800565655002900593655002700622R4EP0100aEndless Ocean 2: Adventures of the Deep 1bNintendoc2010-2-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aEndless Ocean 2 builds on the ocean experience first introduced with Endless Ocean. While the last game emphasized relaxation, this one is designed with more adventure in mind. Divers might find themselves escaping from or calming down attacking sharks, exploring shipwrecks or finding treasure. Endless Ocean 2 also has more creatures and improved graphics designed to fully immerse players in an ocean environment that they can freely explore at their own pace.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aCoaching games2wiiext00929na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264002600035300002300061500067800084542002900762655002800791R4FE2000aStory Hour: Fairy Tales 1bZoo Gamesc2008-12-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aClassic fairy tales and fables had been passed down from generation to generation verbally and in books. Those traditions are now getting an interactive twist in the Story Hour series. A modern take on such beloved tales as Cinderella, Snow White, Jack and the Beanstalk, and Paul Bunyan, these tales offer four different stories that incorporate motion sensitive controls so that parents and preschoolers can tell stories together. Story Hour: Fairy Tales features four classic stories: 12 Dancing Princesses (illustrated by Alessia Girasole), Snow White (illustrated by C.B. Canga), Rapunzel (illustrated by Guy Francis) and Cinderella (illustrated by Patricia Castelao.)  i2008kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00306na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264002400035300002300059500005700082542002900139655002800168R4FP7J00aStory Hour: Fairy Tales 1bZoo Gamesc2009-7-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIncludes four interactive classic favourite stories:  i2009kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00272na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001500007264003400022300002300056500002000079542003800099655002500137R4IPNK00aMad Tracks 1bNeko Entertainmentc2009-12-4  a1 Wii optical disc  a3,2,1....GO!!!!  i2009kNeko EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00414na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264003200032300002300064500012000087542003600207655002500243655002400268R4LPUG00aAthletic Piggy Party 1bMidway Games Incc2009-7-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aProbably the most funny Olympic Games in the World: The Pigs on the farm are going crazy und you are in the middle!  i2009kMidway Games IncsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00414na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264003200032300002300064500012000087542003600207655002500243655002400268R4LXUG00aAthletic Piggy Party 1bMidway Games Incc2009-7-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aProbably the most funny Olympic Games in the World: The Pigs on the farm are going crazy und you are in the middle!  i2009kMidway Games IncsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00231na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003800007264002800045300002300073500000500096542003200101R4MJ0Q00aShikakui Atama o Maruku Suru. Wii 1bIE Institutec2009-4-29  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kIE InstitutesGameTDB00834na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264003700040300002300077500055900100542004100659655002400700R4NE5G00aMajor Minor's Majestic March 1bMajesco Entertainmentc2009-3-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aAttention aspiring drum majors of the world! Can you guide the courageous cat, Major Minor, through this whimsical musical adventure? In a town where marching bands are prevalent and everyone is looking to be the best,Major Mike Minor is fairly ambivalent towards marches despite hailing from a long line of illustrious Drum Majors. After his parents present him with a "special" baton that magically attracts band members to fall into rhythm behind the leader, will Major Minor finally fulfill his potential and share the joy of marching with the world?  i2009kMajesco EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext00814na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264003200040300002300072500051100095542003700606655002400643655002500667R4NX5G00aMajor Minor's Majestic March 1bMajesco Sales Incc2009-4-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aMarchtown has always been a town in which Drum Majors are adored.  One young boy, Major Minor, wanted more then anything to become the world's greatest Drum Major and he would stop at nothing to reach his goal. But something was missing.... He needed band members and instruments to start a marching band.  Once he inherited the Magic Baton from his great grandmother he was ready to begin recruiting members for his band. Can Major Minor fulfill his potential and share the joy of marching with the world?  i2009kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00870na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002100007264003100028300002300059500052600082542003500608655002900643655003400672655003000706R4PE6904aThe Sims 2: Pets 1bElectronic Artsc2007-6-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Sims 2: Pets, you'll create the perfect pet for your Sims to train, play with, and love throughout a lifetime. Choose from dozens of popular dog and cat breeds like Schnauzer and Siamese, or create a unique cat or dog by modifying their features and body type. Teach the pets tricks, take them for a romp in the park to meet other furry friends, or buy them toys, beds, and much more. But pets have minds of their own-so expect the unexpected! Upload your favorite Sim pets to TheSims2.com to share with other players.  i2007kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aLife simulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00834na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002100007264003100028300002300059500049000082542003500572655002900607655003400636655003000670R4PP6904aThe Sims 2: Pets 1bElectronic Artsc2007-6-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aCreate new companions for your Sims to love throughout their lifetime. It’s fun and easy to play with the Wii controls, but expect the unexpected with your furry friends. Choose from popular dog and cat breeds or customize their features to create a unique pet for your Sim to raise as one of the family. Whether Sims are romping with their pets in the central town park or searching the shops for the perfect pet accessory, keep one thing in mind—Sim pets have minds of their own.  i2007kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aLife simulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext01805na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264002400034300002300058500148700081542002801568655002501596655002501621655002501646R4QE0100aMario Strikers Charged 1bNintendoc2007-7-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aSupercharged Characters! - The captains from Super Mario Strikers are back, joined by four new ones, and now you can create your own original team by mixing and matching your captain with an all-new cast of sidekicks. All characters have their own sets of special abilities, making each one play completely differently from one another. New captain super-abilities and sidekick skill-shots add a new level of depth to already crazy soccer battles on the most unpredictable and hazard-filled pitches in the Mario universe. Each field features its own set of interactive hazards that alter game play over the course of the game. **Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection Game Play! - There are tons of new single-player modes, from tournaments to challenges to tutorials, but the game truly shines in multiplayer. The game features a robust multiplayer mode—up to four players can battle locally, or they can go online in each specific sales territory for one-on-one matches. **Kickin' Wii Controls! - Building on the frantic fun of Super Mario Strikers, this game gets you into action only possible on the Wii. Primary game play controls use both the Wii Remote and Nunchuck controllers. Use the Nunchuk to control your characters and deploy items. Flick the Wii Remote to perform the defensive "Big Hit" move and flatten foes. To defend against a "Mega Strike" goal attempt, use the Wii Remote to point at the screen and manually defend against multiple balls as they rocket towards the screen!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext01805na  a2200133   450000100070000024500270000726400240003