 live all the fun and excitement of the next Walt Disney Pictures presentation of a Pixar Animation Studios film, "Cars." Play as all your favorite characters as you help Lightning McQueen capture the coveted Piston Cup Championship.  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00484na  a2200109   4500001000700000245000900007264001900016300002300035500026800058542002300326655002500349RCAP7800aCars 1bTHQc2006-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aRace to the finish line as you live all the fun and excitement of the next Walt Disney Pictures presentation of a Pixar Animation Studios film, "Cars." Play as all your favorite characters as you help Lightning McQueen capture the coveted Piston Cup Championship.  i2006kTHQsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00484na  a2200109   4500001000700000245000900007264001900016300002300035500026800058542002300326655002500349RCAX7800aCars 1bTHQc2006-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aRace to the finish line as you live all the fun and excitement of the next Walt Disney Pictures presentation of a Pixar Animation Studios film, "Cars." Play as all your favorite characters as you help Lightning McQueen capture the coveted Piston Cup Championship.  i2006kTHQsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00484na  a2200109   4500001000700000245000900007264001900016300002300035500026800058542002300326655002500349RCAY7800aCars 1bTHQc2006-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aRace to the finish line as you live all the fun and excitement of the next Walt Disney Pictures presentation of a Pixar Animation Studios film, "Cars." Play as all your favorite characters as you help Lightning McQueen capture the coveted Piston Cup Championship.  i2006kTHQsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00889na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002900007264002600036300002300062500052000085542003000605655002500635655002800660655002900688655002600717RCBE5200aCabela's Big Game Hunter 1bActivisionc2007-11-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake an incredible adventure to the world's marquee hunting locations in pursuit of the most sought-after and exotic big game trophy animals. You will need to put yout hunting skills and techniques to the test to master real-life hunting strategies and bring down legendary big game. Along your journey, you will meet hunting guides who will offer helpful hints, find unlockable hunts for birds and small game, and have surprise encounters with dangerous game. Are you ready for the hunting adventure of a lifetime?  i2007kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00810na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264002600036300002300062500052000085542003000605655002500635655002800660RCBP5200aCabela's Big Game Hunter 1bActivisionc2007-11-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake an incredible adventure to the world's marquee hunting locations in pursuit of the most sought-after and exotic big game trophy animals. You will need to put yout hunting skills and techniques to the test to master real-life hunting strategies and bring down legendary big game. Along your journey, you will meet hunting guides who will offer helpful hints, find unlockable hunts for birds and small game, and have surprise encounters with dangerous game. Are you ready for the hunting adventure of a lifetime?  i2007kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00698na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264003700034300002300071500038600094542004100480655002900521655002600550RCCE5G00aCooking Mama: Cook Off 1bMajesco Entertainmentc2007-3-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aEveryone in the kitchen! Hot on the heels of stir-fry surprise Cooking Mama DS, Majesco whips up two-chef competition in Cooking Mama: Cook Off—a unique family game designed specifically for the Wii. Step-by-step, recipe-by-recipe, help Mama cook international dishes from 10 different nations and watch as the realistic foods actually change in appearance based on your actions!  i2007kMajesco EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aCooking games2wiiext00309na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005200007264002000059300002300079500000500102542002500107655002900132655002600161RCCJC000aCooking Mama: Minna to Issho ni Oryouri Taikai! 1bTaitoc2007-2-8  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kTaitosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aCooking games2wiiext00744na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264002500024300002300049500046600072542002900538655002900567655002600596RCCPGT00aCooking Mama 1b505 Gamesc2007-5-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aMaking special use of the Wii Remote, Cooking Mama is an entertaining blend of mashing, slicing, chopping and stirring as players create more than 300 real-world recipes from 10 different nations. New realistic graphics and real-time cooking effects lend authenticity to player creations and help budding chefs determine when food is overcooked. Best of all, Cooking Mama offers 2-player kitchen competitions to determine who can cook the best meal the fastest.  i2007k505 GamessGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aCooking games2wiiext01032na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001900007264002600026300002300052500070300075542003000778655002500808655002600833655003900859RCDD5200aCall of Duty 3 1bActivisionc2006-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aCall of Duty 3 delivers the intensity of being closer than ever to the fury of combat during the Normandy Breakout, the historic campaign that made the liberation of Paris possible and brought the Allies a step closer to Berlin. Through a seamless narrative that delivers the rush of unrelenting battle and breathtaking action, players assume the roles of four ordinary Allied soldiers—American, British, Canadian and Polish—and are thrust onto an authentic, living battlefield for an unprecedented variety of combat with advanced high-definition graphics, detailed character animations and explosive on-screen action, providing the most immersive and cinematically intense war experience ever.  i2006kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext01033na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001900007264002700026300002300053500070300076542003000779655002500809655002600834655003900860RCDE5200aCall of Duty 3 1bActivisionc2006-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aCall of Duty 3 delivers the intensity of being closer than ever to the fury of combat during the Normandy Breakout, the historic campaign that made the liberation of Paris possible and brought the Allies a step closer to Berlin. Through a seamless narrative that delivers the rush of unrelenting battle and breathtaking action, players assume the roles of four ordinary Allied soldiers—American, British, Canadian and Polish—and are thrust onto an authentic, living battlefield for an unprecedented variety of combat with advanced high-definition graphics, detailed character animations and explosive on-screen action, providing the most immersive and cinematically intense war experience ever.  i2006kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00704na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001900007264002600026300002300052500037500075542003000450655002500480655002600505655003900531RCDP5200aCall of Duty 3 1bActivisionc2006-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aCall of Duty 3 delivers the intensity of being closer than ever to the fury of combat during the battle for the Liberation of Paris, the most harrowing campaign of WWII, known as The Normandy Breakout. Through a seamless narrative, Call of Duty 3 delivers the rush of unrelenting battle and breathtaking action of the Allied offensive that changed the fate of the world.  i2006kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext01081na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001900007264002600026300002300052500075200075542003000827655002500857655002600882655003900908RCDX5200aCall of Duty 3 1bActivisionc2006-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe follow-up to the #1 next-generation game, Call of Duty®3 delivers the intensity of being closer than ever to the fury of combat during the Normandy Breakout, the historic campaign that made the liberation of Paris possible and brought the Allies a step closer to Berlin. Through a seamless narrative that delivers the rush of unrelenting battle and breathtaking action, players assume the roles of four ordinary Allied soldiers—American, British, Canadian and Polish—and are thrust onto an authentic, living battlefield for an unprecedented variety of combat, with advanced high-definition graphics, detailed character animations and explosive on-screen action, delivering the most immersive and cinematically intense war experience ever.  i2006kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00940na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264004100031300002300072500066600095542004400761655002500805RCEE5Z00aMini Desktop Racing 1bConspiracy Entertainmentc2007-11-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aMini Desktop Racing features breakneck racing in the fastest officially licensed Mini game on the Wii. Let loose with a crazy selection of Mini's, each accurately rendered with distinctive performance abilities. Tear past your opponents in Championship and Single Race mode, or shave seconds off your record in Time Trial. Use rulers, books and folders for big air and leap desk-to-desk! Knock over trackside objects and cause havoc for your opponents. Build up your skills and quick reflexes to unlock new minis and tournaments. Each track individually design for a unique racing experience. Compete wheel to wheel in the insanely competitive multiplayer mode.  i2007kConspiracy EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00881na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264002700031300002300058500063400081542003100715655002500746RCEPUG00aMini Desktop Racing 1bData Designc2008-2-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aMini Desktop Racing features breakneck racing in the fastest officially licensed Mini game on the Wii. A perfect combination of miniature Mini mayhem and madcap multiplayer madness. This game puts the fun back into the Mini Tear past your opponents in Championship and Single Race mode or try to shave seconds off your record in Time Trial. Mini Desktop Racing lets you loose with a crazy selection of officially licensed Minis, each accurately rendered with distinctive performance abilities. Racing your inch-long miniatures around the wildest tracks where everyday objects appear immense in size and can become lethal hazards.  i2008kData DesignsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00332na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002600031300002300057500004900080542003100129655002500160655002500185RCEXUG00aMini Desktop Racing 1bData Designc2007-8-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis game puts the fun back into the Mini…  i2007kData DesignsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00661na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264003800025300002300063500035300086542004200439655002500481655003300506RCFE4100aCosmic Family 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-9-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMeet Mom and Dad Cosmic, Big Sister, and the two small children, the crazy dog, the lazy cat and the colorful monsters. Enjoy their cosmic way of life as you explore the five floors of their rocket home and select your favorite room. Use your magic wand on whatever catches your eye to reveal crazy animations, funny stories and playful mini games.  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00623na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264003700025300002300062500035300085542004200438655003300480RCFP4100aCosmic Family 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-9-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMeet Mom and Dad Cosmic, Big Sister, and the two small children, the crazy dog, the lazy cat and the colorful monsters. Enjoy their cosmic way of life as you explore the five floors of their rocket home and select your favorite room. Use your magic wand on whatever catches your eye to reveal crazy animations, funny stories and playful mini games.  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00871na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264003600026300002300062500061100085542004000696655002500736RCGE5400aCarnival Games 1bGlobal Star Softwarec2007-8-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aStep right up! All the fun and excitement of your favorite Carnival Games is coming to Wii this summer. It’s the perfect multi-player game for moms, dads and kids of all ages. Are you ready to rack up the points in a game of classic Alley Ball? Got the muscle to ring the bell in Test of Strength? Been practicing your accuracy for the famed Milk Bottle Throw? Ready to get wet in the Dunk Tank? If yes, then join the action as your Wii remote transforms from a sledgehammer to a frog flinger. Master all the classic carnival games and the ultimate prize could be yours – the virtual goldfish in a bag!  i2007kGlobal Star SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00875na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264003500034300002300069500061100092542003800703655002400741RCGP5400aCarnival Funfair Games 1bTake 2 Interactivec2007-10-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aStep right up! All the fun and excitement of your favorite Carnival Games is coming to Wii this summer. It’s the perfect multi-player game for moms, dads and kids of all ages. Are you ready to rack up the points in a game of classic Alley Ball? Got the muscle to ring the bell in Test of Strength? Been practicing your accuracy for the famed Milk Bottle Throw? Ready to get wet in the Dunk Tank? If yes, then join the action as your Wii remote transforms from a sledgehammer to a frog flinger. Master all the classic carnival games and the ultimate prize could be yours – the virtual goldfish in a bag!  i2007kTake 2 InteractivesGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00687na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001300007264004700020300002300067500037500090542005100465655002400516655002500540RCHEAF00aWe Cheer 1bNAMCO BANDAI Games America Inc.c2008-9-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aWe Cheer brings the excitement and fun of cheerleading to the Wii. Use your Wii Remote(s) as pom-poms and get ready to show your team spirit while you kick, jump, flip, spin and dance to the rhythm of the hottest music from the past and present. Master your moves with precision and timing, and get ready to beat the other squads to claim the #1spot in the championship.  i2008kNAMCO BANDAI Games America Inc.sGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00426na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001300007264002100020300002300041500016600064542002500230655002400255655002500279RCHJAF00aWe Cheer 1bNamcoc2009-3-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aDance and cheer to the hottest music from artists of the past, present and future. Groove to teen sensations Hilary Duff and Aly and AJ to the 70¿s disco bands.  i2009kNamcosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00433na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001300007264002400020300002300044500016600067542002900233655002400262655002500286RCHPGT00aWe Cheer 1b505 Gamesc2009-2-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aDance and cheer to the hottest music from artists of the past, present and future. Groove to teen sensations Hilary Duff and Aly and AJ to the 70¿s disco bands.  i2009k505 GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00819na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005000007264003800057300002300095500048400118542004200602655002500644655002800669RCIE4100aCSI: Crime Scene Investigation: Hard Evidence 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2008-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlayers will join Gil Grissom, Catherine Willows and the rest of the Las Vegas cast to help solve crimes using realistic techniques and lab equipment. CSI: Hard Evidence features forensic reconstructions and atmospheric crime scenes taken directly from the television show, including an all-new garage lab for analyzing large evidence such as cars and boats, improved evidence gathering, review and lab mini-games, and more areas to explore, resulting in longer play experiences.  i2008kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00755na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264003800030300002300068500048400091542004200575655002800617RCIP4100aCSI: Hard Evidence 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2008-3-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlayers will join Gil Grissom, Catherine Willows and the rest of the Las Vegas cast to help solve crimes using realistic techniques and lab equipment. CSI: Hard Evidence features forensic reconstructions and atmospheric crime scenes taken directly from the television show, including an all-new garage lab for analyzing large evidence such as cars and boats, improved evidence gathering, review and lab mini-games, and more areas to explore, resulting in longer play experiences.  i2008kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00749na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003100023300002300054500045100077542003500528655002500563655003900588RCJE8P04aThe Conduit 1bSega of Americac2009-6-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aAfter a full-scale alien attack on Washington D.C., suspicions arise as to the involvement of the U.S. government. Armed with sci-fi gadgets and high-powered weapons, players will battle aliens, rogue agents and enemy forces as a former secret service agent codenamed Mr. Ford. Built exclusively for Wii, The Conduit pushes the boundaries of the platform from incredible award-winning graphics to robust controls that are customizable on-the-fly.  i2009kSega of AmericasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00767na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001600007264002000023300002300043500045100066542002400517655002500541655002800566655003900594RCJP8P04aThe Conduit 1bSegac2009-7-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aAfter a full-scale alien attack on Washington D.C., suspicions arise as to the involvement of the U.S. government. Armed with sci-fi gadgets and high-powered weapons, players will battle aliens, rogue agents and enemy forces as a former secret service agent codenamed Mr. Ford. Built exclusively for Wii, The Conduit pushes the boundaries of the platform from incredible award-winning graphics to robust controls that are customizable on-the-fly.  i2009kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00378na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264002800042300002300070500011800093542003200211655002500243RCKPGN00aAlan Hansen's Sports Challenge 1bOxygen Gamesc2007-12-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aBrave Hansen's dry wit as you put your sporting knowledge to the ultimate test in Alan Hansen's Sports Challenge.  i2007kOxygen GamessGameTDB 7aTrivia games2wiiext00722na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264003500050300002300085500040100108542003800509655002500547655002800572RCLE4Q00aDisney's Chicken Little: Ace in Action 1bDisney Interactivec2006-12-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aInspired by the "movie within the movie" finale of the film "Chicken Little," Disney's Chicken Little: Ace in Action features Ace, the superhero alter ego of Chicken Little, and the Hollywood versions of his misfit band of friends: Runt, Abby and Fish-Out-of-Water. The crew faces off against Foxy Loxy and her evil Amazonian sidekick, Goosey Loosey, who have an evil plan to take over the Earth.  i2006kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00719na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264003400050300002300084500040100107542003800508655002500546655002600571RCLP4Q00aDisney's Chicken Little: Ace in Action 1bDisney Interactivec2007-6-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aInspired by the "movie within the movie" finale of the film "Chicken Little," Disney's Chicken Little: Ace in Action features Ace, the superhero alter ego of Chicken Little, and the Hollywood versions of his misfit band of friends: Runt, Abby and Fish-Out-of-Water. The crew faces off against Foxy Loxy and her evil Amazonian sidekick, Goosey Loosey, who have an evil plan to take over the Earth.  i2007kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00350na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264003900046300002300085500000500108542004300113655002800156655004400184RCOJ9900aMeitantei Conan: Tsuioku no Mirage 1bMarvelous Entertainmentc2007-5-17  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kMarvelous EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPoint-and-click adventure games2wiiext00241na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004500007264003000052300002300082500000500105542003300110RCOKZF00aCase Closed: The Mirapolis Investigation 1bDIGITAL TOUCHc2010-12-16  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kDIGITAL TOUCHsGameTDB00669na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004500007264002300052300002300075500040600098542002700504655002800531RCOPNP00aCase Closed: The Mirapolis Investigation 1bNobilisc2009-2-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe game follows Conan, Richard, Rachel, and The Junior Detective League as they are invited to the opening of a new hotel called The Mirapolis. But on the first day, someone is murdered. Now Conan must find out who did it. Join him and his friends in cracking the case, using his solar-powered skateboard, detective badge, and, most importantly, your brain. Can you solve the murder at the Mirapolis?  i2009kNobilissGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00846na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264004200035300002300077500052800100542004600628655002500674655002500699RCPE1800aKororinpa: Marble Mania 1bHudson Entertainment, Inc.c2007-3-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aKororinpa: Marble Mania is a fun and addictive action puzzle game that lets players tilt and rotate the Wii Remote to roll a ball around a maze to get the goal! Using an intuitive control scheme, gamers of all ages and skill levels can pick up a Wii Remote and start playing right away. Collect crystals and unlock special marbles and hidden stages as you make your way through the numerous mazes. Varying themes such as a magical forest and neon soaked cityscapes keep the game fresh and entertaining for the whole family.  i2007kHudson Entertainment, Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00524na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001400007264002700021300002300048500028700071542003100358655002500389RCPJ1800aKororinpa 1bHudson Softc2006-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aKororinpa is a fun and addictive action puzzle game for your Wii Remote. Players tilt and rotate the Wiimote to roll a ball around a maze to reach the goal. Using an intuitive control scheme, gamers of all ages and skill levels can pick up a Wii Remote and immediately join the fun.  i2006kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00518na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001400007264002400021300002300045500028700068542002800355655002500383RCPP1800aKororinpa 1bNintendoc2007-2-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aKororinpa is a fun and addictive action puzzle game for your Wii Remote. Players tilt and rotate the Wiimote to roll a ball around a maze to reach the goal. Using an intuitive control scheme, gamers of all ages and skill levels can pick up a Wii Remote and immediately join the fun.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00678na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264003200048300002300080500036800103542003600471655002500507655002400532RCQEDA00aPenny Racers Party: Turbo-Q Speedway 1bTomy Corporationc2008-10-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Penny Racers Party! Where else can you race a customized Pop Up Pirate alongside the Honda NSX or the Mazda RX-8? Exclusively on Wii, Penny Racers Party brings buckets of fun with 1-4 players head to head races through wild and wacky courses and 50+ vehicles to customize from Nissan, Toyota, and more! Or go for the crazy rubber ducky or groovy panda!  i2008kTomy CorporationsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00593na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001600007264002000023300002300043500036800066542002400434655002500458RCQJDA00aChoro Q Wii 1bTomyc2008-2-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Penny Racers Party! Where else can you race a customized Pop Up Pirate alongside the Honda NSX or the Mazda RX-8? Exclusively on Wii, Penny Racers Party brings buckets of fun with 1-4 players head to head races through wild and wacky courses and 50+ vehicles to customize from Nissan, Toyota, and more! Or go for the crazy rubber ducky or groovy panda!  i2008kTomysGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00706na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001200007264004200019300002300061500044200084542004500526655002500571RCRE5D00aCruis'n 1bMidway Home Entertainmentc2007-11-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aAn all new version of the classic Midway arcade racer, Cruis'n is coming exclusively to the Wii. Choose your ride from an impressive lineup of licensed cars and experience a rush of adrenaline as you race opponents through twelve different street circuits using the Wii Remote™ to steer and perform outrageous stunts. Win races and earn upgrades including: turbos, body kits, neon and nitrous, allowing you to create the ultimate ride.  i2007kMidway Home EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00667na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001200007264002200019300002300041500044200064542002600506655002500532RCRP5D00aCruis'n 1bMidwayc2008-2-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aAn all new version of the classic Midway arcade racer, Cruis'n is coming exclusively to the Wii. Choose your ride from an impressive lineup of licensed cars and experience a rush of adrenaline as you race opponents through twelve different street circuits using the Wii Remote™ to steer and perform outrageous stunts. Win races and earn upgrades including: turbos, body kits, neon and nitrous, allowing you to create the ultimate ride.  i2008kMidwaysGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00947na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264003500025300002300060500068900083542004000772655002500812RCSE2000aChicken Shoot 1bDestination Softwarec2007-6-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe objective of the game is fairly straightforward: shoot as many chickens as possible! There are 4 different kinds of weapons with different firing ranges that are at the player's disposal: standard handguns, shotguns, and machine guns to name a few. Other guns can be obtained by shooting the chickens that carry them across the screen. Climb behind the trigger and help our distressed farmer friend obliterate hordes of no good cluckers! Great comic sound effects, and catchy original songs to fashion a world where hunting fowl is a blast! Brilliant animation takes you through forests and villages, through deserts and mountains, winging winged adversaries and piling up points.  i2007kDestination SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00269na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002000025300002300045500000500068542002300073655002500096655002600121RCSP7J00aChicken Shoot 1bZooc2007-10-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kZoosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00592na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001800007264004000025300002300065500025000088542004400338655002500382655002500407655002600432RCTE5Z00aCounter Force 1bConspiracy Entertainmentc2007-10-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aEvery day, thousands perish. Those who survive share rumors of an alien entity called 'Diadora'. The survivors took refuge below the earth's surface, narrowly escaping the alien invaders. The governing Council ordered an immediate counterattack.  i2007kConspiracy EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00530na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002500025300002300050500025000073542002900323655002500352655003100377RCTPGT00aCounter Force 1b505 Gamesc2008-9-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aEvery day, thousands perish. Those who survive share rumors of an alien entity called 'Diadora'. The survivors took refuge below the earth's surface, narrowly escaping the alien invaders. The governing Council ordered an immediate counterattack.  i2008k505 GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShoot 'em up games2wiiext01479na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003400007264002500041300002300066500114600089542003001235655002501265655002901290655002601319RCUE5200aCabela's Legendary Adventures 1bActivisionc2008-9-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Cabela’s Legendary Adventures the missions are based on encounters with some of the most famous animals ever hunted in the wild. Featuring amazing once-in-a-lifetime stories Cabela's aims to capture the essence of what hunting is all about: a quest for a legendary experience. Players will hunt in different eras in search of trophies such as white-tailed deer, Yukon moose, Alaskan brown bear and Roosevelt elk in over ten of North America’s top hunting locations, including Kodiak Island, the Yukon, and the Rocky Mountains. Each location in Cabela’s Legendary Adventures is a visually stunning open outdoor environment that encourages exploration and tactical variation. Shooting mechanics have been developed to reflect modern as well as historical hunting technology, so players relive the hunts complete with detail from specific time periods. Under Cabela’s guidance, the firearms, tactics and gear in Cabela’s Legendary Adventures are as true to real life as a game will allow. There will also be a variety of additional hunts featuring over 30 species of other big game, small game, waterfowl, upland birds, and turkey.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00563na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264003900029300002300068500024400091542004200335655002500377655003900402RCVE4100aFar Cry Vengeance 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2006-12-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aFar Cry, the award-winning franchise, makes its debut on Nintendo’s revolutionary Wii console. The game that changed the way first-person shooters are played is set to combine its renowned gameplay with the groundbreaking Wii technology.  i2006kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00816na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264003600029300002300065500050100088542004100589655002500630655003900655RCVP4100aFar Cry Vengeance 1bUbisoft Entertainmentc2007-1-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aA tropical paradise seethes with hidden evil in Far Cry, a cunningly detailed action shooter that pushes the boundaries of combat to shocking new levels. Freelance mariner Jack Carver is cursing the day he ever came to this island. A week ago, a brash female reporter named Valerie had offered him an incredible sum of cash to take her to this unspoiled paradise. Shortly after docking, however, Jack's boat was greeted by artillery fire from a mysterious militia group swarming about the island.  i2007kUbisoft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00741na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002000032300002300052500046800075542002300543655002500566655002800591RCXE7800aAll Star Cheer Squad 1bTHQc2008-10-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aAll Star Cheer Squad allows players to participate in the competitive sport of Cheer, combining traditional cheerleading, dance, gymnastics and squad based teamwork. Players create their own avatar, learn cheer and dance moves, compete against individual team members and ultimately compete against other squads. The player's goal is to become captain of his or her squad and eventually lead the squad to win all of the competitions in the single player campaign.  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00776na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002500007264002000032300002300052500047000075542002300545655002500568655002400593655002500617RCXP7800aAll Star Cheerleader 1bTHQc2008-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aAll Star Cheer Squad allows players to participate in the competitive sport of Cheer, combining traditional cheerleading, dance, gymnastics and squad based teamwork. Players create their own avatar, learn cheer and dance moves, compete against individual team members and ultimately compete against other squads. The player’s goal is to become captain of his or her squad and eventually lead the squad to win all of the competitions in the single player campaign.  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00776na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002500007264002000032300002300052500047000075542002300545655002500568655002400593655002500617RCXX7800aAll Star Cheerleader 1bTHQc2008-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aAll Star Cheer Squad allows players to participate in the competitive sport of Cheer, combining traditional cheerleading, dance, gymnastics and squad based teamwork. Players create their own avatar, learn cheer and dance moves, compete against individual team members and ultimately compete against other squads. The player’s goal is to become captain of his or her squad and eventually lead the squad to win all of the competitions in the single player campaign.  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00606na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002900031300002300060500032000083542003200403655002400435655002500459RCYPGN00aCheggers Party Quiz 1bOxygen Gamesc2008-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aBursting with thousands of questions, plus multiple play modes and rounds, both of the quizzes are delivered in Cheggers’ and Hansen’s inimitable witty styles. From casual play with family or friends to serious sporting challenges, these quizzes have something for everyone – rather like the hosts themselves!  i2008kOxygen GamessGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00810na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264002300023300002300046500052800069542002700597655002500624655003900649RD2E4100aRed Steel 2 1bUbisoftc2010-3-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aRed Steel 2 returns with an artistic style and flair created just for Wii. Set in a desert-bound, high-tech metropolis, Red Steel 2 is a revolution in the action-fighting genre, taking full advantage of the capabilities of the Wii MotionPlus accessory. Your movements are faithfully replicated on-screen, putting the emphasis on swinging, shooting and fun! With the ability of the Wii MotionPlus to sense the strength of a swing, you will literally be able to make an impact on your adversaries through power and precision.  i2010kUbisoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00840na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003800023300002300061500052800084542004200612655002500654655003900679RD2J4100aRed Steel 2 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2010-5-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aRed Steel 2 returns with an artistic style and flair created just for Wii. Set in a desert-bound, high-tech metropolis, Red Steel 2 is a revolution in the action-fighting genre, taking full advantage of the capabilities of the Wii MotionPlus accessory. Your movements are faithfully replicated on-screen, putting the emphasis on swinging, shooting and fun! With the ability of the Wii MotionPlus to sense the strength of a swing, you will literally be able to make an impact on your adversaries through power and precision.  i2010kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00859na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003500023300002300058500055000081542004200631655002500673655003900698RD2K4100aRed Steel 2 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2010--  a1 Wii optical disc  aRed Steel 2 is a single player first-person shooter that allows the player to blend Samurai bushido ethics with the blade, with the over-the-top gun combat. A Wii exclusive, action is set in a fictional, yet immersive and edgy Western setting and utilizes optional Wii MotionPlus technology to add precision to players actions both with the sword and the gun. This precision of motion allows everything from turning the sword into both a cutting and blunt weapon, to blocking bullets with single strokes as players exact revenge on a rival clan.  i2010kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00862na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003800023300002300061500055000084542004200634655002500676655003900701RD2P4100aRed Steel 2 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2010-3-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aRed Steel 2 is a single player first-person shooter that allows the player to blend Samurai bushido ethics with the blade, with the over-the-top gun combat. A Wii exclusive, action is set in a fictional, yet immersive and edgy Western setting and utilizes optional Wii MotionPlus technology to add precision to players actions both with the sword and the gun. This precision of motion allows everything from turning the sword into both a cutting and blunt weapon, to blocking bullets with single strokes as players exact revenge on a rival clan.  i2010kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00860na  a2200121   450000100070000024500160000726400370002330000230006050005500008354200410063365500250067465500390069