  a1 Wii optical disc  aDanceDance your way to Fitness and Fun!  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00289na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264002300047300002300070500003000093542002700123655002900150RD6EE900aAnimal Kingdom: Wildlife Expedition 1bNatsumec2009-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aA Fantastic Photo Safari!  i2009kNatsumesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00334na  a2200121   4500001000700000245007400007264002300081300002300104500000500127542002700132655002500159655002800184RD6J8N00aDoubutsu Kisoutengai! Nazo no Rakuen de Scoop Shashin o Gekisha Seyo! 1bSuccessc2008-5-22  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kSuccesssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00320na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001400007264002300021300002300044500000500067542002700072655002800099655002900127655003000156RD6PNP00aSafar'Wii 1bNobilisc2009-6-26  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kNobilissGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00658na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264002700034300002300061500037400084542003000458655002400488655002400512RD8E5200aDancing with the Stars 1bActivisionc2007-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aDance and perform against the competition to claim the coveted title of America's favorite celebrity dancer. You'll dance to hit songs and compete in dances from the Cha-Cha to the Waltz. Play as one of nine celebrities such as Emmit Smith, Mario Lopez, or Stacey Keibler. Pair with one of the show's professional dancers, and show the judges you've got the star power!  i2007kActivisionsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00261na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264002700040300002300067500000500090542003100095655002500126RD9J1800aPuzzle Series Vol. 1: Sudoku 1bHudson Softc2007-3-21  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00542na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002700045300002300072500024700095542003000342655002400372655002400396RDAE5200aDancing with the Stars: We Dance! 1bActivisionc2008-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aSeize your moment of glory in the battle of the ballroom with more stars, more dances, and more intense competition. Turn it on and dance as all of your favorite couples from past seasons as you dance your way to King & Queen of the Ballroom.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00742na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003900007264003500046300002300081500038300104542003800487655002500525655002700550655003100577RDBE7000aDragon Ball Z: Budokai Tenkaichi 2 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2006-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aDragon Ball Z: Budokai Tenkaichi 2 offers the complete DBZ mythology from Dragon Ball to Dragon Ball GT with a staggering roster of over 100 DBZ heroes and villains and an expansive story mode that allows players to recreate some of the storied confrontations from the TV show, or all-new showdowns of their own with characters that never actually fought in the animated series.  i2006kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00628na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264002000040300002300060500038300083542002500466655002700491RDBJAF00aDragon Ball Z: Sparking! Neo 1bNamcoc2007-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aDragon Ball Z: Budokai Tenkaichi 2 offers the complete DBZ mythology from Dragon Ball to Dragon Ball GT with a staggering roster of over 100 DBZ heroes and villains and an expansive story mode that allows players to recreate some of the storied confrontations from the TV show, or all-new showdowns of their own with characters that never actually fought in the animated series.  i2007kNamcosGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00651na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264002900046300002300075500038300098542003300481655002700514RDBPAF00aDragon Ball Z: Budokai Tenkaichi 2 1bNamco Bandaïc2007-3-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aDragon Ball Z: Budokai Tenkaichi 2 offers the complete DBZ mythology from Dragon Ball to Dragon Ball GT with a staggering roster of over 100 DBZ heroes and villains and an expansive story mode that allows players to recreate some of the storied confrontations from the TV show, or all-new showdowns of their own with characters that never actually fought in the animated series.  i2007kNamco BandaïsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00616na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264001800028300002300046500034900069542002300418655002500441655002800466RDCE7800aDeadly Creatures 1bTHQc2009-2-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aHunt or be hunted in Deadly Creatures, an action/suspense-thriller that puts you in the unlikely role of two of the desert's creepiest predators: the Tarantula and the Scorpion. Set against a cinematic backdrop of mystery, greed and murder, you'll explore the secrets of the desert as you fight for your survival in two interlocking adventures.  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00702na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002100007264001900028300002300047500035300070542002300423655002500446655002800471655002700499655003000526RDCP7800aDeadly Creatures 1bTHQc2009-2-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aHunt or be hunted in Deadly Creatures, an action/suspense-thriller that puts you in the unlikely role of two of the desert’s creepiest predators: the Tarantula and the Scorpion. Set against a cinematic backdrop of mystery, greed and murder, you’ll explore the secrets of the desert as you fight for your survival in two interlocking adventures.  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00829na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004200007264002200049300002300071500050300094542002600597655002400623655002400647655002400671RDDEA400aDance Dance Revolution: Hottest Party 1bKonamic2007-9-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe global dancing phenomenon gets even more physical with an entirely new game designed for the Nintendo Wii. Dance Dance Revolution Hottest Party enhances the series' trademark interactive gameplay by combining the physically engaging, innovative and easy-to-pick-up-and-play mechanics of the Wii. DDR Hottest Party is sure to be the life of the party with four-player multiplayer, Wii Remote and Nunchuk support, smash hits taken from the last four decades of music, entirely new modes and more.  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00830na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004200007264002300049300002300072500050300095542002600598655002400624655002400648655002400672RDDJA400aDance Dance Revolution: Hottest Party 1bKonamic2007-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe global dancing phenomenon gets even more physical with an entirely new game designed for the Nintendo Wii. Dance Dance Revolution Hottest Party enhances the series' trademark interactive gameplay by combining the physically engaging, innovative and easy-to-pick-up-and-play mechanics of the Wii. DDR Hottest Party is sure to be the life of the party with four-player multiplayer, Wii Remote and Nunchuk support, smash hits taken from the last four decades of music, entirely new modes and more.  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00431na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002200036300002300058500018900081542002600270655002500296RDEJ0A00aZenkoku Dekotora Matsuri 1bJalecoc2008-2-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aBuild, Paint, Customize, Drive, and Win! This game is all about your Big Rig and getting to the finish as fast as you can! Win races and get money to purchase new stuff for your truck!  i2008kJalecosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00799na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004000007264003900047300002300086500047000109542004200579655002500621655003100646RDFE4100aShaun White Snowboarding: Road Trip 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2008-11-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aShaun White Snowboarding: Road Trip takes the action-sports genre to a whole new level. For the first-time ever, feel the rocky weight of the mountain push up against your toes in your very own living room, ­with the revolutionary Wii Balance Board. Whether you’re coasting down bunny slopes or carving through black diamonds, don’t expect to survive this wild ride alone – you will need the support of an entourage and friends to make it down this mountain.  i2008kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00802na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004000007264003900047300002300086500047300109542004200582655002500624655003100649RDFP4100aShaun White Snowboarding: Road Trip 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2008-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aShaun White Snowboarding: Road Trip takes the action-sports genre to a whole new level. For the first-time ever, feel the rocky weight of the mountain push up against your toes in your very own living room, ­with the revolutionary Wii Balance Board™. Whether you’re coasting down bunny slopes or carving through black diamonds, don’t expect to survive this wild ride alone – you will need the support of an entourage and friends to make it down this mountain.  i2008kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00783na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002300032300002300055500050500078542002600583655002500609655002700634RDGEA400aCastlevania Judgment 1bKonamic2008-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe battle between good and evil continues with Castlevania Judgment, the first Castlevania title for the Wii. Castlevania Judgment brings together the many generations of heroic vampire hunters, including the fearsome Belmont clan, as well as Dracula’s most formidable allies, and pits them against one another in the first Castlevania 3D Versus Action game ever created! Choose sides from a collection of 14 battle-tested warriors in a clash of epic proportions that will span the depths of time.  i2008kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00791na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002200037300002300059500050400082542002600586655002700612655003000639RDGJA400aAkumajou Dracula Judgment 1bKonamic2009-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe battle between good and evil continues with Castlevania Judgment, the first Castlevania title for the Wii. Castlevania Judgment brings together the many generations of heroic vampire hunters, including the fearsome Belmont clan, as well as Dracula’s most formidable allies, and pits them against one another in the first Castlevania 3D Versus Action game ever created! Choose sides from a collection of 14 battle-tested warriors in a clash of epic proportions that will span the depths of time  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext00744na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264002200032300002300054500050400077542002600581655002700607RDGPA400aCastlevania Judgment 1bKonamic2009-3-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe battle between good and evil continues with Castlevania Judgment, the first Castlevania title for the Wii. Castlevania Judgment brings together the many generations of heroic vampire hunters, including the fearsome Belmont clan, as well as Dracula’s most formidable allies, and pits them against one another in the first Castlevania 3D Versus Action game ever created! Choose sides from a collection of 14 battle-tested warriors in a clash of epic proportions that will span the depths of time  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00503na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004400007264001800051300002300069500021500092542002300307655002500330655002600355RDHE7800aDestroy All Humans! Big Willy Unleashed 1bTHQc2008-3-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aCrypto is back in the franchise that turns the tables on sci-fi action games. Destroy All Humans! Big Willy Unleashed allows you to play as the alien and take on the most feared enemy in the galaxy – mankind!  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00465na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004400007264001800051300002300069500021500092542002300307655002500330RDHP7800aDestroy All Humans! Big Willy Unleashed 1bTHQc2008-3-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aCrypto is back in the franchise that turns the tables on sci-fi action games. Destroy All Humans! Big Willy Unleashed allows you to play as the alien and take on the most feared enemy in the galaxy – mankind!  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00776na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264003700046300002300083500045300106542004200559655002500601655002800626RDIE4100aArtlist Collection: The Dog Island 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2008-5-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aImagine that you're on an island full of dogs. In The Dog Island for Nintendo Wii, you play as a dog whose brother/sister falls ill one day. In order to help your brother/sister, you head to an island in search of a legendary flower. The game includes stages in grass planes, snowy fields and even deserts. You can also choose your dog from a variety of breeds. This is an adorable adventure for kids, based on the best-selling franchise 'THE DOG'.  i2008kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00360na  a2200121   4500001000700000245007000007264003800077300002300115500000500138542004200143655002500185655002800210RDIJG200aArtlist Collection: The Dog Island: Hitotsu no Hana no Monogatari 1bYuke's Media Creationsc2007-4-26  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kYuke's Media CreationssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00396na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264003800046300002300084500007200107542004200179655002500221655002800246RDIP4100aArtlist Collection: The Dog Island 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2008-4-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aTHE DOG ISLAND is an adorable puppy adventure on the WII™ System.  i2008kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00504na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264003300035300002300068500024100091542003700332655002500369RDJE4F00aDeath Jr.: Root of Evil 1bEidos Interactivec2008-5-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience life after death as the Grim Reaper’s teenage son Death Jr. (aka DJ), and his school sweetheart Pandora, as they embark on a journey to free DJ’s captured father and complete their school science project at the same time!  i2008kEidos InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00518na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002000035300002300055500024100078542002500319655002500344655002700369RDJP4F00aDeath Jr.: Root of Evil 1bEidosc2008-5-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience life after death as the Grim Reaper’s teenage son Death Jr. (aka DJ), and his school sweetheart Pandora, as they embark on a journey to free DJ’s captured father and complete their school science project at the same time!  i2008kEidossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext01230na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264002400037300002300061500098300084542002801067655002501095RDKE0100aDonkey Kong: Barrel Blast 1bNintendoc2007-10-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aRace to victory with the DK Crew! Donkey Kong and friends have located high-powered barrel rockets, and now the battle for king of the jungle is on. You've never played a racing game quite like this! Donkey Kong is Back! One of Nintendo's most popular characters, Donkey Kong, is back with all of his friends...and a few enemies as well! Diddy, Dixie, King K. Rool, and the whole gang appear as playable characters in this fast-paced racing adventure. Shake, Rattle, and Roll! Simple Wii controls make racing a snap. Shake the Wii Remote and Nunchuk to accelerate, then shake one or the other to turn. Jumps, attacks, and item usage are all accomplished with a single button press or controller shake. Rocket to Victory! Target enemies with a Pineapple Cannon, skillfully chain together Wild Moves, or use your Wii Remote to blast out of a Style Barrel! Multiple game-play modes, 16 awesome courses, and a rollicking 4-player multiplayer game will keep you coming back for more.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00479na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264002400037300002300061500023200084542002800316655002500344RDKJ0100aDonkey Kong Taru Jet Race 1bNintendoc2007-6-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aDonkey Kong Jet Race on Wii is a set of races taking again the principal characters of the series of Donkey Kong. Choose your pilot and race to the finish. The title is playable up to 4 players of insane wheel out split screen.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00512na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002400033300002300057500023200080542002800312655002500340655002500365RDKP0100aDonkey Kong: Jet Race 1bNintendoc2008-1-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aDonkey Kong Jet Race on Wii is a set of races taking again the principal characters of the series of Donkey Kong. Choose your pilot and race to the finish. The title is playable up to 4 players of insane wheel out split screen.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00386na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264003700033300002300070500011400093542004100207655002800248RDLE5G00aSpy Fox in Dry Cereal 1bMajesco Entertainmentc2008-8-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe award-winning best-selling Humongous children's property made popular on the PC is now available for Wii!  i2008kMajesco EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00308na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264003400033300002300067500000500090542003800095655002500133655002800158RDLP7000aSpy Fox in Dry Cereal 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2009-3-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00903na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264003700024300002300061500060400084542004100688655002500729655002700754RDME6K00aDomino Rally 1bUFO Interactive Gamesc2009-8-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aEver wanted to see a domino help you out? Now you can with Domino Rally - part platformer, part racer, and all fun. Use careful domino paths to help people with their everyday problems. Use the Wii control scheme to precisely set, balance, create, and topple your very own domino paths. There are secret paths to find and explore, as well as 90 secret items, memories, and additional content to discover as you race through the courses. The humor will keep you laughing from start to finish and the unique visuals and one-of-a-kind gameplay will have you zipping and zooming with all kinds of tiles!  i2009kUFO Interactive GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00201na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001800007264002300025300002300048500000500071542002700076RDMJ8N00aGo! Go! Minon 1bSuccessc2007-6-21  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kSuccesssGameTDB00253na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264002700032300002300059500000500082542003100087655002500118RDMPHZ00aMinon: Everyday Hero 1bNordcurrentc2009-4-24  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kNordcurrentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00612na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264002100050300002300071500032200094542002600416655002400442655002400466RDNEA400aDance Dance Revolution: Disney Grooves 1bKonamic2009-4-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe magical world of Disney hits the dance floor with an entirely new DanceDanceRevolution game on Wii. Featuring classic Disney characters and 40 Disney songs that we all know and love! DanceDanceRevolution Disney Grooves combines the mega-popular DanceDanceRevolution dancing hit with the wonderful world of Disney.  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00501na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264003900024300002300063500019200086542004200278655002900320655003000349RDOE4100aPetz: Dogz 2 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aPick a puppy pal from a pack of fuzzy and adorable puppies in Petz: Dogz 2! Together, you and your new cuddly companion will encounter a world that’s fun to play in, explore, and share.  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00818na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002900007264003900036300002300075500045700098542004200555655002800597655002900625655003000654RDOJ4100aWanko to Mahou no Boushi 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-12-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aPick a puppy pal from a pack of fuzzy and adorable puppies in Dogz! Together, you and your new cuddly companion will encounter a world that's fun to play in, explore, and share. Dress up your puppy in fun puppy clothes, play for hours with new toys, or look for hidden surprises that can give your puppy new abilities. Customize your puppy's environment with items and toys, and unlock more goodies as you get better at caring for your new best friend.  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00714na  a2200109   4500001000700000245000900007264003800016300002300054500045700077542004200534655002800576RDOP4100aDogz 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-12-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aPick a puppy pal from a pack of fuzzy and adorable puppies in Dogz! Together, you and your new cuddly companion will encounter a world that's fun to play in, explore, and share. Dress up your puppy in fun puppy clothes, play for hours with new toys, or look for hidden surprises that can give your puppy new abilities. Customize your puppy's environment with items and toys, and unlock more goodies as you get better at caring for your new best friend.  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00712na  a2200109   4500001000700000245000900007264003700016300002300053500045700076542004100533655002800574RDOX4100aDogz 1bUbiSoft Entertainmentc2007-12-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aPick a puppy pal from a pack of fuzzy and adorable puppies in Dogz! Together, you and your new cuddly companion will encounter a world that's fun to play in, explore, and share. Dress up your puppy in fun puppy clothes, play for hours with new toys, or look for hidden surprises that can give your puppy new abilities. Customize your puppy's environment with items and toys, and unlock more goodies as you get better at caring for your new best friend.  i2007kUbiSoft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00747na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264002400040300002300064500049500087542002700582655002800609RDPE5400aDora Saves the Snow Princess 1b2K Playc2008-10-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aA simple, easy to pick up and play, platform-based game aimed at pre-school children age 2-5, Dora Saves the Snow Princess makes good use of the intuitive Wii Remote. Within minutes your child will be building snowmen, ice skating, snowboarding, riding Pegasus, as well as enjoying a slew of other winter-themed activities. And with the game's 'Snowy Forest Helper' feature, parents can join in the fun as their child learns the importance of helping those in need and the value of friends.  i2008k2K PlaysGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00844na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003300007264003400040300002300074500049500097542003800592655002500630655002800655655002700683RDPP5400aDora Saves the Snow Princess 1bTake 2 Interactivec2009-1-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aA simple, easy to pick up and play, platform-based game aimed at pre-school children age 2-5, Dora Saves the Snow Princess makes good use of the intuitive Wii Remote. Within minutes your child will be building snowmen, ice skating, snowboarding, riding Pegasus, as well as enjoying a slew of other winter-themed activities. And with the game's 'Snowy Forest Helper' feature, parents can join in the fun as their child learns the importance of helping those in need and the value of friends.  i2009kTake 2 InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00844na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003300007264003400040300002300074500049500097542003800592655002500630655002800655655002700683RDPX5400aDora Saves the Snow Princess 1bTake 2 Interactivec2009-1-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aA simple, easy to pick up and play, platform-based game aimed at pre-school children age 2-5, Dora Saves the Snow Princess makes good use of the intuitive Wii Remote. Within minutes your child will be building snowmen, ice skating, snowboarding, riding Pegasus, as well as enjoying a slew of other winter-themed activities. And with the game's 'Snowy Forest Helper' feature, parents can join in the fun as their child learns the importance of helping those in need and the value of friends.  i2009kTake 2 InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00886na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006700007264002700074300002300101500055600124542003100680655002500711655002800736RDQEGD00aDragon Quest Swords: The Masked Queen and the Tower of Mirrors 1bSquare-Enixc2008-2-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aDeveloped from the ground up to take advantage of the Nintendo Wii and its motion-sensing technology, DRAGON QUEST SWORDS: The Masked Queen and the Tower of Mirrors is set to slice its way onto Nintendo’s next-generation platform. Use the Wii Remote™ to slash, parry and blast your way through a land filled with trademark DRAGON QUEST foes! Developed with both long-time fans and casual players in mind, DRAGON QUEST SWORDS: The Masked Queen and the Tower of Mirrors is poised to take video gaming to an entirely new level of fun and interaction.  i2008kSquare-EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00876na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005600007264002700063300002300090500055400113542003100667655002500698655003100723RDQJGD00aDragon Quest Swords: Kamen no Joou to Kagami no Tou 1bSquare-Enixc2007-7-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aDeveloped from the ground up to take advantage of the Nintendo Wii and its motion-sensing technology, DRAGON QUEST SWORDS: The Masked Queen and the Tower of Mirrors is set to slice its way onto Nintendo's next-generation platform. Use the Wii Remote™ to slash, parry and blast your way through a land filled with trademark DRAGON QUEST foes! Developed with both long-time fans and casual players in mind, DRAGON QUEST SWORDS: The Masked Queen and the Tower of Mirrors is poised to take video gaming to an entirely new level of fun and interaction.  i2007kSquare-EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00888na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006700007264002600074300002300100500055600123542003100679655002500710655003100735RDQPGD00aDragon Quest Swords: The Masked Queen and the Tower of Mirrors 1bSquare-Enixc2008-5-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aDeveloped from the ground up to take advantage of the Nintendo Wii and its motion-sensing technology, DRAGON QUEST SWORDS: The Masked Queen and the Tower of Mirrors is set to slice its way onto Nintendo’s next-generation platform. Use the Wii Remote™ to slash, parry and blast your way through a land filled with trademark DRAGON QUEST foes! Developed with both long-time fans and casual players in mind, DRAGON QUEST SWORDS: The Masked Queen and the Tower of Mirrors is poised to take video gaming to an entirely new level of fun and interaction.  i2008kSquare-EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00741na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264002200028300002300050500050700073542002600580655002500606RDREA400aDewy's Adventure 1bKonamic2007-9-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe evil Don Hedron has descended upon the peaceful forest with Black Water and it's up to Dewy, a small droplet of water, to eliminate the terrible scourge and save the Tree of Seven Colors. Take control of Dewy using the Wii Remote, rolling him around the environment and using special elemental powers with unique gesture-based controls to take on the dastardly forces of Don Hedron. Control heat and cold to transform Dewy into ice and steam to solve puzzles and restore a beautiful world of peace!  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00849na  a2200133   4500001000700000245005000007264002200057300002300079500050700102542002600609655002500635655002800660655002700688RDRJA400aDewy's Adventure: Suishou Dewy no Daibouken!! 1bKonamic2007-7-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe evil Don Hedron has descended upon the peaceful forest with Black Water and it's up to Dewy, a small droplet of water, to eliminate the terrible scourge and save the Tree of Seven Colors. Take control of Dewy using the Wii Remote, rolling him around the environment and using special elemental powers with unique gesture-based controls to take on the dastardly forces of Don Hedron. Control heat and cold to transform Dewy into ice and steam to solve puzzles and restore a beautiful world of peace!  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00821na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002100007264002300028300002300051500050700074542002600581655002500607655002800632655002700660RDRPA400aDewy's Adventure 1bKonamic2007-11-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe evil Don Hedron has descended upon the peaceful forest with Black Water and it's up to Dewy, 