 will find a new dimension to the Wii Fit experience as you easily set your own customized workout routines or choose 20-, 30- or 40-minute workouts based on how much time you have available. You will also be able to choose from specialized workout routines that focus on your individual personal fitness goals or certain target areas. And with the addition of activities like Skateboarding and Rhythm Kung Fu, you will be using the Wii Balance Board accessory in a variety of new and fun ways.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aCoaching games2wiiext 7aExercise games2wiiext 7aFitness games2wiiext00860na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264003600034300002300070500052000093542003900613655002500652655002400677655002500701RFQE6900aFaceBreaker K.O. Party 1bElectronic Arts Incc2008-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aAn arcade-styled boxing game developed by EA Canada. Created by the same team that developed the award-winning Fight Night Round 3, FaceBreaker offers irreverent fun, immersive gameplay and eye-popping stylized graphics. In this in-your-face, arcade world full of ego-wielding characters, each boxer comes to life with unique attributes and distinct personal style, including Romeo, a Latin lover known for his pelvic thrusts, and Molotov, an oversized Russian demolitions expert with a penchant for fighting dirty.  i2008kElectronic Arts IncsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext00349na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264003800034300002300072500000500095542004100100655002500141655002400166655002500190RFQJ1300aFaceBreaker K.O. Party 1bElectronic Arts Japanc2008-12-11  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kElectronic Arts JapansGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext00851na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264003100034300002300065500052000088542003500608655002500643655002400668655002500692RFQK6900aFaceBreaker K.O. Party 1bElectronic Artsc2009-2-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aAn arcade-styled boxing game developed by EA Canada. Created by the same team that developed the award-winning Fight Night Round 3, FaceBreaker offers irreverent fun, immersive gameplay and eye-popping stylized graphics. In this in-your-face, arcade world full of ego-wielding characters, each boxer comes to life with unique attributes and distinct personal style, including Romeo, a Latin lover known for his pelvic thrusts, and Molotov, an oversized Russian demolitions expert with a penchant for fighting dirty.  i2009kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext00855na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264003200034300002300066500052000089542003500609655002500644655002700669655002500696RFQP6900aFaceBreaker K.O. Party 1bElectronic Artsc2008-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aAn arcade-styled boxing game developed by EA Canada. Created by the same team that developed the award-winning Fight Night Round 3, FaceBreaker offers irreverent fun, immersive gameplay and eye-popping stylized graphics. In this in-your-face, arcade world full of ego-wielding characters, each boxer comes to life with unique attributes and distinct personal style, including Romeo, a Latin lover known for his pelvic thrusts, and Molotov, an oversized Russian demolitions expert with a penchant for fighting dirty.  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext00545na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264003700026300002300063500028300086542004100369655002500410RFRE5G00aFuru Furu Park 1bMajesco Entertainmentc2008-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aFuru Furu Park is a unique arcade experience that features 30 different mini games that all take advantage of the range of motion possible via Wii Remote play. Take on a friend in three multiplayer modes including Love Challenge where you can try your best to impress the girls!  i2008kMajesco EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aCompilations2wiiext00258na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264003300026300002300059500000500082542003700087655002400124RFRJC000aFuru Furu Park 1bMajesco Sales Incc2007-4-19  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00940na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002100031300002300052500065900075542002500734655003100759655002800790RFSEEB00aShiren the Wanderer 1bAtlusc2010-2-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aExplore a thousand years of history to solve a mystery in this time-traveling RPG. A princess has slept inside the Karakuri Mansion for one thousand years. When wandering samurai Shiren is given a key to the house, he unlocks a mystery that will take him into the past to figure out the present. Explore dungeons, villages, and other vibrant locations in feudal Japan to uncover the story of the sleeping princess and fight a menacing evil. Variable game options welcome players of all skill levels. You can customize the strength of your challenge with two difficulty modes, control your party directly, or set their tendencies and let the AI take over.  i2010kAtlussGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aRoguelike games2wiiext00295na  a2200109   4500001000700000245007600007264001900083300002300102500000500125542002400130655003100154RFSJ8P00aFushigi no Dungeon: Fuurai no Shiren 3: Karakuri Yashiki no Nemuri-hime 1bSegac2008-6-5  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kSegasGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00596na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264003500029300002300064500029700087542003800384655002500422655002700447RFTE7000aBackyard Football 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2007-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aCombines Authentic NFL plays and strategies with the wild and wacky antics of the Backyard gang. Players have control of the style, location, pace, and strategy of the game. And, with multiple levels, the game is easy enough for rookie players yet mega challenging for more seasoned veterans.  i2007kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00257na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264002200047300002300069500000500092542002600097655002400123RFUJA400aMahjong Fight Club Wii: Wi-Fi Taiou 1bKonamic2009-4-29  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aBoard games2wiiext00473na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264002700039300002300066500018300089542003000272655002500302655002400327RFVE5200aMonkey Mischief! Party Time 1bActivisionc2008-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe zoo keeper has left for the day and the monkeys are up to no good! It's all out mayhem and no one...including the hippos are safe from a little "monkey mischief" at this zoo!  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00424na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264002600028300002300054500018300077542003000260655002400290RFVP5200aMonkey Mischief! 1bActivisionc2009-2-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe zoo keeper has left for the day and the monkeys are up to no good! It's all out mayhem and no one...including the hippos are safe from a little "monkey mischief" at this zoo!  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00502na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003000007264004100037300002300078500009100101542004400192655002800236655002900264655003000293655003300323RFWE5Z00aSafari Adventures: Africa 1bConspiracy Entertainmentc2009-10-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aSafari Adventures is a collection of 3D adventure games for children 6 to 9 years old.  i2009kConspiracy EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00321na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264003500037300002300072500000500095542003800100655002800138655003300166RFWPNK00aSafari Adventures: Africa 1bNeko Entertainmentc2008-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kNeko EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00287na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002400031300002300055500000500078542002900083655002800112655002500140RFYFMR00aFort Boyard: Le Jeu 1bMindscapec2008-7-4  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kMindscapesGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00597na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264003800034300002300072500028500095542004200380655002900422655002400451RFZE4100aImagine: Fashion Party 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2009-1-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aStar in a reality TV show and compete through a series of challenges to show the world that you are the best young fashion designer! Play with a friend and design glamorous fashions on gorgeous models. Then show off your designs in front of the judges in a hot runway competition!  i2009kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00558na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264003700032300002300069500028500092542004200377655002900419RFZP4100aImagine Fashion Idol 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2009-2-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aStar in a reality TV show and compete through a series of challenges to show the world that you are the best young fashion designer! Play with a friend and design glamorous fashions on gorgeous models. Then show off your designs in front of the judges in a hot runway competition!  i2009kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00628na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002800038300002300066500032900089542003100418655002700449655003000476RG2EXS00aGuilty Gear XX Accent Core 1bAksys Gamesc2007-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe newest incarnation of the popular fighting game franchise, Guilty Gear XX Accent Core returns with its trademark high-resolution graphics along with an entirely retuned fighting system, new stages, new characters, graphics, voices and the ability to create matches between old and new characters in the Generations Mode.  i2007kAksys GamessGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a2D fighting games2wiiext00637na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264003200038300002300070500032900093542003600422655002700458655003000485RG2JJF00aGuilty Gear XX Accent Core 1bArc System Worksc2007-7-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe newest incarnation of the popular fighting game franchise, Guilty Gear XX Accent Core returns with its trademark high-resolution graphics along with an entirely retuned fighting system, new stages, new characters, graphics, voices and the ability to create matches between old and new characters in the Generations Mode.  i2007kArc System WorkssGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a2D fighting games2wiiext00571na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264002000038300002300058500032900081542002400410655002700434RG2PGT00aGuilty Gear XX Accent Core 1bSegac2008-2-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe newest incarnation of the popular fighting game franchise, Guilty Gear XX Accent Core returns with its trademark high-resolution graphics along with an entirely retuned fighting system, new stages, new characters, graphics, voices and the ability to create matches between old and new characters in the Generations Mode.  i2008kSegasGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00932na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005600007264002000063300002300083500066200106542002500768655002900793RG4JC000aDensha de Go! Shinkansen EX: San'you Shinkansen Hen 1bTaitoc2007-3-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is a popular train simulation game series in Japan. Game contains actual train (or tram) routes based on real services in Japan. For the most part, the user's task is to drive the train and adhere to a very exacting timetable, including stopping at stations to within as little as 30 cm of a prescribed stopping point, ideally within half a second of the scheduled arrival time. While the specifics vary slightly between versions, generally speaking along the way, the user is expected to obey speed limits and other posted signs, sound a warning for work parties along the track, arrive at between station waypoints on time, and perform similar tasks.  i2007kTaitosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00750na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004200007264006000049300002300109500042100132542006300553655002400616RG5EWR00aGuinness World Records: The Videogame 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2008-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aBreak records in your living room in a variety of stunts inspired by actual records found in the book. Compete in 36 wild and unique stunts as you take on family, friends and all challengers in your attempt to be the best! Go online and compare your score with players from all over the world, are you the world record holder? If you are the best, you could get listed in the official book of Guinness World Records.  i2008kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00750na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004200007264006000049300002300109500042100132542006300553655002400616RG5PWR00aGuinness World Records: The Videogame 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2008-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aBreak records in your living room in a variety of stunts inspired by actual records found in the book. Compete in 36 wild and unique stunts as you take on family, friends and all challengers in your attempt to be the best! Go online and compare your score with players from all over the world, are you the world record holder? If you are the best, you could get listed in the official book of Gunniess World Records.  i2008kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00929na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002100007264003600028300002300064500059500087542003900682655002400721655002400745655002600769RG6E6900aBoogie SuperStar 1bElectronic Arts Incc2008-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aBe “discovered” and whisked away to a secret, tropical island where you learn what it takes to be a star. Customize your character to create a performer who represents your unique style. Build your singing and dancing skills by performing in posh environments fit for a star. Have a blast playing with or against your friends, belting your favorite tunes into the microphone, and performing real dance moves that are captured on screen using the Wii’s motion-sensing technology. Once your skills are perfected, perform for the judges in the ultimate competition, the Boogie Star Show.  i2008kElectronic Arts IncsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00666na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002100007264003200028300002300060500034000083542003500423655002400458655002400482655002600506RG6P6900aBoogie SuperStar 1bElectronic Artsc2008-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor any girl who has ever dreamed of being a star, Boogie Superstar™ brings future stars one step closer. Combining the hottest music hits from around the world with the coolest dance moves and total character customisation, Boogie SuperStar provides girls the ultimate gaming experience: to sing and dance their way to superstardom!  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00670na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264003400024300002300058500037900081542003800460655002500498655002500523RG7EQH00aCity Builder 1bVirtual Play Gamesc2010-4-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aCity Builder offers a fresh take on classic pipe puzzle games by expanding the gameplay to three overlapping levels: road, underground (water mains) and sky (power lines). Connect resource pieces together to claim land while racing against the clock and overcoming madcap and hilarious obstacles. Solve each resource puzzle and watch each city grow in wacky and unique ways!  i2010kVirtual Play GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00490na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003800023300002300061500018300084542004200267655002900309655003000338RG8E4100aPetz Sports 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2008-11-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aDiscover a new brand furry-fun experience on Wii: care and play with adorable puppies and challenge your friends in multiplayer mode ... So who will cross the finish line first?!  i2008kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00463na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264003900039300002300078500018300101542004200284655002700326RG8P4100aPetz Sports: Dog Playground 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2008-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aDiscover a new brand furry-fun experience on Wii: care and play with adorable puppies and challenge your friends in multiplayer mode ... So who will cross the finish line first?!  i2008kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext00572na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264002400036300002300060500029200083542002700375655002500402655002300427RG9E5400aCarnival Games: MiniGolf 1b2K Playc2008-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aUp to 4 players can hit the links on over 25 larger-than-life, theme park style holes. If you’re ready to journey back to Medieval times, shoot out in the Wild West and walk the plank in Pirate’s Delight - all for the sake of sinking a putt - then welcome to Carnival Games MiniGolf!  i2008k2K PlaysGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00594na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264003500036300002300071500029200094542003800386655002500424655002300449RG9P5400aCarnival Games: MiniGolf 1bTake 2 Interactivec2008-10-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aUp to 4 players can hit the links on over 25 larger-than-life, theme park style holes. If you’re ready to journey back to Medieval times, shoot out in the Wild West and walk the plank in Pirate’s Delight - all for the sake of sinking a putt - then welcome to Carnival Games MiniGolf!  i2008kTake 2 InteractivesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00373na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264002100031300002300052500013900075542002400214655002500238RGAE8P00aPlanet 51: The Game 1bSegac2009-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlanet 51, the white picket-fence world reminiscent of 1950s America is happy, safe and predictable…until the unpredictable happens!  i2009kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00413na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002100031300002300052500013900075542002400214655002800238655002500266RGAP8P00aPlanet 51: The Game 1bSegac2009-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlanet 51, the white picket-fence world reminiscent of 1950s America is happy, safe and predictable…until the unpredictable happens!  i2009kSegasGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00661na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264002100043300002300064500036900087542002600456655002800482655002900510RGBE0800aHarvey Birdman: Attorney at Law 1bCapcomc2008-1-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aHarvey Birdman, Attorney at Law is a fully animated interactive adventure game that merges the fun and mayhem of the popular Adult Swim TV show with Capcom's unique style of gameplay. Players will step into the shiny wingtips of Harvey Birdman, a third-rate superhero turned third-rate defense attorney charged with exonerating parodied classic cartoon characters.  i2008kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00616na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003200007264002600039300002300065500027300088542003100361655002500392655002900417655003600446RGCEXS00aMiniCopter Adventure Flight 1bAksys Gamesc2008-4-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aEngage in 42 missions in 7 different environments from a child’s bedroom, hospital, hotel room and more! Use your air cannon and lift suction to discover hidden areas and coins. Hone your flying skills to receive the highest amount of points possible in every stage.  i2008kAksys GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFlight simulation games2wiiext00367na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003900007264003300046300002300079500000500102542003600107655002500143655002900168655003600197RGCJJF00aPetit Copter Wii: Adventure Flight 1bArc System Worksc2007-12-13  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kArc System WorkssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFlight simulation games2wiiext00453na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002100007264002500028300002300053500012400076542002900200655002500229655002900254655003600283RGCPGT00aRadio Helicopter 1b505 Gamesc2008-6-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aRadio Helicopter sees you piloting your very own radio controlled mini helicopter around everyday real world locations.  i2008k505 GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFlight simulation games2wiiext00581na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001900007264002200026300002300048500026800071542002600339655002500365655002600390655003100416RGDEA400aTarget: Terror 1bKonamic2008-4-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aTarget: Terror is a remake of the popular arcade shooter and will test your reflexes and skills as you blast your way through this light-gun shooter. Taking full advantage of Wii Remote and the Wii Zapper there is a seamless transition from the arcade to the Wii.  i2008kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aRail shooter games2wiiext00284na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005100007264003000058300002300088500000500111542003400116655002400150RGEJJ904aThe World of Golden Eggs: Nori Nori Rhythm-kei 1bAQ Interactivec2008-6-26  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kAQ InteractivesGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00706na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003700007264003500044300002300079500043000102542003900532655002500571RGFE6904aThe Godfather: Blackhand Edition 1bElectronic Arts Incc2007-3-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aA classic story about family, respect, and loyalty, Mario Puzo’s The Godfather and the Paramount Pictures film based on that novel serve as the game’s inspiration. The Godfather Blackhand Edition puts you at the center of the action in one of history’s most revered cinematic masterpieces, allowing you to choose your path as you rise from lowly outsider to envied and feared Don in a living world 1945–1955 New York.  i2007kElectronic Arts IncsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00738na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004000007264003100047300002300078500043000101542003500531655002500566655002500591RGFF6900aLe Parrain: Pouvoir et Manipulation 1bElectronic Artsc2007-3-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aA classic story about family, respect, and loyalty, Mario Puzo’s The Godfather and the Paramount Pictures film based on that novel serve as the game’s inspiration. The Godfather Blackhand Edition puts you at the center of the action in one of history’s most revered cinematic masterpieces, allowing you to choose your path as you rise from lowly outsider to envied and feared Don in a living world 1945–1955 New York.  i2007kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00732na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264003100041300002300072500043000095542003500525655002500560655002500585RGFI6900aIl Padrino: Blackhand Edition 1bElectronic Artsc2007-3-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aA classic story about family, respect, and loyalty, Mario Puzo’s The Godfather and the Paramount Pictures film based on that novel serve as the game’s inspiration. The Godfather Blackhand Edition puts you at the center of the action in one of history’s most revered cinematic masterpieces, allowing you to choose your path as you rise from lowly outsider to envied and feared Don in a living world 1945