joyed the pick-up-and-play gaming of Wii Sports.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00480na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001300007264002400020300002300044500013400067542002800201655002500229655002500254655002400279655003100303RHAP0100aWii Play 1bNintendoc2006-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aBundled with a Wii Remote, Wii Play offers a little something for everyone who enjoyed the pick-up-and-play gaming of Wii Sports.  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aTable tennis games2wiiext00370na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264002400027300002300051500013400074542002800208655002400236RHAW0100aHajimete no Wii 1bNintendoc2008-7-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aBundled with a Wii Remote, Wii Play offers a little something for everyone who enjoyed the pick-up-and-play gaming of Wii Sports.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00779na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004800007264002700055300002300082500042000105542003000525655002500555655002600580655003900606RHCE5204aThe History Channel: Battle for the Pacific 1bActivisionc2007-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe History Channel takes you to the Battle for the Pacific, where you can experience history brought to life in one of the defining campaigns of World War II. Relive epic land battles fought on some of the most brutal and unforgiving battlefields in recorded history. Play through the eyes of an American GI as you experience intense, no holds barred action against an opponent for which surrender isn't an option!  i2007kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00624na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004800007264002600055300002300081500030400104542003000408655002500438655003900463RHCP5204aThe History Channel: Battle for the Pacific 1bActivisionc2008-3-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aHarc a Csendes-óceán for Wii egy mesterlövész az első személy, aki immerses a játékos a közepén egy hadszíntér a legvéresebb a második világháború után. A bőr egy amerikai GI, a lejátszó előre szembe sokaságát az ellenség és megvalósítása a célok egy idő arzenálját.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00841na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003900007264002000046300002300066500046600089542002400555655002500579655002600604655003100630655003400661RHDE8P04aThe House of the Dead 2 & 3 Return 1bSegac2008-3-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aHORDES OF ZOMBIES UNLEASHED ON THE WII! Two grisly titles from the popular THE HOUSE OF THE DEAD series are being compiled into one action-packed horror shooter for the Wii. Both THE HOUSE OF THE DEAD 2 and 3 will feature the original arcade experience, complete with branching storylines, over six ghoul-filled game modes and bonus content. Re-live your glory days in the arcades and mow down packs of clawing, biting undead with the new rapid-fire Wii Zapper.  i2008kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aRail shooter games2wiiext 7aSurvival horror games2wiiext00810na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003900007264002000046300002300066500043500089542002400524655002500548655002600573655003100599655003400630RHDJ8P04aThe House of the Dead 2 & 3 Return 1bSegac2008-3-19  a1 Wii optical disc  a"Two grisly titles from the popular THE HOUSE OF THE DEAD? series are being compiled into one action-packed horror shooter for the Wii?. Both THE HOUSE OF THE DEAD 2 and III will feature the original arcade experience, complete with branching storylines, over six ghoul-filled game modes and bonus content. Re-live your "gory days" in the arcades and mow down packs of clawing, biting un-dead with the new rapid-fire Wii Zapper?!"  i2008kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aRail shooter games2wiiext 7aSurvival horror games2wiiext00847na  a2200157   4500001000700000245003900007264002000046300002300066500043500089542002400524655002500548655002600573655003100599655003400630655002500664RHDP8P04aThe House of the Dead 2 & 3 Return 1bSegac2008-3-28  a1 Wii optical disc  a"Two grisly titles from the popular THE HOUSE OF THE DEAD? series are being compiled into one action-packed horror shooter for the Wii?. Both THE HOUSE OF THE DEAD 2 and III will feature the original arcade experience, complete with branching storylines, over six ghoul-filled game modes and bonus content. Re-live your "gory days" in the arcades and mow down packs of clawing, biting un-dead with the new rapid-fire Wii Zapper?!"  i2008kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aRail shooter games2wiiext 7aSurvival horror games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00828na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264002600043300002300069500057000092542003100662655002500693RHEEJJ00aProfessor Heinz Wolff's Gravity 1bDeep Silverc2009-4-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aGravity is a fun filled puzzle game that will appeal to the young, the old, and everyone in between. The game has hours of game play and endless replayability with over 100 levels packed full of mind boggling and challenging puzzles. The player must master the correct placement of objects in order to advance to the next level. There is more than one way of completing a given puzzle - often times with surprising results. One thing that will stand out in this game is the high quality of hand painted background and artworks, as well as an atmospheric soundtrack.  i2009kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00325na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264002600043300002300069500006700092542003100159655002500190RHEPKM00aProfessor Heinz Wolff's Gravity 1bDeep Silverc2009-2-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aGravity is a combination of puzzle and braingame for everyone.  i2009kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00709na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001500007264002300022300002300045500047700068542002600545655002800571RHFE5D00aHappy Feet 1bMidwayc2006-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay as Mumble in the ultimate adventure to win the heart of Gloria and save the Emperor penguin nation. Based on Warner Bros. Pictures' upcoming comedy adventure HAPPY FEET, Midway's immersive videogame puts the player in the "tap shoes" of Mumble, a young penguin born into a nation of Emperor penguins— where each needs a Heartsong to attract a soul mate. Unfortunately, Mumble is the worst singer in the world... however, as it happens, he is a brilliant tap dancer!  i2006kMidwaysGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00741na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002200022300002300044500047700067542002600544655002400570655002500594RHFP5D00aHappy Feet 1bMidwayc2006-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay as Mumble in the ultimate adventure to win the heart of Gloria and save the Emperor penguin nation. Based on Warner Bros. Pictures' upcoming comedy adventure HAPPY FEET, Midway's immersive videogame puts the player in the "tap shoes" of Mumble, a young penguin born into a nation of Emperor penguins— where each needs a Heartsong to attract a soul mate. Unfortunately, Mumble is the worst singer in the world... however, as it happens, he is a brilliant tap dancer!  i2006kMidwaysGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00280na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264001900036300002300055500000500078542002300083655002500106655002700131RHGP6Z00aAgent Hugo: Lemoon Twist 1bNDSc2008-5-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kNDSsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00292na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264002500036300002300061500000500084542002900089655002500118655002700143RHGX6Z00aAgent Hugo: Lemoon Twist 1bITE Mediac2008-5-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kITE MediasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00476na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003100007264003100038300002300069500010500092542003500197655002500232655002400257655002400281655002500305RHHJ8J00aSuzumiya Haruhi no Gekidou 1bKadokawa Shotenc2009-1-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aDance along with Haruhi, Yuki, and Mikuru in The Melancholy of Haruhi Suzumiya for the Nintendo Wii.  i2009kKadokawa ShotensGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00642na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002800041300002300069500034700092542003100439655002500470655002500495RHIEXJ00aVictorious Boxers: Revolution 1bXSEED Gamesc2007-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake full advantage of the Wii Remote and Nunchuk’s unique capabilities for an authentic boxing experience in the best boxing simulation outside of stepping into a ring. Play against a friend in versus mode, or play through story mode as Ippo Makunouchi, a timid high school student, as he rises to the top of the professional boxing ranks.  i2007kXSEED GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext00585na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264003000037300002300067500028900090542003400379655002500413655002500438RHIJJ900aHajime no Ippo Revolution 1bAQ Interactivec2007-6-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aVictorious Boxers takes full advantage of the unique capabilities of the Wii Remote and Nunchuk to give players an authentic, real-life boxing experience. The various moves include punches like jabs, straights, uppercuts and hooks, as well as defensive maneuvers like ducks and sways.  i2007kAQ InteractivesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext00642na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003200007264003800039300002300077500028900100542004200389655002500431655002700456655002500483RHIP4100aVictorious Boxers Challenge 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2008-2-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aVictorious Boxers takes full advantage of the unique capabilities of the Wii Remote and Nunchuk to give players an authentic, real-life boxing experience. The various moves include punches like jabs, straights, uppercuts and hooks, as well as defensive maneuvers like ducks and sways.  i2008kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext00275na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264003800034300002300072500000500095542004100100655002400141RHJJ1300aGinsei Table Games Wii 1bElectronic Arts Japanc2008-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kElectronic Arts JapansGameTDB 7aBoard games2wiiext00686na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001600007264004200023300002300065500041800088542004600506655002400552RHKE1800aHelp Wanted 1bHudson Entertainment, Inc.c2009-5-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aHelp Wanted allows players to choose from completing over fifty odd jobs, including: Haunted House Monster, Clown, Make-up Artist, Pinch Hitter, Pizza Chef, Stunt Car Driver, Sumo Referee, Action Hero and Sushi Master to name just a few. The game includes multiple difficulty levels that change up the game play elements and a multiplayer feature that allows for head-to-head play on up to fifteen different jobs.  i2009kHudson Entertainment, Inc.sGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00659na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264002800025300002300053500041800076542003100494655002400525RHKJ1800aHataraku Hito 1bHudson Softc2008-11-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aHelp Wanted allows players to choose from completing over fifty odd jobs, including: Haunted House Monster, Clown, Make-up Artist, Pinch Hitter, Pizza Chef, Stunt Car Driver, Sumo Referee, Action Hero and Sushi Master to name just a few. The game includes multiple difficulty levels that change up the game play elements and a multiplayer feature that allows for head-to-head play on up to fifteen different jobs.  i2008kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00655na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001500007264002700022300002300049500041800072542003100490655002400521RHKP1800aJob Island 1bHudson Softc2009-3-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aHelp Wanted allows players to choose from completing over fifty odd jobs, including: Haunted House Monster, Clown, Make-up Artist, Pinch Hitter, Pizza Chef, Stunt Car Driver, Sumo Referee, Action Hero and Sushi Master to name just a few. The game includes multiple difficulty levels that change up the game play elements and a multiplayer feature that allows for head-to-head play on up to fifteen different jobs.  i2009kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00688na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006200007264003500069300002300104500035300127542003900480655002300519655002400542RHLE4Z00aWorld Championship Poker featuring Howard Lederer: All In 1bCrave Entertainmentc2007-5-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aDo you have what it takes to square off against the world’s toughest players like Howard Lederer, Annie Duke, Robert Williamson III, Marcel Luske, Thomas Bihl and Erin Ness? You’ll need superb skills, nerves of steel and a stone-cold poker face to win the pot in this latest version of World Championship Poker featuring Howard Lederer: All-In.  i2007kCrave EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aCard games2wiiext 7aPoker games2wiiext00453na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006200007264002500069300002300094500013800117542002900255655002300284655002400307RHLPGT00aWorld Championship Poker featuring Howard Lederer: All In 1b505 Gamesc2007-9-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aBrings to players the most popular poker games as played by the professionals, like Texas Hold ’em, Pineapple, Omaha and many more.  i2007k505 GamessGameTDB 7aCard games2wiiext 7aPoker games2wiiext00285na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264002300040300002300063500003500086542002700121655002700148RHMEE900aHarvest Moon: Magical Melody 1bNatsumec2009-8-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aStart a farm, build a village!  i2009kNatsumesGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext00837na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264003900040300002300079500055300102542004300655655002900698RHMP9900aHarvest Moon: Magical Melody 1bMarvelous Entertainmentc2008-5-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Harvest Goddess has turned to stone and the Harvest Sprites need your help to bring her back. You need to collect Musical Notes throughout the game in hopes of restoring her to her former self. There are 100 Musical Notes in the game and to collect the notes you must do a variety of different things, some more challenging than others. Such as shipping a certain number of items, winning a festival or making friends with the wild animals found around your farm. Only by collecting a certain number of notes will the Harvest Goddess come back!  i2008kMarvelous EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00802na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001800007264003300025300002300058500046500081542003800546655002500584655002900609655003000638RHNE7000aMy Horse & Me 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2008-2-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aAlmost every girl at some point in their life, dreams of riding or owning a horse. They share a special friendship that is nurtured through riding, training and caretaking. This unique horse experience is now captured in My Horse and Me. My Horse and Me is the most complete and most realistic horse experience simulation on PC, Nintendo DS™ & Wii™. Just like in real-life, name your very own horse and groom, train, and compete in equestrian competitions.  i2008kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00723na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264003500025300002300060500046500083542003800548655002700586RHNP7000aMy Horse & Me 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2007-11-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aAlmost every girl at some point in their life, dreams of riding or owning a horse. They share a special friendship that is nurtured through riding, training and caretaking. This unique horse experience is now captured in My Horse and Me. My Horse and Me is the most complete and most realistic horse experience simulation on PC, Nintendo DS™ & Wii™. Just like in real-life, name your very own horse and groom, train, and compete in equestrian competitions.  i2007kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext01022na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003600007264003100043300002300074500067400097542003500771655002500806655002600831655003100857RHOE8P04aThe House of the Dead: Overkill 1bSega of Americac2009-2-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe House of the Dead: Overkill charges you with mowing down waves of infected, blood-thirsty zombies in a last-ditch effort to survive and uncover the horrific truth behind the origins of the House of the Dead. Survival horror as its never been seen before, The House of the Dead: Overkill is a pulp-style take on the best selling, classic SEGA light-gun shooter series. Back when the famous Agent G was fresh out of the academy, he teamed up with hard-boiled bad-ass Agent Washington to investigate stories of mysterious disappearances in small-town Louisiana. Little did they know what blood-soaked mutant horror awaited them in the streets and swamps of Bayou City.  i2009kSega of AmericasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aRail shooter games2wiiext00553na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003600007264002000043300002300063500022700086542002400313655002500337655002600362655003100388RHOJ8P04aThe House of the Dead: Overkill 1bSegac2009-9-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe House of the Dead: Overkill charges you with mowing down waves of infected, blood-thirsty zombies in a last-ditch effort to survive Bayou City and uncover the horrific truth behind the origins of the House of the Dead.  i2009kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aRail shooter games2wiiext00553na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003600007264002000043300002300063500022700086542002400313655002500337655002600362655003100388RHOP8P04aThe House of the Dead: Overkill 1bSegac2009-2-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe House of the Dead: Overkill charges you with mowing down waves of infected, blood-thirsty zombies in a last-ditch effort to survive Bayou City and uncover the horrific truth behind the origins of the House of the Dead.  i2009kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aRail shooter games2wiiext00293na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500000500087542002700092655002800119655002400147RHPJ8N00aAkko de Pon! Ikasama Hourou-ki 1bSuccessc2008-7-3  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kSuccesssGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext00961na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004100007264003500048300002300083500060600106542003800712655002800750655002400778655002500802RHQE4Q00aHannah Montana: Spotlight World Tour 1bDisney Interactivec2007-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aGo on a wild ride to pop-stardom as you help Hannah Montana win her greatest musical challenge yet. Tour the world as the pop princess herself and live the dream of rock stardom on stage and off while developing musical and fashion skills. Dance with your Wii Remote as Hannah dances with you on stage to earn devoted fans worldwide. Off stage, design the look of each show, including stage settings and wardrobe, and even special effects and pyrotechnics. With Lilly, Oliver, Jackson, and Robbie’s support during transitions and minigames, “it’s the best of both worlds” all around the world.  i2007kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00920na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264003400048300002300082500060600105542003800711655002400749655002500773RHQP4Q00aHannah Montana: Spotlight World Tour 1bDisney Interactivec2008-6-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aGo on a wild 