 nemesis and restore peace to the city!  i2008kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSkateboarding games2wiiext00742na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002800029300002300057500045200080542003100532655002500563655003200588RHUP7J00aSkate City Heroes 1bZoo / Zushic2008-11-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aYour best skating buddy has been kidnapped by Virus, your arch-nemesis, and only you can save him! Become a skateboard master as you zip between hover cars, grind on rails, and pull sick tricks combos throughout a futuristic metropolis. Hidden bonuses and items will help you impress the evil captor in order to free your friend. Your grappling laser and trusty skateboard are all you need to smack down your nemesis and restore peace to the city!  i2008kZoo / ZushisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSkateboarding games2wiiext00687na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002400007264002600031300002300057500036300080542003000443655002500473655002800498655002700526RHVE5Z00aCrazy Chicken Tales 1bConspiracyc2010-1-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aPrepare for the wildest ride of your life! Join Moorhuhn and his friends on their greatest adventure yet- searching for the Forsaken Castle of lore. Face deadly traps and cunning fiends as you jump, run and ride on the backs of Moorhuhn's friends through colorful landscapes of mysterious woods, rocky mountain ranges, treacherous plains and gloomy dungeons.  i2010kConspiracysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00312na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264003800031300002300069500000500092542004100097655002500138655002700163RHVPFR00aCrazy Chicken Tales 1bDigital Tainment Poolc2009-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kDigital Tainment PoolsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00510na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264002600034300002300060500026200083542003000345655002500375RHWE5200aHot Wheels: 