ong.  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00254na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264002100046300002300067500000500090542002500095655002400120RHYJAF00aHaneru no Tobira Wii: Giri Girissu 1bNamcoc2007-12-6  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kNamcosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00507na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264003900026300002300065500019600088542004200284655002900326655003000355RHZE4100aPetz: Horsez 2 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aSaddle up for fun in a game that combines your passion for horses with thrills and adventure! You'll be rewarded for raising horses, training champions, and saving the ranch in Petz Horsez 2.  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00806na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003200007264003900039300002300078500040800101542004200509655002500551655002500576655002900601655003000630RHZP4100aPippa Funnell: Ranch Rescue 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aLily never thought this day would change her life. The rich and treacherous banker Rud Van Guiness was going to seize her family ranch! She was also far from imagining that she would meet Grant, the famous horse whisperer, that she would save the ranch from bankruptcy by winning several riding competitions and that she would meet Liam to fight against the violent methods used by the Van Guiness clan.  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00589na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264003500041300002300076500028000099542003800379655002400417655002600441RI2E4Q00aHigh School Musical: Sing It! 1bDisney Interactivec2007-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aWith “High School Musical: Sing It!,” players express themselves through music with an all-new karaoke twist where they can choose 