at the tip of your fingers as you seek, search and discover with the Wii Remote. Help Cate compile evidence, track down hideouts, and discover the link between these crimes and an unsolved mystery from her past!  i2009kDestineer StudiossGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00338na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002800042300002300070500003800093542003200131655002800163655002500191RKEPGN00aCate West: The Vanishing Files 1bOxygen Gamesc2009-9-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aFind the Clues. Solve the Crimes.  i2009kOxygen GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00704na  a2200145   4500001000700000245005300007264003200060300002300092500030000115542003600415655002700451655002500478655003000503655002500533RKFEH404aThe King of Fighters Collection: The Orochi Saga 1bSNK Playmore USAc2008-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe most extensive King of Fighters Collection collection, The King of Fighters Collection: The Orochi Saga contains five complete games, including the Orochi Saga trilogy ('95-'97) as well as KOF '94 and KOF '98: Dream Match Never Ends. Also featured are a variety of unlockable bonus features.  i2008kSNK Playmore USAsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7a2D fighting games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00328na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005300007264003100060300002300091500000500114542003500119655002700154655002500181RKFKZA04aThe King of Fighters Collection: The Orochi Saga 1bWBA Interactivec2009-9-30  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kWBA InteractivesGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00420na  a2200145   4500001000700000245005300007264003700060300002300097500000500120542004200125655002700167655002500194655003000219655002500249RKFP7U04aThe King of Fighters Collection: The Orochi Saga 1bIgnition Entertainmentc2009-4-2  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kIgnition EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7a2D fighting games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00412na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001500007264003300022300002300055500016400078542003600242655002400278RKGEGY00aBratz Kidz 1bThe Game Factoryc2008-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to the Bratz Kidz Slumber Party! Join your favorite Bratz Kidz characters for a game filled with all the fun of a late night party – no boys allowed!  i2008kThe Game FactorysGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00419na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264003200029300002300061500016500084542003600249655002400285RKGPGY00aBratz Kidz: Party 1bThe Game Factoryc2008-12-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to the Bratz Kidz Slumber Party! Join your favourite Bratz Kidz characters for a game filled with all the fun of a late night party – no boys allowed!  i2008kThe Game FactorysGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext01125na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002500045300002300070500082700093542003000920655002500950655002800975RKHE5200aKung Fu Panda: Legendary Warriors 1bActivisionc2008-1-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the Kung Fu Panda video game, players embark on an epic, action-packed adventure as they master the specialized Kung Fu fighting styles of Po the Panda, the unlikely hero, his teacher Shifu, and the legendary Kung Fu masters, the Furious Five: Monkey, Tigress, Viper, Mantis and Crane. Through 13 legendary levels from the movie and beyond, and spanning land, water and air, players must work their way to become the Dragon Warrior and defeat the ultimate enemy, Tai Lung, as they battle a variety of foes, overcome dangerous obstacles, navigate multi-tiered environments and solve challenging puzzles. Featuring a deep variety of gameplay, unique co-op and competitive multiplayer modes, collectibles, and a host of character upgrades, the Kung Fu Panda video game provides an experience gamers of all ages will enjoy.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01089na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264002700045300002300072500082700095542003000922655002700952RKHP5200aKung Fu Panda: Legendary Warriors 1bActivisionc2008-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the Kung Fu Panda video game, players embark on an epic, action-packed adventure as they master the specialized Kung Fu fighting styles of Po the Panda, the unlikely hero, his teacher Shifu, and the legendary Kung Fu masters, the Furious Five: Monkey, Tigress, Viper, Mantis and Crane. Through 13 legendary levels from the movie and beyond, and spanning land, water and air, players must work their way to become the Dragon Warrior and defeat the ultimate enemy, Tai Lung, as they battle a variety of foes, overcome dangerous obstacles, navigate multi-tiered environments and solve challenging puzzles. Featuring a deep variety of gameplay, unique co-op and competitive multiplayer modes, collectibles, and a host of character upgrades, the Kung Fu Panda video game provides an experience gamers of all ages will enjoy.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00429na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264003300034300002300067500013000090542003700220655002500257655002500282RKIENR00aKidz Sports Ice Hockey 1bDestineer Studiosc2008-1-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet your skates on and take control of your favorite Kidz Sports characters in some of the wackiest games of ice hockey ever!  i2008kDestineer StudiossGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aHockey games2wiiext00291na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264002600034300002300060500000500083542003100088655002500119655002500144RKIPUG00aKidz Sports Ice Hockey 1bData Designc2008-3-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kData DesignsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aHockey games2wiiext00291na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264002600034300002300060500000500083542003100088655002500119655002500144RKIXUG00aKidz Sports Ice Hockey 1bData Designc2008-3-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kData DesignsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aHockey games2wiiext00354na  a2200109   4500001000700000245011600007264002800123300002300151500000500174542003200179655003300211RKJJ0Q00aZaidan Houjin Nihon Kanji Nouryoku Kentei Kyoukai Koushiki Soft: 250 Mannin no Kanken: Wii de Tokoton Kanji Nou 1bIE Institutec2008-7-31  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kIE InstitutesGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00762na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264003700029300002300066500045700089542004100546655002500587655002800612RKKE6K00aHeavenly Guardian 1bUFO Interactive Gamesc2008-4-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aHeavenly Guardian embodies the fast paced fun and adventure of the classic arcade shooter while utilizing the powers of the Nintendo® Wii to add new thrills to the genre. Journey through various environments and fight through a variety of mythological creatures! Fight the journey solo, or gain the aid of your companions in cooperative two-player action. Search for power-ups and special items to vanquish the evil gods and save your love from death.  i2008kUFO Interactive GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00656na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001300007264002800020300002300048500041500071542003200486655002800518RKLEG900aCoraline 1bD3 Publisherc2009-1-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe only videogame based on the movie, Coraline will allow players to explore and interact with such immersive 3-D environments from the movie as the Pink Palace, with its nooks and crannies and apartments, and the unpredictable Other World. Players will engage in unique mini-games and adventures with Coraline’s friends Wybie and Cat as they collect items that will unlock the mysteries of the Other World.  i2009kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00693na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001300007264002800020300002300048500041500071542003200486655002500518655002800543RKLPG900aCoraline 1bD3 Publisherc2009-6-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe only videogame based on the movie, Coraline will allow players to explore and interact with such immersive 3-D environments from the movie as the Pink Palace, with its nooks and crannies and apartments, and the unpredictable Other World. Players will engage in unique mini-games and adventures with Coraline’s friends Wybie and Cat as they collect items that will unlock the mysteries of the Other World.  i2009kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00890na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264004100037300002300078500056500101542004500666655002700711655003000738RKME5D00aMortal Kombat: Armageddon 1bMidway Home Entertainmentc2007-5-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time ever on the Wii™, players will be able to experience the latest chapter in Midway’s award-winning, best selling video game fighting franchise, Mortal Kombat®: Armageddon™. With the most complete roster ever, including more than 60 fighters from the entire Mortal Kombat® universe (past, present and future), a revolutionary Kreate-A-Fighter mode and Kreate-A-Fatality mode, plus a brand new Konquest mode and Endurance Mode, Mortal Kombat®: Armageddon™ promises to be the most complete, intensely lethal, fighting experience ever!  i2007kMidway Home EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext00809na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264002200037300002300059500056400082542002600646655002700672RKMP5D00aMortal Kombat: Armageddon 1bMidwayc2007-6-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time ever on the Wii™, players will be able to experience the latest chapter in Midway's award-winning, best selling video game fi ghting franchise, Mortal Kombat®: Armageddon™. With the most complete roster ever, including more than 60 fighters from the entire Mortal Kombat® universe (past, present and future), a revolutionary Kreate-A-Fighter mode and Kreate-A-Fatality mode, plus a brand new Konquest mode and Endurance Mode, Mortal Kombat®: Armageddon™ promises to be the most complete, intensely lethal, fighting experience ever!  i2007kMidwaysGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00320na  a2200109   4500001000700000245009300007264002300100300002300123500000500146542002600151655003300177RKNJ2N00aZaidan Houjin Nihon Kanji Nouryoku Kentei Kyoukai Kounin: Kanken Wii: Kanji-ou Ketteisen 1bRocketc2007-12-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kRocketsGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00263na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004200007264002300049300002300072500000500095542002800100655002500128RKOJBL00aRilakkuma: Minna de Goyururi Seikatsu 1bMTO Inc.c2009-3-5  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kMTO Inc.sGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00749na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002500025300002300050500047100073542003000544655002500574655002800599RKPE5200aKung Fu Panda 1bActivisionc2008-6-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Kung Fu Panda, players embark on an epic, action-packed adventure as they master the specialized Kung Fu fighting styles of Po the Panda, his teacher Shifu, and the legendary Kung Fu masters. Through 13 legendary levels from the movie and beyond, players must work to become the Dragon Warrior and defeat the ultimate enemy Tai Lung, as they battle a variety of foes, overcome dangerous obstacles, navigate multi-tiered environments and solve challenging puzzles.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00721na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002600036300002300062500047100085542003000556655002500586RKPJ5200aDreamWorks Kung Fu Panda 1bActivisionc2008-7-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Kung Fu Panda, players embark on an epic, action-packed adventure as they master the specialized Kung Fu fighting styles of Po the Panda, his teacher Shifu, and the legendary Kung Fu 