0002300074500036700097542003700464655002500501RKQENR00aCandace Kane's Candy Factory 1bDestineer Studiosc2008-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe zany world of Syrupton comes to the Wii in Candace Kane’s Candy Factory, a fast-paced, addictive puzzle game that puts players in the role of Candace Kane as she attempts to earn enough to make her way to the International Candy Cup Championships. Go it alone or play with a friend in the colorful world of Syrupton, only in Candace Kane’s Candy Factory!  i2008kDestineer StudiossGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00416na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264003200034300002300066500011400089542003700203655002500240655002900265RKSENR00aKidz Sports Basketball 1bDestineer Studiosc2008-1-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake control of your favorite Kidz Sports characters in some of the wackiest games of full-court 3-on-3 ever!  i2008kDestineer StudiossGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBasketball games2wiiext00383na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264003100034300002300065500008500088542003400173655002500207655002900232RKSPUG00aKidz Sports Basketball 1bPopcorn Arcadec2008-11-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aAlways wanted to be a Basketball Hero? With Kidz Sports Basketball, now you can!  i2008kPopcorn ArcadesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBasketball games2wiiext00395na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264003500034300002300069500008500092542004200177655002500219655002900244RKSXUG00aKidz Sports Basketball 1bMetro 3D / Data Designc2017--  a1 Wii optical disc  aAlways wanted to be a Basketball Hero? With Kidz Sports Basketball, now you can!  i2017kMetro 3D / Data DesignsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBasketball games2wiiext00426na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264003300044300002300077500011700100542003700217655002500254655002500279RKTENR00aKidz Sports International Soccer 1bDestineer Studiosc2008-2-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake control of your favorite Kidz Sports characters in some of the wackiest games of international soccer ever!  i2008kDestineer StudiossGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00500na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264003000046300002300076500019300099542003400292655002500326655002700351RKTXUG00aKidz Sports International Football 1bPopcorn Arcadec2008-7-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is your chance to be the sporting hero you’ve always dreamed of! Take control of your team and battle against your opposition in some of the wackiest games of 11-a-side action ever!  i2008kPopcorn ArcadesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00795na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001500007264002400022300002300046500045000069542002900519655002500548655002500573655002400598655002700622RKVE5404aThe BIGS 2 1b2K Sportsc2009-7-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Big Leagues just got BIGGER! Available on all major video game consoles, The BIGS™ 2 allows fans to experience heroic gameplay, legendary game modes and incredible player models. Elevating The BIGS 2 to new heights are bigger power-ups, amazing visual effects, and an all new Become a Legend mode. Featuring exciting player animations and pick-up-and-play controls, The BIGS 2 delivers an action-packed, heroic MLB® video game experience.  i2009k2K SportssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00707na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264004400032300002300076500042500099542004800524655002500572RKVP5404aThe Bigs 2: Baseball 1bTake 2 Interactive / GameTekc2009-8-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe BIGS™ 2 celebrates the most epic moments in Baseball and offers a refreshingly fun and dramatic experience. Fans can enjoy heroic fast-paced gameplay with new opportunities to go up against big baseball legends, more skill-testing mini-games and a variety of other thrilling new features. With exciting player animations and pickup-and-play controls the The BIGS™ 2 baseball delivers an action packed experience.  i2009kTake 2 Interactive / GameTeksGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00224na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003300007264002700040300002300067500000500090542003100095RKWJ1800aJigsaw Puzzle: Kyou no Wanko 1bHudson Softc2007-7-26  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kHudson SoftsGameTDB00421na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001400007264002500021300002300046500015200069542002900221655002400250655002500274RKXE6900aRock Band 1bMTV Gamesc2008-6-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aRock Band for Wii features over 60 songs ranging across all genres of rock, including five extra bonus tracks exclusive to the disc for Wii gamers!  i2008kMTV GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00433na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001400007264003100021300002300052500015200075542003500227655002400262655002500286RKXP6900aRock Band 1bElectronic Artsc2008-9-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aRock Band for Wii features over 60 songs ranging across all genres of rock, including five extra bonus tracks exclusive to the disc for Wii gamers!  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00829na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003700007264002600044300002300070500057200093542002900665655002500694RKYE2000aArmy Men: Soldiers of Misfortune 1bZoo Gamesc2008-10-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aAssume the role of Timmy, mini action adventure hero, and fight the forces of evil in "Army Men: Soldiers of Misfortune." Timmy's Tan Army Men action figures have run amok, capturing his Green Army Men, and attempting to take control of his little slice of suburbia! It's up to you to defeat the enemy, save your toys and family, and restore order to your home! The house is your playground as you control a 3 inch tall Timmy and a slew of toy weaponry to keep his tan Army Men from achieving "Global Home Domination." You'll never look at your toys the same again...  i2008kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00866na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002500044300002300069500057200092542002900664655002500693655002600718RKYP7J00aArmy Men: Soldiers of Misfortune 1bZoo Gamesc2009-1-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aAssume the role of Timmy, mini action adventure hero, and fight the forces of evil in "Army Men :Soldiers of Misfortune." Timmy's Tan Army Men action figures have run amok, capturing his Green Army Men, and attempting to take control of his little slice of suburbia! It's up to you to defeat the enemy, save your toys and family, and restore order to your home! The house is your playground as you control a 3 inch tall Timmy and a slew of toy weaponry to keep his tan Army Men from achieving "Global Home Domination." You'll never look at your toys the same again...  i2009kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00537na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264002200037300002300059500029100082542002600373655002800399RKZEA400aLost in Blue: Shipwrecked 1bKonamic2008-9-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou find yourself stranded on a mysterious island filled with lush forests, a sunken ship, ancient ruins, and an active volcano. With the help of a trusty pet and a new friend, you'll explore the mysteries of the island to find a way out or make a new life for yourselves there forever.  i2008kKonamisGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00510na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264002100029300002300050500027300073542002600346655002800372RKZJA400aSurvival Kids Wii 1bKonamic2008-8-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aStranded on a mysterious island filled with lush forests, a sunken ship, ancient ruins, and an active volcano. With the help of a trusty pet and a new friend, you'll explore the mysteries of the island to find a way out or make a new life for yourselves there forever.  i2008kKonamisGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00519na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264002200037300002300059500027300082542002600355655002800381RKZPA400aLost in Blue: Shipwrecked 1bKonamic2009-2-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aStranded on a mysterious island filled with lush forests, a sunken ship, ancient ruins, and an active volcano. With the help of a trusty pet and a new friend, you'll explore the mysteries of the island to find a way out or make a new life for yourselves there forever.  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00514na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001900007264002000026300002300046500016700069542002300236655002500259655002500284655002900309655003000338RL2E7800aGallop & Ride! 1bTHQc2008-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aLife with a horse is a dream come true! Take on the ownership of the Old Mill Ranch—it's up to you to renovate, manage and care for the stables and your horses.  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00601na  a2200109   4500001000700000245006800007264002500075300002300100500031000123542002900433655002900462RL2HMN00aPaard & Pony: Mijn Paardenstal: Al Jouw Ruiterdromen Komen Uit! 1bMindscapec2008-12-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe riding stable at the old mill is going to shine with a new gleam: the condition of the riding hall is alarming, there's a draught in the stall and no one wants to live in the guest house. But that's all in the past, because now you've arrived and are bringing your worst rivals to the edge of despair.  i2008kMindscapesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00627na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264003600043300002300079500031000102542004100412655002500453655002700478RL2PFR00aHorse & Pony: My Riding Stables 1bDigital Tainment Poolc2007-4-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe riding stable at the old mill is going to shine with a new gleam: the condition of the riding hall is alarming, there's a draught in the stall and no one wants to live in the guest house. But that's all in the past, because now you've arrived and are bringing your worst rivals to the edge of despair.  i2007kDigital Tainment PoolsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00718na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001200007264002800019300002300047500048200070542003100552655002500583RL3EMJ00aLuxor 3 1bMumbo Jumboc2008-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aLUXOR 3 takes you on an ethereal journey as you battle the power-hungry god of Chaos to free the essences of other Egyptian gods before they reach the pyramid at the end of their path. Utilize reflectors to make nearly impossible matches, make three matches in a row and release supernatural power-ups, and collect Ankh coins to use for purchasing important upgrades. Plus collect canopic jars to unlock bonus levels and hit elusive Golden Scarabs to discover hidden treasures!  i2008kMumbo JumbosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00991na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005000007264004000057300002300097500065300120542004300773655002500816655002800841RL4E6400aLEGO Indiana Jones 2: The Adventure Continues 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2009-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's not Mr. Jones. It's not Dr. Jones. It's LEGO Jones! Indiana Jones returns in LEGO form for a new twist on one of Hollywood's most legendary adventures. Don your fedora, grab your whip, and experience a quirky LEGO take on all four Indiana Jones films, including your first crack at visiting the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull. Collect artifacts, unlock characters from Indy's adventures, and use your whip to solve treasure-hunting puzzles. Drop-in, drop-out co-op play lets anyone join at any time. You can even create your own movie moments with LEGO's first-ever Build Your Own Adventure Mode, which lets you design and share your own levels.  i2009kLucasArts EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00860na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005000007264004000057300002300097500052200120542004300642655002500685655002800710RL4P6400aLEGO Indiana Jones 2: The Adventure Continues 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2009-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aLEGO Indiana Jones 2: The Adventure Continues is a comedic action/adventure game that combines the fun and creative construction of LEGO bricks with the wits, daring and non-stop action of one of cinema’s most beloved adventure heroes. With a unique, tongue-in-cheek take on all the Indiana Jones films – including for the first time ever Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull – LEGO Indiana Jones 2 follows Dr. Jones’ escapades from the jungles of South America to the Peruvian Ruins and beyond.  i2009kLucasArts EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00478na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001100007264002700018300002300045500024600068542003000314655002400344RL5E5200aiCarly 1bActivisionc2009-10-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the iCarly videogame, the possibilities are truly endless as players help Carly, Sam, Freddie and the other characters from the hit TV series craft all-new webisodes of the show in an original storyline designed specifically for the game.  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00477na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001100007264002600018300002300044500024600067542003000313655002400343RL5P5200aiCarly 1bActivisionc2009-11-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the iCarly videogame, the possibilities are truly endless as players help Carly, Sam, Freddie and the other characters from the hit TV series craft all-new webisodes of the show in an original storyline designed specifically for the game.  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00886na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002400007264003700031300002300068500053900091542004000630655002500670655002600695655003100721RL6E6900aNerf N-Strike Elite 1bElectronic Arts Inc.c2009-10-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aBundled with the newly designed blue NERF Switch Shot EX-3 blaster and attachable decoder lens that will deliver a blend of covert operation elements with over-the-top blasting missions, NERF: N-Strike Elite features a classic rail shooter style of gameplay and equips players with a cache of fresh features. With the Wii-remote snapped into the NERF Switch Shot EX-3 blaster and the red reveal lens engaged, players will be able to detect enemy weak spots, solve puzzles and decode secret messages as they blast their way to victory.  i2009kElectronic Arts Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aRail shooter games2wiiext00695na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003200038300002300070500042800093542003500521655002900556RL7E6900aLittlest Pet Shop: Friends 1bElectronic Artsc2009-10-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aLittlest Pet Shop Friends centers on party preparations as girls and their favorite pets get ready to celebrate. Littlest Pet Shop Friends is brimming with new elements that girls love, from an all-new, adorable collection of pets and their pet best-friends, to a large array of customizable accessories, fun mini-games, and a deep story with all new adventures set in a vibrant world that features delightful new graphics.  i2009kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00533na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003200038300002300070500027100093542003500364655002400399RL7P6900aLittlest Pet Shop: Friends 1bElectronic Artsc2009-10-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your friends, grab your pets—it’s time to party! The second edition of the LITTLEST PET SHOP video game brings the party to you with a new cast of quirky pets and their best friends. Play tons of new mini-games and explore new towns with your favorite pets.  i2009kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00454na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002500031300002300056500017200079542002900251655002500280655002700305RL8E5400aMLB Power Pros 2008 1b2K Sportsc2008-7-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aMLB® Power Pros 2008 delivers a unique flair to America's favorite pastime with an original visual style, pick-up-and-play gameplay mechanics and deep gameplay modes.  i2008k2K SportssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00742na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264002700024300002300051500046200074542003100536655002500567655002800592RL9PHZ00aKing of Pool 1bNordcurrentc2009-5-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aEver since you were young you've played pool. After your friends introduced you to the sport, you knew it would be your hobby for life - but you never thought it would become your way of life. After long years of hard learning and practice, you're finally ready to start climbing the career ladder of a professional pool player and compete with the best of the best. You can see you goal on the horizon, and you know it - you'll be the King of Pool someday!  i2009kNordcurrentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBilliards games2wiiext00458na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004900007264002500056300002300081500019000104542002900294655002500323RLADMR00aDeal or No Deal: Der Banker schlaegt zurueck 1bMindscapec2009-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aBack by popular demand, Endemol's award-winning TV game show 'Deal or No Deal' is now on Nintendo Wii. The Banker Is Back is the sequel to the successful Deal Or No Deal on Nintendo DS.  i2009kMindscapesGameTDB 7aTrivia games2wiiext00523na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264002500027300002300052500028400075542002900359655002500388RLAE2000aDeal or No Deal 1bZoo Gamesc2009-1-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe hit TV show is coming to your favorite video game system! The premise is simple: You have 26 briefcases in front of you. Each one contains a different amount of money. Open each case one by one, and try to find the briefcase with the biggest amount of money. Deal Or No Deal?  i2009kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aTrivia games2wiiext00449na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264002500047300002300072500019000095542002900285655002500314RLAPMR00aDeal or No Deal: The Banker Is Back 1bMindscapec2009-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aBack by popular demand, Endemol's award-winning TV game show 'Deal or No Deal' is now on Nintendo Wii. The Banker Is Back is the sequel to the successful Deal Or No Deal on Nintendo DS.  i2009kMindscapesGameTDB 7aTrivia games2wiiext00529na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264005400038300002300092500022100115542005800336655002500394RLBEWR00aLEGO Batman: The Videogame 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainmentc2008-9-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aLEGO Batman: The Videogame is the latest game from the award-winning team behind the LEGO Star Wars series of games. With the LEGO fun and charm, the game takes you into the world of the ultimate crime-fighting hero.  i2008kWarner Bros. Interactive EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00538na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264006000038300002300098500021900121542006300340655002500403RLBPWR00aLEGO Batman: The Videogame 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2008-10-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aLEGO Batman: The Video Game is the latest game from the award-winning team behind the LEGO Star Wars series. With trademark LEGO fun and charm, the game takes you into the world of the ultimate crime-fighting hero.  i2008kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00480na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002200031300002300053500020800076542002500284655002500309655002400334RLCP7J00aLove Is... in Bloom 1bZushic2009-10-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aLove Is... playing together. Now heres your chance with Love Is... In Bloom on the Nintendo Wii. Plant, nurture and sell flowers to build your own floral empire and a great relationship at the same time!  i2009kZushisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00523na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264004000032300002300072500024600095542004500341655002700386RLDEGY00aLegend of the Dragon 1bThe American Game Factoryc2007-5-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aClassic arcade style fighting game with a blend of RPG boasting an original never-seen before new spell casting battle system. Featuring characters and settings from the cartoon series of the same name, LOD is an eye-candy visual piece where  i2007kThe American Game FactorysGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00264na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264003100032300002300063500000500086542003600091655002700127RLDPFK00aLegend of the Dragon 1bThe Game Factoryc2007-6-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kThe Game FactorysGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00440na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002400027300002300051500016500074542002800239655002500267655002600292RLEEFS00aTen Pin Alley 2 1bXS Gamesc2008-10-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aTen Pin Alley™ returns this Fall with its pin smashing, wall crashing cast of bowling characters. XS Games™ proudly presents Ten Pin Alley 2™ for the Wii!  i2008kXS GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBowling games2wiiext00670na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004800007264004000055300002300095500033400118542004300452655002500495655002800520RLFE6400aStar Wars: The Clone Wars: Lightsaber Duels 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2008-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aNow everyone can experience the fun and excitement of a Lightsaber fight. Star Wars The Clone Wars: Lightsaber Duels and Star Wars The Clone Wars: Jedi Alliance immerses you in the characters, locations, and epic duels from the all-new Star Wars animated feature film and television series set between Episode II and Episode III.  i2008kLucasArts EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00630na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004800007264004000055300002300095500033400118542004300452655002500495RLFP6400aStar Wars: The Clone Wars: Lightsaber Duels 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2008-11-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aNow everyone can experience the fun and excitement of a Lightsaber fight. Star Wars The Clone Wars: Lightsaber Duels and Star Wars The Clone Wars: Jedi Alliance immerses you in the characters, locations, and epic duels from the all-new Star Wars animated feature film and television series set between Episode II and Episode III.  i2008kLucasArts EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext01171na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264003900045300002300084500088600107542004300993655002501036RLGE6400aLEGO Star Wars: The Complete Saga 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2007-11-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aBuilding on the success of both LEGO Star Wars videogames, LEGO Star Wars: The Complete Saga enables families to play through the events of all six Star Wars movies in one videogame for the first time ever. From the Trade Federation's "negotiations" with Obi-Wan Kenobi and Qui-Gon Jinn in The Phantom Menace to the space battle above Endor in Return of the Jedi, The Complete Saga allows players to kick some brick through 36 Story Mode levels, including Episode II's newly added high-speed pursuit of bounty hunter Zam Wessell. Traveller's Tales has revamped levels from the original LEGO Star Wars to match the gameplay evolutions found in LEGO Star Wars II, and Prequel Trilogy characters can now be mixed and matched with those from the Original Trilogy -- more than 160 in all. Features include new playable characters, an upgraded character customizer, and new bonus levels.  i2007kLucasArts EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00267na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264002600045300002300071500000500094542003000099655002800129RLGJ5200aLEGO Star Wars: The Complete Saga 1bActivisionc2008-3-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00889na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264003900045300002300084500060400107542004300711655002500754RLGP6400aLEGO Star Wars: The Complete Saga 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2007-11-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aLEGO Star Wars: The Complete Saga brings the whole family together to play, for the first time ever, through all six Star Wars movies in one videogame. Developer Traveller's Tales adds new levels, new characters and new features to this tongue-in-cheek take on the Star Wars galaxy, as well as enhanced graphics and other unique functionalities serving the strengths of all next-generation consoles. From the Trade Federation's piece offering with Obi-Wan Kenobi and Qui-Gon Jinn to the space battle above Endor, The Complete Saga is everything you experienced in both LEGO Star Wars games and more.  i2007kLucasArts EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00969na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004500007264003100052300002300083500061700106542003600723655002500759655002400784655002700808RLHE5200aLittle League World Series Baseball 2008 1bActivision Valuec2008-8-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first officially licensed Little League video game to hit next-generation consoles. Players will bat, pitch and field their way from local sandlot slugger to Little League World Series Champion. Featuring eight U.S. and eight international teams, extraordinarily deep character customization, World Series Mode, and a variety of skill based challenges, Little League World Series offers an exciting, authentic baseball experience. Motion-sensing controls on the Wii make it accessible for Little League players and parents alike, while the DS version gives players the freedom to get on the diamond anywhere.  i2008kActivision ValuesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00921na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004500007264002500052300002300077500061700100542003000717655002500747655002700772RLHP5200aLittle League World Series Baseball 2008 1bActivisionc2009-2-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first officially licensed Little League video game to hit next-generation consoles. Players will bat, pitch and field their way from local sandlot slugger to Little League World Series Champion. Featuring eight U.S. and eight international teams, extraordinarily deep character customization, World Series Mode, and a variety of skill based challenges, Little League World Series offers an exciting, authentic baseball experience. Motion-sensing controls on the Wii make it accessible for Little League players and parents alike, while the DS version gives players the freedom to get on the diamond anywhere.  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00638na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004800007264003800055300002300093500030400116542004300420655002500463655002800488RLIE6400aLEGO Indiana Jones: The Original Adventures 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2008-6-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aLEGO® Indiana Jones™: The Original Adventures takes the fun and creative construction of LEGO and combines it with the wits, daring and non-stop action from the original cinematic adventures that enthralled audiences everywhere, from Indy’s entanglements with snakes to his dashing boulder run.  i2008kLucasArts EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00980na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004800007264003800055300002300093500068600116542004300802655002500845RLIP6400aLEGO Indiana Jones: The Original Adventures 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2008-6-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aLEGO Indiana Jones: The Original Adventures takes the fun and creative construction of LEGO and combines it with the wits, daring and non-stop action from the original cinematic adventures that enthralled audiences everywhere (Indiana Jones and the Raiders of the Lost Ark, Indiana Jones and the Temple of Doom and Indiana Jones and the Last Crusade). With a unique tongue-in-cheek take on the original adventures, LEGO Indiana Jones follows Dr. Jones escapades through the jungles of South America to the mountaintops of India. Fans can build, battle and brawl their way through their favorite cinematic moments, from Indy’s entanglements with snakes to his dashing boulder run.  i2008kLucasArts EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00677na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264003500033300002300068500041200091542003900503655002500542RLJEHJ00aLine Rider 2: Unbound 1bGenius Products Incc2008-10-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aBoy grabs sled. Boy rides sled. A simple concept yields endless fun and the latest Internet Phenomenon is born! In Line Rider the player draws their own landscape with a simple pencil tool creating as many ramps, hills, and jumps as they can imagine. Then they send a virtual sledder careening down the course until he wipes out. The possibilities in Line Rider are only limited by the player's imagination.  i2008kGenius Products IncsGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00524na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264002700032300002300059500027600082542003100358655002500389RLJPKM00aLine Rider Freestyle 1bDeep Silverc2009-7-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Line Rider, the sled-stealing scumbag Chaz is up to no good and only you, as the clever and cunning Bosh, can defeat him. For Bosh to save his true love Bailey, players must solve over 40 mind-bending puzzles created by the #1 Line Rider player in the world, TechDawg.  i2009kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00723na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264004200042300002300084500043000107542004500537655003100582RLKEGY00aCode Lyoko: Quest for Infinity 1bThe American Game Factoryc2007-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aAn adventure/RPG based on the 3D animated action-adventure television series, Code Lyoko is about a group of students who uncover a parallel universe called Lyoko inside a super-computer that is threatened by a virus that could destroy the universe. Four ordinary students -- Jeremy, Odd, Ulrich and Yumi -- must help a virtual humanoid creature named "Aelita" to stop rogue computer XANA's latest attack on their real world.  i2007kThe American Game FactorysGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00313na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264003300042300002300075500000500098542003600103655002500139655002700164RLKPFK00aCode Lyoko: Quest for Infinity 1bThe Game Factoryc2007-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kThe Game FactorysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00278na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264003500043300002300078500000500101542003800106655002400144RLLP7000aGo West! A Lucky Luke Adventure 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2007-11-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00771na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001300007264002700020300002300047500053500070542003200605655002400637RLNEVN00aSurvivor 1bValcon Gamesc2011-1-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aDo you have what it takes to be the last Survivor? Now you can find out! Outwit, outplay, and outlast the competition in this game based on the long-running hit reality series. Join host Jeff Probst on a remote tropical island where you'll compete in 24 challenges just like the ones you see on the show. Choose from 16 Survivors and become a member of the Jalapao or Timbira tribe. You can invite up to three friends to play with you. Whether or not you make them barter for chocolates and shoes when they come over is up to you.  i2011kValcon GamessGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00326na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001400007264002600021300002300047500009300070542002900163655002400192RLNFMR00aKoh-Lanta 1bMindscapec2008-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou are on a remote island paradise, two tribes, immunity challenges and Tribal Council!  i2008kMindscapesGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00335na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264002600030300002300056500009300079542002900172655002400201RLNHMR00aExpeditie Robinson 1bMindscapec2008-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou are on a remote island paradise, two tribes, immunity challenges and Tribal Council!  i2008kMindscapesGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00336na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264002600031300002300057500009300080542002900173655002400202RLNIMR00aL' Isola dei Famosi 1bMindscapec2008-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou are on a remote island paradise, two tribes, immunity challenges and Tribal Council!  i2008kMindscapesGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00553na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001300007264002600020300002300046500031600069542002900385655002900414RLNPMR00aSurvivor 1bMindscapec2009-12-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis game is perfect for any fan of the show Survivor. Players will be able to live like the contestants on Survivor. With challenges such as fishing, collecting food and participating in Immunity challenges, players will compete to outwit, outlast and outplay in order to be crowned the ultimate sole Survivor.  i2009kMindscapesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00884na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264003200029300002300061500058400084542003500668655002900703655003000732RLPE6900aLittlest Pet Shop 1bElectronic Artsc2008-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe newest and cutest pets are yours to collect when you step into the Littlest Pet Shop! Choose from 32 of the fuzziest, cuddliest animal friends you could have. Name your pet and begin to explore the four environments the Littlest Pet Shop holds. Travel to a lush jungle, share winter activities together, spend a day in the garden, and manage your shop through the Pet Plaza. Care for your pets and complete mini-games with them to earn accessories, playsets, and new pets. Don't forget to spoil your pals with scarves, glasses, and over 100 more irresistible pet accessories.  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00755na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264003200029300002300061500049900084542003500583655002700618RLPP6900aLittlest Pet Shop 1bElectronic Artsc2008-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aJump right into your own Littlest Pet Shop, full of cute, quirky pets that magically come to life in an exciting digital world. Collect some of the newest and cutest pets and explore the four separate environments where you can care for and play with your pets in a variety of mini-games. The more time you spend having fun with your pet, the more great stuff you earn for your pet shop, including new pets, playsets, accessories, and more. Experience your Littlest Pet Shop in a whole new way!  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext00965na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002200007264003600029300002300065500058800088542003900676655002500715655002900740655002500769655002500794RLQE5200aBig League Sports 1bActivision Blizzardc2008-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aBig League Sports for Wii offers instant access to the most action-packed moments in sports. The result is a title with a singular focus on putting you in the most thrilling situations while competing in your favorite sports. Six sports are represented for a combined total of 22 events, each using instinctive controls that mimic real athletic movement with the Wii Remote. Each sport -- tennis, basketball, football, soccer, lacrosse and hockey -- has its own kind of "hit the shot at the buzzer" style of heart-pounding action, and this is exactly what Big League Sports captures.  i2008kActivision BlizzardsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBasketball games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext 7aHockey games2wiiext00875na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002600037300002300063500058800086542003000674655002500704655002400729RLQP5200aWorld Championship 