g rat with dreams of becoming a great French chef, despite the obvious problem of being a rat!  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00526na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001600007264001800023300002300041500022500064542002300289655002500312655002800337655002700365RLWZ7800aRatatouille 1bTHQc2007-8-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aRelive the most thrilling and hilarious moments from the Disney/Pixar film Ratatouille, as you assume the role of Remy, a young rat with dreams of becoming a great French chef, despite the obvious problem of being a rat!  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00889na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003100007264002700038300002300065500055800088542003100646655002500677655002800702655002500730RLXEMJ00aLuxor: Pharaoh's Challenge 1bMumbo Jumboc2008-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aEmbark on a thrilling adventure through the lands of ancient Egypt in the latest installment of the hit LUXOR series. Enjoy 88 gorgeously-rendered levels of brilliantly crisp and stunning graphics portraying pyramids, temples and many more of Egypt’s amazing marvels. Guide your mystical winged-shooter, swooping back and forth, as you destroy an onslaught of magical spheres before they reach the pyramid lying at the end of their path. To help eliminate enemy spheres, LUXOR: Pharaoh’s Challenge features more explosive power-ups than ever before!  i2008kMumbo JumbosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00376na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264002700038300002300065500012200088542003100210655002500241RLXP3600aLuxor: Pharaoh's Challenge 1bCodemastersc2008-5-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aEmbark on a thrilling adventure! Complete 88 levels of play and marvel at how great the fascinating wonders of Egypt.  i2008kCodemasterssGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00599na  a2200