5003700007264002000044300002300064500041300087542002300500655002800523RN3E7800aNicktoons: Attack of the Toybots 1bTHQc2007-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe evil Professor Calamitous is at it again! But this time he’s gone too far. He has created evil robots that look just like our Nicktoons heroes! Now, SpongeBob, Jimmy Neutron, Danny Phantom, Timmy Turner, and Tak must stop them and the Professor no matter what it takes. By using new attacks, and awesome mech suits, now you can help our heroes stop the evil professor before he wreaks havoc everywhere!  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00616na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004800007264002000055300002300075500032100098542002300419655002500442655002700467RN3J7800aSpongeBob to Nakamatachi: Toybot no Kougeki 1bTHQc2007-12-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aProfessor Calamitous has constructed a vast army of evil toys based on the Nicktoons Heroes, and launched them on a multi-dimensional invasion! Help the Nicktoons stop his diabolical plan and defeat their duplicates! Play as SpongeBob, Tak, Jimmy Neutron or the rest of their pals to face their toughest battle ever!  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00605na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002000044300002300064500032100087542002300408655002500431655002700456RN3P7800aNicktoons: Attack of the Toybots 1bTHQc2007-11-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aProfessor Calamitous has constructed a vast army of evil toys based on the Nicktoons Heroes, and launched them on a multi-dimensional invasion! Help the Nicktoons stop his diabolical plan and defeat their duplicates! Play as SpongeBob, Tak, Jimmy Neutron or the rest of their pals to face their toughest battle ever!  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00605na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002000044300002300064500032100087542002300408655002500431655002700456RN3X7800aNicktoons: Attack of the Toybots 1bTHQc2007-11-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aProfessor Calamitous has constructed a vast army of evil toys based on the Nicktoons Heroes, and launched them on a multi-dimensional invasion! Help the Nicktoons stop his diabolical plan and defeat their duplicates! Play as SpongeBob, Tak, Jimmy Neutron or the rest of their pals to face their toughest battle ever!  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00837na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264003800029300002300067500052700090542004200617655002900659655002700688RN4E4100aDawn of Discovery 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2009-6-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aDawn of Discovery takes place in the year 1404, when King George’s land is suffering from severe droughts and brutal famine. Aware of his people’s distress, the king calls on his two sons, William and Edward, to acquire new territories in order to produce enough goods to satisfy the needs of his empire’s inhabitants. Whereas Edward suggests aggressive means to collect the precious resources, his brother William offers a peaceful solution, proposing to explore new and unsettled lands in the south of the kingdom.  i2009kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00910na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002900007264002300036300002300059500057400082542002700656655002900683655002700712655003700739RN4P4100aAnno: Create a New World 1bUbisoftc2009-5-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aAnno: Create a New World, takes place in year 1404, where King George's land suffers from drought and famine. Aware of the distress of his citizens, he decides to remedy the situation by sending his two sons, William and Edward, to explore new fertile territories that could produce enough goods to satisfy his people. Despite being brothers, both sons have very different personalities; where Edward suggests fighting to collect the resources they need, his brother William offers a more peaceful approach, suggesting they explore new and unsettled lands to the south.  i2009kUbisoftsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aReal-time strategy games2wiiext00584na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004400007264002000051300002300071500029700094542002300391655002400414655002400438RN5E7804aThe Naked Brothers Band: The Video Game 1bTHQc2008-10-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aBecome a part of the Naked Brothers Band Tour! Use your Wii remote and nunchuk or microphone to sing along and play up to 5 instruments as each member of the band. Includes 25 of your favorite Naked Brothers Band songs. Play to unlock new songs, concert venues, outfits, instruments and more!  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00548na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004400007264002000051300002300071500029700094542002300391655002400414RN5P7804aThe Naked Brothers Band: The Video Game 1bTHQc2008-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aBecome a part of the Naked Brothers Band Tour! Use your Wii remote and nunchuk or microphone to sing along and play up to 5 instruments as each member of the band. Includes 25 of your favorite Naked Brothers Band songs. Play to unlock new songs, concert venues, outfits, instruments and more!  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext00563na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004000007264003400047300002300081500020800104542003700312655002500349655002900374655002600403RN6ENR00aNorth American Hunting Extravaganza 1bDestineer Studiosc2008-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aHead out into the wild to track and hunt the most dangerous game in North America. Set your sights on over 20 different wildlife species, with a variety of weapons and hunting equipment at your disposal.  i2008kDestineer StudiossGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00552na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004000007264002800047300002300075500020800098542003200306655002500338655002900363655002600392RN6P7J00aNorth American Hunting Extravaganza 1bFunbox Mediac2010-8-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aHead out into the wild to track and hunt the most dangerous game in North America. Set your sights on over 20 different wildlife species, with a variety of weapons and hunting equipment at your disposal.  i2010kFunbox MediasGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00727na  a2200157   4500001000700000245002300007264001900030300002300049500035200072542002300424655002500447655002400472655002500496655002300521655002500544RN7E7800aNeighborhood Games 1bTHQc2009-1-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake a walk down memory lane to the days when you played with your friends until dark¿ Imagine a place where you can play all those games, where the level of competition is matched only by the sheer amount of fun. Neighborhood Games is that place, offering 24 unique twists on those popular games. No need to worry about the rain ending your fun!  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext 7aTennis games2wiiext00519na  a2200157   4500001000700000245002100007264001900028300002300047500014600070542002300216655002500239655002400264655002500288655002300313655002500336RN7P7800aBig Family Games 1bTHQc2009-5-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to the Neighbourhood where the fun never ends. Endless amounts of fun for the entire family. It will never rain in your neighborhood.  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext 7aTennis games2wiiext00321na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005000007264001900057300002300076500000500099542002400104655003100128655004000159RN8JC800aNobunaga no Yabou: Kakushin with Power-Up Kit 1bKoeic2008-3-6  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kKoeisGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aTactical role-playing games2wiiext00564na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264003300034300002300067500030200090542003700392655002500429RN9E4F00aEscape from Bug Island 1bEidos Interactivec2007-7-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs Ray, you wake up alone in a deep and fog covered forest. Your friends are nowhere to be found. It was supposed to be a cozy night camping in the woods... until strange creatures rose from the darkness. You must find your friends, survive the horrific forest and get off the island in one piece.  i2007kEidos InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00235na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001600007264002100023300002300044500000500067542002500072655002800097RN9JEL00aNecro-Nesia 1bSpikec2006-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2006kSpikesGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00582na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264002100034300002300055500029800078542002500376655002500401655003400426RN9P4F00aEscape from Bug Island 1bEidosc2007-9-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs Ray, you wake up alone in a deep and fog covered forest. Your friends are nowhere to be found. It was supposed to be a cozy night camping in the woods until strange creatures rose from the darkness You must find your friends, survive the horrific forest and get off the island in one piece.  i2007kEidossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSurvival horror games2wiiext00823na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264003500038300002300073500051400096542003900610655002500649655002700674RNAE6900aNCAA Football 09: All-Play 1bElectronic Arts Incc2008-7-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aNow everyone can compete using EA SPORTS All-Play. Get ready for the most fun you've ever had with a college football game. Celebrate your own way after a BIG touchdown during the Wii-exclusive Crowd Hype moments to improve your team's abilities on the field. NCAA on the Wii is the most accessible football experience. There are different playbooks available on the fly for all skill levels and the most approachable controls. Everyone from a novice to an experienced player will have blast playing together.  i2008kElectronic Arts IncsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext01355na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003100023300002300054500106700077542003501144655002501179655002901204RNBE6900aNBA Live 08 1bElectronic Artsc2007-10-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aProviding an unrivaled level of authenticity, NBA LIVE 08 introduces hot spots, using real NBA shot data to illuminate the locations on the floor where your players are most effective. Couple this with all-new signature go-to moves that capture the essence of the NBA's best, and you can now play the game on a console like you see it from the stands. All-new shooting mechanics - from deep three-point shots well beyond the arc to 10-foot jump shots in the paint, every shot attempt has been redesigned to provide more fluid, realistic results. Dunks and lay-ups are now assigned to the same button command making highlight reel plays even easier to perform. Running at a smooth 60 frames per second, NBA LIVE 08 is as close as you can get to the court, without dropping a dime for courtside seats. Player faces, team uniforms, and authentic arenas jump to life behind the power of next-generation game graphics. Whether you're working on your game in the revamped practice gym, or playing in front of a packed house, feel what it's like to be an NBA superstar.  i2007kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBasketball games2wiiext00638na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003100023300002300054500035000077542003500427655002500462655002900487RNBP6900aNBA Live 08 1bElectronic Artsc2007-10-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen the game is on the line and the ball is in your hands, what will you do? Will you penetrate, drive the lane and rise above the rim for a monster dunk, or find an opening on the perimeter and sink a game-winning three? Take control of the game with a full arsenal to win the one-on-one match-up from every spot on the floor with NBA LIVE 08.  i2007kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBasketball games2wiiext00597na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001600007264003100023300002300054500035000077542003500427655002500462RNBX6900aNBA Live 08 1bElectronic Artsc2007-10-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen the game is on the line and the ball is in your hands, what will you do? Will you penetrate, drive the lane and rise above the rim for a monster dunk, or find an opening on the perimeter and sink a game-winning three? Take control of the game with a full arsenal to win the one-on-one match-up from every spot on the floor with NBA LIVE 08.  i2007kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00668na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264003200038300002300070500036700093542003600460655002500496655002500521RNCEH400aSNK Arcade Classics Vol. 1 1bSNK Playmore USAc2008-7-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aCelebrate the history of SNK with the ultimate collection of arcade classic hits. Featuring the following 16 NEOGEO games: Art of Fighting, Baseball Stars 2, Burning Fight, Fatal Fury, KOF 94, King of the Monsters, Last Resort, Magician Lord, Metal Slug, Neo Turf Masters, Samurai Shodown, Sengoku, Shock Troopers, Super Sidekicks 3, Top Hunter and World Heroes.  i2008kSNK Playmore USAsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00423na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264002200045300002300067500017000090542002500260655002800285RNDJAF00aNodame Cantabile: Dream Orchestra 1bNamcoc2007-12-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a本作是“交响情人梦系列”登陆Wii的第一款作品，游戏以完全原创的故事开始，将你带入不一样的《交响情人梦》的世界中。  i2007kNamcosGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext01001na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005200007264002100059300002300080500073700103542002400840655002700864RNEEDA00aNaruto Shippuden: Clash of Ninja Revolution III 1bTomyc2009-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aWii's most explosive fighting game is back, better than ever, building off of its previous successes and implementing the much anticipated Wi-Fi gameplay! Now you can face off against competitors from all across North America over the internet. Featuring an all-new storyline and updated cast of characters from the NARUTO Shippuden series, NARUTO Shippuden: Clash of Ninja Revolution 3 is sure to re-ignite your passion for an ultra competitive, ninja fighting experience - only on Nintendo Wii. After two and a half years, a lot has changed in the Hidden Leaf Village! After years of training, a more mature Naruto has returned home, only to find out that his friend Gaara has been kidnapped by the sinister Akatsuki organization!  i2009kTomysGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00787na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004900007264002100056300002300077500052600100542002400626655002700650RNEJDA00aNaruto Shippuuden: Gekitou Ninja Taisen! EX3 1bTomyc2008-11-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aDragon Ball Z: Budokai Tenkaichi 3 delivers an extreme 3D fighting experience, improving upon last year's game with over 150 playable characters, enhanced fighting techniques, beautifully refined effects and shading techniques, making each character's effects more realistic, and over 20 battle stages. This is the ultimate chapter in Budokai Tenkaichi series with over 20 new characters that have never been seen in any other DBZ video games such as Nail, King Cold and King Vegeta and battle stages that fans will love.  i2008kTomysGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00569na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006900007264001900076300002300095500025300118542002400371655002500395655002700420RNEPDA00aNaruto Shippuden: Clash of Ninja Revolution 3 - European Version 1bTomyc2010-4-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet ready for the ultimate anime action, because Naruto returns to the Wii in spectacular style. The third game in the Clash of Ninja Revolution series offers even more excitement, as players can fight as usual, but for the first time, also online.  i2010kTomysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00863na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264003500025300002300060500056700083542003900650655002500689655002700714RNFE6900aMadden NFL 08 1bElectronic Arts Incc2007-8-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe unstoppable football franchise enters the third year of its five-year exclusivity contract with the '08 entry in the series. Play with only the Wii Remote with EA SPORTS Family Play or use the Wii Remote and Nunchuk for more advanced controls. Featuring an all-new Party Mode, in which you can play trivia or chose from 22 minigames. Break-down plays and highlight key moments with the all-new Madden NFL 08 telestrator. Bring the game online, play head to head with friends and keep up to date with the live sports ticker for the ultimate online experience.  i2007kElectronic Arts IncsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00580na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264003100025300002300056500029200079542003500371655002500406655002700431RNFP6900aMadden NFL 08 1bElectronic Artsc2007-8-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aWith more Europeans discovering American football every year, EA has embraced accessibility as a key feature of its Madden franchise. The previous game in the series introduced motion controls, but Madden NFL 08 is taking accessibility to the next level – and brings it online to boot.  i2007kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00546na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264003900038300002300077500021000100542004300310655003100353655004000384RNGJ9900aNegima! Neo-Pactio Fight!! 1bMarvelous Entertainmentc2007-6-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis Negima Wii game is based on the manga series of the same name. It is a fighting game in the spirit of Harry Potter, where you attack using spells. It has a multiplayer mode supporting up to 4 players.  i2007kMarvelous EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aTactical role-playing games2wiiext00678na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002300026300002300049500040000072542002700472655002700499655003000526RNHE4100aNo More Heroes 1bUbisoftc2008-1-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aNo More Heroes is the story of Travis Touchdown. He has received orders to kill a vagabond. In front of him appears the handsome assassin Helter Skelter. After a fierce skirmish, Travis eliminates Skelter, upon which Silvia Christel arrives. She informs Travis that his victory was done without UAA permission, but he nonetheless becomes the 11th best assassin. And so Travis’s journey begins.  i2008kUbisoftsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00671na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264003900026300002300065500036600088542004300454655002500497655002700522RNHJ9900aNo More Heroes 1bMarvelous Entertainmentc2007-12-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen big time loser Travis Touchdown runs into smokin' hot chick Sylvia Christel at the Death Match Bar, he gets more than he bargained for.  Wiping out a drifter for starters, it isn't long before Travis is ranked 11 in the United Assassins Association's league of hit men.  With a price on his head now, there's only one way to go – all the way to number 1.  i2007kMarvelous EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00256na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264003100026300002300057500000500080542003600085655002500121RNHK8M00aNo More Heroes 1bCyberfront Koreac2009-7-9  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kCyberfront KoreasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00660na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264003300026300002300059500036600082542003700448655002500485655002800510RNHP9900aNo More Heroes 1bRising Star Gamesc2008-3-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen big time loser Travis Touchdown runs into smokin' hot chick Sylvia Christel at the Death Match Bar, he gets more than he bargained for.  Wiping out a drifter for starters, it isn't long before Travis is ranked 11 in the United Assassins Association's league of hit men.  With a price on his head now, there's only one way to go – all the way to number 1.  i2008kRising Star GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00627na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264002400048300002300072500032600095542002900421655002900450655002600479RNIPGT00aMind. Body. Soul.: Nutrition Matters 1b505 Gamesc2009-6-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aNutrition Matters is perfect if you’re looking for a fun way to maintain a healthy balance between diet and exercise in the comfort of your living room. Use your Wii as your personal nutrition monitor to easily track your calories and measure them against daily activities in order to reach your personal fitness goals.  i2009k505 GamessGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aCooking games2wiiext00692na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001600007264002000023300002300043500046600066542002500532655002500557RNJE4F00aMini Ninjas 1bEidosc2009-9-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin Hiro, the smallest hero on the biggest adventure, as he embarks on an epic and electrifying quest to restore harmony to a world on the brink of chaos. Use your skills and mighty Ninja training to battle a magical army of evil Samurai. Harness the power of your Kuji magic and utilise the special skills of your Mini Ninja friends as you travel through a perilous world to reach the final confrontation with the Evil Samurai Warlord in his Fortress of Doom.  i2009kEidossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00733na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264002100023300002300044500046600067542002500533655002500558655002800583RNJP4F00aMini Ninjas 1bEidosc2009-10-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin Hiro, the smallest hero on the biggest adventure, as he embarks on an epic and electrifying quest to restore harmony to a world on the brink of chaos. Use your skills and mighty Ninja training to battle a magical army of evil Samurai. Harness the power of your Kuji magic and utilise the special skills of your Mini Ninja friends as you travel through a perilous world to reach the final confrontation with the Evil Samurai Warlord in his Fortress of Doom.  i2009kEidossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00641na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264003200025300002300057500035300080542003500433655002500468655002600493RNKE6900aNerf N-Strike 1bElectronic Artsc2008-10-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aThrough the din of a popular arcade, one player has emerged as the best N-Strike gamer his friends have ever seen. But even as Shane smashes through the game's record, something far more mysterious is happening: his success is being tracked and recorded. Shane is the perfect candidate for an ultra-exclusive invitation to become an N-Strike Elite.  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01037na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264003100025300002300056500073700079542003500816655002500851655003900876RNKP6900aNerf N-Strike 1bElectronic Artsc2009-2-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Search for the N-Strike Elite Begins...Through the din of a popular arcade, one player has emerged as the best N-Strike gamer his friends have ever seen. But even as Shane smashes through the game's record, something far more mysterious is happening: his success is being tracked and recorded. Shane is the perfect candidate for an ultra-exclusive invitation to become an N-Strike Elite. Later that night, he's awakened to find the Nomad C Series Recruitment bot hovering silently over his bed. "B.O.B." has a challenge for Shane. Join the quest to become an Elite Striker and he'll have access to Top Secret Blasters. It's all the incentive Shane needs, and as the one controlling Shane, it's your opportunity of a lifetime....  i2009kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00635na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001200007264002400019300002300043500036800066542002900434655002500463655002500488RNLE5400aNHL 2K9 1b2K Sportsc2008-9-8  a1 Wii optical disc  a2K Sports is bringing the fun back to hockey video games with an intuitive control scheme and hard-hitting action. As the first & only officially licensed NHL and NHLPA video game for Wii, NHL 2K9 will offer fans the opportunity to play like the pros using the Wii Remote as a hockey stick and experience the sport in a new, entertaining and wholly unique manner.  i2008k2K SportssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aHockey games2wiiext01203na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001200007264002600019300002300045500093400068542002901002655002501031655002501056RNLP5400aNHL 2K9 1b2K Sportsc2008-11-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aDo you long for the days when hockey video games didn’t require an engineering degree to master? 2K Sports has listened to the masses by bringing the fun back to hockey video games with an intuitive control scheme, hard-hitting action and by announcing the debut of NHL 2K9 on the Wii™ console. Developed by award-winning Visual Concepts studios, NHL 2K9 brings a totally rebuilt NHL experience to life with a brand-new in-game presentation system, as well as fresh player animations and controls that fans will enjoy from the moment they play their first game, until well after they become a seasoned veteran. Further adding to an unmatched level of fun and celebrating the NHL’s uniqueness are an all-new Zamboni™ mini-game, playoff beards, a new fighting engine and more! Complete with new commentary, a user-friendly franchise mode and upgraded online features, NHL 2K9 brings the fun back to game consoles on 9.9.08!  i2008k2K SportssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aHockey games2wiiext00510na  a2200145   45000010007000002450019000072640040000263