aced ninja action for up to four players in nine different gameplay modes. This next generation NARUTO title will also include all new character animations, new interactive environments and special mini-games created exclusively for the Wii Remote.  i2007kTomy CorporationsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00913na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004800007264002000055300002300075500065400098542002400752655002700776RNXJDA00aNaruto Shippuuden: Gekitou Ninja Taisen! EX 1bTomyc2007-2-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aNARUTO: Clash of Ninja Revolution is an original Wii game exclusive to the North American Market. Based on the hit series currently airing on Cartoon Network, this first game for the Wii released in North America includes characters that have never been featured in the Clash of Ninja game series. The game follows the storyline of the television series and takes advantage of the Wii Remote in fast-paced ninja action for up to four players in nine different gameplay modes. This next generation NARUTO title will also include all new character animations, new interactive environments and special mini-games created exclusively for the Wii Remote.  i2007kTomysGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00924na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005900007264002000066300002300086500065400109542002400763655002700787RNXPDA00aNaruto: Clash of Ninja Revolution – European Version 1bTomyc2008-3-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aNARUTO: Clash of Ninja Revolution is an original Wii game exclusive to the North American Market. Based on the hit series currently airing on Cartoon Network, this first game for the Wii released in North America includes characters that have never been featured in the Clash of Ninja game series. The game follows the storyline of the television series and takes advantage of the Wii Remote in fast-paced ninja action for up to four players in nine different gameplay modes. This next generation NARUTO title will also include all new character animations, new interactive environments and special mini-games created exclusively for the Wii Remote.  i2008kTomysGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00584na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264003300047300002300080500030800103542003600411655002700447RNYEDA00aNaruto: Clash of Ninja Revolution 2 1bTomy Corporationc2008-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aDeveloped by Eighting and featuring the largest character roster yet for the series and an all-new storyline created for the North American audience. This latest iteration of the hit series is a huge expansion, with never-before-seen modes, improved visual presentation, and polished gameplay mechanics.  i2008kTomy CorporationsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00569na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004900007264002100056300002300077500030800100542002400408655002700432RNYJDA00aNaruto Shippuuden: Gekitou Ninja Taisen! EX2 1bTomyc2007-11-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aDeveloped by Eighting and featuring the largest character roster yet for the series and an all-new storyline created for the North American audience. This latest iteration of the hit series is a huge expansion, with never-before-seen modes, improved visual presentation, and polished gameplay mechanics.  i2007kTomysGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00578na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005900007264002000066300002300086500030800109542002400417655002700441RNYPDA00aNaruto: Clash of Ninja Revolution 2 - European Version 1bTomyc2009-2-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aDeveloped by Eighting and featuring the largest character roster yet for the series and an all-new storyline created for the North American audience. This latest iteration of the hit series is a huge expansion, with never-before-seen modes, improved visual presentation, and polished gameplay mechanics.  i2009kTomysGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00596na  a2200133   45000010007000002450017000072640030000243000023000545000270000775420035003476550025003826550024004076