ii optical disc  a2 Tons of Racing Fun! Get down and dirty with Ford Racing Off Road and experience the thrill of massive high speed action using authentic vehicles made by Ford and Land Rover. Race through dense forests, cliff hanging mountain terrain and snow covered landscapes before making your way across the finish line. Through this unique driving experience, you will feel the adrenaline pumping excitement the way off roading is supposed to be.  i2008kCrave EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aOff-road racing games2wiiext00669na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001300007264002300020300002300043500044100066542002700507655002500534RO2P7N00aOff Road 1bXplosivc2008-8-29  a1 Wii optical disc  a2 Tons of Racing Fun! Get down and dirty with Ford Racing Off Road and experience the thrill of massive high speed action using authentic vehicles made by Ford and Land Rover. Race through dense forests, cliff hanging mountain terrain and snow covered landscapes before making your way across the finish line. Through this unique driving experience, you will feel the adrenaline pumping excitement the way off roading is supposed to be.  i2008kXplosivsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00800na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002400007264002700031300002300058500046500081542003100546655002700577655002500604655003700629RO3EXJ00aLittle King's Story 1bXseed Gamesc2009-7-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aLittle King’s Story is an original title designed and developed by some of the most respected names in the gaming industry. Featuring the efforts of Yasuhiro Wada (Creator: Harvest Moon), Hideo Minaba (Art Director: Final Fantasy XII), and Youichi Kawaguchi (Main Programmer: Dragon Quest VIII), Little King’s Story combines life-simulation, real-time strategy, and adventure elements along with an enchanting storyline to offer a unique gaming experience.  i2009kXseed GamessGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aReal-time strategy games2wiiext00780na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264003800029300002300067500046500090542004300555655002900598655003100627RO3J9900aOusama Monogatari 1bMarvelous Entertainmentc2009-9-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aLittle King’s Story is an original title designed and developed by some of the most respected names in the gaming industry. Featuring the efforts of Yasuhiro Wada (Creator: Harvest Moon), Hideo Minaba (Art Director: Final Fantasy XII), and Youichi Kawaguchi (Main Programmer: Dragon Quest VIII), Little King’s Story combines life-simulation, real-time strategy, and adventure elements along with an enchanting storyline to offer a unique gaming experience.  i2009kMarvelous EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00766na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264003300031300002300064500046500087542003700552655002800589655002700617RO3P9900aLittle King's Story 1bRising Star Gamesc2009-4-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aLittle King’s Story is an original title designed and developed by some of the most respected names in the gaming industry. Featuring the efforts of Yasuhiro Wada (Creator: Harvest Moon), Hideo Minaba (Art Director: Final Fantasy XII), and Youichi Kawaguchi (Main Programmer: Dragon Quest VIII), Little King’s Story combines life-simulation, real-time strategy, and adventure elements along with an enchanting storyline to offer a unique gaming experience.  i2009kRising Star GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00325na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001500007264002800022300002300050500000500073542003100078655002500109655002700134655003000161RO4JDA00aToushinden 1bTakara Tomyc2009-12-10  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kTakara TomysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext00345na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264002700038300002300065500009200088542003000180655002500210RO5E5200aHot Wheels: Battle Force 5 1bActivisionc2009-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aRace, smash, and bash your way to victory. The fate of our planet hangs in the balance!  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00345na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264002700038300002300065500009200088542003000180655002500210RO5P5200aHot Wheels: Battle Force 5 1bActivisionc2010-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aRace, smash, and bash your way to victory. The fate of our planet hangs in the balance!  i2010kActivisionsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00843na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264004200050300002300092500050800115542004600623655002500669655002700694RO7E7D04aThe Legend of Spyro: The Eternal Night 1bSierra Entertainment, Inc.c2007-10-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the second installment of the epic Legend of Spyro™ trilogy, Gaul, the Ape King, arrives at the Temple of Souls in effort to resurrect the Dark Master and usher in a new age of darkness. Spyro must unlock the secrets behind a series of strange visions that he is having and find the power to defeat this terrifying new force. Faced with little time, great danger and new enemies, Spyro fights his way through an epic journey, featuring the voice talents of Elijah Wood, Billy West, and Gary Oldman.  i2007kSierra Entertainment, Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00843na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004300007264002200050300002300072500050800095542002600603655002500629655002800654655002700682RO7P7D04aThe Legend of Spyro: The Eternal Night 1bSierrac2007-12-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the second installment of the epic Legend of Spyro™ trilogy, Gaul, the Ape King, arrives at the Temple of Souls in effort to resurrect the Dark Master and usher in a new age of darkness. Spyro must unlock the secrets behind a series of strange visions that he is having and find the power to defeat this terrifying new force. Faced with little time, great danger and new enemies, Spyro fights his way through an epic journey, featuring the voice talents of Elijah Wood, Billy West, and Gary Oldman.  i2007kSierrasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00749na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004400007264003600051300002300087500042500110542003900535655002500574655002800599RO8E7D04aThe Legend of Spyro: Dawn of the Dragon 1bActivision Blizzardc2008-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aThree long years have passed since Spyro and Cynder were trapped in the crystal, since then Malefor has unleashed his evil onto the world. In this third chapter of the epic Legend of Spyro® trilogy, Spyro must fulfill his destiny and face the Dark Master. As evil spreads over the world, Spyro and Cynder must discover new abilities and unlock their true powers to defeat Malefor and stop him from destroying the world.  i2008kActivision BlizzardsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00683na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004400007264002300051300002300074500042500097542002600522655002500548RO8P7D04aThe Legend of Spyro: Dawn of the Dragon 1bSierrac2008-11-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aThree long years have passed since Spyro and Cynder were trapped in the crystal, since then Malefor has unleashed his evil onto the world. In this third chapter of the epic Legend of Spyro® trilogy, Spyro must fulfill his destiny and face the Dark Master. As evil spreads over the world, Spyro and Cynder must discover new abilities and unlock their true powers to defeat Malefor and stop him from destroying the world.  i2008kSierrasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00722na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004400007264002300051300002300074500042500097542002600522655002500548655002700573RO8X7D04aThe Legend of Spyro: Dawn of the Dragon 1bSierrac2008-11-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aThree long years have passed since Spyro and Cynder were trapped in the crystal, since then Malefor has unleashed his evil onto the world. In this third chapter of the epic Legend of Spyro® trilogy, Spyro must fulfill his destiny and face the Dark Master. As evil spreads over the world, Spyro and Cynder must discover new abilities and unlock their true powers to defeat Malefor and stop him from destroying the world.  i2008kSierrasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00597na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001600007264002400023300002300047500036400070542002800434655002500462RO9EFS00aAqua Panic! 1bXS Gamesc2009-9-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aA giant cyclone has sucked up thousands of fish from the oceans! It's an ecological disaster! Tanks of water are immediately assembled throughout the world, so that all the fish can be returned to the oceans. As the sea creatures start falling back to Earth, someone must make sure they land safely and quickly since they cannot survive for long out of water.  i2009kXS GamessGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00620na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001600007264003400023300002300057500036700080542003800447655002500485RO9PNK00aAqua Panic! 1bNeko Entertainmentc2009-5-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aA giant cyclone has sucked up thousands of fish from the oceans! It’s an ecological disaster! Tanks of water are immediately assembled throughout the world, so that all the fish can be returned to the oceans. As the sea creatures start falling back to  Earth, someone must make sure they land safely and quickly since they cannot survive for long out of water!  i2009kNeko EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00654na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002600007264002700033300002300060500032300083542003100406655002500437655003100462655002700493ROAE3600aOverlord: Dark Legend 1bCodemastersc2009-6-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aA new Overlord action RPG, exclusively for Wii, complete with all-new minion control mechanics, the game is a standalone prequel to the original Overlord. The Young Overlord must protect his father’s castle and lands from his even more evil twin siblings in a tongue-in-cheek fantasy world of grim/twisted fairytales  i2009kCodemasterssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext01232na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002700033300002300060500094300083542003101026655002501057655002801082ROAP3600aOverlord: Dark Legend 1bCodemastersc2009-6-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aDesigned and developed exclusively for Wii, Overlord Dark Legend is a brand new action adventure steeped in fairy tale lore with sinister, satirical twists. Set in a time before the original game (Overlord, 2007), players step into the role of a new younger Overlord and revel in command of the most vicious, yet lovable little critters in gaming – the Minions. Forming a unique rampaging army, the Minions are a demonic, slavish and loyal horde of imp-like critters predisposed to violence. No matter: they’re always ready and willing to follow even the most suicidal order, whether it's raiding villages for kicks and giggles or hurling themselves at enemies in the face of kamikaze odds in the beautifully rendered game world. With a story and characters that poke playful fun at fantasy cliché, our trainee tyrant will be able to take his growing pains out on the local fairy tale inhabitants as he protects his castle and lands.  i2009kCodemasterssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01008na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264003800034300002300072500073600095542004200831655002500873ROBE7U00aObscure: The Aftermath 1bIgnition Entertainmentc2008-3-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aTwo years ago at Leafmore High, a group of young teenagers were trapped inside their school and hunted by monsters that had been released by the maniac principal. Some of them survived that terrible night, while most others perished. The survivors have since picked up their lives and joined college. But all is not right at Fallcreek University... Strange black flowers have suddenly sprung up everywhere on campus. While experimenting with these flowers in class, a dangerous substance was discovered that induces strange but vivid dreams. A handful of students soon find out that there is more to the flowers than anyone could have expected. When the seeds finally germinate, a bad trip suddenly turns into a horrible reality...  i2008kIgnition EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00285na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002500022300002300047500000500070542002900075655002500104655003400129ROBPPL00aObscure II 1bPlaylogicc2008-5-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kPlaylogicsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSurvival horror games2wiiext00555na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264004000029300002300069500024200092542004400334655002500378655003000403ROCE5Z00aCocoto Kart Racer 1bConspiracy Entertainmentc2008-6-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe holy cauldron of Cocoto has disappeared! The imps are in danger of loosing all their powers! Their only chance to recover them is to beat all their opponents in a series of fierce kart races to win the prize: the mysterious cauldron!  i2008kConspiracy EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00540na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264003400029300002300063500023900086542003800325655002500363655003000388ROCPNK00aCocoto Kart Racer 1bNeko Entertainmentc2008-7-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay Cocoto and his friends in devilish races! Choose among 12 characters and their crazy karts! 4 play modes from 1 to 4 players: championship, simple race, battle and time trial. Beat your opponents with lots of devastating attacks!  i2008kNeko EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00772na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002400035300002300059500049100082542002800573655002500601655002400626RODE0100aWarioWare: Smooth Moves 1bNintendoc2007-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe WarioWare team took an idea so wacky, it could only be made with the latest technology: the Wii Remote! Wario stumbles into an old building called the Temple of Form. Inside, he finds a mystical treasure called the Form Baton. There are many ways to hold and move the baton (called "forms"), and legend has it that if the holder follows the forms, he can overcome any challenge. With this discovery, the form craze spreads and soon everybody is doing their best to master the moves.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00731na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264002400031300002300055500049100078542002800569655002400597RODJ0100aOdoru Made in Wario 1bNintendoc2006-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe WarioWare team took an idea so wacky, it could only be made with the latest technology: the Wii Remote! Wario stumbles into an old building called the Temple of Form. Inside, he finds a mystical treasure called the Form Baton. There are many ways to hold and move the baton (called "forms"), and legend has it that if the holder follows the forms, he can overcome any challenge. With this discovery, the form craze spreads and soon everybody is doing their best to master the moves.  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00736na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002400036300002300060500049100083542002800574655002400602RODK0100aChumchwora Made in Wario 1bNintendoc2009-6-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe WarioWare team took an idea so wacky, it could only be made with the latest technology: the Wii Remote! Wario stumbles into an old building called the Temple of Form. Inside, he finds a mystical treasure called the Form Baton. There are many ways to hold and move the baton (called "forms"), and legend has it that if the holder follows the forms, he can overcome any challenge. With this discovery, the form craze spreads and soon everybody is doing their best to master the moves.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00735na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264002400035300002300059500049100082542002800573655002400601RODP0100aWarioWare: Smooth Moves 1bNintendoc2007-1-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe WarioWare team took an idea so wacky, it could only be made with the latest technology: the Wii Remote! Wario stumbles into an old building called the Temple of Form. Inside, he finds a mystical treasure called the Form Baton. There are many ways to hold and move the baton (called "forms"), and legend has it that if the holder follows the forms, he can overcome any challenge. With this discovery, the form craze spreads and soon everybody is doing their best to master the moves.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00457na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002400026300002300050500017400073542002900247655002900276655003000305ROEEJZ00aHotel for Dogs 1b505 Gamesc2009-1-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe dogs have run amok and now it's up to you to keep them from the pesky dogcatcher. You must clean, feed, and play with them or else you'll all end up in the doghouse.  i2009k505 GamessGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00383na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264002400026300002300050500014200073542002900215655002900244ROEPGT00aHotel for Dogs 1b505 Gamesc2009-2-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aHotel for Dogsstars Emma Roberts, Jake T Austin, in a smart, funny comedy adventure that shows how far love and imagination can take you.  i2009k505 GamessGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00476na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264004100044300002300085500014300108542004400251655002500295655003400320ROFE5Z00aOffroad Extreme! Special Edition 1bConspiracy Entertainmentc2007-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the super-charged turbo driven world of Offroad Extreme where intense, free-roaming, off-road racing takes on a whole new meaning!  i2007kConspiracy EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aOff-road racing games2wiiext01159na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264003900028300002300067500089100090542004300981655002501024ROFPUG00aOffroad Extreme! 1bData Design Interactivec2008-2-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnter the super-charged turbo driven world of Off Road Extreme. This is where off road racing takes on a whole new meaning! From Karts to Baja Buggies, Offroad Extreme delivers a unique and exciting gamplay experience. You will race a variety of off road vehicles through visually stunning environments, around rugged terrain, along valleys and through ancient cave structures. Choose from a vast selection of detailed off road machines with an impressive 32 unique track variations including quarries, canyons and mines. Featuring realistic weather conditions during day and night. Earn prize money to unlock hidden extras, including upgrades, extra challenges, extra courses and much more. Utilising the Wii controls to allow you to use the wireless Wii Remote as a steering wheel. Be careful though, every time your vehicle takes some on damage you will have to pay for your repairs.  i2008kData Design InteractivesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext01159na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264003900028300002300067500089100090542004300981655002501024ROFXUG00aOffroad Extreme! 1bData Design Interactivec2008-2-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnter the super-charged turbo driven world of Off Road Extreme. This is where off road racing takes on a whole new meaning! From Karts to Baja Buggies, Offroad Extreme delivers a unique and exciting gamplay experience. You will race a variety of off road vehicles through visually stunning environments, around rugged terrain, along valleys and through ancient cave structures. Choose from a vast selection of detailed off road machines with an impressive 32 unique track variations including quarries, canyons and mines. Featuring realistic weather conditions during day and night. Earn prize money to unlock hidden extras, including upgrades, extra challenges, extra courses and much more. Utilising the Wii controls to allow you to use the wireless Wii Remote as a steering wheel. Be careful though, every time your vehicle takes some on damage you will have to pay for your repairs.  i2008kData Design InteractivesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00801na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002000042300002300062500051800085542002300603655002500626655002800651ROGE7800aTak and the Guardians of Gross 1bTHQc2008-10-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs the keeper of the power of Juju, it's Tak's responsibility to care for the sacred Juju shrines. Unfortunately, Tak accidentally frees the four "Grosstrosities" — Stink Giant, Slime Giant, Landfill Giant, and Molten Cheese Giant who were trapped in the shrine. These giants were trapped because they were so disgusting that they were just too gross to walk the earth. Tak must seek the help of the "Big G's" four master Jujus in order to defeat the giants before they cover the world in their stinky foulness.  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00800na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002000042300002300062500051800085542002300603655002500626655002700651ROGP7800aTak and the Guardians of Gross 1bTHQc2008-10-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs the keeper of the power of Juju, it's Tak's responsibility to care for the sacred Juju shrines. Unfortunately, Tak accidentally frees the four "Grosstrosities" — Stink Giant, Slime Giant, Landfill Giant, and Molten Cheese Giant who were trapped in the shrine. These giants were trapped because they were so disgusting that they were just too gross to walk the earth. Tak must seek the help of the "Big G's" four master Jujus in order to defeat the giants before they cover the world in their stinky foulness.  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00341na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264003500034300002300069500000500092542003800097655002400135655002400159655002400183ROHJAF00aHappy Dance Collection 1bNamco Bandai Gamesc2008-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kNamco Bandai GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00914na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002600026300002300052500063200075542003000707655002900737655002600766ROJE5200aRapala We Fish 1bActivisionc2009-9-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aToday's fresh catch-of-the-day: hilarious arcade fishing action! The company known for its tempting lures drops a new one in the water, designed to grab anglers of all ages. Race your motorboat to where the fish are biting, reel in the biggest catch, and make it back to the finish line before time expires in competitions that test your fishing speed and skill. These fish are pretty fresh: each of the more than 50 species in the water has an over-the-top personality. Play as your Mii character in four multiplayer modes, including four-player split-screen, or in kart-style tournaments in fishing hotspots around the world.  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFishing games2wiiext00952na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001900007264002700026300002300053500063200076542003000708655002500738655002900763655002600792ROJP5200aRapala We Fish 1bActivisionc2009-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aToday's fresh catch-of-the-day: hilarious arcade fishing action! The company known for its tempting lures drops a new one in the water, designed to grab anglers of all ages. Race your motorboat to where the fish are biting, reel in the biggest catch, and make it back to the finish line before time expires in competitions that test your fishing speed and skill. These fish are pretty fresh: each of the more than 50 species in the water has an over-the-top personality. Play as your Mii character in four multiplayer modes, including four-player split-screen, or in kart-style tournaments in fishing hotspots around the world.  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFishing games2wiiext00763na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002800032300002300060500047700083542003100560655002400591655002600615ROKJ1800aKaraoke Joysound Wii 1bHudson Softc2008-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoysound is a version of Xing's Joysound karaoke machine. The service will feature periodically updated music downloads, mini games and more, replicating a full karaoke machine in your home. Hudson offers for purchase a USB microphone to play the game with. Joysound is offered as a packaged version bundling the USB microphone with a disk featuring party games, mini games and a number of popular songs, and is also available via the Wii Ware downloadable gaming service.  i2008kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext01204na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004600007264002100053300002300074500094800097542002401045655002501069ROLE8P00aMario & Sonic at the Olympic Winter Games 1bSegac2009-10-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario and Sonic come together again, this time taking their rivalry to the snow and ice in another officially licensed Olympic-themed game. Mario & Sonic at the Olympic Winter Games will take players to Vancouver, Canada, host city of the official 2010 Olympic Winter Games. This gaming experience invites players of all ages and skill sets to face-off in intense winter competitions. The game will take players to lifelike Olympic venues where they can choose from a legendary cast of playable characters, including new faces to the series to be revealed later this year. Players of all skill levels will enjoy the intuitive controls in both single and multiplayer gaming modes. Additionally, one of the new features to be found in Mario & Sonic at the Olympic Winter Games is the inclusion of the Wii Balance Board which can be used in some events featured in the Wii version, allowing for a more interactive and realistic gaming experience.  i2009kSegasGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext01204na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264002400046300002300070500094800093542002801041655002501069ROLJ0100aMario & Sonic at Vancouver Olympic 1bNintendoc2009-11-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario and Sonic come together again, this time taking their rivalry to the snow and ice in another officially licensed Olympic-themed game. Mario & Sonic at the Olympic Winter Games will take players to Vancouver, Canada, host city of the official 2010 Olympic Winter Games. This gaming experience invites players of all ages and skill sets to face-off in intense winter competitions. The game will take players to lifelike Olympic venues where they can choose from a legendary cast of playable characters, including new faces to the series to be revealed later this year. Players of all skill levels will enjoy the intuitive controls in both single and multiplayer gaming modes. Additionally, one of the new features to be found in Mario & Sonic at the Olympic Winter Games is the inclusion of the Wii Balance Board which can be used in some events featured in the Wii version, allowing for a more interactive and realistic gaming experience.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext01210na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004400007264002500051300002300076500094800099542002801047655002501075ROLK0100aMariowa Sonic Vancouver Donggye-olympic 1bNintendoc2009-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario and Sonic come together again, this time taking their rivalry to the snow and ice in another officially licensed Olympic-themed game. Mario & Sonic at the Olympic Winter Games will take players to Vancouver, Canada, host city of the official 2010 Olympic Winter Games. This gaming experience invites players of all ages and skill sets to face-off in intense winter competitions. The game will take players to lifelike Olympic venues where they can choose from a legendary cast of playable characters, including new faces to the series to be revealed later this year. Players of all skill levels will enjoy the intuitive controls in both single and multiplayer gaming modes. Additionally, one of the new features to be found in Mario & Sonic at the Olympic Winter Games is the inclusion of the Wii Balance Board which can be used in some events featured in the Wii version, allowing for a more interactive and realistic gaming experience.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00332na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004600007264002100053300002300074500004000097542002400137655002500161655002400186ROLP8P00aMario & Sonic at the Olympic Winter Games 1bSegac2009-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aMARIO AND SONIC HEAD TO THE SLOPES!  i2009kSegasGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00318na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002100007264002200028300002300050500000500073542002600078655002500104655002800129655002700157ROMJ0800aMonster Hunter G 1bCapcomc2009-4-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00669na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264002800046300002300074500040300097542003200500655002700532RONEG900aOnechanbara: Bikini Zombie Slayers 1bD3 Publisherc2009-2-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aOnechanbara is the ultimate blood-splattering samurai action game combined with the ultimate fantasy characters.  Take on the role of the beautiful but deadly Aya or her half-blooded sister, Saki.  Armed with only their swords and beauty, these deadly sisters will stop at nothing to rid their home of the zombie threat. Hot babes, sexy outfits, swords, blood and zombies... who could ask for more?  i2009kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00739na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002800007264002700035300002300062500040100085542003200486655002700518655003000545655003000575RONJG900aOneechanbara Revolution 1bD3 Publisherc2008-2-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aOnechanbara is the ultimate blood-splattering samurai action game combined with the ultimate fantasy characters. Take on the role of the beautiful but deadly Aya or her half-blooded sister, Saki. Armed with only their swords and beauty, these deadly sisters will stop at nothing to rid their home of the zombie threat. Hot babes, sexy outfits, swords, blood and zombies... who could ask for more?  i2008kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00746na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003900007264002800046300002300074500040100097542003200498655002500530655002700555655003000582RONPG900aOnechanbara: Bikini Zombie Slayers 1bD3 Publisherc2009-2-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aOnechanbara is the ultimate blood-splattering samurai action game combined with the ultimate fantasy characters. Take on the role of the beautiful but deadly Aya or her half-blooded sister, Saki. Armed with only their swords and beauty, these deadly sisters will stop at nothing to rid their home of the zombie threat. Hot babes, sexy outfits, swords, blood and zombies... who could ask for more?  i2009kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00538na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003900023300002300062500023600085542004200321655002500363655002800388ROPE4100aOpen Season 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2006-11-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aTeam up with a cast of crazy critters, unleashing your animal instincts in Open Season™, the game - a riotous romp in the great outdoors where the rowdy brood of forest animals turns the tables on a bunch of unsuspecting hunters.  i2006kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00895na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003900023300002300062500059300085542004200678655002500720655002800745ROPP4100aOpen Season 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2006-12-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aTeam up with a cast of crazy critters, unleashing your animal instincts in Open Season™, the game - a riotous romp in the great outdoors where the rowdy brood of forest animals turns the tables on a bunch of unsuspecting hunters. When a domesticated grizzly named Boog gets lured into leaving the creature comforts of home by a fast-talking mule deer named Elliot, he finds himself lost in the woods just three days before hunting season. Forced to "rough it" in the great outdoors, Boog goes native, rallying all the forest animals to take back their home and send the hunters packing.  i2006kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00242na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264002100027300002300048500000500071542002500076655003100101ROQJEP00aBaroque for Wii 1bStingc2008-3-13  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kStingsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00761na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001800007264002400025300002300049500044700072542002800519655002500547655002800572655002700600ROSJ0100aTakt of Magic 1bNintendoc2009-5-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aTakt of Magic is an action strategy game, where you're given control of Orwell and Sharlot, two childhood friends who face off on the battlefield against monsters and enemy soldiers. Gameplay consists of holding the Wiimote like a wand and drawing various shapes to perform over 100 different spells. In addition to casting magic, you are also given control of a battle party, whom you direct on the battle field from an overhead perspective.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00653na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003500007264002600042300002300068500030900091542002900400655002500429655002900454655003600483ROTE2000aTwin Strike: Operation Thunder 1bZoo Gamesc2008-10-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aA fast-action arcade style aerial combat game that pits you against a variety of adversaries all intent on blowing you out of the skies. Suit up and choose between six Helicopters, all fully loaded and ready to engage the enemy in the air while avoiding attacks from infantry and artillery on the ground.  i2008kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFlight simulation games2wiiext00771na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264002700042300002300069500051300092542003100605655002500636ROTP7J00aTwin Strike: Operation Thunder 1bZoo Digitalc2009-5-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou are the newest recruit of the United Nations Air Force-a top secret agency set up to protect citizens against the threat of unknown forces without breaking down international agreements or diplomatic acts. You will have to take to the skies in a variety of helicopters to defend the civilized world against wave after wave of enemy aggression. Suit up and choose the best helicopter to engage the enemy in the air while avoiding attacks from the ground. Put yourself in the pilot seat with "Twin Strike"!  i2009kZoo DigitalsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00735na  a2200133   4500001000700000245006500007264003400072300002300106500035400129542003800483655002500521655002800546655002700574ROUJAF00aOne Piece Unlimited Cruise 1: The Treasure Beneath the Waves 1bBandai Namco Gamesc2008-9-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn One Piece: Unlimited Cruise, the motley crew of Straw Hat Pirates find themselves aboard the Thousand Sunny ship, the ship of 1,000 seas, as they set sail to a variety of mysterious islands and begin their fantastic adventures. The game is split into two episodes to accommodate the huge storyline which will keep the player engrossed throughout.  i2008kBandai Namco GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00696na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006500007264003400072300002300106500035400129542003800483655002500521655002800546ROUPAF00aOne Piece Unlimited Cruise 1: The Treasure Beneath the Waves 1bNamco Bandai Gamesc2009-6-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn One Piece: Unlimited Cruise, the motley crew of Straw Hat Pirates find themselves aboard the Thousand Sunny ship, the ship of 1,000 seas, as they set sail to a variety of mysterious islands and begin their fantastic adventures. The game is split into two episodes to accommodate the huge storyline which will keep the player engrossed throughout.  i2009kNamco Bandai GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00611na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264002900028300002300057500036000080542003200440655002900472ROVE6U00aPlaymobil Circus 1bDreamCatcherc2009-12-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou and your family are going to become Playmobil performers in the funniest, most wacky circus around. Practice your acts to make sure they're perfect before you perform them in the center ring for the whole crowd. Perfrom well enough you'll unlock more acts in Encore mode. Play with friends and family in 2 exciting multiplayer modes: Co-op and Versus.  i2009kDreamCatchersGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00616na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264003100028300002300059500036000082542003500442655002900477ROVPHM00aPlaymobil Circus 1bHMH interactivec2010-5-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou and your family are going to become Playmobil performers in the funniest, most wacky circus around. Practice your acts to make sure they're perfect before you perform them in the center ring for the whole crowd. Perform well enough you'll unlock more acts in Encore mode. Play with friends and family in 2 exciting multiplayer modes: Co-op and Versus.  i2010kHMH interactivesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00848na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001100007264002200018300002300040500058400063542002600647655002500673655002800698ROWE0800aŌkami 1bCapcomc2008-4-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe multiple award-winning Ōkami returns for a glorious encore on the Wii! Amaterasu, the wolf-embodied sun god must breathe color and life into a world made dismal by the tyrannical and destructive monster Orochi. Amaterasu travels through various regions of the world to regain "Celestial Brush" powers, all the while revitalizing all life. Featuring a re-imagined control scheme built around the intuitive Wii Remote, Ōkami for the Wii offers players an unparalleled level of control and an opportunity to rediscover a critically-acclaimed and beautifully crafted adventure.  i2008kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00905na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001100007264002300018300002300041500058400064542002600648655002500674655002800699655004400727ROWJ0800aOokami 1bCapcomc2009-10-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe multiple award-winning Ōkami returns for a glorious encore on the Wii! Amaterasu, the wolf-embodied sun god must breathe color and life into a world made dismal by the tyrannical and destructive monster Orochi. Amaterasu travels through various regions of the world to regain "Celestial Brush" powers, all the while revitalizing all life. Featuring a re-imagined control scheme built around the intuitive Wii Remote, Ōkami for the Wii offers players an unparalleled level of control and an opportunity to rediscover a critically-acclaimed and beautifully crafted adventure.  i2009kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPoint-and-click adventure games2wiiext00847na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001100007264002200018300002300040500058300063542002600646655002500672655002800697ROWP0800aŌkami 1bCapcomc2008-6-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe multiple award-winning Ōkami returns for a glorious encore on the Wii! Amaterasu, the wolf-embodied sun god must breathe color and life into a world made dismal by the tyrannical and destructive monster Orochi. Amaterasu travels through various regions of the world to regain "Celestial Brush" powers, all the while revitalizing all life. Featuring a re-imagined control scheme built around the intuitive Wii Remote, Okami for the Wii offers players an unparalleled level of control and an opportunity to rediscover a critically-acclaimed and beautifully crafted adventure.  i2008kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01539na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001400007264002500021300002300046500121200069542002901281655002901310655002601339655004001365ROXE2000aOrder Up! 1bZoo Gamesc2008-7-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aOrder Up is a delicious blend of precision cuisine crafting and culinary empire building, all rolled into a light and flaky crust of memorable characters and humorous situations. With the Wii Remote in hand, the player will be guided from burger to chateaubriand; taught every aspect of food preparation and presentation. For anyone who has dreamed of becoming a world-class chef or restaurant mogul or both!, Order Up will deliver. The core game play of Order Up is cooking, from preparation to presentation. Preparation consists of "cutting and cooking" while Presentation refers to garnishes and "flourishes" - e.g. sauce drizzled over a dish to please the eye or the use of flame (flambé) for dramatic effect. Beyond the core, game play includes rising through the ranks of the culinary world from fast-food to world-class restaurants as chef and owner while ever-expanding your cookbook of recipes and ever-improving the quality of your equipment. Along the way you will face demanding patrons, discriminating food critics…and at the pinnacle of your fame in the world of fine cuisine you will be invited to complete in the, "Fortified Chef World Challenge" - an Iron Chef-style cooking competition.  i2008kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aCooking games2wiiext 7aManagement simulation games2wiiext01577na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001400007264002600021300002300047500121200070542002901282655002501311655002901336655002601365655004001391ROXP7J00aOrder Up! 1bZoo Gamesc2008-10-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aOrder Up is a delicious blend of precision cuisine crafting and culinary empire building, all rolled into a light and flaky crust of memorable characters and humorous situations. With the Wii Remote in hand, the player will be guided from burger to chateaubriand; taught every aspect of food preparation and presentation. For anyone who has dreamed of becoming a world-class chef or restaurant mogul or both!, Order Up will deliver. The core game play of Order Up is cooking, from preparation to presentation. Preparation consists of "cutting and cooking" while Presentation refers to garnishes and "flourishes" - e.g. sauce drizzled over a dish to please the eye or the use of flame (flambé) for dramatic effect. Beyond the core, game play includes rising through the ranks of the culinary world from fast-food to world-class restaurants as chef and owner while ever-expanding your cookbook of recipes and ever-improving the quality of your equipment. Along the way you will face demanding patrons, discriminating food critics…and at the pinnacle of your fame in the world of fine cuisine you will be invited to complete in the, "Fortified Chef World Challenge" - an Iron Chef-style cooking competition.  i2008kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aCooking games2wiiext 7aManagement simulation games2wiiext00609na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001400007264001900021300002300040500025800063542002300321655002900344655002400373655002600397655004000423ROXX7J00aOrder Up! 1bZooc2008-11-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aOrder Up! is a delicious blend of frantic kitchen cooking and restaurant empire building.  Chop, roll, slice, and dice your way to culinary stardom.  Along the way you will face picky patrons, snobby food critics, one grouchy health inspector, and more.  i2008kZoosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aCooking games2wiiext 7aManagement simulation games2wiiext00669na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003800007264003800045300002300083500030700106542004200413655002500455655002800480655002700508ROYE4100aCloudy with a Chance of Meatballs 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2009-9-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay as Flint, the wacky inventor who creates a machine that causes food to rain from the sky! When the machine spirals out of control, it’s up to you to save the town with a variety of outrageously fun and wacky gadgets. Hurl hamburgers, sling spaghetti, and join the most hilarious food fight ever!  i2009kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00669na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003800007264003800045300002300083500030700106542004200413655002500455655002800480655002700508ROYP4100aCloudy with a Chance of Meatballs 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2009-10-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay as Flint, the wacky inventor who creates a machine that causes food to rain from the sky! When the machine spirals out of control, it’s up to you to save the town with a variety of outrageously fun and wacky gadgets. Hurl hamburgers, sling spaghetti, and join the most hilarious food fight ever!  i2009kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00669na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003800007264003800045300002300083500030700106542004200413655002500455655002800480655002700508ROYX4100aCloudy with a Chance of Meatballs 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2009-10-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay as Flint, the wacky inventor who creates a machine that causes food to rain from the sky! When the machine