s, quickness and skill in different minigames, each hosted by a different MySim! Each of your friends and you can select a custom team of 4 characters to play the huge variety MySims Party has to offer. Outwit friends by selecting the right team who will carry the day in contests based on strength, endurance, speed and luck. Pick carefully though, the wrong team will give your friends the edge over you. Bragging rights only belong to those who choose wisely and play flawlessly.  i2009kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00773na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003700038300002300075500050000098542004100598655002400639RP4J1300aBoku to Sim no Machi Party 1bElectronic Arts Japanc2009-3-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aTest your wits, quickness and skill in different minigames, each hosted by a different MySim! Each of your friends and you can select a custom team of 4 characters to play the huge variety MySims Party has to offer. Outwit friends by selecting the right team who will carry the day in contests based on strength, endurance, speed and luck. Pick carefully though, the wrong team will give your friends the edge over you. Bragging rights only belong to those who choose wisely and play flawlessly.  i2009kElectronic Arts JapansGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00747na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264003100024300002300055500050000078542003500578655002400613RP4P6900aMySims Party 1bElectronic Artsc2009-3-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aTest your wits, quickness and skill in different minigames, each hosted by a different MySim! Each of your friends and you can select a custom team of 4 characters to play the huge variety MySims Party has to offer. Outwit friends by selecting the right team who will carry the day in contests based on strength, endurance, speed and luck. Pick carefully though, the wrong team will give your friends the edge over you. Bragging rights only belong to those who cho