000700000245002400007264002400031300002300055500016300078542002700241655002800268RPHPPN00aPeppa Pig: The Game 1bUbisoftc2009-11-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aPeppa Pig is one of the most popular kids cartoons with under 6s, and the game on Wii is a perfect accompaniment to have young children learning as they play.  i2009kUbisoftsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00773na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264002700024300002300051500053400074542003000608655002500638RPIE5200aPimp My Ride 1bActivisionc2006-11-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnter Pimp City, where bling is king, and style is everything. On these streets, if your car isn't fully pimped out, you'd be better off walking. You and Xzibit will take on the challenge of hooking up your homies, and transforming their hoopties, buckets and beaters into the hottest whips on the street, while redlining through the highways and alleyways of Pimp City. You choose the mods, you choose the route, but pimpin' ain't easy. It will take speed and style to hook them up. Do you have what it takes to Pimp Their Ride?  i2006kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00772na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264002600024300002300050500053400073542003000607655002500637RPIP5200aPimp My Ride 1bActivisionc2008-2-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnter Pimp City, where bling is king, and style is everything. On these streets, if your car isn't fully pimped out, you'd be better off walking. You and Xzibit will take on the challenge of hooking up your homies, and transforming their hoopties, buckets and beaters into the hottest whips on the street, while redlining through the highways and alleyways of Pimp City. You choose the mods, you choose the route, but pimpin' ain't easy. It will take speed and style to hook them up. Do you have what it takes to Pimp Their Ride?  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00622na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264003800029300002300067500034900090542004200439655003100481RPJE7U00aArc Rise Fantasia 1bIgnition Entertainmentc2010-7-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aFrom Image Epoch, the team that created the strategy RPG Luminous Arc, comesan epic RPG exclusively developed for the Wii. Arc Rise Fantasia is a product of old and new, combining gorgeous graphics with modern gameplay while bringing classic Japanese high fantasy role-playing action involving airships and dragons, exclusively to the platform.  i2010kIgnition EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00279na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264003800029300002300067500000500090542004300095655003100138RPJJ9900aArc Rise Fantasia 1bMarvelous Entertainmentc2009-6-4  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kMarvelous EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00639na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006500007264002700072300002300099500031800122542003000440655002300470655002400493RPKE5200aWorld Series of Poker: Tournament of Champions: 2007 Edition 1bActivisionc2006-12-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aBuilding on last year's #1 poker title and #1 brand in poker, World Series of Poker: Tournament of Champions takes a story-based approach as you enter the Circuit as Chris “Jesus” Ferguson's protégé. You'll test your skill against more top pros than ever before as you compete in the premier Circuit Events.  i2006kActivisionsGameTDB 7aCard games2wiiext 7aPoker games2wiiext00603na  a2200109   4500001000700000245006500007264002600072300002300098500031800121542003000439655002400469RPKP5200aWorld Series of Poker: Tournament of Champions: 2007 Edition 1bActivisionc2007-3-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aBuilding on last year's #1 poker title and #1 brand in poker, World Series of Poker: Tournament of Champions takes a story-based approach as you enter the Circuit as Chris “Jesus” Ferguson's protégé. You'll test your skill against more top pros than ever before as you compete in the premier Circuit Events.  i2007kActivisionsGameTDB 7aPoker games2wiiext00735na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002700038300002300065500044000088542003000528655002900558655002600587RPLE5200aRapala Tournament Fishing! 1bActivisionc2006-11-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aCatch monster trophy bass and hang on for the fight of your life. Rapala puts you in the middle of heart pounding fishing action as you compete in 20 tournaments on some of the world's most prestigious angling waters. Fill your live well with only the biggest and most sought after trophy fish including bass, pike, catfish, perch, salmon, trout and more. With Rapala Tournament Fishing, fishing like a pro is only a virtual cast away!  i2006kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFishing games2wiiext00692na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264002600038300002300064500044000087542003000527655002500557RPLP5200aRapala Tournament Fishing! 1bActivisionc2007-4-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aCatch monster trophy bass and hang on for the fight of your life. Rapala puts you in the middle of heart pounding fishing action as you compete in 20 tournaments on some of the world's most prestigious angling waters. Fill your live well with only the biggest and most sought after trophy fish including bass, pike, catfish, perch, salmon, trout and more. With Rapala Tournament Fishing, fishing like a pro is only a virtual cast away!  i2007kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00297na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004000007264002200047300002300069500000500092542002600097655002500123655002700148RPMJA400aJikkyou Powerful Major League 2 Wii 1bKonamic2007-10-4  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00519na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264001800036300002300054500023800077542002300315655002900338655003000367RPNE7800aPaws & Claws: Pet Resort 1bTHQc2009-1-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake care of your four-legged and feathered guests including puppies, kitties, rabbits and horses at your very own Pet Resort. Nurture and love the animals to grow your pet care business and become every animal's best friend forever!  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00790na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001100007264002000018300002300038500056400061542002400625655003100649RPOEC800aOpoona 1bKoeic2008-3-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhile on an interplanetary family vacation, the young boy Opoona crash lands on Planet Landroll after his spaceship is involved in a mysterious accident. Separated from his family, Opoona is forced to live alone. On the planet, Opoona must find a job, search for his siblings, and defend himself and the people of Landroll against creatures known as the Dark Rogues. Luckily for Opoona, he is the descendant of a long line of warriors known as the Cosmo Guards. Thus, Opoona’s adventure begins as he struggles to establish a new life and reunite his family.  i2008kKoeisGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00790na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001100007264002000018300002300038500056400061542002400625655003100649RPOJC800aOpoona 1bKoeic2007-11-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhile on an interplanetary family vacation, the young boy Opoona crash lands on Planet Landroll after his spaceship is involved in a mysterious accident. Separated from his family, Opoona is forced to live alone. On the planet, Opoona must find a job, search for his siblings, and defend himself and the people of Landroll against creatures known as the Dark Rogues. Luckily for Opoona, he is the descendant of a long line of warriors known as the Cosmo Guards. Thus, Opoona’s adventure begins as he struggles to establish a new life and reunite his family.  i2007kKoeisGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00790na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001100007264002000018300002300038500056400061542002400625655003100649RPOPC800aOpoona 1bKoeic2008-9-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhile on an interplanetary family vacation, the young boy Opoona crash lands on Planet Landroll after his spaceship is involved in a mysterious accident. Separated from his family, Opoona is forced to live alone. On the planet, Opoona must find a job, search for his siblings, and defend himself and the people of Landroll against creatures known as the Dark Rogues. Luckily for Opoona, he is the descendant of a long line of warriors known as the Cosmo Guards. Thus, Opoona’s adventure begins as he struggles to establish a new life and reunite his family.  i2008kKoeisGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00505na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264003700042300002300079500022600102542004200328655002500370RPPE4100aPrince of Persia: Rival Swords 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-4-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aYour homeland is besieged. Your people are enslaved. Now, you must use the Wii controllers to wield an array of ancient weapons and bring peace to your shattered land. You've never played Prince of Persia quite like this.  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext01014na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264003800042300002300080500069400103542004200797655002500839655002800864RPPP4100aPrince of Persia: Rival Swords 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-4-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Prince of Persia makes his way home to Babylon, bearing with him Kaileena, the enigmatic Empress of Time, and unspeakable scars from the Island of Time. But instead of the peace he longs for, he finds his kingdom ravaged by war and Kaileena the target of a brutal plot. When she is kidnapped, the Prince tracks her to the Palace – only to see her murdered by a powerful enemy. Her death unleashes the Sands of Time, which strike the Prince and threaten to destroy everything he holds dear. Cast to the streets, hunted as a fugitive, the Prince soon discovers that the Sands have tainted him, too. They have given rise to a deadly Dark Prince, whose spirit gradually possesses him….  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00704na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264003600022300002300058500040700081542004100488655002500529655002800554RPQES500aPool Party 1bSouthpeak Interactivec2007-9-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your stick and go head-to-head in POOL PARTY for the Nintendo Wii system. With 13 different types of pool, including 9-Ball, 8-Ball, Rotation, Black Jack and Snooker, there’s a game of billiards to satisfy any pool shark where you will be hustlin’ pros in dive bars, honky-tonks, mansions and even yachts. POOL PARTY includes competitors with intelligent AI and tables with real-world physics.  i2007kSouthpeak InteractivesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBilliards games2wiiext00705na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264003700022300002300059500040700082542004100489655002500530655002800555RPQPS500aPool Party 1bSouthpeak Interactivec2008-7-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your stick and go head-to-head in POOL PARTY for the Nintendo Wii system. With 13 different types of pool, including 9-Ball, 8-Ball, Rotation, Black Jack and Snooker, there’s a game of billiards to satisfy any pool shark where you will be hustlin’ pros in dive bars, honky-tonks, mansions and even yachts. POOL PARTY includes competitors with intelligent AI and tables with real-world physics.  i2008kSouthpeak InteractivesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBilliards games2wiiext00470na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264003500046300002300081500019000104542003800294655002800332RPSE4Q00aDisney Princess: Enchanted Journey 1bDisney Interactivec2007-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aDisney Princess: Enchanted Journey offers young girls the chance to meet and interact with the beloved Disney Princesses while encouraging creativity, exploration and positive messages.  i2007kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00468na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264003400045300002300079500019000102542003800292655002800330RPSJ4Q00aDisney Princess: Mahou no Sekai e 1bDisney Interactivec2007-12-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aDisney Princess: Enchanted Journey offers young girls the chance to meet and interact with the beloved Disney Princesses while encouraging creativity, exploration and positive messages.  i2007kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00469na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264003400046300002300080500019000103542003800293655002800331RPSP4Q00aDisney Princess: Enchanted Journey 1bDisney Interactivec2008-2-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aDisney Princess: Enchanted Journey offers young girls the chance to meet and interact with the beloved Disney Princesses while encouraging creativity, exploration and positive messages.  i2008kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00529na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264002600041300002300067500027000090542003000360655002900390RPTD5200aTierbabys: Mein kleiner Welpe 1bActivisionc2008-3-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aPuppy Luv is the perfect pet, no need to run outside in the rain to take him out, he won't break anything or even leave you a little surprise. This Puppy will provide unconditional love and the entire family will have hours of fun playing with your new best friend!  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00466na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264002500043300002300068500016400091542003000255655002900285655003000314RPTE5200aPuppy Luv: Your New Best Friend 1bActivisionc2008-2-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aPuppy Luv is full of perfect pets! There's no need to run outside in the rain to take them out, they won't break anything, or even leave you a little surprise.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00573na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264002600043300002300069500027000092542003000362655002900392655003000421RPTP5200aPuppy Luv: Your New Best Friend 1bActivisionc2008-2-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aPuppy Luv is the perfect pet, no need to run outside in the rain to take him out, he won't break anything or even leave you a little surprise. This Puppy will provide unconditional love and the entire family will have hours of fun playing with your new best friend!  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00973na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264002000048300002300068500068600091542002400777655002500801655002500826RPUJ8P00aPuyo Puyo! Puyopuyo 15th Anniversary 1bSegac2007-7-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aAnother entry in the classic "falling bean" puzzle game franchise. With this Wii game, SEGA has introduced the new "Puyo Puyo Together" mode, where two players play on the same field, working together to guide falling pieces into place. Two pieces fall simultaneously in this mode, meaning you and your Puyo Puyo friend will have to strategize together. The second new mode of play is called "Remote Controller Puyo Puyo." This mode is played using the motion-sensing capabilities of not one, but two Wiimotes. One controller is used for rotating the pieces while the other is used for moving them. While you can play individually, SEGA seems to want multiple players to cooperate.  i2007kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00891na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001400007264003400021300002300055500059300078542003900671655002900710655003000739RPVE4Z00aPurr Pals 1bCrave Entertainmentc2008-7-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to the cuddly online home of Purr Pals, the game that gives you all the cute, frisky, playful little kittens you’ve ever wanted. Purr Pals lets you choose an adorable virtual kitten to adopt, train, wash, pet, feed and entertain. Better still, your Purr Pal will entertain you! You’ll have hours of furry fun choosing your kitty’s breed, unique personality, fur and eye color and the accessories it will wear while you play. With so many different kittens to choose from, the possibilities with your Purr Pal are nearly endless. If you like kittens, you’ll love Purr Pals.  i2008kCrave EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00450na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001400007264002700021300002300048500016700071542003100238655002900269655003000298RPVPKM00aPurr Pals 1bDeep Silverc2009-7-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn "Purr Pals", pet lovers get to adopt a small cute kitten of their own, raise it, take good care of it, love it, play with it, and spoil it with special treats.  i2009kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00774na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004200007264003800049300002300087500044700110542004200557655002500599655002800624RPWX4100aPrince of Persia: The Forgotten Sands 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2010-5-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aPrince of Persia: The Forgotten Sands for Wii is a new installment in the popular Prince of Persia series and presents a new adventure within the Sands of Time universe. After leaving his father's kingdom to prove his worth, the Prince is drawn toward a mysterious realm. He quickly discovers that he must harness his acrobatic abilities and powers over the environment to not only survive, but to save a mystic palace from unfathomable evil.  i2010kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00774na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004200007264003800049300002300087500044700110542004200557655002500599655002800624RPWZ4100aPrince of Persia: The Forgotten Sands 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2010-5-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aPrince of Persia: The Forgotten Sands for Wii is a new installment in the popular Prince of Persia series and presents a new adventure within the Sands of Time universe. After leaving his father's kingdom to prove his worth, the Prince is drawn toward a mysterious realm. He quickly discovers that he must harness his acrobatic abilities and powers over the environment to not only survive, but to save a mystic palace from unfathomable evil.  i2010kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00475na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264003200025300002300057500022500080542003500305655002500340RPXE6900aEA Playground 1bElectronic Artsc2007-10-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aEA Playground offers endless hours of entertainment for all ages. It is the ultimate party play experience, where bragging rights are at stake as you take on your friends and family in fun and immersive playground games.  i2007kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00243na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003300007264003600040300002300076500000500099542004100104RPXJ1300aPlayground: Kouen de Asobou! 1bElectronic Arts Japanc2008-3-6  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kElectronic Arts JapansGameTDB00510na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264003100025300002300056500022500079542003500304655002500339655002400364RPXP6900aEA Playground 1bElectronic Artsc2007-11-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aEA Playground offers endless hours of entertainment for all ages. It is the ultimate party play experience, where bragging rights are at stake as you take on your friends and family in fun and immersive playground games.  i2007kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00393na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264002200028300002300050500012500073542002500198655002500223655002300248RPYE9B00aSuper Swing Golf 1bTecmoc2006-12-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aYell out “fore!” with friends and family while taking virtual swings in Super Swing Golf™ for the Nintendo Wii™!  i2006kTecmosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7a