am is the most realistic fishing adventure on Wii. Filled with picturesque North American locations, a variety of lifelike fish and soothing environments - it is as good as the real thing!  i2010kNatsumesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFishing games2wiiext00592na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264002600039300002300065500029900088542003000387655002500417655002800442RRGE5200aMadagascar: Escape 2 Africa 1bActivisionc2008-11-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Madagascar: Escape 2 Africa Video Game takes players on a whole new action-packed journey through 12 diverse levels featuring tons of wildy fun mini-games and an expanded multiplayer tournament mode that lets fans experience a number of outlandish competitions alongside or against friends.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00593na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002700041300002300068500029800091542003000389655002500419655002700444RRGP5200aMadagascar 2: Escape 2 Africa 1bActivisionc2008-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet MORE characters, MORE fun, and MORE multiplayer action than ever before in Activision and DreamWorks Animation’s Madagascar: Escape 2 Africa video game! Join the zany Madagascar crew on a new adventure based on Madagascar: Escape 2 Africa the sequel to the blockbuster movie, Madagascar!  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00575na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264002600024300002300050500029800073542003000371655002500401655002700426RRGX5200aMadagaskar 2 1bActivisionc2008-11-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet MORE characters, MORE fun, and MORE multiplayer action than ever before in Activision and DreamWorks Animation’s Madagascar: Escape 2 Africa video game! Join the zany Madagascar crew on a new adventure based on Madagascar: Escape 2 Africa the sequel to the blockbuster movie, Madagascar!  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00516na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003200007264002600039300002300065500014300088542003000231655002500261655002500286655002900311655003000340RRHPUJ00aMary King's Riding School 2 1bGhostlightc2009-9-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aAll the excitement and spectacle of Three Day Eventing is galloping onto your Wii console, courtesy of British Olympic hopeful, Mary King!  i2009kGhostlightsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00457na  a2200133   4500001000700000245000900007264002700016300002300043500014300066542003000209655002500239655002900264655003000293RRHXUJ00aRide 1bGhostlightc2009-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aAll the excitement and spectacle of Three Day Eventing is galloping onto your Wii console, courtesy of British Olympic hopeful, Mary King!  i2009kGhostlightsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00230na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001600007264001900023300002300042500000500065542002600070655002400096RRIPTV00aPaint Works 1bTivolac2010--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kTivolasGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00301na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002600025300002300051500002300074542002900097655002900126655002400155RRJFMR00aCuisine Party 1bMindscapec2009-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aCook it up, quick!  i2009kMindscapesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00307na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264002500030300002300055500002300078542002900101655002900130655002600159RRJIMR00aLa Prova del Cuoco 1bMindscapec2009-8-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aCook it up, quick!  i2009kMindscapesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aCooking games2wiiext00352na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003200007264002500039300002300064500002300087542002900110655002900139655002400168655002600192RRJPMR00aReady Steady Cook: The Game 1bMindscapec2009-8-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aCook it up, quick!  i2009kMindscapesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aCooking games2wiiext00675na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002200007264003400029300002300063500033000086542003800416655002500454655002800479655003400507RRKE7000aAlone in the Dark 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2008-6-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe game that started the popular survival horror genre returns better than ever! Players control Edward Carnby, the main character from the original Alone in the Dark, on a thrilling journey through a dark and terrifying re-creation of New York’s Central Park where Carnby must discover the truth behind a dark conspiracy.  i2008kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSurvival horror games2wiiext01235na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264003400029300002300063500093000086542003801016655002501054655003401079RRKP7000aAlone in the Dark 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2008-6-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aUncover the earth-shattering secret hidden in New York's iconic Central Park in Alone In The Dark. History records that Central Park was built on a useless swamp, yet as the New York City skyline hurtled towards the sky over the last 150 years, making the city the most expensive real estate in the world, the park has remained untouched. Why? Civic pride? Perhaps, but the recent strange happenings in and around the park are casting doubt on that, doubts that require investigating. Edward Carnby, Paranormal Investigator is looking for answers to the strange events and horrific creatures reported in and around the park, but gets more than he bargained for when all the mysteries and terrors of the park spill out over the course of one apocalyptic night. It's your task to avoid the new frightening dangers of the park as you search for the answers to what these supernatural occurrences mean and why they are happening.  i2008kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSurvival horror games2wiiext00677na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002000036300002300056500043700079542002300516655002800539RRLE7800aBratz: Girlz Really Rock 1bTHQc2008-10-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Bratz are out of Stilesville and attending Camp Starshine, a summer camp for the most talented students of the performing arts! They meet Anna, a lonely ballerina who has dedicated so much of her life to dance that she has missed out on fun and friendship. When Anna has a crisis of confidence, her new friends are there to rally around her, helping her create a performance for the end of camp showcase that no one will forget!  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00674na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002000036300002300056500043700079542002300516655002500539RRLP7800aBratz: Girlz Really Rock 1bTHQc2008-10-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Bratz are out of Stilesville and attending Camp Starshine, a summer camp for the most talented students of the performing arts! They meet Anna, a lonely ballerina who has dedicated so much of her life to dance that she has missed out on fun and friendship. When Anna has a crisis of confidence, her new friends are there to rally around her, helping her create a performance for the end of camp showcase that no one will forget!  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00674na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002000036300002300056500043700079542002300516655002500539RRLX7800aBratz: Girlz Really Rock 1bTHQc2008-10-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Bratz are out of Stilesville and attending Camp Starshine, a summer camp for the most talented students of the performing arts! They meet Anna, a lonely ballerina who has dedicated so much of her life to dance that she has missed out on fun and friendship. When Anna has a crisis of confidence, her new friends are there to rally around her, helping her create a performance for the end of camp showcase that no one will forget!  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00674na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002000036300002300056500043700079542002300516655002500539RRLY7800aBratz: Girlz Really Rock 1bTHQc2008-10-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Bratz are out of Stilesville and attending Camp Starshine, a summer camp for the most talented students of the performing arts! They meet Anna, a lonely ballerina who has dedicated so much of her life to dance that she has missed out on fun and friendship. When Anna has a crisis of confidence, her new friends are there to rally around her, helping her create a performance for the end of camp showcase that no one will forget!  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00672na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264001800036300002300054500043700077542002300514655002500537RRLZ7800aBratz: Girlz Really Rock 1bTHQc2009-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Bratz are out of Stilesville and attending Camp Starshine, a summer camp for the most talented students of the performing arts! They meet Anna, a lonely ballerina who has dedicated so much of her life to dance that she has missed out on fun and friendship. When Anna has a crisis of confidence, her new friends are there to rally around her, helping her create a performance for the end of camp showcase that no one will forget!  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00575na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264003600036300002300072500027000095542003900365655002400404655002500428RRME6900aHasbro Family Game Night 1bElectronic Arts Incc2008-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin your host Mr. Potato Head as you play classic Hasbro games as well as exciting new versions created for the Wii & PS2. Hasbro Family Game Night features family favorites such as CONNECT FOUR, BATTLESHIP, YAHTZEE, BOGGLE, SORRY! and the all new, SORRY! Sliders.  i2008kElectronic Arts IncsGameTDB 7aBoard games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00589na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002400007264003200031300002300063500026100086542003500347655002400382655002400406655002500430RRMI6900aHasbro Family Party 1bElectronic Artsc2008-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aOspitato da Mr. Potato Head, Family Games consente a quattro giocatori di diventare concorrenti e partecipare a un'ampia varietà di giochi avvincenti e divertenti. Guadagna e raccogli parti dell'ambita patata d'oro per diventare il vincitore del concorso!  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00594na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002900007264003200036300002300068500026100091542003500352655002400387655002400411655002500435RRMP6900aHasbro Family Game Night 1bElectronic Artsc2008-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin your host Mr. Potato Head as you play classic Hasbro games as well as exciting new versions created for the Wii & PS2. Hasbro Family Game Night features family favorites such as CONNECT FOUR, BATTLESHIP, BOGGLE, SORRY! and the all new, SORRY! Sliders.  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00603na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002900007264003200036300002300068500027000091542003500361655002400396655002400420655002500444RRMX6900aHasbro Family Game Night 1bElectronic Artsc2008-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin your host Mr. Potato Head as you play classic Hasbro games as well as exciting new versions created for the Wii & PS2. Hasbro Family Game Night features family favorites such as CONNECT FOUR, BATTLESHIP, YAHTZEE, BOGGLE, SORRY! and the all new, SORRY! Sliders.  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00493na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264003700030300002300067500022600090542004200316655002500358RRPE4104aThe Price Is Right 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2008-9-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aCOME ON DOWN! The Price Is Right™ game brings all the excitement of the TV show to the consoles and PCs of fans of all ages. The longest running and most popular game show of all time is now making its debut on the Wii.  i2008kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aTrivia games2wiiext00555na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004000007264002700047300002300074500025700097542003000354655002500384655002400409RRQE5200aShrek's Carnival Craze: Party Games 1bActivisionc2008-10-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe twisted fairytale humor of Shrek meets the fun of the renaissance midway in Shrek's Carnival Craze. This game includes 28 hilarious carnival mini-games. Play as your favorite Shrek characters and compete to become the King or Queen of the carnival.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00518na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264002700047300002300074500025700097542003000354655002400384RRQP5200aShrek's Carnival Craze: Party Games 1bActivisionc2008-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe twisted fairytale humor of Shrek meets the fun of the renaissance midway in Shrek's Carnival Craze. This game includes 28 hilarious carnival mini-games. Play as your favorite Shrek characters and compete to become the King or Queen of the carnival.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00517na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264002600047300002300073500025700096542003000353655002400383RRQX5200aShrek's Carnival Craze: Party Games 1bActivisionc2008-11-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe twisted fairytale humor of Shrek meets the fun of the renaissance midway in Shrek's Carnival Craze. This game includes 28 hilarious carnival mini-games. Play as your favorite Shrek characters and compete to become the King or Queen of the carnival.  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00630na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264003900036300002300075500035300098542004400451655002500495RRRE5Z00aReal Heroes: Firefighter 1bConspiracy Entertainmentc2009-8-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnter the soot-stained boots of an everday hero as a newly graduated Fire Academy cadet getting their start in a big city firehouse. Experience raging infernos and explosive environments in this unique first person action game. Use the firefighter's tools of the trade like the axe, hose and saw to rescue survivors and get the fires under control.  i2009kConspiracy EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00297na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264002700036300002300063500000500086542003000091655002500121655002900146RRRPRM00aReal Heroes: Firefighter 1bRondomediac2009-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kRondomediasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00869na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264003400030300002300064500060900087542003800696655002500734RRSE4Q00aMeet the Robinsons 1bDisney Interactivec2007-3-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aDisney’s Meet the Robinsons, based on the Walt Disney Pictures animated film, is a time-traveling action/adventure game. Players will experience the adventure as Wilbur Robinson, helping him chase the dastardly Bowler Hat Guy and his diabolical robotic hat Doris through multiple timelines in an attempt to thwart their evil plans. The game weaves in and out of the film’s plot, expanding the Robinson world and offering an all-new adventure. Wilbur will have a host of gadgets at his disposal as he battles enemies and solves puzzles while pursuing Bowler Hat Guy and trying not to alter the future.  i2007kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00940na  a2200109   4500001000700000245009000007264003500097300002300132500060900155542003800764655002800802RRSJ4Q00aWalt Disney Pictures Presents Lewis to Mirai Dorobou: Wilbur no Kiken na Jikan Ryokou 1bDisney Interactivec2007-12-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aDisney’s Meet the Robinsons, based on the Walt Disney Pictures animated film, is a time-traveling action/adventure game. Players will experience the adventure as Wilbur Robinson, helping him chase the dastardly Bowler Hat Guy and his diabolical robotic hat Doris through multiple timelines in an attempt to thwart their evil plans. The game weaves in and out of the film’s plot, expanding the Robinson world and offering an all-new adventure. Wilbur will have a host of gadgets at his disposal as he battles enemies and solves puzzles while pursuing Bowler Hat Guy and trying not to alter the future.  i2007kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00949na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002300007264003500030300002300065500060900088542003800697655002500735655002800760655002700788RRSP4Q00aMeet the Robinsons 1bDisney Interactivec2007-10-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aDisney’s Meet the Robinsons, based on the Walt Disney Pictures animated film, is a time-traveling action/adventure game. Players will experience the adventure as Wilbur Robinson, helping him chase the dastardly Bowler Hat Guy and his diabolical robotic hat Doris through multiple timelines in an attempt to thwart their evil plans. The game weaves in and out of the film’s plot, expanding the Robinson world and offering an all-new adventure. Wilbur will have a host of gadgets at his disposal as he battles enemies and solves puzzles while pursuing Bowler Hat Guy and trying not to alter the future.  i2007kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00949na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002300007264003500030300002300065500060900088542003800697655002500735655002800760655002700788RRSX4Q00aMeet the Robinsons 1bDisney Interactivec2007-10-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aDisney’s Meet the Robinsons, based on the Walt Disney Pictures animated film, is a time-traveling action/adventure game. Players will experience the adventure as Wilbur Robinson, helping him chase the dastardly Bowler Hat Guy and his diabolical robotic hat Doris through multiple timelines in an attempt to thwart their evil plans. The game weaves in and out of the film’s plot, expanding the Robinson world and offering an all-new adventure. Wilbur will have a host of gadgets at his disposal as he battles enemies and solves puzzles while pursuing Bowler Hat Guy and trying not to alter the future.  i2007kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00644na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264002700033300002300060500039700083542003000480655002400510RRTE5200aBlock Party: 20 Games 1bActivisionc2008-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the most outrageous Block Party ever! Laugh your way through zany and hilarious competitions as you prove to your neighbors that you are the "Best on the Block"! Features 20 block busting games for everyone including "Chariots of Fruit", "Crazy Clothesline", "Save the Sandwich", "Balloon Rescue" and many more! Take on your friends and battle for Block Supremacy in multiplayer mode!  i2008kActivisionsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00643na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264002600033300002300059500039700082542003000479655002400509RRTP5200aBlock Party: 20 Games 1bActivisionc2009-2-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the most outrageous Block Party ever! Laugh your way through zany and hilarious competitions as you prove to your neighbors that you are the "Best on the Block"! Features 20 block busting games for everyone including "Chariots of Fruit", "Crazy Clothesline", "Save the Sandwich", "Balloon Rescue" and many more! Take on your friends and battle for Block Supremacy in multiplayer mode!  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00627na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004300007264002500050300002300075500036500098542002900463655002500492RRUFRT00aWinter Sports 2009: The Next Challenge 1bRTL Gamesc2009-1-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aWinter Sports 2009 is the market leading winter sports compilation. The new successor packs tons of reworked and extended elements of its successful predecessors. Numerous innovative features have been added and optimised. With snowboard half pipe and biathlon, two new sports have been implemented. The career has been extended, now featuring over 40 missions  i2009kRTL GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00667na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264003200050300002300082500035400105542003600459655002500495655002500520RRUJJF00aWinter Sports 2009: The Next Challenge 1bArc System Worksc2009-3-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aWinter Sports 2: The Next Challenge is an arcade oriented 3D simulation of only the most popular winter sports. The player is placed at the center of high level sporting events broadcast live around the world. The excitement of this major international competition is portrayed authentically with commentators, TV cameras and immersive environments.  i2009kArc System WorkssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSkiing games2wiiext00629na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004300007264002600050300002300076500036500099542003000464655002500494RRUPRT00aWinter Sports 2009: The Next Challenge 1bRTL Sportsc2009-1-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aWinter Sports 2009 is the market leading winter sports compilation. The new successor packs tons of reworked and extended elements of its successful predecessors. Numerous innovative features have been added and optimised. With snowboard half pipe and biathlon, two new sports have been implemented. The career has been extended, now featuring over 40 missions  i2009kRTL SportssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext01109na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003100007264003300038300002300071500075400094542003700848655002500885655002600910655003900936RRVENR00aBattle Rage: Mech Conflict 1bDestineer Studiosc2009-2-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aBattle Rage is a third person shooter with elements of a beat'em'up game that allows a player to control giant robots. Battles between the robots take place on carefully selected battlegrounds (so called "arenas") and they are short, quick, brutal skirmishes. The player can fight alone (versus one, two or even three opponents) or in a team against a common foe. Every robot has its own weapons (for melee and distance combat), additional weapon types can be collected on the arena. The player can modify a robot's parameters in the single player mode as well as in the multiplayer to fit its possibilities to his/her own fighting style. Also many new, powerful robots will wait for the player to unlock in the story mode. The Tournament has begun.  i2009kDestineer StudiossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aThird-person shooter games2wiiext00537na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264002200034300002300056500029600079542002500375655002700400RRWJAF00aSuper Robot Taisen Neo 1bNamcoc2009-10-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aSuper Robot Taisen is another one of Bandai Namco's hit series. After participating in the Gundam Seed wars from the last installment, it's time to launch into the battles for energy. As one of the most comprehensive cross-overs, mecha from all famous series and their pilots are joining in.  i2009kNamcosGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext00574na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264004000048300002300088500024100111542004400352655002500396655003100421RRXE5Z00aMonster Trux Arenas: Special Edition 1bConspiracy Entertainmentc2007-10-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aThink that you can handle a monster? Monster Trux Arenas lets you drive these awesome, monstrous machines in some of the toughest arenas known to man. Unleash the power and hold on tight cus' in this game…you have to tame the beast!!!  i2007kConspiracy EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aTruck racing games2wiiext00512na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264003900031300002300070500024100093542004300334655002500377RRXPUG00aMonster Trux Arenas 1bData Design Interactivec2008-2-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aThink that you can handle a monster? Monster Trux Arenas lets you drive these awesome, monstrous machines in some of the toughest arenas known to man. Unleash the power and hold on tight cus' in this game…you have to tame the beast!!!  i2008kData Design InteractivesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00512na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264003900031300002300070500024100093542004300334655002500377RRXXUG00aMonster Trux Arenas 1bData Design Interactivec2008-2-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aThink that you can handle a monster? Monster Trux Arenas lets you drive these awesome, monstrous machines in some of the toughest arenas known to man. Unleash the power and hold on tight cus' in this game…you have to tame the beast!!!  i2008kData Design InteractivesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext01936na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264003900047300002300086500165000109542004201759655002501801RRYEHG00aRogue Trooper: Quartz Zone Massacre 1bGraffiti Entertainmentc2009-11-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aRogue is a Souther G.I.; a genetically engineered super-soldier, designed to fight against the Nort Republic on the poisoned planet of Nu Earth. Each G.I has a ‘biochip’ implanted, which continually records their persona and training so that upon death they can be returned to base and recloned. Rogue’s closest buddies, Helm, Gunnar and Bagman die in their first action, betrayed by a Souther General, during what became known as the Quartz Zone Massacre. Their biochips were installed into Rogue’s Helmet, Rifle and Backpack. They now have control over their respective equipment, providing Rogue with a four-man combat team against the Norts. With Rogue, now the sole survivor of the massacre, his overall objective is simple – find and kill the Traitor General who betrayed the G.I’s! The game fully utilizes the Wiimote interface to provide an immersive gameplay experience with features such as a ‘Twist’ zoom sniper mode. A variety of powerful weapons can be used as well as additional firepower provided by Rogue’s equipment. Gunnar provides weapon modification, Bagman can deploy mines to provide cover, and Helm can create a controllable holographic projection of Rogue to confuse enemies in case of an ambush. The game combines aspects of stealth, cover, and run-n-gun gameplay into 13 action packed single player environments. There is also a fully featured multiplayer mode allowing up to 4 players to compete in a split-screen co-op play. Missions extend up to four kilometres and are designed to allow the player to explore their environment, scope out the enemy and find the best path for their style of attack.  i2009kGraffiti EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00282na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264003400047300002300081500000500104542003800109655002500147RRYPHY00aRogue Trooper: Quartz Zone Massacre 1bReef Entertainmentc2009-2-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kReef EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00755na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264003700025300002300062500045900085542004100544655002500585655002300610RRZEGY00aRubik's World 1bAmerican Game Factoryc2009-11-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Rubik's World- An abstract environment populated by "cubie" which make up the game's DNA. Rubik's world takes the shape, functionality and concept behind the famous Rubik's Cube but twists and turns the rules to transform it into a unique game experience for players of all ages. Get ready for a collection of games that will change your intellect while incorporating the mental twists and moves that made the original Rubik's Cube such a hit!  i2009kAmerican Game FactorysGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aCard games2wiiext00718na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264003300032300002300065500045900088542003600547655002500583RRZPGY00aRubik's Puzzle World 1bThe Game Factoryc2008-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Rubik's World- An abstract environment populated by "cubie" which make up the game's DNA. Rubik's world takes the shape, functionality and concept behind the famous Rubik's Cube but twists and turns the rules to transform it into a unique game experience for players of all ages. Get ready for a collection of games that will change your intellect while incorporating the mental twists and moves that made the original Rubik's Cube such a hit!  i2008kThe Game FactorysGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00590na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002400033300002300057500030400080542002900384655002900413655002600442RS2E2000aUltimate Duck Hunting 1bZoo Gamesc2009-8-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aSet off into the wilderness for the Ultimate Duck Hunting adventure! This game captures all your favorite parts of this outdoor sport-- train and guide your dog, gear up with brand name guns and camo, and don't forget your decoys! Secure the perfect shot and earn points to improve your dog's skill.  i2009kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00632na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264003100033300002300064500033300087542003500420655002900455655002600484RS2EGJ00aUltimate Duck Hunting 1bDetn8 Games Ltdc2007-7-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aChoose your dog (yellow, chocolate, or black Lab) and train him to respond to your commands. Gear up with guns, camouflage, and decoys - then it's off to the wilderness to set up decoys, use duck calls, and ultimately become a crack shot using the Wii Remote to aim and fire at tough-to-down mallard, hen, black, and teal ducks.  i2007kDetn8 Games LtdsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00470na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264002500024300002300049500019300072542003000265655002500295655002800320RS3E52