 Let's Go to the City, life moves at a relaxed pace, but the world brims with endless possibilities.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aLife simulation games2wiiext00370na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002300007264001900030300002300049500000500072542002400077655002500101655002900126655002900155655004000184RUWJC800aWinning Post World 1bKoeic2009-4-2  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kKoeisGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aSim racing games2wiiext 7aManagement simulation games2wiiext00537na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003000038300002300068500027700091542003400368655002500402RUXXUG00aUrban Extreme: Street Rage 1bPopcorn Arcadec2008-7-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aUrban Extreme: Street Rage is set in Fortune City. As an experienced Street driver you are forced by the Underworld into a series of extreme and sometimes lethal urban races. Competing in these contests is a dirty business and could cost you your car, and even your life..  i2008kPopcorn ArcadesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00817na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264002300048300002300071500051700094542002700611655002700638655003000665RUYE4100aNo More Heroes 2: Desperate Struggle 1bUbisoftc2010-1-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aNo More Heroes 2: Desperate Struggle continues the tale of punk anti-hero Travis Touchdown, the Japanese anime Otaku, and pro wrestling-obsessed assassin. Travis finds himself at the bottom of the UAA (United Assassins Association) rankings and must wage war to become the No. 1 assassin once again. The follow-up to the popular No More Heroes will offer fans infectious, fun gameplay that allows you to wield not just one, but two swords and face multiple bosses simultaneously in bigger-than-ever boss battles.  i2010kUbisoftsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00897na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264004000048300002300088500056800111542004300679655002500722655002800747RUYJ9900aNo More Heroes 2: Desperate Struggle 1bMarvelous Entertainmentc2010-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt has been 3 years since Travis earned the Number 1 spot in the United Assassins Assoc. ranking, and investments from major corporations have caused the city of Santa Destroy to change,… but is it really for the better? You are Travis Touchdown – a punk anti-hero , Japanese anime Otaku, beam katana master and pro wrestling-fanatic assassin. Revenge (as well as yoga sex) will bring you back to the UAA tournament. This time though, you begin at the bottom of the ranking and will have to fight your way up to save Santa Destroy and avenge your best friend.  i2010kMarvelous EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00348na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264003900048300002300087500002000110542004300130655002500173655002800198RUYP9900aNo More Heroes 2: Desperate Struggle 1bMarvelous Entertainmentc2010-5-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aTravis is back!  i2010kMarvelous EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00389na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001900007264004700026300002300073500002400096542005000120655002800170655002500198655003200223RUZE7T00aUltimate I Spy 1bElastic/Scholastic Interactivec2008-10-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aSearch. Find. Play.  i2008kElastic/Scholastic InteractivesGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aHidden object games2wiiext00696na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001900007264003400026300002300060500032100083542003700404655002800441655002400469655002500493655003200518RUZP5G00aUltimate I Spy 1bMajesco Sales Incc2008-10-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet ready to savor a truly invigorating riddle experience. Ultimate I SPY combines the classic I Spy gameplay you love with exciting activities that will get you up off the couch and moving around. Exercise your brain and your body as you solve riddles and do your best to get to the bottom of a captivating mystery.  i2008kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aHidden object games2wiiext00557na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264002800024300002300052500031600075542003200391655002400423RV2E5D00aGame Party 2 1bMidway Gamesc2008-10-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aWith 11 games in all, Game Party 2 for Wii includes fun to play games that will provide hours of enjoyment with friends and family. Each game has exciting new features like four player mode, customizable characters, and tournament play; making Game Party 2 the ultimate party game for all ages and skill levels.  i2008kMidway GamessGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00549na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264002300027300002300050500031600073542002600389655002400415RV2P5D00aMore Game Party 1bMidwayc2008-10-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aWith 11 games in all, Game Party 2 for Wii includes fun to play games that will provide hours of enjoyment with friends and family. Each game has exciting new features like four player mode, customizable characters, and tournament play; making Game Party 2 the ultimate party game for all ages and skill levels.  i2008kMidwaysGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00570na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264004700040300002300087500022900110542005100339655002500390655003300415RV3P6N00aClever Kids: Creepy Crawlies 1bMidas Interactive Entertainmentc2009-10-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin Sprocket the Robot on a fantastic journey into the undergrowth of your own garden! Learn about mini-beasts from all over the world, from Goliath Spiders the size of a dinner plate to Fairy Wasps smaller than a pin head!  i2009kMidas Interactive EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00331na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264002600026300002300052500009300