t will ultimately decide who will win the great 100 year old war.  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00634na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004900007264002000056300002300076500037700099542002300476655002500499RV9P7800aAvatar: The Legend of Aang: Into the Inferno 1bTHQc2008-10-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Fire Nation devises a plot to use the power of Sozin's Comet to rain devastation on the rest of the world. The fate of the world lies in the hands of only a few young, brave heroes — Aang and his friends. They are preparing for the ultimate showdown against Fire Lord Ozai and his terrorizing army that will ultimately decide who will win the great 100 year old war.  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00564na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005000007264002000057300002300077500030600100542002300406655002500429RVAE7800aAvatar: The Last Airbender: The Burning Earth 1bTHQc2007-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aAvatar: The Burning Earth continues the epic adventure of Aang and his courageous battle to restore balance to his war-torn world. Join him and his friends Katara, Toph, and Sokka as they master their skills and fight their way to defend the greatest Earth Kingdom city against a Fire Nation invasion!  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00604na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005000007264002000057300002300077500030600100542002300406655002500429655002800454RVAP7800aAvatar: The Legend of Aang: The Burning Earth 1bTHQc2007-10-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aAvatar: The Burning Earth continues the epic adventure of Aang and his courageous battle to restore balance to his war-torn world. Join him and his friends Katara, Toph, and Sokka as they master their skills and fight their way to defend the greatest Earth Kingdom city against a Fire Nation invasion!  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00339na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264003500035300002300070500003600093542003900129655002400168655002500192RVBERS00aAlvin and the Chipmunks 1bBrash Entertainmentc2007-12-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake the stage like a chipmunk!  i2007kBrash EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00986na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264008100035300002300116500059100139542008500730655002400815655002500839RVBPRS00aAlvin and the Chipmunks 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc. / Brash Entertainmentc2008-1-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aRock out with the Chipmunks! Inspired by the #1 kids musical group of all time, Alvin and The Chipmunks makes its debut on gaming systems for the first time ever! Players will play as the Chipmunks as they rock their way to the top of the charts by winning the ultimate battle of the bands contest, Rockathonapalooza. Alvin and the Chipmunks features fun music gameplay, popular licensed songs spanning many different eras, and a variety of play modes including multiplayer and more. Get ready to rock until you drop with Alvin and The Chipmunks in a brand new music-inspired adventure!  i2008kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc. / Brash EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00620na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003300038300002300071500035100094542003700445655002800482RVDPLG00aDiabolik: The Original Sin 1bMicro Applicationc2009-6-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aDiabolik: The Original Sin is a third person adventure game blending the heritage of the point-and-click genre with fast-paced combat and stealth sequences. Its story casts the player as a master thief called Diabolik, out to rescue his beloved Eva, in a fascinating world mixing 3D real-time graphics and 2D black & white comic-style animations.  i2009kMicro ApplicationsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00254na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264002600037300002300063500000500086542002900091655002400120RVEFMR00aBienvenue chez les C