opponents and pull off insane tricks as you race across the tundra!  i2008kDestineer StudiossGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00402na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264002400033300002300057500015900080542002800239655002500267RWBXUG00aKawasaki Snow Mobiles 1bMetro 3Dc2008-5-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your gear, get on your Kawasaki Snowmobile, and head out in the cold to challenge opponents and pull off insane tricks as you race across the tundra!  i2008kMetro 3DsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00856na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005000007264003500057300002300092500056600115542003900681655002600720RWCE4Z00aPinball Hall of Fame: The Williams Collection 1bCrave Entertainmentc2008-2-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aBack in the day, pinball was the game. Wannabe pinball wizards pumped in quarter after quarter and the best players became superstars in the arcade. Now you can relive those glory days with Pinball Hall of Fame - The Williams Collection.With true-to-life recreations of the hottest games from the 80's, you can go full tilt ahead with the legends - including Pinbot, Firepower, and one of the all-time greats: Black Knight. And with the authentic game play, stunning visuals, and thrilling sound effects, you'll swear you've been transported back to the arcade.  i2008kCrave EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aPinball games2wiiext00375na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264002400037300002300061500012700084542002800211655002600239RWCP6M00aWilliams Pinball Classics 1bStudio 3c2011-4-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Totally Authentic Pinball Experience - capturing all the sights, sounds and thrills of real Williams Pinball Machines.  i2011kStudio 3sGameTDB 7aPinball games2wiiext00725na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003700038300002300075500044700098542004100545655002900586RWDE5G00aWild Earth: African Safari 1bMajesco Entertainmentc2008-4-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aExplore the wild and capture its natural beauty on film in Wild Earth: African Safari, a unique simulation for the Wii based on the PC game from Super X Studios. Take award-winning pictures of exotic animals in their natural habitats without disturbing them. From running with herds of zebra to following hunting lions and scavenging vultures, Wild Earth: African Safari lets you risk it all to capture and create magazine-quality pictorials!  i2008kMajesco EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00717na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003300038300002300071500044700094542003700541655002900578RWDP5G00aWild Earth: African Safari 1bMajesco Sales Incc2008-9-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aExplore the wild and capture its natural beauty on film in Wild Earth: African Safari, a unique simulation for the Wii based on the PC game from Super X Studios. Take award-winning pictures of exotic animals in their natural habitats without disturbing them. From running with herds of zebra to following hunting lions and scavenging vultures, Wild Earth: African Safari lets you risk it all to capture and create magazine-quality pictorials!  i2008kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00605na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500032000087542002600407655002500433655002500458RWEEA400aPES 2008: Pro Evolution Soccer 1bKonamic2008-3-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe world’s most popular soccer game is back under a new name, Pro Evolution Soccer 2008. Formerly "Winning Eleven," PES 2008 builds upon the competitive spirit embodied by its predecessor with some major improvements. PES gamers will discover a more immersive, vivid soccer experience than they’ve ever played!  i2008kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00605na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500032000087542002600407655002500433655002500458RWEJA400aWinning Eleven Play Maker 2008 1bKonamic2008-2-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe world’s most popular soccer game is back under a new name, Pro Evolution Soccer 2008. Formerly "Winning Eleven," PES 2008 builds upon the competitive spirit embodied by its predecessor with some major improvements. PES gamers will discover a more immersive, vivid soccer experience than they’ve ever played!  i2008kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00607na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500032000087542002600407655002500433655002700458RWEPA400aPES 2008: Pro Evolution Soccer 1bKonamic2008-3-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe world’s most popular soccer game is back under a new name, Pro Evolution Soccer 2008. Formerly "Winning Eleven," PES 2008 builds upon the competitive spirit embodied by its predecessor with some major improvements. PES gamers will discover a more immersive, vivid soccer experience than they’ve ever played!  i2008kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00302na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004400007264003800051300002300089500000500112542004200117655003300159RWFH4100aMy Word Coach: Verbeter Je Woordenschat 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-11-6  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00686na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002200025300002300047500042000070542002600490655002500516655002300541RWGE0800aWe Love Golf! 1bCapcomc2008-7-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aWe Love Golf! presents a realistic golfing experience with a fresh new spin incorporating the Wii Remote’s unique motion-sensing functionality. Players will use the controller to choose clubs, line up shots, swing and even add a touch fade or draw with a flick of the wrist. Just as on a real course, gauging wind conditions, correct club selection and careful reading of the greens are all essential for victory.  i2008kCapcomsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00685na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002300025300002300048500041800071542002600489655002500515655002300540RWGJ0800aWe Love Golf! 1bCapcomc2007-12-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aWe Love Golf! presents a realistic golfing experience with a fresh new spin incorporating the Wii Remote's unique motion-sensing functionality. Players will use the controller to choose clubs, line up shots, swing and even add a touch fade or draw with a flick of the wrist. Just as on a real course, gauging wind conditions, correct club selection and careful reading of the greens are all essential for victory.  i2007kCapcomsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00685na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002100025300002300046500042000069542002600489655002500515655002300540RWGP0800aWe Love Golf! 1bCapcomc2008-7-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aWe Love Golf! presents a realistic golfing experience with a fresh new spin incorporating the Wii Remote’s unique motion-sensing functionality. Players will use the controller to choose clubs, line up shots, swing and even add a touch fade or draw with a flick of the wrist. Just as on a real course, gauging wind conditions, correct club selection and careful reading of the greens are all essential for victory.  i2008kCapcomsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00574na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264002100034300002300055500033800078542002500416655002300441RWHP4F00aTop Trumps: Doctor Who 1bEidosc2008-12-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aAn amalgamation of two hugely successful brands, Top Trumps and Doctor Who, Top Trumps: Doctor Who for the Nintendo Wii offers fans of both a change to engage with a huge selection of characters, each with their own unique abilities and skills all set in a visual theme inspired by the animated Doctor Who serial, The Infinite Quest.  i2008kEidossGameTDB 7aCard games2wiiext00795na  a2200133   45000010007000002450016000072640042000233