eedy, uncouth and rude anti-hero, returns to his roots. The Wario Land series is where Wario first appeared, and it's back in all its side-scrolling, platform-jumping glory.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00478na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264002300030300002300053500020000076542002800276655002500304655002700329RWLK0100aWario Land Shaking 1bNintendoc2011-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aWario!!! Nintendo's greedy, uncouth and rude anti-hero, returns to his roots. The Wario Land series is where Wario first appeared, and it's back in all its side-scrolling, platform-jumping glory.  i2011kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00492na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264002400043300002300067500020000090542002800290655002500318655002700343RWLP0100aWario Land: The Shake Dimension 1bNintendoc2008-9-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aWario!!! Nintendo's greedy, uncouth and rude anti-hero, returns to his roots. The Wario Land series is where Wario first appeared, and it's back in all its side-scrolling, platform-jumping glory.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00699na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264001900033300002300052500042800075542002300503655002700526655002400553RWME7800aWorms: A Space Oddity 1bTHQc2008-3-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aWorms: A Space Oddity is the “Worms” experience re-imagined for the Nintendo Wii. Retaining the classic turn based gameplay, stylized environments and humor synonymous with the brand, Worms: Wii brings players closer to the game than ever before! Taking advantage of the Wii controller with a redesigned control scheme, players will launch attacks with unique Worms weaponry via a wide range of gesture based maneuvers.  i2008kTHQsGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00700na  a2200121   450000100070000024500260000726400190003330000230005250004280