ars have appeared together in a game.  i2007kSegasGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00464na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264003900031300002300070500019100093542004200284655002800326RWTEG900aBen 10: Alien Force 1bD3Publisher of Americac2008-10-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aExplore action packed levels as Ben and fight off alien enemies including the HighBreed and DNAliens. Play as favorite alien heroes including Big Chill, Swampfire, Humungousaur and more!  i2008kD3Publisher of AmericasGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00481na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002900031300002300060500019100083542003200274655002500306655002800331RWTPG900aBen 10: Alien Force 1bD3 Publisherc2009-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aExplore action packed levels as Ben and fight off alien enemies including the HighBreed and DNAliens. Play as favorite alien heroes including Big Chill, Swampfire, Humungousaur and more!  i2009kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00596na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002500036300002300061500034700084542003000431655002500461RWUE5200aX-Men Origins: Wolverine 1bActivisionc2009-5-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aUncage Wolverine’s tragic past and discover how the ultimate weapon was created. Unleash the razor sharp adamantium claws, feral instincts and mutant regeneration power of the world’s fiercest hero. Visceral combat. Pure rage. Epic battles. Take on the impossible in your hunt to uncover the secrets of Weapon X…then exact your revenge.  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00597na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002600036300002300062500034700085542003000432655002500462RWUP5200aX-Men Origins: Wolverine 1bActivisionc2009-4-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aUncage Wolverine’s tragic past and discover how the ultimate weapon was created. Unleash the razor sharp adamantium claws, feral instincts and mutant regeneration power of the world’s fiercest hero. Visceral combat. Pure rage. Epic battles. Take on the impossible in your hunt to uncover the secrets of Weapon X…then exact your revenge.  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00597na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002600036300002300062500034700085542003000432655002500462RWUX5200aX-Men Origins: Wolverine 1bActivisionc2009-4-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aUncage Wolverine’s tragic past and discover how the ultimate weapon was created. Unleash the razor sharp adamantium claws, feral instincts and mutant regeneration power of the world’s fiercest hero. Visceral combat. Pure rage. Epic battles. Take on the impossible in your hunt to uncover the secrets of Weapon X…then exact your revenge.  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00575na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002000038300002300058500029600081542002300377655002500400655002800425RWWE7800aWWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2008 1bTHQc2007-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aWWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2008 features unique controls and gameplay created specifically for the Wii, resulting in quick response times and a more arcade feel. Ultimate control is taken to the next level, as players can act out slams, strikes, taunts and finishers as they take place on screen.  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00625na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003100007264002500038300002300063500029600086542002900382655002500411655002700436655002800463RWWJ7800aWWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2008 1bTHQ Japanc2008-2-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aWWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2008 features unique controls and gameplay created specifically for the Wii, resulting in quick response times and a more arcade feel. Ultimate control is taken to the next level, as players can act out slams, strikes, taunts and finishers as they take place on screen.  i2008kTHQ JapansGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00713na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003100007264002000038300002300058500039500081542002300476655002500499655002700524655002800551RWWP7800aWWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2008 1bTHQc2007-11-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aWWE Smackdown vs. Raw 2008 lets players develop the WWE Superstars of today into the Legends of tomorrow. The #1 wrestling franchise in the world delivers more depth and strategy with prominent new features, key annual enhancements and incredible graphics while making its much-anticipated debut on three new video game systems. It's time to live the life of a Superstar. How will you play?  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00713na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003100007264002000038300002300058500039500081542002300476655002500499655002700524655002800551RWWX7800aWWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2008 1bTHQc2007-11-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aWWE Smackdown vs. Raw 2008 lets players develop the WWE Superstars of today into the Legends of tomorrow. The #1 wrestling franchise in the world delivers more depth and strategy with prominent new features, key annual enhancements and incredible graphics while making its much-anticipated debut on three new video game systems. It's time to live the life of a Superstar. How will you play?  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00789na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264003800035300002300073500047600096542004200572655002500614655002800639RWXES500aBrave: A Warrior's Tale 1bSouth Peak Interactivec2009-7-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aSet in a fantastic world based upon the mythology of Native America, Brave: A Warrior's Tale plays as a series of flashbacks in which a now elderly Brave describes the events of his life. Players take on the role of Courage and experience Brave's legendary adventures first hand as they relive his story and play through all-new content that will make Courage a legend in his own right! Can Courage live up to his name and stop the evil Wendigo's threat to their village?  i2009kSouth Peak InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00787na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264003700035300002300072500047600095542004100571655002500612655002800637RWXPS500aBrave: A Warrior's Tale 1bSouthpeak Interactivec2009-9-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aSet in a fantastic world based upon the mythology of Native America, Brave: A Warrior's Tale plays as a series of flashbacks in which a now elderly Brave describes the events of his life. Players take on the role of Courage and experience Brave's legendary adventures first hand as they relive his story and play through all-new content that will make Courage a legend in his own right! Can Courage live up to his name and stop the evil Wendigo's threat to their village?  i2009kSouthpeak InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00810na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264003900044300002300083500046800106542004200574655002800616655004400644RWYPHH00aRunaway: The Dream of the Turtle 1bFocus Home Interactivec2009-11-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe adventure is made up of 6 main chapters. Players can explore more than 100 different places in all four corners of the globe: Alaska, Hawaii, underwater or in the sky, in the heart of the jungle or on board a huge yacht. There are tons of different colourful places, marvellous backdrops for an unforgettable adventure. Pendulo Studio has concocted a large number of tasty puzzles and scintillating enigmas of advancing difficulty levels for players to solve.  i2009kFocus Home InteractivesGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPoint-and-click adventure games2wiiext00758na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264003600039300002300075500048400098542004100582655002500623RWZE5G00aWonder World Amusement Park 1bMajesco Entertainmentc2008-7-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aWonderworld Amusement Park includes 30 different mini-games that mirror real carnival games but are re-imagined in the park's five stylized fantasy areas. Players immerse themselves in this fantastical world of fun by creating and customizing their own unique character with outfits and accessories purchased with mini-game winnings. As an added bonus, gamers can also enjoy playable rides within the 3D park and challenge other family members in several 4-player gameplay modes.  i2008kMajesco EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00647na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264003800039300002300077500037200100542004100472655002400513RWZP5G00aWonder World Amusement Park 1bMajesco Entertainmentc2008-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aAll of the fun and thrills of your favorite amusement parks and carnivals are now available in your living room! In Wonder World Amusement Park, you can take your customized character through a fully 3D park with five themed zones and hop on five heart-pounding interactive rides. Play through a huge variety of mini-games as you win prizes for your unique character.  i2008kMajesco EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00639na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264003400039300002300073500037200096542003700468655002400505RWZX5G00aWonder World Amusement Park 1bMajesco Sales Incc2008-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aAll of the fun and thrills of your favorite amusement parks and carnivals are now available in your living room! In Wonder World Amusement Park, you can take your customized character through a fully 3D park with five themed zones and hop on five heart-pounding interactive rides. Play through a huge variety of mini-games as you win prizes for your unique character.  i2008kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext01051na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003500007264003400042300002300076500069600099542003800795655002500833655002900858655003000887RX2E7000aMy Horse & Me: Riding for Gold 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2009-4-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis sequel to My Horse & Me is packed with exciting new features, brand new graphics and animations, and an engrossing storyline to give fans the most complete equestrian experience and the most realistic horse simulation ever seen in a game. Delivering all the excitement and fun of the equestrian life, from sports and leisure riding to horse care, My Horse and Me Riding for Gold is a unique gaming experience for anyone with an interest or passion for horses. The game features the most accurate horse models and animations yet realized in a video game, alongside a richly rewarding game play experience, all set against a beautiful backdrop of charming indoor and outdoor environments.  i2009kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00649na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264003500027300002300062500038700085542003800472655002900510RX2P7000aMy Horse & Me 2 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2008-10-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aMy Horse and Me 2 is packed with exciting new features, brand new graphics and animations, and an engrossing storyline to give fans the most complete equestrian experience and the most realistic horse simulation ever seen in a game. The My Horse and Me series are the only games in the world to earn the exclusive license from the FEI, the world's leading horse sports organization.  i2008kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00488na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264002400036300002300060500020500083542002800288655002500316655002500341RX3E0100aExciteBots: Trick Racing 1bNintendoc2009-4-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aHigh-speed action. Robotic insect and animal racers. Wii Wheel controls. Bowling, poker, clowns – and sandwiches! Add them all together and you get the wild, nonstop fun of Excitebots: Trick Racing.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00482na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264002400030300002300054500020500077542002800282655002500310655002500335RX3J0100aExcite Mou Machine 1bNintendoc2011-8-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aHigh-speed action. Robotic insect and animal racers. Wii Wheel controls. Bowling, poker, clowns – and sandwiches! Add them all together and you get the wild, nonstop fun of Excitebots: Trick Racing.  i2011kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00880na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004500007264003200052300002300084500060400107542003500711655002400746RX4E4Z00aCasper's Scare School: Spooky Sports Day 1bRed Wagon Gamesc2010-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aCasper and his friends scare up some fun with spooky sports games the whole family can enjoy. Once a year, the Underworld celebrates sports day. It's a day when the grounds of Scare School are filled with all kinds of sporting events. Help Casper win gold medals and stop his pesky nemesis Thatch from hogging all the glory. Keep the ball off the ground in a game of Creepy Uppies, balance a giant dragon egg on a tiny spoon in the Dragon Egg and Spoon Race, and much more. Even though these events are fit for ghouls and ghosts, since Casper's involved, you know the competition is always friendly.  i2010kRed Wagon GamessGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00517na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004500007264005200052300002300104500020000127542005600327655002400383RX4PMT00aCasper's Scare School: Spooky Sports Day 1bMastertronic Group Limited / Blast !c2009-9-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aSpooky Sports Day comes around every year and Casper is determined not to let Thatch steal all the glory. Casper and his friends have been training hard to make that the prizes are shared fairly.  i2009kMastertronic Group Limited / Blast !sGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00306na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002700027300002300054500002000077542003000097655002500127655003200152RX5E5200aTony Hawk: Ride 1bActivisionc2009-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aAnyone Can RIDE  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSkateboarding games2wiiext00305na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002600027300002300053500002000076542003000096655002500126655003200151RX5P5200aTony Hawk: Ride 1bActivisionc2009-12-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aAnyone Can RIDE  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSkateboarding games2wiiext01111na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264001900029300002300048500088100071542002300952655002600975RX6E7804aThe Biggest Loser 1bTHQc2009-10-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Biggest Loser video game is a fun and engaging way for players to get in shape and maintain their ideal fitness. Set at The Biggest Loser ranch, players can take The Biggest Loser challenge and compete in 4, 8 or 12 week programs against former contestants from the television show, or workout with a friend to form a support system to see who really is The Biggest Loser. Players will work-out to a series of structured routines with special weekly challenges, weigh-ins and eliminations, or they can even create their own workouts. Workouts include upper, lower and core body exercises, as well as cardio and yoga exercises. Progress is documented on a calendar that keeps track of in-game achievements, upcoming training and weigh-in dates. Players can also receive credit for any progress made while not playing the video game, such as going for a walk or a bike ride.  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aFitness games2wiiext00390na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002000029300002300049500012100072542002300193655002500216655002700241RX6P7804aThe Biggest Loser 1bTHQc2009-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Biggest Loser video game is a fun and engaging way for players to get in shape and maintain their ideal fitness.  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aCoaching games2wiiext00211na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002000007264002700027300002300054500000500077542003100082RX7JGD00aMeja-Maji March 1bSquare-Enixc2009-4-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kSquare-EnixsGameTDB00294na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002200044300002300066500000500089542002600094655002500120655002700145RX8JA400aJikkyou Powerful Pro Yakyuu Next 1bKonamic2009-3-19  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00601na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003600038300002300074500033000097542003900427655002500466RX9E6900aNeed for Speed: Undercover 1bElectronic Arts Incc2008-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou never thought it would turn out like this-an all-out chase where you’re the hunted. And the hunter. Now you must use all of your experience-and every ounce of skill- to infiltrate and take down a ruthless international crime syndicate, outrun the law, & unlock the truth that puts an end to this chase once and for all.  i2008kElectronic Arts IncsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00605na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003800038300002300076500033000099542004100429655002500470RX9J1300aNeed for Speed: Undercover 1bElectronic Arts Japanc2008-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou never thought it would turn out like this-an all-out chase where you’re the hunted. And the hunter. Now you must use all of your experience-and every ounce of skill- to infiltrate and take down a ruthless international crime syndicate, outrun the law, & unlock the truth that puts an end to this chase once and for all.  i2008kElectronic Arts JapansGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00593na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003200038300002300070500033000093542003500423655002500458RX9K6900aNeed for Speed: Undercover 1bElectronic Artsc2008-12-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou never thought it would turn out like this-an all-out chase where you’re the hunted. And the hunter. Now you must use all of your experience-and every ounce of skill- to infiltrate and take down a ruthless international crime syndicate, outrun the law, & unlock the truth that puts an end to this chase once and for all.  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00593na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003200038300002300070500033000093542003500423655002500458RX9P6900aNeed for Speed: Undercover 1bElectronic Artsc2008-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou never thought it would turn out like this-an all-out chase where you’re the hunted. And the hunter. Now you must use all of your experience-and every ounce of skill- to infiltrate and take down a ruthless international crime syndicate, outrun the law, & unlock the truth that puts an end to this chase once and for all.  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00593na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003200038300002300070500033000093542003500423655002500458RX9X6900aNeed for Speed: Undercover 1bElectronic Artsc2008-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou never thought it would turn out like this-an all-out chase where you’re the hunted. And the hunter. Now you must use all of your experience-and every ounce of skill- to infiltrate and take down a ruthless international crime syndicate, outrun the law, & unlock the truth that puts an end to this chase once and for all.  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00593na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003200038300002300070500033000093542003500423655002500458RX9Y6900aNeed for Speed: Undercover 1bElectronic Artsc2008-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou never thought it would turn out like this-an all-out chase where you’re the hunted. And the hunter. Now you must use all of your experience-and every ounce of skill- to infiltrate and take down a ruthless international crime syndicate, outrun the law, & unlock the truth that puts an end to this chase once and for all.  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00949na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002000038300002300058500067000081542002300751655002500774655002800799RXAE7800aWWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2010 1bTHQc2009-10-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's your show in Smackdown vs. Raw 2010, which delivers realistic WWE action, new features, and unprecedented creative freedom. The Create-A-Superstar design tool has been recharged with new options. Once you've built your fighter, build their arsenal with the Create-A-Finisher tool. The WWE Story Designer lets you put together an entire night at the arena, setting match cards, talent, storylines, creating cutscenes, and more. Travel new Roads to Wreslemania, including the first-ever Divas and Create-A-Superstar storylines. And the WWE training facility helps you get the most out of the 60 playable Superstars and Divas with the first-ever in-game tutorial.  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext01071na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002000038300002300058500079200081542002300873655002500896655002800921RXAP7800aWWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2010 1bTHQc2009-10-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor starters, you can only use Created Superstars 10 times in a given story. Mind you, that's not 10 different Superstars; that's 10 appearances by a given hero. Maybe your one CAS is in five matches and five scenes, but you get just those 10 slots. Toss in a second CAS, and the number begins dropping even faster. Personally, I don't get why this restriction exists because I know how many of you were dying to take your cast of created crazies and insert them into tales all their own -- and I know I was excited to give Gruesome Greggy's BYWF counterparts some limelight -- but it is what it is. It sucks, but it doesn't overshadow how awesome it's going to be to take any of the 67 Superstars/Divas, as well as a handful of NPCs, and put them into plays written and directed by you.  i2009kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00979na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264003300033300002300066500067800089542003800767655002500805655002700830RXBE7000aBackyard Baseball '10 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2009-4-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aBackyard Baseball’10 is the latest and greatest version of the best selling kids’ baseball video game series. Backyard Baseball ’10 is a great way to extend the love of baseball from the outside field to the virtual field. Along with cover player David Ortiz, Backyard Baseball ’10, lets kids play with or alongside other pro players featured as kids from all 30 MLB teams. The game also includes realistic baseball action, outrageous game play, power-ups and all 30 MLB teams plus 6 Backyard Teams. New fields, environments, unlockables, single game, season and multiplayer modes plus custom player and team options makes this the best Backyard Baseball game ever!  i2009kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00536na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002900007264003500036300002300071500018900094542003900283655002500322655002500347655003000372RXCE4Z00aDave Mirra BMX Challenge 1bCrave Entertainmentc2007-10-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aDave Mirra rewrote the rules of what's possible in the BMX world. On the ground or above it, the Miracle Boy has redefined the boundaries of his sport and then promptly surpassed them.  i2007kCrave EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aBike racing games2wiiext00494na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264003500036300002300071500018900094542003900283655002500322655002500347RXCPGT00aDave Mirra BMX Challenge 1bCrave Entertainmentc2007-9-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aDave Mirra rewrote the rules of what's possible in the BMX world. On the ground or above it, the Miracle Boy has redefined the boundaries of his sport and then promptly surpassed them.  i2007kCrave EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00714na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264003500048300002300083500039800106542003800504655002500542655002500567RXDD4Q00aDisney Th!nk: Das Schnelldenker-Quiz 1bDisney Interactivec2008-11-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aTH!NK You’re Fast? TH!NK Again! It’s the ultimate trivia showdown that puts your family to the test. Play as a classic Disney character in a game-show style quiz game hosted by the Genie. Prove your smarts with over 5,000 Disney trivia and general knowledge questions. Show off your speed in the mini-games and fastest-finger game rounds. It’s easy and fun to play for the entire family!  i2008kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00725na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005200007264003500059300002300094500039800117542003800515655002500553655002500578RXDE4Q00aDisney Th!nk Fast: The Ultimate Trivia Showdown 1bDisney Interactivec2008-10-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aTH!NK You’re Fast? TH!NK Again! It’s the ultimate trivia showdown that puts your family to the test. Play as a classic Disney character in a game-show style quiz game hosted by the Genie. Prove your smarts with over 5,000 Disney trivia and general knowledge questions. Show off your speed in the mini-games and fastest-finger game rounds. It’s easy and fun to play for the entire family!  i2008kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00663na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264003500040300002300075500039200098542003800490655002500528RXDJ4Q00aDisney Th!nk: Haya Oshi Quiz 1bDisney Interactivec2008-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aTH!NK You're Fast? TH!NK Again! It's the ultimate trivia showdown that puts your family to the test. Play as a classic Disney character in a game-show style quiz game hosted by the Genie. Prove your smarts with