a1 Wii optical disc  aThe mischievous bunnies are back in a hilarious sequel that is guaranteed to be even crazier and funnier than the first – and with even more wacky games!  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00430na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264003800033300002300071500016000094542004200254655002400296RY2J4100aRabbids Party Returns 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-12-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe mischievous bunnies are back in a hilarious sequel that is guaranteed to be even crazier and funnier than the first – and with even more wacky games!  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00474na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264003800036300002300074500016000097542004200257655002500299655002800324RY2K4100aRayman: Raving Rabbids 2 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2008-4-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe mischievous bunnies are back in a hilarious sequel that is guaranteed to be even crazier and funnier than the first – and with even more wacky games!  i2008kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00431na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264003800035300002300073500016000096542004100256655002400297RY2P4100aRayman Raving Rabbids 2 1bUbisoft Entertainmentc2007-11-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe mischievous bunnies are back in a hilarious sequel that is guaranteed to be even crazier and funnier than the first – and with even more wacky games!  i2007kUbisoft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00432na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264003800036300002300074500016000097542004100257655002400298RY2R4100aRayman: Raving Rabbids 2 1bUbisoft Entertainmentc2007-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe mischievous bunnies are back in a hilarious sequel that is guaranteed to be even crazier and funnier than the first – and with even more wacky games!  i2007kUbisoft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00704na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264003900044300002300083500038500106542004200491655002500533655002400558RY3E4100aRayman: Raving Rabbids: TV Party 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2008-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the rabbids in the wackiest TV party ever! Play over 50 hilarious games to get the rabbids out of your TV - including the first game you can play with your butt on the Wii Balance Board! Monster truck race, surf through space, and dance with those wacky rabbids and up to seven friends in the craziest party game ever. Up to4 players simultaneously and 8 players alternating.  i2008kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00695na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264003800035300002300073500038600096542004200482655002500524655002400549RY3J4100aRabbids Party: TV Party 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2009-1-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the rabbids in the wackiest TV party ever! Play over 50 hilarious games to get the rabbids out of your TV - including the first game you can play with your butt on the Wii Balance Board! Monster truck race, surf through space, and dance with those wacky rabbids and up to seven friends in the craziest party game ever. Up to 4 players simultaneously and 8 players alternating.  i2009kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00704na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264003800044300002300082500038600105542004200491655002500533655002400558RY3K4100aRayman: Raving Rabbids: TV Party 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2009-7-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the Rabbids in the wackiest TV party ever! Play over 50 hilarious games to get the Rabbids out of your TV - Including the first game you can play with your butt on the Wii Balance Board! Monster truck race, surf through space, and dance with those wacky Rabbids and up to seven friends in the craziest party game ever. Up to 4 players simultaneously and 8 players alternating.  i2009kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00702na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264003800043300002300081500038600104542004100490655002500531655002400556RY3P4100aRayman Raving Rabbids: TV Party 1bUbisoft Entertainmentc2008-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the rabbids in the wackiest TV party ever! Play over 50 hilarious games to get the rabbids out of your TV - including the first game you can play with your butt on the Wii Balance Board! Monster truck race, surf through space, and dance with those wacky rabbids and up to seven friends in the craziest party game ever. Up to 4 players simultaneously and 8 players alternating.  i2008kUbisoft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00728na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264002100023300002300044500046500067542002400532655002500556655002500581RY4J8P00aPuyo Puyo 7 1bSegac2009-11-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aPuyo Puyo 7 is the 7th and currently latest game in the main Puyo Puyo series, which is denoted by the 7. A break from the previous Fever series games, the game is set in a world similar to the real world instead of Primp Town. In this game, a new game mode known as Transformation was added as the default mode. Five new characters were introduced, and a few characters from past games in the series were reintroduced, either as playable characters or cameos.  i2009kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00496na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264002600037300002300063500024500086542003000331655002500361RY5E5200aBig League Sports: Summer 1bActivisionc2009-6-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnjoy all of your favorite summers sports at the Pro Center, where Coach will guide you through intense drills to test your athletic skills. Push yourself to the max as you compete against your rivals to become the ultimate Sports Champion!  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00504na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264002600045300002300071500024500094542003000339655002500369RY5P5200aWorld Championship Sports: Summer 1bActivisionc2009-6-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnjoy all of your favorite summers sports at the Pro Center, where Coach will guide you through intense drills to test your athletic skills. Push yourself to the max as you compete against your rivals to become the ultimate Sports Champion!  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext01703na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264002200024300002300046500147300069542002601542655002501568RY6EA400aWalk It Out! 1bKonamic2010-1-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet off the couch and get moving to the beat of over a hundred hot songs! Step to the beat of hot hits like the Black Eyed Peas’s “Boom Boom Pow” and Demi Lovato’s “La La Land” and explore a unique in-game world you create with each step you take! It’s a fun and easy way for the whole family to get their hearts pumping! Experience a revolutionary and unique workout where walking to the beat of great music unlocks an exciting in-game world. Keep movin' to the beat of all your favorite in-game tracks as you extend your workout in bonus minigames. Compatible with the Wii Balance Board and the Wii DanceDanceRevolution Controller, Walk It Out will have you groovin' your way to a healthier you! Uniquely motivational, explore an in-game world where the more you step, the richer your world becomes. Discover new places and goodies every day! The only fitness-focused game that keeps you in the game with great music! Move to the beat of 120 songs, including 20 favorite licensed tracks, including masters performed by the original artists! Hits include: Boom Boom Pow by the Black Eyed Peas, How Do You Sleep? by Jesse McCartney, La La Land by Demi Lovato, and more! Get a visual feel for how well you're doing through charts and graphs that show burned calories, distance traveled, steps taken and more! Play with the peripheral of your choice! Accepts input from the DanceDanceRevolution Wii Controller, Wii Remote and Nunchuk, or Wii Balance Board.  i2010kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00757na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002100007264002200028300002300050500045000073542002600523655002500549655002400574655002500598RY6PA400aStep to the Beat 1bKonamic2010-3-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlayers will have to be continuously moving as they explore Rhythm Island while listening to a variety of licensed music tracks. Konami’s fitness game can be played using the Wii Remote and Nunchuk while walking on the spot, walking on a DanceDanceRevolution dance mat, or on a Wii Balance Board. By moving in a walking motion, you’ll have to keep in rhythm to the beat as you explore the island and accept specific challenges along the way.  i2010kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext01243na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264002600026300002300052500100300075542003101078655002401109RY7PHZ00aNinja Captains 1bNordcurrentc2009-10-  a1 Wii optical disc  aNinja Captains is a hilarious party game about four clumsy ninja cats that accidentally find themselves travelling the world and getting into all sorts of trouble! When their city is attacked by a giant mouse, these four felines have no choice but to do what they do best – save the world. They may look like ordinary animals, but whenever there is trouble, they become Ninja Captains! Armed with the latest in mouse-tracking technology, the ninjas follow faulty directions that lead them straight past the robot and into a plane. Join the Ninja Captains as they visit cities such as London, Sydney and Tokyo in a journey that takes them across every continent. During their mouse hunt, they are called on to perform all kinds of wacky activities including running from bulls in Pamplona, racing gondolas in Venice, and sledding down the icy mountains of Antarctica just to finally find themselves back home in downtown New York where their enemy has been right under their noses the entire time!  i2009kNordcurrentsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00689na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003100007264003700038300002300075500033700098542004000435655002500475655002900500655002600529RY8EFS00aBass Pro Shops: The Strike 1b XS Games / Psyclonec2009-10-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Strike literally puts the fishing rod in players' hands as they head out to their favorite hot spots, including several popular lakes in North America. By combining high-quality, advanced gameplay with an innovative, motion-sensing fishing pole controller, The Strike is quite the catch for gamers and outdoor enthusiasts alike.  i2009k XS Games / PsyclonesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFishing games2wiiext00569na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264003200029300002300061500027800084542003500362655002500397655002500422RY9E6900aFIFA 09: All-Play 1bElectronic Artsc2008-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aStep onto the pitch and play a unique soccer experience exclusively on Wii. Enjoy FIFA Soccer 09 All-Play one of two two ways - a Wii specific take on the classic ‘11 vs. 11’ simulation or over-the-top arcade action with Wii versions of your favorite soccer superstars.  i2008kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00341na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006400007264002800071300002300099500000500122542003100127655002500158655003600183RYAJDA00aYatterman Wii: Bikkuri Dokkiri Machine de Mou Race da Koron 1bTakara Tomyc2008-12-11  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2008kTakara TomysGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aFuturistic racing games2wiiext00828na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002500007264003500032300002300067500049100090542003900581655002500620655002400645655002500669RYBE6900aBoom Blox Bash Party 1bElectronic Arts Incc2009-5-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet ready for even more blox-busting action with BOOM BLOX Bash Party for Wii, the sequel to the critically-acclaimed BOOM BLOX game for Wii. Developed by EA in collaboration with director and producer Steven Spielberg, BOOM BLOX Bash Party takes destruction to new heights, providing the ultimate social gaming experience! BOOM BLOX Bash Party will get your party started with new Versus, Co-Op and Team Play challenges - twice as many multiplayer challenges as the original BOOM BLOX.  i2009kElectronic Arts IncsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00820na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002500007264003100032300002300063500049100086542003500577655002500612655002400637655002500661RYBP6900aBoom Blox Bash Party 1bElectronic Artsc2009-5-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet ready for even more blox-busting action with BOOM BLOX Bash Party for Wii, the sequel to the critically-acclaimed BOOM BLOX game for Wii. Developed by EA in collaboration with director and producer Steven Spielberg, BOOM BLOX Bash Party takes destruction to new heights, providing the ultimate social gaming experience! BOOM BLOX Bash Party will get your party started with new Versus, Co-Op and Team Play challenges - twice as many multiplayer challenges as the original BOOM BLOX.  i2009kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00610na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264003500035300002300070500034000093542003800433655002900471RYDELT00aPet Pals: Animal Doctor 1bLegacy Interactivec2008-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou are the animal doctor at a busy veterinarian clinic and will need nurse all the animals back to health! The unique Wii Remote simulates real veterinary tools as you use them to treat 30 different cases, ranging from minor cases like sunburn, lacerations and infections to more serious problems like diabetes, tumors and snakebites.  i2008kLegacy InteractivesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00737na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264003300035300002300068500042800091542003700519655002900556655003000585RYDP6V00aPet Pals: Animal Doctor 1bJoWood Produtionsc2009-3-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aPet Pals: Animal Doctor is now available for the Wii!For the first time, players of all ages can bring the operating table right into their living room and enjoy a one of a kind gamin experience. The unique Wii controller simulates real veterinary tools as you use them to treat 30 different cases, ranging from minor cases like sunburn to more serious problems like tumors. Step in and have fun healing your favorite pets!  i2009kJoWood ProdutionssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00299na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264002200034300002300056500006100079542002500140655002400165RYEEEB00a101-in-1 Party Megamix 1bAtlusc2009-10-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a101 easy to play, hard to master games on a single disc!  i2009kAtlussGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00886na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264002800038300002300066500063200089542003100721655002400752RYEPHZ00a101-in-1 Party Megamix Wii 1bNordcurrentc2009-11-12  a1 Wii optical disc  a101-in-1: Party Megamix Wii is a collection of 101 games offering a healthy serving of adventure, action and puzzle gameplay galore that is fun for the whole family. Come channel surfin’ through 8 different TV stations and play through a series of zany TV shows tailored to all sorts of themes, each packed to the brim with insane adventures and delightful challenges! Featuring 101 games that take you from the depths of the ocean to the Wild West… From the Stone Age to space racing… 101-in-1: Party Megamix Wii boasts a unique visual style, a wide variety of unlockable games and prizes, and superb multiplayer action.  i2009kNordcurrentsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00640na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264002000038300002300058500039900081542002500480655002500505RYGE9B00aRygar: The Battle of Argus 1bTecmoc2009-2-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your “Diskarmor” and swing into action on the Wii as the legendary warrior, Rygar! Immerse yourself in Greco-Roman mythology as you journey through the sundered Island of Argus. Intuitive use of the Wii Remote allows you to deftly and effectively control the use of the powerful Diskarmor to destroy enemies and maneuver on, around, over, and under obstacles to save Princess Harmonia!  i2009kTecmosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00690na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500039900087542002500486655002700511655003000538RYGJ9B00aArgos no Senshi: Muscle Impact 1bTecmoc2008-12-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your “Diskarmor” and swing into action on the Wii as the legendary warrior, Rygar! Immerse yourself in Greco-Roman mythology as you journey through the sundered Island of Argus. Intuitive use of the Wii Remote allows you to deftly and effectively control the use of the powerful Diskarmor to destroy enemies and maneuver on, around, over, and under obstacles to save Princess Harmonia!  i2008kTecmosGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00702na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264003200038300002300070500039700093542003700490655002500527655002800552RYGP9900aRygar: The Battle of Argus 1bRising Star Gamesc2009-7-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your "Diskarmor" and swing into action on the WiiTM as the legendary warrior, Rygar! Immerse yourself in Greco-Roman mythology as you journey through the sundered Island of Argus. Intuitive use of the Wii Remote allows you to deftly and effectively control the use of the powerful Diskarmor to destroy enemies and maneuver on, around, over, and under obstacles to save Princess Harmonia!  i2009kRising Star GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00404na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264003800034300002300072500013200095542004200227655002500269RYHES500aRoogoo: Twisted Towers 1bSouth Peak Interactivec2009-4-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aHarness the power of falling meteors and restore the Planet Roo to its former glory in shape-shifting DS puzzler Roogoo Attack!  i2009kSouth Peak InteractivesGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00449na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001000007264002100017300002300038500018800061542002500249655002500274655002800299RYIE9B00aSPRay 1bTecmoc2008-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aMake a Mess! Play as young prince Ray and use your two helpful spirits to spray slime, water, vomit, and ice on enemies and surfaces! Wipe out evil, save the village, and be the hero!  i2008kTecmosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00475na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001000007264003400017300002300051500018800074542003800262655002500300655002800325RYIPNK00aSPRay 1bNeko Entertainmentc2008-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aMake a Mess! Play as young prince Ray and use your two helpful spirits to spray slime, water, vomit, and ice on enemies and surfaces! Wipe out evil, save the village, and be the hero!  i2008kNeko EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00222na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004300007264002000050300002300070500000500093542002600098RYJPTV00aPrincess Lillifee: The Big Fairy Party 1bTivolac2010-8-  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kTivolasGameTDB01088na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002300007264004600030300002300076500072300099542005100822655002500873655002500898655003100923RYKEAF00aWe Ski & Snowboard 1bNAMCO BANDAI Games America Inc.c2009-3-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aWe Ski & Snowboard is the newest and most advanced snowboarding and skiing game. Perfect for experts or beginners, this latest installment in the hit snow series includes advanced tricks, fun gameplay, more than four miles of riding across two huge mountains, and an open environment with incredible scenery and diverse terrains. Up to 4 players can go head-to-head in boarder-X and slalom runs, or go big in an all-new fun park complete with a huge snow pipe, tons of rails and trick obstacles. You can perform jumps and tricks at any time and relive the moment with instant replay! Grab your Wii Balance Board because you can ride with that too. We Ski & Snowboard let’s you shred the mountain, by board or by ski!  i2009kNAMCO BANDAI Games America Inc.sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSkiing games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00527na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003800007264002200045300002300067500019700090542002500287655002500312655002500337655003100362RYKJAF00aFamily Ski: World Ski & Snowboard 1bNamcoc2008-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aFresh powder, miles of pristine slopes and unstoppable winter fun drift onto Wii in this exciting, fun and feature-packed snowboarding and skiing sequel to the critically acclaimed Family Ski.  i2008kNamcosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSkiing games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00530na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264002900034300002300063500019700086542003200283655002500315655002500340655003100365RYKK0100aFamily Ski & Snowboard 1bNAMCO BANDAIc2015-12-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aFresh powder, miles of pristine slopes and unstoppable winter fun drift onto Wii in this exciting, fun and feature-packed snowboarding and skiing sequel to the critically acclaimed Family Ski.  i2015kNAMCO BANDAIsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSkiing games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00531na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264002900034300002300063500019700086542003300283655002500316655002500341655003100366RYKPAF00aFamily Ski & Snowboard 1bNamco Bandaïc2009-2-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aFresh powder, miles of pristine slopes and