them with “instant beauty” or curse them with an “epic fail.” But use these powers wisely, because they may have unexpected results!  i2010kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aLife simulation games2wiiext01020na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004400007264003400051300002300085500069900108542003800807655002500845655002800870S3PE4Q00aDisney Princess: My Fairytale Adventure 1bDisney Interactivec2012-9-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Fairy Godmother needs your help! Weave your own magical Fairytale Adventure in this game where you'll help save your favorite Disney Princesses. Train as the Fairy Godmother's apprentice and learn the magic you need to break a spell that's fallen over kingdoms of Belle, Cinderella, Tiana, Ariel, and Rapunzel. Explore locations from the Princesses' movies and interact with them and other favorite Disney characters. Customize your character and your room in the Fairy Godmother's castle, then use the Wii motion controls to wave your magic wand in fun and enchanted mini-games. You'll earn gems that you can trade for special items to use as you explore the five magical fairytale worlds.  i2012kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01020na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004400007264003400051300002300085500069900108542003800807655002500845655002800870S3PP4Q00aDisney Princess: My Fairytale Adventure 1bDisney Interactivec2012-10-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Fairy Godmother needs your help! Weave your own magical Fairytale Adventure in this game where you'll help save your favorite Disney Princesses. Train as the Fairy Godmother's apprentice and learn the magic you need to break a spell that's fallen over kingdoms of Belle, Cinderella, Tiana, Ariel, and Rapunzel. Explore locations from the Princesses' movies and interact with them and other favorite Disney characters. Customize your character and your room in the Fairy Godmother's castle, then use the Wii motion controls to wave your magic wand in fun and enchanted mini-games. You'll earn gems that you can trade for special items to use as you explore the five magical fairytale worlds.  i2012kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01020na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004400007264003400051300002300085500069900108542003800807655002500845655002800870S3PX4Q00aDisney Princess: My Fairytale Adventure 1bDisney Interactivec2012-10-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Fairy Godmother needs your help! Weave your own magical Fairytale Adventure in this game where you'll help save your favorite Disney Princesses. Train as the Fairy Godmother's apprentice and learn the magic you need to break a spell that's fallen over kingdoms of Belle, Cinderella, Tiana, Ariel, and Rapunzel. Explore locations from the Princesses' movies and interact with them and other favorite Disney characters. Customize your character and your room in the Fairy Godmother's castle, then use the Wii motion controls to wave your magic wand in fun and enchanted mini-games. You'll earn gems that you can trade for special items to use as you explore the five magical fairytale worlds.  i2012kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00530na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264002500025300002300050500029100073542002900364655002700393S3RJMS00aTwinkle Queen 1bMilestonec2010-8-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe prettiest ladies from famous PC games have gathered in Milestone to participate in the Twinkle Queen Tournament. No matter what type they are, aggressive go-getter or the laid back tea drinker, they are going to give their all to win the prize and the power to realize their dreams.  i2010kMilestonesGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00332na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006700007264002700074300002300101500000500124542003100129655002400160655002600184S3SJ1800aKaraoke Joysound Wii Super DX: Hitori de Minna de Utai Houdai! 1bHudson Softc2010-12-9  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00302na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005100007264002100058300002300079500000500102542002500107655002400132655002400156S3TJAF00aTaiko no Tatsujin Wii: Minna de Party 3-daime! 1bNamcoc2010-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kNamcosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00738na  a2200157   4500001000700000245004500007264002700052300002300079500031600102542003200418655002500450655002400475655002500499655002500524655003100549S3WEG900aFamily Party: 30 Great Games: Winter Fun 1bD3 Publisherc2010-2-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe greatest value in family entertainment returns for the third time.  Family Party: 30 Great Games Winter Fun has 30 brand new games with a winter theme, offering hours of extreme winter sports competition and snow play for up to 4 players.  Indulge in winter wonderland surroundings from the comfort of home.  i2010kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aHockey games2wiiext 7aSkiing games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00620na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004500007264002800052300002300080500031400103542003200417655002500449655002400474S3WPG900aFamily Party: 30 Great Games: Winter Fun 1bD3 Publisherc2010-2-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe greatest value in family entertainment returns for the third time. Family Party: 30 Great Games Winter Fun has 30 brand new games with a winter theme, offering hours of extreme winter sports competition and snow play for up to 4 players. Indulge in winter wonderland surroundings from the comfort of home.  i2010kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext01036na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001200007264002000019300002300039500073700062542002300799655002500822655002700847655002800874S3XE7800aWWE '13 1bTHQc2012-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is a revolution. But the king doesn't wear a crown. He wears a belt. Gut your way to the top of the WWE in this 2013 edition that's overflowing with attitude. Turn your living room into a rocking WWE Live showdown with enhanced presentation that brings better commentary, amped-up sound effects, more hyped-up fans, and jaw-dropping Spectacular Moments. Relive a WWE golden age, when Stone Cold Steve Austin, The Rock, and Degeneration X battled to win the Monday Night Wars of the Attitude Era. Shape your character's destiny and the destiny of the WWE itself in WWE Universe 3.0. Enhancements to the powerful Predator Technology game engine deliver smoother animations and the best wrestling action outside the square circle.  i2012kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext01051na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001200007264001900019300002300038500071100061542002300772655002500795655002700820655002800847655003000875S3XP7800aWWE '13 1bTHQc2012-11-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aWWE '13 will feature the franchise's industry-defining Creation Suite, enabling players to develop and customize Superstars, entrances, arenas, finishing moves, storylines, highlight reels and more, as well as share and download creations with others from around the world. Furthermore, they will compete with a vast array of WWE Superstars and "Attitude Era" luminaries from the largest roster in franchise history, including cover Superstar CM Punk, Stone Cold Steve Austin, Sheamus, Undertaker, Mankind, Chris Jericho, Big Show and Mark Henry. Along with to-be-announced features, a comprehensive roster reveal, downloadable content and big surprises, WWE '13 is poised to live a revolution all its own.  i2012kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext00933na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002600029300002300055500065200078542003000730655002500760655002600785S3ZE5200aMIB: Alien Crisis 1bActivisionc2012-5-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Men In Black: Alien Crisis, players take on the role as Peter Delacoeur, a MIB Agent in training, assigned to unearth enemy aliens who are planning to destroy planet Earth. With hidden surveillance and stealthy guards on the prowl, players must ambush confidential alien intelligence and stop all alien attacks. Men In Black: Alien Crisis brings exciting, realistic MIB Agent movements as players shoot, and dodge their way through action-packed levels to escape fierce alien assaults. Additionally, all platforms feature two-player split-screen gameplay and four-person "hot-seat" competitive action for awesome friends and family involvement.  i2012kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00933na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002600029300002300055500065200078542003000730655002500760655002600785S3ZP5200aMIB: Alien Crisis 1bActivisionc2012-5-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Men In Black: Alien Crisis, players take on the role as Peter Delacoeur, a MIB Agent in training, assigned to unearth enemy aliens who are planning to destroy planet Earth. With hidden surveillance and stealthy guards on the prowl, players must ambush confidential alien intelligence and stop all alien attacks. Men In Black: Alien Crisis brings exciting, realistic MIB Agent movements as players shoot, and dodge their way through action-packed levels to escape fierce alien assaults. Additionally, all platforms feature two-player split-screen gameplay and four-person "hot-seat" competitive action for awesome friends and family involvement.  i2012kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00321na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005600007264002600063300002300089500000500112542003100117655003100148655002000179S4MJGD00aDragon Quest X: Mezameshi Itsutsu no Shuzoku Online 1bSquare-Enixc2012-8-2  a1 Wii optical disc