00172S5KJAF00aTaiko no Tatsujin Wii: Chou Goukaban 1bNamcoc2012-11-29  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2012kNamcosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00711na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264002700045300002300072500044300095542003200538655003100570S5MEVZ00aMonster High: New Ghoul in School 1bLittle Orbitc2015-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aRoam the halls of Monster High in full 3D, and for the first time experience a ghoul’s life with Monster High: New Ghoul In School! Join the student body and begin your education as the newest ghoul in school. Juggle your life as the new ghoul and build relationships with your classmates. Compete to become the leader of the Fearleading Squad or Student Council President in fast-paced mini-games. Be Yourself. Be Unique. Be a Monster.  i2015kLittle OrbitsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00713na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264002900045300002300074500044300097542003200540655003100572S5MPVZ00aMonster High: New Ghoul in School 1bLittle Orbitc2015-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aRoam the halls of Monster High in full 3D, and for the first time experience a ghoul’s life with Monster High: New Ghoul In School! Join the student body and begin your education as the newest ghoul in school. Juggle your life as the new ghoul and build relationships with your classmates. Compete to become the leader of the Fearleading Squad or Student Council President in fast-paced mini-games. Be Yourself. Be Unique. Be a Monster.  i2015kLittle OrbitsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00621na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003600038300002300074500034900097542004000446655002500486S5PPAU00aPSA World Tour Squash 2015 1bAlternative Softwarec2015-6-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aBring the intensity and feeling of a real squash game into your living room. With a unique control system and a variety of game modes, PSA World Tour Squash offers a challenge for both squash fans, and new players alike. Test your reactions against the worlds best and travel the world on a number of courts set in a number of iconic locations!  i2015kAlternative SoftwaresGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00691na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003200007264002000039300002300059500036400082542002400446655002700470655003000497655003000527S5QJC800aSengoku Musou 3: Moushouden 1bKoeic2011-2-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aSamurai Warriors 3 offers two-player online and offline co-op with enhanced sharing features. The game also uses a special new game mode that offers players unique control of characters never seen before. This game mode is based on the Famicom game Nazo no Murasamejo (The Mysterious Murasame Castle) inspired by Nintendo video game designer Shigeru Miyamoto.  i2011kKoeisGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aHistoric settings2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00454na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264003200022300002300054500016300077542003600240655002500276655003100301S5RESZ00aRam Racing 1bStorm City Gamesc2011-12-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aNothing says "power" and "performance" like the legendary Ram brand. Now, you can climb behind the wheel of this iconic American truck and put it to the test!  i2011kStorm City GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aTruck racing games2wiiext00594na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002800022300002300050500031100073542003200384655002500416655003100441S5RPNJ00aRam Racing 1bEnjoy Gamingc2012-4-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aNothing says “power” and “performance” like the legendary Ram brand. Now, you can climb behind the wheel of this iconic American truck and put it to the test! Choose from numerous exciting models, buckle in, rev the engine, and test the limits of this multiple “Truck of the Year” award winner.  i2012kEnjoy GamingsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aTruck racing games2wiiext00297na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002400044300002300068500000500091542002700096655002500123655002700148S5SJHF00aInazuma Eleven Go: Strikers 2013 1bLevel-5c2012-12-20  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2012kLevel-5sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00987na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002900029300002300058500069900081542003200780655002500812655002800837S5TEG900aBen 10: Omniverse 1bD3 Publisherc2012-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe past is coming back to haunt the present in this action-packed time-twisting brawler based on the hit Ben 10 TV series! Use new powers and play as one of 16 total characters as you pound enemies and solve puzzles from the past to fix problems in the present (and the other way around!). Play as Teen Ben and Young Ben for the first time in a story that spans two time periods! Use the power of Ben's new Omnitrix to summon 13 playable alien heroes, including classic forms like Heatblast and XLR8 and new additions Bloxx and Gravattack. Battle through a rough-and-tumble single-player story or have a friend play as Ben's partner Rook (and use his high-tech Proto-Tool) in two-player co-op.  i2012kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00527na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002800029300002300057500024100080542003100321655002500352655002800377S5TPAF00aBen 10: Omniverse 1bD3Publisherc2012-11-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aBen 10: Omniverse is the only video game based on the highly-anticipated, Cartoon Network TV series, Ben 10: Omniverse. The brand-new show spans two time periods between Young and Teen Ben Tennyson, and introduces a hero sidekick, Rook.  i2012kD3PublishersGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00706na  a2200157   4500001000700000245003300007264002600040300002300066500030100089542002900390655002500419655002400444655002600468655002500494655002900519S5WE2000aAround the World in 50 Games 1bZoo Gamesc2010-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake a trip Around the World with 50 fun and exciting games! With 5 adventurous levels, the fun never ends! Travel to exotic locations like Camelot Jazz, Back Country, B.C. Rock, Monster Mashers and Spaced Opera as you try your hand at 50 fun-filled games that will keep you coming back for more.  i2010kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aCricket games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext 7aVolleyball games2wiiext00932na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001000007264004200017300002300059500062900082542004600711655002500757655002800782S6BE4Q00aBrave 1bDisney Interactive Studiosc2012-6-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aSummon the courage to fight fate and change your destiny in this game based on the Disney/Pixar film. Bravely battle to lift a magical curse as you follow the story from the movie or go beyond in storylines sprung from Scottish mythology. Use the Wii motion controls to run, jump, climb, and fight across the rugged Scottish landscape. Play as Merida in single-player or have a friend join as a Will 'o the Wisp in co-op play. Fearlessly face enemies with your sword or bow and arrow. Switch to other characters from the film and use their skills to overcome specific challenges as you uncover mysteries and break the curse.  i2012kDisney Interactive StudiossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00932na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001000007264004200017300002300059500062900082542004600711655002500757655002800782S6BP4Q00aBrave 1bDisney Interactive Studiosc2012-7-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aSummon the courage to fight fate and change your destiny in this game based on the Disney/Pixar film. Bravely battle to lift a magical curse as you follow the story from the movie or go beyond in storylines sprung from Scottish mythology. Use the Wii motion controls to run, jump, climb, and fight across the rugged Scottish landscape. Play as Merida in single-player or have a friend join as a Will 'o the Wisp in co-op play. Fearlessly face enemies with your sword or bow and arrow. Switch to other characters from the film and use their skills to overcome specific challenges as you uncover mysteries and break the curse.  i2012kDisney Interactive StudiossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00916na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001000007264003400017300002300051500062900074542003800703655002500741655002800766S6BX4Q00aBrave 1bDisney Interactivec2012-7-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aSummon the courage to fight fate and change your destiny in this game based on the Disney/Pixar film. Bravely battle to lift a magical curse as you follow the story from the movie or go beyond in storylines sprung from Scottish mythology. Use the Wii motion controls to run, jump, climb, and fight across the rugged Scottish landscape. Play as Merida in single-player or have a friend join as a Will 'o the Wisp in co-op play. Fearlessly face enemies with your sword or bow and arrow. Switch to other characters from the film and use their skills to overcome specific challenges as you uncover mysteries and break the curse.  i2012kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00916na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001000007264003400017300002300051500062900074542003800703655002500741655002800766S6BY4Q00aBrave 1bDisney Interactivec2012-8-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aSummon the courage to fight fate and change your destiny in this game based on the Disney/Pixar film. Bravely battle to lift a magical curse as you follow the story from the movie or go beyond in storylines sprung from Scottish mythology. Use the Wii motion controls to run, jump, climb, and fight across the rugged Scottish landscape. Play as Merida in single-player or have a friend join as a Will 'o the Wisp in co-op play. Fearlessly face enemies with your sword or bow and arrow. Switch to other characters from the film and use their skills to overcome specific challenges as you uncover mysteries and break the curse.  i2012kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00888na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004300007264001900050300002300069500063700092542002300729655002600752S6IE7800aDisney Princess: Enchanting Storybooks 1bTHQc2011-11-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThey may be filled with magic, but none of these stories would be a fairy tale without a fairy! Bring color back to a black-and-white world that's lost all of its fairy-tale magic in this enchanted artistic adventure. Play as a new Disney fairy, Opal, the sprite who uses magic to put the color in kingdoms throughout the world of Disney. But something went wrong with her spell, and she needs your help! Use your uDraw tablet to paint by numbers, play painting games, and color-in pages of story books while you hear the stories aloud. You'll help princesses like Belle, Ariel, Jasmine, Tiana, and Rapunzel live happily ever after.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aDrawing games2wiiext00889na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004300007264002000050300002300070500063700093542002300730655002600753S6IP7800aDisney Princess: Enchanting Storybooks 1bTHQc2011-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThey may be filled with magic, but none of these stories would be a fairy tale without a fairy! Bring color back to a black-and-white world that's lost all of its fairy-tale magic in this enchanted artistic adventure. Play as a new Disney fairy, Opal, the sprite who uses magic to put the color in kingdoms throughout the world of Disney. But something went wrong with her spell, and she needs your help! Use your uDraw tablet to paint by numbers, play painting games, and color-in pages of story books while you hear the stories aloud. You'll help princesses like Belle, Ariel, Jasmine, Tiana, and Rapunzel live happily ever after.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aDrawing games2wiiext00905na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002700026300002300053500062400076542003000700655002500730655002800755S6RE5200aWreck-It Ralph 1bActivisionc2012-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe video game villain who wants to do good gets another chance to be a hero in this Wreck-it Ralph game based on the movie that's based on a (made up) game! And, it's your chance to join Wreck-It Ralph on a new adventure to save the arcade he calls home! Go on a game-hopping journey with the hulking 643-lb. “bad guy” and his buddy Felix, the courageous main character from “Hero Duty.” Switch between characters on the fly to bash through obstacles as Ralph or fix 'em using Felix's hammer. Visit four fictional video game worlds from the film as you battle a new army of Cy-bugs, collect trophies, and more.  i2012kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00910na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001900007264002700026300002300053500059000076542003000666655002500696655002800721655002700749S6RP5200aWreck-It Ralph 1bActivisionc2012-11-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs a story extension to the highly anticipated upcoming blockbuster film of the same name from Walt Disney Animation Studios, the Wreck-It Ralph video game is set to inspire a whole new generation of young gamers as a classic, arcade-style side scroller featuring Ralph - the misunderstood villain of his own arcade game who sets out to prove he can be a hero too. Debuting this fall tied to the movie release, Wreck-It Ralph will bring all the fun from the big screen right into the living room for the Wii system from Nintendo, and the Nintendo 3DS and Nintendo DS hand-held systems.  i2012kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00229na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003900007264002600046300002300072500000500095542003100100S6TJGD00aDragon Quest X: All in One Package 1bSquare-Enixc2014-8-7  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kSquare-EnixsGameTDB00979na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004600007264002400053300002300077500063900100542002800739655002500767655002800792655002500820S72E0100aKirby's Dream Collection: Special Edition 1bNintendoc2012-9-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aKirby's Dream Collection: Special Edition is an all-in-one Kirby gameplay experience. The collection combines six classic Kirby favorites and adds a variety of new stages and challenges, plus multiplayer for the first time in some of the titles. Celebrate the 20th edition of Nintendo's beloved franchise with an experience that spans Kirby's evolution from the original NES all the way to the Wii. Play Kirby's Dream Land, Kirby's Adventure, Kirby's Dream Land 2, Kirby Super Star, Kirby's Dream Land 3, Kirby 64: The Crystal Shards, and top it off with bonus challenges styled after the levels made for Kirby's Return to Dream Land.  i2012kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00463na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005000007264002400057300002300081500015700104542002800261655002500289655002700314S72J0100aHoshi no Kirby: 20 Shuunen Special Collection 1bNintendoc2012-7-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aCelebrating the 20th Anniversary of Nintendo's pink puffball, this Kirby package brings together several of the best games in the series all in one box.  i2012kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00539na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264003200028300002300060500028700083542003500370655002400405S75E6900aMonopoly Streets 1bElectronic Artsc2010-10-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aTo celebrate its 75th anniversary, the world of Monopoly comes to life through a living, breathing city that you can build, own, and monopolize. MONOPOLY STREETS has everything you love about the board game, presented as a street level tour of Mr. Monopoly’s fully animated world.  i2010kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aBoard games2wiiext00538na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264003100028300002300059500028700082542003500369655002400404S75P6900aMonopoly Streets 1bElectronic Artsc2010-11-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aTo celebrate its 75th anniversary, the world of Monopoly comes to life through a living, breathing city that you can build, own, and monopolize. MONOPOLY STREETS has everything you love about the board game, presented as a street level tour of Mr. Monopoly’s fully animated world.  i2010kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aBoard games2wiiext00843na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264005900042300002300101500052100124542006300645655002500708S7AEWR00aLEGO Batman 2: DC Super Heroes 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2012-6-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aHeroes from the DC Universe join up with the Caped Crusader to root out evil in LEGO Batman 2: Super Heroes. The Dynamic Duo of Batman and Robin join other famous super heroes from the DC Universe including Superman, Wonder Woman and Green Lantern to save Gotham City from destruction at the hands of the notorious villains Lex Luthor and the Joker. Batman fans of all ages will enjoy a new and original story filled with classic LEGO videogame action and humor as players fight to put the villains back behind bars.  i2012kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00233na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003500007264003000042300002300072500000500095542003500100S7AKZA00aLEGO Batman 2: DC Super Heroes 1bWBA Interactivec2013-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2013kWBA InteractivesGameTDB00938na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264005900042300002300101500057600124542006300700655002500763655002800788S7APWR00aLEGO Batman 2: DC Super Heroes 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2012-6-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aBatman and Robin return in LEGO Batman 2: DC Super Heroes, the highly-anticipated sequel to the best-selling LEGO videogame of all time, which to date has sold morethan 11 million units worldwide. This time the Dynamic Duo join forces with other famous DC super heroes including Superman, Wonder Woman and Green Lantern to stop the notorious villains Lex Luthor and The Joker from destroying Gotham City. Batman fans of all ages will enjoy a new and original story filled with classic LEGO videogame action and humor as players fight to put the bad guys back behind bars.  i2012kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00917na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264003100044300002300075500061300098542003500711655002400746655002500770S7BE6900aTrivial Pursuit: Bet You Know It 1bElectronic Artsc2011-11-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aHow well do you know what your friends know? Find out in this twist on Trivial Pursuit where you'll bet on whether or not your friends know the answer. Answer thousands of new trivia questions in categories geared for light-hearted fun everyone can enjoy together. Test your knowledge of slang, video games, jingles, '80s music and movies, and more. The new format means everyone plays on every turn, because you're always trying to figure out who knows the answer. You can even steal wedges from other players and fill your pie extra-fast! Bet You Know It also includes a version of classic Trivial Pursuit.  i2011kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aBoard games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00953na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003700007264003100044300002300075500061300098542003500711655002400746655002400770655002500794S7BP6900aTrivial Pursuit: Bet You Know It 1bElectronic Artsc2011-11-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aHow well do you know what your friends know? Find out in this twist on Trivial Pursuit where you'll bet on whether or not your friends know the answer. Answer thousands of new trivia questions in categories geared for light-hearted fun everyone can enjoy together. Test your knowledge of slang, video games, jingles, '80s music and movies, and more. The new format means everyone plays on every turn, because you're always trying to figure out who knows the answer. You can even steal wedges from other players and fill your pie extra-fast! Bet You Know It also includes a version of classic Trivial Pursuit.  i2011kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00562na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264003400045300002300079500028500102542003800387655002700425S7CJAF00aKamen Rider: Climax Heroes Fourze 1bNamco Bandai Gamesc2011-12-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe riders have been protecting world peace in the last 40 years, now's the moment to see who's the strongest, and which duo can deal the most destructive damages. Riders throughout the decades meet in the Climax Heroes Fourze, even the newest hero in the series join in the fray.  i2011kNamco Bandai GamessGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00878na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002700033300002300060500059300083542003000676655002500706655002500731S7DE5200aAngry Birds Star Wars 1bActivisionc2013-10-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aMay the birds be with you! The Angry Birds adventure set in a galaxy far, far away makes the jump to hyperspace and comes out on consoles! The megapopular mobile game lands on Wii with over 20 new levels created just for this big-screen experience. Play through the Star Wars universe, Angry Birds-style, as you wield your lightsaber, use the Force, and blast Pigtroopers. Become a true Jedi Master as you journey from the sands of Tatooine to the Pig Star in over 25 hours of addictive Angry Birds play. Join friends in all-new multiplayer modes featuring co-op and head-to-head options.  i2013kActivisionsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00877na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002600033300002300059500059300082542003000675655002500705655002500730S7DP5200aAngry Birds Star Wars 1bActivisionc2013-11-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMay the birds be with you! The Angry Birds adventure set in a galaxy far, far away makes the jump to hyperspace and comes out on consoles! The megapopular mobile game lands on Wii with over 20 new levels created just for this big-screen experience. Play through the Star Wars universe, Angry Birds-style, as you wield your lightsaber, use the Force, and blast Pigtroopers. Become a true Jedi Master as you journey from the sands of Tatooine to the Pig Star in over 25 hours of addictive Angry Birds play. Join friends in all-new multiplayer modes featuring co-op and head-to-head options.  i2013kActivisionsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00489na  a2200145   4500001000700000245004200007264002700049300002300076500010900099542003000208655002500238655002800263655002700291655002500318S7EE5200aTransformers: Ultimate Battle Edition 1bActivisionc2013-10-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aOne box, two Transformers games - Transformers: Cybertron Adventures and Transformers: Dark of the Moon.  i2013kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00489na  a2200145   4500001000700000245004200007264002700049300002300076500010900099542003000208655002500238655002800263655002700291655002500318S7EP5200aTransformers: Ultimate Battle Edition 1bActivisionc2013-11-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aOne box, two Transformers games - Transformers: Cybertron Adventures and Transformers: Dark of the Moon.  i2013kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00801na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002400022300002300046500053500069542002700604655002400631655002400655S7FE5G00aZumba Kids 1bMajescoc2013-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aNow kids can get moving and express themselves with the Zumba Kids game from the brand that pioneered "exercise in disguise." The first extension of the best selling video game franchise, Zumba Kids is custom designed for kids aged 7 12 with fun routines, energizing music, engaging mini games and creative modes that encourage the entire family to join the party. Kids build self confidence and have a blast as they discover new rhythms in an interactive experience that makes them (and their parents) feel good as they stay fit.  i2013kMajescosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00426na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001500007264002600022300002300048500011800071542002900189655002400218655002400242655002600266S7FPGT00aZumba Kids 1b505 Gamesc2013-12-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first video game based on the Zumba dance-fitness program designed specifically for kids aged 7-12 years old.  i2013k505 GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aFitness games2wiiext00339na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003700007264002800044300002300072500000500095542003100100655002400131655002400155655002600179S7JPKM00aLet's Sing 6: Versión Española 1bDeep Silverc2013-12-17  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2013kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00577na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002700027300002300054500029700077542003100374655002400405655002600429S7KPKM00aLet's Sing 2014 1bDeep Silverc2013-11-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe party has just begun! Connect up to 4 microphones and sing with or compete with friends in multiple game modes: Solo, Duet, Mourning and Cooperative. Players can joke using voice effects in real time, such as automatic tuning, and play your best times to analyze how was your performance.  i2013kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00294na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002600037300002300063500000500086542003100091655002400122655002600146S7LPKM00aLet's Sing @ Radio Italia 1bDeep Silverc2015-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2015kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00473na  a2200157   4500001000700000245002600007264003800033300002300071500005400094542004200148655002500190655002800215655002400243655002400267655002400291S7SP4104aThe Smurfs Party Pack 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2014-5-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aContains The Smurfs Dance Party and The Smurfs 2!  i2014kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00952na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264003400048300002300082500064000105542003700745655002400782655002400806SA3E5G00aAlvin and the Chipmunks: Chipwrecked 1bMajesco Sales Incc2011-11-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience stardom on stage in this game based on the story you see on screen in Alvin and the Chipmunks: Chipwrecked! Play as all six superstars from the Chipmunks and The Chipettes: Alvin, Simon, Theodore, Brittany, Jeanette, or Eleanor, and belt out 30 of their greatest hits. Learn 50 dance moves and earn points based on how well you perform them. Perform for your adoring fans in a single-player storyline based on the film and full of fun cut scenes. Have a two-player dance party in Co-op Mode, go straight to your favorite song in Freestyle mode, and pull of show-stopping finishing moves with help from your Munk Power meter.  i2011kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00951na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264003300048300002300081500064000104542003700744655002400781655002400805SA3P5G00aAlvin and the Chipmunks: Chipwrecked 1bMajesco Sales Incc2012-4-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience stardom on stage in this game based on the story you see on screen in Alvin and the Chipmunks: Chipwrecked! Play as all six superstars from the Chipmunks and The Chipettes: Alvin, Simon, Theodore, Brittany, Jeanette, or Eleanor, and belt out 30 of their greatest hits. Learn 50 dance moves and earn points based on how well you perform them. Perform for your adoring fans in a single-player storyline based on the film and full of fun cut scenes. Have a two-player dance party in Co-op Mode, go straight to your favorite song in Freestyle mode, and pull of show-stopping finishing moves with help from your Munk Power meter.  i2012kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00935na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264002500048300002300073500064000096542002900736655002400765655002400789SA3XGT00aAlvin and the Chipmunks: Chipwrecked 1b505 Gamesc2012-4-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience stardom on stage in this game based on the story you see on screen in Alvin and the Chipmunks: Chipwrecked! Play as all six superstars from the Chipmunks and The Chipettes: Alvin, Simon, Theodore, Brittany, Jeanette, or Eleanor, and belt out 30 of their greatest hits. Learn 50 dance moves and earn points based on how well you perform them. Perform for your adoring fans in a single-player storyline based on the film and full of fun cut scenes. Have a two-player dance party in Co-op Mode, go straight to your favorite song in Freestyle mode, and pull of show-stopping finishing moves with help from your Munk Power meter.  i2012k505 GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00891na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005300007264001900060300002300079500059200102542002300694655002700717655002500744SA5E7800aAre You Smarter than a 5th Grader Back to School 1bTHQc2010-11-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aWith a new school year comes another chance to prove you belong at the head of the class, or at least that you are smarter than a fifth grader! Play the hit show on your Wii with a new round of questions that prove your brains are big enough to conquer grammar school. Answer over 6,000 questions in categories like History, Science, Geography, and more. Join host Jeff Foxworthy for play that unfolds just like you see on TV, or pick from new modes made just for this game. Team up in Study Buddies, go head-to-head in Super Battle of Wits, or pop a four-person quiz in Classroom Clash.  i2010kTHQsGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00899na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264002900035300002300064500064500087542003200732655002500764SA6EG900aBen 10: Galactic Racing 1bD3 Publisherc2011-10-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aSome kart racers are content to let you shift gears. This one lets you shift forms! After battling aliens throughout the universe, Ben is ready to battle them on the track! Use your Ultimatrix as a mid-race mega power-up, shift into alien forms, and gain an advantage over your opponents. But they won't just let you run away with the checkered flag. The courses are packed with Omni-Node power-ups that deliver an instant boost of alien ability. Race as one of 12 characters - including the new alien Fasttrack - on different 12 courses. Compete on the Grand Prix Circuit, run a Quick Race, or challenge up to three friends in multiplayer.  i2011kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00899na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264002900035300002300064500064500087542003200732655002500764SA6PAF00aBen 10: Galactic Racing 1bD3 Publisherc2011-11-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aSome kart racers are content to let you shift gears. This one lets you shift forms! After battling aliens throughout the universe, Ben is ready to battle them on the track! Use your Ultimatrix as a mid-race mega power-up, shift into alien forms, and gain an advantage over your opponents. But they won't just let you run away with the checkered flag. The courses are packed with Omni-Node power-ups that deliver an instant boost of alien ability. Race as one of 12 characters - including the new alien Fasttrack - on different 12 courses. Compete on the Grand Prix Circuit, run a Quick Race, or challenge up to three friends in multiplayer.  i2011kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00615na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002600042300002300068500031900091542003000410655002500440655002800465SA7ESZ00aGummy Bears: Magical Medallion 1bStorm Cityc2011-6-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Gummy Bears kingdom has fallen under the rule of the dastardly King Sour Berry! He has stolen the four mystical gems from the Gummy Bear Medallion. The magical medallion has for centuries kept the Gummy Bears Kingdom hidden from the evil king. You are the Gummy Bears only hope to save the Gummy Bears Kingdom!  i2011kStorm CitysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00908na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264002600034300002300060500066000083542003000743655002500773SA8P5204aThe Amazing Spider-Man 1bActivisionc2012-6-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aGo beyond the movie to experience what it's like to BE Spider-Man like never before. Set shortly after the events of Columbia Pictures' new film, The Amazing Spider-Man throws New York City's brand new hero back into free-roaming, web-slinging action, as he protects the Big Apple from a deluge of unimaginable threats. Experience the new Web Rush mechanic as Spidey twists his way through the NYC skyline with unprecedented speed and grace. The game's original story also explores beautiful indoor environments, as you'll encounter everything from skirmishes with everyday street thugs to pulse-pounding confrontations with Spider-Man's most lethal foes.  i2012kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00309na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264002300046300002300069500005100092542002700143655002900170SA9D7K00aBibi & Tina: Das grosse Reiterfest 1bKiddinxc2011-10-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first great Wii game for all horse lovers!  i2011kKiddinxsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00290na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500000500087542002600092655002500118655002500143SAAJA400aWinning Eleven Play Maker 2013 1bKonamic2012-11-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2012kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00366na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264004800040300002300088500003100111542005100142655002500193655002600218SABENR00aAlien Monster Bowling League 1bData Design / Destineer Studiosc2009-10-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aAliens! Monsters! Bowlers!  i2009kData Design / Destineer StudiossGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBowling games2wiiext00336na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264003200040300002300072500003100095542003700126655002500163655002600188SABPJG00aAlien Monster Bowling League 1bThe Games Companyc2010-7-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aAliens! Monsters! Bowlers!  i2010kThe Games CompanysGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBowling games2wiiext00298na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002900031300002300060500000500083542003400088655002500122655002900147SACSVS00aACB Total 2010-2011 1bSherwood Mediac2011-3-3  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2011kSherwood MediasGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBasketball games2wiiext00783na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264003400045300002300079500050800102542003800610655002500648SADE7000aBackyard Sports: Sandlot Sluggers 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2010-5-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs the snow melts and the temperatures rise, one thing is sure to pop into the minds of boys everywhere: baseball season! Backyard Sports: Sandlot Sluggers allows players to join their favorite neighborhood friends and play ball in fun and exciting arcade style sports action. Sandlot Sluggers is a completely new take on a longtime favorite franchise with all-new features, updated graphics, enhanced gameplay, and extensive options that will keep players and gamers alike enthusiastically entertained.  i2010kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00794na  a2200121   4500001000700000245000800007264003700015300002300052500050400075542004100579655002500620655002700645SAFUHS00aAFL 1bTru Blu Entertainmentc2011-5-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aBringing the Australian Football League to the Wii, AFL offers gamers the chance to experience real footballer action via visceral Wii Remote motion controls. Gameplay features such as mini contests, specky's, smothers, handballs, kicks, evade, hip and shoulder and tackles all provide precise, realistic sports action. A ten-year Career Manager Mode gives gamers an extended play experience over the life of the game. Plus, you can engage your friends in multiplayer matches of up to eight players.  i2011kTru Blu EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00714na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264003800028300002300066500044500089542004200534655002800576SAGE4104aThe Amazing Race 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2010-11-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aRace around the world and experience the thrill of the hit reality series with The Amazing Race video game! Grab your clue, choose your transportation, and make your way to the pit stop! Just like in the TV show you’ll overcome Detours, Road Blocks, Fast Forwards, Intersections and more as you make your way through exotic locations all across the globe! And don’t forget to watch out for unexpected obstacles that could slow you down.  i2010kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00422na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003800007264003100045300002300076500004600099542003500145655002400180655002400204655002300228655002500251SAHE6900aHasbro Family Game Night Fun Pack 1bElectronic Artsc2011-11-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIncludes: Hasbro Family Game Night 2 & 3.  i2011kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext 7aCard games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00670na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004100007264002600048300002300074500032900097542003000426655002500456655002900481655002600510SAJE5200aCabela's Survival: Shadows of Katmai 1bActivisionc2011-11-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aEncounter the Arctic's deadliest creatures in an epic struggle for survival in Cabela's Survival: Shadows of Katmai. Packed with the game-changing Top Shot Elite controller, gamers will face non-stop challenges and the ride of a lifetime through the daunting Alaskan wilderness in an effort to complete a mysterious mission.  i2011kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00671na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004100007264002700048300002300075500032900098542003000427655002500457655002900482655002600511SAJP5200aCabela's Survival: Shadows of Katmai 1bActivisionc2011-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aEncounter the Arctic's deadliest creatures in an epic struggle for survival in Cabela's Survival: Shadows of Katmai. Packed with the game-changing Top Shot Elite controller, gamers will face non-stop challenges and the ride of a lifetime through the daunting Alaskan wilderness in an effort to complete a mysterious mission.  i2011kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext01346na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264001800041300002300059500104800082542002301130655003101153655004001184SAKENS00aSakura Wars: So Long, My Love 1bNISc2010-1-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first Sakura Wars game to reach North America, Sakura Wars: So Long, My Love takes the franchise to America with the franchise's first story set in America, following a new hero who joins the US version of the Hanagumi. Demons have appeared in New York, and its up to Shinjirou, Gemini Sunrise and a new cast of characters to take them out. The cast serves as performers during the day and warriors when called upon, continuing series tradition.Sakura Wars is a strategy RPG that features a unique sim-based story system. Character interaction plays a major role in a storyline that never follows a set course, and your responses to the various characters in the game can ultimately change the story content and even the final outcome. The battle system is divided into two main parts; ground combat and air combat. Ground combat takes place using two-legged mechanized suits, which transform into jet fighters to take the fight to the sky. Every mech unit in the game can transform from battle mech mode to jet fighter mode during combat.  i2010kNISsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aTactical role-playing games2wiiext01485na  a2200157   4500001000700000245003400007264002600041300002300067500104800090542003101138655002801169655003101197655002701228655003201255655004001287SAKPNS00aSakura Wars: So Long, My Love 1bNIS Americac2010-4-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first Sakura Wars game to reach North America, Sakura Wars: So Long, My Love takes the franchise to America with the franchise's first story set in America, following a new hero who joins the US version of the Hanagumi. Demons have appeared in New York, and its up to Shinjirou, Gemini Sunrise and a new cast of characters to take them out. The cast serves as performers during the day and warriors when called upon, continuing series tradition.Sakura Wars is a strategy RPG that features a unique sim-based story system. Character interaction plays a major role in a storyline that never follows a set course, and your responses to the various characters in the game can ultimately change the story content and even the final outcome. The battle system is divided into two main parts; ground combat and air combat. Ground combat takes place using two-legged mechanized suits, which transform into jet fighters to take the fight to the sky. Every mech unit in the game can transform from battle mech mode to jet fighter mode during combat.  i2010kNIS AmericasGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aInteractive fiction2wiiext 7aTactical role-playing games2wiiext01067na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264003300031300002300064500080400087542003800891655002800929SALE4Q00aAlice in Wonderland 1bDisney Interactivec2010-3-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aAlice in Wonderland allows players to guide, protect and aid Alice as she journeys through the world of Underland while unraveling the game's many twisted mysteries. Along the way, players call on a diverse and unique cast of characters such as the Mad Hatter and Cheshire Cat who each have unique abilities to help evade traps and solve challenging puzzles. The Mad Hatter can help Alice alter her perception of Underland and take advantage of optical illusions to open up places in the world the player alone would not have noticed. Meanwhile, the Cheshire Cat can use his ability to make himself and objects appear and disappear helping Alice through this strange world. Players must choose wisely when using each of the characters' powers and combine the abilities to solve more complex puzzles.  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00678na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264003400031300002300065500037700088542003800465655002500503655002800528SALP4Q00aAlice in Wonderland 1bDisney Interactivec2010-3-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aHave you ever wondered what it would be like to fall down the rabbit hole? For the first time you can soon experience Alice's fantastical adventures in Disney Alice in Wonderland designed especially for Nintendo Wii. Inspired by the highly anticipated film from the mind of Tim Burton, this game will take you on a journey beyond the movie... and your wildest imagination!  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00939na  a2200145   4500001000700000245004600007264002500053300002300078500055800101542002800659655002500687655002900712655002600741655002600767SANEFS00aBass Pro Shops: The Hunt: Trophy Showdown 1bXS Gamesc2011-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Hunt is made up of more than just the final moments. Preparation, location, game type, weapon choice, and ammunition all factor into what happens in those last, frantic minutes. Bass Pro Shops: The Hunt - Trophy Showdown lets you stalk your prey in eight different regions through three seasons. Prove you are a master huntsman in The Hunt Champions Tournament and win real prizes. Hit Bass Pro Shops for the latest gear, guns, and ammo, to check your trophy collection, and more. You can hunt with your normal controls or with The Bullseye Pro gun.  i2011kXS GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00908na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002000038300002300058500062500081542002300706655002800729655002900757SAOE7800aMonster High: Ghoul Spirit 1bTHQc2011-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aBe the coolest ghoul in school as you enroll at Monster High! Everything about it is just like a regular high school, except for the students. Creep-tastic creatures inspired by the spookiest movie monsters roam these halls. They're not out for blood or brains...they just want to get their homework done, hang with their friends, and score a date for the dance. Create a custom ghoul with your choice of drop-dead-gorgeous outfits and hair, then hit the books to be an ogre-achiever. Show off your style, build your rep, and see if you have enough creepy-cred to be voted Scream Queen at the Terror Under the Sea Dance.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00926na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002900038300002300067500062500090542003200715655002800747655002900775SAOEVZ00aMonster High: Ghoul Spirit 1bLittle Orbitc2014-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aBe the coolest ghoul in school as you enroll at Monster High! Everything about it is just like a regular high school, except for the students. Creep-tastic creatures inspired by the spookiest movie monsters roam these halls. They're not out for blood or brains...they just want to get their homework done, hang with their friends, and score a date for the dance. Create a custom ghoul with your choice of drop-dead-gorgeous outfits and hair, then hit the books to be an ogre-achiever. Show off your style, build your rep, and see if you have enough creepy-cred to be voted Scream Queen at the Terror Under the Sea Dance.  i2014kLittle OrbitsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00908na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002000038300002300058500062500081542002300706655002800729655002900757SAOP7800aMonster High: Ghoul Spirit 1bTHQc2011-10-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aBe the coolest ghoul in school as you enroll at Monster High! Everything about it is just like a regular high school, except for the students. Creep-tastic creatures inspired by the spookiest movie monsters roam these halls. They're not out for blood or brains...they just want to get their homework done, hang with their friends, and score a date for the dance. Create a custom ghoul with your choice of drop-dead-gorgeous outfits and hair, then hit the books to be an ogre-achiever. Show off your style, build your rep, and see if you have enough creepy-cred to be voted Scream Queen at the Terror Under the Sea Dance.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00926na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002900038300002300067500062500090542003200715655002800747655002900775SAOXVZ00aMonster High: Ghoul Spirit 1bLittle Orbitc2014-10-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aBe the coolest ghoul in school as you enroll at Monster High! Everything about it is just like a regular high school, except for the students. Creep-tastic creatures inspired by the spookiest movie monsters roam these halls. They're not out for blood or brains...they just want to get their homework done, hang with their friends, and score a date for the dance. Create a custom ghoul with your choice of drop-dead-gorgeous outfits and hair, then hit the books to be an ogre-achiever. Show off your style, build your rep, and see if you have enough creepy-cred to be voted Scream Queen at the Terror Under the Sea Dance.  i2014kLittle OrbitsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00938na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264003300048300002300081500066100104542003700765655002600802SAQE5G00aHarley Pasternak's Hollywood Workout 1bMajesco Sales Incc2012-9-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aThere's looking good, then there's looking good enough to walk down the red carpet with the world's eyes on you. Slim down and tone up with the same workout used by Hollywood stars in this fitness program designed by celebrity trainer Harley Pasternak. Use his proven 5-Factor Fitness program to create a customizable workout you'll perform for 25 minutes a day, five days a week. Run, jump, squat, and more in a variety of A-list worthy environments, including a beachfront condo and a Hollywood Hills mansion. Harley helps track your workouts, provides tips on proper form, and offers nutritional advice so you get the maximum benefits from your workout.  i2012kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aFitness games2wiiext00750na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264003200031300002300063500049400086542003500580655002500615SARE4Z00aAladdin Magic Racer 1bRed Wagon Gamesc2011-11-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aSpeed through a whole new world on top of a magical flying carpet. Aladdin and his friends soar through the skies and dive into the oceans of some of the world's most beautiful places while racing to the finish line. Hop on the Wii Balance Board and steer your magical flying carpet away from opponent attacks while setting your own traps to stay one step ahead. Join up with three friends for simultaneous multiplayer split-screen action or compete in a variety of competitive mini-games.  i2011kRed Wagon GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00558na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264003400030300002300064500029800087542003800385655002500423SARPNK00aAladin Magic Racer 1bNeko Entertainmentc2010-4-30  a1 Wii optical disc  a　　曾经梦想过骑乘着魔毯飞行于这个宇宙内最美丽的那些场景中吗？现在就是美梦成真的时刻了。不过请小心，因为在《Aladdin Magic Racer 》内的比赛与小游戏都充满着许多谜题，而其他的参赛者也将不断地提醒你这一点。  i2010kNeko EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00682na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002300007264003100030300002300061500035400084542003600438655002400474655002400498655002600522SASEWW00aAtrévete a Soñar 1bSlang Publishingc2010-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMusical game based on the TV hit “Atrévete a Soñar”. Players will choose their favorite character (Patito or Antonella) and perform the songs of the show singing, dancing or doing both at once, taking advantage of the movement sensor with the Wiimote and using the microphone, specially designed for the console that is included with the game.  i2010kSlang PublishingsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00872na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264003700046300002300083500059100106542004100697655002400738SATE6K00aChuck E. Cheese's Super Collection 1bUFO Interactive Gamesc2011-9-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou can take Chuck E. Cheese's pizza to go. With this collection you can bring home the fun, too! Chuck E. Cheeze has assembled a fun and exciting mini-game mix geared for the whole family. Choose from 25 different games that have you doing everything from making pizza (naturally) to playing Whack-A-Munch to becoming a sports superstar. The Sports Games section lets you pick from nine action-packed contests in two difficulty levels. The party-style play is fit for two to four players, rewards you with tons of Chuck E. Cheese prizes, and features controls easy enough for everyone.  i2011kUFO Interactive GamessGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00505na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004200007264002100049300002300070500021600093542002400309655002500333655002500358SAUJ8P00aPuyo Puyo!! Puyopuyo 20th Anniversary 1bSegac2011-12-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aPuyo Puyo!! 20th Anniversary is currently the latest Puyo Puyo game released. It is the second anniversary game in the series and as such shares more similarities to Puyo Puyo! 15th Anniversary than Puyo Puyo 7.  i2011kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00405na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004400007264003300051300002300084500005300107542003700160655002400197655002500221655002500246SAVE5G00aAlvin and the Chipmunks: The Squeakquel 1bMajesco Sales Incc2009-12-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aBack by popular demand: Alvin and The Chipmunks!  i2009kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00369na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004400007264003400051300002300085500005300108542003700161655002400198655002500222SAVX5G00aAlvin and the Chipmunks: The Squeakquel 1bMajesco Sales Incc2009-12-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aBack by popular demand: Alvin and The Chipmunks!  i2009kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00901na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002400007264002600031300002300057500058200080542003000662655002500692655002500717655002500742SAWE5200aAngry Birds Trilogy 1bActivisionc2013-8-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience Angry Birds with motion controls as the worldwide hit mobile game comes to Nintendo Wii! The Angry Birds Trilogy combines Angry Birds Seasons, Angry Birds Rio, and the original that started it all. Use the Wii Remote to launch your birds and smash the pigs who stole your eggs. Take the battle to the colorful surroundings of Rio, and celebrate festive occasions around the world in Seasons. In all, the games include more than 290 levels of pig-pummeling action. With bonus content added for Wii, you'll get more than 40 hours of motion-control Angry Birds battles.  i2013kActivisionsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00901na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002400007264002600031300002300057500058200080542003000662655002500692655002500717655002500742SAWP5200aAngry Birds Trilogy 1bActivisionc2013-8-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience Angry Birds with motion controls as the worldwide hit mobile game comes to Nintendo Wii! The Angry Birds Trilogy combines Angry Birds Seasons, Angry Birds Rio, and the original that started it all. Use the Wii Remote to launch your birds and smash the pigs who stole your eggs. Take the battle to the colorful surroundings of Rio, and celebrate festive occasions around the world in Seasons. In all, the games include more than 290 levels of pig-pummeling action. With bonus content added for Wii, you'll get more than 40 hours of motion-control Angry Birds battles.  i2013kActivisionsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00822na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264002500034300002300059500050000082542002900582655002500611655002500636655002700661SAXPFH00aMax & the Magic Marker 1bPressPlayc2011-9-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aMax & the Magic Marker is a physics based 2D puzzle platformer, in which the player controls the boy Max and his Magic Marker. While Max enables good old platform¬ing fun, the marker provides the game's signature feature: the ability for the player to draw directly inside the game world where everything drawn becomes physical objects. This feature is used to complete levels and overcome challenges but it also provides the player with a unique tool that in itself is fun to play around with.  i2011kPressPlaysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00284na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264001900029300002300048500005600071542002300127655002400150SAYE2000aBoot Camp Academy 1bZooc2010-5-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aTrain like a soldier in a military-style boot camp!  i2010kZoosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00625na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264003800029300002300067500035800090542004200448655002500490SAYP4100aBoot Camp Academy 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2010-2-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aBoot Camp Academy is a party game that enable casual gamers to earn experience as a new army recruit. Players can learn how to drive a tank, spy on their enemies, protect the Earth from space invadersÂ…as well as peeling potatoes and doing push-ups! Every family member can get into the action with easy-to-use controls and many different mini-games!  i2010kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00948na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264002600034300002300060500066000083542003000743655002500773655002800798SAZE5204aThe Amazing Spider-Man 1bActivisionc2012-6-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aGo beyond the movie to experience what it's like to BE Spider-Man like never before. Set shortly after the events of Columbia Pictures' new film, The Amazing Spider-Man throws New York City's brand new hero back into free-roaming, web-slinging action, as he protects the Big Apple from a deluge of unimaginable threats. Experience the new Web Rush mechanic as Spidey twists his way through the NYC skyline with unprecedented speed and grace. The game's original story also explores beautiful indoor environments, as you'll encounter everything from skirmishes with everyday street thugs to pulse-pounding confrontations with Spider-Man's most lethal foes.  i2012kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00864na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264003700031300002300068500059300091542004100684655002900725SB2ES500aMy Baby First Steps 1bSouthpeak Interactivec2009-11-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aYour baby has grown so fast! Can you believe that a year has already gone by? Take care of your baby from their 1st birthday until they’re 3 years old. Your baby will discover its entire environment and learn from it, they’ll walk, babble and speak, try to catch every object they can, and put everything in their mouth... Your baby will be the apple of your eye! In My Baby Next Steps, the companion to the bestselling My Baby Girl and Boy on Nintendo DS, you can experience the magic of caring for a toddler and experience the joy of seeing your baby grow up right before your eyes!  i2009kSouthpeak InteractivesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00279na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001400007264002400021300002300045500004500068542002700113655002900140SB2PNP00aMy Baby 2 1bNobilisc2009-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aYour baby has grown* and is talking now!  i2009kNobilissGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext01020na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002300042300002300065500072700088542002600815655002700841655003000868SB3E0800aSengoku Basara: Samurai Heroes 1bCapcomc2010-10-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe producer of Devil May Cry 4, Hiroyuki Kobayashi, brings you the newest installment to the BASARA series, Sengoku BASARA Samurai Heroes, on the PLAYSTATION®3 and Wii. A fun, action-packed and accessible title set during a tumultuous period of Japanese history, Sengoku BASARA Samurai Heroes follows you as you fight your way to dramatic battle of Sekigahara. you will master the swords and spears of more than a dozen fierce samurai warriors in huge battles against hundreds of opponents that will become more and more challenging throughout the game. On your journey to the final battle, learn how to unleash powerful and spectacular Basara moves or make use of the boost mode to wipe out as many enemies as possible.  i2010kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext01038na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002100007264002200028300002300050500071800073542002600791655002700817655003000844655003000874SB3J0800aSengoku Basara 3 1bCapcomc2010-7-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe producer of Devil May Cry 4, Hiroyuki Kobayashi, brings you the newest installment to the BASARA series, Sengoku BASARA: Samurai Heroes, on the PlayStation 3 and Wii. A fun, action-packed and accessible title set during a tumultuous period of Japanese history, Sengoku BASARA: Samurai Heroes follows players as they fight their way to the dramatic battle of Sekigahara. Players will take control of more than a dozen samurai heroes, each wielding their own unique weapon, in huge battles against hundreds of opponents that grow ever more challenging. On their journey to the final battle, players will learn how to unleash spectacular BASARA Arts and utilize Hero Time to wipe out as many enemies as possible.  i2010kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aHistoric settings2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext01011na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002300042300002300065500071800088542002600806655002700832655003000859SB3P0800aSengoku Basara: Samurai Heroes 1bCapcomc2010-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe producer of Devil May Cry 4, Hiroyuki Kobayashi, brings you the newest installment to the BASARA series, Sengoku BASARA: Samurai Heroes, on the PlayStation 3 and Wii. A fun, action-packed and accessible title set during a tumultuous period of Japanese history, Sengoku BASARA: Samurai Heroes follows players as they fight their way to the dramatic battle of Sekigahara. Players will take control of more than a dozen samurai heroes, each wielding their own unique weapon, in huge battles against hundreds of opponents that grow ever more challenging. On their journey to the final battle, players will learn how to unleash spectacular BASARA Arts and utilize Hero Time to wipe out as many enemies as possible.  i2010kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00541na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002400032300002300056500025700079542002800336655002500364655003000389SB4E0100aSuper Mario Galaxy 2 1bNintendoc2010-5-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aSuper Mario Galaxy 2, the sequel to the smash-hit galaxy-hopping original game, includes the amazing gravity-defying, physics-based exploration from the first game, but is loaded with entirely new galaxies and features to challenge and delight players.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00620na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002500007264002400032300002300056500025700079542002800336655002500364655002800389655002700417655003000444SB4J0100aSuper Mario Galaxy 2 1bNintendoc2010-5-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aSuper Mario Galaxy 2, the sequel to the smash-hit galaxy-hopping original game, includes the amazing gravity-defying, physics-based exploration from the first game, but is loaded with entirely new galaxies and features to challenge and delight players.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00561na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004900007264002300056300002300079500025700102542002800359655002500387655002700412SB4K0100aSuper Mario Wii 2: Galaxy Adventure Together 1bNintendoc2010-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aSuper Mario Galaxy 2, the sequel to the smash-hit galaxy-hopping original game, includes the amazing gravity-defying, physics-based exploration from the first game, but is loaded with entirely new galaxies and features to challenge and delight players.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00620na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002500007264002400032300002300056500025700079542002800336655002500364655002800389655002700417655003000444SB4P0100aSuper Mario Galaxy 2 1bNintendoc2010-6-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aSuper Mario Galaxy 2, the sequel to the smash-hit galaxy-hopping original game, includes the amazing gravity-defying, physics-based exploration from the first game, but is loaded with entirely new galaxies and features to challenge and delight players.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00541na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002400032300002300056500025700079542002800336655002500364655003000389SB4W0100aSuper Mario Galaxy 2 1bNintendoc2010-12-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aSuper Mario Galaxy 2, the sequel to the smash-hit galaxy-hopping original game, includes the amazing gravity-defying, physics-based exploration from the first game, but is loaded with entirely new galaxies and features to challenge and delight players.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00863na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001300007264002600020300002300046500058900069542002900658655002500687655002900712SB5E5400aNBA 2K11 1b2K Sportsc2010-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn NBA 2K11, players can experience what it's like to play in Michael Jordan's shoes! Relive 10 different legendary games from Michael Jordan's career and replicate in NBA 2K11 what MJ did on the court, and even unlock MJ: Creating a Legend, a special mode where you get to take control of a newly drafted rookie Michael Jordan and craft your own version of Michael’s career in the NBA. Players can also experience what it's like to be part of some of the greatest teams in NBA history as the 1985-86, 1989-90, 1990-91, 1991-92, 1994-95, 1995-96, 1996-97, and 1997-98 Chicago Bulls.  i2010k2K SportssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBasketball games2wiiext00881na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001300007264003500020300002300055500058900078542003800667655002500705655002900730SB5P5400aNBA 2K11 1bTake 2 Interactivec2010-10-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn NBA 2K11, players can experience what it's like to play in Michael Jordan's shoes! Relive 10 different legendary games from Michael Jordan's career and replicate in NBA 2K11 what MJ did on the court, and even unlock MJ: Creating a Legend, a special mode where you get to take control of a newly drafted rookie Michael Jordan and craft your own version of Michael’s career in the NBA. Players can also experience what it's like to be part of some of the greatest teams in NBA history as the 1985-86, 1989-90, 1990-91, 1991-92, 1994-95, 1995-96, 1996-97, and 1997-98 Chicago Bulls.  i2010kTake 2 InteractivesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBasketball games2wiiext00797na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002600042300002300068500050600091542003000597655002500627655002300652SB6E5200aBakugan: Defenders of the Core 1bActivisionc2010-11-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time ever, ultimate monsters come to life in all-out ultimate brawls. In Bakugan: Defenders of the Core, you'll sieze real-time control of towering Bakugan as you unleash their fury in action-packed ultimate battles. A thrilling action game that merges fi ghting and stealth adventure gameplay into one awesome experience, you'll control skyscraper-sized Bakugan in your quest to save the world's cities from the evil Spectra and his Vexos armies. The fate of humankind is in your hands!  i2010kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aCard games2wiiext00797na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002600042300002300068500050600091542003000597655002500627655002300652SB6P5200aBakugan: Defenders of the Core 1bActivisionc2010-11-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time ever, ultimate monsters come to life in all-out ultimate brawls. In Bakugan: Defenders of the Core, you'll sieze real-time control of towering Bakugan as you unleash their fury in action-packed ultimate battles. A thrilling action game that merges fi ghting and stealth adventure gameplay into one awesome experience, you'll control skyscraper-sized Bakugan in your quest to save the world's cities from the evil Spectra and his Vexos armies. The fate of humankind is in your hands!  i2010kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aCard games2wiiext00301na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002900035300002300064500000500087542003300092655002500125655002900150SB7IVU00aPlanet Basket 2009-2010 1bDouble junglec2010-8-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kDouble junglesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBasketball games2wiiext00525na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001500007264003400022300002300056500026900079542003800348655002900386SB8EQH00aBurger Bot 1bVirtual Play Gamesc2010-5-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aHave you ever dreamed about running a fast food restaurant? Burger Bot, a strategy game in which you guide a robotic waiter to serve food and drinks to guests at a fast-food restaurant. Manage your time efficiently when assembling orders and preparing ingredients.  i2010kVirtual Play GamessGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00855na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264002000039300002300059500061600082542002300698655002400721SB9E7800aBarbie: Groom and Glam Pups 1bTHQc2010-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aDog show meets fashion show in this chance to turn an adorable puppy into a glamourous star! Barbie: Groom and Glam Pups gives you everything you need to make sure that, when the moment comes, your puppy will be ready to shine. Pick from six breeds, each chosen because they're high on cute factor and even higher on high-style potential. Use real grooming techniques to help your dog look her best, then add layers of style with glam clothes, costumes, and collars. Get advice from Barbie to make sure your dog is ready for the big finale - a dance sequence, a walk down the runway, and a fabulous photo shoot!  i2010kTHQsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00815na  a2200097   450000100070000024500320000