of “Playstyle Matters” – an innovative style of gameplay created by Disney Interactive Studios’ Junction Point, led by industry luminary Warren Spector, where players creatively tackle different challenges in the world to explore all the possibilities and storylines – but with consequences for their chosen actions.  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext01277na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004700007264002300054300002300077500097400100542002801074655002501102655002801127SEMJ0100aEpic Mickey: Mickey Mouse to Mahou no Fude 1bNintendoc2011-8-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aDisney Epic Mickey is an action-adventure platforming game for the Wii console that sends Mickey Mouse on an epic journey of creativity and discovery. As Mickey, the player is propelled into Wasteland, an alternate world made up of Disney’s forgotten creative efforts, and is given the power to wield paint and paint thinner to dynamically change the world while determining Mickey’s path to becoming an epic hero. Through the use of this unique paint and paint thinner, the key components of animation and Mickey’s tools for impacting his world, players will have the ability to shape how the story unfolds as they discover the concept of “Playstyle Matters” – an innovative style of gameplay created by Disney Interactive Studios’ Junction Point, led by industry luminary Warren Spector, where players creatively tackle different challenges in the world to explore all the possibilities and storylines – but with consequences for their chosen actions.  i2011kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01300na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002300007264003500030300002300065500096000088542003801048655002501086655002801111655002701139SEMP4Q00aDisney Epic Mickey 1bDisney Interactivec2010-11-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aDisney Epic Mickey is an action-adventure platforming game for the Wii console that sends Mickey Mouse on an epic journey of creativity and discovery. As Mickey, the player is propelled into Wasteland, an alternate world made up of Disney's forgotten creative efforts, and is given the power to wield paint and paint thinner to dynamically change the world while determining Mickey's path to becoming an epic hero.   Through the use of this unique paint and paint thinner, the key components of animation and Mickey's tools for impacting his world, players will have the ability to shape how the story unfolds as they discover the concept of "Playstyle Matters" - an innovative style of gameplay created by Disney Interactive Studios' Junction Point, led by industry luminary Warren Spector, where players creatively tackle different challenges in the world to explore all the possibilities and storylines - but with consequences for their chosen actions.  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00805na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002300007264003500030300002300065500042300088542003800511655002500549655002800574655002700602655003000629SEMX4Q00aDisney Epic Mickey 1bDisney Interactivec2010-11-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aDisney Epic Mickey is an action-adventure platforming game for the Wii console that sends Mickey Mouse on an epic journey of creativity and discovery. As Mickey, the player is propelled into Wasteland, an alternate world made up of Disney’s forgotten creative efforts, and is given the power to wield paint and paint thinner to dynamically change the world while determining Mickey’s path to becoming an epic hero.  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00763na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002300007264003500030300002300065500042300088542003800511655002500549655002800574655002700602SEMY4Q00aDisney Epic Mickey 1bDisne