ons2wiiext00663na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003500007264003900042300002300081500030300104542004300407655002900450655002400479655002600503SFZEPZ00aPheasants Forever: Wingshooter 1bGame Mill Entertainmentc2010-10-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aFinally a bird hunting game that gets it right! From the moment you open the game until the last competitive shot fired, you will be amazed by the entertaining game play, bird selection, mini-game depth and authentic brands in the game that separate Pheasants Forever from every other hunting game.  i2010kGame Mill EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00425na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002800029300002300057500013600080542003200216655002900248655002600277SFZPXT00aPheasants Forever 1bFunbox Mediac2011-8-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeel the chill in the air and the leaves under your feet as you prepare for the moment. Then suddenly . . . a flurry fills the air!  i2011kFunbox MediasGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00678na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002400029300002300053500040400076542002800480655002500508655002300533SG2EFS00aCrazy Mini Golf 2 1bXS Gamesc2010-1-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aCrazy Mini Golf 2 will be exclusively for the Wii and will support the new Motion Plus Controller for the most realistic and accurate putting movement. Totally fluid instant feedback, wherever you swing your putter, your on-screen character follows; lift, turn, twist, swing, every detailed swing of your putter is accurately replicated in real time. It works for both left and right handed players.  i2010kXS GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00717na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264003700041300002300078500040400101542004200505655002500547655002300572SG2PUG00aKidz Sports Crazy Mini Golf 2 1bMetro 3D / Data Designc2012-2-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aCrazy Mini Golf 2 will be exclusively for the Wii and will support the new Motion Plus Controller for the most realistic and accurate putting movement. Totally fluid instant feedback, wherever you swing your putter, your on-screen character follows; lift, turn, twist, swing, every detailed swing of your putter is accurately replicated in real time. It works for both left and right handed players.  i2012kMetro 3D / Data DesignsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00719na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264003900041300002300080500040400103542004200507655002500549655002300574SG2XUG00aKidz Sports Crazy Mini Golf 2 1bMetro 3D / Data Designc2011-12-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aCrazy Mini Golf 2 will be exclusively for the Wii and will support the new Motion Plus Controller for the most realistic and accurate putting movement. Totally fluid instant feedback, wherever you swing your putter, your on-screen character follows; lift, turn, twist, swing, every detailed swing of your putter is accurately replicated in real time. It works for both left and right handed players.  i2011kMetro 3D / Data DesignsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00718na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264004400029300002300073500040400096542004800500655002500548655002300573SG2YFS00aCrazy Mini Golf 2 1bXS Games / Jack Of All Gamesc2009-11-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aCrazy Mini Golf 2 will be exclusively for the Wii and will support the new Motion Plus Controller for the most realistic and accurate putting movement. Totally fluid instant feedback, wherever you swing your putter, your on-screen character follows; lift, turn, twist, swing, every detailed swing of your putter is accurately replicated in real time. It works for both left and right handed players.  i2009kXS Games / Jack Of All GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00281na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264003500040300002300075500000500098542003900103655002900142SG3DSV00aGermany's Next Topmodel 2010 1bSevenOne Intermediac2010-2-25  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kSevenOne IntermediasGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00651na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264002800023300002300051500037400074542003200448655002400480655002500504SG5PSV00aFamily Quiz 1bFunbox Mediac2011-1-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aFamily Quiz on Wii is an exciting quiz game with board game elements and minigames, packed with several thousand questions on a wide variety of topics! Quiz questions on a wide variety of topics such as history, politics, physics, chemistry, mathematics, general knowledge, geography, biology and sport, some of which are accompanied by picture puzzles and video clips.  i2011kFunbox MediasGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00349na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002400007264003500031300002300066500000500089542003900094655002400133655002500157655003300182SG6DSV00aGalileo Family Quiz 1bSevenOne Intermediac2010-3-12  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kSevenOne IntermediasGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00916na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005100007264002500058300002300083500064700106542002900753655002400782SG7E2004aThe Garfield Show: Threat of the Space Lasagna 1bZoo Gamesc2010-7-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aSpace Lasagnas are preparing to invade the Earth! They will first have to neutralize their most terrible opponent: the endlessly hungry Garfield. Thanks to their mighty hypnotizing laser, the Lasagnas turn the mice completely mad. The mice become crazy and start invading the whole city, causing chaos everywhere. The only way for Garfield to wash the hypnosis away is to beat the mice down. To do so, Garfield will chase the mice into Jon's house, Vito's pizzeria and even the butcher's shop in order to teach the mice a good lesson. Garfield has to do all he can to thwart the Lasagnas' plans and eradicate the threat of the Space Lasagnas.  i2010kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00280na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005100007264002800058300002300086500000500109542003200114655002400146SG7PVL04aThe Garfield Show: Threat of the Space Lasagna 1bEko Softwarec2010-6-11  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kEko SoftwaresGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00929na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001400007264002800021300002300049500065000072542003200722655002500754655002800779SG8EG900aYogi Bear 1bD3 Publisherc2010-12-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aBe sure and pack a pic-a-nic basket for this adventure based on the Yogi Bear live-action CG movie! It's the 100th anniversary of Jellystone Park, and instead of throwing a huge celebration, some greedy developers want to close the park. Travel through Jellystone rescuing protected animals and working to keep the park open. Sneak through majestic levels using zip-lines, bungees, belly slides, and other moves to keep from being spotted by Ranger Smith and other humans. Collect items to build gadgets and shake or move objects to discover useful hidden items. You'll need to be smarter than the average bear if you're going to save your home!  i2010kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00761na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002000037300002300057500048200080542002500562655002500587655002700612SG8PAF00aYogi Bear: The Video Game 1bNamcoc2011-1-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe 100th Anniversary of Jellystone Park is fast approaching – and land developers want to shut it down! Based on Warner Bros. Studios live-action CG animated feature film Yogi Bear, Yogi Bear: The Video Game lets players become “smarter than the average bear” while exploring the park as Yogi. Belly slide, zip-line, bungee, and sneak through majestic levels, all the while rescuing protected animals and finding a way to save Jellystone Park from shutting down forever!  i2011kNamcosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00409na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002000007264002100027300002300048500004600071542002400117655002500141655002800166655002500194655004400219SG9EYC00aGremlins: Gizmo 1bNECAc2011-11-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aUnleash Gizmo's Fun-Loving Personalality!  i2011kNECAsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPoint-and-click adventure games2wiiext01001na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002500033300002300058500071600081542003000797655002500827655002700852SGAE8P00aTournament of Legends 1bSega Japanc2010-7-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aSet in the brutal arenas of ancient Rome, Tournament of Legends is a weapon and magic based 3D-fight game featuring fighters based on a legend from world mythology: the Minotaur, a powerful Gladiator, Gorgon, Stone Golem, Valkyrie and other well-known and powerful characters. Tournament of Legends features epic battles in fantastic fighting arenas where players wield mythical blade weapons, launch 40 magic attacks, and dodge giant mythological creatures that protect the battle lairs. In intense one and two-player fights, players master a range of character and weapon based magic attacks; including unleashing, amongst others, a man-eating lion, Jupiter's Storm, Thor's Fury and a nest of venomous snakes.  i2010kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00534na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264002500033300002300058500028600081542003000367655002700397SGAP8P00aTournament of Legends 1bSega Japanc2010-7-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aBecome a legend in epic 3D duels against the greatest fighters of world mythology. Wield mythic weapons and unleash special animated attacks. Wield two weapons at the same time with the Wii Remote™ and Nunchuk™ Controller. Sharpen your skills in the interactive training level.  i2010kSega JapansGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext01071na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002300037300002300060500078800083542002700871655002500898655002600923SGBE5G00aGreg Hastings Paintball 2 1bMajescoc2010-9-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aGreg Hastings Paintball 2 introduces more than 10 single and multiplayer game modes each staged in all-new, paintball locations based on actual fields around the world. Seven single-player game modes challenge the most experienced "ballers" to hone their skills and then test them against up to 19 others in seven different multiplayer game types. Whether playing alone or against others, Greg Hastings Paintball 2 ups the ante with game-changing weather conditions and field hazards including rain, wind and fog. The game also features an improved map editor along with the hottest new gear and weapons. When things are at their bleakest, players can even use the all-new cheat meter that lets them avoid elimination by successfully wiping away paint splatter before they're caught.  i2010kMajescosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01000na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003000007264002500037300002300062500078800085542002900873SGBPGT00aGreg Hastings Paintball 2 1b505 Gamesc2015-10-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aGreg Hastings Paintball 2 introduces more than 10 single and multiplayer game modes each staged in all-new, paintball locations based on actual fields around the world. Seven single-player game modes challenge the most experienced "ballers" to hone their skills and then test them against up to 19 others in seven different multiplayer game types. Whether playing alone or against others, Greg Hastings Paintball 2 ups the ante with game-changing weather conditions and field hazards including rain, wind and fog. The game also features an improved map editor along with the hottest new gear and weapons. When things are at their bleakest, players can even use the all-new cheat meter that lets them avoid elimination by successfully wiping away paint splatter before they're caught.  i2015k505 GamessGameTDB00708na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001400007264002600021300002300047500043700070542002900507655002500536655002500561SGCE2000aGlacier 2 1bZoo Gamesc2009-10-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aA fresh group of contenders have entered this alpine race with faster and stronger vehicles equipped with shocking new weapons. Watch out for treacherous cliffs, falling rocks, and icy hairpin turns as racers careen down the mountains. But it takes more to be #1. Aim your rockets, ready your machine guns, and deploy mines to battle your opponents because in Glacier 2, there's only one rule: "He who finishes first is victorious."  i2009kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00492na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264002600029300002300055500024400078542003100322655002900353SGDEJJ00aLet's Play Garden 1bDeep Silverc2010-6-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aHave you ever wanted a place to call your own? Now you can create your own special world - your very own garden! Add playground accessories, fruit trees, flowers and more as you experience the different seasons and the fun that they bring.  i2010kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00488na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264002700024300002300051500024400074542003100318655002900349SGDPKM00aPlay Gardens 1bDeep Silverc2010-3-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aHave you ever wanted a place to call your own? Now you can create your own special world - your very own garden! Add playground accessories, fruit trees, flowers and more as you experience the different seasons and the fun that they bring.  i2010kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00956na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264002900040300002300069500066100092542003200753655002400785655002500809SGEEG900aNat Geo Challenge! Wild Life 1bD3 Publisherc2010-11-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aHow well do you know your home planet? Find out in this NatGeo trivia game that is as eye-catching as it is challenging. A vibrant background photo from National Geographic's unrivaled library of nature photography dazzles your eyes while a variety of questions in four categories look to dazzle your mind. The Amazing Planet category centers around Earth's most inspiring places. Aquatic Life, naturally, covers the living things that call rivers, lakes, and oceans home. Dangerous Encounters is a safe way to visit creatures you don't want to meet in the wild. And Predators vs. Prey focuses on a few notable wild animals and goes over what's for dinner.  i2010kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00326na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002800007264002600035300002300061500000500084542003000089655002500119655002300144655002500167SGEPLG00aNat Geo Quiz! Wild Life 1bBlack Beanc2010-6-25  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kBlack BeansGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aCard games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00994na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002900007264003900036300002300075500063000098542004200728655002500770655002600795655003900821SGHE4100aTom Clancy's Ghost Recon 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2010-11-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin one of the most elite combat units in gaming in this Wii-exclusive adaption of Tom Clancy's Ghost Recon. Hibbard and Booth are the newest members of the ultra-elite Ghost team. The unit is ambushed on a mission in Moscow, leaving the rookies separated from their team. The two soldiers have only one way out, and it involves a whole lot of bullets. Fight through 30 missions where you're constantly outmanned and outgunned. The action-packed third-person style is optimized for co-op play, with a friend able to drop in or out at any time. Arcade Mode lets soldiers shoot for the high score in co-op or competitive play.  i2010kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00708na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264003800036300002300074500038400097542004100481655002500522655003900547SGHP4100aTom Clancy's Ghost Recon 1bUbisoft Entertainmentc2010-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aAfter being inserted in Moscow and separated from the rest of their team, Ghost soldiers Hibbard and Booth must operate as a two-man team, relying on the intel of the local militia to fight their way to their target in a city infested with enemies. With the numbers clearly not in their favor, they will have to use their advanced weaponry and training to make sure the odds are.  i2010kUbisoft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00511na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264002200037300002300059500026800082542002600350655002500376SGIEA400aGTI Club Supermini Festa! 1bKonamic2010-2-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aEverything about the racing game GTI Club Supermini Festa! has been designed to give the player a feeling of sheer speed and total control, and users can also add a personal touch to their car via the extensive customization features in the game's Garage section.  i2010kKonamisGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00586na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264002200037300002300059500034300082542002600425655002500451SGIJA400aGTI Club: World City Race 1bKonamic2010-2-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aStaying true to the original racing frenzy of the award-winning arcade game, players will race through the cityscapes of France, the UK, Italy, USA and Japan. Speed through tight bends and back roads of the urban sprawl, up steep mountainous roads and caves. Tackle a wide variety of driving conditions in the ultimate race to the finish!  i2010kKonamisGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00586na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264002200037300002300059500034300082542002600425655002500451SGIPA400aGTI Club Supermini Festa! 1bKonamic2010-3-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aStaying true to the original racing frenzy of the award-winning arcade game, players will race through the cityscapes of France, the UK, Italy, USA and Japan. Speed through tight bends and back roads of the urban sprawl, up steep mountainous roads and caves. Tackle a wide variety of driving conditions in the ultimate race to the finish!  i2010kKonamisGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00559na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264002700048300002300075500029300098542003000391655002800421SGJDSV00aGalileo Mystery: Die Krone des Midas 1bSevenGamesc2009-10-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aStephan took a job as a night watchmen in a museum, but the adventure of his life begins just a few minutes after he arrives!  A mysterious boss, cryptic exhibits and dangerous intruders; he will need all his wits about him if he and his friend Jessica are to make it through the night…  i2009kSevenGamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00561na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264003700030300002300067500029300090542004000383655002800423SGJPSV04aThe Crown of Midas 1bZushi Games - Funboxc2011-11-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aStephan took a job as a night watchmen in a museum, but the adventure of his life begins just a few minutes after he arrives!  A mysterious boss, cryptic exhibits and dangerous intruders; he will need all his wits about him if he and his friend Jessica are to make it through the night…  i2011kZushi Games - FunboxsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00857na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004600007264002700053300002300080500054800103542003000651655002500681655002900706SGKEC800aChampion Jockey: G1 Jockey & Gallop Racer 1bKoei Tecmoc2011-11-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aSpend a day at the races; only instead of watching from the stands, you are the one guiding the winning horse to the finish line! Saddle up and experience the most intense horse-racing competition using Wii motion controls. Guide your horse to victory on 19 tracks inspired by the world's most challenging courses. Jump fences and other obstacles in steeple chases or make a mad dash to the finish on dirt and turf racetracks. Rookie riders can dial back the challenge in Fun Race Mode, where the racing is less authentic but just as exciting.  i2011kKoei TecmosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00780na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004600007264003200053300002300085500046000108542003600568655002500604655002900629SGKJC800aChampion Jockey: Gallop Racer & GI Jockey 1bKoei Tecmo Gamesc2011-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aChampion Jockey uses motion control functionality to simulate the jockey experience to a degree of accuracy beyond anything you've ever played in a horse racing game. Players will learn how to use the horse’s reins and whip as well shifting their body-weight to ride their thorough-bred to victory. In addition to controlling their horse, players must understand its unique rhythm, potential, stamina and preferred racing style to truly master the game.  i2011kKoei Tecmo GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00767na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004600007264002500053300002300078500046000101542003000561655002500591655002900616SGKPC800aChampion Jockey: G1 Jockey & Gallop Racer 1bKoei Tecmoc2011-9-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aChampion Jockey uses motion control functionality to simulate the jockey experience to a degree of accuracy beyond anything you've ever played in a horse racing game. Players will learn how to use the horse’s reins and whip as well shifting their body-weight to ride their thorough-bred to victory. In addition to controlling their horse, players must understand its unique rhythm, potential, stamina and preferred racing style to truly master the game.  i2011kKoei TecmosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00334na  a2200109   4500