bstance Traptanium and home to Skylands' most nefarious baddies. In an attempt to build his own army of foes, Kaos blows up the prison, releasing the most wanted villains and blasting shards of Traptanium to Earth in the form of Traps. Now it's up to Portal Masters to recapture all of the escaped villains using powerful Traptanium Traps and defeat Kaos before it's too late!  i2014kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00867na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002600033300002300059500058000082542003000662655002500692655002800717SK8E5200aSkylanders: Trap Team 1bActivisionc2014-10-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Skylanders Trap Team, Kaos continues his ongoing quest to rule over Skylands. He has discovered the location of the legendary Cloudcracker Prison -- a fortress built entirely out of the magical substance Traptanium and home to Skylands' most nefarious baddies. In an attempt to build his own army of foes, Kaos blows up the prison, releasing the most wanted villains and blasting shards of Traptanium to Earth in the form of Traps. Now it's up to Portal Masters to recapture all of the escaped villains using powerful Traptanium Traps and defeat Kaos before it's too late!  i2014kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00867na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002700032300002300059500058000082542003000662655002500692655002800717SK8I5200aSkylanders Trap Team 1bActivisionc2014-10-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Skylanders Trap Team, Kaos continues his ongoing quest to rule over Skylands. He has discovered the location of the legendary Cloudcracker Prison -- a fortress built entirely out of the magical substance Traptanium and home to Skylands' most nefarious baddies. In an attempt to build his own army of foes, Kaos blows up the prison, releasing the most wanted villains and blasting shards of Traptanium to Earth in the form of Traps. Now it's up to Portal Masters to recapture all of the escaped villains using powerful Traptanium Traps and defeat Kaos before it's too late!  i2014kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00867na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002600033300002300059500058000082542003000662655002500692655002800717SK8P5200aSkylanders: Trap Team 1bActivisionc2014-10-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Skylanders Trap Team, Kaos continues his ongoing quest to rule over Skylands. He has discovered the location of the legendary Cloudcracker Prison -- a fortress built entirely out of the magical substance Traptanium and home to Skylands' most nefarious baddies. In an attempt to build his own army of foes, Kaos blows up the prison, releasing the most wanted villains and blasting shards of Traptanium to Earth in the form of Traps. Now it's up to Portal Masters to recapture all of the escaped villains using powerful Traptanium Traps and defeat Kaos before it's too late!  i2014kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00868na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002700033300002300060500058000083542003000663655002500693655002800718SK8V5200aSkylanders: Trap Team 1bActivisionc2014-10-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Skylanders Trap Team, Kaos continues his ongoing quest to rule over Skylands. He has discovered the location of the legendary Cloudcracker Prison -- a fortress built entirely out of the magical substance Traptanium and home to Skylands' most nefarious baddies. In an attempt to build his own army of foes, Kaos blows up the prison, releasing the most wanted villains and blasting shards of Traptanium to Earth in the form of Traps. Now it's up to Portal Masters to recapture all of the escaped villains using powerful Traptanium Traps and defeat Kaos before it's too late!  i2014kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00864na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002300033300002300056500058000079542003000659655002500689655002800714SK8X5200aSkylanders: Trap Team 1bActivisionc2018--  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Skylanders Trap Team, Kaos continues his ongoing quest to rule over Skylands. He has discovered the location of the legendary Cloudcracker Prison -- a fortress built entirely out of the magical substance Traptanium and home to Skylands' most nefarious baddies. In an attempt to build his own army of foes, Kaos blows up the prison, releasing the most wanted villains and blasting shards of Traptanium to Earth in the form of Traps. Now it's up to Portal Masters to recapture all of the escaped villains using powerful Traptanium Traps and defeat Kaos before it's too late!  i2018kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00733na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002200035300002300057500045500080542002600535655002400561655002600585SKAEA400aKaraoke Revolution Glee 1bKonamic2010-11-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aCalling all “gleeks!” For the very first time, fans will get a chance to perform their hearts out in this year’s version of Karaoke Revolution Glee. Filled with the show’s main characters, memorable scenes, and the unforgettable songs from Season 1, players of all ages will experience glee like never before. Belt out to chart-topping glee tunes, reenact scenes with friends and family, take center stage and own the moment on Wii this Fall!  i2010kKonamisGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00570na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002300035300002300058500029100081542002600372655002400398655002600422SKAPA400aKaraoke Revolution Glee 1bKonamic2010-11-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aKaraoke Revolution Glee, out now for Wii, will feature the chart-topping music and captivating performances from one of the most talked about shows of the year. The game will give fans the chance to enter the role of the ultimate underdog as they perform the songs featured on the show.  i2010kKonamisGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00959na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004100007264002800048300002300076500062200099542003200721655002400753655002400777655002400801SKBEG900aKidz Bop Dance Party! The Video Game 1bD3 Publisherc2010-9-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aKidz Bop Dance Party is a rhythm game where you hold the Wii Remote in your right hand and dance along with the avatar onscreen. You don't have to perform the moves exactly, but dancing along is a bit easier than swinging your arms when the arrows appear, because it's all about timing. Even if you're making some outrageous gestures, as long as you are more or less following along, you'll do just fine. Your score is tallied at the end to see how well you shook your bon bon--wait, that's not it. If you're too embarrassed to do this on your own, bring a friend along and see who's the better dancer in Versus mode.  i2010kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00535na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264002000034300002300054500025700077542002300334655002500357655003100382SKCE2000aBigfoot: King of Crush 1bZooc2011-10-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aCrush cars and break records as Bigfoot comes to you larger than life in 3D! Unleash the power of Bigfoot as you demolish metal, shatter glass and win championships. Prove you're the baddest Bigfoot around, and the competition will be eatin' your dust!  i2011kZoosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aTruck racing games2wiiext00408na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264002700048300002300075500010700098542003100205655002400236655002600260SKDJ1800aKaraoke Joysound Wii: Duet Kyoku-hen 1bHudson Softc2010-6-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aKaraoke Joysound Wii Duet Song, features 50 Japanese songs that are designed for two people including:  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00311na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004600007264002700053300002300080500000500103542003100108655002400139655002600163SKEJ1800aKaraoke Joysound Wii: Enka Kayoukyoku-hen 1bHudson Softc2010-6-10  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00919na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002100045300002300066500063200089542002600721655002400747655002600771SKGEA400aKaraoke Revolution Glee: Volume 2 1bKonamic2011-4-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe reach of Gleekdom knows no bounds. The singing sensation keeps rolling with Karaoke Revolution Glee Volume 2! Become part of everyone's favorite glee club, New Directions, and perform duets with the show's most popular characters. Choose from 20 memorable performances from the second half of Glee's first season. You'll share a "Bad Romance" with Kurt, blow the crowd out of the water with Mercedes on "Like a Prayer," and share the stage with Jesse St. James. Use vocal enhancers to boost and tweak your performance, collect special items in Scrapbook Mode, and watch extended and never-before-seen footage from the show.  i2011kKonamisGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00920na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002200045300002300067500063200090542002600722655002400748655002600772SKGPA400aKaraoke Revolution Glee: Volume 2 1bKonamic2011-5-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe reach of Gleekdom knows no bounds. The singing sensation keeps rolling with Karaoke Revolution Glee Volume 2! Become part of everyone's favorite glee club, New Directions, and perform duets with the show's most popular characters. Choose from 20 memorable performances from the second half of Glee's first season. You'll share a "Bad Romance" with Kurt, blow the crowd out of the water with Mercedes on "Like a Prayer," and share the stage with Jesse St. James. Use vocal enhancers to boost and tweak your performance, collect special items in Scrapbook Mode, and watch extended and never-before-seen footage from the show.  i2011kKonamisGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00668na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003700007264002200044300002300066500033800089542002500427655002500452655002700477655003000504SKHJAF00aKamen Rider: Super Climax Heroes 1bNamcoc2012-11-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe 2012 entry of the Kamen Rider Climax Heroes series. The controls and mechanics have been revamped, with playstyles similar to a free-roam Marvel vs Capcom. Several new Riders were added to the roster, including Kamen Rider Wizard Kamen Rider Meteor and other secondary Riders from other series such as Gills, Chalice and Sasword.  i2012kNamcosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext00693na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264001800031300002300049500046300072542002300535655002500558SKJE7800aYou Don't Know Jack 1bTHQc2011-2-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aYOU DON'T KNOW JACK, the original quiz show party game, is back and trivia-y-er than ever! You're the contestant in a truly interactive game show experience, complete with cash, prizes, backstage characters, pounding music, bizarre sound effects and your lovable yet verbally sassy host, Cookie Masterson. Play at home or online - alone or with friends - as you battle through a trivia mind-field on your way to victory, defeat or, more likely, soiled pants.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aTrivia games2wiiext01024na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004200007264003400049300002300083500068600106542003800792655002800830655004400858SKKPHY00aCaptain Morgane and the Golden Turtle 1bReef Entertainmentc2012-3-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aAdventure was always in her blood. From being a pirate captain’s daughter to becoming the Caribbean’s first female pirate captain herself; Morgane Castillo was never going to lead a boring life! Join Morgane as she grows up from an innocent 8 year old island girl to becoming the most famous pirate of the Caribbean! Join her in her adventure as she seeks out the mysterious treasure of the Golden Turtle and help her solve the mysteries and puzzles as well as outwit her enemies along the way. Help her recruit her crew, explore over 50 locations on 5 beautiful and exotic islands in the Caribbean sea, but above all try to keep her out of trouble…she is a pirate after all!  i2012kReef EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPoint-and-click adventure games2wiiext01024na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004200007264003400049300002300083500068600106542003800792655002800830655004400858SKKXHY00aCaptain Morgane and the Golden Turtle 1bReef Entertainmentc2012-3-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aAdventure was always in her blood. From being a pirate captain’s daughter to becoming the Caribbean’s first female pirate captain herself; Morgane Castillo was never going to lead a boring life! Join Morgane as she grows up from an innocent 8 year old island girl to becoming the most famous pirate of the Caribbean! Join her in her adventure as she seeks out the mysterious treasure of the Golden Turtle and help her solve the mysteries and puzzles as well as outwit her enemies along the way. Help her recruit her crew, explore over 50 locations on 5 beautiful and exotic islands in the Caribbean sea, but above all try to keep her out of trouble…she is a pirate after all!  i2012kReef EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPoint-and-click adventure games2wiiext00257na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264002600038300002300064500000500087542003000092655002500122SKLDSV00aK11: Kommissare im Einsatz 1bSevenGamesc2010-4-14  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kSevenGamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00631na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264003400040300002300074500035900097542003800456655002700494SKMJAF00aKamen Rider: Climax Heroes W 1bNamco Bandai Gamesc2009-12-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aKamen Rider: Climax Heroes W features Kamen Rider Double from Kamen Rider W, which premiered after the release of the original Climax Heroes, as a playable character, as well as various kaijin such as Worms and Dopants. Although a reading for the letter "W" in the title is not given, it refers both to the new series W and the Wii platform for the game.  i2009kNamco Bandai GamessGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00678na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003700007264002600044300002300070500042000093542003000513655002500543SKNE5200aSkylanders: SuperChargers Racing 1bActivisionc2015-9-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aReady. Set. Race! Skylanders, start your engines! The infamous race promoter Pandergast has challenged the best racers in Skylands to come forward and test their driving skills in a head-to-head, no-holds-barred driving competition! Race across Land, Sea, and Sky for the ultimate prize - a mysterious token of immense power! Kick start your Skylanders adventure into overdrive with Skylanders SuperChargers Racing.  i2015kActivisionsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00739na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002600044300002300070500044100093542003000534655002800564655002500592SKNP5200aSkylanders: SuperChargers Racing 1bActivisionc2015-10-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aSkylands is in peril in Skylanders SuperChargers on Wii Kaos hasunleashed his most evil weapon yet – the Doomstation of Ultimate Doomstruction. With all of Skylands on the verge of collapse a special team called the SuperChargers has been assembled to pilot an unstoppable fleet of incredible vehicles. Now you and the SuperChargers must embark on epic adventures over land under sea and through the sky to stop Kaos and save Skylands  i2015kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00867na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002300045300002300068500057800091542002600669655002400695655002600719SKOEA400aKaraoke Revolution Glee: Volume 3 1bKonamic2011-11-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Gleek-out continues as the McKinley High Glee Club returns with their biggest selection of hits yet! The hit show is only two seasons old, but this is already the third volume of Karaoke favorites unleashed by the unstoppable prime-time pop powerhouse. Sing along with your favorite characters from the show's cast in 35 of their greatest performances from Glee's second season. Relive the most memorable moments from "Auditions," "Britney/Brittany," "The Rocky Horror Glee Show," and other episodes. Make it a party with multiplayer games geared for up to four Gleeks.  i2011kKonamisGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00865na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002200045300002300067500057700090542002600667655002400693655002600717SKOPA400aKaraoke Revolution Glee: Volume 3 1bKonamic2011-12-7  a1 Wii optical disc  ahe Gleek-out continues as the McKinley High Glee Club returns with their biggest selection of hits yet! The hit show is only two seasons old, but this is already the third volume of Karaoke favorites unleashed by the unstoppable prime-time pop powerhouse. Sing along with your favorite characters from the show's cast in 35 of their greatest performances from Glee's second season. Relive the most memorable moments from "Auditions," "Britney/Brittany," "The Rocky Horror Glee Show," and other episodes. Make it a party with multiplayer games geared for up to four Gleeks.  i2011kKonamisGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00907na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264002900038300002300067500064800090542003200738655002700770SKREG900aKamen Rider: Dragon Knight 1bD3 Publisherc2009-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay as all 13 Kamen Riders from the Kamen Rider Dragon Knight TV series, each with their own unique Contract Beasts, Advent cards, and special abilities - More than 65 exciting missions on Ventara will test the skill of your Kamen Riders - Battle head to head with your favorite Kamen Riders in a unique battle system utilizing Contract Beasts and Advent cards. (2 player versus only available on Wii version) - Earn extra Advent cards and unlock additional special abilities that could be used on multiple game modes - Simple but versatile controls allow players of all skill levels to pull off their favorite Kamen Rider moves from the show  i2009kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00979na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001300007264002500020300002300045500070600068542002900774655002500803655002900828SKSE5400aNBA 2K13 1b2K Sportsc2012-10-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the era of the Big Three, it's only fitting that NBA 2K13 showcases three cover athletes for the first time ever. The premier NBA experience expands its rule with new gameplay improvements and production values boosted by executive producer Jay-Z. Use a new control scheme that concentrates dribbling, passing, shooting, and other offense moves in the Right Analog Stick for fluid on-court control. Take over the game using the Signature Skills of your favorite superstars, from Derrick Rose leading the charge as The Floor General to the Durant icing the game as The Closer. Create shots with a new Dynamic Shot Generator, use a revamped fast-break passing system to visit Lob City, and much more.  i2012k2K SportssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBasketball games2wiiext00998na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001300007264003500020300002300055500070600078542003800784655002500822655002900847SKSP5400aNBA 2K13 1bTake 2 Interactivec2012-10-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the era of the Big Three, it's only fitting that NBA 2K13 showcases three cover athletes for the first time ever. The premier NBA experience expands its rule with new gameplay improvements and production values boosted by executive producer Jay-Z. Use a new control scheme that concentrates dribbling, passing, shooting, and other offense moves in the Right Analog Stick for fluid on-court control. Take over the game using the Signature Skills of your favorite superstars, from Derrick Rose leading the charge as The Floor General to the Durant icing the game as The Closer. Create shots with a new Dynamic Shot Generator, use a revamped fast-break passing system to visit Lob City, and much more.  i2012kTake 2 InteractivesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBasketball games2wiiext00694na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002000007264001900027300002300046500038500069542002300454655002500477655002700502655003100529SKTE7800aAll Star Karate 1bTHQc2010-4-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn All Star Karate, players will follow the life of a young, martial arts novice whose noble attempt to save an elderly man from a pack of ninjas brings him face-to-face with a true karate master. The sensei, a cantankerous old-timer, offers his services and teaches his new protégé the proper techniques and disciplines of karate and guides him toward achieving the black belt.  i2010kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aMartial arts games2wiiext00736na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002000007264001900027300002300046500038500069542002300454655002500477655002700502655003100529655003000560SKTP7800aAll Star Karate 1bTHQc2010-5-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn All Star Karate, players will follow the life of a young, martial arts novice whose noble attempt to save an elderly man from a pack of ninjas brings him face-to-face with a true karate master. The sensei, a cantankerous old-timer, offers his services and teaches his new protégé the proper techniques and disciplines of karate and guides him toward achieving the black belt.  i2010kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aMartial arts games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext00624na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264001900027300002300046500035700069542002300426655002500449655002800474SKUE7800aKung Fu Panda 2 1bTHQc2011-5-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aKung Fu is at risk of being gone forever! In an original story, players are plunged into the video game after the movie ends. At the summons of the Kung Fu council, comprised of masters Shifu, Croc and Ox, players must help Po and the Furious Five defeat looting wolves, powerful gorillas and clans of sneaky Komodo Dragons, all in the name of Kung Fu!  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00662na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002000007264001900027300002300046500035700069542002300426655002500449655002800474655002600502SKUP7800aKung Fu Panda 2 1bTHQc2011-6-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aKung Fu is at risk of being gone forever! In an original story, players are plunged into the video game after the movie ends. At the summons of the Kung Fu council, comprised of masters Shifu, Croc and Ox, players must help Po and the Furious Five defeat looting wolves, powerful gorillas and clans of sneaky Komodo Dragons, all in the name of Kung Fu!  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aDrawing games2wiiext00636na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264001900039300002300058500035700081542002300438655002500461655002800486SKUZ7800aKung Fu Panda 2 (Exclusive) 1bTHQc2011-5-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aKung Fu is at risk of being gone forever! In an original story, players are plunged into the video game after the movie ends. At the summons of the Kung Fu council, comprised of masters Shifu, Croc and Ox, players must help Po and the Furious Five defeat looting wolves, powerful gorillas and clans of sneaky Komodo Dragons, all in the name of Kung Fu!  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00850na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003600007264002500043300002300068500051600091542002900607655002500636655002900661655002600690SKVE2000aKevin VanDam Big Bass Challenge 1bZoo Gamesc2010-12-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aIf you have ever dreamed of becoming a Bass Master Champion, now is your chance! Six-time Angler of the Year winner Kevin Van Dam will provide expert advice as you go from amateur fisherman to pro angler. Choose your boat, fishing rod, and lure wisely to attract largemouth, smallmouth, and spotted bass. Compete in tournaments against the man himself, KVD, and show him who the better bass man is. Earn money for each catch and spend it on fancy new equipment like a GPS or a Depth Finder to better track fish.  i2010kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFishing games2wiiext00350na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264003400031300002300065500004700088542003800135655002500173655003000198SKWPNK00aCocoto Kart Racer 2 1bNeko Entertainmentc2011-12-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe new four-wheeled adventures of Cocoto!  i2011kNeko EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00833na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264002500024300002300049500055700072542002900629655002500658655002800683SKXE2000aPirate Blast 1bZoo Gamesc2011-2-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aSay yo-ho-ho and fire your guns as you try and stop a band of evil pirates in this swashbuckling action-shooter. Captain Greasebeard has set his sights on the Vile Isle, and the evil captain has built an army of Henchbots to take over the island. Put a stop to the Captain's plans by taking aim at the Henchbots and battling your way to an ultimate showdown with Greasebeard himself. Blast through enemies in eight chapters set in a variety of pirate-inspired locations. You can take aim with your Wii Remote or use a compatible Wii Shooter peripheral.  i2011kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00666na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264002600024300002300050500038900073542002900462655002500491655002800516SKXPFH00aPirate Blast 1bZoo Gamesc2012-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aCaptain Greasebeard and his evil Henchbots are determined to take over Vile Isle, and it's up to you to save the innocent and destroy the evil swashbucklers in Pirate Blast. Destroy as many of the Captain's Henchbots as possible, and fight your way to the end to face off with Greasebeard himself. Restor order and defeat Captain Greasebeard or find yourself walking the plank, matey.  i2012kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00686na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002300007264002700030300002300057500032000080542003000400655002500430655002800455655002700483655003000510SKYE5200aSkylanders: Giants 1bActivisionc2012-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aThousands of years ago, the Giants fought epic battles in Skylands but were banished to Earth. With a new threat looming, it's time to bring them back to join forces with the Skylanders to defeat KAOS. Only you can put them on the Portal of Power® to unleash their strength in the ultimate battle to save Skylands!  i2012kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00646na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002300007264002700030300002300057500032000080542003000400655002500430655002700455655003000482SKYP5200aSkylanders: Giants 1bActivisionc2012-10-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aThousands of years ago, the Giants fought epic battles in Skylands but were banished to Earth. With a new threat looming, it's time to bring them back to join forces with the Skylanders to defeat KAOS. Only you can put them on the Portal of Power® to unleash their strength in the ultimate battle to save Skylands!  i2012kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00646na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002300007264002700030300002300057500032000080542003000400655002500430655002700455655003000482SKYX5200aSkylanders: Giants 1