stars race, they don't call in stunt doubles! Your favorite characters from DreamWorks animated films hit the track for a racing extravaganza that's as outrageous as some of their movies. Compete for the checkered flag with the stars of Shrek, Madagascar, Monsters Vs. Aliens, and How to Train Your Dragon. Choose from a variety of different races, including Time Trial, Circuit,  Battle, and four-player split screen. Use power-ups to rocket past the competition on twisting turning tracks filled with challenges of their own. Announcer King Julien is on hand to call all the action.  i2011kActivisionsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00860na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264002700039300002300066500060600089542003000695655002500725SKZP5200aDreamWorks Super Star Kartz 1bActivisionc2011-11-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen these movie stars race, they don't call in stunt doubles! Your favorite characters from DreamWorks animated films hit the track for a racing extravaganza that's as outrageous as some of their movies. Compete for the checkered flag with the stars of Shrek, Madagascar, Monsters Vs. Aliens, and How to Train Your Dragon. Choose from a variety of different races, including Time Trial, Circuit,  Battle, and four-player split screen. Use power-ups to rocket past the competition on twisting turning tracks filled with challenges of their own. Announcer King Julien is on hand to call all the action.  i2011kActivisionsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00685na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002500007264002400032300002300056500035700079542002800436655002500464655002800489655003400517SL2J0100aZero: Shinku no Chou 1bNintendoc2012-6-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience the story of twin sisters Mio and Mayu Amakura, who find themselves trapped in the 'Lost Village'. With the Camera Obscura, a device that has the power to seal away ghosts and reveal past events, the pair must solve the mysteries of the ghost-ridden village to escape. As the story continues, more light is shed on the village's tragic past.  i2012kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSurvival horror games2wiiext00692na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003200007264002400039300002300063500035700086542002800443655002500471655002800496655003400524SL2P0100aProject Zero 2: Wii Edition 1bNintendoc2012-6-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience the story of twin sisters Mio and Mayu Amakura, who find themselves trapped in the 'Lost Village'. With the Camera Obscura, a device that has the power to seal away ghosts and reveal past events, the pair must solve the mysteries of the ghost-ridden village to escape. As the story continues, more light is shed on the village's tragic past.  i2012kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSurvival horror games2wiiext00923na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002600007264003400033300002300067500057800090542003700668655002800705655002500733655003100758SL3ENR00aDragon's Lair Trilogy 1bDestineer Studiosc2010-10-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience the fantasy adventures that became a cultural phenomenon! Game publisher Destineer today announces a partnership with Digital Leisure Inc. to develop Dragon’s Lair Trilogy, bringing three timeless arcade adventures together on one disc for Wii™: Dragon’s Lair, Dragon’s Lair 2: Time Warp, and Space Ace. For the first time ever on a console platform, you can experience the stunning visuals and engaging storylines from all three of these classic arcade games created by legendary American animator Don Bluth. Lead on brave adventurer, your quest awaits!  i2010kDestineer StudiossGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aInteractive movies2wiiext00342na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003800007264002900045300002300074500000500097542003200102655002400134655002400158655002600182SL4PAF00aLos 40 Principales: Karaoke Party