sis system powered by groundbreaking physics. Unleash fire-bending bombs and blasts as Zuko, use stealth weapons as his Blue Spirit ninja alter-ego, and create tornadoes, vortexes and more as Aang, the last Airbender. Master your Firebending and Airbending abilities as you win epic battles, defeat powerful foes, and harness magical powers unlike anything you've ever seen.  i2010kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00718na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264001900030300002300049500044800072542002300520655002500543655002800568SLAP7804aThe Last Airbender 1bTHQc2010-7-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aExclusive Toys R Us Content: This version of the video game includes exclusive content and a new game mode:player vs.player. Enter the Southern Water Tribe and The Spiritual Place, two EXCLUSIVE ARENAS that are pivotal scenes from the movie.New Intense player vs. player combat as Aang, Zuko or Blue Spirit can battle each other only in this exclusive version of the game. Enter the world of The Last Airbender and discover you bending powers!  i2010kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00707na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264001900048300002300067500041900090542002300509655002500532655002800557SLAX7804aThe Last Airbender (Special Edition) 1bTHQc2010-7-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis version of the video game includes exclusive content and a new game mode:player vs.player. Enter the Southern Water Tribe and The Spiritual Place, two EXCLUSIVE ARENAS that are pivotal scenes from the movie.New Intense player vs. player combat as Aang, Zuko or Blue Spirit can battle each other only in this exclusive version of the game. Enter the world of The Last Airbender and discover you bending powers!  i2010kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00730na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264001900042300002300061500044800084542002300532655002500555655002800580SLAZ7804aThe Last Airbender (Toys R Us) 1bTHQc2010-6-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aExclusive Toys R Us Content: This version of the video game includes exclusive content and a new game mode:player vs.player. Enter the Southern Water Tribe and The Spiritual Place, two EXCLUSIVE ARENAS that are pivotal scenes from the movie.New Intense player vs. player combat as Aang, Zuko or Blue Spirit can battle each other only in this exclusive version of the game. Enter the world of The Last Airbender and discover you bending powers!  i2010kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00477na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264002800028300002300056500019600079542003200275655002400307655002400331SLCEGN00aGet Up and Dance 1bOxygen Gamesc2011-12-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet Up and Dance is the ultimate dancing game for everyone to play, whether you are the star performer or prefer to stay out of the limelight as a backing dancer, Get Up and Dance is for you.  i2011kOxygen GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00477na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264002800028300002300056500019600079542003200275655002400307655002400331SLCPGN00aGet Up and Dance 1bOxygen Gamesc2011-11-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet Up And Dance is the ultimate dancing game for everyone to play, whether you are the star performer or prefer to stay out of the limelight as a backing dancer, Get Up And Dance is for you.  i2011kOxygen GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00893na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003600023300002300059500060100082542004000683655002400723655002400747SLDEYG00aLet's Dance 1bMaximum Family Gamesc2012-7-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aIf what you want, what you really, really want is to dance like the pros, then check out this how-to featuring one of the best: former Spice Girl Mel B! Learn smash-hit moves from the smash-hit star as you groove to the sounds of 28 dance floor favorites from artists like Lady Gaga, Rihanna, Pussycat Dolls, Gloria Gaynor, Culture Club, and more. Choose from a range of friendly styles like pop, '80s, and party classics designed to get everyone into the groove. The game monitors your standings on local and online leader boards and Mel checks in with advice on how to improve your performance.  i2012kMaximum Family GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00414na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264002600034300002300060500013100083542003000214655002400244655002400268SLDPLG00aLet's Dance with Mel B 1bBlack Beanc2011-6-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin Melanie Brown as she takes the gamer through a range of dancercizes that are not only fun but will keep them fit as well.  i2011kBlack BeansGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00928na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264001900033300002300052500065500075542002300730655002700753655002600780SLEE7800aDeepak Chopra's Leela 1bTHQc2011-11-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aMany games vow to awaken a character's spirit within. Leela does it within you. Take an interactive journey unlike any other in this experience designed to align your mind, body, and spirit. Mind/body wellness guru Deepak Chopra has created a journey designed to sharpen your awareness of your body's seven energy centers, bringing them into harmony through seven motion-based stages. Focus on each of your seven Chakras as you relax, stretch, breathe, and meditate accompanied by immersive visuals and atmospheric sounds. The exercises are designed to be done at your pace, allowing you to grow naturally into balanced harmony and greater awareness.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aCoaching games2wiiext 7aFitness games2wiiext00929na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002000033300002300053500065500076542002300731655002700754655002600781SLEP7800aDeepak Chopra's Leela 1bTHQc2011-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMany games vow to awaken a character's spirit within. Leela does it within you. Take an interactive journey unlike any other in this experience designed to align your mind, body, and spirit. Mind/body wellness guru Deepak Chopra has created a journey designed to sharpen your awareness of your body's seven energy centers, bringing them into harmony through seven motion-based stages. Focus on each of your seven Chakras as you relax, stretch, breathe, and meditate accompanied by immersive visuals and atmospheric sounds. The exercises are designed to be done at your pace, allowing you to grow naturally into balanced harmony and greater awareness.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aCoaching games2wiiext 7aFitness games2wiiext00291na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002700022300002300049500001600072542003100088655002400119655002600143SLFPKM00aLet's Sing 1bDeep Silverc2012-11-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aTrack list:  i2012kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00350na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003700007264002800044300002300072500001600095542003100111655002400142655002400166655002600190SLFXKM00aLet's Sing 5: Versión Española 1bDeep Silverc2013-12-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aTrack list:  i2013kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00611na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264003000027300002300057500032600080542003300406655002400439655002600463SLGEYG00aLet's Sing 2016 1bMaximum Gamesc2015-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your mic and sing your heart out! Featuring 35 chart hits from some of the world’s biggest artists, Let’s Sing gives you the stage to be the star you know you are! Play with friends and go head to head in Battle mode or put your talents together in Duet mode. With 7 exciting ways to play, the party never stops!  i2015kMaximum GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00607na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002800027300002300055500032600078542003100404655002400435655002600459SLGPKM00aLet's Sing 2016 1bDeep Silverc2015-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your mic and sing your heart out! Featuring 35 chart hits from some of the world’s biggest artists, Let’s Sing gives you the stage to be the star you know you are! Play with friends and go head to head in Battle mode or put your talents together in Duet mode. With 7 exciting ways to play, the party never stops!  i2015kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00972na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264006000040300002300100500061100123542006300734655002500797655002800822SLHEWR00aLEGO Harry Potter: Years 5-7 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2011-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aSummon your magical side for the thrilling conclusion of the Harry Potter saga. The story that was told in three books and four movies, is one unforgettable LEGO adventure! Play through 24 of the story's biggest events and encounter over 80 Harry Potter characters. Visit the Ministry of Magic and Diagon Alley, journey to Godric's Hollow, and more. Use powerful new magic, including the Unforgivable Curses, to battle the Dark Lord's army and his Death Eaters. Master your charms and spells. You'll need them all for the showdown that's been building for seven years, the final battle with Lord Voldemort!  i2011kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00877na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264006000040300002300100500051600123542006300639655002500702655002800727SLHPWR00aLEGO Harry Potter: Years 5-7 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2011-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on the last three Harry Potter books and final four films, LEGO® Harry Potter™: Years 5-7 takes players through Harry Potter’s heroic adventures in the Muggle™ and wizarding worlds. From Privet Drive in Little Whinging to Diagon Alley™, Hogsmeade™ and Hogwarts™ – plus new locations including Grimmauld Place, the Ministry of Magic, and Godric’s Hollow – players will encounter new faces, new challenges and new magic, preparing them for the ultimate face-off against Lord Voldemort™.  i2011kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00522na  a2200133   4500001000700000245005300007264003500060300002300095500015400118542003900272655002500311655002700336655002500363SLIE5200aLittle League World Series Baseball: Double Play 1bActivision-Blizzardc2010-7-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis double-pack of baseball games celebrated the Little League World Series with the 2008 and 2009 versions of the popular franchise all in one box.  i2010kActivision-BlizzardsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00619na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002700044300002300071500032200094542003100416655002400447655002600471SLJPKM00aLet's Sing 8: Versión Española 1bDeep Silverc2015-10-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your mic and sing your heart out! Featuring 35 chart hits from some of the world's biggest artists, Let's Sing gives you the stage to be the star you know you are! Play with friends and go head to head in Battle mode or put your talents together in Duet mode. With 7 exciting ways to play, the party never stops!  i2015kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00300na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002700042300002300069500000500092542003100097655002400128655002600152SLKPKM00aLet's Sing 2016: Hits Francais 1bRavenscourtc2015-11-6  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2015kRavenscourtsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00926na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003700007264003100044300002300075500058000098542003400678655002500712655002700737655002800764SLLEWW00aLucha Libre AAA: Heroes del Ring 1bSlang / Konamic2011-12-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aLucha Libre AAA: Héroes del Ring is an action sports game based on Mexican sport of 'Lucha Libre' style wrestling. The first video game to cover Mexican wrestling, Lucha Libre AAA: Héroes del Ring features dozens of real wrestlers from Mexico's premiere wrestling federation. Each of these possesses the acrobatic, over-the-top action that Lucha Libre, and which inspired modern professional wrestling around the world. Additional game features include: a popularity based scoring system, the ability to create you own luchador, authentic Mexican wrestling venues and more.  i2011kSlang / KonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00322na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004500007264003300052300002300085500000500108542003700113655002400150655002600174SLMPWL00aLos 40 Principales: Karaoke Party Vol. 2 1bWired Productionsc2016-1-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2016kWired ProductionssGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00655na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264007500025300002300100500028100123542007900404655002400483655002600507SLNP7M00aLa Voz Vol. 3 1bAsmik Ace Entertainment Inc./ Wired Productions / Le Cortexc2016-1-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aHe lives in this third installment of the official video game experience "Voice" closer than ever, with new features and game modes. You can choose from among 30 current hits the perfect song that show your talent to the coaches, from the blind auditions to the final assault.  i2016kAsmik Ace Entertainment Inc./ Wired Productions / Le CortexsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00354na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264003400034300002300068500000500091542003800096655002500134655002800159655003300187SLPP5D04aThe Spirit of the Wolf 1bMidway / Tradewestc2009-12-4  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kMidway / TradewestsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00974na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264006000038300002300098500061500121542006300736655002500799655002800824SLREWR00aLEGO The Lord of the Rings 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2012-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience the incredible Lord of the Rings Trilogy as told by little LEGO figures in this saga that captures The Fellowship of the Ring, The Two Towers, and The Return of the King in one epic journey. Join the fellowship and travel across Middle-earth with Frodo, Sam, Gandalf, Aragon, Merry, Pippin, Gimli, Legolas and other favorites, with 60 total playable characters in all! Use magical items, battle Orcs, and experience unforgettable scenes with dialog straight out of the films. Use the magic of the Seeing Stone to jump between multiple storylines in play where friends can drop in or out at any time.  i2012kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00824na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264006000038300002300098500046500121542006300586655002500649655002800674SLRPWR00aLEGO The Lord of the Rings 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2012-11-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aLEGO The Lord of the Rings is based on The Lord of the Rings motion picture trilogy and follows the original storylines of The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring, The Lord of the Rings: The Two Towers, and The Lord of the Rings: The Return of the King. Now the entire family can team up in pairs as adorable LEGO The Lord the Rings minifigures to experience countless dangers, solve riddles and battle formidable foes on their journey to Mount Doom.  i2012kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01025na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001900007264002700026300002300053500067500076542003100751655003100782655003800813655004000851SLSEXJ04aThe Last Story 1bXseed Gamesc2012-8-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aEmbark on a quest not just to win victory but to win great honor in this well-scripted adaptation of a Japanese RPG. Play as a warrior-for-hire with mysterious powers and lead your team across an island where a long-simmering conflict between two civilizations is about to explode. Uncover ancient secrets and use an innovative combat system that relies on smart teamwork. Summon your Gathering ability to draw enemy fire so your teammates can recover their health or launch strategic counter-strikes. Battle according to your own skill by using manual commands or use automated attacks. Online play loads up on action, with co-op and vs. battles for two to six players.  i2012kXseed GamessGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aAction role-playing games2wiiext 7aTactical role-playing games2wiiext00593na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002400026300002300050500030100073542002800374655003100402655003800433SLSJ0104aThe Last Story 1bNintendoc2011-1-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Last Story is a JRPG for the Wii console from Hironobu Sakaguchi that lets you take charge of a band of mercenaries and journey with them into a sprawling cinematic adventure. Enjoy the adventure alone in this epic Wii game or jump into online multiplayer modes with up to five other players.  i2011kNintendosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aAction role-playing games2wiiext00630na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001900007264002400026300002300050500030100073542002800374655002500402655003100427655003800458SLSP0104aThe Last Story 1bNintendoc2012-2-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Last Story is a JRPG for the Wii console from Hironobu Sakaguchi that lets you take charge of a band of mercenaries and journey with them into a sprawling cinematic adventure. Enjoy the adventure alone in this epic Wii game or jump into online multiplayer modes with up to five other players.  i2012kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aAction role-playing games2wiiext00802na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005700007264002800064300002300092500052000115542003100635655002600666SLTEJJ00aNewU Fitness First Mind Body: Yoga & Pilates Workout 1bDeep Silverc2010-12-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake a deep breath, relax, and let one of three personal trainers guide you through the world of Yoga and Pilates. Perform 117 standard Yoga and Pilates exercises designed for men and women to combat the physical and psychological stresses of everyday life. Get the most out of your workout utilizing the Wii Balance Board and Wii MotionPlus for accurate feedback. Create and follow a specifically-targeted training schedule to reach your overall goals. Choose one of six tranquil locations for your serene routine.  i2010kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aFitness games2wiiext00374na  a2200133   4500001000700000245005700007264003200064300002300096500000500119542003600124655002700160655002700187655002600214SLTPLG00aNewU Fitness First Mind Body: Yoga & Pilates Workout 1bBlack Bean Gamesc2010-3-26  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kBlack Bean GamessGameTDB 7aCoaching games2wiiext 7aExercise games2wiiext 7aFitness games2wiiext00477na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264003800039300002300077500020100100542004200301655002400343SLVP4100aWe Dare: Flirty Fun for All 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2011-3-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aWe Dare is a sexy, quirky party game that offers a large variety of hilarious, innovative and physical, sometimes kinky, challenges. The more friends you invite to the party, the saucier the game!  i2011kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00525na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264003800048300002300086500019900109542004200308655002800350655002500378SLWE4100aWhere's Waldo? The Fantastic Journey 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2009-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on the famous franchise, Where’s Waldo? The Fantastic Journey is an original interactive adventure for the whole family, as you search for the one and only Waldo and his cast of friends.  i2009kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00862na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001200007264003200019300002300051500054100074542003600615655002500651655002800676655002400704SLYESZ00aBeastly 1bStorm City Gamesc2011-2-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aBeastly is a film based on Beauty and the Beast, and the game delivers a fresh take on the movie. You can experience your own version of the Beastly story through the eyes of your own character. Attend Buckston Academy alongside Kyle Kingston, the big man on campus who has it all, only to lose everything when he's cursed with tortured looks. Play 14 mini-games in seven 3D environments straight out of the movie. Connect with characters through the Buckston Academy social network, collect clips and pictures from the movie, and more.  i2011kStorm City GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00817na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001200007264002700019300002300046500054100069542003200610655002500642655002800667SLYPNJ00aBeastly 1bEnjoy Gamingc2011-9-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aBeastly is a film based on Beauty and the Beast, and the game delivers a fresh take on the movie. You can experience your own version of the Beastly story through the eyes of your own character. Attend Buckston Academy alongside Kyle Kingston, the big man on campus who has it all, only to lose everything when he's cursed with tortured looks. Play 14 mini-games in seven 3D environments straight out of the movie. Connect with characters through the Buckston Academy social network, collect clips and pictures from the movie, and more.  i2011kEnjoy GamingsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01038na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264002600030300002300056500075400079542003000833655002700863655002600890SM2E5200a10 Minute Solution 1bActivisionc2010-6-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aSased on the popular exercise DVD series, 10 Minute Solution will bring focused exercise activities to fitness fans with busy schedules, in an affordable and fun way. 10 Minute Solution combines the ease of the popular fitness DVDs with casual gaming fun. The game allows players to construct regimens from a wide variety of 10 minute routine blocks, organized into three main categories: cardio boxing, mixed games and aerobics. 10 Minute Solution is designed to captivate fitness enthusiasts and gamers alike with intense routines that play as a game, unlike other fitness games that simply have the player following a trainer on screen. The game is enhanced when played with the Wii Balance Board, but still offers a fantastic workout without it.  i2010kActivisionsGameTDB 7aCoaching games2wiiext 7aFitness games2wiiext01076na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002300007264002500030300002300055500075400078542003000832655002700862655002700889655002600916SM2P5200a10 Minute Solution 1bActivisionc2010-9-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on the popular exercise DVD series, 10 Minute Solution will bring focused exercise activities to fitness fans with busy schedules, in an affordable and fun way. 10 Minute Solution combines the ease of the popular fitness DVDs with casual gaming fun. The game allows players to construct regimens from a wide variety of 10 minute routine blocks, organized into three main categories: cardio boxing, mixed games and aerobics. 10 Minute Solution is designed to captivate fitness enthusiasts and gamers alike with intense routines that play as a game, unlike other fitness games that simply have the player following a trainer on screen. The game is enhanced when played with the Wii Balance Board, but still offers a fantastic workout without it.  i2010kActivisionsGameTDB 7aCoaching games2wiiext 7aExercise games2wiiext 7aFitness games2wiiext00952na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002600007264005400033300002300087500056000110542005800670655002500728655003400753655003100787SM4E2000aMonster Trucks Mayhem 1bDestination Software / Zoo Games / KSSc2009-9-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aStrap yourself in because it’s time for some Monster Trucks Mayhem!  Enormous tires, incredibly powerful engines, and the shocking excitement of monster truck racing has come exclusively to Wii™!  Put the beasts to the test as you tear through some of the meanest and most challenging tracks devised, destroying whatever lies in your path and smashing opponents off the road.  Roaring, pumping engines!  Destructively powerful tires!  Stunning off-road experiences!  All combine to bring the shocking excitement of Monster Trucks Mayhem home for play.  i2009kDestination Software / Zoo Games / KSSsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aOff-road racing games2wiiext 7aTruck racing games2wiiext00328na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264002800026300002300054500008400077542003200161655002500193SM4PXT00aMonster Trucks 1bFunbox Mediac2012-8-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnormous tires, incredible, massive engine power and the shocking excitement of  i2012kFunbox MediasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00935na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002900033300002300062500064300085542003200728655002500760655002800785SM5EAF00aPower Rangers Samurai 1bNamco Bandaic2011-11-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Power Rangers power up with help from an ancient force as a new generation of heroes rises to battle on Nintendo Wii! Learn to control Fire, Water, Forest, Earth, and Sky as you master the mystical Samurai Symbols of Power. Work together with other Power Ranger Samurai to battle enemies that are invading from the Netherworld. Morph into the Red, Green, Blue, Yellow, or Pink Ranger and use their special weapons to defeat monsters, then combine into a giant Samurai Megazord for huge boss battles. Look for hidden items, discover secret passageways, and collect Zord discs as you build up your powers and fight for ultimate victory!  i2011kNamco BandaisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00934na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002800033300002300061500064300084542003200727655002500759655002800784SM5PAF00aPower Rangers Samurai 1bNamco Bandaic2011-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Power Rangers power up with help from an ancient force as a new generation of heroes rises to battle on Nintendo Wii! Learn to control Fire, Water, Forest, Earth, and Sky as you master the mystical Samurai Symbols of Power. Work together with other Power Ranger Samurai to battle enemies that are invading from the Netherworld. Morph into the Red, Green, Blue, Yellow, or Pink Ranger and use their special weapons to defeat monsters, then combine into a giant Samurai Megazord for huge boss battles. Look for hidden items, discover secret passageways, and collect Zord discs as you build up your powers and fight for ultimate victory!  i2011kNamco BandaisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00804na  a2200157   4500001000700000245003700007264005800044300002300102500033100125542006200456655002400518655002400542655002700566655002700593655002600620SM6PNK00aMy Body Coach 2: Fitness & Dance 1bNeko Entertainment / Diffusion / Naps teamc2011-9-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhether you want to be coached by Valérie Orsoni, or prefer to create your own fitness sessions by choosing from over 130 different exercises, My Body Coach 2 offers you a complete diet and fitness program that you can do at home. Besides the sports coach, you will also benefit from nutritional advice in 170 detailed menus.  i2011kNeko Entertainment / Diffusion / Naps teamsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aCoaching games2wiiext 7aExercise games2wiiext 7aFitness games2wiiext00971na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264003100025300002300056500068300079542003500762655002500797655002700822SM7E6900aMadden NFL 12 1bElectronic Artsc2011-8-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aMadden delivers its most helmet-rattling, bone-crunching edition with an all-new collision system that lowers the boom with the biggest hits yet. Ride your momentum all the way through impact in new tackling animations. Take more control over Xs and Os with highly customizable playbooks. You can also skip the play-calling and let the GameFlow feature take over. New Dynamic Player Performance means players are affected by the type of game - or season - they're having, good or bad. Add in hundreds more refinements to Franchise Mode, superstar development, broadcast presentation, visuals, and player and team animations, and you have an experience that's 100% real gridiron.  i2011kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00910na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002600042300002300068500061600091542003000707655002500737655002600762SM8D5200aCall of Duty: Modern Warfare 3 1bActivisionc2011-11-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aOne man pushes the free world to the brink as Modern Warfare crashes the borders of the most powerful nations on Earth. This campaign is not about flushing out terrorists in far-away locales. It's a desperate fight to survive, right on the homefront. Take up arms to defend England, Germany, France, and the United States in urban settings where freedom is on the line. Multiplayer retains its key features and adds a few choice upgrades, while the action takes a furious new turn with the addition of Survival Mode. Team up with a friend and see how long you can withstand a continuous onslaught of enemy fire.  i2011kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00961na  a2200133   45000010007000002450035000072640026000423000023000685000616000915420