the exotic land of Rio. In this multiplayer video game, Blu goes on the adventure of his life, with the help of his female counterpart, Jewel, and a group of wise-cracking and smooth-talking city birds.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00252na  a2200109   4500001000700000245000800007264001800015300002300033500003900056542002300095655002400118SRIP7800aRio 1bTHQc2011-4-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aBIRDS OF A FEATHER PARTY TOGETHER!  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00279na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264003300045300002300078500000500101542003800106655002500144SRJJAF00aSuper Sentai Battle: Ranger Cross 1bBandai Namco Gamesc2011-9-8  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2011kBandai Namco GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00957na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264002300048300002300071500065900094542002700753655002900780655002600809SRKEFP00aRemington Super Slam Hunting: Alaska 1bMastiffc2011-4-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Alaskan wilderness is home to some of the most ferocious animals on Earth. Here is your chance to pay them a visit! Remington Super Slam Hunting: Alaska sends you into the cold, sometimes snowy wilds of the Alaskan frontier. Choose from 35 authentic weapons - including rifles, handguns, and bows - plus scopes and other accessories from Remington, one of the leading makers of outdoor gear. Hunt 30 of the biggest animals that call Alaska home in 35 different environments. Bring friends along on four-player co-op and competitive hunts, and save some space in that trophy room for the 150-plus trophies and achievements you can rack up as you play.  i2011kMastiffsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00961na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264003000039300002300069500065900092542003300751655002900784655002600813SRKPNK00aRemington Dangerous Animals 1bMastiff Gamesc2011-12-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Alaskan wilderness is home to some of the most ferocious animals on Earth. Here is your chance to pay them a visit! Remington Super Slam Hunting: Alaska sends you into the cold, sometimes snowy wilds of the Alaskan frontier. Choose from 35 authentic weapons - including rifles, handguns, and bows - plus scopes and other accessories from Remington, one of the leading makers of outdoor gear. Hunt 30 of the biggest animals that call Alaska home in 35 different environments. Bring friends along on four-player co-op and competitive hunts, and save some space in that trophy room for the 150-plus trophies and achievements you can rack up as you play.  i2011kMastiff GamessGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00315na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264003200036300002300068500000500091542003600096655002800132655003300160SRLXNL00aReader Rabbit: Preschool 1bNordic Softsalesc2012-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2012kNordic SoftsalessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00678na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264002700036300002300063500038600086542003100472655002800503655002500531SRME1800aRooms: The Main Building 1bHudson Softc2010-3-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aRooms: The Main Building is a breakthrough gaming experience that blends brain-teasing adventure elements with a wholly unique world to create a journey unlike any other. Your adventure begins when an invitation abruptly arrives at your doorstep and diverts you to an entrance of a world filled with mystic beauty. Getting there is the easy part, coming home will be the adventure.  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00672na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264002200040300002300062500038600085542002600471655002800497655002500525SRMJ1800aRooms: Fushigi na Ugoku Heya 1bHudsonc2010-4-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aRooms: The Main Building is a breakthrough gaming experience that blends brain-teasing adventure elements with a wholly unique world to create a journey unlike any other. Your adventure begins when an invitation abruptly arrives at your doorstep and diverts you to an entrance of a world filled with mystic beauty. Getting there is the easy part, coming home will be the adventure.  i2010kHudsonsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00835na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264003300026300002300059500057600082542003800658655002900696SRNE7000aProject Runway 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2010-3-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aAll the glitz and glamour of a fashion designer is yours, without the moody models. Create extravagant ensembles to display on the runway in this game inspired by the hit television show. Customize a model that wears your designer style best. Style the model's hair and make-up, select her skin tone, and customize hundreds of other features before unveiling your new design to the world. Step out on the catwalk and test your rhythm and posing skills with the Wii Balance Board. Face the judges to see if your design is the next fashion trend, or this season's disaster.  i2010kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00922na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264003300026300002300059500066300082542003800745655002900783SRNP7000aProject Runway 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2010-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aA must have "accessory" for series fans, Project Runway the videogame will put players in the role of an aspiring fashion designer. Similar to the show, players will be presented with a range of theme challenges as they create designs and adorn models with hair, make-up, and accessories. Players can then become the model and strut their creations down the runway using the Wii Balance Board accessory. Capturing the true essence of Project Runway, the title will feature the show's key talent, Tim Gunn, Heidi Klum, Nina Garcia, and Michael Kors as well as the top eight contestants from season six including reigning Project Runway winner Irina Shabayeva.  i2010kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00559na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002800033300002300061500026900084542003100353655002500384655002800409SROENS00aRodea the Sky Soldier 1bNIS Americac2015-11-10  a1 Wii optical disc  a1,000 years ago, Emperor Geardo of the Naga Empire sent an army of machine soldiers to invade the sky kingdom of Garuda. Thanks to the efforts of Princess Cecilia and Rodea, a machine soldier who promised to protect Garuda, Emperor Geardo’s assault was thwarted.  i2015kNIS AmericasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00301na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264003000033300002300063500000500086542003500091655002500126655002800151SROJQC00aTenkuu no Kishi Rodea 1bKadokawa Shotenc2015-4-2  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2015kKadokawa ShotensGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00310na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264003500034300002300069500000500092542003800097655002500135655002800160SROKZ500aCheongongui Gisa Rodea 1bShinsegae I&C Inc.c2015-11-12  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2015kShinsegae I&C Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00559na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002800033300002300061500026900084542003100353655002500384655002800409SROPNS00aRodea the Sky Soldier 1bNIS Americac2015-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  a1,000 years ago, Emperor Geardo of the Naga Empire sent an army of machine soldiers to invade the sky kingdom of Garuda. Thanks to the efforts of Princess Cecilia and Rodea, a machine soldier who promised to protect Garuda, Emperor Geardo’s assault was thwarted.  i2015kNIS AmericasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01010na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001200007264003500019300002300054500072000077542003800797655002500835655002800860SRPE4Q00aTangled 1bDisney Interactivec2010-11-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aA damsel in distress becomes a damsel in action in this game inspired by the Disney animated film. Tangled reinvents the classic tale of Rapunzel by getting Rapunzel out of her tower and into an adventure with a swashbuckler named Flynn. Explore worlds inspired by the film as the two solve puzzles and overcome obstacles together. Rapunzel can use her hair to climb, swing, grab objects, and perform moves that redefine what it means to have a good hair day. Flynn can scale walls, swordfight, and find hidden treasure with his Flynntuition. Two players can share split-screen play, and younger players can get a boost with the Hold My Hand feature. Game also includes: poster and a Disney Tangled movie admission.  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00503na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001200007264003400019300002300053500021400076542003800290655002500328655002800353SRPP4Q00aTangled 1bDisney Interactivec2010-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aDisney Tangled: The Video Game is a story-based adventure sent in a vast kingdom featuring characters with unique abilities, colorful environments, creative play, fun quests, and competitive racing challenges.  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00626na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001900007264003700026300002300063500028300086542004200369655002500411655003100436655002500467SRQE4100aRacquet Sports 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2010-3-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aRacquet Sports is a multisport game that includes tennis, ping pong, badminton, squash and beach tennis. The game engages players in 40 rich graphical environments in worldwide locations including an underwater reef, a Moroccan palace, a New York loft, and a fan-filled stadium.  i2010kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aTable tennis games2wiiext 7aTennis games2wiiext00668na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002400007264003800031300002300069500028300092542004200375655002500417655002400442655003100466655002500497SRQP4100aRacket Sports Party 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2010-3-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aRacquet Sports is a multisport game that includes tennis, ping pong, badminton, squash and beach tennis. The game engages players in 40 rich graphical environments in worldwide locations including an underwater reef, a Moroccan palace, a New York loft, and a fan-filled stadium.  i2010kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aTable tennis games2wiiext 7aTennis games2wiiext00399na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001900007264003300026300002300059500002900082542003700111655002500148655002400173655002500197655003100222SRRENR00aRec Room Games 1bDestineer Studiosc2009-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  a20 Games Under One Roof!  i2009kDestineer StudiossGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aHockey games2wiiext 7aTable tennis games2wiiext00672na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002200007264002700029300002300056500031600079542003200395655002500427655002500452655002400477655002500501SRRPGN00aGreat Party Games 1bOxygen Gamesc2010-6-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aHave fun with the family with this great compilation of 20 classic games like Foosball, Bowling, Air Hockey, Table Tennis and more. With something for everyone Great Party Games will give you and your family hours of fun, either playing on your own against the computer or playing multiplayer against each other  i2010kOxygen GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00929na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264001900029300002300048500070000071542002300771655002500794SRSE2000aSuper Sonic Racer 1bZooc2011-7-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aTo bring home the checkered flag in this kart racer, you will travel to places you have never seen in a racing game! Super Sonic Racing sends you to four worlds, each more bizarre than the next, but all geared for super-charged driving action. Choose from 12 crazy characters with equally unusual rides. Drive a space shuttle, monster truck, futuristic magnetic superbike, pizza-delivery mobile, and more. Compete on 16 reversible tracks in the fiery Nightmare World, the shimmering Underwater World, the video-game-inspired Game World, or the garbage-covered planet of Trash World. Use boosts to outmaneuver other drivers and watch out for hazards just waiting to derail your charge to victory.  i2011kZoosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00936na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264002300028300002300051500070000074542002700774655002500801SRSPXT00aSupersonic Racer 1bFun Boxc2012-9-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aTo bring home the checkered flag in this kart racer, you will travel to places you have never seen in a racing game! Super Sonic Racing sends you to four worlds, each more bizarre than the next, but all geared for super-charged driving action. Choose from 12 crazy characters with equally unusual rides. Drive a space shuttle, monster truck, futuristic magnetic superbike, pizza-delivery mobile, and more. Compete on 16 reversible tracks in the fiery Nightmare World, the shimmering Underwater World, the video-game-inspired Game World, or the garbage-covered planet of Trash World. Use boosts to outmaneuver other drivers and watch out for hazards just waiting to derail your charge to victory.  i2012kFun BoxsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00315na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264003200036300002300068500000500091542003600096655002800132655003300160SRTXNL00aReader Rabbit: 1st Grade 1bNordic Softsalesc2011-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2011kNordic SoftsalessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00780na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264003100042300002300073500051100096542003500607655002800642SRUE4Z00aRudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer 1bRed Wagon Gamesc2010-11-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aRudolph may not have been able to compete in the Reindeer Games, but you certainly can! Join all of Santa's reindeer for some cheerful holiday competition. All games are based on the beloved holiday classic, Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer. Race in Blitzen's Blitz, build toys in Santa's Workshop, defang the Bumble, escape the Island of Misfit Toys, stay on top in the Iceberg Hop, and light the way for Santa's sleigh. The whole family can enjoy the Reindeer Games during the holidays or any time of year.  i2010kRed Wagon GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext01001na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264003900039300002300078500068700101542004200788655002400830655002500854SRVE4104aThe Price Is Right: Decades 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2011-10-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe longest-running game show in TV history brings the excitement of 40 years of pricing fun right into your living room! Feel the thrill of being called to "Come on down" to four different decades of the show. Play over 40 pricing games from the last four decades, including rare games taken from the TV show vault and brand new games never seen in any previous versions. Sit on Contestant's Row - where you're always the next contestant! If you make it far enough, you can even Spin the Wheel for a chance at a payoff in the Showdown. Play on your own, or challenge a friend in local multiplayer. Authentic show music and sound effects round out a true-to-TV game show experience.  i2011kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00315na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264003200036300002300068500000500091542003600096655002800132655003300160SRWXNL00aReader Rabbit: 2nd Grade 1bNordic Softsalesc2012-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2012kNordic SoftsalessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00989na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264002600046300002300072500068900095542003000784655002500814655002800839SRXE5200aGenerator Rex: Agent of Providence 1bActivisionc2011-11-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen mankind evolves into raging mutant beasts, one teenager gets lucky and morphs into...Earth's most advanced weapon! Play as Rex and join Providence, the organization dedicated to stop the mutants in this game based on the Cartoon Network series. Particles called nanites have infected nearly everyone on Earth, turning them into beasts called E.V.O.s. Rex can not only control his E.V.O. mutation, he can use it to take on different forms and drain nanites from other mutants, curing their infection. Use your one-of-a-kind abilities to battle mutants across the globe, building bigger weapons to defeat an enemy that's evolving into something more powerful with each passing day.  i2011kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00989na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264002600046300002300072500068900095542003000784655002500814655002800839SRXP5200aGenerator Rex: Agent of Providence 1bActivisionc2011-11-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen mankind evolves into raging mutant beasts, one teenager gets lucky and morphs into...Earth's most advanced weapon! Play as Rex and join Providence, the organization dedicated to stop the mutants in this game based on the Cartoon Network series. Particles called nanites have infected nearly everyone on Earth, turning them into beasts called E.V.O.s. Rex can not only control his E.V.O. mutation, he can use it to take on different forms and drain nanites from other mutants, curing their infection. Use your one-of-a-kind abilities to battle mutants across the globe, building bigger weapons to defeat an enemy that's evolving into something more powerful with each passing day.  i2011kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00584na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001300007264002800020300002300048500034500071542003200416655002600448SRYEAF00aExerBeat 1bNamco Bandaic2011-4-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aExerBeat offers an interactive fitness experience where players workout to the beat by utilizing the Wii Remote to perform more than 150 simple yet challenging exercises. With a wealth of activities, in-game personal trainers, customizable programs and data for calories burned, ExerBeat offers a robust virtual workout studio for the home.  i2011kNamco BandaisGameTDB 7aFitness games2wiiext00800na  a2200169   4500001000700000245001800007264003400025300002300059500035500082542003800437655002500475655002400500655002500524655003100549655002400580655002600604SRYJAF00aFitness Party 1bNamco Bandai Gamesc2010-12-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aFitness Party offers an interactive fitness experience where players workout to the beat by utilizing the Wii Remote to perform more than 150 simple yet challenging exercises. With a wealth of activities, in-game personal trainers, customizable programs and data for calories burned, Fitness Party offers a robust virtual workout studio for the home.  i2010kNamco Bandai GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext 7aMartial arts games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aFitness games2wiiext00656na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264002100039300002300060500041200083542002500495655002600520SRYPAF00aExerBeat: Gym Class Workout 1bNamcoc2011-5-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aEver used the following excuses? “I’m too busy to go to the gym!” “How can I find time to work out when I have kids?” “I hate dieting!” “If only I could have fun working out with my family at home.” ExerBeat is a rhythm-based fun fitness game for people of all ages who want to stay in good health. With 155 exercises and a variety of menu options, ExerBeat makes working out easy and fun!  i2011kNamcosGameTDB 7aFitness games2wiiext00818na  a2200157   4500001000700000245004000007264003700047300002300084500037000107542004100477655002500518655002500543655002500568655003100593655003600624SS2PFR00aWinter Sports 2012: Feel the Spirit 1bDigital Tainment Poolc2011-12-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aPrepare to beat the records and compete in 10 intoxicating Winter sports. Become the Winter champion and take part in exciting contests on the most thrilling ice surfaces and snow pistes in the world. Immerse yourself in a fantastic competition atmosphere and be right up close as a Winter sports athlete when victory in a competition means a hundredth of a second!  i2011kDigital Tainment PoolsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aSkiing games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00689na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004500007264006000052300002300112500034800135542006300483655003300546SS3EWR00aSesame Street: Elmo's A-to-Zoo Adventure 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2010-10-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Sesame Street: Elmo's A-to-Zoo Adventure, kids head to the zoo with Elmo, Zoe and their animal friends, as they explore games based on a variety of literacy skills, including letter identification, letter sounds and word families. Kids can also explore exciting zoo habitats including the Aquarium, Savanna, Jungle, Wetlands and the Arctic.  i2010kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00704na  a2200109   4500001000700000245006000007264006000067300002300127500034800150542006300498655003300561SS3UWR00aSesame Street: Elmo's A-to-Zoo Adventure: The Videogame 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2010-11-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Sesame Street: Elmo's A-to-Zoo Adventure, kids head to the zoo with Elmo, Zoe and their animal friends, as they explore games based on a variety of literacy skills, including letter identification, letter sounds and word families. Kids can also explore exciting zoo habitats including the Aquarium, Savanna, Jungle, Wetlands and the Arctic.  i2010kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00710na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004600007264006000053300002300113500036800136542006300504655003300567SS4EWR00aSesame Street: Cookie's Counting Carnival 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2010-10-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Sesame Street: Cookie's Counting Carnival, kids join Cookie Monster and Big Bird at a fun-filled carnival, through gameplay steeped in math skills that include number identification, counting, shapes and pattern recognition. Kids journey through the game in the many areas of the carnival such as The Grandstand, Midway, Petting Zoo, Food Court and the Arcade.  i2010kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00725na  a2200109   4500001000700000245006100007264006000068300002300128500036800151542006300519655003300582SS4UWR00aSesame Street: Cookie's Counting Carnival: The Videogame 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2010-10-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Sesame Street: Cookie's Counting Carnival, kids join Cookie Monster and Big Bird at a fun-filled carnival, through gameplay steeped in math skills that include number identification, counting, shapes and pattern recognition. Kids journey through the game in the many areas of the carnival such as The Grandstand, Midway, Petting Zoo, Food Court and the Arcade.  i2010kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00718na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264003200041300002300073500044600096542003700542655002900579SS5ENR00aSatisfashion: Rock the Runway 1bDestineer Studiosc2010-6-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aStep into the world of high fashion! As young designer Grace Styles, you'll lead the team at the Satisfashion Design House on a journey to the top of the fashion industry. Create trends with the latest fashions, hippest models and funkiest makeup. Show off your hot new looks on runways across the globe and set the fashion world on fire! With each innovative new trend you create you'll help elevate Satisfashion to the top of the industry!  i2010kDestineer StudiossGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00768na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264003700041300002300078500045200101542004100553655002500594655002700619SS6UHS00aAFL: Game of the Year Edition 1bTru Blu Entertainmentc2012-7-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aAFL offers gamers the chance to experience real footballer action via visceral Wii Remote motion controls. Gameplay features such as mini contests, specky's, smothers, handballs, kicks, evade, hip and shoulder and tackles all provide precise, realistic sports action. A ten-year Career Manager Mode gives gamers an extended play experience over the life of the game. Plus, you can engage your friends in multiplayer matches of up to eight players.  i2012kTru Blu EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext01010na  a2200145   4500001000700000245004100007264002300048300002300071500063700094542002700731655002500758655002900783655002600812655002600838SS7EFP00aRemington Super Slam Hunting: Africa 1bMastiffc2010-12-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen it comes to big game, it doesn't get any bigger than this! Go on safari into the furthest reaches of Africa, tracking 15 big game animals, including Africa's Big 5: rhino, buffalo, elephant, leopard, and lion. Equip your hunter with over 30 licensed guns and accessories for an experience that combines realistic hunting with arcade-style action. Track your prey day and night through a variety of conditions. Keep your target in your sights while rain soaks you, wind swirls, or brush fires rage all around. Join up to four friends for co-op or competitive hunts, and see who's bagged the most trophies in online leaderboards.  i2010kMastiffsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00795na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264002200048300002300070500049800093542002700591655002900618655002600647SS7URN00aRemington Super Slam Hunting: Africa 1bMastiffc2011-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aHunt Africa’s most dangerous game! Stalk over 30 of Africa’s most lethal animals to fill your trophy room and become the greatest Hunter on the Dark Continent. Use over 30 real, licensed weapons, scopes, and accessories to climb your way to the top of the Online Leaderboards! Remington Super Slam Hunting: Africa features both competitive and cooperative multiplayer for up to 4 players. Compete for 175 achievements and trophies. More than 30 unique and dangerous environments await you!  i2011kMastiffsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00947na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004000007264001900047300002300066500066300089542002300752655002400775655002600799SS8E7800aNickelodeon SpongeBob SquigglePants 1bTHQc2011-4-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor this crazy creation, SpongeBob has invented a whole new way to play! Chase your imagination wherever it leads in artistic Nanogames - games that move so fast they can't even be called 'mini.' Finish one and you're right onto the next! Zip through over 100 wacky games that have you tilting, flicking, tapping, and drawing at speeds geared for laugh-out-loud fun. Paint, draw, color, and create with a a versatile set of artistic tools, then save and share your work. You'll see SpongeBob art styles straight from the Nickelodeon vault, styles no one has seen before now. The extravaganza is hosted by Patchy the Pirate, President of SpongeBob's fan club.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aDrawing games2wiiext00935na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264001900035300002300054500066300077542002300740655002400763655002600787SS8P7800aSpongeBob SquigglePants 1bTHQc2011-4-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor this crazy creation, SpongeBob has invented a whole new way to play! Chase your imagination wherever it leads in artistic Nanogames - games that move so fast they can't even be called 'mini.' Finish one and you're right onto the next! Zip through over 100 wacky games that have you tilting, flicking, tapping, and drawing at speeds geared for laugh-out-loud fun. Paint, draw, color, and create with a a versatile set of artistic tools, then save and share your work. You'll see SpongeBob art styles straight from the Nickelodeon vault, styles no one has seen before now. The extravaganza is hosted by Patchy the Pirate, President of SpongeBob's fan club.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aDrawing games2wiiext00525na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264004400043300002300087500019500110542004700305655002500352655002600377SS9JMS00aMilestone Shooting Collection 2 1bMilestone / UFO Interactivec2010-12-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aMilestone Shooting Collection 2 has everything a shooter wants. It contains: Radirgy, Radirgy Noa, Chaos Field, Karous and Ilvero, almost all of the remarkable titles the studio has created.  i2010kMilestone / UFO InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00865na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002000025300002300045500059900068542002300667655002500690655002800715SSBE7800aPuss in Boots 1bTHQc2011-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aBecome the swashbuckling cat with the sharp sword and even sharper wits in this game set in the fairy tale universe of Shrek! Based on the Puss in Boots movie, this slick adventure begins in Puss in Boots' hometown and takes you up the beanstalk to the Giant's castle in the sky, and beyond. Learn swordplay as you duel banditos and fight with unmistakable Puss in Boots style. Outsmart enemies with clever tricks and use quick reflexes to perform cool moves in battle. Just don't get too caught up in being a hero - be sure to save some time to sing for the senoritas you meet on your journey.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00865na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002000025300002300045500059900068542002300667655002500690655002800715SSBP7800aPuss in Boots 1bTHQc2011-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aBecome the swashbuckling cat with the sharp sword and even sharper wits in this game set in the fairy tale universe of Shrek! Based on the Puss in Boots movie, this slick adventure begins in Puss in Boots' hometown and takes you up the beanstalk to the Giant's castle in the sky, and beyond. Learn swordplay as you duel banditos and fight with unmistakable Puss in Boots style. Outsmart enemies with clever tricks and use quick reflexes to perform cool moves in battle. Just don't get too caught up in being a hero - be sure to save some time to sing for the senoritas you meet on your journey.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00360na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264005900040300002300099500000500122542006300127655002400190655002400214SSCDWR00aScene It? Ganz großes Kino! 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2009-12-3  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext00890na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264004100047300002300088500060000111542004400711655002500755SSCEPM00aScene It Bright Lights! Big Screen! 1bWarner Bros. Interactivec2009-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen it comes to movie knowledge, are you a hit or a flop? Find out with this interactive version of the popular Scene It? movie trivia game. Test your knowledge with thousands of new trivia questions covering the most recent Hollywood hits and classic films stretching back four decades. An improved single-player mode challenges you to find the right answers and find them fast. A freewheeling multiplayer mode offers a good-time social challenge led by a lively new host. Use 12 new avatars, solve new puzzle types, and play new mini-games as you prove how much you've seen on the big screen.  i2009kWarner Bros. InteractivesGameTDB 7aTrivia games2wiiext00361na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264005900040300002300099500000500122542006300127655002400190655002500214SSCFWR00aScene it? Lumières! Action! 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2009-12-3  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00306na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264003400036300002300070500000500093542003800098655002400136655002400160SSCIWR00aScene It? Ciak! Si Gira! 1bWarner Interactivec2009-12-3  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kWarner InteractivesGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext00879na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264003400048300002300082500056600105542003800671655002400709655002400733SSCPWR00aScene It? Bright Lights! Big Screen! 1bWarner Interactivec2009-12-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aBring the magic Hollywood to your living room! Scene It? Bright Lights! Big Screen! Is taking the movie trivia experience to a whole new level, featuring all new level, featuring all new puzzles about the latest box office hits and many more of your big screen favorties! Scene It? Bright Lights! Big Screen! is the ultimate movie trivia game for the trivia masters and casual gamers alike. Challenge your family and friends to a fun group showdown or keep your skills sharp in single player mode. Get ready for stardom with Scene It? Bright Lights! Big Screen!  i2009kWarner InteractivesGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext00411na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004700007264005900054300002300113500000500136542006300141655002400204655002400228655002500252SSCSWR00aScene It? ¡Estrellas en Pantalla Gigante! 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2009-12-4  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00891na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264004100048300002300089500060000112542004400712655002500756SSCXPM00aScene It? Bright Lights! Big Screen! 1bWarner Bros. Interactivec2009-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen it comes to movie knowledge, are you a hit or a flop? Find out with this interactive version of the popular Scene It? movie trivia game. Test your knowledge with thousands of new trivia questions covering the most recent Hollywood hits and classic films stretching back four decades. An improved single-player mode challenges you to find the right answers and find them fast. A freewheeling multiplayer mode offers a good-time social challenge led by a lively new host. Use 12 new avatars, solve new puzzle types, and play new mini-games as you prove how much you've seen on the big screen.  i2009kWarner Bros. InteractivesGameTDB 7aTrivia games2wiiext00323na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264006500027300002300092500000500115542006900120655002400189SSDDRV00aSchlag den Raab 1bbitComposer Games - NAMCO BANDAI Partners Germanyc2010-9-10  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kbitComposer Games - NAMCO BANDAI Partners GermanysGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00355na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002700026300002300053500007500076542003200151655002400183655002600207SSEDNG00aWe Sing Vol. 2 1bNordic Gamesc2010-8-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe most successful karaoke game on the Nintendo Wii for 2009 is back!  i2010kNordic GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00607na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002800026300002300054500032600077542003200403655002400435655002600459SSEPNG00aWe Sing Encore 1bNordic Gamesc2010-8-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aWe Sing Encore (known as We Sing Vol. 2 in Germany) is the 2010 music video game sequel to the original We Sing for the Wii. Developed by Le Cortex, produced by Wired Productions and published by Nordic Games, it is the latest singing game in the series to support 4 players simultaneously each with their own microphone.  i2010kNordic GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00554na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002800026300002300054500027300077542003200350655002400382655002600406SSEVNG00aWe Sing Encore 1bNordic Gamesc2011-8-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe We Sing party just got louder! Now jam packed with 40 great songs, more new features than you can shake a stick at, real Karaoke mode, a Jukebox mode, in-game Awards and if you need any help with the vocal chords, try the new Singing Lesson mode… plus lots more!  i2011kNordic GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00303na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264002700036300002300063500001400086542003100100655002400131655002600155SSFPKM00aSing 4: The Hits Edition 1bDeep Silverc2011-11-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aSonglist:  i2011kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00506na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001200007264002900019300002300048500023100071542003200302655002400334655002600358SSGPNG00aWe Sing 1bNordic Gamesc2009-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe singing game featuring four mics and four singers has arrived. Thirty chart topping tunes from a wide range of musical tastes. Fun for young and old singers, and a party piece for the whole family. Exclusively for the Wii!  i2009kNordic GamessGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext00492na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004000007264003900047300002300086500016600109542004200275655002500317655002800342SSHPHH00aSherlock Holmes: The Silver Earring 1bFocus Home Interactivec2011-11-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aSherlock Holmes comes to life in a brand new adventure: an investigation created in pure Holmesian style where your talent for deduction will be put to the test.  i2011kFocus Home InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00691na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003500007264003300042300002300075500030400098542003700402655002500439655002500464655002500489655003100514SSIENR00aWinter Blast: Snow & Ice Games 1bDestineer Studiosc2010-3-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet ready for the ultimate Winter Sports package! Featuring Ice Hockey, Long Jump and more, Winter Blast: Snow & Ice Games brings all the excitement of the winter games into your home. Includes 9 exciting games, Wii™ Balance Board support and addictive multiplayer game types for the whole family.  i2010kDestineer StudiossGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aHockey games2wiiext 7aSkiing games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00942na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264002700029300002300056500069700079542003100776655002500807SSJEJJ00aSummer Stars 2012 1bDeep Silverc2012-7-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aTravel all around the world to prove you're the world's best all-around athlete in this fully loaded collection of summer sports! Compete in over 18 challenges in stadiums and arenas across the globe as you prove your athletic prowess in track and field events, swimming showdowns, outdoor contests, and more. Experience a story-driven Career Mode, challenge up to three friends in split-screen multiplayer, or have the family join in party play that levels the field by balancing everyone's skill level. Compete in events like diving, sprinting, mountain biking, and more as you control your on-screen athlete with classic arcade-style controls or go all-in with full motion-control support.  i2012kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00265na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264002700029300002300056500002000079542003100099655002500130SSJPKM00aSummer Stars 2012 1bDeep Silverc2012-3-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aReady, Set, Go!  i2012kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00620na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264003300043300002300076500034500099542003700444655002900481SSLENR00aI Love Horses: Rider's Paradise 1bDestineer Studiosc2011-1-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMake your dreams come to life by riding in Riders Paradise! Play the role of Natalie, a new student at Riders Paradise. Learn to ride and care for horses, live a storyline about friendship, love for horses, wrong choices, sacrifice and responsibility. Take part in equestrian events such as dressage, jumping and cross country competitions.  i2011kDestineer StudiossGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00386na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002000007264002600027300002300053500006100076542003100137655002500168655002900193655003000222SSLPKM04aThe Saddle Club 1bDeep Silverc2010-7-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aAfter the books and the TV series, here's the videogame!  i2010kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00986na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264003000034300002300064500064300087542003300730655002900763655002700792655003300819SSMEYG00aAmerican Mensa Academy 1bMaximum Gamesc2012-12-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aIf you really want to sharpen your smarts, there's no one better to turn to than the intelligence experts at Mensa! Raise your IQ with mini-games and puzzles endorsed by the American Mensa Academy. Challenge yourself in fun environments with wacky characters and exciting graphics designed to create an engrossing, immersive experience. Choose from Play, Test, and Coach modes, plus multiplayer battles and races for up to four players. Topics cover a range of subjects, including Logic, Memory, Literacy, Numeracy, and Visual and Spatial Skills. If you come up short, keep challenging yourself until you hit the score you're looking for.  i2012kMaximum GamessGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00433na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001800007264002700025300002300052500010400075542003100179655002900210655002700239655003300266SSMPGD00aMensa Academy 1bSquare-Enixc2012-7-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aMensa Academy is a new brain training game that will give players the ultimate grey matter workout.  i2012kSquare-EnixsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00973na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264003600024300002300060500067700083542004000760655002500800655002600825SSNEYG00aSniper Elite 1bMaximum Family Gamesc2010-12-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aA thrilling console saga gets even more intense as Sniper Elite comes to Wii. It is spring, 1945, the final days of World War II. The Russian Secret Service has descended upon Berlin to steal plans for the A-bomb. You're invisible, elite, and working alone, with the fate of the world entirely in your hands. Infiltrate enemy-occupied territory and stop Stalin's forces from harnessing the world's nuclear technology. The motion-controlled targeting system puts you behind enemy lines like never before as you take out key enemy targets in non-linear levels. Account for heart rate, posture, wind speed, and even your breath to hone your skills and complete your missions.  i2010kMaximum Family GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01533na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001700007264003500024300002300059500114500082542003801227655002501265655003101290655002601321655004001347SSNPHY00aSniper Elite 1bReef Entertainmentc2010-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aSniper Elite 25: You are an elite American sniper sent into the dangerous chaos of World War II! Sniper Elite features true-to-life weapons, 29 missions, and multi-player Sniper and Spotter challenges. Sniper Elite transports you into a different time where you are a highly trained American sniper on a mission at the dawn of the Cold War. One of the most realistic shooting games to date, Sniper Elite takes advantage of the Wii's precise control system to perfect each movement, gesture, and attack. In the wake of WWII you are an elite American sniper sent into the dangerous chaos erupting between the Russians and Germans. Your mission is to prevent Stalin from gaining critical nuclear research developed by Germany to produce the atom bomb. One of the most realistic shooting games to date, Sniper Elite takes advantage of the Wii's precise control system to perfect each movement, gesture, and attack. Features specialized sniper technique training, detailed weapon and ammo selections, single and 2-player co-op challenges, 29 action-packed missions, and 4 difficulty settings including: Rookie, Cadet, Marksmen, and Sniper Elite!  i2010kReef EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aTactical role-playing games2wiiext00457na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002700041300002300068500016100091542003000252655002500282655002800307SSPE5200aSkylanders: Spyro's Adventure 1bActivisionc2011-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience a brand new way to play on Wii as Skylanders Spyro’s Adventure transports real-world action figures into the game environment before your eyes!  i2011kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00457na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002600042300002300068500016100091542003000252655002500282655002800307SSPJGD00aSkylanders: Spyro no Daibouken 1bActivisionc2013-7-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience a brand new way to play on Wii as Skylanders Spyro’s Adventure transports real-world action figures into the game environment before your eyes!  i2013kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00457na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002700041300002300068500016100091542003000252655002500282655002800307SSPP5200aSkylanders: Spyro's Adventure 1bActivisionc2011-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience a brand new way to play on Wii as Skylanders Spyro’s Adventure transports real-world action figures into the game environment before your eyes!  i2011kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00457na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002700041300002300068500016100091542003000252655002500282655002800307SSPX5200aSkylanders: Spyro's Adventure 1bActivisionc2011-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience a brand new way to play on Wii as Skylanders Spyro’s Adventure transports real-world action figures into the game environment before your eyes!  i2011kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00457na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002700041300002300068500016100091542003000252655002500282655002800307SSPY5200aSkylanders: Spyro's Adventure 1bActivisionc2011-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience a brand new way to play on Wii as Skylanders Spyro’s Adventure transports real-world action figures into the game environment before your eyes!  i2011kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00336na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002400025300002300049500006600072542002800138655002400166655002400190SSQE0100aMario Party 9 1bNintendoc2012-3-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your friends and family and captain the crew to victory!  i2012kNintendosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext00336na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002400025300002300049500006600072542002800138655002400166655002400190SSQJ0100aMario Party 9 1bNintendoc2012-4-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your friends and family and captain the crew to victory!  i2012kNintendosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext00300na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264002400025300002300049500006600072542002800138655002400166SSQK0100aMario Party 9 1bNintendoc2013-4-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your friends and family and captain the crew to victory!  i2013kNintendosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00335na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002300025300002300048500006600071542002800137655002400165655002400189SSQP0100aMario Party 9 1bNintendoc2012-3-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your friends and family and captain the crew to victory!  i2012kNintendosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext00336na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002400025300002300049500006600072542002800138655002400166655002400190SSQW0100aMario Party 9 1bNintendoc2012-6-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your friends and family and captain the crew to victory!  i2012kNintendosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext00655na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264002500030300002300055500037500078542002900453655002500482655002600507SSRE2000aWild West Shootout 1bZoo Gamesc2010-9-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aDraw your six-shooter and survive a hail of gunfire in Wild West Shootout. Fight your way through treacherous terrain on your way west, but beware - outlaws are rounding every corner looking to take you down with a single bullet, so watch your step and keep your finger on the trigger! Barrel through the gunsmoke, and live to tell the tale of gold rushes and gunfights.  i2010kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00808na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264002600030300002300056500052700079542002900606655002500635655002600660SSRPXT00aWild West Shootout 1bZoo Gamesc2010-12-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aRoar through the Wld West with your guns a-blazin’ in this fast-paced cowboy showdown. Travel through a throwback frontier landscape where enemies wait around every corner. Keep your six-gun at the ready because danger could show up at any time. Dive for cover and survive a hail of bullets in shootouts against gangs of enemies, or giddyup and take aim on horseback in Ride and Shoot levels. Cowboy up in Story Mode, survive Wanted Mode, grab a pardner for multiplayer, or, if you have the glasses, play the game in 3D.  i2010kZoo GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01245na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004700007264005800054300002300112500090400135542006301039655003301102SSSEWR00aSesame Street: Elmo's Musical Monsterpiece 1bWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.c2012-6-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aSesame Street: Elmo's Musical Monsterpiece is a new game for the Nintendo Wii and DS that kids will be able to rock out with their favorite Sesame Street characters, engaging in activities that promote musical creativity and dancing. The game also manages to throw in a few activities designed to foster development of math skills through connections between math and music. The in-game music comes from eclectic Los Angeles band Ozomatli, who use a wide range of styles in their music - ideal for kids who need a lot of variety. Ozomatli is also no stranger to lending their work to the video game world, with songs featured in many prominent sports games, so their work should feel natural on these new Nintendo Wii and DS games. The game is simple enough for toddlers to play without too much help, but there is plenty of room for parents to get involved and get in some playtime with their kids.  i2012kWarner Bros. Interactive Entertainment Inc.sGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00475na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003200007264002800039300002300067500012600090542003200216655002800248655002900276655003600305SSTEG900aKid Adventures: Sky Captain 1bD3 Publisherc2010-6-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aKid Adventures: Sky Captain is an original concept, designed and developed by Torus Games and published with D3Publisher.  i2010kD3 PublishersGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFlight simulation games2wiiext00525na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003500007264003300042300002300075500016700098542003600265655002500301655002900326655003600355SSTPY500aStunt Flyer: Hero of the Skies 1bEasy Interactivec2011-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aPrepare for the greatest and most challenging flight adventure on Nintendos Wii platform. Master the skies of Gloster Island as you take control of a daring pilot  i2011kEasy InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFlight simulation games2wiiext00690na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001900007264003700026300002300063500033600086542004100422655002900463655002600492655003800518SSUES500aSushi Go Round 1bSouthpeak Interactivec2010-3-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aSushi Go Round puts you in charge of a Sushi Restaurant, and it’s your job to turn it into a successful enterprise and keep your customers happy! Your memory and skills will be pushed to their limits as you memorise recipes, prepare meals, order ingredients and expand your business in the hustle and bustle of a busy restaurant.  i2010kSouthpeak InteractivesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aCooking games2wiiext 7aBusiness simulation games2wiiext00939na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001400007264002600021300002300047500066700070542003000737655002500767655002500792SSVE5200aWipeout 3 1bActivisionc2012-9-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe hit TV obstacle course challenge returns for a third smash-and-splash romp that adds two key words: Instant Replay. Test your balance as you try your luck on 12 new winter and summer obstacle courses in solo or team modes for up to four contestants. Successfully survive courses to unlock new characters, episodes, and power-ups. A new over-the-shoulder point of view lets you see firsthand that squishy foam obstacle that's about to derail your dreams of victory and send you splashing into defeat. Each splashdown can now be rewound and played over and over again with the new Instant Replay feature, so you can get maximum payout from every wacky wipeout!  i2012kActivisionsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00488na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264003800024300002300062500022600085542004200311655002500353SSWDRM00aWater Sports 1bGameMill Entertainmentc2009-1-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time ever on the Nintendo Wii™, experience the world's most popular Water Sports! The Wii Balance Board™ puts you in the action with multiple levels of difficulty so anyone from 6 to 96 can join the fun.  i2009kGameMill EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00839na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001700007264004000024300002300064500045100087542004300538655002500581655002500606655002600631655003600657SSWEPZ00aWater Sports 1bGame Mill Entertainmentc2009-10-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aWater Sports gives players the opportunity to go Kite Surfing, Wake Boarding,Wind Surfing and Jet Skiing all without having to get wet or leave your living room! Challenge yourself on the Wii Balance Board, race against your friend in multiplayer mode, or work together in cooperative Wake Boarding. Water Sports is designed to be an easy to learn but difficult to master game for the family that feels more like an arcade game than a simulation.  i2009kGame Mill EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aSurfing games2wiiext 7aWatercraft racing games2wiiext00406na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264003900024300002300063500014300086542004200229655002500271SSWPGR00aWater Sports 1bGameMill Entertainmentc2010-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience the world’s most popular water sports on the Wii, featuring Kite Surfing, Wake Boarding, Wind Surfing and Water Craft Racing.  i2010kGameMill EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00535na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001100007264003300018300002300051500028700074542003700361655002700398SSZE5G00aSwords 1bMajesco Sales Incc2010-9-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aSwords pits you against the best of the best from past, present, and future in the ultimate sword fighting contest. This is what you’ve trained for, this is your destiny. Make your way from the dojo to the Final Showdown, and prove that you are the greatest swordsman of all time!  i2010kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00274na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002400022300002300046500000500069542002800074655002500102655002500127ST3J0100aKiki Trick 1bNintendoc2012-1-19  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2012kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00708na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264005000047300002300097500039600120542005400516655002800570ST4PNX00aThomas & Friends: Hero of the Rails 1bBarnstorm Games / Nomisian Limitedc2010-8-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aAimed at younger gamers and tank-engine aficionados of all ages, Thomas & Friends: Hero of the Rails is a lighthearted railroad adventure of eight easy-to-play mini-games, featuring the locomotive characters and Sodor Island settings of the long-running children's television series. Players can take the roles of Thomas, Percy, James, or Harold, as they engage in challenges such as Racing,  i2010kBarnstorm Games / Nomisian LimitedsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00708na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264005000047300002300097500039600120542005400516655002800570ST4XNX00aThomas & Friends: Hero of the Rails 1bBarnstorm Games / Nomisian Limitedc2010-12-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aAimed at younger gamers and tank-engine aficionados of all ages, Thomas & Friends: Hero of the Rails is a lighthearted railroad adventure of eight easy-to-play mini-games, featuring the locomotive characters and Sodor Island settings of the long-running children's television series. Players can take the roles of Thomas, Percy, James, or Harold, as they engage in challenges such as Racing,  i2010kBarnstorm Games / Nomisian LimitedsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00947na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264002600046300002300072500068700095542003000782655002500812ST5E5200aTransformers: Cybertron Adventures 1bActivisionc2010-6-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aBefore they battled on Earth, the Autobots and Decepticons fought a battle so big it destroyed a planet. Experience the civil war that sparked the Transformer saga in this game that lets you fight the battle for Cybertron. Choose your side and play two campaigns. Stand strong in the name of freedom with the Autobots, or fuel your lust for power with the Decepticons. No matter which side you choose, you'll battle as the ultimate weapon, transforming any time between vehicle and robot and hitting your enemies with incredible futuristic firepower. Go deep into the untold history of Cybertron in Wii-exclusive missions or have a friend join the fight in two-player co-op battles.  i2010kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00947na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264002600046300002300072500068700095542003000782655002500812ST5P5200aTransformers: Cybertron Adventures 1bActivisionc2010-6-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aBefore they battled on Earth, the Autobots and Decepticons fought a battle so big it destroyed a planet. Experience the civil war that sparked the Transformer saga in this game that lets you fight the battle for Cybertron. Choose your side and play two campaigns. Stand strong in the name of freedom with the Autobots, or fuel your lust for power with the Decepticons. No matter which side you choose, you'll battle as the ultimate weapon, transforming any time between vehicle and robot and hitting your enemies with incredible futuristic firepower. Go deep into the untold history of Cybertron in Wii-exclusive missions or have a friend join the fight in two-player co-op battles.  i2010kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00392na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264001900039300002300058500015200081542002300233655002600256ST6E7804aThe Biggest Loser Challenge 1bTHQc2010-11-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing expertise from trainers Bob Harper and Jillian Michaels as well as encouragement from host Alison Sweeney and over 70 former contestants.  i2010kTHQsGameTDB 7aFitness games2wiiext00394na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264002000039300002300059500015200082542002300234655002700257ST6P7804aThe Biggest Loser Challenge 1bTHQc2010-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing expertise from trainers Bob Harper and Jillian Michaels as well as encouragement from host Alison Sweeney and over 70 former contestants.  i2010kTHQsGameTDB 7aCoaching games2wiiext00875na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264002400026300002300050500064000073542002800713655002400741ST7E0100aFortune Street 1bNintendoc2011-12-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aClose the biggest deals to make the biggest bucks in this game where the one with the biggest bank account wins! Play as your favorite characters from the Super Mario and Dragon Quest game worlds, or as your Mii. Move around the board, buying and selling shops and collecting fees from opponents. Collect symbols that you can cash in for gold and use the gold to make more investments. The more money you have, the more you can make. Learn how to make your fortune in streamlined beginner play. An advanced mode adds more strategy and more complex investment options, while 15 different game boards keep the wheeling and dealing going.  i2011kNintendosGameTDB 7aBoard games2wiiext00921na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264002700030300002300057500064000080542003100720655002400751655002400775ST7JGD00aItadaki Street Wii 1bSquare Enixc2011-12-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aClose the biggest deals to make the biggest bucks in this game where the one with the biggest bank account wins! Play as your favorite characters from the Super Mario and Dragon Quest game worlds, or as your Mii. Move around the board, buying and selling shops and collecting fees from opponents. Collect symbols that you can cash in for gold and use the gold to make more investments. The more money you have, the more you can make. Learn how to make your fortune in streamlined beginner play. An advanced mode adds more strategy and more complex investment options, while 15 different game boards keep the wheeling and dealing going.  i2011kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext00719na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001600007264002500023300002300048500041100071542002800482655002700510655002400537655002400561ST7P0100aBoom Street 1bNintendoc2011-12-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe aim of Boom Street is to get rich quicker than your opponents through a mixture of property acquisition and property investment. Challenge up to three friends at home using one Wii Remote or play against people from across the world online to see who can increase their net worth the quickest. You can even utilise an in-game stock market element to purchase shares and earn dividends for extra wealth.  i2011kNintendosGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext00309na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002500027300002300052500003100075542003000106655002500136655002600161ST9E5200aTop Shot Arcade 1bActivisionc2011-3-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aShootin' fun for everyone!  i2011kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00897na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002000022300002300042500063700065542002300702655002400725655002600749STAE7800aPictionary 1bTHQc2010-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou never had to be an artist to play Pictionary. Now, you don't even need to own a pencil! Play the classic drawing game in a whole new way with the interactive uDraw art pad. The game plays in the same familiar way: players sketch out clues for their teammates to guess. Now, you'll draw on a tablet surface and watch your creations come to life onscreen. The game is loaded with over 3,000 word clues covering people, places, objects, animals, actions, and the formidable "difficult." Choose from three modes: Pictionary Game Show, Pictionary Mania, and Free Draw and never wonder what happened to those pesky mini-pencils again.  i2010kTHQsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aDrawing games2wiiext00337na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001500007264001800022300002300040500004300063542002300106655002400129655002400153655002600177STAP7800aPictionary 1bTHQc2011-3-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aA Whole New Way To Play Pictionary™!  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext 7aDrawing games2wiiext00337na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001500007264001800022300002300040500004300063542002300106655002400129655002400153655002600177STAU7800aPictionary 1bTHQc2011-3-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aA Whole New Way To Play Pictionary™!  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext 7aDrawing games2wiiext00493na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001100007264002400018300002300042500022800065542002700293655002500320655002600345STDEFP00aReload 1bMastiffc2010-11-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aTrain hard to shoot right! Can you make it as a sniper, a SWAT officer doing hostage rescue? A Secret Service Officer, a solider firing a heavy vehicle mounted machine gun going through an enemy village? Find out in RELOAD.  i2010kMastiffsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00215na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001100007264003200018300002300050500000500073542003900078STDURN00aReload 1bMastiff / N3V Gamesc2011--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2011kMastiff / N3V GamessGameTDB01128na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264002200031300002300053500089000076542002700966655002500993STEETR00aTetris Party Deluxe 1bMajescoc2010-6-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aTetris Party Deluxe builds on success of Tetris Party (formerly found on WiiWare)by adding new modes and features to enrich the overall game play experience. The game features six new game modes, including the explosive Bombliss and VS. Sprint -- a mode that enables up to four players to compete for the first 40 line completion! In addition, there are four additional enhanced modes of play including an Edit Mode within Shadow that lets players create their own shadow puzzles to play. And for Tetris fans who like playing with others, Tetris Party Deluxe has a wealth of modes including online battles over Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection in addition to local multiplayer fun for groups of friends and family. With the Wii version, there are even crazy ways of playing the game -- use the Wii Balance Board, Wii Wheel, Wii Speak or your own personal Mii to customize the game experience!  i2010kMajescosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext01175na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002600032300002300058500089100081542003100972655002501003655002501028STEJ1800aTetris Party Premium 1bHudson Softc2010-8-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aTetris Party Premium builds on success of Tetris Party (formerly found on WiiWare)by adding new modes and features to enrich the overall game play experience. The game features six new game modes, including the explosive Bombliss and VS. Sprint -- a mode that enables up to four players to compete for the first 40 line completion! In addition, there are four additional enhanced modes of play including an Edit Mode within Shadow that lets players create their own shadow puzzles to play. And for Tetris fans who like playing with others, Tetris Party Deluxe has a wealth of modes including online battles over Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection in addition to local multiplayer fun for groups of friends and family. With the Wii version, there are even crazy ways of playing the game -- use the Wii Balance Board, Wii Wheel, Wii Speak or your own personal Mii to customize the game experience!  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext01131na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264002300031300002300054500089100077542002800968655002500996STEPTR00aTetris Party Deluxe 1bNintendoc2010-9-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aTetris Party Deluxe builds on success of Tetris Party (formerly found on WiiWare) by adding new modes and features to enrich the overall game play experience. The game features six new game modes, including the explosive Bombliss and VS. Sprint -- a mode that enables up to four players to compete for the first 40 line completion! In addition, there are four additional enhanced modes of play including an Edit Mode within Shadow that lets players create their own shadow puzzles to play. And for Tetris fans who like playing with others, Tetris Party Deluxe has a wealth of modes including online battles over Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection in addition to local multiplayer fun for groups of friends and family. With the Wii version, there are even crazy ways of playing the game -- use the Wii Balance Board, Wii Wheel, Wii Speak or your own personal Mii to customize the game experience!  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00910na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264002700040300002300067500061500090542003000705655002500735655002800760STFE5200aTransformers Prime: The Game 1bActivisionc2012-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Decepticons have discovered a secret weapon in outer space, one with the power to destroy not just the Autobots, but the entire Earth! Play as your favorite Autobot characters as you lead the charge to stop Megatron and save the planet in this game based on the hit Transformers Prime animated series. Battle the Decepticons as Optimus Prime, Bumblebee, Ratchet, Arcee, Bulkhead, and other heroic Autobots. The action spans the globe with explosive brawls when you're in robot mode and high-speed chases when you're in vehicle mode. Get help from the show's human characters, including Jack, Miko, and Raf.  i2012kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00965na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264002600040300002300066500071100089542003000800655002500830STFP5200aTransformers Prime: The Game 1bActivisionc2012-11-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on the hit animated television show produced by Hasbro Studios and currently airing on The Hub television network in the U.S., the game lets fans play as their favorite AUTOBOT characters and embark on an action-packed adventure to save the earth from the evil MEGATRON and his new secret weapon. Players step into the roles of OPTIMUS PRIME, BUMBLEBEE, ARCEE, AUTOBOT RATCHET, BULKHEAD and more as they explore unique vistas all around the world with brawler-style combat and diverse driving sequences. Along the way, gamers cultivate friendships with Jack, Miko and Raf - the human characters from the show - as Team Prime sets out to protect mankind and eliminate the DECEPTICONS once and for all.  i2012kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00243na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264002200027300002300049500000500072542002500077655003100102STGJAF00aTales of Graces 1bNamcoc2009-12-10  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kNamcosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00449na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264001900032300002300051500021600074542002400290655002500314STHE8P00aThor: God of Thunder 1bSegac2011-5-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience a spectacular, epic-scale original adventure in Thor’s first standalone game, as he battles through numerous worlds of Norse mythology to overcome monstrous foes lifted from the pages of the comics.  i2011kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00490na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002000032300002300052500021600075542002400291655002500315655002800340STHP8P00aThor: God of Thunder 1bSegac2011-4-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience a spectacular, epic-scale original adventure in Thor’s first standalone game, as he battles through numerous worlds of Norse mythology to overcome monstrous foes lifted from the pages of the comics.  i2011kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00247na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264002700027300002300054500000500077542003100082655002400113STIFKM00aTiteuf: Le Film 1bDeep Silverc2011-3-31  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2011kDeep SilversGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00353na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003700007264003500044300002300079500000500102542003800107655002500145655002400170655002500194STJJAF00aTaiko no Tatsujin Wii: Ketteiban 1bNamco Bandai Gamesc2011-11-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2011kNamco Bandai GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext01480na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004500007264002200052300002300074500117800097542002601275655002701301655003001328STKE0800aTatsunoko vs. Capcom: Ultimate All-Stars 1bCapcomc2010-1-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aTatsunoko vs. Capcom: Ultimate All-Stars is a 2.5D fighting game developed exclusively for the Wii console, in which players face each other with a team of two in a one-on-one fight to deplete their opponent's health bar. Tatsunoko vs. Capcom is a departure from the more complex attack systems implemented in the Street Fighter series and some previous Vs. fighting titles. The game was built around a simplified three-button attack system (Weak, Medium, Strong) since it was developed with the Wii in mind and an attribute of Vs. games is the ability to execute special moves with simple commands. There is also the multifunctional "Partner" button that can be used to tag in a teammate or provide assistance in attacking. The game's two largest and most powerful characters, Tatsunoko's Gold Lightan and Capcom's PTX-40A, fight on their own without a partner resulting in the inability to do universal techniques that require a partner. To regenerate health, each player may switch out their characters at any time. A team can perform two special moves simultaneously at the cost of three special bars. The match is over once one of the teams have no remaining fighters.  i2010kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a2D fighting games2wiiext01438na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004500007264002200052300002300074500117800097542002601275655002701301STKJ0800aTatsunoko vs. Capcom: Ultimate All-Stars 1bCapcomc2010-1-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aTatsunoko vs. Capcom: Ultimate All-Stars is a 2.5D fighting game developed exclusively for the Wii console, in which players face each other with a team of two in a one-on-one fight to deplete their opponent's health bar. Tatsunoko vs. Capcom is a departure from the more complex attack systems implemented in the Street Fighter series and some previous Vs. fighting titles. The game was built around a simplified three-button attack system (Weak, Medium, Strong) since it was developed with the Wii in mind and an attribute of Vs. games is the ability to execute special moves with simple commands. There is also the multifunctional "Partner" button that can be used to tag in a teammate or provide assistance in attacking. The game's two largest and most powerful characters, Tatsunoko's Gold Lightan and Capcom's PTX-40A, fight on their own without a partner resulting in the inability to do universal techniques that require a partner. To regenerate health, each player may switch out their characters at any time. A team can perform two special moves simultaneously at the cost of three special bars. The match is over once one of the teams have no remaining fighters.  i2010kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00908na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004500007264002200052300002300074500061100097542002600708655002500734655002700759STKP0800aTatsunoko vs. Capcom: Ultimate All-Stars 1bCapcomc2009-1-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aFrom Capcom’s 30-year history comes characters like Ryu and Chun-Li from the Street Fighter series, Morrigan from Darkstalkers and company mascot Mega Man Volnutt from Mega Man Legends. Tatsunoko’s near half-century of Japanese animation excellence is represented by the likes of Ken the Eagle and Jun the Swan from the Science Ninja Team Gatchaman anime (known in Europe as Battle of the Planets or G-Force), cybernetic warrior Casshan and comedic action hero Yatterman No. 1. All together, there are more than 20 colourful combatants to choose from in order to form the ultimate tag team combination.  i2009kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00428na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264001900025300002300044500016700067542002300234655002400257655002500281STLE7800aTruth or Lies 1bTHQc2010-9-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aFriends and family will be squirming in their seats as they answer some of the game's silliest and most provocative questions in the new Truth or Lies video game.  i2010kTHQsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00429na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002000025300002300045500016700068542002300235655002400258655002500282STLP7800aTruth or Lies 1bTHQc2010-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aFriends and family will be squirming in their seats as they answer some of the game's silliest and most provocative questions in the new Truth or Lies video game.  i2010kTHQsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext 7aTrivia games2wiiext00966na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002000007264002700027300002300054500060100077542003200678655002800710655002500738655002500763655003200788STMEGN00aTitanic Mystery 1bOxygen Gamesc2012-4-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Titanic sails again in this interactive mystery! Hop aboard a new version of the famous ship for a journey across the ocean that - without your help - may end just as badly as the first. When the Titanic II sets sail, a bomb is found, threatening to make the Titanic II's maiden voyage its last. Explore the gigantic ocean liner in a race to save the ship and all the people onboard. Play 30 mini-games in 30 challenging levels. Meet members of the crew, find hidden objects, and solve the mystery before it's too late. As you uncover clues, you'll uncover secrets about the original Titanic.  i2012kOxygen GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aHidden object games2wiiext00893na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002800027300002300055500060100078542003200679655002800711655003200739STMPKP00aTitanic Mystery 1bPurple Hillsc2012-4-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Titanic sails again in this interactive mystery! Hop aboard a new version of the famous ship for a journey across the ocean that - without your help - may end just as badly as the first. When the Titanic II sets sail, a bomb is found, threatening to make the Titanic II's maiden voyage its last. Explore the gigantic ocean liner in a race to save the ship and all the people onboard. Play 30 mini-games in 30 challenging levels. Meet members of the crew, find hidden objects, and solve the mystery before it's too late. As you uncover clues, you'll uncover secrets about the original Titanic.  i2012kPurple HillssGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aHidden object games2wiiext00916na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264003800046300002300084500059200107542004200699655002500741655002800766STNE4104aThe Adventures of Tintin: The Game 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2011-12-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe whimsical tale of a young reporter's quest for a legendary treasure comes to life in this game meant to be a true companion to The Adventures of Tintin movie. Built with help from filmmakers Steven Spielberg and Peter Jackson, the whole experience gets as close to the movie as possible. Solve an incredible mystery as you hunt for lost scrolls that lead to a bounty of sunken treasure, playing solo or with a friend in co-op. Play as Tintin, Captain Haddock, Snowy, and three unlockable characters as you fly planes, fight ancient knights, and more in a true adventure for the ages.  i2011kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00677na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005600007264003900063300002300102500033500125542004200460655002500502655002800527STNP4104aThe Adventures of Tintin: The Secret of the Unicorn 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2011-10-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn The Adventures of Tintin: The Game, play as Tintin, the intrepid reporter and hero of the action-packed movie The Adventures of Tintin directed by Steven Spielberg. Developed in close collaboration with the filmmaking team, the video game offers an authentic immersion into the movie’s enchanting environments and characters.  i2011kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00400na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264003500041300002300076500012900099542003800228655002400266STOE4Q00aCars Toon: Mater's Tall Tales 1bDisney Interactivec2010-10-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience the outrageous moments from Disney/Pixar's Mater's Tall Tales! 30 exciting games for endless hours of Mania! fun!  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00791na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264003500041300002300076500052000099542003800619655002400657STOP4Q00aCars Toon: Mater's Tall Tales 1bDisney Interactivec2010-11-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aCars Toon: Mater’s Tall Tales features a large collection of pick-up-and-play games inspired by Disney-Pixar’s popular Mater’s Tall Tales animated short series. The game will bring Mater together with Lightning McQueen and the “Cars” gang for a new set of adventures, capturing the endearing sense of humour of everyone’s favourite tow truck. Players will join Mater and his pals as they relive the wild stories he conjures up about hilariously unpredictable events that may or may not have taken place.  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00791na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264003500041300002300076500052000099542003800619655002400657STOX4Q00aCars Toon: Mater's Tall Tales 1bDisney Interactivec2010-11-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aCars Toon: Mater’s Tall Tales features a large collection of pick-up-and-play games inspired by Disney-Pixar’s popular Mater’s Tall Tales animated short series. The game will bring Mater together with Lightning McQueen and the “Cars” gang for a new set of adventures, capturing the endearing sense of humour of everyone’s favourite tow truck. Players will join Mater and his pals as they relive the wild stories he conjures up about hilariously unpredictable events that may or may not have taken place.  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00581na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264003600034300002300070500021500093542004000308655002900348655004000377655003000417STPPML00aPet Vet: Marine Patrol 1bdtp Entertainment AGc2010-9-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aAnimals are in danger and only you can help! Become a real veterinarian and travel to an animal clinic in northern Canada, where you can care for orcas, seals, dolphins, polar bears and many other baby animals.  i2010kdtp Entertainment AGsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aManagement simulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00487na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002300035300002300058500020700081542002700288655002500315655002500340STQJHF00aInazuma Eleven Strikers 1bLevel-5c2011-7-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first home console entry in the soccer sim/RPG franchise by Level-5, Inazuma Eleven Strikers is a soccer sim that brings popular characters from past entries together for action on the soccer field.  i2011kLevel-5sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00566na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002800007264002400035300002300059500023900082542002800321655002500349655003100374655002700405STQP0100aInazuma Eleven Strikers 1bNintendoc2012-9-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aSpectacular Special Moves and instant action combine to create a totally new kind of football experience in Inazuma Eleven Strikers on Wii. Get ready for the beautiful game as you’ve never seen it before – this is battle football!  i2012kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00566na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002800007264002400035300002300059500023900082542002800321655002500349655003100374655002700405STQX0100aInazuma Eleven Strikers 1bNintendoc2012-9-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aSpectacular Special Moves and instant action combine to create a totally new kind of football experience in Inazuma Eleven Strikers on Wii. Get ready for the beautiful game as you’ve never seen it before – this is battle football!  i2012kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00974na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264003400041300002300075500066300098542003800761655002500799655002800824STRE4Q00aTron: Evolution: Battle Grids 1bDisney Interactivec2010-12-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen a movie is set inside a video game, you know it's only a matter of time before you can play it for yourself! Disappear into the digital void as you experience the action-packed, high-tech world of Tron. Tron: Evolution features a variety of game modes built around Tron's Grid-based universe. Race Light Cycles, fight Light Disc battles, engage in Light Runner Combat, and play Hyperball as you compete in the arcade-style Grid Games Mode. The quest to become Grid champion gets a cinematic edge in Story Mode. Multiplayer lets four friends compete, and Championship Mode lets you create your own multiplayer experience by designing a custom party mode.  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00814na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264004200041300002300083500048700106542004600593655002500639655002800664STRP4Q00aTron: Evolution: Battle Grids 1bDisney Interactive Studiosc2010-12-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnter the thrilling digital world of TRON and prepare for an adventure like you've never experienced before. Travel through the cities of this dazzling and deadly cyber universe as you explore TRON in a new way. However, sightseeing is not why you have ventured to this compelling technological realm. Your goal is to become a champion. When you step onto the Battle Grid, you suddenly realize that this is not like any game you've ever played. How will the Battle Grids define you?  i2010kDisney Interactive StudiossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00837na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005700007264004200064300002300106500048700129542004600616655002500662655002800687STRX4Q00aTron: Evolution: Battle Grids (Championship Edition) 1bDisney Interactive Studiosc2010-12-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnter the thrilling digital world of TRON and prepare for an adventure like you've never experienced before. Travel through the cities of this dazzling and deadly cyber universe as you explore TRON in a new way. However, sightseeing is not why you have ventured to this compelling technological realm. Your goal is to become a champion. When you step onto the Battle Grid, you suddenly realize that this is not like any game you've ever played. How will the Battle Grids define you?  i2010kDisney Interactive StudiossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00700na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003400023300002300057500040700080542003800487655002500525655002800550STSE4Q00aToy Story 3 1bDisney Interactivec2010-6-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aEmbracing the adored and inspired fun of the Toy Story franchise, Toy Story 3: The Video Game features a story mode that follows the Toy Story 3 film adventures in which Buzz, Woody and friends grapple with their uncertain future as Andy prepares to depart for college. Dive into to all new heroic adventures in Story Mode or let your imagination run wild in the exiting new open world of Toy Box Mode!  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00700na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003400023300002300057500040700080542003800487655002500525655002800550STSP4Q00aToy Story 3 1bDisney Interactivec2010-6-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aEmbracing the adored and inspired fun of the Toy Story franchise, Toy Story 3: The Video Game features a story mode that follows the Toy Story 3 film adventures in which Buzz, Woody and friends grapple with their uncertain future as Andy prepares to depart for college. Dive into to all new heroic adventures in Story Mode or let your imagination run wild in the exiting new open world of Toy Box Mode!  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00657na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001600007264003100023300002300054500040700077542003800484655002500522STSR4Q00aToy Story 3 1bDisney Interactivec2017--  a1 Wii optical disc  aEmbracing the adored and inspired fun of the Toy Story franchise, Toy Story 3: The Video Game features a story mode that follows the Toy Story 3 film adventures in which Buzz, Woody and friends grapple with their uncertain future as Andy prepares to depart for college. Dive into to all new heroic adventures