 future as Andy prepares to depart for college. Dive into to all new heroic adventures in Story Mode or let your imagination run wild in the exiting new open world of Toy Box Mode!  i2010kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00273na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264003300037300002300070500000500093542003700098655002800135STTDRM00aHidden Mysteries: Titanic 1bastragon Softwarec2010-3-11  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kastragon SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00560na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003000007264002600037300002300063500016900086542003000255655002800285655002500313655003200338655004400370STTE5200aHidden Mysteries: Titanic 1bActivisionc2009-11-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aExplore the most famous ship in the world! Feel the ship deck creak as you search for hidden objects, decode secret puzzles and solve the greatest sea mystery ever!  i2009kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aHidden object games2wiiext 7aPoint-and-click adventure games2wiiext00424na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003000007264001900037300002300056500004700079542002300126655002800149655002500177655003200202655004400234STTPGR00aHidden Mysteries: Titanic 1bGSPc2010-7-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aA lost world of hidden objects and puzzles  i2010kGSPsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aHidden object games2wiiext 7aPoint-and-click adventure games2wiiext00425na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003000007264002000037300002300057500004700080542002300127655002800150655002500178655003200203655004400235STTXGR00aHidden Mysteries: Titanic 1bGSPc2010-10-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aA lost world of hidden objects and puzzles  i2010kGSPsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aHidden object games2wiiext 7aPoint-and-click adventure games2wiiext00422na  a2200133   45000010007000002450017000072640025000243000023000495