- here's your chance to experience what it takes to get there! Train like an MMA champion with this interactive fitness challenge that whips you into shape using UFC expertise and the power of Wii Motion Controls. Perform over 70 of the same exercises used by UFC fighters as you improve your total body strength and conditioning. Target specific muscle groups in 51 exercise routines. Further your fitness objectives by crafting your own workouts and adjusting the intensity to suit your own personal performance.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aFitness games2wiiext01160na  a2200133   4500001000700000245005400007264001900061300002300080500082000103542002300923655002700946655002700973655002601000SU4P7800aUFC Personal Trainer: The Ultimate Fitness System 1bTHQc2011-7-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aSet personal goals and achieve real results with an unparalleled mixed martial arts (MMA) fitness program designed by leading MMA training experts and certified by UFC and the National Academy of Sports Medicine (NASM). UFC Personal Trainer provides players with an extensive assortment of effective and challenging MMA-inspired exercises, in both pre-set and customizable routines, to build strength, increase endurance, burn calories and get results. Personalized instruction and tips from the MMA trainers guide players to stay motivated, get fit and track their goals with a helpful in-game journal. In addition, the games Ultimate Training Mode enables players to participate in high impact agility drills, with opportunities to earn rewards and have fun with friends in a competitive, multiplayer environment.  i2011kTHQsGameTDB 7aCoaching games2wiiext 7aExercise games2wiiext 7aFitness games2wiiext00860na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264002900048300002300077500059300100542003200693655002500725SU5EVZ00aMonster High: Skultimate Roller Maze 1bLittle Orbitc2012-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe monster madness goes underground in this roller-racing challenge where you'll skate through the catacombs beneath Monster High! The Skultimate Roller Maze is packed with monstrous obstacles and treacherous hazards waiting to send your hopes of victory to an early grave. Compete as your favorite Monster High character and choose your team. Get help from your teammates, using each character's special abilities and monstrous power-ups to flex your ghoul power and roll past your opponents. Multiple difficulty levels and a variety of gameplay options make sure each race is a scream!  i2012kLittle OrbitsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00375na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004100007264002800048300002300076500003500099542003200134655002500166655002500191655002500216SU5PVZ00aMonster High: Skultimate Roller Maze 1bLittle Orbitc2012-11-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aOn Your Mark, Get Set, SCREAM!  i2012kLittle OrbitsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00962na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002300007264003400030300002300064500063000087542003700717655002400754655002400778655002600802SU6E5G00aZumba Fitness Core 1bMajesco Sales Incc2012-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aGroove your way to rock-hard abs in this Zumba challenge that features the most rhythm styles of any dance or fitness game! Get a full-body workout that focuses on your core by dancing to 40 songs in a variety of Zumba styles, including Salsa, Bollywood, Reggaton, Cumbia, Brazilian, African, Disco, Jive, and more. Returning experts Beto, Gina Grant, Tanya Beardsley, and Kass Martin are joined by new celebrity instructors Loretta Bates and Nicholas Logrea. Hit the expanded tutorial section to learn the basics of six popular styles, have a friend join you for a shared workout, exercise in exotic new locations, and more.  i2012kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aFitness games2wiiext00961na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002300007264003300030300002300063500063