l disc  aPeach's Castle is a tech demo for Nintendo GameCube. In 2001, Nintendo sent various developers an interactive tech demo in order to show them the graphical capabilities of their new console as part of the Nintendo GameCube Software Development Kit. In this demo, the player controls a red arrow that can go through various places in Peach's Castle from Super Mario 64. Different rooms show different graphical effects, which includes the following: large textures, bumps and shadows, anti-aliasing, local lighting, projection textures, environment mapping, and maximum polygons.  i2022sGameTDB00804na  a2200145   4500001000700000245005100007264002600058300002300084500041300107542003100520655002500551655002700576655003000603655002500633DBSBT300aDragon Ball Budokai Tenkaichi 3 Version Latino 1bblack&whitec2017-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aUn juego de peleas de la saga budokai tenkaichi esta es la tercera entrega pero este es un juego modificado donde tiene las voces puestas en español todos los créditos a shadowthecanine este simplemente es una re ubicación de personajes con un poco de swap repito todos los créditos de doblaje y mods a shadowthecanine exepto el mod vegetto ssjblue y Gogeta ssjblue esos pertenecen al team sparkingmeteor  i2017kblack&whitesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00247na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002300005264001300028300002300041500006700064542001800131DC8A00aLine Attack Heroes 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aCustom English patched version of the Japanese exclusive game.  i2014sGameTDB00225na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004100007264002300048300002300071500000500094542002800099DIYP0100aNew Super Mario Bros. Wii 0-4 D.I.Y. 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kNintendosGameTDB00346na  a2200121   450000100070000024500210000726400210002830000230004950000740007254200280014665500250017465500250019