00053G4DE0100a 1bc2025--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2025sGameTDB00357na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264003400048300002300082500007700105542003800182655002700220G4NEDA00aNaruto Gektiou Ninja Taisen! 4 [Eng] 1bTomy / Takara Tomyc2021-3-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aNaruto: Great Ninja Battle! 4) is the fourth installment of this series.  i2021kTomy / Takara TomysGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext01085na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264002300046300002300069500079000092542002800882655002500910655002800935G4SK0104aThe Legend of Zelda: Four Swords + 1bNintendoc2004-3-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis four-player Zelda connectivity adventure combines gameplay on both the GameCube and Game Boy Advance for a mix of competitive and cooperative multiplayer fun. By hooking up GBAs to the GameCube, the action will move from the television screen (when players are on the overworld map), to the GBA screen (when entering houses and caves). Players work together to brave 24 challenges in eight levels in Hyrule Adventure (1-4 players, multiplayer only with GBAs) or compete in 10 frantic multiplayer versus battles (2-4 players, GBAs required). Takes place in similar environments as the SNES classic Link to the Past, but features updated character sprites, new special effects, and overall improved graphics. The Japanese version included an additional mode, known as Navi Trackers.  i2004kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00559na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264002900050300002300079500024600102542003200348655002700380655003000407GACE0100aSuper Smash Bros. Melee: Akaneia Build 1bAkaneia Teamc2021-12-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Akaneia Build is a ground-breaking Melee mod that adds new viable and authentic content to the game such as costumes, stages, and more. The mod is powered by m-ex, our own system that allows for streamlined expansion of content in Melee.  i2021kAkaneia TeamsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a2D fighting games2wiiext00486na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264002400046300002300070500018600093542002800279655002700307655003000334GACE0A00aSuper Smash Bros. Melee: ACE Build 1bTeam ACEc2026-5-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aA add-on to the Base Akaneia Mod Which Aims to Includes Every currently Released characters and Some Newcomers making there first Public Debut In ACE in one big melee Build for Fun.  i2026kTeam ACEsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a2D fighting games2wiiext00246na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264002300028300002300051500000500074542002800079655002900107GAEE0100aAnimal Forest e+ 1bNintendoc2020-1-4  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00672na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001700007264001600024300002300040500049300063542001800556GAKE0100aBeyond Melee 1bc2022-7-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aBeyond Melee is a rollback compatible game that sets out to take what you love about competitive Melee, and expand upon it with heaps of exciting new content. Over the past year and a half, we’ve created additional characters, stages, mechanics, and educated reimaginings of Melee’s original cast. Most importantly, though, Beyond Melee was created with the express purpose of carefully curating gameplay scenarios fit for tournament matches at every level of play, for years to come.  i2022sGameTDB00341na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001500007264002800022300002300050500002700073542003200100655002400132655002400156655002700180GAYE4100aJust Pride 1bFurryTrash23c2026-1-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Just Pride.  i2026kFurryTrash23sGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aExercise games2wiiext00785na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001400007264002200021300002300043500047200066542002600538655002500564655002800589655003400617GBIK0800aBiohazard 1bCapcomc2002-3-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aRaccoon City has been completely overrun by mutant beasts and bloodthirsty zombies. You are a member of S.T.A.R.S.--a rescue squad sent into the community to investigate the ominous mansion at the core of the disaster. Take the role of operative Jill Valentine or Chris Redfield and uncover the secrets behind a radical, genetic research facility. With an array of weapons to master and horrors around every corner, the ultimate test may be just to make it out alive.  i2002kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSurvival horror games2wiiext00329na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005400007264003500061300002300096500003600119542003900155655002500194GC4EBN00aShinseiki GPX Cyber Formula Road to the EVOLUTION 1bSunrise Interactivec2024-8-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aTranslation by DOL Translations  i2024kSunrise InteractivesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00982na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002100045300002300066500068600089542002600775655002500801655003400826GCDK0800aBiohazard Code: Veronica Complete 1bCapcomc2003-8-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aDirect GameCube port of the Resident Evil/BioHazard side chapter, previously released on Dreamcast and later PS2. This time you play as Claire Redfield from Resident Evil 2. After narrowly surviving the horrific onslaught in Raccoon City, Claire now seeks clues in search of her missing brother, Chris. To her horror, she discovers Umbrella Corporation's insidious activities are not isolated to the remote, mid-western city. Something much larger is going on! Flesh-eating zombies and horrific beasts haunt Claire's every move. Just how far does this twisted conspiracy extend? What is Umbrella Corporation really up to? And who is behind this bio-tech terror? Ships on two discs.  i2003kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSurvival horror games2wiiext00180na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001600007264001300023300002300036500000500059542001800064GCREBM00aXeno Crisis 1bc2023--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2023sGameTDB00180na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001600007264001300023300002300036500000500059542001800064GCRJBM00aXeno Crisis 1bc2023--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2023sGameTDB00180na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001600007264001300023300002300036500000500059542001800064GCRPBM00aXeno Crisis 1bc2023--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2023sGameTDB00264na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264001400035300002300049500003600072542002100108655002500129GDPEAF00aMr. Driller: Drill Land 1bNamcoc--  a1 Wii optical disc  aTranslation by DOL Translations  ikNamcosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00572na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002600033300002300059500028800082542003000370655002500400655002500425GDXE0100aKirby Air Ride Deluxe 1bUnclePunchc2025-7-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aKirby Air Ride Deluxe is a collection of mods powered by the hoshi framework with an emphasis on customization and familiar aesthetics. Many new menus and UI elements are included to improve the user experience. All features are toggleable and their settings save to the memory card.  i2025kUnclePunchsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00547na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264003300027300002300060500024400083542003700327655002500364655003600389GDXE8P00aSonic Riders DX 1bExtreme Gear Labsc2021-4-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aSonic Riders DX is a mod for "Sonic Riders" that enhances the game with new playstyles and balance for competitive play while improving the quality of the game with additional music, giving characters access to more gears, and fixing jank.  i2021kExtreme Gear LabssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aFuturistic racing games2wiiext00517na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264002700035300002300062500026100085542003000346655003100376GEAK8P00aEternal Arcadia Legends 1bSega Japanc2002-12-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aDescribed by Sega as the "director's cut" of the acclaimed Skies of Arcadia for the SEGA Dreamcast, "Skies of Arcadia Legends" features a refined battle system and hours of all-new gameplay chronicling the back-story of the original game's main characters.  i2002kSega JapansGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext01097na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264002400040300002300064500084100087542002800928655003100956GFEK0100aFire Emblem: Souen no Kiseki 1bNintendoc2005-4-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aFirst console installment of the strategy-RPG series since the SNES days. Previously released on Famicom (Japan-only), Super Famicom (Japan-only), and Game Boy Advance, Fire Emblem leaves the 2D overhead maps of old behind to serve up 3D villages, fields, and caves, and polygonal battle sequences. The continent of Tellius is divided into humans and half-man/half-beast demi-humans. These two races have battled for centuries and only recently established an uneasy peace. Now, a new force threatens to tear apart the seven kingdoms and reignite the flames of war. Joining the Fire Emblem ranks are new units, such as such as the shape-shifting laguz who transform into beasts to attack their foes. Additionally, characters can now learn unique skills as they gain experience, giving players even more ways to customize their strategy.  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00327na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001400007264002500021300002300046500004500069542003000114655002500144655003600169GFZJ8P00aF-Zero AX 1bSega Japanc2003-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aArcade version on Triforce system board.  i2003kSega JapansGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aFuturistic racing games2wiiext00963na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002500007264003900032300002300071500060300094542004300697655002500740655003000765655003400795GGPE0100aMario Kart Arcade GP 1bNintendo/Namco/Triforcec2005-10-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Arcade GP (マリオカート アーケードグランプリ) is an arcade-only iteration of Nintendo's Mario Kart series, developed by Namco. Designed for the Triforce arcade board (also used for F-Zero AX), players can race as one of eleven characters in twenty-four tracks. On certain machines, for an additional fee, a player's data can be saved on a magnetic card which can be inserted into the machine again later to retain unlocked items and records. Nintendo's limited role of development was mainly isolated to ensuring that it was a worthy title for the established franchised.  i2005kNintendo/Namco/TriforcesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aOff-road racing games2wiiext01004na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002700007264003800034300002300072500060600095542004300701655002500744655003000769655003400799655002500833GGPE0200aMario Kart Arcade GP 2 1bNintendo/Namco/Triforcec2007-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Arcade GP 2 (マリオカート アーケードグランプリ2) is an arcade-only iteration of Nintendo's Mario Kart series, developed by Namco. Designed for the Triforce arcade board (also used for F-Zero AX), players can race as one of eleven characters in twenty-four tracks. On certain machines, for an additional fee, a player's data can be saved on a magnetic card which can be inserted into the machine again later to retain unlocked items and records. Nintendo's limited role of development was mainly isolated to ensuring that it was a worthy title for the established franchised.  i2007kNintendo/Namco/TriforcesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aOff-road racing games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00193na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002700007264001500034300002300049500000500072542001800077GGPJ0200aMario Kart Arcade GP 2 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00183na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001900007264001300026300002300039500000500062542001800067GH2E4100aJust Dance GH2 1bc2021--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021sGameTDB00272na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264002300027300002300050500003600073542002800109655002500137GKQE0100aKururin Squash! 1bNintendoc2023-7-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aTranslation by DOL Translations  i2023kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00340na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005000007264003900057300002300096500003600119542004300155655003200198GL3EE800aLupin the Third - Lost Treasure Under the Sea 1bAsmik Ace Entertainmentc2024-8-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aTranslation by DOL Translations  i2024kAsmik Ace EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aInteractive fiction2wiiext00743na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004400007264002600051300002300077500043800100542003000538655002500568655002800593GLME0200aLuigi's Mansion: First-Person Optimized 1bSky Bluigic2023-4-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aA simple modification aimed to optimize the game-play of Luigi’s Mansion to accommodate a first-person perspective, made possible using an Action Replay code by Laser Crusader. This novelty hack makes the game fully playable through the eyes of Luigi, transforming the GameCube classic into an unusual sort of FPS; one focused on hunting ghosts in a spooky mansion, presented as a lighthearted adventure with some eerie undertones.  i2023kSky BluigisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00793na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264003700043300002300080500047500103542004000578655002500618655002800643GLME0500aLuigi's Mansion: Premium Deluxe 1bPortable Productionsc2021-11-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience Luigi's Mansion Like Never Before! With Improvements, Customization Toggles, Secret Unlockables, New Enemies, Areas, Achievements, Widescreen And Much More, Luigi's Mansion Has NEVER Felt So Complete! This Project Sets The Bar High Allowing For You To Define The Rules Of Your Own Gameplay! Made With Every Slice Of The Audience In Mind, The Possibilities Are Endless And So Is The Fun! Let's Get Spooky, With The Ever Evolving Luigi's Mansion Premium Deluxe!  i2021kPortable ProductionssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00540na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004600007264002400053300002300077500023700100542002800337655002500365655002800390GLME0600aLuigi's Mansion Beta Restoration Revamped 1bNintendoc2025-10-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aLuigi's Mansion Beta Restoration Revamped is a remake of the popular title, Luigi's Mansion Beta Restoration released in 2022, this rework has been made from the ground up and is now fully compatible with Nintendo Gamecube Hardware.  i2025kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00584na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264003600039300002300075500030800098542004000406655002800446GLME0900aLuigi's Mansion: Open World 1bPortable Productionsc2023-5-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aLuigi's Mansion but you explore however you'd want, its entirely up to you! Clear rooms, Catch Boos and Fight Bosses in any order you want! Try and be the quickest to clear the game and strategize to get the fastest clear time in this twist on the original Luigi's Mansion where the choice is all yours!  i2023kPortable ProductionssGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00433na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264003100037300002300068500013200091542003500223655002500258655002800283GLMERP00aLuigi's Mansion Repainted 1bGames Repaintedc2015-7-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Debut Mod of an ongoing group project of editing textures and other various files in video games for comedic entertainment.  i2015kGames RepaintedsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01017na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002400027300002300051500074000074542002800814655002500842655002800867GLMK0100aLuigi's Mansion 1bNintendoc2001-9-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aLuigi steps out from the shadow of his brother Mario and into the gloomy shadows of a very haunted house in this, his first-ever starring role. When Luigi learns that he's the proud new owner of a creepy old mansion, he's thrilled. Of course, his feelings immediately shift when his brother, the storied Mario, disappears from the house. Now, you'll have to help Luigi track his brother down, making your way through expansive 3D levels. Each stage is packed with ghosts and ghouls to put you on edge; and you'll be armed with a flashlight and a vacuum cleaner to help you capture your foes. Armed with a flashlight and a customized vacuum cleaner, Luigi must rid the mansion of Boos and ghouls -- and find his missing brother to boot!  i2001kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00368na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002800007264002500035300002300060500000500083542002900088655002500117655002500142655002800167655002700195GLMLFG00aLuigi's Final Ghosthunt 1bluigitimec2022-5-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2022kluigitimesGameTDB 7aHorror games2wiiext 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00740na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264003100034300002300065500047900088542003800567655002500605GLMN6400aProject Reality (Demo) 1bGoldenluigi Napierc2023--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Project Reality Demo is here! This is a Luigi's Mansion ROM hack created by Goldenluigi Napier and loser 2024. Featured in Kaze Emanuar's F3 2023 event, this is a sequel to Super Mario 64 where Luigi must save Mario! It has custom code, custom OST, custom room models and mechanics. Demo is downloadable at the Project Reality community Discord. Full game will be there too, when it eventually releases. Demo trailer is available on Goldenluigi Napier's YouTube channel.  i2023kGoldenluigi NapiersGameTDB 7aHorror games2wiiext00978na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003500007264003400042300002300076500062900099542003800728655002500766655002800791655002500819GLMPR100aProject Reality (Full Version) 1bGoldenluigi Napierc2025-5-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis ambitious Luigi’s Mansion ROM hack by Goldenluigi Napier and Sam is now complete, delivering a full-fledged sequel to Super Mario 64! Originally revealed at Kaze Emanuar’s F3 2023 event, Project Reality sends Luigi on a thrilling mission to rescue Mario across an expansive haunted world. Featuring custom code, an entirely original soundtrack, brand-new room models, bosses, and gameplay mechanics, this full release expands upon the demo with even more levels, puzzles, and secrets. Join the adventure with enhanced storytelling, unique environments, and appearances from characters like Wario, Waluigi, and more.  i2025kGoldenluigi NapiersGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aHorror games2wiiext00924na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002500007264002400032300002300056500060000079542002800679655002500707655002800732655003000760GLSE0100aSuper Luigi Sunshine 1bNintendoc2020-1-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aLuigi makes his debut on the Nintendo GameCube with Super Luigi Sunshine. On a vacation away from the Mushroom Kingdom, Luigi finds himself in a messy situation on the island of Delphino, where a Luigi look alike has been causing all kinds of trouble. Explore huge 3D environments that range from a lush waterfall paradise, to an exciting amusement park complete with a rollercoaster you can ride. Luigi makes use of a new water pack, which allows him to hover, launch, and rocket around levels, as well as spray enemies with. Luigi has never had so many cool new moves, or looked so good in 3D.  i2020kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00354na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003600007264003500043300002300078500000500101542003900106655002500145655002500170655002500195GM2EBJ00aMonkeyed Ball 2: Witty Subtitle 1bTwilight (BitesDev)c2018-10-6  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2018kTwilight (BitesDev)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00322na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264004100036300002300077500000500100542004500105655002500150655002500175GM2EDX00aSuper Monkey Ball Deluxe 1bSuper Monkey Ball Discordc2020-2-14  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kSuper Monkey Ball DiscordsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00352na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264002700042300002300069500008900092542003100181655003000212GM4E0500aMario Kart: Double Dash!! Plus 1bThat1loser4c2024-3-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart: Double Dash!! Plus is a retro track distribution created by That1loser4.  i2024kThat1loser4sGameTDB 7aKart racing games2wiiext00487na  a2200133   4500001000700000245005200007264003600059300002300095500011500118542004000233655002500273655002500298655003000323GM4E0800aMario Kart Double Dash!! Retro Track Grand Prix 1bPortable Productionsc2026-2-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis mod adds waves of brand new double dash styled retro tracks to the game without replacing current tracks!  i2026kPortable ProductionssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00281na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264001900034300002300053500000500076542002300081655002500104655003000129GM4E6400aM64 MKDD EXTENDED v2.0 1bM64c2023-9-20  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2023kM64sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext01203na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001800007264002400025300002300049500087900072542002800951655002500979655002601004655003901030GM8K0100aMetroid Prime 1bNintendoc2003-2-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aEveryone's favorite heroine, Samus Aran, is back! Packed to the gills with exploration, creative power-ups, and wicked enemies, Metroid Prime is a first-person adventure worthy of the Metroid stamp. An action-packed adventure set in the first-person perspective, Metroid Prime takes place just after the events in the original Metroid (NES). It has lead character Samus Aran, a bounty hunter by trade, chasing down the evil Space Pirates. Their intention is to use a genetic mutagen called Phazon to create a super army and take over the universe. While the installments in the series before have never been home to deeply involving storylines, Metroid Prime breaks the shell to offer up one of the most intriguing and read-worthy sagas yet. Developed by Texas-based Retro Studios. Metroid Prime brings all of the elements of the acclaimed franchise into a massive 3D arena.  i2003kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00193na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002900007264001300036300002300049500000500072542001800077GMPE0200aMario Party 4 Widescreen 1bc2023--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2023sGameTDB00974na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264001600032300002300048500071400071542001800785655002500803655002400828GMPEDX00aMario Party 4 Deluxe 1bc2024-10-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aMP4DX is a mod of Mario Party 4 which expands the game by changing it's item roster to one of a whopping 36 items. Does the Mini-Mega system get tiresome pretty quickly? Well, here's more items to play with and to spice up the MP4 experience! Returning, important staples from the Mario Party series that were absent on vanilla MP4, such as Mushrooms, Golden Mushrooms, Skeleton Keys and Plunder Chests, the items from Mario Party 3 are back too: Reverse Mushroom, Cellular Shopper, Bowser Phone now to your disposal. The Mario Party 1 dice blocks and items from newer games also made their way to this mod, as well as 5 rare items that you can get if you're lucky enough! (Including the dreaded Wacky Watch!)  i2024sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00319na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264003300044300002300077500000500100542003700105655002500142655003000167GMSE0200aSuper Mario Sunshine Multiplayer 1bBlastsoft Studiosc2017-2-20  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2017kBlastsoft StudiossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00370na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002300031300002300054500008800077542002800165655002500193655003000218GMSE0300aSuper Mario Sunburn 1bNintendoc2020-5-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aSuper Mario Sunburn is a project that has been in the work's for about 2 1/2 years.  i2020kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00285na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002400031300002300055500000500078542002800083655002500111655002700136GMSE0400aSuper Mario Eclipse 1bNintendoc2021-9-25  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00544na  a2200157   4500001000700000245002700007264002800034300002300062500014500085542003300230655002500263655002800288655003000316655001800346655002200364GMSE0500aSuper Mario Solarshine 1bDemonSlayer69c2022-3-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aSuper Mario Solarshine is a mod for Super Mario Sunshine that adds a bunch of levels from Mario Galaxy 1 and 2, along with many other games!  i2022kDemonSlayer69sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext 7aDemos2wiiext 7aEmulators2wiiext00963na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002500007264002400032300002300056500060000079542002800679655002500707655002800732655002700760655003000787GMSK0100aSuper Mario Sunshine 1bNintendoc2002-7-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario makes his debut on the Nintendo GameCube with Super Mario Sunshine. On a vacation away from the Mushroom Kingdom, Mario finds himself in a messy situation on the island of Delphino, where a Mario look alike has been causing all kinds of trouble. Explore huge 3D environments that range from a lush waterfall paradise, to an exciting amusement park complete with a rollercoaster you can ride. Mario makes use of a new water pack, which allows him to hover, launch, and rocket around levels, as well as spray enemies with. Mario has never had so many cool new moves, or looked so good in 3D.  i2002kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext01004na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002700007264003800034300002300072500060600095542004300701655002500744655003000769655003400799655002500833GNLE8200aMario Kart Arcade GP 2 1bNintendo/Namco/Triforcec2007-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Arcade GP 2 (マリオカート アーケードグランプリ2) is an arcade-only iteration of Nintendo's Mario Kart series, developed by Namco. Designed for the Triforce arcade board (also used for F-Zero AX), players can race as one of eleven characters in twenty-four tracks. On certain machines, for an additional fee, a player's data can be saved on a magnetic card which can be inserted into the machine again later to retain unlocked items and records. Nintendo's limited role of development was mainly isolated to ensuring that it was a worthy title for the established franchised.  i2007kNintendo/Namco/TriforcesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aOff-road racing games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00193na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002700007264001500034300002300049500000500072542001800077GNLJ8200aMario Kart Arcade GP 2 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00209na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004500007264001300052300002300065500000500088542001800093GOZED304aThe Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time 1.0 1bc2026--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2026sGameTDB00194na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003000007264001300037300002300050500000500073542001800078GP5E0200aMario Party 5+ Base Patch 1bc2023--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2023sGameTDB