aVirtua Striker 4 Ver.2006 1bSega Japanc2006-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aJapan Version of the Triforce Arcade Game Virtua Striker 4 Ver. 2006 (Modified to have an independent game ID.)  i2006kSega JapansGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00395na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003000007264002500037300002300062500006900085542003000154655002500184655002500209655002700234GVSJ9P00aVirtua Striker 4 Ver.2006 1bSega Japanc2006-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aJapan Version of Triforce Arcade Game Virtua Striker 4 ver.2006.  i2006kSega JapansGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00387na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002300033300002300056500010200079542002800181655002500209655003100234GX2E0100aPokémon XG: Next Gen 1bNintendoc2016-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe world's first ever Pokemon XD:GoD hack! Features physical/special split, fairy type and more.  i2016kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00301na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264003700028300002300065500003600088542004200124655002500166GXQP4100aTaxi 3: The Game 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2023-8-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aTranslation by DOL Translations  i2023kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00630na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264003100043300002300074500031500097542003500412655002500447655003600472GXSRTE00aSonic Riders Tournament Edition 1bRiders Workshopc2020-1-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aSonic Riders Tournament Edition is a fanmade modification of Sonic Riders, that gears the game towards competitive play. This mod is being built on the belief that Sonic Riders was a sorely misunderstood game, and that it's in-depth mechanics and skill ceiling actually have competitive potential as an eSport.  i2020kRiders WorkshopsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aFuturistic racing games2wiiext00250na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264002000043300002300063500000500086542002400091655002500115GXTE8P00aSonic Riders Tournament Edition 1bSegac2020-3-13  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kSegasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00297na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264001700026300002300043500003600066542002400102655002400126655002500150GY3E0100aDonkey Konga 3 1bNintendoc--  a1 Wii optical disc  aTranslation by DOL Translations  ikNintendosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext01209na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264002400048300002300072500091100095542002801006655002501034655002801059GZ2K0100aZelda no Densetsu: Twilight Princess 1bNintendoc2006-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aLink, a young man raised as a wrangler in a small, rural village, is ordered by the mayor to attend the Hyrule Summit. He sets off, oblivious to the dark fate that has descended upon the kingdom. When he enters the Twilight Realm that has covered Hyrule, he transforms into a wolf and is captured. A mysterious figure named Midna helps him break free, and with the aid of her magic, they set off to free the land from the shadows. Link must explore the vast land of Hyrule and uncover the mystery behind its plunge into darkness. As he does, he'll have to enlist the aid of friendly folk, solve puzzles and battle his way through dangerous dungeons. In the Twilight Realm, he’ll have to use his wolf abilities and Midna’s magic to bring light to the land. Besides his trusty sword and shield, Link will use his bow and arrows, fight while on horseback and use a wealth of other items, both new and old.  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00349na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264002300046300002300069500009400092542002600186655002700212GZBEB200aZatch Bell! Go! Go! Mamodo Fight!! 1bBandaic2005-12-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnglish translation patch of Konjiki no Gash Bell!! Go! Go! Mamono Fight!! by SuperrSonic  i2005kBandaisGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00903na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002400045300002300069500060800092542002800700655002500728655002800753GZLK0100aZelda no Densetsu: Kaze no Takuto 1bNintendoc2002-12-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aNintendo's thematic action-adventure sequel to Ocarina of Time takes the series back to its more cartoonish roots. Utilizing a completely new look with cel-shaded graphics, the game casts players in the role of a familiar young boy, who sets out to save his kidnapped sister. Gameplay is vintage Zelda, only that the game's overworld is covered by water. Players have to control the direction of the wind to sail across the ocean and find dungeons, towns, and plenty of secrets. A special Game Boy Advance link-up option lets another player join the quest and give hints and assistance via the handheld.  i2002kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00343na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004700007264002500054300002300079500003900102542002800141655002500169655002700194HBWE0100aNew Super Mario Bros. Wii: Hellboy Edition 1bNintendoc2010-10-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnjoy this Custom made by Hellboy.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00300na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264002400040300002300064500000500087542002800092655002800120655003000148HSMP0100aHarder Super Mario Bros. Wii 1bNintendoc2019-3-16  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2019kNintendosGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aTraditional games2wiiext00356na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002800007264002000035300002300055500004800078542002300126655002400149655002400173655002500197J24E4100aJust Dance 2024 Edition 1bMatc2023-10-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aJust dance mod with 2024 songs made by Mat.  i2023kMatsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aRhythm 