ly in 3D, full of incredible effects and scenarios. Now you can compete with your friends online and become the greatest fighter of all time.  i2023kMarkZsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00676na  a2200109   4500001000700000245006100007264003400068300002300102500037600125542003800501655002700539RDXE7000aDragon Ball Z Budokai Tenkaichi 3 Version! Latino Beta 3 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2016-7-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aDragon Ball Z: Budokai Tenkaichi 3 offers online multiplayer play, more than 150 playable characters, more than 30 battle stages, and upgraded shading techniques providing enhanced and devastating effects. Furthermore, the Wii control system has been fine-tuned, allowing players to easily direct characters, mimic their favorite DBZ moves, and execute explosive attacks.  i2016kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00689na  a2200109   4500001000700000245007500007264003300082300002300115500037600138542003800514655002700552RDYE7000aDragon Ball Z Budokai Tenkaichi 3 Version! Latino [BETA 3 - UPDATE 1 ] 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2017-7-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aDragon Ball Z: Budokai Tenkaichi 3 offers online multiplayer play, more than 150 playable characters, more than 30 battle stages, and upgraded shading techniques providing enhanced and devastating effects. Furthermore, the Wii control system has been fine-tuned, allowing players to easily direct characters, mimic their favorite DBZ moves, and execute explosive attacks.  i2017kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00669na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005400007264003400061300002300095500037600118542003800494655002700532RDZE7000aDragon Ball Z Budokai Tenkaichi 3 Version! Latino 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2014-2-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aDragon Ball Z: Budokai Tenkaichi 3 offers online multiplayer play, more than 150 playable characters, more than 30 battle stages, and upgraded shading techniques providing enhanced and devastating effects. Furthermore, the Wii control system has been fine-tuned, allowing players to easily direct characters, mimic their favorite DBZ moves, and execute explosive attacks.  i2014kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00648na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005300007264002000060300002300080500038300103542002500486655002700511REBE7000aDragon Ball Z Budokai Tenkaichi 2[ALPHA][CUSTOM] 1bMarkZc2019-5-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aDragon Ball Z: Budokai Tenkaichi 2 offers the complete DBZ mythology from Dragon Ball to Dragon Ball GT with a staggering roster of over 100 DBZ heroes and villains and an expansive story mode that allows players to recreate some of the storied confrontations from the TV show, or all-new showdowns of their own with characters that never actually fought in the animated series.  i2019kMarkZsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00341na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005700007264002100064300002300085500007100108542002500179655002700204RESE7000aDragon Ball Z Budokai Tenkaichi 3 Versión! Español 1bMarkZc2021-5-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aSpanish version of Budokai Tenkaichi 3 NTSC-U Translated by MarkZ.  i2021kMarkZsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00779na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264002400024300002300048500054400071542002900615655002500644REVE6400aRevo Kart 64 1bLucasArtsc2019-9-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aRevo Kart 64 is a custom track distribution made by CuberHax. It includes all Mario Kart 64 tracks, as well as 16 tracks from Super Mario Kart. It also includes all arenas from Mario Kart 64 and Super Mario Kart, along with online play, custom music, custom item icons, the Pipe Frame custom vehicle by KTH, and the Kamek custom character by DJ Lowgey. Some tracks have been modified to work on their slots, and the slots of Mario Circuit and Moonview Highway have been swapped to keep the original order of tracks without having problems.  i2019kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00604na  a2200109   4500001000700000245007700007264003800084300002300122500028000145542004200425655002700467REYE7000aDragon Ball Z  Budokai Tenkaichi  3 Version! Latino [BETA 3 - UPDATE 2 ] 1bDragon Porunga´s Teamc2018-2-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis new installment of the Budokai Tenkaichi series combines the speed of the fight and the action with a new environment made entirely in 3D, full of effects and incredible scenarios. Now you can compete with your friends online and become the ultimate fighter of all time.  i2018kDragon Porunga´s TeamsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00731na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002400042300002300066500042100089542002800510655003100538655004000569RFEK0100aFire Emblem Akatsuki no Megami 1bNintendoc2007-2-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aThree years have passed since the great war that ended in the death of Mad King Ashnard. His country of Daein suffers under the rule of the war's victors. Now, a small band of freedom fighters struggle to end the long, dark night of Daein's oppression. Micaiah, Sothe and a host of others – the infamous "Dawn Brigade" – rally under the banner of Daein's long-lost prince to bring a new day to this ravaged land.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aTactical role-playing games2wiiext00216na  a2200097   4500001000700000245005200007264001300059300002300072500000500095542001800100RFEP0200aFire Emblem: Radiant Dawn - Reverse Recruitment 1bc2021--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021sGameTDB00731na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002400042300002300066500042100089542002800510655003100538655004000569RFEPUD00aFire Emblem: Radian Dawn Undub 1bNintendoc2007-11-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aThree years have passed since the great war that ended in the death of Mad King Ashnard. His country of Daein suffers under the rule of the war's victors. Now, a small band of freedom fighters struggle to end the long, dark night of Daein's oppre