12-12.ntsc 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2012-12-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the newest release of Wiimms Mario Kart Fun series. It contains some new tracks, some updated tracks. And the most popular tracks are there again.  i2012kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00892na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001500007264001600022300002300038500067800061542001800739655002500757RMCE1C00a100cc Pack 1bc2021-1-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a100cc Pack is a distribution created by Sara-L. It replaces the original 32 tracks with versions that play at about 100cc speed when played on 150cc or in a Time Trial. Due to slightly less precision with the speed factor compared to the actual speed factor used for 100cc (1/256 compared to 1/16777216), the 100cc-S version is about 0.2% slower than 100cc, and the 100cc-F version is about 0.3% faster than 100cc. While this was made so that players could practice 100cc within a Time Trial, it can also be used to play 100cc in Mirror Mode or to play 50cc online (using the 100cc-S version along with setting the actual engine class to 100cc is about 1% faster than 50cc)  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00244na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264002600026300002300052500000500075542002900080655002500109RMCE1H00aMKWII HoopaN13 1bHoopa N13c2020-10-22  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kHoopa N13sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00253na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264002600035300002300061500000500084542002900089655002500118RMCE1N00aMario Kart Wii HoopaN13 1bHoopa N13c2020-10-22  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kHoopa N13sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00450na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264004500039300002300084500015900107542004900266655002500315RMCE2000aWiimms MKW Fun 2013-04.ntsc 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2013-4-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the newest release of Wiimms Mario Kart Fun series. It contains some new tracks, some updated tracks. And the most popular tracks are there again.  i2013kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00449na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264004400039300002300083500015900106542004900265655002500314RMCE2100aWiimms MKW Fun 2013-09.ntsc 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2013-9-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the newest release of Wiimms Mario Kart Fun series. It contains some new tracks, some updated tracks. And the most popular tracks are there again.  i2013kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00387na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264004600039300002300085500009500108542004900203655002500252RMCE2200aWiimms MKW Fun 2013-10.ntsc 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2013-10-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the newest release of Wiimms Mario Kart Fun series. It contains 128 custom tracks.  i2013kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00404na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264004500039300002300084500011300107542004900220655002500269RMCE2300aWiimms MKW Fun 2014-01.ntsc 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2014-1-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the newest release of Wiimms Mario Kart Fun series. It contains 32 Wii tracks and 152 custom tracks.  i2014kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00476na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264001600041300002300057500024300080542001800323655002500341RMCE2400aWiimms MKW Retro 2014-02.ntsc 1bc2014-2-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Retro 2014-02 is an alternative distribution for Wiimms MKW-Fun series. It contains adoptions of old Nintendo consoles (Wii, DS, GameCube, N64, GBA und SNES) and some other retro tracks. Overall there are 160 tracks sorted by console.  i2014sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00485na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264004500039300002300084500019400107542004900301655002500350RMCE2500aWiimms MKW Fun 2014-04.ntsc 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2014-4-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the last edition of MKW-Fun before Nintendo shuts down the servers on 20th May. You have the possibility to play 15 new and 145 old custom tracks for four weeks before this happens.  i2014kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00308na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264004600039300002300085500001600108542004900124655002500173RMCE2600aWiimms MKW Fun 2014-11.ntsc 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2014-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  acoming soon  i2014kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00507na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003200007264004500039300002300084500013200107542004900239655002500288655003000313655003000343RMCE2700aWiimms MKW-Fun 2015-03.ntsc 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2015-3-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2015-03 now contains 184 Custom tracks and of course the 32 original tracks. All 216 tracks are distributed to 54 cups.  i2015kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aBike racing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00471na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264004500041300002300086500017800109542004900287655002500336RMCE2800aWiimms MKW Retro 2015-05.ntsc 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2015-5-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the anniversary edition for the first anniversary of Wiimmfi. Exactly one year ago, on 10 May 2014, Wiimmfi was released to the public and is available continuously.  i2015kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00395na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264004500039300002300084500010400107542004900211655002500260RMCE2900aWiimms MKW-Fun 2015-08.ntsc 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2015-8-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe previous release of MKW-Fun is now 5 months old and the custom track developers have been busy.  i2015kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00571na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264004100039300002300080500028800103542004500391655002500436RMCE3000aWiimms MKW-Fun 2015-12.ntsc 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2015-12-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe new edition od MKW-Fun comes with 19 new tracks, 32 updated track and several new features. Some tracks go over 1 up to 8 laps with correct lap counter. For some tracks, the base speed is higher. And after a hit by thunder cloud, the player is small only 5 instead of 10 seconds.  i2015kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00393na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264004100039300002300080500011000103542004500213655002500258RMCE3100aWiimms MKW-Fun 2016-02.ntsc 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2016-2-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2016-02 is now absolutely packed! It comes with 248 tracks in 62 Cups, thereof 216 custom tracks.  i2016kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00401na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264004000039300002300079500011900102542004500221655002500266RMCE3200aWiimms MKW-Fun 2016-07.ntsc 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2016-7-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aAfter the poll, 11 new tracks got into MKW Fun 2016-07. However, 11 old tracks were removed due to space shortage.  i2016kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00308na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004200038300002300080500002500103542004500128655002500173RMCE3300aWiimms MKW-Fun 2016-10.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2016-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aAutumn Motor Racing:  i2016kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00306na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500002400102542004500126655002500171RMCE3400aWiimms MKW-Fun 2017-05.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2017-5-10  a1 Wii optical disc  a3 years of Wiimmfi!  i2017kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00615na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500033300102542004500435655002500480RMCE3500aWiimms MKW-Fun 2017-12.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2017-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis new release of MKW-Fun features 34 all new tracks and multiple updates. Therefor 34 established tracks had to make way for the new ones. The tracks in MKW-Fun have been drawn by lot this time and removed tracks will be in the draw pot with an increased chance next time. This way there will be no more permanent fare-wells.  i2017kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00595na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500031300102542004500415655002500460RMCE3600aWiimms MKW-Fun 2018-03.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2018-3-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aJust 3 months after the previous distribution, MKW-Fun 2018-03 is now released. It contains 16 new and 14 updated tracks. In addition to that, 25 tracks return to the game because of the rotation system. On the other hand, 63 tracks did not have as much luck in the dsraw and therefor not included this time.  i2018kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00496na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500021400102542004500316655002500361RMCE3700aWiimms MKW-Fun 2018-06.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2018-6-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aSince the end of 2017, MKW-Fun is published every 3 months. Again, there are 18 new and 23 updated tracks. The rotation brings other 26 tracks back, so there are a total of 67 alterations over its predecessor.  i2018kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00496na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500021400102542004500316655002500361RMCE3800aWiimms MKW-Fun 2018-09.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2018-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aSince the end of 2017, MKW-Fun is published every 3 months. Again, there are 17 new and 25 updated tracks. The rotation brings other 37 tracks back, so there are a total of 79 alterations over its predecessor.  i2018kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00292na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002100041300002300062500000500085542002500090655002500115655003000140RMCE3900aWiimms Mario Kart Fun 2018-12 1bWiimmc2018-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2018kWiimmsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00539na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264001500038300002300053500031000076542001800386655002500404RMCE3H00a3Hunts's Custom Track Pack 1bc2020-5-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a3hunts's Custom Track Pack is a custom track distribution created by 3hunts. It features 31 custom tracks (and one track edit) that the author likes, automatic BRSAR patching and a custom Wiimmfi region. There are some hard, easy, old, and newer tracks, some of which being a part of custom track history.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00372na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264001500034300002300049500014700072542001800219655002500237RMCE3S00aHide and Seek 3DS Pack 1bc2021-6-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aHide and Seek 3DS Pack is a distribution created by Krummers. It contains tracks and arenas from Mario Kart 7 for the game mode Hide and Seek.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00523na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500024100102542004500343655002500388RMCE4000aWiimms MKW-Fun 2019-03.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2019-3-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aSince the end of 2017, MKW-Fun is published every 3 months. This time again 17 new and 22 updated tracks are included. Due to the rotation, another 27 tracks are back, so that there are a total of 66 changes compared to the predecessor.  i2019kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00634na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500035200102542004500454655002500499RMCE4100aWiimms MKW-Fun 2019-06.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2019-6-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time, the new MKW-Fun is based on LE-CODE by Leseratte with many new options (see below). In particular, all tracks are included, which are rotated in the previous versions due to lack of space. Since the rotation is no longer necessary, the upcoming versions of MKW-Fun no longer appear in the fixed 3-month interval, but on demand.  i2019kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00485na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004200038300002300080500020200103542004500305655002500350RMCE4200aWiimms MKW-Fun 2019-10.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2019-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aTechnically, MKW-Fun has not changed. Only new tracks have been added or existing tracks have been updated. The same LE-CODE works in the background as before. This allows up to 4000 custom tracks.  i2019kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00692na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500041000102542004500512655002500557RMCE4300aWiimms MKW-Fun 2020-02.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2020-2-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the anniversary edition of MKW-Fun. Exactly 10 years ago, on February 14, 2010, the very first distribution of MKW-Fun. MKW-Fun 2010-02 was published in collaboration of Wiimm with Jillian. At that time they had to swap the tracks in manual and painstaking work with WiiScrubber. Since Wiimm definitely didn't want to do that again, he started to implement the creation of the images in WIT tools.  i2020kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00583na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500030100102542004500403655002500448RMCE4400aWiimms MKW-Fun 2020-06.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2020-6-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2020-06 appeared on June 18th 2020. On this day, Wiimmfi runs exactly 2231 days. And that is exactly the number of days with which the original Mario Kart Wii could be played on the original Nintendo/Gamespy servers. From now on Wiimmfi.de exists longer. So a special Wiimmfi anniversary!  i2020kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00552na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264004200034300002300076500027300099542004500372655002500417RMCE4500aWiimms MKW-Fun 2020-12 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2020-12-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis version of MKW-Fun was released on December 12th 2020. MKW-Fun 2020-12 contains 10 battle arenas plus 32 original tracks plus 376 custom tracks, which are divided into 2 Battle Cups and many Racing Cups. Like its successor MKW-Fun 2020-06, it is based on LE-CODE.  i2020kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00658na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264003900038300002300077500033600100542004500436655002500481655003000506RMCE4600aWiimms MKW-Fun 2021-09.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2021-9-  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2021-09 was published on September 11, 2021, a full 9 months after the previous edition. Usually MKW-Fun appears every 3 to 6 months. This edition contains 10 arenas plus 32 original tracks plus 404 custom tracks. Compared to the previous version, there are 55 new custom tracks and 62 updates; 16 tracks have been removed.  i2021kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00722na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264004000042300002300082500039700105542004300502655002500545655003000570RMCE4700aWiimms MKW-History 2021-12.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/wii/mkwc2021-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aWiimms Mario Kart History 2021-12 is a custom track distribution created by Wiimm. It was released on 2021-12-18 and it contains all the tracks that were ever included in any MKW-Fun distribution since 2010 (except the tracks that cause crashes). In addition, tracks that are planned for the next regular distribution of MKW-Fun have been included. These tracks fall under the "NEW" category.  i2021kWiimm, wiimm.de/wii/mkwsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00626na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500034400102542004500446655002500491RMCE4800aWiimms MKW-Fun 2022-05.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2022-5-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2022-05 was published on May 21, 2022, 8 months after its predecessor MKW-Fun 2021-09. In between, the alternative variant Wiimms Mario Kart History 2021-12 was released. Compared to MKW-Fun 2021-09, 26 tracks have been removed, 42 new tracks have been added and 48 tracks have been updated. In addition, 1 former track was reused.  i2022kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00547na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264001700038300002300055500031600078542001800394655002500412RMCE4900aWiimms MKW-Fun 2022-11.usa 1bc2022-11-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2022-11 was published on November 12, 2022. This edition contains 10 original areanes, 63 texture hacks of the arenas, 32 original tracks, 320 texture hacks of the tracks and 436 custom tracks. Compared to the previous version, there are 40 new custom tracks and 44 updates; 22 tracks have been removed.  i2022sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00368na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004300007264001600050300002300066500012600089542001800215655002500233RMCE4D00a4DR Yoshi1998's Texture And Music Pack 1bc2021-1-22  a1 Wii optical disc  a4DR Yoshi1998's Texture & Music Pack is a texture hack and custom music distribution created by PurpleYoshiFanSpence1998.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00409na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264001500039300002300054500017900077542001800256655002500274RMCE4P00aPotatoman44's CTs Stretched 1bc2021-8-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aPotatoman44's CTs Stretched is a custom track distribution created by Potatoman44. It features some of the author's custom tracks that have been scaled by 30× on the Y-axis.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00596na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264004200043300002300085500030800108542004500416655002500461RMCE5000aWiimms MKW-Textures 2022-12.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2022-12-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Textures 2022-12 is a special edition for friends of texture hacks. It contains 32 original tracks, 10 original arenas and 852 texture hacks. When the player selects an original track or arena, a matching texture hack is randomly selected by the system. Texture tracks can also be selected directly.  i2022kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00578na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500029600102542004500398655002500443RMCE5100aWiimms MKW-Fun 2023-09.usa 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2023-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2023-09 was published on September 22, 2023. This edition contains 10 original areanes with 68 texture hacks, 32 original tracks with 316 texture hack and 449 custom tracks. Compared to the previous version, there are 45 new custom tracks and 33 updates; 36 tracks have been removed.  i2023kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00264na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264003000036300002300066500000500089542003500094655002500129RMCE5400aMARIO KART CRIS DELUXE 2 1bCRIA & Asley bbc2020-2-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kCRIA & Asley bbsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00343na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001300007264001600020300002300036500013100059542001800190655002500208RMCE5C00a5cc Pack 1bc2021-1-25  a1 Wii optical disc  a5cc Pack is a distribution created by Sara-L. It replaces the 32 original tracks with versions that play at about 71.1% speed.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00384na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002400035300002300059500009700082542002800179655002500207655003000232RMCE6000aMario Kart Wii Faraphel 1bFaraphelc2021-5-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis Mario Kart Wii mod contains about 1'200+ new tracks with a score between 1 and 3 stars.  i2021kFaraphelsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00524na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264002400024300002300048500024700071542002900318655002500347655003000372RMCE6400aPeach Kart 8 1bDark Starc2015-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aPeach Kart 8 is a mega distribution like MKW Hack Pack. It's support of maximum track slots is based on CTGP Revolution by MrBean35000vr and Chadderz. The download will include a music pack, custom fonts, custom characters and minimap colors.  i2015kDark StarsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00268na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264003800025300002300063500000500086542004200091655002500133RMCE6900aCria Kart Wii 1bChrisDark64 & Asley :vc2018-5-22  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2018kChrisDark64 & Asley :vsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00384na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264001600034300002300050500015800073542001800231655002500249RMCE6N00aHide and Seek N64 Pack 1bc2021-7-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aHide and Seek N64 Pack is a distribution created by Krummers and Derby. It contains tracks and arenas from Mario Kart 64 for the game mode Hide and Seek.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00224na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002200007264003100029300002300060500000500083542003800088RMCE7000aStickboy Kart Wii 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB00440na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002600007264002000033300002300053500024100076542002500317RMCE7300aMario Kart Adventures 1bHelixc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Adventures is a custom Mario Kart Wii game that aims to provide a new Mario Kart experience for Wii. It plans to change the physics, all the tracks, all the music, most of the characters, most of the items, and all the menus.  i2014kHelixsGameTDB00440na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002600007264002000033300002300053500024100076542002500317RMCE7400aMario Kart Adventures 1bHelixc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Adventures is a custom Mario Kart Wii game that aims to provide a new Mario Kart experience for Wii. It plans to change the physics, all the tracks, all the music, most of the characters, most of the items, and all the menus.  i2014kHelixsGameTDB00289na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264004000041300002300081500000500104542004500109655002500154RMCE7500aCam, Tom and Troy's CTGP Pack 1bSales Curve (Storm / SCI)c2017-3-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2017kSales Curve (Storm / SCI)sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00757na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003800023300002300061500045300084542004300537655002500580655003000605RMCE7600aPro CT Pack 1bHuili, Pro CT Pack Teamc2014-4-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is Huili's first Custom Track Distribution. It is a collection of the 32 hardest custom tracks he could find. This distribution was originally thought of as being the ULTIMATE Time Trial distribution in it's early phases, but with the Custom Servers up this is also Wiimmfi compatible so you can enjoy this distribution with your friends online. Huili invites you to play this distribution with those on your friend rosters so you can meet up.  i2014kHuili, Pro CT Pack TeamsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00187na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002100007264001500028300002300043500000500066542001800071RMCE7700aSpyKid's CT Pack 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00206na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003400007264001600041300002300057500000500080542002300085RMCE7800aMario Kart: Double Dash!! Wii 1bTHQc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kTHQsGameTDB00421na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264002700029300002300056500017700079542003000256655002500286RMCE7T00aCuber's Hack Pack 1bScholasticc2019-12-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aCuber's Hack Pack is a custom track distribution made by CuberHax. It has older and newer tracks, and has modified vehicle stats, 200cc, online play, and a My Stuff folder.  i2019kScholasticsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00212na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003000007264002100037300002300058500000500081542002800086RMCE8100aSpade's Custom Track Pack 1bTeichikuc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kTeichikusGameTDB00249na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264002600029300002300055500000500078542003100083655002500114RMCE8600aMario Kart Cris 4 1bChrisDark64c2020-5-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kChrisDark64sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00264na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264002900038300002300067500000500090542003400095655002500129RMCE8800aMario Kart Cris Deluxe 3.0 1bDATAM-Polystarc2020-3-3  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kDATAM-PolystarsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00246na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264002300032300002300055500000500078542002800083655002500111RMCE8900aMario Kart Cris Kuin 1bCría :vc2017-9-5  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2017kCría :vsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00376na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264001600031300002300047500015300070542001800223655002500241RMCE8X00aMario Kart Wii X DS 1bc2020-4-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Wii x DS is a custom track distribution created by AC. It is a remake distribution made to play Mario Kart DS tracks with Mario Kart Wii.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00265na  a2200109   45000010007000002450037000072640027000443000023