5655003000330RMCE9600aMario Kart 6 1bSuper-Mario68c2014-12-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart 6 is a custom track distribution created by Super-Mario68 based on Mario Kart series tracks. Mario Kart 6 will update every so often with another music pack and more tracks added.  i2014kSuper-Mario68sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00289na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004200007264003600049300002300085500000500108542004100113655002500154RMCE9700aMario Kart Fusion v2.0 -Deluxe style- 1bChrisDark64 & FJRoyetc2021-3-5  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021kChrisDark64 & FJRoyetsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00197na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003100007264001500038300002300053500000500076542001800081RMCE9800aMario Kart Wii Awesomeness 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00287na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264003600047300002300083500000500106542004100111655002500152RMCE9900aMario Kart Fusion v2.0 -Cris style- 1bChrisDark64 & FJRoyetc2021-3-5  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021kChrisDark64 & FJRoyetsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00585na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264001600043300002300059500035000082542001800432655002500450RMCE9R00aRookie's Texture And Music Pack 1bc2013-8-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is simply a texture / custom music pack made by Rookie to run off of the MyStuff folder in CTGP Revolution. After downloading the file, extract the file to your ctgpr folder, and merge it with your MyStuff folder. Textures were created by various authors, and all BRSTM files were created by Rookie. Credit goes to all the texture creators!  i2013sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00642na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002100033300002300054500036400077542002400441655002500465655003000490RMCEA100aMario Kart Adventures 1bnonec2014-11-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Adventures is a custom track distribution with 8 themed cups. The goal of the project is to build a polished and unique version of Mario Kart. Most of the characters have either been texture modded or replaced by a completely new character. The game is distributed with a soundtrack mostly made up of free fan-made arrangements of video game music.  i2014knonesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00323na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264002300048300002300071500006700094542002700161655002500188RMCEA200aMario Kart Wii Deluxe -Blue Edition- 1bFJRoyetc2018-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay Mario Kart Wii with more tracks, more music and more fun!  i2018kFJRoyetsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00322na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264002300047300002300070500006700093542002700160655002500187RMCEA300aMario Kart Wii Deluxe -Red Edition- 1bFJRoyetc2018-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay Mario Kart Wii with more tracks, more music and more fun!  i2018kFJRoyetsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00324na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004200007264002300049300002300072500006700095542002700162655002500189RMCEA400aMario Kart Wii Deluxe -Green Edition- 1bFJRoyetc2018-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay Mario Kart Wii with more tracks, more music and more fun!  i2018kFJRoyetsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00375na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264003900029300002300068500010600091542004300197655002500240RMCEA500aAlpha's Track Mix 1bK.Amusement Leasing Co.c2020-1-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aAlpha's Track Mix is a custom track distribution created by AlphaFlame. It features 32 custom tracks.  i2020kK.Amusement Leasing Co.sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00323na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004200007264002200049300002300071500006700094542002700161655002500188RMCEA600aMario Kart Wii Deluxe -Koopa Edition- 1bFJRoyetc2023-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay Mario Kart Wii with more tracks, more music and more fun!  i2023kFJRoyetsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00505na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264001600024300002300040500028900063542001800352655002500370RMCEA700aAnt Kart Wii 1bc2020-1-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aAnt Kart Wii is a distribution created by Floogal, designed for CTGP Revolution's My Stuff users. It currently contains 12 Nintendo tracks that are scaled up by 10 times on all of the axes and changed to 1 lap, along with a 6.0× speed modifier. The tracks have a Multiplayer variant.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00492na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002500007264002600032300002300058500016900081542003100250655002500281655002700306655002500333RMCEA800aMario Kart Arcade JY 1bCharlyRetroc2016-4-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario kart arcade JY is a Mario Kart Wii hack whose characteristics are derived which brings new worlds, characters, vehicles and mas.algunos of his characters are:  i2016kCharlyRetrosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00966na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264003500040300002300075500069400098542003900792655002500831RMCEA900aMario Kart Wii - The Top 100 1bTechnos Japan Corp.c2020-5-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Wii: The Top 100 is a custom track distribution created by _tZ, ALPHAMARIOX, Ferv, Jasperr, WoomyLuma, Skipper93653, Natani, YoshTaku, and ZPL Gaming. It celebrates the 2010s of Mario Kart Wii custom track creation; containing 100 tracks from the 2010s (10 representing each year), which have been voted on by the community, and 20 developer picked tracks (two picked by each developer), which are tracks the developers would have hoped to pass the vote but did not. As this distribution uses LE-CODE, it takes advantage of the features included with LE-CODE, such as the support of Battle Mode co-existing with the extra track slots, with one arena from each year of the 2010s.  i2020kTechnos Japan Corp.sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00199na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003500007264001300042300002300055500000500078542001800083RMCEAI00aMario Kart Wii AIParam Edition 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00185na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002100007264001300028300002300041500000500064542001800069RMCEAQ00aAntique Kart Wii 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00285na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002200032300002300054500000500077542002600082655002500108655003000133RMCEAS00aMario Kart All-Stars 1bCad111c2022-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2022kCad111sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00206na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004200007264001300049300002300062500000500085542001800090RMCEAT00aAndré's Retro Texture and Music Pack 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00628na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005100007264001700058300002300075500037700098542001800475655002500493RMCEAX00aMario Kart Wii but You Never Stop Accelerating 1bc2020-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Wii but you Never Stop Accelerating is a custom game mode created by HackerCop. It effectively disables the acceleration limit of the game allowing players to reach impossible speeds of up to 1600km/h. This game mode supports WHackR for online gameplay and users can run custom content by placing files in the SD\infiniteAcceleration\accelerationEdit directory.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00444na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264002200031300002300053500020800076542002500284655002500309RMCEB100aMario Kart Wii 2017 1bASCIIc2016-12-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aHere it comes! Mario Kart Wii 2017. A new Mario Kart with all updated tracks from SNES to 3DS and some amazing extras! Stay tuned. You can also play online with your friends too! Full Wiimmfi connection.  i2016kASCIIsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00295na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264002400031300002300055500005400078542002800132655002500160RMCEB200aMario Kart Wii 2017 1bNintendoc2017-4-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aNew version from the popular Mario Kart Wii 2017.  i2017kNintendosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00310na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264002400033300002300057500006700080542002800147655002500175RMCEB400aMario Kart Wii Deluxe 1bNintendoc2018-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay Mario Kart Wii with more tracks, more music and more fun!  i2018kNintendosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00198na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003400007264001300041300002300054500000500077542001800082RMCEB500aMario Kart Wii Deluxe B-Sides 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00484na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002000007264002900027300002300056500011800079542003200197655002500229655003000254655003000284655002400314RMCEB600aMario Kart 7 JY 1bCharly Retroc2016-12-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart 7 JY It is a mod based on the Mk7 3ds including new music, textures, worlds, characters and much more.  i2016kCharly RetrosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aBike racing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00986na  a2200157   4500001000700000245002100007264002900028300002300057500058000080542003200660655002000692655002500712655003000737655003600767655002500803RMCEB800aMario Kart Mania 1bCharly Retroc2017-12-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aAnother great game (MOD) by Mario Kart knocks on the door of your console from Charly Retro. Mario Kart Mania brings 32 tracks, Sonic as a playable character, a redesign of the menu and graphic improvements of tracks and vehicles. Do not you want to complete the whole game again? No problem! Mario Kart Mania uses your data of the original game, therefore you will not have any problem. The game has its online mode for you to enjoy this MOD with everyone, is not it great ?! Turn on the engines ... Because a fascinating experience type Mario Kart 7 & 8 await you. TO PLAY!  i2017kCharly RetrosGameTDB 7aFantasy2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext01264na  a2200169   4500001000700000245004100007264002600048300002300074500079800097542003000895655002500925655002700950655003000977655003601007655003001043655002101073RMCEBC00aNeptune777 Forza MAX Broad Challenge 1bNeptune777c2020-10-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe fourth volume of the Neptune777 Forza MAX series of mods, is a mod with tracks vs race selection of a wide competitive gamma where you will have to give high performance, each one has a great competition environment, a mod in which only with the maximum mastery of the vehicle you will be able to take the lead to the end, tracks of the most diverse complexity and each one an extensive challenge with which you will improve your driving skills without doubting, in terms of pure quality battle arena, they are all diverse and great with their own textures and environments never seen before, a wide challenge awaits you in this mod, where it will be extensive and high performance, can you overcome it? Now available Neptune777 Forza MAX Broad Challenger, he challenged beyond the limits.  i2020kNeptune777sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aBike racing games2wiiext 7aFuturistic racing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aWargames2wiiext00299na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002300044300002300067500000500090542002700095655002500122655003000147RMCEBM00aMKW Hack Pack vX InvisibleRacing 1bPhillyGc2014-9-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kPhillyGsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00374na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264001300028300002300041500015700064542001800221655002500239RMCEBR00aMario Kart Brown 1bc2023--  a1 Wii optical disc  aEssentially the Spiritual Successor to Mario Kart Black by Roobix. This time with full Model swaps, new tracks, music and Vehicles as well as animations  i2023sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00403na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264001600034300002300050500017700073542001800250655002500268RMCEBT00aBoost Track Grand Prix 1bc2021-4-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aBoost Track Grand Prix is a custom track distribution created by HackStarz. It has all boost tracks on Wiimm's Custom Archive as of its release, plus some new boost tracks.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00180na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001600007264001300023300002300036500000500059542001800064RMCEC700aCosmic Kart 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00205na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004100007264001300048300002300061500000500084542001800089RMCECD00aCederic's MKW Texture and Music Pack 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00185na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002100007264001300028300002300041500000500064542001800069RMCECG00aColor Grand Prix 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00404na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264001600025300002300041500018700064542001800251655002500269RMCECH00aChis Kart Wii 1bc2020-5-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aChis Kart Wii is a custom track distribution created by ChisSilver64. It features 136 of the author's favorite custom tracks. v3.5 does not have NTSC-J or PAL supported at this time.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00340na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264001600029300002300045500011900068542001800187655002500205RMCECK00aConfused Kart Wii 1bc2021-4-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aConfused Kart Wii is a distribution created by Fynn93. It replaces the original 32 tracks with tracks that rotate.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00192na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002800007264001300035300002300048500000500071542001800076RMCECL00aCTGP Revolution Classic 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00396na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264001600034300002300050500017000073542001800243655002500261RMCECN00aHide and Seek GCN Pack 1bc2021-6-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aHide and Seek GCN Pack is a distribution created by Krummers and Derby. It contains tracks and arenas from Mario Kart: Double Dash!! for the game mode Hide and Seek.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00593na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003500007264001600042300002300058500027500081542001800356655002500374655003000399655003000429RMCECT00aMario Kart Wii CTGP Revolution 1bc2010-2-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aCTGP Revolution, by MrBean 3500vr and Chadderz contains 128 custom tracks as well as Nintendo's original 32 tracks. CTGP even allows for CTWW(Custom Track Worldwide) searching while in wifi mode. This feature is currently experimental, but seems to be working correctly.  i2010sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aBike racing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00487na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004700007264001600054300002300070500024100093542001800334655002500352RMCECU00aMario Kart Wii but the CPUs Are Impossible 1bc2020-8-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Wii but the CPUs Are Impossible is a custom game mode created by HackerCop. It increases the speed of the CPU players, making them much harder to beat. The author recommends playing at 150cc with the Item Mode set to "Basic".  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00474na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264002300029300002300052500023600075542002800311655002500339RMCECY00aCTGP Classic Pack 1bRipstonec2015-3-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis pack was made for the purpose for people who prefer older versions of CTGP. Since Wiimmfi did not exist at the time, Jax53000VR decided to include it in the pack. The current version only uses the v1.01 track list shown below.  i2015kRipstonesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00370na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264002100030300002300051500013600074542002500210655002500235RMCED300aDryBowser Kart Wii 1bSigmac2020-4-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aDryBowser Kart Wii is a texture hack distribution created by DryBowser. It contains 32 texture hacked tracks that the author likes.  i2020kSigmasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00195na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003100007264001300038300002300051500000500074542001800079RMCED800aDryBowser's Unused CT Pack 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00300na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005400007264001600061300002300077500000500100542001800105655002500123655003000148RMCEDC00aMario Kart Wii but You Can Only Drive on the Road 1bc2021-2-17  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00400na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002600026300002300052500011800075542003000193655002500223655003000248RMCEDK00aDarky Kart Wii 1bDarkyBenjic2011-4-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is a mod I compiled from some killer textures I found (personal opinion anyway). It is pretty good so enjoy.  i2011kDarkyBenjisGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00310na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264001600035300002300051500008300074542001800157655002500175RMCEDT00aDrift Rebalance with CT 1bc2021-7-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aDrift Rebalance with CT is a custom track distribution created by JacksonD407.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00187na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002300007264001300030300002300043500000500066542001800071RMCEDX00aDxrk X Hari's Pack 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00432na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264001500032300002300047500020900070542001800279655002500297RMCEEX00aMKW Exploration Pack 1bc2021-3-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW Exploration Pack is a distribution created by Mr perfect mkwii. It replaces the original 32 tracks with versions that allow you to drive anywhere in the track, including previously inaccessible areas.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00419na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264003000027300002300057500016900080542003500249655002500284RMCEF100aFancy's CT Pack 1bMotown Softwarec2019-6-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aFancy's CT Pack is a custom track distribution made by FancyDoesCustomTracks. It contains 32 tracks and 10 arenas. The latest development version can be found here.  i2019kMotown SoftwaresGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00353na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264001500043300002300058500011900081542001800200655002500218RMCEF400aFe4less' Authentic Texture Pack 1bc2021-1-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aFe4rless' Texture Pack is a texture hack distribution created by DrFe4rless. It features 26 texture hacked tracks.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00298na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264002300043300002300066500000500089542002700094655002500121655003000146RMCEFA00aMKW Hack Pack vX 200KMH Version 1bPhillyGc2014-9-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kPhillyGsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00444na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264001600032300002300048500022000071542001800291655002500309RMCEFC00aFalco's Texture Pack 1bc2021-7-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aFalco's Texture Pack is a texture hack distribution created by Funkyguy!. It features 32 texture hacks. The author released this simultaneously with an update to his custom music distribution Funky Guy's Music Pack.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00438na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003600007264004000043300002300083500019000106542004400296RMCEFE00aFancy's CT Pack - Extra Edition 1bDavidson / Western Tech.c2019-6-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aFancy's CT Pack: Extra Edition is a custom track distribution made by FancyDoesCustomTracks. It is an extended version of the author's main distribution, Fancy's CT Pack, using CT-CODE.  i2019kDavidson / Western Tech.sGameTDB00460na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264001600028300002300044500024000067542001800307655002500325RMCEFK00aFormula Kart Wii 1bc2021-1-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aFormula Kart Wii is a custom game mode created by CLF78 and Ismy. It consists of racing for 50 laps around the same track with random items and other miscellaneous changes. The mod is inspired by Formula One, a car racing championship.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00220na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003400007264002300041300002300064500000500087542003000092RMCEFL00aMario Kart Wii Forza MAX LOOK 1bNeptune777c2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kNeptune777sGameTDB01492na  a2200169   4500001000700000245003300007264002500040300002300065500103500088542003001123655002501153655002701178655003001205655003001235655003601265655002101301RMCEFO00aNeptune777 Forza MAX Origins 1bNeptune777c2020-6-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt is the first volume of the series of mods of Neptune777 Forza MAX, only with circuits and high elite tracks, for the selection of these tracks a rigorous selection procedure is made based on many methods of strategies and skills, so that the selection of the 32 tracks be of high quality and competitiveness, the rules of this game in vs race mode is 3 mushrooms, which allows a game of adrenaline and constant speed without interfering with annoying items that make you unfairly lose the advantage gained by your skills, it is clear that the most expert and advanced will be the first in forza max, and the battle mode will surprise you with the distribution of items, in powerful coin runners and they support you when you are at a disadvantage, and in battle mode, total power, a war without quarter where The wildest of the players and the one with the best control of the vehicle will have the victory, do you dare the challenge of neptune777 ?, Neptune777 Forza MAX Origins, the Origin of the Forza MAX, is now available.  i2020kNeptune777sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aBike racing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext 7aWargames2wiiext00301na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264002300046300002300069500000500092542002700097655002500124655003000149RMCEFR00aMKW Hack Pack vX 2X Frames Version 1bPhillyGc2014-9-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kPhillyGsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00586na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002500042300002300067500029000090542002900380655002500409655003000434RMCEG200aMario Kart Wii CTGP Revolution 1bDarkumbrac2012-9-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Wii CTGP Revolution, by MrBean 3500vr and Chadderz contains 184 custom tracks as well as Nintendo's original 32 tracks. CTGP even allows for CTWW(Custom Track Worldwide) searching while in wifi mode. This feature is currently experimental, but seems to be working correctly.  i2012kDarkumbrasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00587na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264002800041300002300069500032900092542003100421655002500452RMCEG400aDiddz' Gang Custom Track Pack 1bKiKi Co Ltdc2014-10-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aDiddz' Gang Custom Track Pack (also known simply as DGCT) is a custom track distribution created by BeanJr, Austen and ProtoxFox. It is based around the community known as Diddz' Gang, featuring many inside jokes during the release of the distribution. Custom music is featured, as well as a separate Time Trial mode option.  i2014kKiKi Co LtdsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00399na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002600007264002900033300002300062500005600085542003300141655002500174655003000199655003600229RMCEG500aNew Mario Kart Wii 64 1bMateus Viannac2014-7-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aAnother Custom Track Distribution by Mateus Vianna!  i2014kMateus ViannasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00387na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264001500034300002300049500016200072542001800234655002500252RMCEGB00aHide and Seek GBA Pack 1bc2021-7-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aHide and Seek GBA Pack is a distribution created by Toad4Smash. It contains tracks and arenas from Mario Kart: Super Circuit for the game mode Hide and Seek.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00191na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002700007264001300034300002300047500000500070542001800075RMCEGC00aCTGP Revolution Legacy 1bc2024--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2024sGameTDB00374na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264001600048300002300064500013400087542001800221655002500239RMCEGN00aGiant Objects Mode: Complete Edition 1bc2021-2-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aGiant Objects Mode: Complete Edition is a distribution created by Potatoman44. The tracks have had some of the objects scaled up.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00613na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003500007264002500042300002300067500027500090542002900365655002500394655003000419655003000449RMCEGP00aMario Kart Wii CTGP Revolution 1bdarkumbrac2012-2-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aCTGP Revolution, by MrBean 3500vr and Chadderz contains 128 custom tracks as well as Nintendo's original 32 tracks. CTGP even allows for CTWW(Custom Track Worldwide) searching while in wifi mode. This feature is currently experimental, but seems to be working correctly.  i2012kdarkumbrasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aBike racing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext01354na  a2200157   4500001000700000245003100007264002500038300002300063500092300086542003001009655002501039655003001064655003601094655003001130655003601160RMCEGT00aNeptune777 Xtreme Race GTX 1bNeptune777c2020-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aNeptune777 Xtreme Race GTX, the first Ultra MOD of Neptune777, comes loaded with the best racing music plus the best tracks vs races, a unique and genuine selection that you will love, this ultra mod endowed with pure originality and revolution in racing will transport you to a Endless new custom tracks, and also has 32 original nintendo tracks that in online mode you can play in WorldWide mode, while in regional mode you can play All Tracks mode, 260 tracks of great variety and different difficulties, where you will enjoy to the fullest also One of the new textures that neptune777 prepared for some tracks that you will not be able to find in any other mod, another of its countless novelties is its difficulty against the cpu, totally Xtreme in its difficulty and maximum speed, do you dare to enter the Xtreme Race mode? Can you win? Neptune777 Xtreme Race GTX, racing to the max, now available for download.  i2020kNeptune777sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aBike racing games2wiiext 7aFuturistic racing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00197na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003300007264001300040300002300053500000500076542001800081RMCEH500aHD Battle Track Texture Pack 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB01306na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264001500027300002300042500108800065542001801153655002501171RMCEH800aHD's Retro Pack 1bc2019-9-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aHD's Retro Pack is a custom track distribution made by a few members of High Definition, a Mario Kart community. The pack was originally planned to be private, however was put up here if anyone ever showed interest in trying it out. The pack was created and updated by Rookie and KD. Thanks to ChaosShadow23 and Torran for helping a little bit as well. The purpose of the pack is to provide some of the best and most memorable tracks that Nintendo has created in past (and future) Mario Kart games, and putting them all into 1 game. So if you're one of those people who dislikes a lot of the custom tracks in CTGP-R, or simply someone who wants more of a Mario Kart feel with new fanmade track music remixes as well, maybe you'd be interested in trying the pack out. The pack runs independently through Riivolution. XMLs are included in the download. You must extract the ZIP from the download to the root of your SD card to use. Special thanks to ChaosShadow and Torran for coding help, as well as all music remixers and CT creators whose content is used in the mod. Enjoy the pack!  i2019sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00495na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264001500027300002300042500027700065542001800342655002500360RMCEHC00aCTGP-R HNS Pack 1bc2021-8-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aCTGP-R v1.02 HNS Pack is a custom track distribution created by HackStarz. It contains tracks from CTGP Revolution v1.02 for the game mode Hide and Seek. This supports most default languages (except Korean) and uses a custom revo_kart.brsar file to change the track music.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00199na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003500007264001300042300002300055500000500078542001800083RMCEHD00aMario Kart Wii - HD - Remaster 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00302na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004000007264002300047300002300070500000500093542002700098655002500125655003000150RMCEHK00aMKW Hack Pack vX 1st Person Edition 1bPhillyGc2014-9-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kPhillyGsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00531na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264001600038300002300054500030100077542001800378655002500396RMCEHX00aHide and Seek Extreme Pack 1bc2021-7-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aHide and Seek Extreme Pack is a custom track distribution created by Dolphin. It contains tracks that the author believed would be difficult for the game mode Hide and Seek. While the first release only contains tracks, the author plans to add custom battle arenas and custom music in the future.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00650na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264001700031300002300048500042600071542001800497655002500515RMCEHY00aHypersonic Kart Wii 1bc2020-11-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aHypersonic Kart Wii is a custom game mode created by HackerCop for CTGP My Stuff users that makes the player feel like they are traveling extremely fast by modifying the visuals of the game. All the tracks are enlarged by 9x with a 9x speed modifier to create this effect. Currently, this game mode only supports My Stuff users however the author will add Riivolution support in a future update once he has fixed this bug  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00188na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002400007264001300031300002300044500000500067542001800072RMCEI400aMario Kart Infinite 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00588na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264006000027300002300087500023700110542006400347655002500411655003000436RMCEIK00aInsane Kart Wii 1bToadette Hack Fan, Numerosity, PaperToadettec2021-11-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aInsane Kart Wii (formerly known as Ultimate Hack Pack) is a custom track distribution created by Toadette Hack Fan, Numerosity and PaperToadette. The distribution contains a whopping 5,448 custom tracks and 190 custom battle arenas.  i2021kToadette Hack Fan, Numerosity, PaperToadettesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00293na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002300038300002300061500000500084542002700089655002500116655003000141RMCEIR00aMKW Hack Pack vX Item Rain 1bPhillyGc2014-9-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kPhillyGsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00430na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264001600031300002300047500020700070542001800277655002500295RMCEIT00aInvisibility Toggle 1bc2020-8-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aInvisibility Toggle is a custom game mode created by Melg. Racers, items and objects will be invisible for six seconds and then visible for three seconds. The game mode comes with its own custom region.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00185na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002100007264001300028300002300041500000500064542001800069RMCEJ300aJTG Texture Pack 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00514na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264001600024300002300040500029800063542001800361655002500379RMCEJ600aJHFR CT Pack 1bc2018-1-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aJHFR CT Pack is a custom track distribution created by Jaxx, Hoesay, FergMK, and Renverse. It is designed to cater more to competitive players, where it includes custom tracks from previous and current versions of CTGP Revolution, as well as plenty of tracks not included in that distribution.  i2018sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00183na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001900007264001300026300002300039500000500062542001800067RMCEK100a1-Lap Kart Wii 1bc2021--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021sGameTDB00358na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004400007264001700051300002300068500011400091542001800205655002500223RMCEK300aKing Toad's Epic Music and Texture Pack 1bc2020-10-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aKing Toad's Epic Music and Texture Pack is a texture hack and custom music distribution created by King Toad.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00294na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264002100043300002300064500000500087542002500092655002500117655003000142RMCEKB00aKrash&Burn's Other Texture Pack 1bKrashc2019-6-14  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2019kKrashsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00795na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264001700026300002300043500057600066542001800642655002500660RMCEKK00aKrash Kart Wii 1bc2020-12-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aKrash Kart Wii (formerly known as Krash&Burn's Texture & Music Pack since v2) is a texture and music pack made by Krash for CTGP Revolution. This includes custom textures for Title Screen, Menu, and other things in the game. Some elements from others' packs were modified by the author, such as the HUD, MenuSingle, etc. Most of the custom music (except those taken from other music packs) were made by the author. This page shows only the details of the tracks and arenas, so checking out the video or downloading the pack would show the rest of the things in this pack.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00194na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003000007264001300037300002300050500000500073542001800078RMCEKW00aKiwi's Hide and Seek Pack 1bc2021--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021sGameTDB00278na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264003000026300002300056500003000079542003400109655002500143RMCEL100aLuma's CT Pack 1baplumafreak500c2016-5-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aA Luma's dream come true!  i2016kaplumafreak500sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00245na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264002400030300002300054500000500077542002800082655002500110RMCEL900aMario Kart Legacii 1bWiisleyUc2017-9-12  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2017kWiisleyUsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00187na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002300007264001300030300002300043500000500066542001800071RMCELF00aFlounder's Megamix 1bc2024--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2024sGameTDB00793na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264003100027300002300058500054100081542003600622655002500658RMCELG00aLegacy Kart Wii 1bBlack Bean Gamesc2019-8-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aLegacy Kart Wii is a custom track distribution that is developed by ZPL Gaming, _tZ and YoshTaku. It is a revival of the Legacy Pack distribution that was announced in early 2018 by AlphaFlame and sasuke, though it was discontinued later that year. This distribution features 144 tracks that set a legacy in the custom track community; as in, older Mario Kart Wii custom tracks that have been forgotten about and how they started this community we know today. This custom track distribution also includes the 32 regular Nintendo tracks.  i2019kBlack Bean GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00178na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001400007264001300021300002300034500000500057542001800062RMCELI00aEvil Pack 1bc2024--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2024sGameTDB00406na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003300007264002900040300002300069500005600092542003300148655002500181655003000206655003600236RMCEM400aMario Kart Super Circuit Wii 1bMateus Viannac2016-6-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aAnother Custom Track Distribution by Mateus Vianna!  i2016kMateus ViannasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00424na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264002800032300002300060500017300083542003300256655002500289RMCEM600aNew Mario Kart Seven 1bMateus Viannac2016-3-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aThere's a new way to play Mario Kart 7! Grab your Wii Wheel or your tradicional controllers and have fun with Mario Kart 7 race tracks in Mario Kart Wii gameplay style.  i2016kMateus ViannasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00454na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264002800041300002300069500019400092542003300286655002500319RMCEM900aNew Mario Kart: Double Dash!! 1bMateus Viannac2018-9-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aThere is a new way to play Mario Kart: Double Dash!! Grab your Wii Wheel or your traditional controls and have fun with Mario Kart tracks: Double Dash!! in the style of Mario Kart Wii game.  i2018kMateus ViannasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00897na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264001500031300002300046500067500069542001800744655002500762RMCEMN00aMario Kart Midnight 1bc2023-1-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Midnight is a custom track distribution created by marionose1 and ZPL. It aims to be a celebration of custom tracks, featuring the "best" tracks released between December 2021 and November 2022. Every track released during this time period was featured in monthly public polls, which were voted on by custom track enthusiasts. Every track that averaged a score of four or above out of five was guaranteed a spot in the distribution. In order to reach the total of 200 tracks, certain tracks that averaged 3.5 out of five were also included. marionose1 hosted the polls, did the planning and created every BRSTM, whereas ZPL helped with LE-CODE and bug fixing.  i2023sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00193na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002900007264001300036300002300049500000500072542001800077RMCEMP00aBowser498's MK8 HNS Pack 1bc2024--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2024sGameTDB00634na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264001500026300002300041500041700064542001800481655002500499RMCEMX00aMaxed Kart Wii 1bc2020-7-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMaxed Kart Wii is a custom game mode and distribution created by Joeblase. It modifies every single vehicle in the game to have stats that are similar to those of the Platinum Runner, and enables regional lobbies to allow matchmaking with only those who also have the mod. Time Trials currently works but ghost saving will not be supported. Currently, PAL may not have everything unlocked and has incorrect text.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00300na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264002400031300002300055500005900078542002800137655002500165RMCEMZ00aMizy's Texture Pack 1bMad Catzc2012-8-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's a really cool texture hack with new Custom Tracks  i2012kMad CatzsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00542na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264001600030300002300046500032000069542001800389655002500407RMCEN200aNintendo Remasters 1bc2020-12-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aNintendo Remasters (formerly known as Nintendo Remixes and Galaxy Songs) is a custom music and texture hack distribution created by MarkAlbertsma03. It features various Nintendo remixes and songs. There are also some songs that do not belong in the Mario-verse, but are fitting within the theme of what they replace  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00182na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001800007264001300025300002300038500000500061542001800066RMCEN800aNitro CT Pack 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00368na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264006200035300002300097500000500120542006600125655002500191655003000216RMCENA00aNew Adventure All-Stars 1bKiwiPowerGreen, Potatoman44, Cats4Life, Fynn93c2021-4-12  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021kKiwiPowerGreen, Potatoman44, Cats4Life, Fynn93sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext01587na  a2200181   4500001000700000245004000007264002500047300002300072500107500095542003001170655002501200655002701225655003001252655003601282655003001318655003601348655002101384RMCENG00aNeptune777 Forza MAX New Generation 1bNeptune777c2020-8-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the second volume of the Neptune777 Forza MAX mods series, it comes enhanced with a more street style and without a doubt more gangster that will make the competitions more serious and competitive to take them more seriously the races and battles to the maximum, the Choice of tracks in racing mode are at another level, extreme difficulty in each of them and the best textures of neptune777, which only the new generation will be able to overcome, the battle arenas will leave you astonished with the selection they have, arenas of interesting aspect and strategies to use that will surprise you, definitely all the battles are new, just like all the vs race tracks, with their own essence that you will love, real wars in battle mode await you in this surprising and powerful mod, where you must create your perfect strategy to take the lead and be the best, the best of the new generation, with all the power and adrenaline you can in this fantastic mod by neptune777 , Neptune777 Forza MAX New Generation, now available to be a winner of the next generation.  i2020kNeptune777sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aBike racing games2wiiext 7aFuturistic racing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext 7aWargames2wiiext00441na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264001600030300002300046500021900069542001800288655002500306RMCENH00aNavi's HNS CT Pack 1bc2021-7-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aNavi's HNS CT Pack is a custom track distribution created by Navi4205. It contains custom tracks that are intentionally difficult to hide or seek in, despite purposefully being made for the Hide and Seek game mode.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext01403na  a2200181   4500001000700000245003600007264002500043300002300068500089500091542003000986655002501016655002701041655003001068655003601098655003001134655003601164655002101200RMCENL00aNeptune777 Forza MAX Next Layer 1bNeptune777c2020-9-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe third volume of the Neptune777 Forza MAX series of mods, this is a mod that comes with airs of revolution, wide-length revolution, making a wide and deep selection of stages vs race and battles arenas, and even from popular past games are present in this great mod, this is the mod that wants to be 100% fun in addition to 100% competition, it is the mod that wants to achieve all the limits of fun possible, with many stages vs race never seen before and other popular ones, battles Never seen before and other very popular ones, this mod does cover all the extremes between the known and the unknown only with the aim of entertaining a new phase, which can only be the next layer, which is the state beyond the maximum fun, prepare your place because the stage is ready, open next layer and enjoy what is fun beyond the limits, Neptune777 Forza MAX Next Layer, now available to enjoy!  i2020kNeptune777sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aBike racing games2wiiext 7aFuturistic racing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext 7aWargames2wiiext00457na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264001500043300002300058500022300081542001800304655002500322RMCENQ00aNevesqq's Texture n' Music Pack 1bc2019-1-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aNevesqq's Texture n' Music Pack is Nevesqq's first distribution. It features different texture hacks made by various creators, BRSTMs that the author made and the Darky Funky Kong character texture, made by DarkyBenji.  i2019sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00744na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264001500027300002300042500052600065542001800591655002500609RMCEO400aOptPack CT Pack 1bc2018-2-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aOptPack Custom Track Pack is Optllizer's first custom track distribution with over 200 custom tracks and 50 cups. This is a distribution that was created by the author to mess around with BMGs and game files. It consists of mostly known tracks, as well as legacy and unknown tracks. Most of CTGP Revolution's features are present. v0.1 was an experiment to see how a distribution would work, v3.0 transitioned to CT-CODE and v3.1 was big for organizing the distribution. The v4.0 series will be the final set of versions.  i2018sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00185na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002100007264001300028300002300041500000500064542001800069RMCEOA00aChaotic Kart Wii 1bc2024--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2024sGameTDB00183na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001900007264001300026300002300039500000500062542001800067RMCEOR00aBored Kart Wii 1bc2024--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2024sGameTDB00306na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002600044300002300070500000500093542003100098655002500129655003000154RMCEP400aPotatoman44's Transformed Tracks 1bPotatoman44c2021-2-4  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021kPotatoman44sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00463na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264002900028300002300057500021500080542003300295655002500328RMCEPG00aPenguin Kart Wii 1bPhoenix Gamesc2020-1-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aPenguin Kart Wii is a texture hack distribution created by That Mario Kart Pro. Tracks and menus are now themed around penguins, mostly the penguin emoji used on Twitter and the penguin from Super Mario Galaxy.  i2020kPhoenix GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00296na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002300041300002300064500000500087542002700092655002500119655003000144RMCEPH00aMKW Hack Pack vX CTDN Version 1bPhillyGc2014-9-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kPhillyGsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00183na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001900007264001300026300002300039500000500062542001800067RMCEPK00aPride Kart Wii 1bc2021--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021sGameTDB00424na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264001500030300002300045500020300068542001800271655002500289RMCEPT00aPlatinum Hack Pack 1bc2021-1-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlatinum Hack Pack is a distribution created by Cuke and Clipeus. It includes vehicles with various maximum stats, which have been inspired from Platinum Funky on Platinum Runner. The edits include:  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00181na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001700007264001300024300002300037500000500060542001800065RMCER400aRay Kart Wii 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00494na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264001600025300002300041500027700064542001800341655002500359RMCER900aRosa Kart Wii 1bc2020-1-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aRosa Kart Wii is a custom track distribution made by J0sh, Zappg and FancyDoesCustomTracks. It features 32 custom tracks and a range of game modes, all of which come with their own Wiimmfi regions. The distribution will include 10 custom battle arenas in a future release.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00338na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264001700025300002300042500012000065542001800185655002500203RMCERB00aBear Kart Wii 1bc2018-11-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aBear Kart Wii is a custom track distribution created by Bear. It has 104 custom tracks and a custom Wiimmfi region.  i2018sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00459na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002000007264002300027300002300050500013700073542003000210655002500240655003000265655003000295RMCERE00aMario Kart 64Re 1bDiego Vapyc2021--  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnjoy this mod playing the wonderful tracks offered by Mario Kart 64, Play online and put your skills to the test in the time trial.  i2021kDiego VapysGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aTraditional games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00483na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001600007264001600023300002300039500026800062542001800330655002500348RMCERL00aRandom Laps 1bc2020-8-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aRandom Laps is a custom game mode created by Melg, following ideas by aimsgaims and Worcestershirey. Each race will be between one to five laps, chosen randomly at the voting screen. Currently, it only works online. The game mode comes with its own custom region.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00376na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264001600033300002300049500015100072542001800223655002500241RMCERM00aMario Kart Wii Remake 1bc2021-5-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Wii Remake is a distribution created by Sergio Gimenez Alcaraz. It contains remakes of some of the original tracks from Mario Kart Wii.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00383na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003700007264001600044300002300060500014700083542001800230655002500248RMCES000a$uicideboy$ Texture & Music Pack 1bc2021-6-19  a1 Wii optical disc  a$uicideboy$ Texture & Music Pack is a texture hack and custom music distribution created by dex. It features songs by hip hop duo $uicideboy$.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00177na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001300007264001300020300002300033500000500056542001800061RMCES100aSmacpack 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00345na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264001500025300002300040500012900063542001800192655002500210RMCESC00aSecret Tracks 1bc2021-3-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aSecret Tracks is a distribution created by Fynn93. He made battle arenas and other miscellaneous tracks drivable for racing.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00187na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002300007264001300030300002300043500000500066542001800071RMCESF00aSkullFace Kart Wii 1bc2026--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2026sGameTDB00209na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002700007264002100034300002300055500000500078542002800083RMCESH00aShortcut Practice Pack 1bSabarasac2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kSabarasasGameTDB00608na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264001700027300002300044500038800067542001800455655002500473RMCESR00aS☆Ris CT Pack 1bc2020-12-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aS☆Ris CT Pack is a custom track distribution created by Lexus0346 and TipherethUK. It contains a total of 228 tracks, including the 32 Nintendo tracks. The tracks in this LE-CODE-based distribution are carefully selected by the team members, along with tracks, as of its release, that have not been added to CTGP Revolution. It includes several of the LE-CODE friend room settings.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00647na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003400007264003300041300002300074500025300097542003600350655002500386655002400411655003000435655003600465RMCEST00aSkipper's 200Kmh Distribution 1bStickmen Studiosc2018-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aSkipper's 200kmh Distribution is Skipper93653's first custom track distribution. Players will race at 200kmh on custom tracks selected by the creator. This distribution also features 48 different missions (all made by the creator) for Mission Mode.  i2018kStickmen StudiossGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00202na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003800007264001300045300002300058500000500081542001800086RMCESU00aSnorgUp's Textures and Music Pack 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00187na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002300007264001300030300002300043500000500066542001800071RMCESV00aMario Kart Archive 1bc2024--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2024sGameTDB00189na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002500007264001300032300002300045500000500068542001800073RMCESY00aSpyro's Texture Pack 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00626na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264001600026300002300042500040800065542001800473655002500491RMCET000aTomB's CT Pack 1bc2018-3-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aTomB's CT Pack is a custom track distribution made by Tombwarrior, which was in development for a very long time. The pack got delayed around August 2017. The development didn't go too well at the start, as there were many broken XMLs and files. The pack has been discontinued on May 28, 2018. The spiritual successor, Variety Pack, has replaced this distribution and will have better support long-term.  i2018sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00279na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002000029300002300049500000500072542002500077655002500102655003000127RMCET100aWiimms Intermezzo 1bWiimmc2013-11-  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2013kWiimmsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00199na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003500007264001300042300002300055500000500078542001800083RMCET200aToxic's Texture and Music Pack 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00575na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264001600048300002300064500033500087542001800422655002500440RMCET600aMan - O - Wii's Least Favorites Pack 1bc2020-5-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aMan-O-Wii's Least Favorites Pack is a custom track distribution created by DryBowser. This distribution contains 32 tracks that the author dislikes; this is purely opinion-based, and the author did not intend to be mean towards the track authors. This is his first distribution to use custom BMGs, though they only support English  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00566na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264001600039300002300055500033500078542001800413655002500431RMCET700aCam, Tom And Troy's CT Pack 1bc2013-8-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs lots of CTGP Revolution players waited for a new update, the CTGP Pack was created and featured some of the new tracks that would be featuring in the upcoming CTGP. This distribution was created by some of the most famous Mario Karters. The pack comes with BRSTMs and various tracks have a speed modifier or various lap counts.  i2013sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00355na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264001600034300002300050500012900073542001800202655002500220RMCETD00aAlmostTWD's Favourites 1bc2021-3-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aAlmostTWD98's Favourites is a distribution created by AlmostTWD98. For most tracks, there are multiple options between them.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00212na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003400007264001900041300002300060500000500083542002600088RMCETH00aMario Kart Wii Theob78's Pack 1bKolkomc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kKolkomsGameTDB00189na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002500007264001300032300002300045500000500068542001800073RMCETM00aMario Kart Time Warp 1bc2024--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2024sGameTDB00597na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001700007264002000024300002300044500024600067542002300313655002500336655002400361655003000385655003600415RMCETO00aRetro Rewind 1bZPLc2021-12-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience every retro track from Super Mario Kart to Mario Kart 7, plus tracks from Mario Kart 8, Tour, Arcade GP and Mario Kart World. Track your progress, compete for the fastest times, and connect with the community on Retro WFC servers.  i2021kZPLsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00348na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264001500032300002300047500012500070542001800195655002500213RMCETP00aTan in the Snow Pack 1bc2021-4-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aTan In The Snow Pack Demo is a texture hack distribution created by Cats4Life. It was created for April Fools' Day 2021.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00205na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001900007264002300026300002300049500000500072542003000077RMCETW00aTrent Kart Wii 1bTwo Tribesc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kTwo TribessGameTDB00471na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264001600038300002300054500024100077542001800318655002500336RMCETX00aToxic's Hide and Seek Pack 1bc2021-5-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aToxic's Hide and Seek Pack is a custom track distribution created by Toxic Prime. It was made for the game mode Hide and Seek. Currently, the author plans to release a future update with a more fitting track selection for the game mode.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00503na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264001600037300002300053500027400076542001800350655002500368RMCEU700aMario Kart Wii Ultra Pack 1bc2019-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW Ultra Pack is a custom track distribution made by IronDragonNet, with help from FancyDoesCustomTracks, ZPL Gaming, Tombwarrior, and WoomyLuma. It contains 32 texture hacks and 72 custom tracks, as well as HD item textures and Mission Mode, with 16 missions to play.  i2019sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00652na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264001600028300002300044500043200067542001800499655002500517RMCEVI00aVintage Kart Wii 1bc2020-3-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aVintage Kart Wii is Optllizer's second custom track distribution. It has over 112 custom tracks, along with the original 32 tracks, in 36 cups. This is a distribution that was created by the author for his friends to play some retro tracks, but he decided to release it to the public. It is filled with nostalgia, consisting of most tracks from past and present Mario Kart games. Most of CTGP Revolution's features are present.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00398na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264003000027300002300057500015000080542003300230655002500263RMCEVK00aViolet Kart Wii 1bSandlot Gamesc2015-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is a texture hack distribution made by ΔMKW大GIRLΔ, in which all tracks have textures in dark shades. It also contains some custom bikes.  i2015kSandlot GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00230na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002400007264003300031300002300064500000500087542004000092RMCEVS00aVariation Sensation 1bKorner Entertainmentc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kKorner EntertainmentsGameTDB00631na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264001500024300002300039500041600062542001800478655002500496RMCEVY00aVariety Pack 1bc2019-5-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Variety Pack is a custom track distribution founded by Tombwarrior and is developed by Brawlboxgaming, Bladestorm227, Skipper93653, Bear, MrFib, and AlphaFlame. It features 128 custom tracks (32 in the demo and Variety Pack Lite), ranging from difficult to "meme"-like, to even some that are in CTGP Revolution (hence the name "variety"). The Great Role Reversal is present in all modes except Mission Mode.  i2019sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00186na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002200007264001300029300002300042500000500065542001800070RMCEW500aReleasio Kart Wee 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00296na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264002500035300002300060500005000083542002800133655002500161RMCEW600aMario Kart Wii Ultimate 1bWiisleyUc2018-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Mario Kart Wii that you love even better!  i2018kWiisleyUsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext01025na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264001600028300002300044500080500067542001800872655002500890RMCEW800aWaluigi Kart Wii 1bc2019-5-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aWaluigi Kart Wii is a distribution made by IronDragonNet. It originally featured 32 texture hacks. However, it was changed to support 32 custom tracks and 64 missions. On top of the 32 texture hacks that were planned for the game. It also features custom fonts, a new custom gamemode by the author called "Wah Items", where all item textures are changed to the Waluigi symbol so you'll never know what you're going to get, as well as support for "My Stuff" and CTGP's "My Stuff" folders. Wiimmfi is supported through Worldwide and Custom Track Worldwides as well. "Story Mode" replaces Mission Mode in the pack (does the same thing) because it features an original story where Waluigi has taken over Mario Kart Wii. The author also decided to dedicate this project to her dead Pekingese dog, Scrappy.  i2019sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00350na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264001600026300002300042500013200065542001800197655002500215RMCEWH00aWheel Kart Wii 1bc2021-5-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aWheel Kart Wii is a custom track distribution created by Jblox. The tracks were selected through a wheel of 95 possible tracks.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00541na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264005600026300002300082500019800105542006100303655002500364655003000389RMCEWS00aWine's CT Pack 1bWine, Kyt, Keiichi1996, Hiroki, and Dark.c2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is a Mario Kart Wii Mod made by someone named Wine, and other people helped in making this mod too. This is Wine's first mod for Mario Kart Wii, and it includes his favorite custom tracks.  i2014kWine, Kyt, Keiichi1996, Hiroki, and Dark.sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00204na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004000007264001300047300002300060500000500083542001800088RMCEX100aXenon's Hide and Seek CT Collection 1bc2021--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021sGameTDB00367na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264003200024300002300056500011700079542003600196655002500232RMCEX400aMario Kart X 1bEasy Interactivec2018-7-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart X is a custom track distribution by Zef. This pack comes with 84 custom tracks from various creators.  i2018kEasy InteractivesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00549na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264001600042300002300058500031500081542001800396655002500414RMCEX500aMario Kart Wii - Battle Royale 1bc2020-7-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Wii: Battle Royale (also known as MKWBR) is a custom track distribution created by TheNinjaKingOW, Scath, RoGamer, Dracheron, and SarahCute. It features 88 custom tracks, alongside the original 32 tracks, with simultaneous online play. The distribution also includes new game modes made by the team.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00347na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264001700027300002300044500012700067542001800194655002500212RMCEXA00aXander Kart Wii 1bc2020-12-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aXander Kart Wii is a custom track distribution created by XanderKartWii. It contains mostly tracks from Custom Track Jams.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00190na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002600007264001300033300002300046500000500069542001800074RMCEY300aYoshi's Racing Resort 1bc2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020sGameTDB00399na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264001600025300002300041500018200064542001800246655002500264RMCEY800aYeet Kart Wii 1bc2018-7-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aYeet Kart Wii is a custom track distribution made by Hman6516 and BillyNoodles. There are 92 tracks; 63 are custom tracks, 2 are texture hacks, and the rest are Nintendo tracks.  i2018sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00374na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264002800029300002300057500012600080542003300206655002500239RMCEY900aYosh's Track Pack 1bRadiationBurnc2020-2-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aYosh's Track Pack is a custom track distribution made by YoshTaku. It contains many custom tracks that the author enjoys.  i2020kRadiationBurnsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00235na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264001600038300002300054500000500077542001800082655002500100RMCEYP00aYoshi's Racing Resort Plus 1bc2021-6-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00355na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264001500032300002300047500013200070542001800202655002500220RMCEYT00aYosh's Track Pack DX 1bc2021-5-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aYosh's Track Pack DX is a custom track distribution created by YoshTaku and Trainiax. It is the successor to Yosh's Track Pack.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00417na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264001600034300002300050500019100073542001800264655002500282RMCEZ200aZPL's Track Collection 1bc2020-2-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aZPL's Track Collection is a custom track distribution created by ZPL Gaming. It contains the author's favorite tracks that he has made, as well as tracks from others that he has updated.  i2020sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00462na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264001600024300002300040500024600063542001800309655002500327RMCEZ800aZef Kart Wii 1bc2017-7-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aZef Kart Wii is a texture hack distribution by Zef. This pack includes Texture Hacks for all 32 tracks, all 24 characters (including icons and allkarts), and all items (models and textures), menus, and BRSTMs from Alexdelfino and Halvencyon.  i2017sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00336na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264001600025300002300041500011900064542001800183655002500201RMCEZC00aZef's CT Pack 1bc2018-6-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aZef's CT Pack is a custom track distribution by Zef. This pack comes with 232 custom tracks from various creators.  i2018sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00199na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003500007264001300042300002300055500000500078542001800083RMCEZH00aZPL's Hide and Seek Collection 1bc2021--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021sGameTDB00396na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264001600024300002300040500018000063542001800243655002500261RMCEZP00aMario Kart Z 1bc2021-8-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Z is a custom track distribution created by ZPL. It contains 100 custom tracks that are not featured in CTGP Revolution. This distribution receives monthly updates.  i2021sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00475na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264004600039300002300085500014100108542004900249655002500298655003000323RMCJ0600aWiimms MKW Fun 2010-12.ntsc 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2010-12-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aA collection of 32 custom tracks created by different people and bundled as a modification patch for Mario Kart by Wii ISO expert Wiimm.  i2010kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00303na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264002200034300002300056500002200079542002500101655002500126655003000151RMCJ1200aWiimms MKW Fun 2011-11 1bWiimmc2011-11-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a32 custom tracks:  i2011kWiimmsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00570na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500028800102542004500390655002500435RMCJ3000aWiimms MKW-Fun 2015-12.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2015-12-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe new edition od MKW-Fun comes with 19 new tracks, 32 updated track and several new features. Some tracks go over 1 up to 8 laps with correct lap counter. For some tracks, the base speed is higher. And after a hit by thunder cloud, the player is small only 5 instead of 10 seconds.  i2015kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00392na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500011000102542004500212655002500257RMCJ3100aWiimms MKW-Fun 2016-02.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2016-2-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2016-02 is now absolutely packed! It comes with 248 tracks in 62 Cups, thereof 216 custom tracks.  i2016kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00400na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004000038300002300078500011900101542004500220655002500265RMCJ3200aWiimms MKW-Fun 2016-07.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2016-7-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aAfter the poll, 11 new tracks got into MKW Fun 2016-07. However, 11 old tracks were removed due to space shortage.  i2016kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00308na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004200038300002300080500002500103542004500128655002500173RMCJ3300aWiimms MKW-Fun 2016-10.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2016-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aAutumn Motor Racing:  i2016kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00306na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500002400102542004500126655002500171RMCJ3400aWiimms MKW-Fun 2017-05.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2017-5-10  a1 Wii optical disc  a3 years of Wiimmfi!  i2017kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00615na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500033300102542004500435655002500480RMCJ3500aWiimms MKW-Fun 2017-12.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2017-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis new release of MKW-Fun features 34 all new tracks and multiple updates. Therefor 34 established tracks had to make way for the new ones. The tracks in MKW-Fun have been drawn by lot this time and removed tracks will be in the draw pot with an increased chance next time. This way there will be no more permanent fare-wells.  i2017kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00595na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500031300102542004500415655002500460RMCJ3600aWiimms MKW-Fun 2018-03.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2018-3-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aJust 3 months after the previous distribution, MKW-Fun 2018-03 is now released. It contains 16 new and 14 updated tracks. In addition to that, 25 tracks return to the game because of the rotation system. On the other hand, 63 tracks did not have as much luck in the dsraw and therefor not included this time.  i2018kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00496na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500021400102542004500316655002500361RMCJ3700aWiimms MKW-Fun 2018-06.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2018-6-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aSince the end of 2017, MKW-Fun is published every 3 months. Again, there are 18 new and 23 updated tracks. The rotation brings other 26 tracks back, so there are a total of 67 alterations over its predecessor.  i2018kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00496na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500021400102542004500316655002500361RMCJ3800aWiimms MKW-Fun 2018-09.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2018-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aSince the end of 2017, MKW-Fun is published every 3 months. Again, there are 17 new and 25 updated tracks. The rotation brings other 37 tracks back, so there are a total of 79 alterations over its predecessor.  i2018kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00292na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002100041300002300062500000500085542002500090655002500115655003000140RMCJ3900aWiimms Mario Kart Fun 2018-12 1bWiimmc2018-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2018kWiimmsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00523na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500024100102542004500343655002500388RMCJ4000aWiimms MKW-Fun 2019-03.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2019-3-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aSince the end of 2017, MKW-Fun is published every 3 months. This time again 17 new and 22 updated tracks are included. Due to the rotation, another 27 tracks are back, so that there are a total of 66 changes compared to the predecessor.  i2019kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00634na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500035200102542004500454655002500499RMCJ4100aWiimms MKW-Fun 2019-06.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2019-6-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time, the new MKW-Fun is based on LE-CODE by Leseratte with many new options (see below). In particular, all tracks are included, which are rotated in the previous versions due to lack of space. Since the rotation is no longer necessary, the upcoming versions of MKW-Fun no longer appear in the fixed 3-month interval, but on demand.  i2019kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00485na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004200038300002300080500020200103542004500305655002500350RMCJ4200aWiimms MKW-Fun 2019-10.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2019-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aTechnically, MKW-Fun has not changed. Only new tracks have been added or existing tracks have been updated. The same LE-CODE works in the background as before. This allows up to 4000 custom tracks.  i2019kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00692na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500041000102542004500512655002500557RMCJ4300aWiimms MKW-Fun 2020-02.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2020-2-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the anniversary edition of MKW-Fun. Exactly 10 years ago, on February 14, 2010, the very first distribution of MKW-Fun. MKW-Fun 2010-02 was published in collaboration of Wiimm with Jillian. At that time they had to swap the tracks in manual and painstaking work with WiiScrubber. Since Wiimm definitely didn't want to do that again, he started to implement the creation of the images in WIT tools.  i2020kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00583na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500030100102542004500403655002500448RMCJ4400aWiimms MKW-Fun 2020-06.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2020-6-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2020-06 appeared on June 18th 2020. On this day, Wiimmfi runs exactly 2231 days. And that is exactly the number of days with which the original Mario Kart Wii could be played on the original Nintendo/Gamespy servers. From now on Wiimmfi.de exists longer. So a special Wiimmfi anniversary!  i2020kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00556na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004200038300002300080500027300103542004500376655002500421RMCJ4500aWiimms MKW-Fun 2020-12.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2020-12-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis version of MKW-Fun was released on December 12th 2020. MKW-Fun 2020-12 contains 10 battle arenas plus 32 original tracks plus 376 custom tracks, which are divided into 2 Battle Cups and many Racing Cups. Like its successor MKW-Fun 2020-06, it is based on LE-CODE.  i2020kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00660na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500033600102542004500438655002500483655003000508RMCJ4600aWiimms MKW-Fun 2021-09.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2021-9-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2021-09 was published on September 11, 2021, a full 9 months after the previous edition. Usually MKW-Fun appears every 3 to 6 months. This edition contains 10 arenas plus 32 original tracks plus 404 custom tracks. Compared to the previous version, there are 55 new custom tracks and 62 updates; 16 tracks have been removed.  i2021kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00626na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500034400102542004500446655002500491RMCJ4800aWiimms MKW-Fun 2022-05.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2022-5-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2022-05 was published on May 21, 2022, 8 months after its predecessor MKW-Fun 2021-09. In between, the alternative variant Wiimms Mario Kart History 2021-12 was released. Compared to MKW-Fun 2021-09, 26 tracks have been removed, 42 new tracks have been added and 48 tracks have been updated. In addition, 1 former track was reused.  i2022kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00599na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004200038300002300080500031600103542004500419655002500464RMCJ4900aWiimms MKW-Fun 2022-11.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2022-11-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2022-11 was published on November 12, 2022. This edition contains 10 original areanes, 63 texture hacks of the arenas, 32 original tracks, 320 texture hacks of the tracks and 436 custom tracks. Compared to the previous version, there are 40 new custom tracks and 44 updates; 22 tracks have been removed.  i2022kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00596na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264004200043300002300085500030800108542004500416655002500461RMCJ5000aWiimms MKW-Textures 2022-12.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2022-12-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Textures 2022-12 is a special edition for friends of texture hacks. It contains 32 original tracks, 10 original arenas and 852 texture hacks. When the player selects an original track or arena, a matching texture hack is randomly selected by the system. Texture tracks can also be selected directly.  i2022kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00578na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500029600102542004500398655002500443RMCJ5100aWiimms MKW-Fun 2023-09.jap 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2023-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2023-09 was published on September 22, 2023. This edition contains 10 original areanes with 68 texture hacks, 32 original tracks with 316 texture hack and 449 custom tracks. Compared to the previous version, there are 45 new custom tracks and 33 updates; 36 tracks have been removed.  i2023kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00292na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002400035300002300059500000500082542002800087655002500115655003000140RMCJ6000aMario Kart Wii Faraphel 1bFaraphelc2021-5-15  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021kFaraphelsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00524na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264002400024300002300048500024700071542002900318655002500347655003000372RMCJ6400aPeach Kart 8 1bDark Starc2015-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aPeach Kart 8 is a mega distribution like MKW Hack Pack. It's support of maximum track slots is based on CTGP Revolution by MrBean35000vr and Chadderz. The download will include a music pack, custom fonts, custom characters and minimap colors.  i2015kDark StarsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00757na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003800023300002300061500045300084542004300537655002500580655003000605RMCJ7600aPro CT Pack 1bHuili, Pro CT Pack Teamc2014-4-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is Huili's first Custom Track Distribution. It is a collection of the 32 hardest custom tracks he could find. This distribution was originally thought of as being the ULTIMATE Time Trial distribution in it's early phases, but with the Custom Servers up this is also Wiimmfi compatible so you can enjoy this distribution with your friends online. Huili invites you to play this distribution with those on your friend rosters so you can meet up.  i2014kHuili, Pro CT Pack TeamsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00217na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002900007264002400036300002300060500000500083542003100088RMCJ8600aMario Kart Cris 3.500 CT 1bChrisDark64c2020--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kChrisDark64sGameTDB00291na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002700029300002300056500000500079542003000084655002500114655003000139RMCJ9000aMario Kart Fusion 1bCrisDark64c2020-12-14  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kCrisDark64sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00299na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264001900050300002300069500000500092542002500097655002500122655003000147RMCJ9100aWiimms Mario Kart Fun 2021-09 Reserved 1bWiimmc2021-9-  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021kWiimmsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00627na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264004100025300002300066500031600089542004500405655002500450655003000475RMCJ9300aMKW Hack Pack 1bHuili, MKW Hack Pack Teamc2015-4-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is Huili's third distribution, and by far his most ambitious distribution ever. The MKW Hack Pack is the first major distribution to ever include both custom tracks and texture hack tracks in them. This distribution will feature 184 Custom Tracks and 64 Texture Hack tracks, with the expansion of main.dol.  i2015kHuili, MKW Hack Pack TeamsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00647na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002100038300002300059500036400082542002400446655002500470655003000495RMCJA100aMario Kart Adventures v0.8 1bnonec2014-11-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Adventures is a custom track distribution with 8 themed cups. The goal of the project is to build a polished and unique version of Mario Kart. Most of the characters have either been texture modded or replaced by a completely new character. The game is distributed with a soundtrack mostly made up of free fan-made arrangements of video game music.  i2014knonesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00288na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002300033300002300056500000500079542002700084655002500111655003000136RMCJA200aMario Kart Wii Deluxe 1bFJRoyetc2018-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2018kFJRoyetsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00374na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264001300028300002300041500015700064542001800221655002500239RMCJBR00aMario Kart Brown 1bc2023--  a1 Wii optical disc  aEssentially the Spiritual Successor to Mario Kart Black by Roobix. This time with full Model swaps, new tracks, music and Vehicles as well as animations  i2023sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00593na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003500007264001600042300002300058500027500081542001800356655002500374655003000399655003000429RMCJCT00aMario Kart Wii CTGP Revolution 1bc2010-2-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aCTGP Revolution, by MrBean 3500vr and Chadderz contains 128 custom tracks as well as Nintendo's original 32 tracks. CTGP even allows for CTWW(Custom Track Worldwide) searching while in wifi mode. This feature is currently experimental, but seems to be working correctly.  i2010sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aBike racing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00278na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264003000026300002300056500003000079542003400109655002500143RMCJL100aLuma's CT Pack 1baplumafreak500c2016-5-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aA Luma's dream come true!  i2016kaplumafreak500sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00279na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002000029300002300049500000500072542002500077655002500102655003000127RMCJT100aWiimms Intermezzo 1bWiimmc2013-11-  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2013kWiimmsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00597na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001700007264002000024300002300044500024600067542002300313655002500336655002400361655003000385655003600415RMCJTO00aRetro Rewind 1bZPLc2021-12-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience every retro track from Super Mario Kart to Mario Kart 7, plus tracks from Mario Kart 8, Tour, Arcade GP and Mario Kart World. Track your progress, compete for the fastest times, and connect with the community on Retro WFC servers.  i2021kZPLsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00198na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003100007264001600038300002300054500000500077542001800082RMCJYP00aYoshi's Racing Resort Plus 1bc2021-6-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021sGameTDB00634na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500035200102542004500454655002500499RMCK4100aWiimms MKW-Fun 2019-06.kor 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2019-6-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time, the new MKW-Fun is based on LE-CODE by Leseratte with many new options (see below). In particular, all tracks are included, which are rotated in the previous versions due to lack of space. Since the rotation is no longer necessary, the upcoming versions of MKW-Fun no longer appear in the fixed 3-month interval, but on demand.  i2019kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00485na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004200038300002300080500020200103542004500305655002500350RMCK4200aWiimms MKW-Fun 2019-10.kor 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2019-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aTechnically, MKW-Fun has not changed. Only new tracks have been added or existing tracks have been updated. The same LE-CODE works in the background as before. This allows up to 4000 custom tracks.  i2019kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00655na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500041000102542004500512RMCK4300aWiimms MKW-Fun 2020-02.kor 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2020-2-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the anniversary edition of MKW-Fun. Exactly 10 years ago, on February 14, 2010, the very first distribution of MKW-Fun. MKW-Fun 2010-02 was published in collaboration of Wiimm with Jillian. At that time they had to swap the tracks in manual and painstaking work with WiiScrubber. Since Wiimm definitely didn't want to do that again, he started to implement the creation of the images in WIT tools.  i2020kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB00583na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500030100102542004500403655002500448RMCK4400aWiimms MKW-Fun 2020-06.kor 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2020-6-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2020-06 appeared on June 18th 2020. On this day, Wiimmfi runs exactly 2231 days. And that is exactly the number of days with which the original Mario Kart Wii could be played on the original Nintendo/Gamespy servers. From now on Wiimmfi.de exists longer. So a special Wiimmfi anniversary!  i2020kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00556na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004200038300002300080500027300103542004500376655002500421RMCK4500aWiimms MKW-Fun 2020-12.kor 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2020-12-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis version of MKW-Fun was released on December 12th 2020. MKW-Fun 2020-12 contains 10 battle arenas plus 32 original tracks plus 376 custom tracks, which are divided into 2 Battle Cups and many Racing Cups. Like its successor MKW-Fun 2020-06, it is based on LE-CODE.  i2020kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00660na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500033600102542004500438655002500483655003000508RMCK4600aWiimms MKW-Fun 2021-09.kor 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2021-9-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2021-09 was published on September 11, 2021, a full 9 months after the previous edition. Usually MKW-Fun appears every 3 to 6 months. This edition contains 10 arenas plus 32 original tracks plus 404 custom tracks. Compared to the previous version, there are 55 new custom tracks and 62 updates; 16 tracks have been removed.  i2021kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00722na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264004000042300002300082500039700105542004300502655002500545655003000570RMCK4700aWiimms MKW-History 2021-12.kor 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/wii/mkwc2021-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aWiimms Mario Kart History 2021-12 is a custom track distribution created by Wiimm. It was released on 2021-12-18 and it contains all the tracks that were ever included in any MKW-Fun distribution since 2010 (except the tracks that cause crashes). In addition, tracks that are planned for the next regular distribution of MKW-Fun have been included. These tracks fall under the "NEW" category.  i2021kWiimm, wiimm.de/wii/mkwsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00626na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500034400102542004500446655002500491RMCK4800aWiimms MKW-Fun 2022-05.kor 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2022-5-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2022-05 was published on May 21, 2022, 8 months after its predecessor MKW-Fun 2021-09. In between, the alternative variant Wiimms Mario 