0106542004900238655002500287655003000312655003600342RMCP2700aWiimms MKW-Fun 2015-03.pal 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2015-3-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2015-03 now contains 184 Custom tracks and of course the 32 original tracks. All 216 tracks are distributed to 54 cups.  i2015kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00470na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264004500040300002300085500017800108542004900286655002500335RMCP2800aWiimms MKW Retro 2015-05.pal 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2015-5-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the anniversary edition for the first anniversary of Wiimmfi. Exactly one year ago, on 10 May 2014, Wiimmfi was released to the public and is available continuously.  i2015kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00394na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004500038300002300083500010400106542004900210655002500259RMCP2900aWiimms MKW-Fun 2015-08.pal 1bWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2015-8-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe previous release of MKW-Fun is now 5 months old and the custom track developers have been busy.  i2015kWiimm, www.wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00570na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500028800102542004500390655002500435RMCP3000aWiimms MKW-Fun 2015-12.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2015-12-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe new edition od MKW-Fun comes with 19 new tracks, 32 updated track and several new features. Some tracks go over 1 up to 8 laps with correct lap counter. For some tracks, the base speed is higher. And after a hit by thunder cloud, the player is small only 5 instead of 10 seconds.  i2015kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00482na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500011000102542004500212655002500257655003000282655003600312RMCP3100aWiimms MKW-Fun 2016-02.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2016-2-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2016-02 is now absolutely packed! It comes with 248 tracks in 62 Cups, thereof 216 custom tracks.  i2016kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00400na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004000038300002300078500011900101542004500220655002500265RMCP3200aWiimms MKW-Fun 2016-07.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2016-7-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aAfter the poll, 11 new tracks got into MKW Fun 2016-07. However, 11 old tracks were removed due to space shortage.  i2016kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00308na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004200038300002300080500002500103542004500128655002500173RMCP3300aWiimms MKW-Fun 2016-10.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2016-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aAutumn Motor Racing:  i2016kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00306na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500002400102542004500126655002500171RMCP3400aWiimms MKW-Fun 2017-05.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2017-5-10  a1 Wii optical disc  a3 years of Wiimmfi!  i2017kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00615na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500033300102542004500435655002500480RMCP3500aWiimms MKW-Fun 2017-12.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2017-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis new release of MKW-Fun features 34 all new tracks and multiple updates. Therefor 34 established tracks had to make way for the new ones. The tracks in MKW-Fun have been drawn by lot this time and removed tracks will be in the draw pot with an increased chance next time. This way there will be no more permanent fare-wells.  i2017kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00595na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500031300102542004500415655002500460RMCP3600aWiimms MKW-Fun 2018-03.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2018-3-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aJust 3 months after the previous distribution, MKW-Fun 2018-03 is now released. It contains 16 new and 14 updated tracks. In addition to that, 25 tracks return to the game because of the rotation system. On the other hand, 63 tracks did not have as much luck in the dsraw and therefor not included this time.  i2018kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00496na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500021400102542004500316655002500361RMCP3700aWiimms MKW-Fun 2018-06.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2018-6-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aSince the end of 2017, MKW-Fun is published every 3 months. Again, there are 18 new and 23 updated tracks. The rotation brings other 26 tracks back, so there are a total of 67 alterations over its predecessor.  i2018kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00496na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500021400102542004500316655002500361RMCP3800aWiimms MKW-Fun 2018-09.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2018-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aSince the end of 2017, MKW-Fun is published every 3 months. Again, there are 17 new and 25 updated tracks. The rotation brings other 37 tracks back, so there are a total of 79 alterations over its predecessor.  i2018kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00497na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004200038300002300080500021400103542004500317655002500362RMCP3900aWiimms MKW-Fun 2018-12.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2018-12-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aSince the end of 2017, MKW-Fun is published every 3 months. Again, there are 18 new and 19 updated tracks. The rotation brings other 37 tracks back, so there are a total of 75 alterations over its predecessor.  i2018kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00523na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500024100102542004500343655002500388RMCP4000aWiimms MKW-Fun 2019-03.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2019-3-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aSince the end of 2017, MKW-Fun is published every 3 months. This time again 17 new and 22 updated tracks are included. Due to the rotation, another 27 tracks are back, so that there are a total of 66 changes compared to the predecessor.  i2019kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00634na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500035200102542004500454655002500499RMCP4100aWiimms MKW-Fun 2019-06.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2019-6-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time, the new MKW-Fun is based on LE-CODE by Leseratte with many new options (see below). In particular, all tracks are included, which are rotated in the previous versions due to lack of space. Since the rotation is no longer necessary, the upcoming versions of MKW-Fun no longer appear in the fixed 3-month interval, but on demand.  i2019kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00485na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004200038300002300080500020200103542004500305655002500350RMCP4200aWiimms MKW-Fun 2019-10.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2019-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aTechnically, MKW-Fun has not changed. Only new tracks have been added or existing tracks have been updated. The same LE-CODE works in the background as before. This allows up to 4000 custom tracks.  i2019kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00692na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500041000102542004500512655002500557RMCP4300aWiimms MKW-Fun 2020-02.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2020-2-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the anniversary edition of MKW-Fun. Exactly 10 years ago, on February 14, 2010, the very first distribution of MKW-Fun. MKW-Fun 2010-02 was published in collaboration of Wiimm with Jillian. At that time they had to swap the tracks in manual and painstaking work with WiiScrubber. Since Wiimm definitely didn't want to do that again, he started to implement the creation of the images in WIT tools.  i2020kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00583na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500030100102542004500403655002500448RMCP4400aWiimms MKW-Fun 2020-06.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2020-6-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2020-06 appeared on June 18th 2020. On this day, Wiimmfi runs exactly 2231 days. And that is exactly the number of days with which the original Mario Kart Wii could be played on the original Nintendo/Gamespy servers. From now on Wiimmfi.de exists longer. So a special Wiimmfi anniversary!  i2020kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00556na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004200038300002300080500027300103542004500376655002500421RMCP4500aWiimms MKW-Fun 2020-12.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2020-12-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis version of MKW-Fun was released on December 12th 2020. MKW-Fun 2020-12 contains 10 battle arenas plus 32 original tracks plus 376 custom tracks, which are divided into 2 Battle Cups and many Racing Cups. Like its successor MKW-Fun 2020-06, it is based on LE-CODE.  i2020kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00660na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500033600102542004500438655002500483655003000508RMCP4600aWiimms MKW-Fun 2021-09.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2021-9-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2021-09 was published on September 11, 2021, a full 9 months after the previous edition. Usually MKW-Fun appears every 3 to 6 months. This edition contains 10 arenas plus 32 original tracks plus 404 custom tracks. Compared to the previous version, there are 55 new custom tracks and 62 updates; 16 tracks have been removed.  i2021kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00665na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264004200042300002300084500033600107542004500443655002500488655003000513RMCP4700aWiimms MKW-History 2021-12.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2021-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-History 2021-12 was published on December 18, 2021. It contains all the tracks that were ever included in any MKW-Fun distribution since 2010 (except the tracks that cause crashes). In addition, tracks that are planned for the next regular distribution of MKW-Fun have been included. These tracks fall under the "NEW" category.  i2021kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00589na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500034400102542004500446RMCP4800aWiimms MKW-Fun 2022-05.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2022-5-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2022-05 was published on May 21, 2022, 8 months after its predecessor MKW-Fun 2021-09. In between, the alternative variant Wiimms Mario Kart History 2021-12 was released. Compared to MKW-Fun 2021-09, 26 tracks have been removed, 42 new tracks have been added and 48 tracks have been updated. In addition, 1 former track was reused.  i2022kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB00599na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004200038300002300080500031600103542004500419655002500464RMCP4900aWiimms MKW-Fun 2022-11.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2022-11-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2022-11 was published on November 12, 2022. This edition contains 10 original areanes, 63 texture hacks of the arenas, 32 original tracks, 320 texture hacks of the tracks and 436 custom tracks. Compared to the previous version, there are 40 new custom tracks and 44 updates; 22 tracks have been removed.  i2022kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00596na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264004200043300002300085500030800108542004500416655002500461RMCP5000aWiimms MKW-Textures 2022-12.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2022-12-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Textures 2022-12 is a special edition for friends of texture hacks. It contains 32 original tracks, 10 original arenas and 852 texture hacks. When the player selects an original track or arena, a matching texture hack is randomly selected by the system. Texture tracks can also be selected directly.  i2022kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00578na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264004100038300002300079500029600102542004500398655002500443RMCP5100aWiimms MKW-Fun 2023-09.pal 1bWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/func2023-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aMKW-Fun 2023-09 was published on September 22, 2023. This edition contains 10 original areanes with 68 texture hacks, 32 original tracks with 316 texture hack and 449 custom tracks. Compared to the previous version, there are 45 new custom tracks and 33 updates; 36 tracks have been removed.  i2023kWiimm, wiimm.de/r/mkw/funsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00384na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002400035300002300059500009700082542002800179655002500207655003000232RMCP6000aMario Kart Wii Faraphel 1bFaraphelc2021-5-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis Mario Kart Wii mod contains about 1'200+ new tracks with a score between 1 and 3 stars.  i2021kFaraphelsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00524na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264002400024300002300048500024700071542002900318655002500347655003000372RMCP6400aPeach Kart 8 1bDark Starc2015-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aPeach Kart 8 is a mega distribution like MKW Hack Pack. It's support of maximum track slots is based on CTGP Revolution by MrBean35000vr and Chadderz. The download will include a music pack, custom fonts, custom characters and minimap colors.  i2015kDark StarsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00757na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003800023300002300061500045300084542004300537655002500580655003000605RMCP7600aPro CT Pack 1bHuili, Pro CT Pack Teamc2014-4-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is Huili's first Custom Track Distribution. It is a collection of the 32 hardest custom tracks he could find. This distribution was originally thought of as being the ULTIMATE Time Trial distribution in it's early phases, but with the Custom Servers up this is also Wiimmfi compatible so you can enjoy this distribution with your friends online. Huili invites you to play this distribution with those on your friend rosters so you can meet up.  i2014kHuili, Pro CT Pack TeamsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00250na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002200007264002700029300002300056500000500079542003100084655002500115RMCP8600aMario Kart Cris 4 1bChrisDark64c2020-4-22  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kChrisDark64sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00291na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002700029300002300056500000500079542003000084655002500114655003000139RMCP9000aMario Kart Fusion 1bCrisDark64c2020-12-14  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2020kCrisDark64sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00299na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264001900050300002300069500000500092542002500097655002500122655003000147RMCP9100aWiimms Mario Kart Fun 2021-09 Reserved 1bWiimmc2021-9-  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021kWiimmsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00627na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264004100025300002300066500031600089542004500405655002500450655003000475RMCP9300aMKW Hack Pack 1bHuili, MKW Hack Pack Teamc2015-4-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is Huili's third distribution, and by far his most ambitious distribution ever. The MKW Hack Pack is the first major distribution to ever include both custom tracks and texture hack tracks in them. This distribution will feature 184 Custom Tracks and 64 Texture Hack tracks, with the expansion of main.dol.  i2015kHuili, MKW Hack Pack TeamsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00265na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264002600046300002300072500000500095542003000100655002500130RMCP9504aThe NMeade's Mario Kart Fun v2.0.1 1bThe NMeadec2021-6-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021kThe NMeadesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00189na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002500007264001300032300002300045500000500068542001800073RMCP9600aSuper Mario Kart Wii 1bc2021--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021sGameTDB00642na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002100033300002300054500036400077542002400441655002500465655003000490RMCPA100aMario Kart Adventures 1bnonec2014-11-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Adventures is a custom track distribution with 8 themed cups. The goal of the project is to build a polished and unique version of Mario Kart. Most of the characters have either been texture modded or replaced by a completely new character. The game is distributed with a soundtrack mostly made up of free fan-made arrangements of video game music.  i2014knonesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00366na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264002300048300002300071500006800094542002700162655002500189655003000214RMCPA200aMario Kart Wii Deluxe -Blue Edition- 1bFJRoyetc2018-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay Mario Kart Wii with more courses, more music and more fun!  i2018kFJRoyetsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00369na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002500007264002200032300002300054500000500077542002600082655002500108655002400133655003000157655003600187RMCPAS00aMario Kart All-Stars 1bCad111c2022-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2022kCad111sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00374na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264001300028300002300041500015700064542001800221655002500239RMCPBR00aMario Kart Brown 1bc2023--  a1 Wii optical disc  aEssentially the Spiritual Successor to Mario Kart Black by Roobix. This time with full Model swaps, new tracks, music and Vehicles as well as animations  i2023sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00368na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002500007264002100032300002300053500000500076542002600081655002500107655002400132655003000156655003600186RMCPCA00aMario Kart Wii [CAT] 1bwiicatc2024-1-5  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2024kwiicatsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00586na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002500042300002300067500029000090542002900380655002500409655003000434RMCPG200aMario Kart Wii CTGP Revolution 1bDarkumbrac2012-9-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario Kart Wii CTGP Revolution, by MrBean 3500vr and Chadderz contains 184 custom tracks as well as Nintendo's original 32 tracks. CTGP even allows for CTWW(Custom Track Worldwide) searching while in wifi mode. This feature is currently experimental, but seems to be working correctly.  i2012kDarkumbrasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00609na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003100007264002500038300002300063500027500086542002900361655002500390655003000415655003000445RMCPGP00aMario Kart CTGP Revolution 1bDarkUmbrac2012-2-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aCTGP Revolution, by MrBean 3500vr and Chadderz contains 128 custom tracks as well as Nintendo's original 32 tracks. CTGP even allows for CTWW(Custom Track Worldwide) searching while in wifi mode. This feature is currently experimental, but seems to be working correctly.  i2012kDarkUmbrasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aBike racing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00672na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002000007264006000027300002300087500023700110542006400347655002500411655002400436655003000460655003600490RMCPIK00aInsane Kart Wii 1bToadette Hack Fan, Numerosity, PaperToadettec2021-11-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aInsane Kart Wii (formerly known as Ultimate Hack Pack) is a custom track distribution created by Toadette Hack Fan, Numerosity and PaperToadette. The distribution contains a whopping 5,448 custom tracks and 190 custom battle arenas.  i2021kToadette Hack Fan, Numerosity, PaperToadettesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00278na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264003000026300002300056500003000079542003400109655002500143RMCPL100aLuma's CT Pack 1baplumafreak500c2016-5-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aA Luma's dream come true!  i2016kaplumafreak500sGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00279na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002000029300002300049500000500072542002500077655002500102655003000127RMCPT100aWiimms Intermezzo 1bWiimmc2013-11-  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2013kWiimmsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00203na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003900007264001300046300002300059500000500082542001800087RMCPT200aMario Kart Wii - Japanese Regional 1bc2021--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021sGameTDB00597na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001700007264002000024300002300044500024600067542002300313655002500336655002400361655003000385655003600415RMCPTO00aRetro Rewind 1bZPLc2021-12-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience every retro track from Super Mario Kart to Mario Kart 7, plus tracks from Mario Kart 8, Tour, Arcade GP and Mario Kart World. Track your progress, compete for the fastest times, and connect with the community on Retro WF