magical attack. The next thing he knows, he finds himself on a mysterious moon high above the Mushroom Kingdom! Navigate Mario through a bevy of exciting new worlds and the depths of space, with all new enemies, power-ups and attack skills, as he collects the Stars needed to save Princess Peach!  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00555na  a2200193   4500001000700000245002200007264002800029300002300057500000500080542003300085655002000118655002500138655002800163655002700191655003100218655003000249655004400279655003800323RMGE0400aSuper Mario Earth 1bDemonSlayer69c2021-4-4  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021kDemonSlayer69sGameTDB 7aFantasy2wiiext 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext 7aPoint-and-click adventure games2wiiext 7aAction role-playing games2wiiext00203na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003900007264001300046300002300059500000500082542001800087RMGE0500aSuper Mario Galaxy: No Black Holes 1bc2022--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2022sGameTDB00200na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003600007264001300043300002300056500000500079542001800084RMGE0600aSuper Mario Galaxy: Anti Piracy 1bc2022--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2022sGameTDB00200na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003600007264001300043300002300056500000500079542001800084RMGE0700aTransformationless Mario Galaxy 1bc2022--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2022sGameTDB00212na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004800007264001300055300002300068500000500091542001800096RMGE0800aSuper Mario Galaxy: Multiplayer Splitscreen 1bc2022--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2022sGameTDB00332na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002300045300002300068500004000091542003000131655002400161655002500185RMGE5200aGuitar Hero III Custom : Megadeth 1bActivisionc2010--  a1 Wii optical disc  aMade by RandomHero of DarkUmbra.Net  i2010kActivisionsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00305na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264002600025300002300051500006000074542003300134655002800167RMGE6400aSPG64 IN SMG! 1bDemonSlayer69c2019--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is just a custom character for Super Mario Galaxy.  i2019kDemonSlayer69sGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext01058na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264002500030300002300055500077800078542002800856655002500884655002700909RMGR0100aSuper Mario Galaxy 1bNintendoc2007-11-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aEvery hundred years a comet passes over the Mushroom Kingdom and rains down stars and stardust, and as Princess Peach and the citizens of the kingdom are celebrating the centennial event, Bowser and his legions attack by launching asteroids at the Mushroom Kingdom and crystallizing the Toads! Knowing that Bowser is after Princess Peach, Mario runs to save her. Things go awry as Bowser summons a massive spaceship, abducts Peach's entire castle and hits Mario with a massive magical attack. The next thing he knows, he finds himself on a mysterious moon high above the Mushroom Kingdom! Navigate Mario through a bevy of exciting new worlds and the depths of space, with all new enemies, power-ups and attack skills, as he collects the Stars needed to save Princess Peach!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00346na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264002100030300002300051500006800074542002600142655002500168655003100193RMHC0800aMonster Hunter Tri 1bCapcomc2011-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aHunt majestic monsters together in an immense, beautiful world.  i2011kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00334na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264003700025300002300062500002800085542004400113655002500157655003000182RMKE0200aCustom Kart 1 1bRocket Games / Ajinomotoc2010--  a1 Wii optical disc  aCustom Mario Kart game.  i2010kRocket Games / AjinomotosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00274na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004200007264002200049300002300071500002000094542002600114655002400140RMMP5200aGuitar Hero III Custom : Metal Mayhem 1bDohethc2010-1-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aGH Metal Mayhem  i2010kDohethsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext01005na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005600007264002100063300002300084500073700107542002400844655002700868RNEEUD00aNaruto Shippuden: Clash of Ninja Revolution 3 Undub 1bTomyc2009-11-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aWii's most explosive fighting game is back, better than ever, building off of its previous successes and implementing the much anticipated Wi-Fi gameplay! Now you can face off against competitors from all across North America over the internet. Featuring an all-new storyline and updated cast of characters from the NARUTO Shippuden series, NARUTO Shippuden: Clash of Ninja Revolution 3 is sure to re-ignite your passion for an ultra competitive, ninja fighting experience - only on Nintendo Wii. After two and a half years, a lot has changed in the Hidden Leaf Village! After years of training, a more mature Naruto has returned home, only to find out that his friend Gaara has been kidnapped by the sinister Akatsuki organization!  i2009kTomysGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00813na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004100007264002400048300002300072500047300095542002800568655002500596655002800621655003000649RNVW0100aSuper Mario Galaxy: Nvidia Shield TV 1bNintendoc2018-3-22  a1 Wii optical disc  a«Super Mario Galaxy» is very popular among various players throughout the world. With the first game released on November 1st 2007, and the second game released on May 23th 2010, Nintendo has made videogame history and enlighted the childhood of many players. While «Super Mario Galaxy 2» was available in 8 languages, the first game of the duology was only released in 7 official languages, missing the chinese translation due to it never being released in China.  i2018kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00290na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264002100040300002300061500000500084542002400089655002500113655003000138RODL0100aKirby: Revenge of Dream Land 1bShayc2021-10-31  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2021kShaysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7a2D platform games2wiiext00466na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003900007264002600046300002300072500012100095542003000216655002800246655002700274655003100301ROMESD00aMonster Hunter G (English Patched) 1bSasukedicec2010-4-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis game was never officially released in the United State, but was patched from Japanese to English by Sasukedice.  i2010kSasukedicesGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00508na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002400007264002500031300002300056500018700079542002800266655002500294655002800319655002700347ROSE0100aTakt of Magic [ENG] 1bNintendoc2020-11-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aTakt of Magic is an action strategy game, where you're given control of Orwell and Sharlot, two childhood friends who face off on the battlefield against monsters and enemy soldiers.  i2020kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00628na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264003800035300002300073500034900096542004200445655003100487RPJEUD00aArc Rise Fantasia Undub 1bIgnition Entertainmentc2010-7-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aFrom Image Epoch, the team that created the strategy RPG Luminous Arc, comesan epic RPG exclusively developed for the Wii. Arc Rise Fantasia is a product of old and new, combining gorgeous graphics with modern gameplay while bringing classic Japanese high fantasy role-playing action involving airships and dragons, 