ilation of competitive stages and character costumes that enhance the enjoyment of Project M while keeping the brilliant competitive gameplay untouched. The music that has been added to this build was carefully selected to fit appropriately with each stage. There is a lot of songs from other great games and remixes of familiar game soundtracks to enjoy.  i2014kMagnumsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00815na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264009500031300002300126500043000149542009900579655002700678RSBE2400aSuper Smash Bros. 3 1bTaiko, SatoshiKura, Mewtwo2000, Pik, Nanobuds, Thany, Starwaffle, Eternal_Yoshic2013-9-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aSmash 3 is a visual overhaul of Brawl, with the goal of bringing Smash 4's visual style to Brawl. Though Taiko will be bringing the visual style, he doesn't plan on replicating Smash 4 1:1, as there are some things that just can't be brought over. He won't be adding Smash 4 characters. He won't be adding Smash 4 gameplay. He won't be adding Young Link. Think of it like Brawl was developed with the visual style of Smash 4.  i2013kTaiko, SatoshiKura, Mewtwo2000, Pik, Nanobuds, Thany, Starwaffle, Eternal_YoshisGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00404na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264002200041300002300063500015400086542002700240655002700267RSBE2500aSuper Smash Bros. Red Version 1bxxRedxxc2013-2-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aAre you ready to Super Smash again, with 100+ characters to choose from this time? Try it now to find new characters you possibly never tried before!  i2013kxxRedxxsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00203na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002900007264001700036300002300053500000500076542002400081RSBE2600aSuper Smash Bros. Silver 1bEnixc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kEnixsGameTDB00279na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005200007264002400059300002300083500000500106542003100111655002700142RSBE2700aSpringboy64's Super Smash Bros. Brawl Hack Pack