 Wii optical disc  aMarvel and Capcom joins forces to confront the Smash Bros.  characters, bringing us a new variety of emblematic characters from the most important games, like Ryu, Spiderman, Little Mac, aqmong others.  i2016kMCS TeamsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext00352na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003700007264002200044300002300066500009900089542002700188655002700215RSBEBB00aSuper Smash Bros. Balanced Brawl 1bSunsoftc2013-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aBalanced Brawl is a mod project that improves the character balance of Super Smash Bros. Brawl  i2013kSunsoftsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00255na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264001900041300002300060500001100083542002400094655002700118RSBEBM00aSuper Smash Bros. Brawl Minus 1bXINGc2013-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aBrawl-  i2013kXINGsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00719na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264003700040300002300077500044000100542004200540655002700582RSBEBP00aSuper Smash Bros. Brawl Plus 1bGlobal A Entertainmentc2013-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aBrawl+ is a project pioneered by a portion smash community with the intent to make Brawl a deeper, more balanced competitive fighter. Brawl+ utilizes codes compiled and developed within the Workshop Backroom to afford enhanced gameplay with features ranging from the removal of random tripping to the addition of more hitstun and new character balance. Please view our changelist for a detailed view as to what has changed in the game.  i2013kGlobal A EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00644na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005000007264003400057300002300091500035500114542003800469655002700507RSBEC300aSuper Smash Bros. Project M 3.5 Netplay Build 1bProject M Backroomc2012-5-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aProject M is a community-made mod of Brawl inspired by Super Smash Bros. Melee's gameplay designed to add rich, technical gameplay to a balanced cast of characters while additionally enhancing the speed of play. Project M employs new codes which seamlessly add in new, universal features to the entire cast to add technical variety to all characters.  i2012kProject M BackroomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00674na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004700007264002600054300002300080500040400103542003000507655002700537RSBEDH00aSuper Smash Bros. Brawl Dark Hole/D.A.R.S. 1bRequiem307c2013-6-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is a Super Smash Bros. Brawl Mod where there are a various number of new stages that are added to the game, (New, Old, Remakes, Alternative, etc.), and remember stages which have been removed from Super Smash Bros. Brawl, are added as Planet Namek, Ho-OH's Tower, Final Bowser 64, Wuhu Island, among others. This version is created with the objective to load as smoothly as possible from a USB.  i2013kRequiem307sGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00963na  a2200157   4500001000700000245006400007264005800071300002300129500045500152542006200607655002000669655003200689655002700721655002700748655003000775RSBEDT00aSuper Smash Bros. Ultimate Dark Phoenix: Tournament Edition 1bUDP TEAM (Requiem307 and JavierMontenegro)c2014-6-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aSuper Smash Bros Ultimate Dark Phoenix is a mod of Super Smash Bros Brawl which focuses on the gameplay 1v1 tournament, this mod brings back some characters (characters) Stages, and this latter project takes some bases SSBB DARS and make something never before seen in the custom of Brawl, it is designed to be juege only 2 players at the same time as all the graphics of the Wii squeezes, has the playability of the SSBB 4 and brings some worlds it.  i2014kUDP TEAM (Requiem307 and JavierMontenegro)sGameTDB 7aFantasy2wiiext 7aModern-day settings2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext00209na  a2200097   450000100070000024500450000726400130005230000230006550000050008