00245005400007264003700061300002300098500000500121542004400126SMMP0200aSuper Mario: Mushroom Adventure PLUS: Winter Moon 1bRocket Games / Ajinomotoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kRocket Games / AjinomotosGameTDB01894na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002400037300002300061500160500084542002801689655002501717655003001742SMNC0100aNew Super Mario Bros. Wii 1bNintendoc2010-6-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aFinally a Mario adventure of a lifetime, but with touches new. The developers at Nintendo have long dreamed of creating a title of Super Mario Bros. with simultaneous multiplayer. Now the Wii console makes this dream possible for everyone for Christmas this year. Travel through side-scrolling worlds alone or with up to three friends, while at the same level and at any point in the game to enjoy the title of a cooperative or competitive. With the multiplayer mode, the next installment in the saga's most famous video game promises to bring to the living room a new form of entertainment for the whole family and engage groups of friends to the frantic fun of Super Mario Bros. Features: # New Super Mario Bros. Wii offers a combination of cooperation and competition. You can help the other players, or launched directly into danger. # Mario, Luigi and two Toads are playable characters, but many of the Mushroom Kingdom will make their appearance throughout the game. Can be mounted on different characters and use Yoshi's tongue to swallow enemies or other players. # In some areas, you can use the motion sensing Wii Remote. The first player to reach a seesaw can use it to reach a higher platform, then tilted backward to let the other players can not use it. # Among the new items include costume propellant, casting the character to hit the heights of the Wii Remote, or the new ability to become Mario Mario Penguin. # At the end of each level during simultaneous multiplayer mode, players receive a classification based on their points, coins collected and the number of enemies defeated.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7a2D platform games2wiiext00309na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264003700034300002300071500003600094542004400130655002500174SMNE0200aNew Super Mario Remake 1bRocket Games / Ajinomotoc2010--  a1 Wii optical disc  aAnother new super mario remake!  i2010kRocket Games / AjinomotosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00534na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264002500039300002300064500024300087542003000330655002500360655002700385SMNE0300aNewer Super Mario Bros. Wii 1bNewer Teamc2013-6-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aNewer is a full unofficial sequel to New Super Mario Bros. Wii, crafted over the span of 3 years by a team of devoted Nintendo fans. Playable legally on any homebrew-enabled Wii; no piracy or hardware mods needed. In Newer, you'll find...  i2013kNewer TeamsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00495na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264002900040300002300069500019500092542003400287655002500321655002700346SMNE0400aCannon Super Mario Bros. Wii 1bLeplap, Welandc2012-8-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis mod features 14 full new levels divided over 3 worlds, over 50 new goodies and retextured objects, many custom music composed over almost all levels, and of course some custom tilesets.  i2012kLeplap, WelandsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00464na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002100041300002300062500018000085542002500265655002500290655002700315SMNE0500aAnother Super Mario Bros. Wii 1bSkawoc2011-7-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aAnother Super Mario Bros. Wii is a simple mod created by Skawo and released in December 2010 which includes a full set of new levels with the same themes as the original game.  i2011kSkawosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00449na  a2200121   45000010007000002450021000072640025000283000023000