ows massive amounts of game patching, so original Yoshi music or backgrounds could be included. Characters can be re-skinned too, like the purple Toad with a heart spot at the title screen.  i2014kDarkly77sGameTDB00761na  a2200097   4500001000700000245005700007264002300064300002300087500052500110542002800635SMNE3500aNew Super Mario Bros. Wii: Yoshi Mode - Classic Mode 1bDarkly77c2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis was gonna be a full game mod that anyone could run using Riivolution, a game patching application that requires no hacking or modding. Made with Reggie!, Yoshi Mode was being created to put Yoshi in every level, originally as a surprise for Darkly77's girlfriend - who will only play the Yoshi levels with him. Riivolution allows massive amounts of game patching, so original Yoshi music or backgrounds could be included. Characters can be re-skinned too, like the purple Toad with a heart spot at the title screen.  i2014kDarkly77sGameTDB00228na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004000007264002400047300002300071500000500094542003100099SMNE3600aNew Super Mario Bros. Wii Hack Pack 1bCodemastersc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kCodemasterssGameTDB00272na  a2200097   4500001000700000245005200007264004000059300002300099500000500122542004700127SMNE3700aNew Super Mario Bros. Wii Dragon Coaster Frenzy 1bTaito / GAGA Communicationsc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kTaito / GAGA CommunicationssGameTDB00359na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004700007264002100054300002300075500013700098542002600235SMNE3800aNew Super Mario Bros. Wii Underground Maze 1bLagunac2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis contains only 1 level that takes place in Level 1-2, and it's, like the title suggests, a level that has a maze... underground!  i2014kLagunasGameTDB00370na  a2200097   4500001000700000245005100007264002100058300002300079500014400102542002600246SMNE3900aNewer Super Mario Bros. Wii: Antnee Level Pack 1bAn