SMNJ0300aNewer Super Mario Bros. Wii 1bNewer Teamc2013-6-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aNewer is a full unofficial sequel to New Super Mario Bros. Wii, crafted over the span of 3 years by a team of devoted Nintendo fans. Playable legally on any homebrew-enabled Wii; no piracy or hardware mods needed. In Newer, you'll find...  i2013kNewer TeamsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00495na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264002900040300002300069500019500092542003400287655002500321655002700346SMNJ0400aCannon Super Mario Bros. Wii 1bLeplap, Welandc2012-8-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis mod features 14 full new levels divided over 3 worlds, over 50 new goodies and retextured objects, many custom music composed over almost all levels, and of course some custom tilesets.  i2012kLeplap, WelandsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00449na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264002500028300002300053500016900076542003000245655002500275655002700300SMNJ0600aNewer Summer Sun 1bNewer Teamc2012-7-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aReady for some fun in the sun? The Newer Team is proud to present the Newer Summer Sun special! So put on your sun hats and rub in the sunscreen, 'cause here we go!  i2012kNewer TeamsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00465na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002700033300002300060500017800083542003000261655002500291655002700316SMNJ0700aNewer Holiday Special 1bNewer Teamc2011-11-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aNewer: Holiday Special is a frosty adventure created to celebrate Christmas 2011. Explore 8 of the coldest levels you'll ever see, set to chilly music and new, icy textures!  i2011kNewer TeamsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00487na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264003100035300002300066500019000089542003400279655002500313655002700338SMNJ0800aEpic Super Bowser World 1bWeland, Leplapc20