game is a modification of New Super Mario Bros. Wii using assets from Newer Super Mario Bros. Wii. Mario has gone missing yet again, and it's up to Luigi and co. to save him once more! However, this time, they have Luigi's unique set of physics on their side!  i2020kNew Luigi TeamsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00232na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004400007264002400051300002300075500000500098542003100103SMNP3100aNew Super Mario Bros. Wii - Other World 1bCarrozzeriac2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014kCarrozzeriasGameTDB00746na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004200007264002300049300002300072500052500095542002800620SMNP3400aNew Super Mario Bros. Wii: Yoshi Mode 1bDarkly77c2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis was gonna be a full game mod that anyone could run using Riivolution, a game patching application that requires no hacking or modding. Made with Reggie!, Yoshi Mode was being created to put Yoshi in every level, originally as a surprise for Darkly77's girlfriend - who will only play the Yoshi levels with him. Riivolution allows massive amounts of game patching, so original Yoshi music or backgrounds could be included. Characters can be re-skinned too, like the purple Toad with a heart spot at the title screen.  i2014kDarkly77sGameTDB00761na  a2200097   4500001000700000245005700007264002300064300002300087500052500110542002800635SMNP3500aNew Super Mario Bros. Wii: Yoshi Mode - Classic Mode 1bDarkly77c2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis was gonna be a full game mod that anyone could run using Riivolution, a game patching application that requires no hacking or modding. Made with Reggie!, Yoshi Mode was being created to put Yoshi in every level, originally as a surprise for Darkly77's girlfriend - who will only play the Yoshi levels with him. Riivolution allows massive amounts of game patching, so original Yoshi music or backgrounds could be included. Characters can be re-skinned too, lik