pershellc2012-7-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aAdds Yoshi into as many stages as he works. Unlike the original Yoshi Mode (started and abandoned by Darkly77), this mod does not seek to completely redesign stages in which Yoshi clearly does not work (ie: levels centered on swimming and fence climbing). Some minor alterations were made, but the goal is to keep the same "feel" of the original game. Levels that already have Yoshi are not modified in any way. Also, this mod does NOT affect any of the multiplayer battle areas that are not featured in the main game.  i2012kHypershellsGameTDB00282na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264002600023300002300049500000500072542003100077655002500108655002700133SMNP4400aGo Go Mario 1bZementBlockc2015-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2015kZementBlocksGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00552na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002800033300002300061500026300084542003100347655002500378655002700403SMNP4500aLemmy's Winter Palace 1bZementBlockc2014-11-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aLooks like Lemmy got his own winter palace and he made a New Super Mario Bros. Wii level for it. (Or ZementBlock did.) This is only one level playable in this New Super Mario Bros. Wii Mod, but you will know which level it is when you start playing the game.  i2014kZementBlocksGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00318na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005700007264002400064300002300088500000500111542002800116655002500144655002700169SMNP4600aNew Super Mario Bros. Wii - Birthday Batch of Levels 1bSystem 3c2010-2-20  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kSystem 3sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00437na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002600032300002300058500015100081542003100232655002500263655002700288SMNP4704aThe New Special Road 1bZementBlockc2015-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is a new Special Road (World 9 in New Sup