005264002700037300002300064500074600087542003200833655002700865655002700892WA7P00aToribash Violence Perfected 1bNabi Studiosc2010-7-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aToribash is an online fighting game where you make all the moves. Use precision motion controls to create any move you want - the only limit is your imagination. Manipulate your fighter's joints for maximum impact and take out your opponents with precise hits. Boost your joints for added speed and strength to hit harder, then grab your opponents and slam them to the ground. Fight online and challenge players around the world using Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection (broadband Internet access required). Want to make your own fight movies? Just jump into the replay editor. You can enter replays at any point in time and review your fight to catch that mind-blowing move you missed. When you're done, share with your buddies through WiiConnect24.  i2010kNabi StudiossGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00383na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264002400029300002300053500010700076542002800183655002500211655002500236WA8E00aArt Style - ROTOZOA 1bNintendoc2010-6-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aGuide a rotozoan through primordial ooze where precise control and movement are vital to your success.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00375na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003900005264002100044300002300065500012400088542002800212655002500240WA8J00aArt Style Series - PENTA TENTACLES 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake an unusual journey into a microscopic world in this unique action game from the genre-redefining Art Style series.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00370na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003100005264002400036300002300060500012400083542002800207655002500235WA8P00aArt Style: PENTA TENTACLES 1bNintendoc2010-5-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake an unusual journey into a microscopic world in this unique action game from the genre-redefining Art Style series.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00478na  a2200133   4500001000500000245003100005264003800036300002300074500012800097542004200225655002500267655002700292655002500319WAAE00aAya and the Cubes of Light 1bObject Vision Softwarec2011-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aKeep on the Light! Solve the cubic mazes and rekindle the stars! Exceptional hybrid of puzzle, platform game and 3D action!  i2011kObject Vision SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00555na  a2200133   4500001000500000245003100005264003800036300002300074500020500097542004200302655002500344655002700369655002500396WAAP00aAya and the Cubes of Light 1bObject Vision Softwarec2011-8-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhat's gotten into Cseom?! Instead of keeping the Cubes running, he's taking the Energy Packs out of the terminals! The Cubes are the power sources of the stars, and if they stop working it gets dark!  i2011kObject Vision SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00361na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001900005264003400024300002300058500010700081542003800188655002500226WABE00aArt of Balance 1bShin'en Multimediac2010-2-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your Wii Remote and build balanced stacks in this engaging and challenging physics-based puzzler.  i2010kShin'en MultimediasGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00337na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001900005264003400024300002300058500008300081542003800164655002500202WABP00aArt of Balance 1bShin'en Multimediac2010-3-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your Wii Remote and build a balanced stack in this physics-based puzzler!  i2010kShin'en MultimediasGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00655na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002700027300002300054500037200077542003100449655002500480655002800505WACE00aArcade Essentials 1bNordcurrentc2011-3-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aArcade Essentials is a collection of five classic arcade games. The games are enduring classics and some of the most popular games ever! All the games are presented in a modern reincarnation with enhanced gameplay, stylish graphics and sound effects. Jump straight in, enjoy the non-stop gameplay and immerse yourself in these classic games as you did many years ago.  i2011kNordcurrentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00615na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002700027300002300054500037200077542003100449655002500480WACP00aArcade Essentials 1bNordcurrentc2011-2-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aArcade Essentials is a collection of five classic arcade games. The games are enduring classics and some of the most popular games ever! All the games are presented in a modern reincarnation with enhanced gameplay, stylish graphics and sound effects. Jump straight in, enjoy the non-stop gameplay and immerse yourself in these classic games as you did many years ago.  i2011kNordcurrentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00371na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002100005264002500026300002300051500013400074542002800208655002500236WAEE00aAround the World 1bWizarboxc2010-12-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aBe a geomaster without any hassle! Discover landmarks, cities, and many other things... Enjoy this cultural and funny experience!  i2010kWizarboxsGameTDB 7aTrivia games2wiiext00292na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002100005264002400026300002300050500005600073542002800129655002500157WAEP00aAround the World 1bWizarboxc2011-1-28  a1 Wii optical disc  a“Around the World” brings the fun to geography!  i2011kWizarboxsGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00442na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003300005264003100038300002300069500017700092542003400269655002900303WAFE00aAirport Mania - First Flight 1bLemon Games SLc2010-11-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aPack your bags for a trip through the skies in Airport Mania! Travel through eight amusing airports while you land a variety of planes, purchase upgrades, and avoid delays.  i2010kLemon Games SLsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00637na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003200005264002700037300002300064500038000087542003100467655002900498WAFP00aAirport Mania: First Flight 1bLemon Gamesc2011-6-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aPack your bags for a trip through the skies in Airport Mania! Travel through 8 amusing airports while you land a variety of planes, purchase upgrades and avoid delays. Stay on your toes as some planes carry precious cargo and will need to land in a hurry, while others might need a trip to the repair shop. But, with good planning, you're sure to make it to the gate on time!  i2011kLemon GamessGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00486na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002300005264003000028300002300058500019800081542003300279655002700312655002500339WAGE00aPinocchio's Puzzle 1bEnjoyUp Gamesc2011-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aRemember the puppet whose nose grew? Remember the values taught by the story? Friendship, cunning and tenderness... Will you reach the end of the story of Pinocchio through a series of puzzles?  i2011kEnjoyUp GamessGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext01013na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002900027300002300056500076300079542003400842655002700876WAHE00aTrenches Generals 1bFishing Cactusc2011-9-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aTrenches deploys to the Wii and is taking no hostages. Trenches has been designed for the Wii from the ground up for an immersive and engaging experience and provides a twist on the tried and true castle defense genre with its own personal style. Command Royal British Expeditionary Forces as the defender of the free world. Your troops must take to the field and defend your bunker from being overrun and use the Trenches located on the battlefield to hold their ground in between no mans land. Lead rifleman, mortarmen, snipers, machinegunners, and more against the enemies in the east! Choose your perks to customize how you play the single-player campaign or join with a friend for splitscreen cooperative and competitive multiplayer! Your war, your way!  i2011kFishing CactussGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext00797na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002300005264003000028300002300058500050800081542003400589655002500623655002700648WAHP00aTrenches: Generals 1bFishing Cactusc2011-10-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aTrenches deploys to the Wii console and is taking no hostages! Trenches has been designed from the ground up for Wii for an immersive and engaging experience, providing a twist on the tried and true tower defence genre with a personal style all its own. Command Royal British Expeditionary Forces as the defender of the free world. Your troops must take to the field and defend your bunker from being overrun and use the Trenches located on the battlefield to hold their ground in between no man's land.  i2011kFishing CactussGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00359na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003100005264002800036300002300064500006600087542003100153655002500184655002800209WAIE00a101-in-1 Explosive Megamix 1bNordcurrentc2011-10-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to the home of 101 mind-blowing games for all tastes!  i2011kNordcurrentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00632na  a2200157   4500001000500000245003100005264002700036300002300063500023300086542003100319655002500350655002500375655002500400655002400425655002500449WAIP00a101-in-1 Explosive Megamix 1bNordcurrentc2011-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to the home of 101 mind-blowing games for all tastes! Whether you like puzzle games, sport games or fast-paced arcade action, you'll definitely find something to suit you here! Jump in - tens of hours of games await you.  i20