  i2010kKonamisGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00346na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003900005264003200044300002300076500006800099542003600167655003300203WAOE04aThe Very Hungry Caterpillar's ABCs 1bCYBIRD Co., Ltd.c2010-9-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnjoy Learning to Read Along with the Very Hungry Caterpillar !  i2010kCYBIRD Co., Ltd.sGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00531na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002800005264002800033300002300061500023200084542003500316655002500351655003300376WAOJ00aHarapeko Aomushi no ABC 1bCYBIRD Co.,Ltd.c2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is an activity game based on the children's book The Very Hungry Caterpillar. Young players can learn the alphabet by associating words and pictures with each letter, as well as engaging in drawing and colouring exercises.  i2014kCYBIRD Co.,Ltd.sGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00527na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003900005264002200044300002300066500023200089542002600321655002500347655003300372WAOP04aThe Very Hungry Caterpillar's ABCs 1bCybirdc2012-1-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is an activity game based on the children's book The Very Hungry Caterpillar. Young players can learn the alphabet by associating words and pictures with each letter, as well as engaging in drawing and colouring exercises.  i2012kCybirdsGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00675na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004700005264002400052300002300076500041400099542002800513655002400541WAQJ00aYakuman Wii - Ide Yosuke no Kenkou Mahjong 1bNintendoc2008-5-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aNintendo's own Mahjong game seems to be a neat version with tutorials, Mii support and online modes. Mahjong is a traditional Japanese game that can be played with up to 4 players. Don't confuse this with the western Mahjong which is Shanghai. We don't have any real Mahjong game on the Wii yet and this would be a great addition for all Mahjong fans since this is not as exotic and unknown as some may think.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aBoard games2wiiext00279na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004200005264001300047300002300060500000500083542001800088655002700106655002400133WARJ00aTsuushin Taikyoku - Igo Dojo 2700-Mon 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext00211na  a2200097   4500001000500000245004700005264001500052300002300067500000500090542001800095WASJ00aTsuushin Taikyoku - Hayazashi Shogi Sandan 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00264na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002300005264002800028300002300056500001800079542003200097655002500129WATE00aAstro Bugz Revenge 1bSudden Gamesc2010-9-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aGame Overview  i2010kSudden GamessGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00198na  a2200097   4500001000500000245003600005264001300041300002300054500000500077542001800082WAUJ00aTsuushin Taikyoku - World Chess 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00408na  a2200145   4500001000500000245002100005264002800026300002300054500004600077542003200123655002500155655002500180655002700205655003000232WAYE00aAnd Yet It Moves 1bBroken Rulesc2010-8-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aRun, jump and turn the world upside-down!  i2010kBroken RulessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a2D platform games2wiiext00450na  a2200145   4500001000500000245002100005264002800026300002300054500008800077542003200165655002500197655002500222655002700247655003000274WAYP00aAnd Yet It Moves 1bBroken Rulesc2010-8-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aAnd Yet It Moves is a puzzle-platformer set in a unique world made of ripped paper.  i2010kBroken RulessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a2D platform games2wiiext00311na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002900005264002400034300002300058500006700081542002800148655002500176WAZE04aThe Amazing Brain Train! 1bNinjaBeec2010-1-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aHarness your brain power to solve puzzles and complete quests!  i2010kNinjaBeesGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00415na  a2200109   4500001000500000245010300005264003100108300002300139500008100162542003400243655002800277WB2E00aStrong Bad's Cool Game for Attractive People - Episode 4 - Dangeresque 3 - The Criminal Projective 1bTelltale Gamesc2008-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe suave star of Homestarrunner.com now has his own game series on WiiWare!  i2008kTelltale GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00790na  a2200133   4500001000500000245010000005264003000105300002300135500038600158542003400544655002500578655002800603655002500631WB2P00aStrong Bad's Cool Game for Attractive People Episode 4: Dangeresque 3 - The Criminal Projective 1bTelltale Gamesc2008-12-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aMove over, James Bond! Strong Bad is here to show you how it's done in his hand-crafted cinematic masterpiece, Dangeresque 3: The Criminal Projective. You play Dangeresque, a dirty cop in pursuit of a little action and several big sacks of cash. Can our hero stay alive long enough to defeat his arch-nemesis, save the world, and get the girl? Looks like he's gonna have to jump…  i2008kTelltale GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00619na  a2200109   4500001000500000245007900005264003100084300002300115500030900138542003400447655002800481WB3E00aStrong Bad's Cool Game for Attractive People - Episode 5 - 8-Bit Is Enough 1bTelltale Gamesc2008-12-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aStrong Bad's Cool Game for Attractive People is a 5-episode series starring Strong Bad, star of the Homestarrunner.com web cartoons and self-proclaimed coolest person ever. With four episodes out now and one still to come, the series is headed for an exciting climax in 8-Bit Is Enough, starring Trogdor!  i2008kTelltale GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00883na  a2200133   4500001000500000245007700005264002900082300002300111500050300134542003400637655002500671655002800696655002500724WB3P00aStrong Bad's Cool Game for Attractive People Episode 5 - 8-Bit Is Enough 1bTelltale Gamesc2009-1-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aTrogdor, the beefy-armed dragon of legend, has shaken free from his video game and is running through the countryside, burninating everything in sight. With a dragon on the loose and 8-bit classics leaking into the real world, it's all fun and games until the proud land of Strong Badia falls to Trogdor's fiery wrath. Now Strong Bad must take back the night by sending this scorching menace back into his arcade cabinet once and for all. Just one problem... does anybody know how to kill a dragon?  i2009kTelltale GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00387na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001900005264002300024300002300047500011600070542002800186655002500214655002600239WB4E00aWild West Guns 1bGameloftc2008-8-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aDraw your revolver to see who’s the fastest gun in the West! Practice your aim and speed on numerous targets.  i2008kGameloftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01128na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001900005264002300024300002300047500085700070542002800927655002500955655002600980WB4J00aWild West Guns 1bGameloftc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aDraw your revolver and see if you're the fastest gun in the West! Adjust your speed and precision as targets or enemies appear in front of you: point and shoot to earn more points. You can aim at anything so be sure to explore the environment for elements that will earn you more shooting points. Identify your enemies among the characters you encounter, but don't shoot at innocent citizens! Take part in an Old West-style train attack or challenge your skills in a variety of increasingly difficult shooting challenges in other beautiful, classic and lively Western environments. As you progress through challenges, you’ll earn medals and rewards, making for non-stop and addictive action. Play in a 2-player multiplayer mode where you and your partner can combine points, or play against each other to find out who’s the fastest gun in the West.  i2014kGameloftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01148na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001900005264003300024300002300057500085700080542003800937655002500975655002601000WB4P00aWild West Guns 1bGameloft / Ubisoftc2008-8-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aDraw your revolver and see if you're the fastest gun in the West! Adjust your speed and precision as targets or enemies appear in front of you: point and shoot to earn more points. You can aim at anything so be sure to explore the environment for elements that will earn you more shooting points. Identify your enemies among the characters you encounter, but don't shoot at innocent citizens! Take part in an Old West-style train attack or challenge your skills in a variety of increasingly difficult shooting challenges in other beautiful, classic and lively Western environments. As you progress through challenges, you’ll earn medals and rewards, making for non-stop and addictive action. Play in a 2-player multiplayer mode where you and your partner can combine points, or play against each other to find out who’s the fastest gun in the West.  i2008kGameloft / UbisoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00736na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002500005264002400030300002300054500049600077542002800573655002500601WB5E00aBlock Breaker Deluxe 1bGameloftc2008-6-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aBlock Breaker Deluxe is a reinvention of the classic arcade brick-breaker game with a trendy graphical style, fun atmosphere, and an exclusive multiplayer mode. Lively characters and amazing graphics provide distinctive settings of the jet-set nightlife, like a cool bar, dance club, casino, and more! Special bricks, multiple bonuses, secret weapons, paddle size options, and ball speed variations make this fascinating game even more challenging. The Block Breaker Deluxe rage has arrived!  i2008kGameloftsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext00832na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002500005264002100030300002300051500055800074542002800632655002500660655002500685WB5J00aBlock Breaker Deluxe 1bGameloftc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aPrepare for the frenzy of the coolest block-breaker game ever! Block Breaker Deluxe is a reinvention of the classic arcade brick-breaker game with a trendy graphical style, fun atmosphere, and an exclusive multiplayer mode. Lively characters and amazing graphics provide distinctive settings of the jet-set nightlife, like a cool bar, dance club, casino and more! Special bricks, multiple bonuses, secret weapons, paddle size options, and ball speed variations make this fascinating game even more challenging. The Block Breaker Deluxe rage has arrived!  i2014kGameloftsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00855na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002500005264003400030300002300064500055800087542003800645655002500683655002500708WB5P00aBlock Breaker Deluxe 1bGameloft / Ubisoftc2008-6-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aPrepare for the frenzy of the coolest block-breaker game ever! Block Breaker Deluxe is a reinvention of the classic arcade brick-breaker game with a trendy graphical style, fun atmosphere, and an exclusive multiplayer mode. Lively characters and amazing graphics provide distinctive settings of the jet-set nightlife, like a cool bar, dance club, casino and more! Special bricks, multiple bonuses, secret weapons, paddle size options, and ball speed variations make this fascinating game even more challenging. The Block Breaker Deluxe rage has arrived!  i2008kGameloft / Ubi