0002300067500040100090542003500491655002500526655002500551WBGP00aBang Attack - Project Bang 1bEngine Softwarec2008-12-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aBang Attack is a fun colourful puzzle game for young and old alike! You don’t have to learn how to play Bang Attack, you can pick it up as you go along. The objective is to find identical objects and then smash them with your little hammer. Once you have enough points, you can use the Wii Remote™ to swing with the BIG hammer. If there is a banana in the way, simply whack it off the screen!  i2008kEngine SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00376na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001600005264002900021300002300050500009700073542003300170655002500203655002600228WBHE00aBlood Beach 1bCoresoft Inc.c2010-5-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aDefend your island outpost from the Japanese Navy using your incredible arsenal of weaponry.  i2010kCoresoft Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00454na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001600005264003000021300002300051500021200074542003300286655002500319WBHP00aBlood Beach 1bCoresoft Inc.c2010-11-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou are hopelessly outnumbered and have no option except to fight and win: it's  just you and your guns. Only the thin stretch of "Blood Beach" stands between you and the whole of the Japanese Imperial Navy.  i2010kCoresoft Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00356na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001100005264002700016300002300043500004900066542003000115655002500145655002700170655002500197WBIE00aBoingz 1bRealArcadec2008-11-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aBend, stretch and flick your way to freedom!  i2008kRealArcadesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00280na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003400005264002400039300002300063500002800086542002700114655002900141WBJE00aHarvest Moon - My Little Shop 1bNatsumec2009-11-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Clover Town!  i2009kNatsumesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00290na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004800005264002000053300002300073500002800096542002700124655002900151WBJJ00aBokujou Monogatari Series - Makiba no Omise 1bNatsumec2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Clover Town!  i2014kNatsumesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00286na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001900005264002700024300002300051500004600074542003100120655002500151WBKE00aArkanoid Plus! 1bSquare Enixc2009-9-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aRelive the old school days of Arkanoid…  i2009kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext01069na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001900005264002400024300002300048500079500071542003100866655002500897655002500922WBKJ00aArkanoid Plus! 1bSquare Enixc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aARKANOID Plus! is an updated version of the original arcade blockbuster. Players must destroy coloured blocks by guiding an Energy Ball around the screen using a spaceship called a VAUS. The game features a host of new modes and settings which radically alter the gameplay experience: "Arcade Mode" consists of 61 Rounds divided into left and right versions with two types of boss character appearing in the last Round; "VS Mode" lets players face off against a friend or the CPU; and the unfailingly frantic "Time Mode" challenges players to clear Rounds within a strict time limit. Factor in the subtle differences arising from the choice of “Lives” or “Barrier” rules, along with a plethora of exciting items, and it’s clear you’re in for hours and hours of blockbusting fun!  i2014kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext01072na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001900005264002700024300002300051500079500074542003100869655002500900655002500925WBKP00aArkanoid Plus! 1bSquare Enixc2009-8-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aARKANOID Plus! is an updated version of the original arcade blockbuster. Players must destroy coloured blocks by guiding an Energy Ball around the screen using a spaceship called a VAUS. The game features a host of new modes and settings which radically alter the gameplay experience: "Arcade Mode" consists of 61 Rounds divided into left and right versions with two types of boss character appearing in the last Round; "VS Mode" lets players face off against a friend or the CPU; and the unfailingly frantic "Time Mode" challenges players to clear Rounds within a strict time limit. Factor in the subtle differences arising from the choice of “Lives” or “Barrier” rules, along with a plethora of exciting items, and it’s clear you’re in for hours and hours of blockbusting fun!  i2009kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00360na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002400005264002100029300002300050500012700073542002500200655002500225WBLE00aBubble Bobble Plus! 1bTaitoc2009-5-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aBubble trappin’ & poppin’ action! Relive the classic or try new rounds. Solve hidden puzzles and seek the true ending.  i2009kTaitosGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext00454na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002700027300002300054500017400077542003100251655002500282655002500307WBLJ00aBubble Bobble Wii 1bSquare Enixc2009-2-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aBUBBLE BOBBLE Plus! is a simple yet exhilarating action game where you control the bubble blowing dragons Bub and Bob, trapping enemies in bubbles and then popping them.  i2009kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00456na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264002700029300002300056500017400079542003100253655002500284655002500309WBLP00aBubble Bobble Plus! 1bSquare Enixc2009-4-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aBUBBLE BOBBLE Plus! is a simple yet exhilarating action game where you control the bubble blowing dragons Bub and Bob, trapping enemies in bubbles and then popping them.  i2009kSquare EnixsGame