110542004400207655002400251WF3E00aFamily Games - Pen and Paper Edition 1bIcon Games Entertainmentc2010-12-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aA collection of classic family pen and paper games. Timeless favorites for the whole family.  i2010kIcon Games EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00870na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003800005264002600043300002300069500060600092542003100698655003100729WF4E00aFINAL FANTASY IV: THE AFTER YEARS 1bSquare Enixc2009-6-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aFINAL FANTASY IV: THE AFTER YEARS is the sequel to the hit RPG FINAL FANTASY IV. The story takes place many years after the original and centers on a young man named Ceodore, the son of the paladin Cecil and the white mage Rosa, who with their loyal and steadfast friends once saved the world from the evil born of the second moon. Now, monsters have begun reappearing in a world that had finally attained peace. The second moon has returned anew. What tidings does this ominous harbinger bring? Familiar faces and new allies join the battle to save the Blue Planet once more from a yet darker threat.  i2009kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00366na  a2200109   4500001000500000245005600005264002400061300002300085500008600108542003100194655003100225WF4J00aFinal Fantasy IV - The After Years - Tsuki no Kikan 1bSquare Enixc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aFINAL FANTASY IV: THE AFTER YEARS is the sequel to the hit RPG, FINAL FANTASY IV.  i2014kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00350na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003800005264002600043300002300069500008600092542003100178655003100209WF4P00aFINAL FANTASY IV: THE AFTER YEARS 1bSquare Enixc2009-6-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aFINAL FANTASY IV: THE AFTER YEARS is the sequel to the hit RPG, FINAL FANTASY IV.  i2009kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00321na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002700027300002300054500008000077542003100157655002300188WF5E00aFamily Card Games 1bAksys Gamesc2009-11-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aDaddy, Mommy, Sarah, and Billy are back for some good ol' card game action!  i2009kAksys GamessGameTDB 7aCard games2wiiext01102na  a2200109   4500001000500000245005200005264002900057300002300086500082400109542003600933655002300969WF5J00aOkiraku Daifugou Wii - Honkaku Wi-Fi Net Taisen 1bARC SYSTEM WORKSc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aDaddy, Mommy, Sarah, and Billy are back for some good ol' card game action! Try your hand at one of three card games! Pick from Daifugo, Speed, and Memory! Family Card Games displays appealing cel-shaded graphics and endearing music, on top of the friendly competitive match-ups. You can play 1P Daifugo, or play against up to three other random players in an online match! You can also view your ranking and see how you match up with players around the world! Both Speed and Memory are available to play as well! Test your reflexes and card prowess against another player in Speed to see who truly has the fastest hands. Memory will test your mental capacity as you try to remember where cards and their respective match are. Do you have it in you to be both the fastest and the smartest among your friends and family?  i2014kARC SYSTEM WORKSsGameTDB 7aCard games2wiiext01116na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264003200027300002300059500082400082542003600906655002900942655002300971WF5P00aFamily Card Games 1bArc System Worksc2010-8-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aDaddy, Mommy, Sarah, and Billy are back for some good ol' card game action! Try your hand at one of three card games! Pick from Daifugo, Speed, and Memory! Family Card Games displays appealing cel-shaded graphics and endearing music, on top of the friendly competitive match-ups. You can play 1P Daifugo, or play against up to three other random players in an online match! You can also view your ranking and see how you match up with players around the world! Both Speed and Memory are available to play as well! Test your reflexes and card prowess against another player in Speed to see who truly has the fastest hands. Memory will test your mental capacity as you try to remember where cards and their respective match are. Do you have it in you to be both the fastest and the smartest among your friends and family?  i2010kArc System WorkssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aCard games2wiiext00356na  a2200145   4500001000500000245001100005264002300016300002300039500001800062542002600080655002500106655002800131655002600159655002500185WF6E00aFrobot 1bFugazoc2010-12-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aGame Overview  i2010kFugazosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00430na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002300005264003500028300002300063500009400086542004000180655002500220655002600245655002500271WFAE00aFast Draw Showdown 1bDigital Leisure Inc.c2010-1-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen it comes to fast draw there’re only two types of people: the quick...and the dead!  i2010kDigital Leisure Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00589na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002300005264003600028300002300064500028900087542004000376655002500416655002600441WFAP00aFast Draw Showdown 1bDigital Leisure Inc.c2010-1-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen it comes to fast draw there’re only two types of people: the quick…and the dead! Now you have the chance to find out where you stand, or lie, as the case may be. You’ll go up against the best quick draws in the business, including one of the world’s fastest, Wes Flowers.  i2010kDigital Leisure Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00261na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001600005264002100021300002300042500007200065542002600137WFBE00aSandy Beach 1bKonamic2009-1-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnjoy a fun day at Sandy Beach as you build elaborate sand castles.  i2009kKonamisGameTDB00281na  a2200097   4500001000500000245003800005264001900043300002300062500007200085542002600157WFBJ00aBeach de Oshiro wo Tsukuccha Wow! 1bKonamic2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnjoy a fun day at Sandy Beach as you build elaborate sand castles.  i2014kKonamisGameTDB00261na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001600005264002100021300002300042500007200065542002600137WFBP00aSandy Beach 1bKonamic2010-8-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnjoy a fun day at Sandy Beach as you build elaborate sand castles.  i2010kKonamisGameTDB00711na  a2200133   4500001000500000245005600005264002700061300002300088500034800111542003100459655002900490655003100519655002700550WFCE00aFinal Fantasy Crystal Chronicles: My Life as a King 1bSquare Enixc2008-5-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou are a young king who must rebuild his kingdom, beginning with the castle town. When the king first reaches the borders of his realm, he finds that the crystal in the center of town has given him special powers to be a "master builder," a unique ability he uses to construct houses, shops and the like to rebuild and revitalize his kingdom.  i2008kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00880na  a2200121   4500001000500000245005600005264002700061300002300088500055800111542003100669655003100700655002700731WFCJ00aFinal Fantasy Crystal Chronicles: My Life as a King 1bSquare Enixc2008-3-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aAccording to legend, a deserted town now serves as the lifeless reminder of a once powerful kingdom. The young son of an exiled king reaches this land after a long journey, finding only an abandoned castle – and a magic crystal. Though tarnished by years of neglect, the crystal has maintained its luminous glow and bestows upon the boy the power of architek, the ability to manifest memories into reality. With the help of loyal servants and audacious adventurers, the new king dutifully prepares to rebuild his people’s homeland in this new realm.  i2008kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00880na  a2200121   4500001000500000245005600005264002700061300002300088500055800111542003100669655003100700655002700731WFCP00aFinal Fantasy Crystal Chronicles: My Life as a King 1bSquare Enixc2008-5-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aAccording to legend, a deserted town now serves as the lifeless reminder of a once powerful kingdom. The young son of an exiled king reaches this land after a long journey, finding only an abandoned castle – and a magic crystal. Though tarnished by years of neglect, the crystal has maintained its luminous glow and bestows upon the boy the power of architek, the ability to manifest memories into reality. With the help of loyal servants and audacious adventurers, the new king dutifully prepares to rebuild his people’s homeland in this new realm.  i2008kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00820na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002100005264002500026300002300051500054300074542002900617655002700646655002500673WFDE00aSave the Furries 1bSDP Gamesc2012-6-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aHelp Save the Furries across 60 levels in this puzzle-adventure ! Furries are cute green creatures that like to visit strange planets and then stroll about oblivious to the dangers around them. Where you are needed is to use the Wii Remote to move and swipe pinballs, ropes, logs, crates, carts, switches, fans and all sorts of other items to help create a safe path to the exit. Make sure you keep the Furries safe from strange galactic creatures, spikey pits, huge explosions, giant drops and becoming the main dinner of the evil Furax!  i2012kSDP GamessGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00897na  a2200145   4500001000500000245002100005264002500026300002300051500054300074542002900617655002500646655002800671655002700699655002500726WFDP00aSave the Furries 1bSDP Gamesc2012-6-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aHelp Save the Furries across 60 levels in this puzzle-adventure ! Furries are cute green creatures that like to visit strange planets and then stroll about oblivious to the dangers around them. Where you are needed is to use the Wii Remote to move and swipe pinballs, ropes, logs, crates, carts, switches, fans and all sorts of other items to help create a safe path to the exit. Make sure you keep the Furries safe from strange galactic creatures, spikey pits, huge explosions, giant drops and becoming the main dinner of the evil Furax!  i2012kSDP GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00384na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003800005264002600043300002300069500008600092542003100178655002500209655002800234WFEE00aFenimore Fillmore - The Westerner 1bRevistronicc2010-9-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs Fenimore Fillmore, help the farmers against the cowboys of the cattle rancher.  i2010kRevistronicsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00355na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002300005264003400028300002300062500006300085542003700148655002500185655002300210WFFE00aFun! Fun! Minigolf 1bShinen Multimediac2008-12-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay minigolf with your friends in beautiful environments.  i2008kShinen MultimediasGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00389na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002300005264003100028300002300059500006300082542003800145655002500183655002300208655002400231WFFJ00aFun! Fun! Minigolf 1bShin'en Multimediac2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay minigolf with your friends in beautiful environments.  i2014kShin'en MultimediasGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00391na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002300005264003300028300002300061500006300084542003800147655002500185655002300210655002400233WFFP00aFun! Fun! Minigolf 1bShin'en Multimediac2009-1-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay minigolf with your friends in beautiful environments.  i2009kShin'en MultimediasGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00320na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002000005264002200025300002300047500005200070542002600122655002500148655002500173WFGE00aFrogger Returns 1bKonamic2009-11-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aYour favorite street-hopping amphibian is back!  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00590na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002000005264001900025300002300044500032500067542002600392655002500418655002500443WFGJ00aFrogger Returns 1bKonamic2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aFrogger Returns takes the heart-pounding challenge of arcade Frogger and takes it into the next dimension! Classic top-down 2D gameplay is updated with colourful 3D graphics, a new perspective, all-new levels, new enemies and game-changing power-ups to dodge and use! Local multiplayer lets you race a friend to victory.  i2014kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00486na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001900005264002400024300002300048500025200071542002800323655002500351WFHE00aFlight Control 1bFiremintc2011-8-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aControl a never-ending stream of aircraft in this insanely addictive worldwide hit from Firemint! Take on the role of an air traffic controller at an increasingly busy airport. Direct all manner of aircraft to safety, but don’t let them collide!  i2011kFiremintsGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00584na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001900005264003300024300002300057500025200080542003700332655002500369655002900394655002700423WFHP00aFlight Control 1bFiremint Pty Ltd.c2011-8-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aControl a never-ending stream of aircraft in this insanely addictive worldwide hit from Firemint! Take on the role of an air traffic controller at an increasingly busy airport. Direct all manner of aircraft to safety, but don’t let them collide!  i2011kFiremint Pty Ltd.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00319na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002700005264002300032300002300055500003700078542002700115655002900142655002600171WFIE00aReel Fishing Challenge 1bNatsumec2009-6-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aAre you ready for the challenge?  i2009kNatsumesGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFishing games2wiiext00892na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264002500029300002300054500060600077542003200683655002900715655002600744WFIJ00aFish Eyes Challenge 1bNatsume Inc.c2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aReel Fishing Challenge offers a fun and challenging experience for novice fishers and master anglers alike. Put your skills to the test and discover new types of fish in the challenging mission mode, or relax and enjoy the game at your own pace in free play mode. No matter which mode you play, the game's beautiful graphics and natural setting bring the fishing experience to life. Choose from a variety of lures to attract and hook the game's numerous wily fish. Each fish looks and moves so much like the real thing, it's the closest you can get to real-life fishing without putting on your waders!  i2014kNatsume Inc.sGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFishing games2wiiext00898na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002700005264002800032300002300060500060600083542003200689655002900721655002600750WFIP00aReel Fishing Challenge 1bNatsume Inc.c2010-2-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aReel Fishing Challenge offers a fun and challenging experience for novice fishers and master anglers alike. Put your skills to the test and discover new types of fish in the challenging mission mode, or relax and enjoy the game at your own pace in free play mode. No matter which mode you play, the game's beautiful graphics and natural setting bring the fishing experience to life. Choose from a variety of lures to attract and hook the game's numerous wily fish. Each fish looks and moves so much like the real thing, it's the closest you can get to real-life fishing without putting on your waders!  i2010kNatsume Inc.sGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFishing games2wiiext00413na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002600005264002700031300002300058500012400081542003100205655002500236655003000261WFKE00aFamily Go-Kart Racing 1bAksys Gamesc2010-2-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aFamily Go-Kart Racing from Arc System Works! Choose among six karts and twelve exciting tracks to race your way to win.  i2010kAksys GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00405na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002100005264002400026300002300050500012400073542003100197655002500228655003000253WFKJ00aOkiraku Kart Wii 1bAksys Gamesc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aFamily Go-Kart Racing from Arc System Works! Choose among six karts and twelve exciting tracks to race your way to win.  i2014kAksys GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00523na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001300005264002400018300002300042500029500065542002800360655002500388WFLE00aFluidity 1bNintendoc2010-12-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aFluidity combines an amazing physics engine that realistically models flowing water with innovative puzzle game play. Using the three forms of water – liquid, ice and cloud –players will solve challenging puzzles across multiple chapters of an illustrated magical book called Aquaticus.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00487na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001700005264002500022300002300047500025400070542002800324655002500352WFLP00aHydroventure 1bNintendoc2010-12-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake control of a body of water inside a magical book called the Aquaticus, where an evil force is 