05264002300051300002300074500039900097542003000496655002800526655003200554WKWJ00aItem Sagashi - Yousei to Fushigi no Shima 1bAteam Inc.c2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aWork together or compete in each stage to find the necessary items that will help the game’s hero find a way home. From seashells to sparkling jewels, do your best to find the hidden objects as fast as you can! During this adventure you will also confront ghosts and a dragon for some action stages. Lots of items for each stage and lots of excitement can be found in this hidden object game!  i2014kAteam Inc.sGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aHidden object games2wiiext00715na  a2200121   4500001000500000245005000005264002600055300002300081500039900104542003000503655002800533655003200561WKWP00aAdventure on Lost Island - Hidden Object Game 1bAteam Inc.c2010-9-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aWork together or compete in each stage to find the necessary items that will help the game’s hero find a way home. From seashells to sparkling jewels, do your best to find the hidden objects as fast as you can! During this adventure you will also confront ghosts and a dragon for some action stages. Lots of items for each stage and lots of excitement can be found in this hidden object game!  i2010kAteam Inc.sGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aHidden object games2wiiext00391na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003300005264003900038300002300077500011300100542004300213655002500256WL2E00aTarget Toss Pro - Lawn Darts 1bIncredible Technologiesc2010-9-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aTarget Toss Pro: Lawn Darts is a new WiiWare game based on one of the nation's most infamous backyard games.  i2010kIncredible TechnologiessGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext01036na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002400005264002700029300002300056500079200079542003000871655002500901WL5E00aHB Arcade Disc Golf 1bHB Studiosc2010-11-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aHB Arcade Disc Golf recreates the popular disc-flinging sport in the comfort of your own living room. Playing the game is as easy as tossing a disc around on a beautiful day. The goal of the game is to put the disc in the basket in the fewest amount of throws possible. Disc golfers have three different types of discs at their disposal when out on the course: a driver, a mid-range disc, and a putter. Also, there are three different types of throw available: forehand, backhand, and the hammer throw. The forehand and backhand throws change based on the handedness of the player, and can be used to draw or fade a shot, while the hammer throw is less about distance and more about height. At the end of the round, scores are tallied, and the player with the lowest score is the winner.  i2010kHB StudiossGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00694na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002800005264003500033300002300068500042000091542004000511655003300551WL9E00aLet's Create! - Pottery 1bInfinite Dreams Inc.c2012-7-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aThrow the clay on the wheel, release all your artistic talents and take benefit of dozens of materials available in order to create your own design! Even when you glaze and fire your very first pot you will feel accomplished and relaxed as pottery is the best way to relieve your everyday stress and find your inner peace. An amazing, therapeutic and uplifting experience you can enjoy with your family and friends!  i2012kInfinite Dreams Inc.sGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00347na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002300005264002500028300002300053500010700076542003000183655002400213WLCE00aBingo Party Deluxe 1bAteam Inc.c2011-5-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe ultimate BINGO game collection! Includes classic BINGO games and an exciting new BINGO PARTY mode.  i2011kAteam Inc.sGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00347na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002500005264002300030300002300053500010700076542003000183655002400213WLCJ00aWai Wai Bingo Deluxe 1bAteam Inc.c2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe ultimate BINGO game collection! Includes classic BINGO games and an exciting new BINGO PARTY mode.  i2014kAteam Inc.sGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00348na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002300005264002600028300002300054500010700077542003000184655002400214WLCP00aBingo Party Deluxe 1bAteam Inc.c2011-3-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe ultimate BINGO game collection! Includes classic BINGO games and an exciting new BINGO PARTY mode.  i2011kAteam Inc.sGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00191na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002900005264001300034300002300047500000500070542001800075WLDJ00aBokumo Sekai wo Sukuitai 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00780na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004200005264003300047300002300080500046100103542003600564655002500600655003300625WLEE00aLearning with The PooYoos - Episode 1 1bLexis Numériquec2009-11-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aLearning with the PooYoos Episode 1 is the first preschool brain trainer for children aged 3 to 6, and is available to download via the Wii Shop Channel. Set in a unique, original, funny and poetic universe, Learning with the PooYoos Episode 1 is a WiiWare title that lets children learn in a very exciting way. Shapes, colors, space orientation and coordination are used as the gameplay introduces youngsters to letters, numbers and more in a fun setting.  i2009kLexis NumériquesGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00767na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003300005264002900038300002300067500046100090542003600551655002500587655003300612WLEJ00aPooYoo to Asobou - Episode 1 1bLexis Numériquec2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aLearning with the PooYoos Episode 1 is the first preschool brain trainer for children aged 3 to 6, and is available to download via the Wii Shop Channel. Set in a unique, original, funny and poetic universe, Learning with the PooYoos Episode 1 is a WiiWare title that lets children learn in a very exciting way. Shapes, colors, space orientation and coordination are used as the gameplay introduces youngsters to letters, numbers and more in a fun setting.  i2014kLexis NumériquesGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00777na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004000005264003200045300002300077500046100100542003600561655002500597655003300622WLEP00aLearning with The PooYoos Episode 1 1bLexis Numériquec2009-9-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aLearning with the PooYoos Episode 1 is the first preschool brain trainer for children aged 3 to 6, and is available to download via the Wii Shop Channel. Set in a unique, original, funny and poetic universe, Learning with the PooYoos Episode 1 is a WiiWare title that lets children learn in a very exciting way. Shapes, colors, space orientation and coordination are used as the gameplay introduces youngsters to letters, numbers and more in a fun setting.  i2009kLexis NumériquesGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00315na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002600025300002300051500007800074542003000152655002300182WLGE00aHB Arcade Cards 1bHB Studiosc2009-7-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aHB Arcade Cards is a great collection of fun and easy-to-play card games.  i2009kHB StudiossGameTDB 7aCard games2wiiext00817na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001100005264003100016300002300047500053800070542003500608655002700643655002500670WLIE00aLiight 1bStudio Walljumpc2011-3-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe wait is over! Liight is a unique, award winning puzzle solving game from independent developer Studio Walljump where you use colored lights and shadows to solve puzzles and make music. Each puzzle in Liight is a unique combination of colored lights and targets arranged on a special board. If you completely cover a target with light of the matching color, the target will glow and play music. A puzzle is solved when all the targets are glowing and playing music together. Every puzzle makes a different song each time you play!  i2011kStudio WalljumpsGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00211na  a2200097   4500001000500000245004900005264001300054300002300067500000500090542001800095WLJJ00aBokumo Sekai wo Sukuitai - Battle Tournament 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00541na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002800005264002700033300002300060500032900083542003100412WLKJ00aLicca-chan Oshare House 1bTakara Tomyc2009-6-30  a1 Wii optical disc  a"Licca-chan", which is very popular with girls, is now available in WiiWare! You can enjoy mini games with daddies and moms and change clothes for Licca. You can get fashion items such as Licca's clothes and shoes by playing the mini game. Collect fashion items and dress up Licca-chan! You can also listen to Licca's phone.  i2009kTakara TomysGameTDB00353na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003400005264003500039300002300074500008100097542003800178655002700216WLLE00aLittle Tournament Over Yonder 1bGevo Entertainmentc2009-11-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aBe the master of strategy. Be the ultimate fighter. Be the complete warrior!  i2009kGevo EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext00722na  a2200133   4500001000500000245003400005264003500039300002300074500037400097542003800471655002500509655002700534655002700561WLLP00aLittle Tournament Over Yonder 1bGevo Entertainmentc2009-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aEnter the world of Little Tournament Over Yonder. Play as a young Prince or Princess leading your team through numerous battles. Plan and deploy your units to gain strategic advantages. Launch real-time battles between units and fight hard, fight fast, fight smart. Build your team, hire new units with different powers; groom them with battle experience to gain level.  i2009kGevo EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiie