03000600655002500630655002800655655002500683WLTJ00aSchool of Darkness 1bWayForwardc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aLIT is a 3D horror action puzzle game that follows Jake - a typical apathetic teenager, who’s trapped in his high school when it’s overrun by dark creatures. Players must guide Jake through 30 unique classrooms, using the available light sources to create paths to each exit. The goal is to reunite Jake with his girlfriend Rachael, who’s also trapped in the school and calls Jake from time to time on the school’s phone system. Stay in the light and Jake’s safe. Step into the darkness and he’s pulled under.  i2014kWayForwardsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00857na  a2200133   4500001000500000245000800005264004000013300002300053500052600076542004300602655002500645655002800670655002500698WLTP00aLIT 1bWayForward Technologiesc2009-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aLIT is a 3D horror action puzzle game that follows Jake - a typical apathetic teenager, who’s trapped in his high school when it’s overrun by dark creatures. Players must guide Jake through 30 unique classrooms, using the available light sources to create paths to each exit. The goal is to reunite Jake with his girlfriend Rachael, who’s also trapped in the school and calls Jake from time to time on the school’s phone system. Stay in the light and Jake’s safe. Step into the darkness and he’s pulled under.  i2009kWayForward TechnologiessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00693na  a2200145   4500001000500000245001400005264003700019300002300056500032200079542004100401655002500442655002800467655002700495655002500522WLWE00aLostWinds 1bFrontier Developmentsc2008-5-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aLostWinds is a fresh, enchanting adventure that lets you wield the awesome powers of Enril the wind Spirit - from raging tornados to the gentlest breeze – to guide and protect Toku, a y