!  i2008kHUDSON SOFTsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00484na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003400005264002400039300002300063500023200086542003100318655002500349WM8J00aWi-Fi 8 Hito Battle Bomberman 1bHudson Softc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aA brand new addition to the "Bomberman" series is available on WiiWare! Up to 8 players can battle online at once via Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection! Simple controls make this a great game for family and friends to enjoy at anytime!  i2014kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00556na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002000005264005000025300002300075500023200098542005400330655002500384655002500409WM8P00aBomberman Blast 1bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2008-9-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aA brand new addition to the "Bomberman" series is available on WiiWare! Up to 8 players can battle online at once via Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection! Simple controls make this a great game for family and friends to enjoy at anytime!  i2008kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00361na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002500025300002300050500012300073542003000196655002500226WM9E00aHappy Hammerin' 1bGAMEBRIDGEc2010-3-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aSwing the Wii Remote like a hammer and bash little moles. Compete with friends and family in this exciting party game.  i2010kGAMEBRIDGEsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00409na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002100005264001900026300002300045500014300068542002600211655002500237655002500262WM9J00aTataite! Mogupon 1bAgendac2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aHappy Hammerin’ is a fun-packed, mole-whacking party game with a variety of modes suitable for single players, friends and family alike.  i2014kAgendasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00418na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002000005264002500025300002300050500014300073542003000216655002500246655002500271WM9P00aHappy Hammerin' 1bGamebridgec2010-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aHappy Hammerin’ is a fun-packed, mole-whacking party game with a variety of modes suitable for single players, friends and family alike.  i2010kGamebridgesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00465na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001300005264002300018300002300041500023900064542002700303655002500330WMAE00aMagnetis 1bYullabyc2009-12-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aMagnetis is all about attraction! Connect magnets together to create series of electric explosions. This frenetic puzzle game forces you to think fast and anticipate future connections to create chain-reactionss and score more points!  i2009kYullabysGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00304na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001300005264002300018300002300041500004100064542002700105655002500132655002500157WMAP00aMagnetis 1bYullabyc2009-9-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMagnetis™ is all about attraction!  i2009kYullabysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00388na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002100005264002500026300002300051500011400074542002800188655002500216655002500241WMBE00aMaboshi's Arcade 1bNintendoc2008-12-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aAim for a million points in three shape-based games. Watch as actions of one player impact the other players!  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00593na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003900005264002100044300002300065500030500088542002800393655002500421655002500446WMBJ00aKatachi no Game - Maru Bou Shikaku 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis unique arcade action title features three games in one, based on three classic shapes: circle, bar and square. There are three game windows on screen at the same time, allowing for three people to play different games simultaneously. But there is a twist – each game impacts the other players!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00594na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003700005264002400042300002300066500030500089542002800394655002500422655002500447WMBP00aMaBoShi - The Three Shape Arcade 1bNintendoc2008-8-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis unique arcade action title features three games in one, based on three classic shapes: circle, bar and square. There are three game windows on screen at the same time, allowing for three people to play different games simultaneously. But there is a twist – each game impacts the other players!  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00415na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004400005264002200049300002300071500012300094542002600217655002500243655002500268WMCE02aA Monsteca Corral - Monsters vs. Robots 1bOntecac2010-8-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aNo longer is planet Monsteca the harmonious world it once was—overrun by a robotic army set out to rule and conquer.  i2010kOntecasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00730na  a2200145   4500001000500000245004300005264002200048300002300070500036000093542002600453655002500479655002800504655002700532655002500559WMCP02aA Monsteca Corral: Monsters vs. Robots 1bOntecac2010-8-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aNo longer is the planet Monsteca the harmonious world it once was, overrun by a robotic army set out to rule and conquer. Monsteca natives, the Stompies, have no choice but to run or be captured. Unable to defend themselves against such heavy machinery, the Stompies must rely on the strength of their herd to work together and defeat the meddling robots.  i2010kOntecasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00313na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001300005264003000018300002300048500007300071542003400144655002500178WMDE00aMadStone 1bRiverman Mediac2008-10-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aRelentless puzzle action explodes in an earth-shaking confrontation!  i2008kRiverman MediasGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00300na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001500005264002600020300002300046500003000069542003000099655002500129655002400154WMGE00aMart Racer 1bJoju Gamesc2009-9-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aSupermarket drifting fun!  i2009kJoju GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00336na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001600005264003000021300002300051500009300074542003400167655002500201WMHE00aMouse House 1bBig John Gamesc2010-2-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aLead a lively little mouse on his hunt to collect the cheese in 100 challenging puzzles!  i2010kBig John GamessGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00717na  a2200133   4500001000500000245003600005264003100041300002300072500037300095542003500468655002500503655002800528655002700556WMJE00aDive - The Medes Islands Secret 1bCosmonaut Gamesc2010-7-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aOver the past five centuries, hundreds of ships flying every ensign have succumbed to the power of the ocean. Merchant boats, pirate ships, navy vessels...all of them have ended up covered with coral at the bottom of the oceans around the planet. But all of them guarded secrets that remained hidden over the years. Secrets that have always been a mystery...until now.  i2010kCosmonaut GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00596na  a2200133   4500001000500000245003600005264003100041300002300072500025200095542003500347655002500382655002800407655002700435WMJP00aDive - The Medes Islands Secret 1bCosmonaut Gamesc2010-7-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aOver the past five centuries, hundreds of ships flying every ensign have succumbed to the power of the ocean. Merchant boats, pirate ships, navy vessels... all of them have ended up covered with coral at the bottom of the oceans around the planet.  i2010kCosmonaut GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00369na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002900027300002300056500007700079542003400156655002800190655002900218WMKE00aLead the Meerkats 1bLapland Studioc2010-6-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Lead the Meerkats you are a meerkat and you have a lot to accomplish.  i2010kLapland StudiosGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00547na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002200005264003000027300002300057500021500080542003400295655002800329655002900357655002700386WMKP00aLead the Meerkats 1bLapland Studioc2010-5-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Lead the Meerkats you are a young meerkat and you have a lot to accomplish.You have been separated from your pack and the time has come for you to form your own meerkat pack. Are you ready for the challenge?  i2010kLapland StudiosGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00963na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003500005264002300040300002300063500071500086542002700801655002500828WMLE00aMajor League Eating - The Game 1bMastiffc2008-7-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe ultimate chomp-off is about to begin. Grab your Wii Remote controller and dig into 12 different foods as you compete against the greatest major-league eaters in the world. This isn't just a race to stuff your face-you'll need strategy to master a smorgasbord of digestive attacks, defenses and counters. These include the Mega Burp, Gas Attack, Antacid and more. And don't forget to keep an eye on your Barf-O-Meter, because if the food hits the plate twice, you're out. Unlock more than 10 characters in single-player career mode, go gut-to-gut against your friends in versus mode, or compete online using Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection. Online play supports friend codes, random matchmaking and leader boards.  i2008kMastiffsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00962na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003500005264002200040300002300062500071500085542002700800655002500827WMLJ00aMajor League Eating - The Game 1bWarashic2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe ultimate chomp-off is about to begin. Grab your Wii Remote controller and dig into 12 different foods as you compete against the greatest major-league eaters in the world. This isn't just a race to stuff your face-you'll need strategy to master a smorgasbord of digestive attacks, defenses and counters. These include the Mega Burp, Gas Attack, Antacid and more. And don't forget to keep an eye on your Barf-O-Meter, because if the food hits the plate twice, you're out. Unlock more than 10 characters in single-player career mode, go gut-to-gut against your friends in versus mode, or compete online using Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection. Online play supports friend codes, random matchmaking and leader boards.  i2014kWarashisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00322na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001700005264004700022300002300069500004400092542005100136655002500187WMME00aMuscle March 1bNAMCO BANDAI Games America Inc.c2010-1-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aAll Muscle. All Marching. All the Time!  i2010kNAMCO BANDAI Games America Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00777na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002400005264003100029300002300060500052100083542003800604655002500642WMMJ00aMuscle Koushinkyoku 1bNAMCO BANDAI Gamesc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aMuscle March is a quirky Japanese action game stuffed full of macho bodybuilders. The all mighty protein powder has been stolen so it’s up to Tony and his muscle-bound crew to catch the thieves. Choose from a variety of perfectly molded superstars and bring these terrible villains to justice. As each thief attempts their escape, they will smash through walls while making a variety of poses. You must match these poses to fit through the holes and catch up to the thieves. The protein powder will be yours again!  i2014kNAMCO BANDAI GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00773na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001700005264003400022300002300056500052100079542003800600655002500638WMMP00aMuscle March 1bNAMCO BANDAI Gamesc2010-3-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aMuscle March is a quirky Japanese action game stuffed full of macho bodybuilders. The all mighty protein powder has been stolen so it’s up to Tony and his muscle-bound crew to catch the thieves. Choose from a variety of perfectly molded superstars and bring these terrible villains to justice. As each thief attempts their escape, they will smash through walls while making a variety of poses. You must match these poses to fit through the holes and catch up to the thieves. The protein powder will be yours again!  i2010kNAMCO BANDAI GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00278na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001400005264002400019300002300043500005000066542002700116655002500143WMOE00aMoki Moki 1bNatsumec2009-12-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's a mind-bending, gravity-defying puzzler!  i2009kNatsumesGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00398na  a2200133   4500001000500000245005200005264002500057300002300082500005000105542003200155655002500187655002700212655002500239WMOJ00aAnata ga Mawashite Sukuu Puzzle - Mochi Mochi Q 1bNatsume Inc.c2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's a mind-bending, gravity-defying puzzler!  i2014kNatsume Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00364na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001400005264002900019300002300048500005000071542003200121655002500153655002700178655002500205WMOP00aMoki Moki 1bNatsume Inc.c2009-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's a mind-bending, gravity-defying puzzler!  i2009kNatsume Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00200na  a2200097   4500001000500000245003800005264001300043300002300056500000500079542001800084WMPJ00aKotoba no Puzzle - Mojipittan Wii 1bc2019--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2019sGameTDB00758na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002600027300002300053500051600076542003100592655002500623WMRE00aMonochrome Racing 1bNordcurrentc2011-8-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aScreeching tires, the smell of burned rubber, the rush of adrenaline and enemies that are left in the dust – these are the emotions that drive real racers. However there is much more than this in the world of Monochrome Racing – there is the passion for color! Color is everything here, it is what you strive for, in the world where everything is in black and white. Color is your fuel, color gives you speed, color makes you stronger and ultimately makes you the true leader of the monochrome racing world.  i2011kNordcurrentsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00839na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002200005264002600027300002300053500052300076542003100599655002500630655002500655655002500680WMRP00aMonochrome Racing 1bNordcurrentc2011-8-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aScreeching tyres, the smell of burning rubber, the rush of adrenaline and enemies that are left in the dust – these are the sensations that drive real racers. However, there is much more than this in the world of Monochrome Racing – there is the passion for colour! Colour is everything here, it is what you strive for, in a world where everything is in black and white. Colour is your fuel, colour gives you speed, colour makes you stronger and ultimately makes you the true leader of the monochrome racing world.  i2011kNordcurrentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00365na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002400005264002500029300002300054500012300077542003000200655002500230WMSE00aEnjoy your Massage! 1bMicroforumc2010-8-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou've just been hired as an apprentice masseur of Giselle's beauty farm. Learn new massage combinations and try them!  i2010kMicroforumsGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00464na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002400005264002700029300002300056500021600079542003000295655002900325WMSP00aEnjoy Your Massage! 1bMicroforumc2010-11-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aCongratulations! You have just been hired as an apprentice masseur at Giselle's beauty farm, one of the most famous in the city. Learn new relaxing massage combinations and apply them on your stressed customers!  i2010kMicroforumsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00356na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001800005264003000023300002300053500010400076542003300180655003300213WMWP00aMiffy's World 1bPAN Vision ABc2010-10-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the iconic Miffy and perform quests and solve puzzles by exploring Miffy’s World on WiiWare.  i2010kPAN Vision ABsGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00356na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001800005264003000023300002300053500010400076542003300180655003300213WMWX00aMiffy's World 1bPAN Vision ABc2010-10-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the iconic Miffy and perform quests and solve puzzles by exploring Miffy’s World on WiiWare.  i2010kPAN Vision ABsGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00392na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002700005264002500032300002300057500007100080542003000151655002500181655002700206655002500233WMXE00aMax & the Magic Marker 1bPress Playc2010-3-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aDid you ever dream your drawings were real? In this game they are!  i2010kPress PlaysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00889na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002700005264002300032300002300055500057000078542003000648655002500678655002700703655002500730WMXJ00aMax & the Magic Marker 1bPress Playc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aMax is a young boy, and like most boys he loves to draw. One day he gets a mysterious marker in the mail. There is no letter attached – only the plain orange marker. Max decides to test it right away, sits down and starts drawing. He draws a monster but as soon as he finishes the lines on the paper start moving and to Max’s great surprise the monster runs off the paper and into another drawing. Max realizes that he has to stop the monster, so he draws himself on the same drawing that the monster is in and immediately finds himself inside the drawing……  i2014kPress PlaysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00892na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002700005264002600032300002300058500057000081542003000651655002500681655002700706655002500733WMXP00aMax & the Magic Marker 1bPress Playc2010-1-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aMax is a young boy, and like most boys he loves to draw. One day he gets a mysterious marker in the mail. There is no letter attached – only the plain orange marker. Max decides to test it right away, sits down and starts drawing. He draws a monster but as soon as he finishes the lines on the paper start moving and to Max’s great surprise the monster runs off the paper and into another drawing. Max realizes that he has to stop the monster, so he draws himself on the same drawing that the monster is in and immediately finds himself inside the drawing……  i2010kPress PlaysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00641na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001200005264002200017300002300039500038200062542002600444655002400470655002500494WMZP00aMahjong 1bGameOnc2009-12-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aMahjong features 30 layouts of the traditional tile-matching game in 3D, each with millions of different shuffles to play. The game's style and interface has been designed for easy intuitive operation with the Wii Remote™ controller - zooming is possible with the push of a button. The graphics can be customized with six fabulous tile-sets and a wide variety of backgrounds.  i2009kGameOnsGameTDB 7aBoard games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00846na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003200005264002700037300002300064500059100087542003100678655002700709WN9E00aMilitary Madness - Nectaris 1bHudson Softc2010-4-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Military is back for a new generation of recruits! The classic turn-based strategy series Military Madness, a.k.a. Nectaris, is exploding onto WiiWare with a platoon of new features. Coordinate strategies or taunt foes in team or vs. multiplayer modes for up to 4 people, offline or online. Customise the all-new commander unit by selecting from 20 unique abilities as it leads your forces in multiplayer. Command respect as you increase your rank as you march up the leaderboards on your mission to prove you’re the top general around. This is the maddest game in the series yet!  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext00867na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001300005264002600018300002300044500059100067542003100658655002900689655002700718WN9J00aNectaris 1bHudson Softc2010-2-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Military is back for a new generation of recruits! The classic turn-based strategy series Military Madness, a.k.a. Nectaris, is exploding onto WiiWare with a platoon of new features. Coordinate strategies or taunt foes in team or vs. multiplayer modes for up to 4 people, offline or online. Customise the all-new commander unit by selecting from 20 unique abilities as it leads your forces in multiplayer. Command respect as you increase your rank as you march up the leaderboards on your mission to prove you’re the top general around. This is the maddest game in the series yet!  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00932na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003100005264005000036300002300086500059100109542005400700655002900754655002700783WN9P00aMilitary Madness: Nectaris 1bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2010-3-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Military is back for a new generation of recruits! The classic turn-based strategy series Military Madness, a.k.a. Nectaris, is exploding onto WiiWare with a platoon of new features. Coordinate strategies or taunt foes in team or vs. multiplayer modes for up to 4 people, offline or online. Customise the all-new commander unit by selecting from 20 unique abilities as it leads your forces in multiplayer. Command respect as you increase your rank as you march up the leaderboards on your mission to prove you’re the top general around. This is the maddest game in the series yet!  i2010kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00781na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001900005264002300024300002300047500055000070542002700620655002400647WNAP00aBack to Nature 1bUFA Labc2012-11-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to the farm in the forest! Help Gert the cockerel, Bla the donkey, Rosi the pig and Susi the sheep to help find their friend Tom the cat. He has probably lost his way in the forest! The four friends set off and experience a number of different adventures along the way. They need your help and that of the bear, the master of the forest, to overcome obstacles to find Tom. They arrive at an abandoned house, have to repair a boat, catch fish, prepare wood, make a fireplace and cook their dinner. Can you help them find their friend Tom?  i2012kUFA LabsGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00785na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004600005264003600051300002300087500046100110542004100571655002700612655002400639WNEE00aPenguins & Friends - Hey! That's My Fish! 1bGammick Entertainmentc2009-5-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou can become the fishing king! The penguins are hungry and need your help to feed themselves. Catch all the fish you can before someone steals them from you! Strategy is fundamental in this exciting game. Keep moving ahead of the other penguins so that you don’t get trapped, and try to get to the ice floes that hold more fish. Between one and four players can play “Penguins & Friends” at the same time—providing they can handle the polar cold.