02300041500032500064542003000389655002500419655002700444WOTJ00aOverturn 1bGamebridgec2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aOverturn: Mecha Wars is a tournament-based game where two challengers go head-to-head. The tournament consists of six classes: Rookie, Novice, Elite, Ace, Grand and Master classes. Games take place within closed battlefields with the contestants controlling futuristic machines equipped with a host of high tech weapons.  i2014kGamebridgesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00596na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001300005264002600018300002300044500032500067542003000392655002500422655002700447WOTP00aOverturn 1bGamebridgec2010-2-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aOverturn: Mecha Wars is a tournament-based game where two challengers go head-to-head. The tournament consists of six classes: Rookie, Novice, Elite, Ace, Grand and Master classes. Games take place within closed battlefields with the contestants controlling futuristic machines equipped with a host of high tech weapons.  i2010kGamebridgesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00187na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002500005264001300030300002300043500000500066542001800071WOXJ00aOsu! Exercise Doujou 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00354na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001400005264002100019300002300040500009100063542002500154655002500179655002800204WOYE00aBit Boy!! 1bBplusc2009-7-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet ready for the most spectacular journey through time in the history of videogames!!  i2009kBplussGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00351na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001400005264001800019300002300037500009100060542002500151655002500176655002800201WOYJ00aBit Man!! 1bBplusc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet ready for the most spectacular journey through time in the history of videogames!!  i2014kBplussGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00353na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001400005264002000019300002300039500009100062542002500153655002500178655002800203WOYP00aBit Boy!! 1bBplusc2009-7-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet ready for the most spectacular journey through time in the history of videogames!!  i2009kBplussGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00206na  a2200097   4500001000500000245004400005264001300049300002300062500000500085542001800090WOZJ00aKodomo Kyouiku Terebi Wii - Aiue Oumuzu 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00749na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001500005264003300020300002300053500050100076542003700577655002500614WP2E00aPotpourrii 1bAbstraction Gamesc2008-9-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the puzzle game Potpourrii, everything revolves around the seasons. For centuries, the seasons have followed a set pattern. But then things start to go awry in the forest. Suddenly it's snowing while the sun shines and flowers bloom while leaves are falling. Then a strange purple goo appears. The leprechauns are stunned. Even worse, the magic oak of life loses its power. It all turns out to be the fault of an evil wizard. You must help the leprechauns defeat him and restore natural order.  i2008kAbstraction GamessGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00361na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001500005264003400020300002300054500007500077542003700152655002500189655002500214WP2P00aPotpourrii 1bAbstraction Gamesc2008-10-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the puzzle game Potpourrii, everything revolves around the seasons.  i2008kAbstraction GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00997na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004600005264003700051300002300088500065800111542004100769655002900810655003600839WP3P00aPearl Harbor - Episode 1 - Red Sun Rising 1bLegendo Entertainmentc2010-7-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aPearl Harbor Trilogy - 1941: Red Sun Rising is the first title in a trilogy of air-combat action games for the WiiWare service. Take off from aircraft carrier decks and historic military bases as you conduct covert strikes, engage in furious dogfights and fly search-and-destroy missions. Pilot the most prolific fighter, bomber and torpedo-bearing aircraft of the World War II Pacific Theatre. Featuring two campaigns spanning the early years of the Pacific War, you can play as the United States Naval Air Force or the Imperial Japanese Navy Air Force. You can also choose to practice your combat skills in the Avenging Ace or Survival dogfight modes.  i2010kLegendo EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFlight simulation games2wiiext00419na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004200005264003100047300002300078500010300101542003500204655002500239655003300264WP4E00aLearning with The PooYoos - Episode 3 1bLexis Numeriquec2010-10-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to the world of the PooYoos, the first fun poetic braintrainer for children 3-6 years old.  i2010kLexis NumeriquesGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00419na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004000005264003200045300002300077500010300100542003600203655002500239655003300264WP4P00aLearning with The PooYoos Episode 3 1bLexis Numériquec2010-10-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to the world of the PooYoos, the first fun poetic braintrainer for children 3-6 years old.  i2010kLexis NumériquesGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00234na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002100025300002300046500000500069542002500074655002500099WP5J00aPokosuka Racing 1bRECOMc2010-3-16  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2010kRECOMsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00224na  a2200097   4500001000500000245006200005264001300067300002300080500000500103542001800108WP6J00aBoku wa Plarail Untenshi - Shinkansen & Joukikikansha Hen 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00379na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001900005264002800024300002300052500013400075542003100209655002900240WP7E00aMy Planetarium 1bHudson Softc2010-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aMy Planetarium is a game that allows you to observe celestial bodies from the comfort of your TV using the Wii Remote controller.  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00352na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001600005264001900021300002300040500012400063542002600187655002900213WP7J00aPlanetarium 1bHudsonc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aMy Starry Night is a game that allows you to observe celestial bodies from the comfort of your TV using the Wii Remote.  i2014kHudsonsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00360na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002300025300002300048500012400071542002600195655002900221WP7P00aMy Starry Night 1bHudsonc2010-10-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aMy Starry Night is a game that allows you to observe celestial bodies from the comfort of your TV using the Wii Remote.  i2010kHudsonsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00177na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001500005264001300020300002300033500000500056542001800061WP9J00aPokers Wii 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00286na  a2200109   4500001000500000245006100005264002300066300002300089500000500112542002800117655003100145WPAJ00aPokémon Fushigi no Dungeon - Ikuzo! Arashi no Boukendan 1bNintendoc2009-8-4  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00400na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001400005264003500019300002300054500007600077542004000153655002500193655002400218655002400242WPBE00aPub Darts 1bBig Blue Bubble Inc.c2010-1-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aSee who has nerves of steel and the accuracy of a champion dart player.  i2010kBig Blue Bubble Inc.sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aDarts games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00843na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001400005264003500019300002300054500055500077542004000632655002500672655002400697WPBP00aPub Darts 1bBig Blue Bubble Inc.c2010-5-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aPub Darts is a simple darts simulation which uses the Wii Remote's unique features to let you mimic a dart throwing motion. The game is set in a local pub where the players will settle in to play some of their favourite dart games including 501, Cricket, Around the Clock, Killer, and Baseball. Controls function just like throwing a real dart and players are able to create their own personal profiles; selecting their avatar image from a collection of creative characters and also selecting the design they would like displayed on the dart flights.  i2010kBig Blue Bubble Inc.sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aDarts games2wiiext00912na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002800005264002500033300002300058500063100081542002800712655002500740655002500765WPCE00aDoc Louis's Punch-Out!! 1bNintendoc2009-10-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aDoc Louis's Punch-Out!! is a three-tier sampling of the Punch-Out!! gameplay, but with Doc Louis as your opponent. The game starts out in "Warm up" which is really just a clever way to say "Easy Mode." Here, the Punch-Out!! gameplay begins for the Novice – Doc telegraphs all his moves just like the Punch-Out!! opponents, but since he's on your side he actually tells you what to do with verbal commands. "Duck this one!" "Block this!" "Dodge!" He'll get roughed up, showing physical damage as you beat him up throughout the three rounds. There are no TKOs as Doc will stop the fight after being whittled down to no health.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext00563na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003600005264001900041300002300060500028200083542002400365655002500389655002700414WPDJ00aChindouchuu!! Paul no Daibouken 1bSegac2009-2-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is a parody of platforming games and videogames in general. It's full of secrets, jokes and try&error-traps that aren't meant to be serious. Old-school gameplay and audiovisuals make this a charming title and for only 500 Wii Points many are really curious about this one!  i2009kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00286na  a2200109   4500001000500000245006100005264002300066300002300089500000500112542002800117655003100145WPFJ00aPokémon Fushigi no Dungeon - Susume! Honou no Boukendan 1bNintendoc2009-8-4  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00384na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264001700023300002300040500012200063542001800185655002900203655003000232WPGE00aSnowpack Park 1bc2010-11-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aBring penguins back to the safety of Snowpack Park. Play games with them, pet them, and feed them so they stay happy!  i2010sGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00379na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264001300022300002300035500012200058542001800180655002900198655003000227WPGJ00aPenguin Life 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aBring penguins back to the safety of Snowpack Park. Play games with them, pet them, and feed them so they stay happy!  i2014sGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00287na  a2200109   4500001000500000245006200005264002300067300002300090500000500113542002800118655003100146WPHJ00aPokémon Fushigi no Dungeon - Mezase! Hikari no Boukendan 1bNintendoc2009-8-4  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00324na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002700025300002300052500008300075542003100158655002500189WPIE00aPit Crew Panic! 1bHUDSON SOFTc2008-12-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aHelp your all-female pit crew fix the most bizarre things, like giant toilets!  i2008kHUDSON SOFTsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext01307na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002000005264002400025300002300049500099300072542003101065655002501096655002701121655002501148WPIJ00aPit Crew Panic! 1bHudson Softc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aA frantic action-packed game that unfolds on the racing circuit. During the game, the pit crew is not only faced with repairing vehicles, but various WHATSITs as well! Handling the WHATSIT repairs is a pit crew made up of legendary beauties! Simple Controls! Just grab a member of the crew with the Wii Remote's A Button, release the button when the Pointer is over the damaged PART, and that crew member will begin repairs. Assign repairs to the members of your team, and provide support using the Wii Remote to send a fully repaired WHATSIT out of the pit as quick as you can! The game features Normal Mode which can be played using one of two rules; an Abnormal Mode where players split into two teams and compete against each other; and a Ranking Mode where you compete with players around the world for the top record. Each mode can be played with a maximum of 4 Wii Remotes, allowing you to team up with friends and family. In short, your teamwork could lead to outstanding records!  i2014kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext01356na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002000005264005000025300002300075500099300098542005401091655002501145655002701170655002501197WPIP00aPit Crew Panic! 1bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2008-12-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aA frantic action-packed game that unfolds on the racing circuit. During the game, the pit crew is not only faced with repairing vehicles, but various WHATSITs as well! Handling the WHATSIT repairs is a pit crew made up of legendary beauties! Simple Controls! Just grab a member of the crew with the Wii Remote's A Button, release the button when the Pointer is over the damaged PART, and that crew member will begin repairs. Assign repairs to the members of your team, and provide support using the Wii Remote to send a fully repaired WHATSIT out of the pit as quick as you can! The game features Normal Mode which can be played using one of two rules; an Abnormal Mode where players split into two teams and compete against each other; and a Ranking Mode where you compete with players around the world for the top record. Each mode can be played with a maximum of 4 Wii Remotes, allowing you to team up with friends and family. In short, your teamwork could lead to outstanding records!  i2008kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00418na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264003400029300002300063500012000086542003800206655002500244655002700269WPJE00aPucca's Kisses Game 1bBigBen Interactivec2011-2-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aPucca has one great dream, to kiss her sweet Garu. But he does not have the slightest desire in the world to do so!  i2011kBigBen InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00583na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264003300029300002300062500028600085542003800371655002500409655002700434WPJP00aPucca's Kisses Game 1bBigben Interactivec2011-2-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aPucca has one great dream in her life, to kiss her sweet and tender Garu, the little Ninja, who does not have the slightest desire in the world to do so! But Pucca is a young lady who is as much in love as stubborn in her pursuit of Garu, truly determined to cover him with kisses.  i2011kBigben InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00351na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264002400029300002300053500007800076542002800154655002300182655002400205WPKE00aTexas Hold'em Poker 1bGameloftc2009-9-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aPrepare to experience the intensity of Texas Hold’Em poker tournaments!  i2009kGameloftsGameTDB 7aCard games2wiiext 7aPoker games2wiiext01290na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264002400029300002300053500101700076542002801093655002301121655002401144WPKP00aTexas Hold'em Poker 1bNintendoc2009-8-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aPrepare to experience the intensity of a real Texas Hold’em poker tournament! Whether you’re a poker novice or veteran, you’ll enjoy Tournament, Cash Game, and Heads-up mode with simple and fun Wii Remote controls. Hit the tables as one of 6 fun and charismatic characters, or import your own Mii to really put on your poker face. Take on the world’s most prestigious casinos - from Monaco to New York - and challenge opponents that won’t hesitate to taunt or comment on your playing style, creating a very realistic poker atmosphere! Or you can impress friends with wild poker parties thanks to an Online mode that allows you to play with up to 5 friends and create your own tournaments, in addition to joining official Gameloft tournaments. You can even challenge random online opponents of any skill level you want. Even if you’ve never played poker before, you can learn all the rules and strategy with the Advanced Tutorial that teaches you everything from winning hands and betting to bluffing.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aCard games2wiiext 7aPoker games2wiiext00387na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002000005264003600025300002300061500005200084542004000136655002500176655002700201655002500228WPLE00aPlanet Pachinko 1bAllied Kingdoms Inc.c2009-1-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aCan you survive the temples of Planet Pachinko?  i2009kAllied Kingdoms Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00177na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001500005264001300020300002300033500000500056542001800061WPNJ00aPonjan Wii 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00192na  a2200097   4500001000500000245003000005264001300035300002300048500000500071542001800076WPOJ00aPopple to Mahou no Crayon 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB01203na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264002700029300002300056500091500079542003100994655002501025655003101050WPPE00aFamily Table Tennis 1bAksys Gamesc2008-5-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's time for some good old family fun, and what's more fun than table tennis? Just like a real family, choose your character from a cast of four, which includes Daddy, Mommy, Sarah and Billy. There are four table tennis-tastic stages where it doesn't matter if you're an indoors or outdoors table-tennis player. Pick your poison from a gymnasium, a forest park, a beach or even an amusement park. Choose from Single or Versus mode, or select a minigame to play. In Versus mode, you and a friend can play against each other to see who is the better table-tennis player. And if Single and Versus modes aren't enough, select between three minigames, which include Target Table Tennis, Thrilling Table Tennis and Matching Table Tennis. The appealing cell-shaded graphics and endearing music, on top of the super-fun game play, will have you and your family playing from morning till night. Get your paddles ready.  i2008kAksys GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aTable tennis games2wiiext00362na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002600005264002200031300002300053500007900076542002900155655002500184655003100209WPPJ00aOkiraku Ping Pong Wii 1b505 Gamesc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aChallenge to Family Table Tennis in the slickest Ping Pong game available!  i2014k505 GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aTable tennis games2wiiext00363na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264002500029300002300054500007900077542002900156655002500185655003100210WPPP00aFamily Table Tennis 1b505 Gamesc2009-3-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aChallenge to Family Table Tennis in the slickest Ping Pong game available!  i2009k505 GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aTable tennis games2wiiext00340na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001500005264002200020300002300042500007500065542002700140655002500167655002600192