 cubes by firing matching colours from your launcher, but make sure your aim is as your thinking, or the Cubello will grow out of control.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00421na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002500025300002300050500018500073542002800258655002500286WPSE00aPokémon Rumble 1bNintendoc2009-11-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aAvailable exclusively for the WiiWare service, Pokémon Rumble is an action game in which you control Pokémon and take on wave after wave of other Pokémon in a variety of stages.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00549na  a2200133   4500001000500000245003000005264002100035300002300056500022900079542002800308655002500336655002700361655002700388WPSJ00aRansen! Pokémon Scramble 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aIntroducing a new kind of Pokémon challenge – exclusive to WiiWare! Pokémon Rumble is an action game in which you control Toy Pokémon and battle against waves of enemy Pokémon in order to be the last Pokémon standing!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00543na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002000005264002500025300002300050500022900073542002800302655002500330655002700355655002700382WPSP00aPokémon Rumble 1bNintendoc2009-11-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aIntroducing a new kind of Pokémon challenge – exclusive to WiiWare! Pokémon Rumble is an action game in which you control Toy Pokémon and battle against waves of enemy Pokémon in order to be the last Pokémon standing!  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext00527na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001800005264002400023300002300047500021900070542002800289655002500317655002600342655002500368WPTJ00aFantasic Cube 1bZOOM Incc2010-2-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aAfter FANTASIC TAMBOURINE this is now the second game in the FANTASIC-series. This is a variation of the Quarth puzzle/shooter genre and a good one at that, with it's own rules, a story mode and online multiplayer.  i2010kZOOM IncsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext01009na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002000027300002300047500077900070542002500849655002500874WPUE00aBust-a-Move Plus! 1bTaitoc2009-7-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aBUST-A-MOVE Plus! is a simple but hugely addictive puzzle game in which you must try to burst a multicolored mass of bubbles with your very own bubble launcher! Every time you make a group of three or more bubbles of the same color, they pop! There are two game modes available: 1P Puzzle, where players tackle the game’s 135 stages in pursuit of a new high score or best time; and Battle, in which players take on friends or computer-controlled opponents. And if all of that doesn’t satisfy your passion for popping, there are a total of 270 extra stages waiting for you in the two purchasable add-on-content packs! That’s 135 new stages per pack! BUST-A-MOVE Plus! is simple to get into and deep enough to keep you coming back for more, so what are you waiting for!?  i2009kTaitosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00695na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264001800027300002300045500046700068542002500535655002500560WPUJ00aPuzzle Bobble Wii 1bTaitoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a“PUZZLE BOBBLE Plus!” is a simple but hugely addictive puzzle game in which you must try to burst a multicoloured mass of bubbles with your very own bubble launcher! Every time you make a group of 3 or more bubbles of the same colour, they pop! There are 2 game modes available: 1P PUZZLE, where players tackle the game’s 135 stages in pursuit of a new high score or best time; and BATTLE, in which players take on friends or computer-controlled opponents.  i2014kTaitosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00700na  a2200109   450000100050000024500240000526400210002930000230005050004670007354200250054