r chef's hat on, sharpen your knives and turn the heat on the cooker up, because you have to show the entire world who the fastest, most skilful chef is.  i2008kVirtual ToyssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aCooking games2wiiext00593na  a2200133   4500001000500000245004400005264002200049300002300071500024600094542002600340655002800366655003200394655003300426WYSE00aYard Sale Hidden Treasures - Sunnyville 1bKonamic2010-6-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to the town of Sunnyville! Search local yard sales on your mission to find hidden treasures and objects. Use your fantastic finds to decorate your dream home in a competition to win the illustrious "Superstar Homes Magazine Contest!"  i2010kKonamisGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aHidden object games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00584na  a2200133   4500001000500000245004400005264002100049300002300070500024600093542002600339655002800365655003200393655002500425WYSP00aYard Sale Hidden Treasures - Sunnyville 1bKonamic2011-6-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to the town of Sunnyville! Search local yard sales on your mission to find hidden treasures and objects. Use your fantastic finds to decorate your dream home in a competition to win the illustrious "Superstar Homes Magazine Contest!"  i2011kKonamisGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aHidden object games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00330na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002900023300002300052500004600075542003400121655002500155655002800180WZAE00aZombii Attack 1bGamers Digitalc2012-1-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aZombii Attack is an arcade survival game.  i2012kGamers DigitalsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00592na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002700027300002300054500031100077542003100388655002500419655002600444WZBP00aCricket Challenge 1bGameshastrac2011-2-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aCricket Challenge is an arcade-style sports game that gives you a fun-filled experience while playing as a batsman in a game of cricket. Using the Wii Remote like a real cricket bat, you can swing and control the actions of a batsman to make him play strokes, hit boundaries, 6s and try a variety of shots.  i2011kGameshastrasGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aCricket games2wiiext00285na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001800005264003000023300002300053500003900076542003500115655002500150WZGE00aZoo Disc Golf 1bSonalysts, Inc.c2010-6-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhere the Animals Come Out to Play  i2010kSonalysts, Inc.sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00326na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001100005264002800016300002300044500004700067542003100114655002900145655003000174WZHE00aMy Zoo 1bHudson Softc2009-11-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aRaise exotic animals in your very own zoo!  i2009kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00525na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004300005264002400048300002300072500021800095542003100313655002900344655003000373WZHJ00aAnimal Life - Doubutsu Fureai Seikatsu 1bHudson Softc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a"My Zoo" is a relaxing animal sim that puts you in the shoes of an animal breeder, raising up animals you'd normally only dream of. All it takes is a Wii Remote for a simple, yet fulfilling connection with nature.  i2014kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aVirtual pet games2wiiext00543na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001100005264005100016300002300067500021800090542005400308655002900362655003000391WZHP00aMy Zoo 1bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2009-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  a"My Zoo" is a relaxing animal sim that puts you in the shoes of an animal breeder, raising up animals you'd normally only dream of. All it takes is a Wii Remote for a simple, yet fulfilling connection with nature.  i2009kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation 