 the WiiWare.This demo version includes three (3) songs for you to enjoy KARAOKE.  i2014kBrother InternationalsGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aKaraoke games2wiiext 7aDemos2wiiext00174na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001200005264001300017300002300030500000500053542001800058FA2J00aExerion 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00180na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001600005264001500021300002300036500000500059542001800064FA3J00aFormation Z 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00441na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001600005264002100021300002300042500021300065542002800278655002500306FA4J00aDevil World 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn this little-known action game from Mario creator Shigeru Miyamoto, you play heroic dragon Tamagon, who must defeat evil by collecting Boa-Boa Dots inside a maze and destroying enemies with his fire breath.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00445na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001600005264002500021300002300046500021300069542002800282655002500310FA4P00aDevil World 1bNintendoc2008-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn this little-known action game from Mario creator Shigeru Miyamoto, you play heroic dragon Tamagon, who must defeat evil by collecting Boa-Boa Dots inside a maze and destroying enemies with his fire breath.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00213na  a2200097   4500001000500000245005100005264001300056300002300069500000500092542001800097FA5J00aFire Emblem - Ankoku Ryuu to Hikari no Tsurugi 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00797na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002500005264002300030300002300053500055000076542002800626655003300654FA6E00aDonkey Kong Jr. Math 1bNintendoc2007-9-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aLearning can be fun, especially when you play along with Donkey Kong Jr.! Practice addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division by directing Junior, a cute little monkey who must climb up and down vines to collect numbers and math symbols to solve the math problems his father gives him. Compete with a friend in a race to solve problems in Game A or add more challenge with Game B. Of course, you can also practice on your own! This game is perfect for younger players who are looking for a fun and easy way to develop their math skills!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00479na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003600005264002300041300002300064500022100087542002800308655003300336FA6J00aDonkey Kong Jr. no Sansou Asobi 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin Donkey Kong Jr.™ for a maths lesson with a difference! In this educational NES game, swing and jump around the stage, collecting numbers and symbols to calculate the correct figure displayed by Donkey Kong™.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00469na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002500005264002400030300002300054500022100077542002800298655003300326FA6P00aDonkey Kong Jr. Math 1bNintendoc2007-4-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin Donkey Kong Jr.™ for a maths lesson with a difference! In this educational NES game, swing and jump around the stage, collecting numbers and symbols to calculate the correct figure displayed by Donkey Kong™.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext00783na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001000005264002300015300002300038500055900061542002800620655002500648FA7E00aYoshi 1bNintendoc2007-7-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aYoshi is an action/puzzle game starring Mario's dinosaur buddy Yoshi who has been imprisoned in an egg. Now it's raining Goombas, Bloopers, and Boo Buddies, and you have to help Mario stop the airborne invasion. As the critters fall, catch them on trays. Stack two of a kind and they both disappear, or capture the whole bunch in between eggshells. When the eggshells match, out hatches Yoshi and up goes your score! The action heats up as the characters fall faster and faster. To save the day, switch and shuffle, and don't let your piles get too high!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00401na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002300025300002300048500016700071542002800238655002500266FA7J00aYoshi no Tamago 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario & Yoshi™ is a fast-paced NES puzzle game in which you must mix and match falling characters and piece together eggshells to free the Yoshi trapped inside.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00400na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001800005264002400023300002300047500016700070542002800237655002500265FA7P00aMario & Yoshi 1bNintendoc2007-5-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario & Yoshi™ is a fast-paced NES puzzle game in which you must mix and match falling characters and piece together eggshells to free the Yoshi trapped inside.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00389na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001000005264002100015300002300036500016700059542002800226655002500254FA7T00aYoshi 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario & Yoshi™ is a fast-paced NES puzzle game in which you must mix and match falling characters and piece together eggshells to free the Yoshi trapped inside.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00438na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002400027300002300051500020100074542002800275655002500303FA8E00aKirby's Adventure 1bNintendoc2007-2-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aReleased in the later years of the NES, Kirby’s Adventure™ was a groundbreaking, graphically impressive platformer that famously introduced Kirby’s ability to copy the powers of his enemies.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00477na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002400027300002300051500020100074542002800275655002500303655002700328FA8F00aKirby's Adventure 1bNintendoc2007-2-16  a1 Wii optical disc