iext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext01087na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002100005264002000026300002300046500081800069542002500887655002500912655002800937FBJE00aMighty Bomb Jack 1bTecmoc2007-5-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aMighty Bomb Jack is an action/adventure game that was originally released for the Nintendo Entertainment System in 1987 by Tecmo. The hero of the game, Jack, must make his way through 16 levels of a pyramid in order to defeat the demon Belzebut and rescue the royal Pamera family. Each level is split into two parts; an action zone and a Royal Palace room. Action zones can be split up into several portions, and contain power-ups usually hidden in treasure chests such as money bags, Mighty Coins, and Mighty Drinks. Mighty Coins allow Jack to change colors; blue allows Jack to open orange treasure chests, orange allows him to open any treasure chest by simply touching it from the side, and green transforms all enemies on the screen into coins for 5 seconds. Mighty Drinks add 10 seconds to the game's timer.  i2007kTecmosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00568na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002100005264002000026300002300046500033900069542002500408655002500433FBJJ00aMighty Bomb Jack 1bTecmoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe great King Pamera, his Queen and the fair Princess have been kidnapped by the evil demon Belzebut and imprisoned in his cursed pyramid. Jack's elder brothers braved the pyramid to try and rescue them, but not one of them has returned since. Only Jack remains. He summons all his courage and steps forth into the pyramid himself...  i2014kTecmosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00569na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002100005264002100026300002300047500033900070542002500409655002500434FBJP00aMighty Bomb Jack 1bTecmoc2007-4-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe great King Pamera, his Queen and the fair Princess have been kidnapped by the evil demon Belzebut and imprisoned in his cursed pyramid. Jack's elder brothers braved the pyramid to try and rescue them, but not one of them has returned since. Only Jack remains. He summons all his courage and steps forth into the pyramid himself...  i2007kTecmosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00293na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003300005264002100038300002300059500005000082542002600132655002500158FBKE00aTeenage Mutant Ninja Turtles 1bKonamic2007-4-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aHeroes on the halfshell return to their roots  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00322na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002300005264002100028300002300049500005000072542002600122655002500148655002700173FBKJ00aGekikame Ninja Den 1bKonamic2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aHeroes on the halfshell return to their roots  i2014kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00333na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003300005264002200038300002300060500005000083542002600133655002500159655002700184FBKP00aTeenage Mutant Ninja Turtles 1bKonamic2007-3-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aHeroes on the halfshell return to their roots  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext01265na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001600005264005000021300002300071500094500094542005401039655002501093655002501118FBLE00aLode Runner 1bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2007-6-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis landmark action-puzzle game has been a worldwide fixture in video games from the moment of its inception until today, producing many sequels and related products along the way. The player controls the hero, or "Runner," who collects gold nuggets located around every stage, all the while avoiding capture by enemy robots. The action itself is simple, but the stages are designed as increasingly challenging puzzles, and none of the 50 stages is as easy as it seems. The Runner avoids enemies by digging holes in the floor to the right and left of his position-by doing this, he can clear a path to places that, at first glance, seem unreachable. Players must use their brains to collect all the gold nuggets in every puzzling stage if they want to escape to the next. In addition to normal play, this version of the game features an Edit Mode that allows players to design their own stages, adding a new level of enjoyment to the game.  i2007kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00474na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001600005264002600021300002300047500020100070542003100271655002500302655002500327FBLJ00aLode Runner 1bHudson Softc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis landmark action-puzzle game has been a worldwide fixture in video games from the moment of its inception through to the present day, producing many sequels and related products along the way!  i2014kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00475na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001600005264002700021300002300048500020100071542003100272655002500303655002500328FBLM00aLode Runner 1bHudson Softc2010-3-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis landmark action-puzzle game has been a worldwide fixture in video games from the moment of its inception through to the present day, producing many sequels and related products along the way!  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00886na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264002100022300002300043500062000066542002500686655002500711655002800736FBNE00aNinja Gaiden 1bTecmoc2007-5-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlayers take on the role of Ryu Hayabusa, a rising warrior in his family's clan whose main role in the world is to protect the Dark Dragon Blade from falling into the hands of evil. Ryu travels to America to seek vengeance for his father's death. Players fight their way through 14 challenging side-scrolling levels while defeating gangs of street thugs, battling evil ninjas and fighting barbarian bosses by using the deadly Dragon Sword, ninja skills and Ninpo (ninja magic). Players can run, crouch, jump and climb as they make their way through each stage and collect items to gain points, strength and weapons.  i2007kTecmosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00887na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002000005264002000025300002300045500062000068542002500688655002500713655002700738FBNJ00aNinja Ryukenden 1bTecmoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlayers take on the role of Ryu Hayabusa, a rising warrior in his family's clan whose main role in the world is to protect the Dark Dragon Blade from falling into the hands of evil. Ryu travels to America to seek vengeance for his father's death. Players fight their way through 14 challenging side-scrolling levels while defeating gangs of street thugs, battling evil ninjas and fighting barbarian bosses by using the deadly Dragon Sword, ninja skills and Ninpo (ninja magic). Players can run, crouch, jump and climb as they make their way through each stage and collect items to gain points, strength and weapons.  i2014kTecmosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00885na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264002100022300002300043500062000066542002500686655002500711655002700736FBNM00aNinja Gaiden 1bTecmoc2007-9-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlayers take on the role of Ryu Hayabusa, a rising warrior in his family's clan whose main role in the world is to protect the Dark Dragon Blade from falling into the hands of evil. Ryu travels to America to seek vengeance for his father's death. Players fight their way through 14 challenging side-scrolling levels while defeating gangs of street thugs, battling evil ninjas and fighting barbarian bosses by using the deadly Dragon Sword, ninja skills and Ninpo (ninja magic). Players can run, crouch, jump and climb as they make their way through each stage and collect items to gain points, strength and weapons.  i2007kTecmosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00196na  a2200097   4500001000500000245003200005264001500037300002300052500000500075542001800080FBOJ00aGradius II - Gofer no Yabou 1bc2012-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2012sGameTDB00180na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001800005264001300023300002300036500000500059542001800064FBQJ00aDruaga no Tou 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00427na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001100005264004600016300002300062500011800085542005100203655002500254655002600279FBRE00aGalaga 1bNAMCO BANDAI Games America Inc.c2007-4-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aControl your fighter, with its unique ability to combine with other fighters, and shoot down the invading aliens.  i2007kNAMCO BANDAI Games America Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00401na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001100005264003300016300002300049500011800072542003800190655002500228655002600253FBRJ00aGalaga 1bNamco Bandai Gamesc2012-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aControl your fighter, with its unique ability to combine with other fighters, and shoot down the invading aliens.  i2012kNamco Bandai GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00401na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001100005264003300016300002300049500011800072542003800190655002500228655002600253FBRP00aGalaga 1bNamco Bandai Gamesc2007-3-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aControl your fighter, with its unique ability to combine with other fighters, and shoot down the invading aliens.  i2007kNamco Bandai GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00399na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001100005264003100016300002300047500011800070542003800188655002500226655002600251FBRT00aGalaga 1bNamco Bandai Gamesc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aControl your fighter, with its unique ability to combine with other fighters, and shoot down the invading aliens.  i2014kNamco Bandai GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01112na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002600005264002600031300002300057500086600080542003100946655002500977FBSE00aMilon's Secret Castle 1bHUDSON SOFTc2007-6-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt is a world where music is the language of the people. An evil warlord from the north arrives and captures the castle. The princess is imprisoned deep within the castle, and the world's musical instruments are taken and hidden away. Our hero, Milon, takes it upon himself to fight the warlord, rescue the princess and recover the people's musical instruments. He has only his wits and the magical Bubble to aid him on his quest. Help Milon along the way by looking for hidden doors, finding secret items and defeating fierce enemies. Make sure to look for the shops inside the castle, where you can buy hints and valuable items. Whenever Milon finds a Music Box, he will be transported to a bonus stage. Each instrument you find will add a layer to the background music. Try to grab all seven instruments to create a performance worthy of a music-themed game.  i2007kHUDSON SOFTsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00535na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004300005264002600048300002300074500023300097542003100330655002500361655002700386FBSJ00aMeikyuu Kumikyoku - Milon no Daibouken 1bHudson Softc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn a world where music is the language of the people, an evil warlord from the north arrives and captures the castle. The queen is imprisoned deep within the castle, and the world's musical instruments are taken and hidden away!  i2014kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00519na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002600005264002700031300002300058500023300081542003100314655002500345655002700370FBSM00aMilon's Secret Castle 1bHudson Softc2010-3-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn a world where music is the language of the people, an evil warlord from the north arrives and captures the castle. The queen is imprisoned deep within the castle, and the world's musical instruments are taken and hidden away!  i2010kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00535na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002300005264002900028300002300057500028600080542003400366655002500400FBUE00aAdventures of Lolo 1bHAL Laboratoryc2007-8-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Great Devil has threatened to destroy the peaceful country of Eden, so Princess Lala and Prince Lolo set off to seek help. But when Lala is kidnapped, Lolo must go it alone. As Lolo, use your intelligence and wits to brave the Great Devil’s trap-laden castle and rescue Lala!  i2007kHAL LaboratorysGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00521na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002300005264002100028300002300049500028600072542002800358655002500386FBUJ00aAdventures of Lolo 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Great Devil has threatened to destroy the peaceful country of Eden, so Princess Lala and Prince Lolo set off to seek help. But when Lala is kidnapped, Lolo must go it alone. As Lolo, use your intelligence and wits to brave the Great Devil’s trap-laden castle and rescue Lala!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00524na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002300005264002400028300002300052500028600075542002800361655002500389FBUP00aAdventures of Lolo 1bNintendoc2007-5-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Great Devil has threatened to destroy the peaceful country of Eden, so Princess Lala and Prince Lolo set off to seek help. But when Lala is kidnapped, Lolo must go it alone. As Lolo, use your intelligence and wits to brave the Great Devil’s trap-laden castle and rescue Lala!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00521na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002300005264002100028300002300049500028600072542002800358655002500386FBUT00aAdventures of Lolo 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Great Devil has threatened to destroy the peaceful country of Eden, so Princess Lala and Prince Lolo set off to seek help. But when Lala is kidnapped, Lolo must go it alone. As Lolo, use your intelligence and wits to brave the Great Devil’s trap-laden castle and rescue Lala!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00183na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002100005264001300026300002300039500000500062542001800067FBVJ00aTsuppari Oozumou 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB01154na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001900005264001300024300002300037500097800060542001801038FBWJ00aJoy Mech Fight 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a주요 파트로만 구성된 로봇들로 활기차게 스테이지를 누비며, 코믹한 움직임과 익살스런 디자인을 즐길 수 있는 로봇 격투 대전 액션 게임입니다. 어느 날 갑자기 로봇으로 세계 정복을 하겠다고 선언한 「못텐마이어 박사」. 그의 로봇에 대항할 수 있는 것은 친구 「차칸스키 박사」의 개그 로봇 「스카퐁」밖에 없습니다. 스카퐁은 동료 로봇을 구하고 세계의 평화를 지키기 위해 싸웁니다. 나쁜 로봇과의 1:1 대전은 박력 만점! 펀치와 킥은 물론, 각 로봇 특유의 개성 넘치는 다양한 필살기를 사용할 수 있습니다. 어려운 조작도 「매뉴얼」 모드에서 연습해 볼 수 있으므로 걱정 없습니다. 1P 퀘스트 모드를 진행하면 다른 모드에서 사용할 수 있는 로봇이 늘어나고, 최대 36종류 중 마음에 드는 로봇을 선택해서 대전할 수 있습니다.  i2014sGameTDB01154na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001900005264001300024300002300037500097800060542001801038FBWQ00aJoy Mech Fight 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a주요 파트로만 구성된 로봇들로 활기차게 스테이지를 누비며, 코믹한 움직임과 익살스런 디자인을 즐길 수 있는 로봇 격투 대전 액션 게임입니다. 어느 날 갑자기 로봇으로 세계 정복을 하겠다고 선언한 「못텐마이어 박사」. 그의 로봇에 대항할 수 있는 것은 친구 「차칸스키 박사」의 개그 로봇 「스카퐁」밖에 없습니다. 스카퐁은 동료 로봇을 구하고 세계의 평화를 지키기 위해 싸웁니다. 나쁜 로봇과의 1:1 대전은 박력 만점! 펀치와 킥은 물론, 각 로봇 특유의 개성 넘치는 다양한 필살기를 사용할 수 있습니다. 어려운 조작도 「매뉴얼」 모드에서 연습해 볼 수 있으므로 걱정 없습니다. 1P 퀘스트 모드를 진행하면 다른 모드에서 사용할 수 있는 로봇이 늘어나고, 최대 36종류 중 마음에 드는 로봇을 선택해서 대전할 수 있습니다.  i2014sGameTDB00179na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001700005264001300022300002300035500000500058542001800063FBXJ00aFamicom Wars 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00441na  a2200121   45000010005000002450024000052640023000293000023000525000166