ugh the depths of planet Zebes to take out the pirates’ leader Mother Brain and restore peace to the galaxy.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00565na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001200005264002300017300002300040500026000063542002800323655002500351655002800376655002700404FBZJ00aMetroid 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMetroids – the most dangerous creatures in the galaxy – have fallen into the hands of Space Pirates! As bounty hunter Samus Aran, battle through the depths of planet Zebes to take out the pirates’ leader Mother Brain and restore peace to the galaxy.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00566na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001200005264002400017300002300041500026000064542002800324655002500352655002800377655002700405FBZP00aMetroid 1bNintendoc2007-7-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aMetroids – the most dangerous creatures in the galaxy – have fallen into the hands of Space Pirates! As bounty hunter Samus Aran, battle through the depths of planet Zebes to take out the pirates’ leader Mother Brain and restore peace to the galaxy.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00179na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001700005264001300022300002300035500000500058542001800063FC2J00aHanjuku Hero 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00477na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001800005264002200023300002300045500024900068542002500317655002500342FC3E00aBubble Bobble 1bTaitoc2007-12-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aBubble Bobble is a puzzle-action game featuring the two Bubble Dragons, Bub and Bob. When it hit arcades in 1986 it introduced brand-new play mechanics, with players defeating enemies by trapping them in bubbles they blew and then popping them.  i2007kTaitosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00515na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002100023300002300044500024900067542002500316655002500341655002700366FC3J00aBubble Bobble 1bTaitoc2008-5-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aBubble Bobble is a puzzle-action game featuring the two Bubble Dragons, Bub and Bob. When it hit arcades in 1986 it introduced brand-new play mechanics, with players defeating enemies by trapping them in bubbles they blew and then popping them.  i2008kTaitosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00516na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002200023300002300045500024900068542002500317655002500342655002700367FC3P00aBubble Bobble 1bTaitoc2007-11-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aBubble Bobble is a puzzle-action game featuring the two Bubble Dragons, Bub and Bob. When it hit arcades in 1986 it introduced brand-new play mechanics, with players defeating enemies by trapping them in bubbles they blew and then popping them.  i2007kTaitosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00512na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264001800023300002300041500024900064542002500313655002500338655002700363FC3T00aBubble Bobble 1bTaitoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aBubble Bobble is a puzzle-action game featuring the two Bubble Dragons, Bub and Bob. When it hit arcades in 1986 it introduced brand-new play mechanics, with players defeating enemies by trapping them in bubbles they blew and then popping them.  i2014kTaitosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00178na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001600005264001300021300002300034500000500057542001800062FC4J00aChack'n Pop 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00201na  a2200097   4500001000500000245003700005264001500042300002300057500000500080542001800085FC5J00aGanbare Goemon! Karakuri Douchuu 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB01079na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001600005264002300021300002300044500084600067542002800913655002800941FC6E00aStarTropics 1bNintendoc2008-1-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aFind out just how resourceful you can be in this classic game, with its mixture of adventure and RPG elements. Step into the shoes of Mike Jones, a teenage star pitcher from Seattle, who has come to the tropics to visit his famous archeologist uncle, Dr. Jones. After being told that his uncle has been abducted, Mike begins a perilous quest in order to rescue him and figure out the mysterious plot behind his disappearance. Luckily for Mike, he meets helpful villagers and finds more powerful weapons as he explores numerous locations and island hops using his uncle’s submarine. You’ll never know what to expect next as the cosmic story unfolds over the course of eight action-packed chapters, ranging from Dr. Jones’s lab on C-Island to an alien spacecraft. Who knew a tropical vacation could turn into a mission to save the world?  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00534na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001600005264002300021300002300044500026400067542002800331655002500359655002800384FC6J00aStartropics 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMike Jones is an ordinary kid who embarks on an extraordinary adventure! Invited by his archaeologist uncle to a tropical island, Mike arrives to find his uncle kidnapped, and vows to track him down and uncover the dark secrets lurking in the island paradise.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00535na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001600005264002400021300002300045500026400068542002800332655002500360655002800385FC6P00aStarTropics 1bNintendoc2008-1-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aMike Jones is an ordinary kid who embarks on an extraordinary adventure! Invited by his archaeologist uncle to a tropical island, Mike arrives to find his uncle kidnapped, and vows to track him down and uncover the dark secrets lurking in the island paradise.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01132na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002900005264002400034300002300058500084900081542002800930655002500958655002700983FC7E00aNES Play Action Football 1bNintendoc2007-9-10  a1 Wii optical disc  a“Ready! Hut hut hut…” Nintendo takes to the gridiron with the classic football powerhouse NES Play Action Football. Featuring a distinct overhead viewpoint that creates an almost 3-D field, the action is more simulation based than many of the more arcade-based games of the time. Play through four 15-minute quarters (in accelerated time) and even substitute players when your first stringers get tired! Want more options? Each of the eight available teams has multiple running/passing plays to choose from while on offense, as well as a wide selection of defensive schemes that can be run when you’re on the other side of the ball. And in addition to viewing two full teams on-screen at once without any slowdown, you’ll hear voice snippets at key points of the game. Line up, and see if you have what it takes to win the Power Bowl!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext01129na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002900005264002100034300002300055500084900078542002800927655002500955655002700980FC7J00aNES Play Action Football 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a“Ready! Hut hut hut…” Nintendo takes to the gridiron with the classic football powerhouse NES Play Action Football. Featuring a distinct overhead viewpoint that creates an almost 3-D field, the action is more simulation based than many of the more arcade-based games of the time. Play through four 15-minute quarters (in accelerated time) and even substitute players when your first stringers get tired! Want more options? Each of the eight available teams has multiple running/passing plays to choose from while on offense, as well as a wide selection of defensive schemes that can be run when you’re on the other side of the ball. And in addition to viewing two full teams on-screen at once without any slowdown, you’ll hear voice snippets at key points of the game. Line up, and see if you have what it takes to win the Power Bowl!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00418na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003500005264002300040300002300063500017100086542002600257655002500283FC8E00aCastlevania II - Simon's Quest 1bKonamic2007-10-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Castlevania II: Simon’s Quest for NES, vampire hunter Simon Belmont must track down and destroy Dracula’s remains in order to save himself from a deadly curse.  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00452na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003200005264002100037300002300058500017100081542002600252655002500278655002700303FC8J00aDracula II - Noroi no Fuuin 1bKonamic2012-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Castlevania II: Simon’s Quest for NES, vampire hunter Simon Belmont must track down and destroy Dracula’s remains in order to save himself from a deadly curse.  i2012kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00456na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003400005264002300039300002300062500017100085542002600256655002500282655002700307FC8P00aCastlevania II: Simon's Quest 1bKonamic2007-10-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Castlevania II: Simon’s Quest for NES, vampire hunter Simon Belmont must track down and destroy Dracula’s remains in order to save himself from a deadly curse.  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00185na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002300005264001300028300002300041500000500064542001800069FC9J00aMetal Slader Glory 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00983na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264002700022300002300049500070700072542003100779655002500810655002600835FCAE00aStar Soldier 1bHUDSON SOFTc2007-7-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe standard for vertically scrolling shooters, Star Soldier is the original game that spawned all of the titles in the long-running Soldier series. Go inside a floating space station inhabited by a giant computer known as Starbrain. Your mission: to stop Starbrain's galactic invasion by piloting Caesar, a new, compact space fighter through 16 deadly stages. Collect power capsules to increase three different attributes of your ship: firepower, movement speed, and defensive shields. Blast wave after wave of approaching enemies or use the innovative Trap Zone feature to fly beneath a land mass and avoid incoming fire. Conquer each stage to make your way to the final confrontation with Starbrain!  i2007kHUDSON SOFTsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00982na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264002600022300002300048500070700071542003100778655002500809655002600834FCAJ00aStar Soldier 1bHUDSON SOFTc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe standard for vertically scrolling shooters, Star Soldier is the original game that spawned all of the titles in the long-running Soldier series. Go inside a floating space station inhabited by a giant computer known as Starbrain. Your mission: to stop Starbrain's galactic invasion by piloting Caesar, a new, compact space fighter through 16 deadly stages. Collect power capsules to increase three different attributes of your ship: firepower, movement speed, and defensive shields. Blast wave after wave of approaching enemies or use the innovative Trap Zone feature to fly beneath a land mass and avoid incoming fire. Conquer each stage to make your way to the final confrontation with Starbrain!  i2014kHUDSON SOFTsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00343na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001600005264001300021300002300034500013600057542001800193655002200211FCEJ00aEsper Dream 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aFCE Ultra GX is a modified port of FCE Ultra. With it you can play NES games on your Wii/GameCube. The GUI is powered by li