Balloon Fight 1bNintendoc2007-7-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aOriginally a hit in the arcades of the early ‘80s, NES classic Balloon Fight puts you in control of a heroic balloonist. Simply, pop the balloons of your enemies before they pop yours!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00421na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001800005264002100023300002300044500019100067542002800258655002500286FCPJ00aBalloon Fight 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aOriginally a hit in the arcades of the early ‘80s, NES classic Balloon Fight puts you in control of a heroic balloonist. Simply, pop the balloons of your enemies before they pop yours!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00424na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001800005264002400023300002300047500019100070542002800261655002500289FCPP00aBalloon Fight 1bNintendoc2007-5-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aOriginally a hit in the arcades of the early ‘80s, NES classic Balloon Fight puts you in control of a heroic balloonist. Simply, pop the balloons of your enemies before they pop yours!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext01069na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004600005264002200051300002300073500077300096542002500869655002500894655002800919FCQE00aNinja Gaiden II - The Dark Sword of Chaos 1bTecmoc2007-10-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Ninja Gaiden II, a new villain, Ashtar, is revealed. Take on the role of Ryu Hayabusa and rescue Irene Lew, a former CIA agent, from Ashtar. Destroy the Sword of Chaos, a weapon of great power forged from the bone of a demon. Use techniques such as the Fire Wheel or the Windmill Throwing Star and attack while holding on to walls and ladders. Utilize the most innovative technique of all--the ability to create Shadow Clones, orange shadow versions of Ryu that will constantly follow him, repeating previous actions (moving or attacking) in a delayed cycle. Once again defeat henchmen, creatures, and bosses with new fighting techniques and even more weapons as you progress through multiple stages on your way to destroying Ashtar, Jaquio, and the Realm of Chaos.  i2007kTecmosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01041na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002000005264002000025300002300045500077300068542002500841655002500866655002800891FCQJ00aNinja Gaiden II 1bTecmoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Ninja Gaiden II, a new villain, Ashtar, is revealed. Take on the role of Ryu Hayabusa and rescue Irene Lew, a former CIA agent, from Ashtar. Destroy the Sword of Chaos, a weapon of great power forged from the bone of a demon. Use techniques such as the Fire Wheel or the Windmill Throwing Star and attack while holding on to walls and ladders. Utilize the most innovative technique of all--the ability to create Shadow Clones, orange shadow versions of Ryu that will constantly follow him, repeating previous actions (moving or attacking) in a delayed cycle. Once again defeat henchmen, creatures, and bosses with new fighting techniques and even more weapons as you progress through multiple stages on your way to destroying Ashtar, Jaquio, and the Realm of Chaos.  i2014kTecmosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00698na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002100005264002600026300002300052500045700075542003100532655002500563FCRE00aAdventure Island 1bHUDSON SOFTc2007-9-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aA mysterious tropical paradise known as Adventure Island is the setting for this side-scrolling action game. The evil Witch Doctor has kidnapped Tina, the true love of Master Higgins. To save her, you must safely guide Master Higgins through eight perilous stages - including dense forests and creepy caves - while defeating all of the enemies in your path. Each area is made up of four rounds filled with enemies determined to stop you in your tracks.  i2007kHUDSON SOFTsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00711na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003600005264002400041300002300065500045700088542003100545655002500576FCRJ00aTakahashi Meijin no Bouken Jima 1bHudson Softc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aA mysterious tropical paradise known as Adventure Island is the setting for this side-scrolling action game. The evil Witch Doctor has kidnapped Tina, the true love of Master Higgins. To save her, you must safely guide Master Higgins through eight perilous stages - including dense forests and creepy caves - while defeating all of the enemies in your path. Each area is made up of four rounds filled with enemies determined to stop you in your tracks.  i2014kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00699na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002100005264002700026300002300053500045700076542003100533655002500564FCRP00aAdventure Island 1bHudson Softc2008-2-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aA mysterious tropical paradise known as Adventure Island is the setting for this side-scrolling action game. The evil Witch Doctor has kidnapped Tina, the true love of Master Higgins. To save her, you must safely guide Master Higgins through eight perilous stages - including dense forests and creepy caves - while defeating all of the enemies in your path. Each area is made up of four rounds filled with enemies determined to stop you in your tracks.  i2008kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00742na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002100005264004700026300002300073500045700096542005400553655002500607FCRT00aAdventure Island 1bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aA mysterious tropical paradise known as Adventure Island is the setting for this side-scrolling action game. The evil Witch Doctor has kidnapped Tina, the true love of Master Higgins. To save her, you must safely guide Master Higgins through eight perilous stages - including dense forests and creepy caves - while defeating all of the enemies in your path. Each area is made up of four rounds filled with enemies determined to stop you in your tracks.  i2014kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00807na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001200005264002200017300002300039500058400062542002600646655002500672FCSE00aSuper C 1bKonamic2007-8-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn this action-packed sequel to the popular Contra, players have little time to think. Experience run-and-gun game play at its best as you take control of Mad Dog or Scorpion and once again battle the forces of Red Falcon. Stages feature a combination of perspectives (side scrolling, top down, etc.) and intense battles against huge bosses. Use a variety of powerful weapons and tap into your killer instinct to survive the deadly waves of enemies. And if you're scared, recruit a friend to help you. Because if your trigger finger lacks stamina, then Earth will lack a future!.  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00384na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001700005264002100022300002300043500015700066542002600223655002500249FCSJ00aSuper Contra 1bKonamic2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the year 2634, Earth has finally escaped from the hand of Black Magic, one year after the end of the war with the mysterious alien army... Or has it?  i2014kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00416na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004700005264002300052300002300075500015700098542002600255655002500281FCSP00aProbotector II - Return of the Evil Forces 1bKonamic2007-10-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the year 2634, Earth has finally escaped from the hand of Black Magic, one year after the end of the war with the mysterious alien army... Or has it?  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext01205na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001300005264002200018300002300040500098100063542002601044655002501070FCTE00aMega Man 1bCapcomc2008-8-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMega Man is pitted against the powerful leaders and fighting forces of Monsteropolis. Brilliant scientist Dr. Light originally conceived the construction of fully-operational human-like experimental robots to perform specific everyday duties. Dr. Light, and his assistant Dr. Wily, encouraged by their very first near-human robot – Mega Man – proceeded to develop six additional humanoids, all programmed to perform specialist tasks: Cut Man, Ice Man, Guts Man, Bomb Man and Fire Man. The experiment was a success, but Dr. Wily turned disloyal, re-programming Dr. Light's humanoids to use their powers to allow him to control the world and its resources. The only robot to survive Dr. Wily's evil plan was Mega Man, who volunteered to be the defender of the universe and its inhabitants – to single-handedly penetrate seven separate empires of Monsteropolis, and to eliminate the leaders and followers of these sovereignties. Get ready for some very exciting challenges!  i2008kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext01242na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001200005264002100017300002300038500098100061542002601042655002501068655002701093FCTJ00aRockman 1bCapcomc2012-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMega Man is pitted against the powerful leaders and fighting forces of Monsteropolis. Brilliant scientist Dr. Light originally conceived the construction of fully-operational human-like experimental robots to perform specific everyday duties. Dr. Light, and his assistant Dr. Wily, encouraged by their very first near-human robot – Mega Man – proceeded to develop six additional humanoids, all programmed to perform specialist tasks: Cut Man, Ice Man, Guts Man, Bomb Man and Fire Man. The experiment was a success, but Dr. Wily turned disloyal, re-programming Dr. Light's humanoids to use their powers to allow him to control the world and its resources. The only robot to survive Dr. Wily's evil plan was Mega Man, who volunteered to be the defender of the universe and its inhabitants – to single-handedly penetrate seven separate empires of Monsteropolis, and to eliminate the leaders and followers of these sovereignties. Get ready for some very exciting challenges!  i2012kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext01244na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001300005264002200018300002300040500098100063542002601044655002501070655002701095FCTP00aMega Man 1bCapcomc2007-6-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aMega Man is pitted against the powerful leaders and fighting forces of Monsteropolis. Brilliant scientist Dr. Light originally conceived the construction of fully-operational human-like experimental robots to perform specific everyday duties. Dr. Light, and his assistant Dr. Wily, encouraged by their very first near-human robot – Mega Man – proceeded to develop six additional humanoids, all programmed to perform specialist tasks: Cut Man, Ice Man, Guts Man, Bomb Man and Fire Man. The experiment was a success, but Dr. Wily turned disloyal, re-programming Dr. Light's humanoids to use their powers to allow him to control the world and its resources. The only robot to survive Dr. Wily's evil plan was Mega Man, who volunteered to be the defender of the universe and its inhabitants – to single-handedly penetrate seven separate empires of Monsteropolis, and to eliminate the leaders and followers of these sovereignties. Get ready for some very exciting challenges!  i2007kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00505na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001500005264002500020300002300045500023300068542002800301655002500329655002900354FCUE00aVolleyball 1bNintendoc2007-11-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aVolleyball is an action game for one or two players. Choose a country to represent, choose a mens or womens team, then head to the court to begin! You can serve, set the ball for a teammate, spike, lob, or dive to save the game.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aVolleyball games2wiiext00405na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001500005264002300020300002300043500013500066542002800201655002500229655002900254FCUJ00aVolleyball 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aVolleyball is one of the fastest team games around, and this NES classic recreates the speedy sport in a way that anyone can play.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aVolleyball games2wiiext00406na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001500005264002400020300002300044500013500067542002800202655002500230655002900255FCUP00aVolleyball 1bNintendoc2007-8-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aVolleyball is one of the fastest team games around, and this NES classic recreates the speedy sport in a way that anyone can play.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aVolleyball games2wiiext01102na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002500023300002300048500083100071542002800902655002500930655002500955FCVE00aWrecking Crew 1bNintendoc2007-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the days before Mario and Luigi became sports stars in their downtime between plumbing and saving the Princess, they tried their hands as one-man wrecking crews. With a hammer as their only tool, players take control of the brothers and set out to destroy ladders, rip out pipes, knock out walls, and detonate explosive devices. But make sure to plan your path of destruction carefully, as each building is designed as its own clever puzzle—if you’re not careful, you can easily trap yourself in a dead end! Adding to the excitement and challenge are fireballs, enemies, and an angry foreman roaming the buildings, all trying to stop you from moving on to the next stage. With 100 buildings to demolish and the ability to construct your own, it’s a wonder Mario and Luigi ever got back to saving the Mushroom Kingdom!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00370na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001800005264002300023300002300046500013800069542002800207655002500235FCVJ00aWrecking Crew 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn NES classic Wrecking Crew, Mario swaps his plumber’s cap for a hard hat as he takes on the unique role of a demolition engineer!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00371na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001800005264002400023300002300047500013800070542002800208655002500236FCVP00aWrecking Crew 1bNintendoc2007-8-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn NES classic Wrecking Crew, Mario swaps his plumber’s cap for a hard hat as he takes on the unique role of a demolition engineer!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00397na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002400005264002400029300002300053500015800076542002800234655002500262FCWE00aSuper Mario Bros. 3 1bNintendoc2007-11-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario and Luigi are called back into action when Bowser and his kids turn the kings of the Mushroom World into animals and steal their royal magic wands.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00435na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264002300029300002300052500015800075542002800233655002500261655002700286FCWJ00aSuper Mario Bros. 3 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario and Luigi are called back into action when Bowser and his kids turn the kings of the Mushroom World into animals and steal their royal magic wands.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00436na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264002400029300002300053500015800076542002800234655002500262655002700287FCWP00aSuper Mario Bros. 3 1bNintendoc2007-11-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario and Luigi are called back into action when Bowser and his kids turn the kings of the Mushroom World into animals and steal their royal magic wands.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00433na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264002100029300002300050500015800073542002800231655002500259655002700284FCWQ00aSuper Mario Bros. 3 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario and Luigi are called back into action when Bowser and his kids turn the kings of the Mushroom World into animals and steal their royal magic wands.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext01172na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001900005264002300024300002300047500093900070542002801009655002501037FCYE00aYoshi's Cookie 1bNintendoc2008-4-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake one part puzzle game, combine with intuitive game play, add a pinch of multiplayer action, and top with a layer of everyone’s favorite dinosaur. Mix together and let set for roughly 100 stages worth of time. If that sounds like a winning recipe to you, then step into the kitchen and get ready for a batch of fast-paced puzzle action! Hunker down to move rows and columns of randomly placed cookies in an effort to align all the cookies of the same type. Successfully assemble a row or column to make the line disappear, and then move to a new one. If you’re good enough, you may even be able to make a Yoshi cookie appear! Feel like taking on a friend? Fire up the two-player mode, where you can attack your opponent while competing to match as many cookies as possible. Be careful, though—if your timing is off, you could end up attacking yourself! Who knew that dinosaurs had such a weakness for puzzle games and sweets?  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00421na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002300025300002300048500018700071542002800258655002500286FCYJ00aYoshi no Cookie 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario and Yoshi are filling in at the cookie factory, and they need your help! As freshly baked cookies roll out of the ovens, you must sort and stack them before they pile too high.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext01174na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001900005264002500024300002300049500093900072542002801011655002501039FCYK00aYoshi's Cookie 1bNintendoc2008-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake one part puzzle game, combine with intuitive game play, add a pinch of multiplayer action, and top with a layer of everyone’s favorite dinosaur. Mix together and let set for roughly 100 stages worth of time. If that sounds like a winning recipe to you, then step into the kitchen and get ready for a batch of fast-paced puzzle action! Hunker down to move rows and columns of randomly placed cookies in an effort to align all the cookies of the same type. Successfully assemble a row or column to make the line disappear, and then move to a new one. If you’re good enough, you may even be able to make a Yoshi cookie appear! Feel like taking on a friend? Fire up the two-player mode, where you can attack your opponent while competing to match as many cookies as possible. Be careful, though—if your timing is off, you could end up attacking yourself! Who knew that dinosaurs had such a weakness for puzzle games and sweets?  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00420na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001900005264002300024300002300047500018700070542002800257655002500285FCYP00aYoshi's Cookie 1bNintendoc2008-4-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario and Yoshi are filling in at the cookie factory, and they need your help! As freshly baked cookies roll out of the ovens, you must sort and stack them before they pile too high.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00422na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001900005264002500024300002300049500018700072542002800259655002500287FCYT00aYoshi's Cookie 1bNintendoc2008-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario and Yoshi are filling in at the cookie factory, and they need your help! As freshly baked cookies roll out of the ovens, you must sort and stack them before they pile too high.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00809na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002700023300002300050500053200073542003100605655002500636655002600661FCZE00aKing's Knight 1bSquare Enixc2008-3-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the kingdom of Izander, the fair Princess Claire has been kidnapped by a foul and insidious dragon, and it is the mission of four brave fighters to save her. Through five thrilling, fast-action stages, our gallant heroes—a knight, a wizard, a monster, and a thief—will take on an army of incredible enemies. You must help them reach their goal, as you are now part of the team that will fight to free the princess from her imprisonment. Keep your wits about you, plan your strategy, and set off on an exciting adventure!  i2008kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00806na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002400023300002300047500053200070542003100602655002500633655002600658FCZJ00aKing's Knight 1bSquare Enixc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the kingdom of Izander, the fair Princess Claire has been kidnapped by a foul and insidious dragon, and it is the mission of four brave fighters to save her. Through five thrilling, fast-action stages, our gallant heroes—a knight, a wizard, a monster, and a thief—will take on an army of incredible enemies. You must help them reach their goal, as you are now part of the team that will fight to free the princess from her imprisonment. Keep your wits about you, plan your strategy, and set off on an exciting adventure!  i2014kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00561na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002700023300002300050500028300073542003100356655002500387655002700412FD2E00aDouble Dragon 1bAksys Gamesc2008-4-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aDouble Dragon is one of the most popular arcade-style action fighting games ever, and has been used as a classic model for subsequent beat'em-up games. Published initially as an arcade title only, it's huge success has allowed the game to be converted across multiple platforms.  i2008kAksys GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00554na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002200023300002300045500028300068542002900351655002500380655002700405FD2J00aDouble Dragon 1b505 Gamesc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aDouble Dragon is one of the most popular arcade-style action fighting games ever, and has been used as a classic model for subsequent beat'em-up games. Published initially as an arcade title only, it's huge success has allowed the game to be converted across multiple platforms.  i2014k505 GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00557na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002500023300002300048500028300071542002900354655002500383655002700408FD2P00aDouble Dragon 1b505 Gamesc2008-4-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aDouble Dragon is one of the most popular arcade-style action fighting games ever, and has been used as a classic model for subsequent beat'em-up games. Published initially as an arcade title only, it's huge success has allowed the game to be converted across multiple platforms.  i2008k505 GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext01345na  a2200097   4500001000500000245004600005264001300051300002300064500114200087542001801229FD3J00aNekketsu Koukou Dodgeball Bu - Soccer Hen 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a패밀리컴퓨터의 대표적인 인기 캐릭터 「쿠니오」와 피구부의 팀원들이 축구 경기에 도전하는 액션 게임입니다. 전국 대회 출전권을 땄지만 식중독에 걸리고 만 축구부를 대신해 「쿠니오」가 이끄는 열혈고교 피구부가, 전국 12팀을 상대로 한 무법천지 축구 시합에서 우승에 도전합니다. 태클과 슬라이딩을 비롯한 거친 플레이는 물론 개성적인 필살 슛 등, 시리즈 고유의 게임성 또한 여전히 건재합니다. 플레이어가 직접 조작하지 않는 캐릭터들에게는 간단한 조작만으로 지시를 내릴 수 있어 절묘한 패스에서 오버헤드 킥, 필살 슛까지 축구 시합만의 팀 플레이를 즐길 수 있습니다. 우승을 거듭할수록 열혈고교 팀에는 강력한 축구부원들이 하나둘 돌아오게 됩니다. 피구부원들과 축구부원들을 적절히 배치하여 전국 대회 제패를 노려 봅시다. 또한 2인 대전 및 2인 협력 플레이도 가능합니다. 「쿠니오」와 열혈남아들의 뜨거운 싸움을 지켜봐 주세요.  i2014sGameTDB01345na  a2200097   4500001000500000245004600005264001300051300002300064500114200087542001801229FD3Q00aNekketsu Koukou Dodgeball-bu - Soccer Hen 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a패밀리컴퓨터의 대표적인 인기 캐릭터 「쿠니오」와 피구부의 팀원