n wave after wave of enemies. Destroy particular enemies throughout the game—all of which takes place within the body of an enormous alien—to release power-up capsules and equip your ship with your choice of more powerful weapons, extra speed, and shields. Utilize the power-ups carefully, though, as a fearsome guardian lurks at the end of each stage and won’t be easily defeated. You can go it alone or bring along a friend to take on the challenge simultaneously. Do you have what it takes to save your planet?  i2012kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00186na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002400005264001300029300002300042500000500065542001800070FEOJ00aZoids - Mokushiroku 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00182na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002000005264001300025300002300038500000500061542001800066FEPJ00aGetsu Fuuma Den 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00614na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003800005264002200043300002300065500036500088542002600453655002500479FEQE00aCastlevania III - Dracula's Curse 1bKonamic2009-1-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aFight back against Dracula in the third exciting instalment of the highly popular Castlevania franchise! As with the original ‘Castlevania’, the player’s goal is to work their way through deviously challenging levels, but this time there's a difference - when the level ends, you can choose one of two paths to take for a completely different experience!  i2009kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00636na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002100027300002300048500036500071542002600436655002500462655002700487FEQJ00aAkumajou Densetsu 1bKonamic2012-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aFight back against Dracula in the third exciting instalment of the highly popular Castlevania franchise! As with the original ‘Castlevania’, the player’s goal is to work their way through deviously challenging levels, but this time there's a difference - when the level ends, you can choose one of two paths to take for a completely different experience!  i2012kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00693na  a2200133   4500001000500000245003700005264002300042300002300065500036500088542002600453655002500479655002800504655002700532FEQP00aCastlevania III: Dracula's Curse 1bKonamic2008-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aFight back against Dracula in the third exciting instalment of the highly popular Castlevania franchise! As with the original ‘Castlevania’, the player’s goal is to work their way through deviously challenging levels, but this time there's a difference - when the level ends, you can choose one of two paths to take for a completely different experience!  i2008kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00891na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003600005264002500041300002300066500063600089542002800725655002800753FERE00aZoda's Revenge - StarTropics II 1bNintendoc2008-12-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake on the role of Mike Jones, intrepid hero of the StarTropics universe, and once again battle the evil alien Zoda to control the fate of the Argonian people. The island hopping of Mike’s original adventure gives way to traveling through time and visiting locations around the world in this journey. And you never know what famous historical figures may appear along the way to aid Mike, giving him helpful advice or useful items. Luckily, Mike also has a wider range of weapons and improved play control on his side, so he may yet stand a chance against Zoda. Can you help Mike stand the test of time and save the world again?  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00437na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001900005264002100024300002300045500016600068542002800234655002500262655002800287FERJ00aZoda's Revenge 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aIntrepid adventurer Mike Jones, just back from the South Pacific, is off on a new journey through time and space. Mike's mission: to save seven mystic Tetrads...  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00457na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003600005264002400041300002300065500016600088542002800254655002500282655002800307FERM00aZoda's Revenge - StarTropics II 1bNintendoc2009-7-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aIntrepid adventurer Mike Jones, just back from the South Pacific, is off on a new journey through time and space. Mike's mission: to save seven mystic Tetrads...  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00431na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003700005264002300042300002300065500014000088542002800228655002500256655002800281FERP00aZoda’s Revenge: StarTropics II 1bNintendoc2015-9-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aMike Jones, high-school ace pitcher and part-time adventurer, returns for another escapade: travelling not into space but back in time!  i2015kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00554na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264002300022300002300045500028600068542002800354655002500382655002500407FESE00aClu Clu Land 1bNintendoc2008-9-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aReleased in the early days of the NES, Clu Clu Land is a unique and fast-paced action-maze game! Manoeuvre Bubbles around the levels by grabbing posts with her outstretched hands and swinging in your chosen direction. To win, explore the whole maze to uncover all of the gold bars!  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00547na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004700005264002300052300002300075500028600098542002800384655002500412FESJ00aClu Clu Land - Welcome to New Clu Clu Land 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aReleased in the early days of the NES, Clu Clu Land is a unique and fast-paced action-maze game! Manoeuvre Bubbles around the levels by gr