cs and sound are shadows of its descendents, but the gameplay is addictive and the story is stunningly rich and thoughtful. Players guide parties of four characters on a series of quests to defeat four ancient demons and save the world--which is also stuck in a time loop!  i2014kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00610na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001800005264002600023300002300049500036600072542003100438655003100469FFAM00aFinal Fantasy 1bSquare Enixc2010-5-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis classic console fantasy RPG spawned an unstoppable series of great games. The graphics and sound are shadows of its descendents, but the gameplay is addictive and the story is stunningly rich and thoughtful. Players guide parties of four characters on a series of quests to defeat four ancient demons and save the world--which is also stuck in a time loop!  i2010kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00183na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002100005264001300026300002300039500000500062542001800067FFBJ00aFinal Fantasy II 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB01077na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004100005264002700046300002300073500077600096542003100872655002500903655002700928FFDE00aCrash 'n the Boys - Street Challenge 1bAksys Gamesc2009-9-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aTodd Thornley, son of the head of Thornley Industries, has had it with Crash and the Southside boys. Todd decides Hiller High, along with help from other various high schools, will take down Crash by challenging him and Southside High to an unsanctioned street challenge. Take control of one of four high school teams, with four different characters to play as per team, as you make your way through five different sporting events. Dash and bash your way through the 400 meter hurdles, swing your way to victory in the hammer throw, swim and knock out your opponent while swimming, pole vault, jump and unicycle your way across building roof tops, and judo fight your opponent in a one-on-one brawl fest. Can you lead your high school to the top of the Street Challenge!?  i2009kAksys GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext01088na  a2200121   4500001000500000245005500005264002400060300002300084500077600107542003100883655002500914655002700939FFDJ00aBikkuri Nekketsu Shin Kiroku! Harukanaru Kin Medal 1bAksys Gamesc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aTodd Thornley, son of the head of Thornley Industries, has had it with Crash and the Southside boys. Todd decides Hiller High, along with help from other various high schools, will take down Crash by challenging him and Southside High to an unsanctioned street challenge. Take control of one of four high school teams, with four different characters to play as per team, as you make your way through five different sporting events. Dash and bash your way through the 400 meter hurdles, swing your way to victory in the hammer throw, swim and knock out your opponent while swimming, pole vault, jump and unicycle your way across building roof tops, and judo fight your opponent in a one-on-one brawl fest. Can you lead your high school to the top of the Street Challenge!?  i2014kAksys GamessGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00478na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004700005264003800052300002300090500014900113542004100262655002800303655002500331FFEE02aA Boy and His Blob - Trouble on Blobolonia 1bMajesco Entertainmentc2009-11-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aHELP SAVE BLOBOLONIA! Blob (full name Blobert) has come from the distant planet Blobolonia in search of an earth boy to help him save his world!  i2009kMajesco EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00486na  a2200133   4500001000500000245004700005264002400052300002300076500014900099542002700248655002500275655002700300655002500327FFEP02aA Boy and His Blob - Trouble on Blobolonia 1bMajescoc2009-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aHELP SAVE BLOBOLONIA! Blob (full name Blobert) has come from the distant planet Blobolonia in search of an earth boy to help him save his world!  i2009kMajescosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00184na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002200005264001300027300002300040500000500063542001800068FFFJ00aFinal Fantasy III 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00216na  a2200097   4500001000500000245005400005264001300059300002300072500000500095542001800100FFGJ00aSD Gundam World - Gachapon Senshi - Scramble Wars 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00176na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001400005264001300019300002300032500000500055542001800060FFJJ00aMetal Max 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00191na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002900005264001300034300002300047500000500070542001800075FFKJ00aChampionship Lode Runner 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB01232na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004100005264002600046300002300072500096800095542003101063655002801094FFLE00aPrincess Tomato in the Salad Kingdom 1bHUDSON SOFTc2010-2-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing a cast of cute characters and an endearing sense of humor, this unique title has gained a dedicated following since its release on the original NES system. The wicked Minister Pumpkin, a nobleman in the Salad Kingdom, has rebelled and kicked King Broccoli off the throne. Worse yet, he has kidnapped Princess Tomato and, with the help of the treacherous Farmies, proceeded to abolish all truth, justice, sweetness and light from the Salad Kingdom. Players take on the role of the brave Sir Cucumber, hero of the kingdom, and set out on a quest to rescue the princess and topple Minister Pumpkin. Progress through multiple locations using set commands (such as MOVE, LOOK, and TALK), while winning bouts of Finger Wars (Rock-Paper-Scissors), collecting information and items, and heeding helpful clues from your faithful companion, Percy (a Persimmon). If you fail, the entire Salad Kingdom will be tossed into frenzy. Sir Cucumber, your princess awaits!  i2010kHUDSON SOFTsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext01223na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003400005264002400039300002300063500096800086542003101054655002801085FFLJ00aSalada no Kuni no Tomato Hime 1bHUDSON SOFTc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing a cast of cute characters and an endearing sense of humor, this unique title has gained a dedicated following since its release on the original NES system. The wicked Minister Pumpkin, a nobleman in the Salad Kingdom, has rebelled and kicked King Broccoli off the throne. Worse yet, he has kidnapped Princess Tomato and, with the help of the treacherous Farmies, proceeded to abolish all truth, justice, sweetness and light from the Salad Kingdom. Players take on the role of the brave Sir Cucumber, hero of the kingdom, and set out on a quest to rescue the princess and topple Minister Pumpkin. Progress through multiple locations using set commands (such as MOVE, LOOK, and TALK), while winning bouts of Finger Wars (Rock-Paper-Scissors), collecting information and items, and heeding helpful clues from your faithful companion, Percy (a Persimmon). If you fail, the entire Salad Kingdom will be tossed into frenzy. Sir Cucumber, your princess awaits!  i2014kHUDSON SOFTsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00763na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001900005264002400024300002300048500049200071542002700563655002500590655002600615FFME00aBlaster Master 1bSunsoftc2009-12-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe New York sewers were never like this! You've fallen down a hidden manhole into a world of creatures so terrifying they'd scare the rats away. You can panic and perish, or blast your way through an endless maze of tunnels, searching for the secret passages to your escape. And, that's the easy part. Because the Masters of the Caverns lay waiting - prehistoric creatures so powerful, so gigantic, they literally fill your screen! So load your arsenal and get ready for Blaster Master.  i2009kSunsoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00402na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003500005264002000040300002300060500015700083542002700240655002500267FFMJ00aChou Wakusei Senki - Metafight 1bSunsoftc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aOriginally titled Meta Fight in Japan, this groundbreaking game was given a story makeover and released as Blaster Master in Europe to critical acclaim.  i2014kSunsoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00388na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001900005264002200024300002300046500015700069542002700226655002500253FFMP00aBlaster Master 1bSunsoftc2010-4-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aOriginally titled Meta Fight in Japan, this groundbreaking game was given a story makeover and released as Blaster Master in Europe to critical acclaim.  i2010kSunsoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00599na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001500005264002200020300002300042500037300065542002600438655002500464FFNE00aMega Man 4 1bCapcomc2010-4-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aA year after the destruction of Gamma and Dr. Wily's defeat at the hands of Mega Man, the world is still at peace. One day a letter arrives for Dr. Light from a mysterious Russian scientist named Dr. Mikhail Cossack. Dr. Cossack plans to eliminate Mega Man to prove himself to be the greatest robot designer of all time. It's up to Mega Man to save the day once again.  i2010kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00657na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003500005264002100040300002300061500037300084542002600457655002500483655002700508FFNJ00aRockman 4 - Arata Naru Yabou!! 1bCapcomc2012-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aA year after the destruction of Gamma and Dr. Wily's defeat at the hands of Mega Man, the world is still at peace. One day a letter arrives for Dr. Light from 