brave enough to take on the armies of Super Ghouls 'n Ghosts.  i2007kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00213na  a2200097   4500001000500000245004900005264001500054300002300069500000500092542001800097JA5J00aHeracles no Eikou III - Kamigami no Chinmoku 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00957na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002900005264002600034300002300060500067100083542002900754655002500783655002700808JA6E00aZombies Ate My Neighbors 1bLucasArtsc2009-10-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou will play the game as one of two brave kids: Zeke or Julie. Both kids utilize the same control scheme and have the same characteristics. If you’re playing the two-player game, each player must pick a kid. You can’t have two Zekes or two Julies! Each player starts with three lives. When your life bar runs out, you lose a life. There are hidden 1-Up bonuses in the game. You may also earn bonus lives if you have ten victims left when you finish a level. Now, get ready to conquer 48 levels of giant ants, mad scientists, and big babies. Find seven bonus levels (look for the question marks!), earn points, and stockpile your water pistols and other weapons!  i2009kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00953na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002900005264002200034300002300056500067100079542002900750655002500779655002700804JA6J00aZombies Ate My Neighbors 1bLucasArtsc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou will play the game as one of two brave kids: Zeke or Julie. Both kids utilize the same control scheme and have the same characteristics. If you’re playing the two-player game, each player must pick a kid. You can’t have two Zekes or two Julies! Each player starts with three lives. When your life bar runs out, you lose a life. There are hidden 1-Up bonuses in the game. You may also earn bonus lives if you have ten victims left when you finish a level. Now, get ready to conquer 48 levels of giant ants, mad scientists, and big babies. Find seven bonus levels (look for the question marks!), earn points, and stockpile your water pistols and other weapons!  i2014kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00940na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001200005264002600017300002300043500067100066542002900737655002500766655002700791JA6P00aZombies 1bLucasArtsc2009-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou will play the game as one of two brave kids: Zeke or Julie. Both kids utilize the same control scheme and have the same characteristics. If you’re playing the two-player game, each player must pick a kid. You can’t have two Zekes or two Julies! Each player starts with three lives. When your life bar runs out, you lose a life. There are hidden 1-Up bonuses in the game. You may also earn bonus lives if you have ten victims left when you finish a level. Now, get ready to conquer 48 levels of giant ants, mad scientists, and big babies. Find seven bonus levels (look for the question marks!), earn points, and stockpile your water pistols and other weapons!  i2009kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00755na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001400005264002700019300002300046500047900069542003100548655002500579655002900604JA7D00aActRaiser 1bSquare Enixc2007-4-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aA masterpiece of game design originally released in the early days of the Super Nintendo Entertainment System, ActRaiser’s enduring popularity stems from its revolutionary combination of action- and simulation-based game play. The user plays the role of the Master, a dethroned deity whose once idyllic world has fallen under the control of the Evil One. Stripped of godly power, the Master must somehow put an end to the Evil One’s reign and rebuild his desolate realm.  i2007kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00755na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001400005264002700019300002300046500047900069542003100548655002500579655002900604JA7E00aActRaiser 1bSquare Enixc2007-5-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aA masterpiece of game design originally released in the early days of the Super Nintendo Entertainment System, ActRaiser’s enduring popularity stems from its revolutionary combination of action- and simulation-based game play. The user plays the role of the Master, a dethroned deity whose once idyllic world has fallen under the control of the Evil One. Stripped of godly power, the Master must somehow put an end to the Evil One’s reign and rebuild his desolate realm.  i2007kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00792na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001400005264002700019300002300046500047700069542003100546655002500577655002900602655002700631JA7F00aActRaiser 1bSquare-Enixc2007-4-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aCréé pour la Super Nintendo qui venait de sortir à l'époque, ActRaiser® continue d'impressionner les joueurs du monde entier. Ce succès durable est dû au mélange révolutionnaire de deux genres: action et simulation. Le joueur incarne "le Maître", une divinité déchue dont le royaume jadis idyllique est tombé entre les mains du Mal. Privé de tous ses pouvoirs divins, le Maître doit affronter le démon Tanzra et redonner à son royaume sa grandeur d'antan.  i2007kSquare-EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00784na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001400005264002600019300002300045500047000068542003100538655002500569655002900594655002700623JA7J00aActRaiser 1bSquare-Enixc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aA masterpiece of game design originally released in the early days of the Super Nintendo Entertainment System, ActRaiser’s enduring popularity stems from its revolutionary combination of action and simulation-based gameplay. Take control of the Master, a dethroned deity whose once-idyllic world has fallen under the control of the Evil One. Stripped of his divinity, the Master must somehow put an end to the Evil One's reign and rebuild this now-desolate realm.  i2014kSquare-EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00785na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001400005264002700019300002300046500047000069542003100539655002500570655002900595655002700624JA7P00aActRaiser 1bSquare-Enixc2007-4-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aA masterpiece of game design originally released in the early days of the Super Nintendo Entertainment System, ActRaiser’s enduring popularity stems from its revolutionary combination of action and simulation-based gameplay. Take control of the Master, a dethroned deity whose once-idyllic world has fallen under the control of the Evil One. Stripped of his divinity, the Master must somehow put an end to the Evil One's reign and rebuild this now-desolate realm.  i2007kSquare-EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00801na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001600005264002100021300002300042500057500065542002600640655002500666JA8E00aFinal Fight 1bCapcomc2007-3-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aJessica had it all. She was the daughter of former wrestling star and mayor of Metro City Mike Haggar and girlfriend to Cody Travers, one of the coolest and toughest boys around. But now she has been mysteriously kidnapped! Take to the streets with either Haggar or Cody and fight your way across town, deep into the turf of the Mad Gear Gang. As you cross the town, fight with all your strength to save the one you love. Enjoy unmatched beat 'em up action in this arcade classic and discover just who is behind the Mad Gear Gang in what may be Metro City's final fight.  i2007kCapcomsGameTDB 7aArcade games2wiiext00535na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001600005264002100021300002300042500022800065542002600293655002500319655002700344655003000371JA8J00aFinal Fight 1bCapcomc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aJessica had it all. She was the daughter of former wrestling star and mayor of Metro City Mike Haggar and girlfriend to Cody Travers, one of the coolest and toughest boys around. But now she has been mysteriously kidnapped!  i2014kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00536na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001600005264002200021300002300043500022800066542002600294655002500320655002700345655003000372JA8P00aFinal Fight 1bCapcomc2007-4-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aJessica had it all. She was the daughter of former wrestling star and mayor of Metro City Mike Haggar and girlfriend to Cody Travers, one of the coolest and toughest boys around. But now she has been mysteriously kidnapped!  i2007kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00297na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002300027300002300050500006100073542002800134655002500162JAAE00aSuper Mario World 1bNintendoc2007-2-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe SNES Mario mega-adventure jumps onto Virtual Console  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00518na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002300027300002300050500024300073542002800316655002500344655002700369JAAJ00aSuper Mario World 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario and Luigi must once again save their favourite princess as Bowser and his minions try to take their revenge on the plumber brothers in Dinosaur Land. The Super Mario series took the Super Nintendo by storm with this instant classic.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00518na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002300027300002300050500024300073542002800316655002500344655002700369JAAP00aSuper Mario World 1bNintendoc2007-2-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aMario and Luigi must once again save their favourite princess as Bowser and his 