adventure…  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00507na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004400005264002400049300002300073500020800096542002800304655002500332655002800357JADP04aThe Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past 1bNintendoc2007-3-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aA young boy named Link leaves home on a stormy night to find and rescue Princess Zelda. You might have heard this story before, but this time saving the princess is only the beginning of the adventure…  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00505na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004500005264002100050300002300071500020800094542002800302655002500330655002800355JADT04aThe Legend of Zelda - A Link to the Past 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aA young boy named Link leaves home on a stormy night to find and rescue Princess Zelda. You might have heard this story before, but this time saving the princess is only the beginning of the adventure…  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00305na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002400005264002400029300002300053500006600076542002800142655002500170JAEE00aDonkey Kong Country 1bNintendoc2007-2-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aDonkey Kong leaves the arcade behind and heads for adventure!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00500na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002300027300002300050500022500073542002800298655002500326655002700351JAEJ00aSuper Donkey Kong 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aDonkey Kong and Diddy Kong go on a quest to recover their bananas stolen by King K.Rool. This jaw-dropping platform game revived the popular Donkey Kong franchise and became one of the biggest hits of the Super Nintendo.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00503na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264002400029300002300053500022500076542002800301655002500329655002700354JAEP00aDonkey Kong Country 1bNintendoc2006-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aDonkey Kong and Diddy Kong go on a quest to recover their bananas stolen by King K.Rool. This jaw-dropping platform game revived the popular Donkey Kong franchise and became one of the biggest hits of the Super Nintendo.  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00500na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264002100029300002300050500022500073542002800298655002500326655002700351JAET00aDonkey Kong Country 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aDonkey Kong and Diddy Kong go on a quest to recover their bananas stolen by King K.Rool. This jaw-dropping platform game revived the popular Donkey Kong franchise and became one of the biggest hits of the Super Nintendo.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00958na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001200005264002500017300002300042500063300065542002800698655002900726655002700755655004200782JAFD00aSimCity 1bNintendoc2006-12-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aSo you want to be mayor? Well, here’s your opportunity! Begin with empty land, start a town, name it after yourself, and build it into a city. Then see if you can sustain enough growth to build your city into a megalopolis! As mayor, you have the tools to overcome any challenge. Whether it's taxes, zoning, crime, transportation, fire control, pollution, natural disasters, or other critical issues, the duties as mayor are yours. For a change of pace, try saving a city burdened with problems by playing one of the eight built-in scenarios. Time is passing and every decision you make has future consequences-so get to work!  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aConstruction simulation games2wiiext00920na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001300005264002500018300002300043500063300066542002800699655002900727655004200756JAFE00aSim City 1bNintendoc2006-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aSo you want to be mayor? Well, here’s your opportunity! Begin with empty land, start a town, name it after yourself, and build it into a city. Then see if you can sustain enough growth to build your city into a megalopolis! As mayor, you have the tools to overcome any challenge. Whether it's taxes, zoning, crime, transportation, fire control, pollution, natural disasters, or other critical issues, the duties as mayor are yours. For a change of pace, try saving a city burdened with problems by playing one of the eight built-in scenarios. Time is passing and every decision you make has future consequences-so get to work!  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aConstruction simulation games2wiiext00574na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001200005264002500017300002300042500028800065542002800353655002900381655004200410JAFF00aSimCity 1bNintendoc2006-12-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aLa fameuse simulation dans laquelle le joueur doit développer une ville pour lui faire atteindre la taille d'une mégalopole. Cette version, co-développée par Maxis et Nintendo, est considérée comme la meilleure adaptation du jeu original. Elle ne sortit que sur Super Nintendo.  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aConstruction simulation games2wiiext00565na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001200005264002500017300002300042500027900065542002800344655002900372655004200401JAFJ00aSimCity 1bNintendoc2006-12-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe famous simulation in which one takes the role of a mayor and must help a new city thrive and become a megalopolis. This version, co-developed by Maxis and Nintendo, is widely considered as the best adaptation of the original game. It was only released on Super Nintendo.  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aConstruction simulation games2wiiext00565na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001200005264002500017300002300042500027900065542002800344655002900372655004200401JAFP00aSimCity 1bNintendoc2006-12-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe famous simulation in which one takes the role of a mayor and must help a new city thrive and become a megalopolis. This version, co-developed by Maxis and Nintendo, is widely considered as the best adaptation of the original game. It was only released on Super Nintendo.  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aConstruction simulation games2wiiext00198na  a2200097   4500001000500000245003400005264001500039300002300054500000500077542001800082JAGJ00aFire Emblem - Monshou no Nazo 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00808na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003700005264002200042300002300064500052200087542002600609655002500635655002600660JAHE00aR-Type III - The Third Lightning 1bJalecoc2007-1-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt was believed on Earth that the deadly BYDO Empire had been destroyed - but now they've returned, as nasty as ever. Their ships and armies are more powerful than before, and Earth will surely be conquered unless the new R-90 ship can destroy them. Powered with engines that launch it into different dimensions, and armed with the Round, Shadow and Cyclone Forces, the R-90 has what it takes to wipe out the BYDO threat. The BYDO mother ship must be found and destroyed to entirely erase the species from our galaxy.  i2007kJalecosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00440na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003700005264001900042300002300061500015900084542002400243655002500267655002600292JAHJ00aR-Type III - The Third Lightning 1bIremc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Bydo Empire is back! More powerful and deadlier than ever, the Bydo are en-route to Earth, and only you and your lone R-90 fighter stand in their way.  i2014kIremsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00440na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003600005264002000041300002300061500015900084542002400243655002500267655002600292JAHP00aR-TYPE III: The Third Lightning 1bIREMc2007-2-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Bydo Empire is back! More powerful and deadlier than ever, the Bydo are en-route to Earth, and only you and your lone R-90 fighter stand in their way.  i2007kIREMsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00438na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003700005264001700042300002300059500015900082542002400241655002500265655002600290JAHQ00aR-Type III - The Third Lightning 1bIremc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Bydo Empire is back! More powerful and deadlier than ever, the Bydo are en-route to Earth, and only you and your lone R-90 fighter stand in their way.  i2014kIremsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01080na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002500005264002300030300002300053500084000076542002600916655002800942JAIE00aSuper Castlevania IV 1bKonamic2006-12-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the peaceful country of Transylvania, there is a legend of an evil castle and its master, the Prince of Darkness, Dracula. Once every hundred years, the powers of good mysteriously weaken, and evil attempts to resurrect Dracula. It's up to the Belmont clan to take up the eternal fight against the vampire. Players take on the role of Simon Belmont, armed with the legendary whip, Vampire Killer, to defeat Dracula and his evil minions. Luckily, Simon has many additional weapons at his disposal, including axes, holy water, crosses, knives and even a magical stopwatch that can stop the flow of time for a spell. Simon must travel through 11 stages, beginning in the countryside, to reach Dracula's Castle, all the while overcoming perilous traps and hideous monsters. Only the power of the Belmonts can quell the looming darkness.  i2006kKonamisGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00589na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002100005264002100026300002300047500031900070542002600389655002500415655002700440JAIJ00aAkumajou Dracula 1bKonamic2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aA century of Transylvanian tranquility is about to come to a shocking end. Once again the mortifying screams of helpless villagers shake the ground as they huddle against new nightmarish horrors unleashed by the Duke of Darkness, Count Dracula. And this time he has a tombstone with your name on it, Simon Belmont.  i2014kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00595na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002500005264002300030300002300053500031900076542002600395655002500421655002700446JAIP00aSuper Castlevania IV 1bKonamic2006-10-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aA century of Transylvanian tranquility is about to come to a shocking end. Once again the mortifying screams of helpless villagers shake the ground as they huddle against new nightmarish horrors unleashed by the Duke of Darkness, Count Dracula. And this time he has a tombstone with your name on it, Simon Belmont.  i2006kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00817na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004100005264002300046300002300069500056200092542002600654655002700680JAJE00aStreet Fighter II: The World Warrior 1bCapcomc2006-12-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aStreet Fighter II defined gaming in the 1990s by revolutionizing the fighting-game genre. Regarded as one of the greatest games of all time, Street Fighter II: The World Warrior was the first release of the original Street Fighter II series. This game features the original eight world warriors, including Ryu, Chun-Li and Guile. Each character has his or her own fighting skills, speed, special moves and unique ending to make for a truly unique fighting-game experience. Players choose their own characters to become heroes in the Street Fighter universe.  i2006kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00795na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004200005264002100047300002300068500054100091542002600632655002700658JAJJ00aStreet Fighter II - The World Warrior 1bCapcomc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aStreet Fighter® II defined gaming in the 1990s by revolutionising the fighting game genre. Regarded as one of the greatest games of all time, Street Fighter® II: The World Warrior was the first release of the Street Fighter® II series, featuring the original eight world warriors including Ryu, Chun-Li, and Guile. Each character has his or her own fighting skills, speed, special moves, and unique ending to make for a truely unique fighting game experience. Choose your character and become a hero in the Street Fighter® universe.  i2014kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00795na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004100005264002200046300002300068500054100091542002600632655002700658JAJP00aStreet Fighter II: The World Warrior 1bCapcomc2007-1-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aStreet Fighter® II defined gaming in the 1990s by revolutionising the fighting game genre. Regarded as one of the greatest games of all time, Street Fighter® II: The World Warrior was the first release of the Street Fighter® II series, featuring the original eight world warriors including Ryu, Chun-Li, and Guile. Each character has his or her own fighting skills, speed, special moves, and unique ending to make for a truely unique fighting game experience. Choose your character and become a hero in the Street Fighter® universe.  i2007kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00851na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003100005264002200036300002300058500060900081542002600690655002500716JALE00aContra III: The Alien Wars 1bKonamic2007-1-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the year 2636, the Alien War continues, and it's up to two soldiers, Jimbo and Scully, to put a stop to the alien invasion. The aliens have ravaged the Earth with their powerful organic and technological weapons. Players can join with a partner and battle through six stages of nonstop, run-and-gun action. Collect power-ups, including bombs, flamethrowers, spread shots, lasers and machine guns to take out the aliens. Control Jimbo and Scully as they travel through war-torn cities, race on air bikes, ride missiles and ultimately break into the alien base to defeat the alien boss once and for all.  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00553na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001900005264002100024300002300045500028500068542002600353655002500379655002700404JALJ00aContra Spirits 1bKonamic2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt is the year 2636. Once again the aliens who lost in battle to the Probotectors have regained their full strength and have begun a large-scale invasion. Humans are mere rag dolls in the face of the aliens’ overwhelming resources, scientific capability and powerful life force.  i2014kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00571na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003600005264002200041300002300063500028500086542002600371655002500397655002700422JALP00aSuper Probotector: Alien Rebels 1bKonamic2007-1-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt is the year 2636. Once again the aliens who lost in battle to the Probotectors have regained their full strength and have begun a large-scale invasion. Humans are mere rag dolls in the face of the aliens’ overwhelming resources, scientific capability and powerful life force.  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00563na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003100005264001900036300002300055500028500078542002600363655002500389655002700414JALT00aContra III: The Alien Wars 1bKonamic2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt is the year 2636. Once again the aliens who lost in battle to the Probotectors have regained their full strength and have begun a large-scale invasion. Humans are mere rag dolls in the face of the aliens’ overwhelming resources, scientific capability and powerful life force.  i2014kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00572na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001600005264002200021300002300043500030700066542002600373655002500399655002600424JAME00aGradius III 1bKonamic2007-4-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aReturn as the pilot of the Vic Viper starfighter to battle the onslaughts of the Bacterion Empire. Blast through 10 action-packed levels in space, destroying everything in your path. Customize and power up your ship with weapons and upgrades including speed-ups, missiles, lasers, options, and shields.  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00456na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001600005264002100021300002300042500019200065542002600257655002500283655002600308JAMJ00aGradius III 1bKonamic2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThat wretched fiend is once again wreaking havoc on Gradius and the surrounding planets, and it’s your destiny to put an end to it. Unless you think life as an amoeba would be pleasant!  i2014kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00456na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001600005264002100021300002300042500019200065542002600257655002500283655002600308JAMM00aGradius III 1bKonamic2007-2-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aThat wretched fiend is once again wreaking havoc on Gradius and the surrounding planets, and it’s your destiny to put an end to it. Unless you think life as an amoeba would be pleasant!  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00452na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001400005264001900019300002300038500019200061542002600253655002500279655002600304JAMT00aGradius 3 1bKonamic2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThat wretched fiend is once again wreaking havoc on Gradius and the surrounding planets, and it’s your destiny to put an end to it. Unless you think life as an amoeba would be pleasant!  i2014kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00198na  a2200097   4500001000500000245003400005264001500039300002300054500000500077542001800082JAPJ00aFire Emblem - Seisen no Keifu 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00201na  a2200097   4500001000500000245003700005264001500042300002300057500000500080542001800085JAUJ00aFamicom Bunko - Hajimari no Mori 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00883na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001800005264002400023300002300047500065000070542002800720655002500748JAVE00aSuper Metroid 1bNintendoc2007-8-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Space Pirates, merciless agents of the evil Mother Brain, have stolen the last Metroid from a research station, and once again Mother Brain threatens the safety of the galaxy! Samus Aran must don her awesome array of high-tech weaponry to retrieve the deadly Metroid hidden deep within the cave-riddled planet Zebes. Super Metroid features excellent graphics, with a huge variety of enemies and worlds to explore. The side-view action will be familiar to many players, only now there are new weapons and items, including the Grappling Beam, which allows Samus to swing across large chasms, and the X-Ray Scope, which reveals secret passages.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00465na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002300023300002300046500019400069542002800263655002500291655002700316JAVJ00aSuper Metroid 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aWith the last Metroid in captivity, the galaxy is at peace. But when Space Pirates snatch the larva for their own evil purposes, bounty hunter Samus Aran must spring into action once again!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00467na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002500023300002300048500019400071542002800265655002500293655002700318JAVP00aSuper Metroid 1bNintendoc2007-10-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aWith the last Metroid in captivity, the galaxy is at peace. But when Space Pirates snatch the larva for their own evil purposes, bounty hunter Samus Aran must spring into action once again!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00463na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002100023300002300044500019400067542002800261655002500289655002700314JAVT00aSuper Metroid 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aWith the last Metroid in captivity, the galaxy is at peace. But when Space Pirates snatch the larva for their own evil purposes, bounty hunter Samus Aran must spring into action once again!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext01009na  a2200109   4500001000500000245005100005264002000056300002300076500074900099542002400848655002700872JAWE00aRomance of the Three Kingdoms IV: Wall of Fire 1bKoeic2007-3-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aRomance of the Three Kingdoms IV is a tactical simulation game in which the player takes the role of a ruler seeking to unite China in the era of the three kingdoms of Wei, Wu and Shu. The role of the ruler is to command a range of officers with differing characteristics - some cunning strategists, others brave warriors - and strengthen the military might of his or her kingdom. Foreign policy, involving forming alliances with certain kingdoms and hatching plans to weaken others, will play a major role in this process. Once players have developed a powerful enough military, it will be time to expand their borders through military conquest. Ultimate victory will only be achieved once all 43 cities in China lie within a player's control.  i2007kKoeisGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext00975na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001800005264001900023300002300042500074900065542002400814655002700838JAWJ00aSangokushi IV 1bKoeic2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aRomance of the Three Kingdoms IV is a tactical simulation game in which the player takes the role of a ruler seeking to unite China in the era of the three kingdoms of Wei, Wu and Shu. The role of the ruler is to command a range of officers with differing characteristics - some cunning strategists, others brave warriors - and strengthen the military might of his or her kingdom. Foreign policy, involving forming alliances with certain kingdoms and hatching plans to weaken others, will play a major role in this process. Once players have developed a powerful enough military, it will be time to expand their borders through military conquest. Ultimate victory will only be achieved once all 43 cities in China lie within a player's control.  i2014kKoeisGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext01214na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003300005264002200038300002300060500097000083542002601053655002501079JAZD04aThe Legend of Mystical Ninja 1bKonamic2007-3-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn The Legend of The Mystical Ninja, take control of Kid Ying and Dr. Yang in an action adventure through feudal Japan. A curse has stricken the village of Horo-Horo, and its beloved princess has vanished. Together Kid Ying, a daring young mystical ninja, and Dr. Yang, master of the invincible spirit transformation, must overcome 10 levels of the Dragonbeast to save Princess Yuki. Each stage contains intense 3-D and 2-D zones where the duo must perform dozens of attack moves and solve magical problems and puzzles before advancing. Battle humorous enemies like the Carp Meister, who stuns victims with poisonous fighting fish, Tanaka-U-Out, a knockout artist who wallops opponents with a bone-crushing hammer, and the Sumo Tag Team, kings of the unbeatable belly-buster crunch. Collect coins to buy new equipment and to receive clues, spend some time playing minigames in the arcade or try your luck and increase your fortune at the Quiz House and Horse Races.  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext01217na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003300005264002200038300002300060500097000083542002601053655002801079JAZE04aThe Legend of Mystical Ninja 1bKonamic2007-4-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn The Legend of The Mystical Ninja, take control of Kid Ying and Dr. Yang in an action adventure through feudal Japan. A curse has stricken the village of Horo-Horo, and its beloved princess has vanished. Together Kid Ying, a daring young mystical ninja, and Dr. Yang, master of the invincible spirit transformation, must overcome 10 levels of the Dragonbeast to save Princess Yuki. Each stage contains intense 3-D and 2-D zones where the duo must perform dozens of attack moves and solve magical problems and puzzles before advancing. Battle humorous enemies like the Carp Meister, who stuns victims with poisonous fighting fish, Tanaka-U-Out, a knockout artist who wallops opponents with a bone-crushing hammer, and the Sumo Tag Team, kings of the unbeatable belly-buster crunch. Collect coins to buy new equipment and to receive clues, spend some time playing minigames in the arcade or try your luck and increase your fortune at the Quiz House and Horse Races.  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00461na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004700005264002100052300002300073500016400096542002600260655002500286655002800311JAZJ00aGanbare Goemon - Yukihime Kyuushutsu Emaki 1bKonamic2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aA curse has stricken the village of Horo-Horo. Their beloved princess has vanished. And without her powers, a plague of giant locusts will ravage the helpless.  i2014kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00448na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003300005264002200038300002300060500016400083542002600247655002500273655002800298JAZP04aThe Legend of Mystical Ninja 1bKonamic2007-3-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aA curse has stricken the village of Horo-Horo. Their beloved princess has vanished. And without her powers, a plague of giant locusts will ravage the helpless.  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01020na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264009700022300002300119500059700142542010200739655002800841655002900869JB3D00aHarvest Moon 1bMarvelous Entertainment / Victor Entertainment / Pack-In-Video / Rising Star Gamesc2008-1-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou bought the farm, so now it's time to roll up your sleeves and try living off the fat of the land. Fresh air and the beauty of the outdoors will be fulfilling, but a successful farm needs a lot of working capital as well. There are buildings on your property, but they are in need of livestock. You have a modest house, but if things get lonely in the field, it's going to take a remodel to woo a female farming companion. Your challenge is to dig in and build your life as a farmer from the ground up. How you manage will determine the outcome, but remember, you always reap what you sow!  i2008kMarvelous Entertainment / Victor Entertainment / Pack-In-Video / Rising Star GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00934na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264005300022300002300075500059700098542005700695655002900752655003100781JB3E00aHarvest Moon 1bNatsume, Nintendo, Nintendo Australiac2008-2-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou bought the farm, so now it's time to roll up your sleeves and try living off the fat of the land. Fresh air and the beauty of the outdoors will be fulfilling, but a successful farm needs a lot of working capital as well. There are buildings on your property, but they are in need of livestock. You have a modest house, but if things get lonely in the field, it's going to take a remodel to woo a female farming companion. Your challenge is to dig in and build your life as a farmer from the ground up. How you manage will determine the outcome, but remember, you always reap what you sow!  i2008kNatsume, Nintendo, Nintendo AustraliasGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00685na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264009100022300002300113500027200136542009800408655002800506655002900534JB3J00aHarvest Moon 1bMarvelous Entertainment / Victor Entertainment / Pack-In-Video / Rising Star Gamesc--  a1 Wii optical disc  aReleased for the Super Nintendo in 1998, this is the first in the now legendary Harvest Moon series of farm simulation games. Starting off with nothing but a few fields and empty stables, you must build up your farm in order to reach your ultimate goal – matrimony!  ikMarvelous Entertainment / Victor Entertainment / Pack-In-Video / Rising Star GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00695na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264009700022300002300119500027200142542010200414655002800516655002900544JB3P00aHarvest Moon 1bMarvelous Entertainment / Victor Entertainment / Pack-In-Video / Rising Star Gamesc2008-1-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aReleased for the Super Nintendo in 1998, this is the first in the now legendary Harvest Moon series of farm simulation games. Starting off with nothing but a few fields and empty stables, you must build up your farm in order to reach your ultimate goal – matrimony!  i2008kMarvelous Entertainment / Victor Entertainment / Pack-In-Video / Rising Star GamessGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext00187na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002300005264001500028300002300043500000500066542001800071JB5J00aSuper Gussun Oyoyo 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00186na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002200005264001500027300002300042500000500065542001800070JB6J00aTreasure Hunter G 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00200na  a2200097   4500001000500000245003800005264001300043300002300056500000500079542001800084JB7J00aFront Mission Series - Gun Hazard 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00197na  a2200097   4500001000500000245003300005264001500038300002300053500000500076542001800081JB9J00aGakkou de atta Kowai Hanashi 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB01271na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264003500023300002300058500096600081542003801047655002701085655003701112JBAE00aMetal Marines 1bNamco Bandai Gamesc2007-10-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aSet in the near future, most of Earth's land has been disintegrated in the chaos of the Anti-matter War. This real-time strategy game portrays the Colonies’ Allied Force--the Metal Marines--in their epic struggle against General Zorgeuf and the Imperial Federation, who are bent on world domination. Commanding the Metal Marines across a series of battles, the player must strategically allocate resources, ready supplies, manage funds, and move troops in an effort to outwit and outmove the opponent. The real-time battle system rewards split-second decisions and adaptability in the struggle for military superiority. Unlike most turn-based strategy games, Metal Marines engrosses the player in a fast-paced and frantic battle in which both sides advance simultaneously. A constant eye must be kept on enemy movements to maintain a formidable defense and not miss the perfect chance to strike. Strategic foresight and quick judgment hold the key to victory.  i2007kNamco Bandai GamessGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aReal-time strategy games2wiiext01235na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001200005264001900017300002300036500096600059542002401025655002701049655003701076JBAJ00aMilitia 1bNBGIc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aSet in the near future, most of Earth's land has been disintegrated in the chaos of the Anti-matter War. This real-time strategy game portrays the Colonies’ Allied Force--the Metal Marines--in their epic struggle against General Zorgeuf and the Imperial Federation, who are bent on world domination. Commanding the Metal Marines across a series of battles, the player must strategically allocate resources, ready supplies, manage funds, and move troops in an effort to outwit and outmove the opponent. The real-time battle system rewards split-second decisions and adaptability in the struggle for military superiority. Unlike most turn-based strategy games, Metal Marines engrosses the player in a fast-paced and frantic battle in which both sides advance simultaneously. A constant eye must be kept on enemy movements to maintain a formidable defense and not miss the perfect chance to strike. Strategic foresight and quick judgment hold the key to victory.  i2014kNBGIsGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aReal-time strategy games2wiiext01063na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004900005264002200054300002300076500080100099542002600900655002700926JBBE00aSuper Street Fighter II: The New Challengers 1bCapcomc2008-1-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen Super Street Fighter II: The New Challengers debuted, the fighting-game genre was forever changed. Along with a revolutionary combo system, the game introduced a new set of challengers to fight alongside the original Street Fighter II cast. In addition to the classic characters of Ryu, Ken, Chun-Li, Guile, Blanka, E. Honda, Zangief, Dhalsim, Balrog, Vega, Sagat, and M. Bison, take control of four brand-new characters in exciting head-to-head fighting game play! Choose T. Hawk and his unmatched strength to crush your opponents, use Deejay's unrivaled kickboxing ability to defeat your opponents, unleash your inner dragon with the furious kung fu of Fei Long, and drill your rivals with the deadly beauty of Cammy. Get ready for the Street Fighter tournament and the fight of your life!  i2008kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00376na  a2200109   4500001000500000245005000005264002100055300002300076500011400099542002600213655002700239JBBJ00aSuper Street Fighter II - The New Challengers 1bCapcomc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen Super Street Fighter II - The New Challengers debuted, the fighting game genre would be changed forever.  i2014kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00450na  a2200133   4500001000500000245004900005264002200054300002300076500011400099542002600213655002500239655002700264655002500291JBBP00aSuper Street Fighter II: The New Challengers 1bCapcomc2008-1-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen Super Street Fighter II - The New Challengers debuted, the fighting game genre would be changed forever.  i2008kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00850na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002500005264002400030300002300054500057500077542002800652655002500680655002300705JBCE00aKirby's Dream Course 1bNintendoc2007-7-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aStep up to the tee for the wackiest golf game of your life. This one- or two-player game features a floating golf course in the sky. High above Dream Land, players can pitch and putt the ever-popular puff ball, Kirby, through a maze of three-dimensional obstacles on a zany checkerboard course. Players must aim for the multitude of enemies that are spread throughout each fairway. Kirby must hit all the enemies to make them disappear, and the last one becomes the hole. Sink Kirby into the hole to advance to the next stage and clear all 8 courses – 64 holes in all.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00531na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001500005264002300020300002300043500026700066542002800333655002500361655002300386JBCJ00aKirby Bowl 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aKirby’s Dream Course puts a new spin on the sport of golf, with Kirby as the ball and his enemies as obstacles! There are eight different courses to conquer, each containing eight levels packed with obstacles like water, spikes, conveyor belts and trampolines.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00542na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002500005264002400030300002300054500026700077542002800344655002500372655002300397JBCP00aKirby's Dream Course 1bNintendoc2007-5-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aKirby’s Dream Course puts a new spin on the sport of golf, with Kirby as the ball and his enemies as obstacles! There are eight different courses to conquer, each containing eight levels packed with obstacles like water, spikes, conveyor belts and trampolines.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00539na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002500005264002100030300002300051500026700074542002800341655002500369655002300394JBCT00aKirby's Dream Course 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aKirby’s Dream Course puts a new spin on the sport of golf, with Kirby as the ball and his enemies as obstacles! There are eight different courses to conquer, each containing eight levels packed with obstacles like water, spikes, conveyor belts and trampolines.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00890na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004600005264002400051300002300075500059000098542002800688655002500716655002700741JBDD00aDonkey Kong Country 2: Diddy's Kong Quest 1bNintendoc2007-5-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the sequel to the immensely popular Donkey Kong Country, Diddy Kong gets the spotlight, along with his girlfriend, Dixie Kong--a great little monkey with a dangerous ponytail. The action starts on the wreck of King K. Rool's Gangplank Galleon that has apparently broken up on a reef offshore from the Kremlings’ island. Diddy and his friends will have to work together to rescue Donkey Kong, exploring all the hidden areas of the Kremlings’ island: a spooky haunted forest, treacherous swamps, a giant beehive oozing with sticky honey, and lava-filled caves--just to name a few.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00891na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004600005264002400051300002300075500059000098542002800688655002500716655002800741JBDE00aDonkey Kong Country 2: Diddy's Kong Quest 1bNintendoc2007-5-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the sequel to the immensely popular Donkey Kong Country, Diddy Kong gets the spotlight, along with his girlfriend, Dixie Kong--a great little monkey with a dangerous ponytail. The action starts on the wreck of King K. Rool's Gangplank Galleon that has apparently broken up on a reef offshore from the Kremlings’ island. Diddy and his friends will have to work together to rescue Donkey Kong, exploring all the hidden areas of the Kremlings’ island: a spooky haunted forest, treacherous swamps, a giant beehive oozing with sticky honey, and lava-filled caves--just to name a few.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00487na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004000005264002300045300002300068500019400091542002800285655002500313655002700338JBDJ00aSuper Donkey Kong 2 - Dixie & Diddy 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aDonkey Kong has been kidnapped by the evil Kaptain K. Rool, who is demanding DK’s hard-earned banana hoard as a ransom! But there’s no way the Kongs are going to give it up that easily!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00494na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004600005264002400051300002300075500019400098542002800292655002500320655002700345JBDP00aDonkey Kong Country 2: Diddy's Kong Quest 1bNintendoc2007-5-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aDonkey Kong has been kidnapped by the evil Kaptain K. Rool, who is demanding DK’s hard-earned banana hoard as a ransom! But there’s no way the Kongs are going to give it up that easily!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00492na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004700005264002100052300002300073500019400096542002800290655002500318655002700343JBDT00aDonkey Kong Country 2 - Diddy's Kong Quest 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aDonkey Kong has been kidnapped by the evil Kaptain K. Rool, who is demanding DK’s hard-earned banana hoard as a ransom! But there’s no way the Kongs are going to give it up that easily!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00181na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001700005264001500022300002300037500000500060542001800065JBEJ00aMagical Drop 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00177na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001500005264001300020300002300033500000500056542001800061JBFJ00aOtogirisou 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00207na  a2200097   4500001000500000245004300005264001500048300002300063500000500086542001800091JBGJ00aFushigi no Dungeon 2 - Furai no Shiren 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00218na  a2200097   4500001000500000245005400005264001500059300002300074500000500097542001800102JBHJ00aHeracles no Eikou IV - Kamigami kara no Okurimono 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00728na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004500005264002200050300002300072500047000095542002600565655002700591JBIE00aStreet Fighter II' Turbo: Hyper Fighting 1bCapcomc2007-6-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aStreet Fighter II defined gaming in the 1990s by revolutionizing the fighting-game genre. Regarded as one of the greatest games of all time, Street Fighter II Turbo: Hyper Fighting was the third and final release in the original series. Featuring the eight original World Warriors (including Ryu, Chun Li and Guile) along with playable boss characters (Balrog, Sagat and M. Bison), this classic title offered enhanced playing speed and improved character balancing.  i2007kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00524na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004600005264002100051300002300072500026600095542002600361655002700387JBIJ00aStreet Fighter II' Turbo - Hyper Fighting 1bCapcomc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aStreet Fighter™ II defined gaming in the 1990s by revolutionising the fighting game genre. Regarded as one of the greatest games of all time, STREET FIGHTER™ II' TURBO: HYPER FIGHTING was the third and final release of the original Street Fighter II series.  i2014kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00524na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004500005264002200050300002300072500026600095542002600361655002700387JBIP00aStreet Fighter II' Turbo: Hyper Fighting 1bCapcomc2007-7-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aStreet Fighter™ II defined gaming in the 1990s by revolutionising the fighting game genre. Regarded as one of the greatest games of all time, STREET FIGHTER™ II' TURBO: HYPER FIGHTING was the third and final release of the original Street Fighter II series.  i2007kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext01134na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002200027300002300049500089500072542002600967655003100993JBKE00aBreath of Fire II 1bCapcomc2007-8-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing a wide range of characters and personalities and a vast, endless world to explore, Breath of Fire II is the sequel to the original smash-hit role-playing game. In a world set 500 years after the previous installment, in a frontier village known as Gate, the father and sister of a young boy known as Ryu are suddenly abducted. Strangely, all the villagers appear to have completely forgotten everything about the incident, and Ryu has instantly become an orphan. At a church, Ryu meets Bow, another orphan in a similar predicament, and they slip away from town together to begin their adventure. Take advantage of the multiple game-play viewpoints found in the game (such as the quarter-view perspective during battles that made the original game so popular) to use exciting abilities like shaman fusing and dragon transformations and help these two heroes complete their mission!  i2007kCapcomsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00427na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003700005264002100042300002300063500017400086542002600260655003100286JBKJ00aBreath of Fire II - Shimei no Ko 1bCapcomc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing a wide range of characters and personalities and a vast, endless world to explore, Breath of Fire II is the sequel to the original smash-hit role-playing game.  i2014kCapcomsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00413na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002200027300002300049500017400072542002600246655003100272JBKP00aBreath of Fire II 1bCapcomc2007-8-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing a wide range of characters and personalities and a vast, endless world to explore, Breath of Fire II is the sequel to the original smash-hit role-playing game.  i2007kCapcomsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext01185na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001500005264003400020300002300054500093500077542003801012655002501050JBLE00aPac-Attack 1bNamco Bandai Gamesc2008-1-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aPac-Man makes a rare appearance outside of a maze environment in Pac-Attack, a fun and quirky puzzle game! This unique entry in the genre puts its own twist on established conventions and adds one of gaming’s most iconic characters to the mix. The goal is simple: keep your screen clear of falling blocks and ghosts by lining up blocks horizontally, causing them to disappear. Clearing the ghosts, though, requires the help of a hungry Pac-Man (who just happens to swing by every so often for a snack). It’s up to you to get all of the ghosts lined up for him, because Pac-Man will keep eating them until he is stopped by a block or he runs out of ghosts. In addition, his range of movement on the playing field is limited to horizontal or downward—thus adding further strategy. There are three game modes to choose from: 1 Player Normal, 2 Player VS., and the challenging 1 Player Puzzle. Feel like gobbling up some ghosts?  i2008kNamco Bandai GamessGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00317na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002600005264002300031300002300054500007700077542002800154655002500182JBLJ00aCosmo Gang the Puzzle 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aPac-Man makes an appearance in Pac-Attack, a fun and quirky puzzle game!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00307na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001500005264002400020300002300044500007700067542002800144655002500172JBLP00aPac-Attack 1bNintendoc2008-6-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aPac-Man makes an appearance in Pac-Attack, a fun and quirky puzzle game!  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00895na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001600005264002200021300002300043500063100066542002500697655002500722655002600747JBNE00aDarius Twin 1bTaitoc2010-12-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor countless millennia, the space tyrant Belser and his cosmic marauders have terrorized this once-peaceful galaxy. No sector remains safe from these stellar mercenaries and their evil empire. The Galactic Federation has finally called on two of its ace pilots and their sleek Silver Hawk warships to do battle with Belser's malicious metal menaces and reclaim their beloved planet Darius. Climb into the pilot's seat for a solo mission against Belser's forces or engage the enemy with a fellow Federation pilot in a simultaneous two-player team attack. The future of the galaxy depends on the success of this perilous quest.  i2010kTaitosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00891na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001600005264001800021300002300039500063100062542002500693655002500718655002600743JBNJ00aDarius Twin 1bTaitoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor countless millennia, the space tyrant Belser and his cosmic marauders have terrorized this once-peaceful galaxy. No sector remains safe from these stellar mercenaries and their evil empire. The Galactic Federation has finally called on two of its ace pilots and their sleek Silver Hawk warships to do battle with Belser's malicious metal menaces and reclaim their beloved planet Darius. Climb into the pilot's seat for a solo mission against Belser's forces or engage the enemy with a fellow Federation pilot in a simultaneous two-player team attack. The future of the galaxy depends on the success of this perilous quest.  i2014kTaitosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01652na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001700005264001500022300002300037500147600060542001801536JBOJ00aPanel de Pon 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a인접한 좌우 패널의 위치를 바꾸어 3개 이상의 같은 패널을 가로 또는 세로로 이어지게 해서 없애 나가는 액션 퍼즐 게임입니다. 커서를 움직여서 위치를 바꿀 패널을 선택하고, a 또는 b 버튼을 누르면 패널의 위치가 바뀝니다. 아래에서 쌓여 올라오는 패널이 화면 위까지 가득 차게 되면 게임 오버입니다. 한 번에 4개 이상의 패널을 없애는 「동시에 없애기」나 패널이 없어진 곳에 떨어진 다른 패널이 다음 패널과 만나 또 다시 없어지게 되는 「연쇄 없애기」 등을 적극적으로 활용해 봅시다. 그 중에서도 가장 고급 테크닉은 「액티브 연쇄」입니다. 패널이 없어지는 동안에도 다른 패널을 움직일 수 있으므로 비어있는 곳에 패널이 떨어지기 전에 미리 패널을 옮겨두어 연속으로 없앨 수 있습니다. 간단한 조작과 쉬운 규칙으로 누구나 즐길 수 있지만 다양한 난이도의 다채로운 게임 모드가 마련되어 있어 게임을 마스터하기 위해서는 상당한 수준이 필요합니다. 특히 스토리 모드나 2인 대전 플레이에서는 패널을 동시에 없애거나 연속으로 없애면 상대방에게 「방해 패널」을 보내서 방해를 할 수 있어 더욱 흥미진진합니다. 동시에 없애기와 연쇄 없애기를 마스터해서 게임을 유리하게 이끌어 보세요.  i2014sGameTDB01650na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001700005264001300022300002300035500147600058542001801534JBOQ00aPanel de Pon 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a인접한 좌우 패널의 위치를 바꾸어 3개 이상의 같은 패널을 가로 또는 세로로 이어지게 해서 없애 나가는 액션 퍼즐 게임입니다. 커서를 움직여서 위치를 바꿀 패널을 선택하고, a 또는 b 버튼을 누르면 패널의 위치가 바뀝니다. 아래에서 쌓여 올라오는 패널이 화면 위까지 가득 차게 되면 게임 오버입니다. 한 번에 4개 이상의 패널을 없애는 「동시에 없애기」나 패널이 없어진 곳에 떨어진 다른 패널이 다음 패널과 만나 또 다시 없어지게 되는 「연쇄 없애기」 등을 적극적으로 활용해 봅시다. 그 중에서도 가장 고급 테크닉은 「액티브 연쇄」입니다. 패널이 없어지는 동안에도 다른 패널을 움직일 수 있으므로 비어있는 곳에 패널이 떨어지기 전에 미리 패널을 옮겨두어 연속으로 없앨 수 있습니다. 간단한 조작과 쉬운 규칙으로 누구나 즐길 수 있지만 다양한 난이도의 다채로운 게임 모드가 마련되어 있어 게임을 마스터하기 위해서는 상당한 수준이 필요합니다. 특히 스토리 모드나 2인 대전 플레이에서는 패널을 동시에 없애거나 연속으로 없애면 상대방에게 「방해 패널」을 보내서 방해를 할 수 있어 더욱 흥미진진합니다. 동시에 없애기와 연쇄 없애기를 마스터해서 게임을 유리하게 이끌어 보세요.  i2014sGameTDB01265na  a2200109   4500001000500000245005600005264002500061300002300086500099300109542002801102655002501130JBPE00aDonkey Kong Country 3: Dixie Kong's Double Trouble! 1bNintendoc2007-12-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aRevisit Donkey Kong Island and join the Kong family for their latest adventure. The Kremlings have a mysterious new leader named KAOS and are up to their usual mischief, even capturing Donkey Kong and Diddy Kong. Now it's up to Dixie Kong and the newest Kong, a giant infant named Kiddy, to rescue the two missing apes. They'll travel across previously unseen parts of the island in their search, and even take to the skies in a rocket at one point. Lucky for them, Dixie and Kiddy's powers complement each other (including Kiddy's talent for rolling like a barrel), so they form a powerful team capable of major Kremling damage. They're not completely on their own, either, since returning favorites like Funky Kong and Enguarde the swordfish provide help along the way. And in a series known for its abundance of secrets and high replay value, this entry doesn't disappoint, with enough hours of game play to satisfy Donkey Kong himself. Anyone else have a sudden urge for some bananas?  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00439na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004400005264002300049300002300072500014200095542002800237655002500265655002700290JBPJ00aSuper Donkey Kong 3 - Nazo no Krems Tou 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aDonkey Kong and Diddy have been captured by the Kremlings! So it’s up to Dixie Kong to team up with new sidekick Kiddy to save the day.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00455na  a2200121   4500001000500000245005800005264002500063300002300088500014200111542002800253655002500281655002700306JBPP00aDonkey Kong Country 3: Dixie Kong’s Double Trouble! 1bNintendoc2007-12-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aDonkey Kong and Diddy have been captured by the Kremlings! So it’s up to Dixie Kong to team up with new sidekick Kiddy to save the day.  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext01016na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002400027300002300051500077900074542002800853655002500881JBQE00aKirby's Avalanche 1bNintendoc2007-9-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aEveryone's favorite round, pink hero takes a break from swallowing his enemies to put your brain to work in this fast-paced puzzle game. Players take control of Kirby and match wits with well-known enemies from the Kirby series (including his archrival, King Dedede!) in an effort to win the First Annual Dream Land Avalanche Competition. The simple-but-addictive game play revolves around brightly colored blobs and boulders. When the right amount of matching blobs are stacked, they explode and rain down on your opponent's field of play! Repeat this until your screen is clear to move on to the next round. But be careful—the farther you advance, the faster the blobs fall, and the smarter the opponents get! Are you good enough to help Kirby become the avalanche king?  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00337na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002100027300002300048500010300071542002800174655002500202JBQJ00aKirby's Avalanche 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe call has gone out throughout Dream Land – the First Annual Ghost Trap Competition has begun!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00341na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002300005264002400028300002300052500010300075542002800178655002500206JBQP00aKirby's Ghost Trap 1bNintendoc2007-7-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe call has gone out throughout Dream Land – the First Annual Ghost Trap Competition has begun!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext01141na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264002500022300002300047500087400070542002800944655002300972655002400995JBRE00aVegas Stakes 1bNintendoc2007-11-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeel like taking a road trip to Las Vegas? Let your inner high roller go wild as you try your luck at five different games—black jack, slots, poker, craps, and roulette. Start with only $1,000 in your pocket and play your way through five casinos, each with a different theme and varying limits. But no one wants to gamble alone, right? Not a problem, as you’ll be able to choose one of four friends to tag along and offer advice when you need it. Further enhancing the experience is the fact that you’ll be presented with a slew of interactions with random casino patrons. Best be careful, though—your choices in these situations could either get you closer to the millions of dollars you’re after or cost you a pile of that hard-earned cash. Roll the dice, spin the wheel, hit or stand—do whatever it takes to stake your claim in Vegas and beat the house!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aCard games2wiiext 7aPoker games2wiiext00434na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001700005264002300022300002300045500013300068542002800201655002400229655002300253655002400276JBRJ00aVegas Stakes 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience all the thrills and skills of real casino action, as you take a trip to the ultimate gambler’s paradise: Las Vegas!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aBoard games2wiiext 7aCard games2wiiext 7aPoker games2wiiext00435na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001700005264002400022300002300046500013300069542002800202655002400230655002300254655002400277JBRP00aVegas Stakes 1bNintendoc2007-8-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience all the thrills and skills of real casino action, as you take a trip to the ultimate gambler’s paradise: Las Vegas!  i2007kNintendosGameTDB 7aBoard games2wiiext 7aCard games2wiiext 7aPoker games2wiiext00924na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001100005264002300016300002300039500066300062542002600725655002500751655002600776JBSE00aAxelay 1bKonamic2007-11-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aMysterious aliens have invaded the Earth-like planet of Corliss, slowly draining the planet’s resources. Take control of the prototype Axelay ship and utilize its wide range of advanced weaponry to battle the enemy forces. Play through multiple stages of action ranging from other planets to space stations, all on your way to destroying the alien headquarters. Be careful not to be too distracted by the excellent graphics (including great scrolling effects) or rocking music, though; you’re Corliss’s last line of defense! Pilot the Axelay using Konami’s famously tight play control and experience what many consider a classic of the shooter genre!  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00922na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001100005264002100016300002300037500066300060542002600723655002500749655002600774JBSJ00aAxelay 1bKonamic2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aMysterious aliens have invaded the Earth-like planet of Corliss, slowly draining the planet’s resources. Take control of the prototype Axelay ship and utilize its wide range of advanced weaponry to battle the enemy forces. Play through multiple stages of action ranging from other planets to space stations, all on your way to destroying the alien headquarters. Be careful not to be too distracted by the excellent graphics (including great scrolling effects) or rocking music, though; you’re Corliss’s last line of defense! Pilot the Axelay using Konami’s famously tight play control and experience what many consider a classic of the shooter genre!  i2014kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00924na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001100005264002300016300002300039500066300062542002600725655002500751655002600776JBSP00aAxelay 1bKonamic2007-10-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aMysterious aliens have invaded the Earth-like planet of Corliss, slowly draining the planet’s resources. Take control of the prototype Axelay ship and utilize its wide range of advanced weaponry to battle the enemy forces. Play through multiple stages of action ranging from other planets to space stations, all on your way to destroying the alien headquarters. Be careful not to be too distracted by the excellent graphics (including great scrolling effects) or rocking music, though; you’re Corliss’s last line of defense! Pilot the Axelay using Konami’s famously tight play control and experience what many consider a classic of the shooter genre!  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00895na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001900005264002300024300002300047500062200070542002800692655002500720655002800745JBTE00aSuper Turrican 1bFactor 5c2008-3-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou are Bren McGuire, on a United Planets Freedom Forces mission to save the peaceful planet Katakis from the Machine, source of all that is cruel and evil in the universe. The only weapon on your side is the state-of-the-art Turrican Assault Suit. Equipped with multiple weapons, including the incredible Freeze-Beam that temporarily immobilizes almost any enemy, the Turrican Assault Suit gives one man the power of an entire army. Use the myriad weapons and powers at your disposal to fight through 12 increasingly insane levels, free the innocent residents of the planet Katakis, and crush the oppressive Machine.  i2008kFactor 5sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00932na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001900005264002100024300002300045500062200068542002800690655002500718655002800743655002700771JBTJ00aSuper Turrican 1bFactor 5c2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou are Bren McGuire, on a United Planets Freedom Forces mission to save the peaceful planet Katakis from the Machine, source of all that is cruel and evil in the universe. The only weapon on your side is the state-of-the-art Turrican Assault Suit. Equipped with multiple weapons, including the incredible Freeze-Beam that temporarily immobilizes almost any enemy, the Turrican Assault Suit gives one man the power of an entire army. Use the myriad weapons and powers at your disposal to fight through 12 increasingly insane levels, free the innocent residents of the planet Katakis, and crush the oppressive Machine.  i2014kFactor 5sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00935na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001900005264002400024300002300048500062200071542002800693655002500721655002800746655002700774JBTP00aSuper Turrican 1bFactor 5c2008-2-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou are Bren McGuire, on a United Planets Freedom Forces mission to save the peaceful planet Katakis from the Machine, source of all that is cruel and evil in the universe. The only weapon on your side is the state-of-the-art Turrican Assault Suit. Equipped with multiple weapons, including the incredible Freeze-Beam that temporarily immobilizes almost any enemy, the Turrican Assault Suit gives one man the power of an entire army. Use the myriad weapons and powers at your disposal to fight through 12 increasingly insane levels, free the innocent residents of the planet Katakis, and crush the oppressive Machine.  i2008kFactor 5sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00787na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002100005264002400026300002300050500051100073542002800584655002500612655002800637JBUE00aSuper Turrican 2 1bFactor 5c2008-9-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs the last survivor of the United Freedom Forces, it is your duty to destroy the Machine's forces that have devastated the galaxy. Fight through countless hordes of enemies using everything at your disposal. Use weapons and power-ups to fight back the tide of oncoming enemies. Use your special abilities, like the Energy Wheel and Cyberfist, to find secret areas and score extra lives. When your lives and continues are gone, the mission ends. You are the galaxy's last hope. Are you up to the challenge?  i2008kFactor 5sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00786na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002300005264002100028300002300049500051100072542002800583655002500611655002800636JBUJ00aSuper Turrican Two 1bFactor 5c2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs the last survivor of the United Freedom Forces, it is your duty to destroy the Machine's forces that have devastated the galaxy. Fight through countless hordes of enemies using everything at your disposal. Use weapons and power-ups to fight back the tide of oncoming enemies. Use your special abilities, like the Energy Wheel and Cyberfist, to find secret areas and score extra lives. When your lives and continues are gone, the mission ends. You are the galaxy's last hope. Are you up to the challenge?  i2014kFactor 5sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00183na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001900005264001500024300002300039500000500062542001800067JBVJ00aDer Langrisser 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB01255na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001500005264005100020300002300071500097200094542005401066655002501120JBWE00aCybernator 1bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2007-12-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt is the near future, resources are dwindling, and the major powers of the world are in dispute over territory. Pilot the Cybernator G5-E for the 95th brigade of the mechanized marines, and throw yourself into the war. Get briefed before each mission to confirm your targets, and then do your best to clear each of the seven stages, freely using the suit’s equipped tools and four types of weaponry. By collecting the “power chips” left by defeated enemies, it is also possible to reinforce each weapon up to a maximum of three levels. It is left to your judgment as to whether to reinforce a specific weapon or to power up all weapons simultaneously, adding a bit of strategy to the nonstop action. The powerful background music, military-like atmosphere (look for bullet marks on the walls and the strained communication during combat), and intense story development combine to give the world of Cybernator a gritty, sci-fi feel that you won’t soon forget.  i2007kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00487na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002300005264002100028300002300049500025400072542002600326655002500352JBWJ00aJusou Kihei Valken 1bKonamic2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt is the near future. Resources are dwindling and the major powers of the world are locked in a territorial dispute. As Pacific States Marine Corps soldier Jake, you must lead your platoon on a deadly mission to destroy the enemy's ultimate weapon.  i2014kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00480na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001500005264002200020300002300042500025400065542002600319655002500345JBWP00aCybernator 1bKonamic2007-12-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt is the near future. Resources are dwindling and the major powers of the world are locked in a territorial dispute. As Pacific States Marine Corps soldier Jake, you must lead your platoon on a deadly mission to destroy the enemy's ultimate weapon.  i2007kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00477na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001500005264001900020300002300039500025400062542002600316655002500342JBWT00aCybernator 1bKonamic2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt is the near future. Resources are dwindling and the major powers of the world are locked in a territorial dispute. As Pacific States Marine Corps soldier Jake, you must lead your platoon on a deadly mission to destroy the enemy's ultimate weapon.  i2014kKonamisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00885na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264002000022300002300042500062300065542002400688655002500712655002600737JBYE00aSuper R-Type 1bIREMc2008-3-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aA galactic battle begins! The BYDO Empire of mutant extraterrestrials is back with evil intent and awesome power. Now the evil empire is poised to launch a new attack on Earth. Only the revolutionary R-9, the planet’s most advanced form of defense, stands between these monsters and doom. Fight through seven challenging stages—picking up power-up items as you progress—on the way to each stage’s memorable boss. Is the BYDO Empire invincible? You’ll need lightning reflexes, intuitive moves, and a big dose of cosmic luck to hold your own! Better prepare yourself, because the mutants “R” ready for you!  i2008kIREMsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00309na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264002800022300002300050500003000073542003300103655002500136655002600161JBYJ00aSuper R-Type 1bIrem Softwarec2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aA galactic battle begins!  i2014kIrem SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00292na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264002000022300002300042500003000065542002400095655002500119655002600144JBYP00aSuper R-Type 1bIREMc2008-3-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aA galactic battle begins!  i2008kIREMsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00307na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264002600022300002300048500003000071542003300101655002500134655002600159JBYT00aSuper R-Type 1bIrem Softwarec2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aA galactic battle begins!  i2014kIrem SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00183na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002100005264001300026300002300039500000500062542001800067JC2J00aTaikou Risshiden 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00181na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001900005264001300024300002300037500000500060542001800065JC3J00aBahamut Lagoon 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00675na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003900005264002600044300002300070500037900093542002900472655002500501655002700526JC4E00aIndiana Jones' Greatest Adventures 1bLucasArtsc2009-11-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your trusty whip and slash your way through all three Indy classics in this no-thrills-barred adventure. If it happened in the movies, it happens here: the giant boulder from Raiders of the Lost Ark, the mine-cart chase from Temple of Doom, the three trials from Last Crusade, Rene Belloq and Colonel Vogel – it's three times the action, all in one fully loaded game.  i2009kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00665na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003400005264002200039300002300061500037800084542002900462655002500491655002700516JC4J00aIndiana Jones Great Adventure 1bLucasArtsc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your trusty whip and slash your way through all three Indy classics in this no-holds-barred adventure. If it happened in the movies, it happens here: the giant boulder from Raiders of the Lost Ark, the mine-cart chase from Temple of Doom, the three trials from Last Crusade, René Belloq and Colonel Vogel – it's three times the action, all in one fully loaded game.  i2014kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00673na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003900005264002500044300002300069500037800092542002900470655002500499655002700524JC4P00aIndiana Jones' Greatest Adventures 1bLucasArtsc2010-4-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your trusty whip and slash your way through all three Indy classics in this no-holds-barred adventure. If it happened in the movies, it happens here: the giant boulder from Raiders of the Lost Ark, the mine-cart chase from Temple of Doom, the three trials from Last Crusade, René Belloq and Colonel Vogel – it's three times the action, all in one fully loaded game.  i2010kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00183na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001900005264001500024300002300039500000500062542001800067JC5J00aRomancing SaGa 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00185na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002100005264001500026300002300041500000500064542001800069JC6J00aRomancing SaGa 2 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00874na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002000005264002800025300002300053500059300076542003100669655002500700655002700725JC7E04aThe Combatribes 1bAksys Gamesc2009-11-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe evil gang known as "Guilty Zero" rules the city and it's up to you as one of the members of the Combatribes to take them down. Choose one of three characters and fight your way through the city of New York. Progress through the game by tackling the goons and boss of each stage using your arsenal of kicks, punches, throws, and other techniques to beat them into submission. Once your stamina bar is reduced to zero, you'll need to use a continue, but when you're out of continues, it's game over. Can you eliminate the threat of "Guilty Zero" and restore the peace in New York City!?  i2009kAksys GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00870na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002000005264002400025300002300049500059300072542003100665655002500696655002700721JC7J04aThe Combatribes 1bAksys Gamesc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe evil gang known as "Guilty Zero" rules the city and it's up to you as one of the members of the Combatribes to take them down. Choose one of three characters and fight your way through the city of New York. Progress through the game by tackling the goons and boss of each stage using your arsenal of kicks, punches, throws, and other techniques to beat them into submission. Once your stamina bar is reduced to zero, you'll need to use a continue, but when you're out of continues, it's game over. Can you eliminate the threat of "Guilty Zero" and restore the peace in New York City!?  i2014kAksys GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00388na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002100005264002600026300002300052500014100075542003100216655003100247JC8E00aFinal Fantasy II 1bSquare Enixc2010-3-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aOriginally released as FINAL FANTASY II on SNES in North America, this game is in fact FINAL FANTASY IV from the main series chronology.  i2010kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00388na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002100005264002600026300002300052500014100075542003100216655003100247JC8J00aFinal Fantasy IV 1bSquare Enixc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aOriginally released as FINAL FANTASY II on SNES in North America, this game is in fact FINAL FANTASY IV from the main series chronology.  i2014kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00389na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002100005264002700026300002300053500014100076542003100217655003100248JC8M00aFinal Fantasy II 1bSquare Enixc2010-6-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aOriginally released as FINAL FANTASY II on SNES in North America, this game is in fact FINAL FANTASY IV from the main series chronology.  i2010kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00388na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002700025300002300052500014100075542003100216655003100247JC8P00aFinal Fantasy 2 1bSquare Enixc2010-6-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aOriginally released as FINAL FANTASY II on SNES in North America, this game is in fact FINAL FANTASY IV from the main series chronology.  i2010kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00182na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002000005264001300025300002300038500000500061542001800066JC9J00aFinal Fantasy V 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00925na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004900005264004100054300002300095500062600118542004600744655002500790JCAJ00aDoReMi Fantasy - Milon no DokiDoki Daibouken 1bHudson Entertainment, Inc.c2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is an action game where an energetic boy named Milon sets off on a great adventure in a cute fairy-tale world. Piccolo is a village in the country of Fantasia. One day, they hear from the fairy Alis that songs and music have disappeared from the forest. Suddenly the wizard Amon appears, grabs Alis, and vanishes with her. The brave Milon must now go on a journey to rescue his kidnapped friend, with his bubble shooter as his only weapon. Along the way, he’ll need to retrieve five legendary instruments and stars by defeating Amon’s minions. Get ready to enjoy the fun and comical action of this charming game!  i2014kHudson Entertainment, Inc.sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00462na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004800005264004900053300002300102500010900125542005400234655002500288655002700313JCAL00aDoReMi Fantasy - Milon's DokiDoki Adventure 1bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2008-9-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aDive into the cute fairy-tale world of Fantasia for this exciting Super Nintendo action-platformer game!  i2008kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00940na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004700005264005000052300002300102500062600125542005400751655002500805JCAN00aDoReMi Fantasy: Milon's DokiDoki Adventure 1bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2008-3-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is an action game where an energetic boy named Milon sets off on a great adventure in a cute fairy-tale world. Piccolo is a village in the country of Fantasia. One day, they hear from the fairy Alis that songs and music have disappeared from the forest. Suddenly the wizard Amon appears, grabs Alis, and vanishes with her. The brave Milon must now go on a journey to rescue his kidnapped friend, with his bubble shooter as his only weapon. Along the way, he’ll need to retrieve five legendary instruments and stars by defeating Amon’s minions. Get ready to enjoy the fun and comical action of this charming game!  i2008kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext01195na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002300025300002300048500095500071542002801026655003101054JCBE00aSuper Mario RPG 1bNintendoc2008-9-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aSet in the Mushroom Kingdom and featuring its cast of well-known characters, this adventure RPG begins with a familiar scenario: Mario must rescue Princess Toadstool from Bowser. However, a mysterious new enemy named Smithy soon appears, and Mario and Bowser are forced to fight as allies for the first time in their long history. In the quest to defeat their powerful new foe, they’ll journey across a wide variety of locations (a town of mining moles, a tropical forest, a thundering waterfall—just to name a few) and tackle a mix of obstacles requiring both expert timing and strategy to overcome. Along the way, they’ll gain experience and grow more powerful, while also meeting new characters whose unique abilities will be needed to take on Smithy and his gang. Striking a perfect balance of traditional RPG elements and the action-packed game play Mario is famous for, it’s easy to see why this title has earned “legendary” status!  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00442na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002300025300002300048500020200071542002800273655003100301JCBJ00aSuper Mario RPG 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis legendary role-playing game comes to PAL regions for the first time! Designed by the RPG experts at Square (now Square Enix), Super Mario RPG is satisfyingly deep yet easy to pick up and play.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00443na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002400025300002300049500020200072542002800274655003100302JCBM00aSuper Mario RPG 1bNintendoc2008-8-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis legendary role-playing game comes to PAL regions for the first time! Designed by the RPG experts at Square (now Square Enix), Super Mario RPG is satisfyingly deep yet easy to pick up and play.  i2008kNintendosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext01301na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002100005264002400026300002300050500106500073542002801138655002501166JCCE00aKirby Super Star 1bNintendoc2010-5-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aThat awful King Dedede is at it again—he’s stolen all the food in Dream Land! It’s up to Kirby to get it back…and ultimately save Pop Star from being taken over. In what may be the most diverse adventure yet for the round, pink hero, he journeys through six main games and two minigames, finishing with the ultimate showdown in The Arena. Each game offers its own story and variation of platforming action, as well as unique environments and an assortment of enemies. Speaking of which, swallowing an enemy allows Kirby to copy the abilities of that enemy, granting him the power to perform special attacks and giving him a new hat to don. Adding a strategic twist, Kirby can now give up an acquired ability and use it to instead turn an enemy into a helper. The helper will follow Kirby around and automatically fight as his ally—or offer a second player the chance to join in the game by controlling it. There’s never a dull moment as Kirby dashes, flies, and swallows enemies in his battle against King Dedede, Dyna Blade, Meta Knight, and more!  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext01311na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003200005264002300037300002300060500106500083542002801148655002501176JCCJ00aHoshi no Kirby Super Deluxe 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThat awful King Dedede is at it again—he’s stolen all the food in Dream Land! It’s up to Kirby to get it back…and ultimately save Pop Star from being taken over. In what may be the most diverse adventure yet for the round, pink hero, he journeys through six main games and two minigames, finishing with the ultimate showdown in The Arena. Each game offers its own story and variation of platforming action, as well as unique environments and an assortment of enemies. Speaking of which, swallowing an enemy allows Kirby to copy the abilities of that enemy, granting him the power to perform special attacks and giving him a new hat to don. Adding a strategic twist, Kirby can now give up an acquired ability and use it to instead turn an enemy into a helper. The helper will follow Kirby around and automatically fight as his ally—or offer a second player the chance to join in the game by controlling it. There’s never a dull moment as Kirby dashes, flies, and swallows enemies in his battle against King Dedede, Dyna Blade, Meta Knight, and more!  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext01300na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002400025300002300049500106500072542002801137655002501165JCCP00aKirby's Fun Pak 1bNintendoc2010-5-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aThat awful King Dedede is at it again—he’s stolen all the food in Dream Land! It’s up to Kirby to get it back…and ultimately save Pop Star from being taken over. In what may be the most diverse adventure yet for the round, pink hero, he journeys through six main games and two minigames, finishing with the ultimate showdown in The Arena. Each game offers its own story and variation of platforming action, as well as unique environments and an assortment of enemies. Speaking of which, swallowing an enemy allows Kirby to copy the abilities of that enemy, granting him the power to perform special attacks and giving him a new hat to don. Adding a strategic twist, Kirby can now give up an acquired ability and use it to instead turn an enemy into a helper. The helper will follow Kirby around and automatically fight as his ally—or offer a second player the chance to join in the game by controlling it. There’s never a dull moment as Kirby dashes, flies, and swallows enemies in his battle against King Dedede, Dyna Blade, Meta Knight, and more!  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00884na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002500005264002300030300002300053500064500076542002800721655002500749JCDE00aKirby's Dream Land 3 1bNintendoc2009-1-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aKirby, Dream Land's resident hero (and everyone's favorite puffball), must once again save the day when the mischievous King Dedede starts causing trouble. Kirby must travel through an assortment of levels, battling an exotic array of enemies (both new and familiar) determined to stop him from completing his mission. Always armed with his trusty ability to swallow enemies and gain special attacks, Kirby can also unite with some of his animal friends and make use of their particular talents. Featuring detailed graphics, challenging boss battles and the distinct charm of a Kirby game, it's no wonder this title is considered a classic.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00614na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002100005264002300026300002300049500034000072542002800412655002500440655002700465JCDJ00aHoshi no Kirby 3 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe mischievous King Dedede is back! Now possessed by an evil force, the king is causing trouble and strife all over Dream Land, and only Kirby, the powerful pink puffball, can save the day! Previously released only in Japan and the U.S., Kirby’s Dream Land 3 features crisp, colourful 2D graphics and a simultaneous two-player mode.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00619na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002500005264002400030300002300054500034000077542002800417655002500445655002700470JCDM00aKirby's Dream Land 3 1bNintendoc2009-7-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe mischievous King Dedede is back! Now possessed by an evil force, the king is causing trouble and strife all over Dream Land, and only Kirby, the powerful pink puffball, can save the day! Previously released only in Japan and the U.S., Kirby’s Dream Land 3 features crisp, colourful 2D graphics and a simultaneous two-player mode.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00194na  a2200097   4500001000500000245003000005264001500035300002300050500000500073542001800078JCEJ00aFire Emblem - Thracia 776 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00214na  a2200097   4500001000500000245005000005264001500055300002300070500000500093542001800098JCGJ00aGanbare Goemon 2 - Kiteretsu Shogun Magginesu 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00226na  a2200097   4500001000500000245006400005264001300069300002300082500000500105542001800110JCHJ00aGanbare Goemon 3 - Shishijuurokube no Karakuri Manji Gatame 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00221na  a2200097   4500001000500000245005700005264001500062300002300077500000500100542001800105JCIJ00aFamicom Tantei Club Part II - Ushiro ni Tatsu Shoujo 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00953na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002400027300002300051500067900074542002800753655002500781655002500806JCJE00aSuper Punch-Out!! 1bNintendoc2009-3-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing the tight game play and humor the series is known for, this sequel to the NES classic sees Little Mac return to the ring with the World Video Boxing Association belt once again at stake. Slug your way through the grueling, sweat-pounding matches of the Minor, Major, and World Circuits as you face off against some of Little Mac’s greatest rivals like Bear Hugger, Bald Bull, and Super Macho Man. With a cast of new challengers waiting, do you have what it takes to identify their unique patterns and exploit their weaknesses? Go to your corner and come out fighting, but remember what Doc Louis would say, “It’s not about brawling—it’s about finesse!”  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext00952na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002300027300002300050500067900073542002800752655002500780655002500805JCJJ00aSuper Punch-Out!! 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing the tight game play and humor the series is known for, this sequel to the NES classic sees Little Mac return to the ring with the World Video Boxing Association belt once again at stake. Slug your way through the grueling, sweat-pounding matches of the Minor, Major, and World Circuits as you face off against some of Little Mac’s greatest rivals like Bear Hugger, Bald Bull, and Super Macho Man. With a cast of new challengers waiting, do you have what it takes to identify their unique patterns and exploit their weaknesses? Go to your corner and come out fighting, but remember what Doc Louis would say, “It’s not about brawling—it’s about finesse!”  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext00953na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002400027300002300051500067900074542002800753655002500781655002500806JCJP00aSuper Punch-Out!! 1bNintendoc2009-3-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing the tight game play and humor the series is known for, this sequel to the NES classic sees Little Mac return to the ring with the World Video Boxing Association belt once again at stake. Slug your way through the grueling, sweat-pounding matches of the Minor, Major, and World Circuits as you face off against some of Little Mac’s greatest rivals like Bear Hugger, Bald Bull, and Super Macho Man. With a cast of new challengers waiting, do you have what it takes to identify their unique patterns and exploit their weaknesses? Go to your corner and come out fighting, but remember what Doc Louis would say, “It’s not about brawling—it’s about finesse!”  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBoxing games2wiiext01006na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003800005264002200043300002300065500072000088542002500808655002500833655002600858JCKE00aSpace Invaders: The Original Game 1bTaitoc2008-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience one of gaming’s iconic franchises in this perfect rendition of the arcade classic! Take aim at the field of invaders relentlessly marching toward you. Move quickly, but carefully, and use the barriers for protection as you avoid missiles fired by the aliens and try to destroy all of them before they reach the bottom of the screen. Further enhance the nostalgia by choosing from several modes that simulate different versions of the arcade game (such as upright cabinet or black and white). Or if you want to prove your superior skills to a friend, try the brand-new VS mode and see who can stop the alien menace the quickest. All in all, it’s pure gaming at its best, now with no quarters required!  i2008kTaitosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00383na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003900005264002000044300002300064500009800087542002500185655002500210655002600235JCKJ00aSpace Invaders - The Original Game 1bTaitoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience one of gaming's iconic franchises in this perfect rendition of the arcade classic!  i2014kTaitosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00385na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003900005264002200044300002300066500009800089542002500187655002500212655002600237JCKP00aSpace Invaders - The Original Game 1bTaitoc2008-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience one of gaming's iconic franchises in this perfect rendition of the arcade classic!  i2008kTaitosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01089na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001900005264002800024300002300052500084200075542003100917655003100948JCLD00aSecret of Mana 1bSquare Enixc2008-12-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aGood and evil battle for a young warrior's heart. There is one force in the universe that keeps good and evil in perfect balance. It is called the tree of Mana. But a magic sword has tricked a young warrior into upsetting this balance, spreading evil throughout the land. Thus, the warrior must undertake a dangerous journey to find the seeds of the Mana tree which have been hidden for centuries. Only then can perfect harmony be restored. In this incredible adventure, things are not as they seem. Magic swords release evil as well as fight it. Treasure chests hold booby traps. Monsters are friends and friends are enemies. Potions give power, black magic takes it away. Dragons fly, weapons change. It's a world turned upside down that you must help the warrior make right. And the only way to succeed is to solve the Secret of Mana.  i2008kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext01089na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001900005264002800024300002300052500084200075542003100917655003100948JCLE00aSecret of Mana 1bSquare Enixc2008-10-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aGood and evil battle for a young warrior's heart. There is one force in the universe that keeps good and evil in perfect balance. It is called the tree of Mana. But a magic sword has tricked a young warrior into upsetting this balance, spreading evil throughout the land. Thus, the warrior must undertake a dangerous journey to find the seeds of the Mana tree which have been hidden for centuries. Only then can perfect harmony be restored. In this incredible adventure, things are not as they seem. Magic swords release evil as well as fight it. Treasure chests hold booby traps. Monsters are friends and friends are enemies. Potions give power, black magic takes it away. Dragons fly, weapons change. It's a world turned upside down that you must help the warrior make right. And the only way to succeed is to solve the Secret of Mana.  i2008kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00362na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001900005264002800024300002300052500007800075542003100153655002500184655003100209JCLF00aSecret of Mana 1bSquare Enixc2008-12-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the epic battle as good and evil battle for a young warrior's heart!  i2008kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00363na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002600027300002300053500007800076542003100154655002500185655003100210JCLJ00aSeiken Densetsu 2 1bSquare Enixc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the epic battle as good and evil battle for a young warrior's heart!  i2014kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00362na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001900005264002800024300002300052500007800075542003100153655002500184655003100209JCLP00aSecret of Mana 1bSquare Enixc2008-12-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the epic battle as good and evil battle for a young warrior's heart!  i2008kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00185na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002100005264001500026300002300041500000500064542001800069JCMJ00aSuper Wagan Land 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00922na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002100005264002200026300002300048500065000071542002700721655002500748655002700773JCNE00aPrince of Persia 1bUbisoftc2012-9-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Grand Vizier Jaffar has thrown a young prince into the dungeon. Jaffar has forced the prince’s beloved to choose between marrying Jaffar or death. Take on the role of the prince and try to escape from the dungeon. Beware of obstacles such as unpredictable floors and ceilings, hidden spikes and walls of flames. Pass through invisible doors and walk through portals. Find bottles of magic potions, but partake of them wisely – they could increase your life or, just as easily, they might poison you. Survive all of the perilous levels, rescue the princess from the evil Jaffar and claim the royal residence before the hourglass is empty.  i2012kUbisoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00920na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002100005264002000026300002300046500065000069542002700719655002500746655002700771JCNJ00aPrince of Persia 1bUbisoftc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Grand Vizier Jaffar has thrown a young prince into the dungeon. Jaffar has forced the prince’s beloved to choose between marrying Jaffar or death. Take on the role of the prince and try to escape from the dungeon. Beware of obstacles such as unpredictable floors and ceilings, hidden spikes and walls of flames. Pass through invisible doors and walk through portals. Find bottles of magic potions, but partake of them wisely – they could increase your life or, just as easily, they might poison you. Survive all of the perilous levels, rescue the princess from the evil Jaffar and claim the royal residence before the hourglass is empty.  i2014kUbisoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00464na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002100005264002300026300002300049500015100072542002700223655002500250655002800275655002700303JCNP00aPrince of Persia 1bUbisoftc2012-1-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe classic Prince of Persia is now available for download! Relive this classic game that is often heralded as a pioneer of the platforming genre.  i2012kUbisoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00827na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004600005264002600051300002300077500055500100542003100655655003100686JCTE00aOgre Battle: The March of the Black Queen 1bSquare Enixc2009-3-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's up to you to defeat the Empire! It's been nearly a quarter of a century since the Zetegenian Empire first conquered the Kingdoms of Zenobia through wrath, fear, and bloodshed. You are the leader of a band of rebels who have fought to preserve the last shred of honor in this desperate time of treachery. Manage the ranks of a full-blown rebel army, complete with hundreds of characters, magic items, weapons, and mystical Tarot cards. You must succeed in ousting the evil usurpers, as your fate, and that of the entire population, depends on it!  i2009kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00386na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002800005264002600033300002300059500004100082542003100123655003100154655002700185655004000212JCTJ00aDensetsu no Ogre Battle 1bSquare Enixc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's up to you to defeat the Empire!  i2014kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aTactical role-playing games2wiiext00404na  a2200133   4500001000500000245004600005264002600051300002300077500004100100542003100141655003100172655002700203655004000230JCTM00aOgre Battle: The March of the Black Queen 1bSquare Enixc2009-7-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's up to you to defeat the Empire!  i2009kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aTactical role-playing games2wiiext01155na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001700005264002300022300002300045500092000068542002800988655002901016JCUJ00aTactics Ogre 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the Flight Club to take to the skies and experience a variety of aerial activities. Take off and pilot a biplane through rings along a predetermined flight path, or drift serenely in a hang glider, catching thermal currents to gain altitude. In either case, just be sure to stick the landing. Looking for more speed? Strap on the rocket belt to blast your way around an obstacle course. If that's not enough, reach maximum velocity as you tackle a skydiving lesson at 3,800 feet. Complete specific objectives within a set time limit to score points (and maybe even a bonus chance) and obtain certification in eight different lessons. Your goals will become more challenging, and weather conditions will make controlling your vehicle more difficult as you progress. If you succeed, you will be rewarded with the opportunity to pilot an attack helicopter on a daring rescue mission. It's time to earn your wings.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext01203na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001500005264002500020300002300045500092000068542002800988655002901016655003601045JCVE00aPilotwings 1bNintendoc2009-12-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the Flight Club to take to the skies and experience a variety of aerial activities. Take off and pilot a biplane through rings along a predetermined flight path, or drift serenely in a hang glider, catching thermal currents to gain altitude. In either case, just be sure to stick the landing. Looking for more speed? Strap on the rocket belt to blast your way around an obstacle course. If that's not enough, reach maximum velocity as you tackle a skydiving lesson at 3,800 feet. Complete specific objectives within a set time limit to score points (and maybe even a bonus chance) and obtain certification in eight different lessons. Your goals will become more challenging, and weather conditions will make controlling your vehicle more difficult as you progress. If you succeed, you will be rewarded with the opportunity to pilot an attack helicopter on a daring rescue mission. It's time to earn your wings.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFlight simulation games2wiiext00441na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001500005264002100020300002300041500021000064542002800274655002900302JCVJ00aPilotwings 1bNintendoc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Pilotwings Flight Club, where your career can really soar! Produced by the legendary Shigeru Miyamoto, this Super Nintendo classic wowed audiences by putting a fun new spin on flight simulation.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00444na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001500005264002400020300002300044500021000067542002800277655002900305JCVP00aPilotwings 1bNintendoc2009-8-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Pilotwings Flight Club, where your career can really soar! Produced by the legendary Shigeru Miyamoto, this Super Nintendo classic wowed audiences by putting a fun new spin on flight simulation.  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext01179na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002100005264002500026300002300051500090000074542002800974655002501002655003001027JCWE00aSuper Mario Kart 1bNintendoc2009-11-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet-in, sit-down, and buckle-up to experience frantic kart racing with the game that started it all. Select one of eight characters from the Mario series—offering a variety of driving styles—and take on three championship cups in three different kart classes. Win enough and you’ll unlock a fourth circuit: the ultra-tough Special Cup. Crossing the finish line in first place isn’t an easy task though, as each track has unique obstacles to conquer and racers can obtain special power-ups that boost them to victory. For a different kind of challenge, take on a friend in multiplayer races or go head-to-head in the Battle Mode arena of your choosing, where the object is to pop your opponent’s balloons before you lose your own. With more than 15 tracks to master and nearly endless replay value, Super Mario Kart is classic gaming…with some banana peels thrown in for good measure!  i2009kNintendosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00478na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002100005264002300026300002300049500020100072542002800273655002500301655003000326JCWJ00aSuper Mario Kart 1bNintendoc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aStart your engines for the original, legendary Super Mario Kart! Consistently ranked as one of the best video games ever made, it launched the kart racing genre and spawned five smash hit sequels.  i2014kNintendosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00514na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002100005264002300026300002300049500020100072542002800273655002500301655002400326655003000350JCWP00aSuper Mario Kart 1bNintendoc2010-4-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aStart your engines for the original, legendary Super Mario Kart! Consistently ranked as one of the best video games ever made, it launched the kart racing genre and spawned five smash hit sequels.  i2010kNintendosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext 7aKart racing games2wiiext00688na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264002000029300002300049500040500072542002400477655002700501655003800528JCXE00aNobunaga's Ambition 1bKoeic2009-4-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aNobunaga’s Ambition is a game set in Japan’s Warring States period, a turbulent age when feudal warlords battled for control of the country. As the ruler of a fief, the player chooses his or her own path to conquest: Will you wage war on your neighbors or rely on diplomacy? Use economic sanctions or send ninja assassins? Use all of your ingenuity and resources to unite Japan under your banner!  i2009kKoeisGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aTurn-based strategy games2wiiext00705na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004200005264001900047300002300066500040500089542002400494655002700518655003800545JCXJ00aSuper Nobunaga no Yabou - Zenkoku Ban 1bKoeic2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aNobunaga’s Ambition is a game set in Japan’s Warring States period, a turbulent age when feudal warlords battled for control of the country. As the ruler of a fief, the player chooses his or her own path to conquest: Will you wage war on your neighbors or rely on diplomacy? Use economic sanctions or send ninja assassins? Use all of your ingenuity and resources to unite Japan under your banner!  i2014kKoeisGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aTurn-based strategy games2wiiext00691na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003500005264001900040300002300059500040300082542002400485655002900509655003100538JCYE00aUncharted Waters: New Horizons 1bKoeic2009-4-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aUncharted Waters: New Horizons is a game set in the Age of Discovery, the golden era of European global exploration during the early 16th century. The player selects one of six characters to play as, each with different backgrounds and different motivations. The player is free to sail the world's oceans as he or she wishes, visiting a variety of exotic ports and making thrilling new discoveries.  i2009kKoeisGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00679na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002300005264001900028300002300047500040300070542002400473655002900497655003100526JCYJ00aDaikoukai Jidai II 1bKoeic2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aUncharted Waters: New Horizons is a game set in the Age of Discovery, the golden era of European global exploration during the early 16th century. The player selects one of six characters to play as, each with different backgrounds and different motivations. The player is free to sail the world's oceans as he or she wishes, visiting a variety of exotic ports and making thrilling new discoveries.  i2014kKoeisGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00968na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004300005264001900048300002300067500071500090542002400805655002900829JCZE00aGenghis Khan II: Clan of the Gray Wolf 1bKoeic2009-6-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Genghis Khan II: Clan of the Gray Wolf, unite the scattered Mongol tribes under your banner and conquer the world as Genghis Khan! Choose from two riveting scenarios: Mongolia and all of Eurasia! It is up to you to take your fledgling empire from your humble beginnings on the Mongolian plateau and expand your borders across the land! As your rivals look enviously upon your domain, you must struggle to weather the assaults of your opponents and carve out a living for your people. Engage in diplomacy to forge alliances and organize your troops to defend the prosperity of your empire! If you can manage to spread the borders of your empire to the corners of the world, all will pay homage to your might!  i2009kKoeisGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00981na  a2200109   4500001000500000245005600005264001900061300002300080500071500103542002400818655002900842JCZJ00aSuper Aoki Oukami to Shiroki Mejika - Genchou Hishi 1bKoeic2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Genghis Khan II: Clan of the Gray Wolf, unite the scattered Mongol tribes under your banner and conquer the world as Genghis Khan! Choose from two riveting scenarios: Mongolia and all of Eurasia! It is up to you to take your fledgling empire from your humble beginnings on the Mongolian plateau and expand your borders across the land! As your rivals look enviously upon your domain, you must struggle to weather the assaults of your opponents and carve out a living for your people. Engage in diplomacy to forge alliances and organize your troops to defend the prosperity of your empire! If you can manage to spread the borders of your empire to the corners of the world, all will pay homage to your might!  i2014kKoeisGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00193na  a2200097   4500001000500000245003100005264001300036300002300049500000500072542001800077JD2J00aBishoujo Janshi Suchie-Pai 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00377na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003700005264004500042300002300087500004500110542004900155655002500204655002600229JD3E00aSuper E.D.F. Earth Defense Force 1bJaleco / Jaleco Entertainmentc2011-7-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the shooter to end all shooters!  i2011kJaleco / Jaleco EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00319na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001700005264004500022300002300067500004500090542004900135655002500184JD3J00aSuper E.D.F. 1bJaleco / Jaleco Entertainmentc2011-1-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the shooter to end all shooters!  i2011kJaleco / Jaleco EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00341na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003800005264004600043300002300089500004500112542004900157655002500206JD3P00aSUPER E.D.F.: Earth Defense Force 1bJaleco / Jaleco Entertainmentc2010-10-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis is the shooter to en