bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2011-5-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aMaster Higgins is back for more awesome axe-chucking, skateboard-riding adventures!  i2011kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00453na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002400005264005000029300002300079500012300102542005400225655002500279655002700304JD8E00aAdventure Island II 1bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2011-8-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe illustrious Master Higgins returns in this Action RPG sequel to the highly acclaimed ‘Super Adventure Island’.  i2011kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00414na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004200005264002100047300002300068500012300091542002600214655002500240655002700265JD8J00aTakahashi Meijin no Daibouken Jima II 1bHudsonc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe illustrious Master Higgins returns in this Action RPG sequel to the highly acclaimed ‘Super Adventure Island’.  i2014kHudsonsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00459na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003000005264005000035300002300085500012300108542005400231655002500285655002700310JD8P00aSuper Adventure Island II 1bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2011-6-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe illustrious Master Higgins returns in this Action RPG sequel to the highly acclaimed ‘Super Adventure Island’.  i2011kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00611na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001500005264004900020300002300069500033000092542005400422655002500476JD9E00aSuper Bonk 1bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2011-4-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aDive headfirst into the action with your famously hard head in the first installment of the Bonk series on the Super NES. This time, Bonk has been caught in King Drool's trap and hurled into darkness. To find his way back to prehistoric times, he must embark on an adventure through streets, caves and eventually outer space!  i2011kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00318na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001700005264002600022300002300048500004200071542003100113655002500144655002700169JD9J00aSuper Genjin 1bHUDSON SOFTc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aBonk moonlights on the Super Nintendo  i2014kHUDSON SOFTsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00364na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001500005264005100020300002300071500004200094542005400136655002500190655002700215JD9M00aSuper Bonk 1bHudson Soft / Hudson Entertainmentc2010-12-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aBonk moonlights on the Super Nintendo  i2010kHudson Soft / Hudson EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00486na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002700027300002300054500023700077542003100314655003100345JDAE00aFinal Fantasy III 1bSquare Enixc2011-6-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aAges ago, evil beings created powerful creatures called Espers and unleashed them against each other. The resulting battles left their world in smouldering rubble. Legend has it, the Espers destroyed themselves and most of humanity.  i2011kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00484na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002100005264002600026300002300052500023700075542003100312655003100343JDAJ00aFinal Fantasy VI 1bSquare Enixc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aAges ago, evil beings created powerful creatures called Espers and unleashed them against each other. The resulting battles left their world in smouldering rubble. Legend has it, the Espers destroyed themselves and most of humanity.  i2014kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00486na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002700027300002300054500023700077542003100314655003100345JDAM00aFINAL FANTASY III 1bSquare Enixc2011-6-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aAges ago, evil beings created powerful creatures called Espers and unleashed them against each other. The resulting battles left their world in smouldering rubble. Legend has it, the Espers destroyed themselves and most of humanity.  i2011kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00486na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002700027300002300054500023700077542003100314655003100345JDAP00aFinal Fantasy III 1bSquare Enixc2011-3-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aAges ago, evil beings created powerful creatures called Espers and unleashed them against each other. The resulting battles left their world in smouldering rubble. Legend has it, the Espers destroyed themselves and most of humanity.  i2011kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00301na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002200027300002300049500006800072542002600140655002500166JDBE00aSuper Bomberman 3 1bHudsonc2008-5-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aBomberman returns  and  The Five Dastardly Bombers are back to.  i2008kHudsonsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00911na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002700005264002200032300002300054500067100077542002600748655002700774JDCE00aStreet Fighter Alpha 2 1bCapcomc2009-12-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aStreet Fighter Alpha 2 explodes on-screen with lightning-fast gameplay and amazing innovations. Quick Move Reversals, Alpha Counters and the incredible Custom Combo System create a new standard for all games to fight by. Push your talents to the limit as you discover new hidden moves and reversals for every character. Neutralize opponent’s attacks with high and low Alpha Counters and execute incredible Custom Combos to create your own rapid-fire assault of attacks. All your favorite warriors are back for more. Previously hidden characters Dan, Akuma, and Bison are joined by five new fighters: Rolento, Gen, Sakura, and classic favorites Dhalsim and Zangief.  i2009kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00439na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002900005264001900034300002300053500020000076542002600276655002700302JDCJ00aStreet Fighter Two Alpha 1bCapcomc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aStreet Fighter Alpha 2 explodes on-screen with lightning-fast gameplay and amazing innovations. Alpha Counters and the incredible Custom Combo System create a new standard for all fighting games.  i2014kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00440na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002700005264002200032300002300054500020000077542002600277655002700303JDCP00aStreet Fighter Alpha 2 1bCapcomc2010-1-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aStreet Fighter Alpha 2 explodes on-screen with lightning-fast gameplay and amazing innovations. Alpha Counters and the incredible Custom Combo System create a new standard for all fighting games.  i2010kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00956na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002300023300002300046500068200069542002600751655002700777655003000804JDDE00aFinal Fight 2 1bCapcomc2009-10-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aIt's been several years since peace settled in Metro City. With Cody and Jessica on vacation and Guy resuming his training out of town, everything seems to be in order. But recently, Haggar is feeling uneasy after learning that Mad Gear was not completely destroyed. Once again the Mad Gear Gang has emerged and this time they want revenge. They'll stop at nothing to bring Haggar and the entire world down to its knees. This time they've kidnapped Guy's master, Genryusai and his daughter, Rena. Now Haggar must travel the four corners of the globe to search for Genryusai and Rena. With the help of Maki and Carlos, the reign of the Mad Gear Gang will hopefully be destroyed.  i2009kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00605na  a2200133   4500001000500000245002000005264002100025300002300046500029400069542002600363655002500389655002700414655003000441JDDJ00aFinal Fight Two 1bCapcomc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Mad Gear Gang has emerged once again, and this time they want revenge! They’ll stop at nothing to bring Haggar and the entire world crumbling down. To prove they’re serious, they’ve kidnapped Guy’s master, Genryusai, along with his daughter, Rena, who is also Guy’s fiancée.  i2014kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00604na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001800005264002200023300002300045500029400068542002600362655002500388655002700413655003000440JDDP00aFinal Fight 2 1bCapcomc2009-10-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Mad Gear Gang has emerged once again, and this time they want revenge! They’ll stop at nothing to bring Haggar and the entire world crumbling down. To prove they’re serious, they’ve kidnapped Guy’s master, Genryusai, along with his daughter, Rena, who is also Guy’s fiancée.  i2009kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext01148na  a2200121   4500001000500000245001800005264002100023300002300044500087600067542002600943655002700969655003000996JDEE00aFinal Fight 3 1bCapcomc2010-1-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aFollowing the defeat and subsequent disappearance of the Mad Gear Gang, a small group known only as “Skull Cross” is responsible for a new uprising of vandalism, terrorism and death. The government of Metro City is at a complete loss. Metro City’s mayor, Mike Haggar, and Guy are prepared to take on the new gang, but before they can act, the door bursts open, revealing Lucia, Cody’s old friend. “Metro City is under attack!” she shouts, “Skull Cross is loose, and they’ve got something up their sleeves.” But before any of them can move, a mysterious man appears in the doorway. “My name is Dean,” he says. “I know Skull Cross inside-and-out, and I hate them more than anything. I can help you, and you can help me. We must go!” All four fighters vow to bring Skull Cross down. It will be a tough assignment, and may even be their final fight!  i2010kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00471na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002200005264002100027300002300048500023700071542002600308655002700334JDEJ00aFinal Fight Tough 1bCapcomc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aFollowing the defeat and subsequent disappearance of the Mad Gear Gang, a small group known only as Skull Cross is responsible for a new uprising of vandalism, terrorism and death. The government of Metro City is at a complete loss.  i2014kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00467na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001800005264002100023300002300044500023700067542002600304655002700330JDEP00aFinal Fight 3 1bCapcomc2010-2-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aFollowing the defeat and subsequent disappearance of the Mad Gear Gang, a small group known only as Skull Cross is responsible for a new uprising of vandalism, terrorism and death. The government of Metro City is at a complete loss.  i2010kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00179na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001700005264001300022300002300035500000500058542001800063JDFJ00aSutte Hakkun 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00185na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002300005264001300028300002300041500000500064542001800069JDHJ00aSuper Famicom Wars 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00832na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002000005264002500025300002300050500059500073542002900668655002500697JDIE00aSuper Star Wars 1bLucasArtsc2009-8-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aRisk your life as a Jedi Knight. Join Luke, Han and Chewbacca in their fierce war against the Evil Empire. Battle treacherous aliens. Pilot two vehicles in high speed, first person, 3-D sequences. Rip through the desert in Luke's landspeeder. Clash with aliens in the Mos Eisley Cantina. Blast menacing boss monsters and Imperial stormtroopers. Attack TIE fighters in the trenches of the Death Star. Fight your way through the wastelands of Tatooine to the hostile streets of Mos Eisley and beyond. So grab your blaster, strap on your lightsaber, and take on the fight for galactic freedom.  i2009kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00429na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002000005264002200025300002300047500015600070542002900226655002500255655002700280JDIJ00aSuper Star Wars 1bLucasArtsc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first chapter of the epic Super Star Wars™ trilogy blasts on to Virtual Console, combining classic action gaming with high-octane vehicle levels!  i2014kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00432na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002000005264002500025300002300050500015600073542002900229655002500258655002700283JDIP00aSuper Star Wars 1bLucasArtsc2009-9-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first chapter of the epic Super Star Wars™ trilogy blasts on to Virtual Console, combining classic action gaming with high-octane vehicle levels!  i2009kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext01207na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004500005264002500050300002300075500094500098542002901043655002501072JDJE00aSuper Star Wars: The Empire Strikes Back 1bLucasArtsc2009-8-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aWill You Accept the Challenge as a Jedi Knight? Pursued across the galaxy, you and your Rebel Forces now marshall new strength on the remote ice world of Hoth. Although tracked by probe droids, attacked by ice monsters, and confronted by an army of gigantic Imperial Walkers, you must not give in. You are the Alliance's only hope. Learn the ways of the Force, then test your skills in this fast-paced, action-packed sequel to the hit game, Super Star Wars. It is a dark time for the Rebellion. Although the Death Star has been destroyed, Imperial troops have driven the Rebel forces from their hidden base and pursued them across the galaxy. Evading the dreaded Imperial Starfleet, a group of freedom fighters led by Luke Skywalker has established a new secret base on the remote ice world of Hoth. The evil lord Darth Vader, obsessed with finding young Skywalker, has dispatched thousands of remote probes into the far reaches of space...  i2009kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00349na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004400005264002200049300002300071500005200094542002900146655002500175655002700200JDJJ00aSuper Star Wars The Empire Strikes Back 1bLucasArtsc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aWill You Accept the Challenge as a Jedi Knight?  i2014kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00353na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004500005264002500050300002300075500005200098542002900150655002500179655002700204JDJP00aSuper Star Wars: The Empire Strikes Back 1bLucasArtsc2009-10-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aWill You Accept the Challenge as a Jedi Knight?  i2009kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00178na  a2200097   4500001000500000245001600005264001300021300002300034500000500057542001800062JDKJ00aMetal Max 2 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00908na  a2200109   4500001000500000245004000005264002400045300002300069500065200092542002900744655002500773JDLE00aSuper Star Wars: Return of the Jedi 1bLucasArtsc2009-9-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aCrush The Empire - Once and For All. Join the Rebellion and crush the Death Star in a giant universe filled with all the action and adventure of the Star Wars® finale. Take command of five different characters – from Wicket the Ewok to Princess Leia – and go up against the Empire’s worst, from Jabba the Hutt to the Emperor himself! This is it! You’re going to need every ounce of Force you’ve got in you. Battle in actual movie locales, from Jabba the Hutt’s palace to the Forest of Endor and the Emperor’s Tower. Duel sabers with the darkest of the dark side: Bib Fortuna, Jabba the Hutt, the rancor, Darth Vader and the Emperor.  i2009kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00333na  a2200121   4500001000500000245003900005264002200044300002300066500004100089542002900130655002500159655002700184JDLJ00aSuper Star Wars Return Of The Jedi 1bLucasArtsc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aCrush the Empire - Once and For All.  i2014kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00338na  a2200121   4500001000500000245004000005264002600045300002300071500004100094542002900135655002500164655002700189JDLP00aSuper Star Wars: Return of the Jedi 1bLucasArtsc2009-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aCrush the Empire - Once and For All.  i2009kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00192na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002800005264001500033300002300048500000500071542001800076JDMJ00aKirby no Kirakira Kizzu 1bc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00647na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001700005264002500022300002300047500041300070542002900483655002500512JDNE00aGhoul Patrol 1bLucasArtsc2010-1-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aGhoul Patrol to the rescue! The main attractions at the library’s Goblin exhibit have come to life! As the Ghoul Patrol, go back in time and de-spook an encyclopedia of zombified historic dudes. Vaporize garbage can ghosts and ninja spirits, rescue bug-eyed librarians and wigged-out pirates, dodge flying books and adolescent-eating plants, and ultimately put the beastly spirit back in the history books!  i2010kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00644na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001700005264002200022300002300044500041300067542002900480655002500509JDNJ00aGhoul Patrol 1bLucasArtsc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aGhoul Patrol to the rescue! The main attractions at the library’s Goblin exhibit have come to life! As the Ghoul Patrol, go back in time and de-spook an encyclopedia of zombified historic dudes. Vapo