7300002300050500023100073542002700304655002500331655002700356JDWE00aAero the Acro-Bat 1bSunsoftc2010-7-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe madman industrialist Edgar Ektor has seized control of the World of Amusement. He and a deranged cast of fairground freaks threaten the circus. The only hope for survival is the high-flying, death-defying Aero the acrobat!  i2010kSunsoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00501na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002100005264002000026300002300046500023100069542002700300655002500327655002700352JDWJ00aAero The Acrobat 1bSunsoftc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe madman industrialist Edgar Ektor has seized control of the World of Amusement. He and a deranged cast of fairground freaks threaten the circus. The only hope for survival is the high-flying, death-defying Aero the acrobat!  i2014kSunsoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00505na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002200005264002300027300002300050500023100073542002700304655002500331655002700356JDWP00aAero the Acro-Bat 1bSunsoftc2010-7-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe madman industrialist Edgar Ektor has seized control of the World of Amusement. He and a deranged cast of fairground freaks threaten the circus. The only hope for survival is the high-flying, death-defying Aero the acrobat!  i2010kSunsoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext01009na  a2200121   4500001000500000245002300005264002300028300002300051500073400074542002700808655002500835655002700860JDXE00aAero the Acrobat 2 1bSunsoftc2010-9-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe aerialist extreme, Aero the Acro-Bat, bounds back into the spotlight once again to stop the wicked industrialist, Edgar Ektor! Aero has entered a new realm of enchantment and must now use all of his acrobatic prowess to foil a criminal plot known only as "Plan B." Join Aero as he discovers new friends - and enemies - in a world custom-built for his high-flying adventures. There are 45 levels of acrobatic fun, including Bonus Rounds, Chance Stages and Hidden Chambers. Discover new villains and original digitized character voices. A password feature allows you to return to any level. The Chillin' Snow Boarding Stage adds a new twist to Aero's style, and you'll find new moves and fighting techniques for Aero's attacks.  i2010kSunsoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00969na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002500005264002000030300002300050500073400073542002700807655002500834JDXJ00aAero The Acrobat Two 1bSunsoftc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe aerialist extreme, Aero the Acro-Bat, bounds back into the spotlight once again to stop the wicked industrialist, Edgar Ektor! Aero has entered a new realm of enchantment and must now use all of his acrobatic prowess to foil a criminal plot known only as "Plan B." Join Aero as he discovers new friends - and enemies - in a world custom-built for his high-flying adventures. There are 45 levels of acrobatic fun, including Bonus Rounds, Chance Stages and Hidden Chambers. Discover new villains and original digitized character voices. A password feature allows you to return to any level. The Chillin' Snow Boarding Stage adds a new twist to Aero's style, and you'll find new moves and fighting techniques for Aero's attacks.  i2014kSunsoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00969na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002300005264002200028300002300050500073400073542002700807655002500834JDXP00aAero the Acrobat 2 1bSunsoftc2010-8-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe aerialist extreme, Aero the Acro-Bat, bounds back into the spotlight once again to stop the wicked industrialist, Edgar Ektor! Aero has entered a new realm of enchantment and must now use all of his acrobatic prowess to foil a criminal plot known only as "Plan B." Join Aero as he discovers new friends - and enemies - in a world custom-built for his high-flying adventures. There are 45 levels of acrobatic fun, including Bonus Rounds, Chance Stages and Hidden Chambers. Discover new villains and original digitized character voices. A password feature allows you to return to any level. The Chillin' Snow Boarding Stage adds a new twist to Aero's style, and you'll find new moves and fighting techniques for Aero's attacks.  i2010kSunsoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00182na  a2200097   4500001000500000245002000005264001300025300002300038500000500061542001800066JDYJ00aRudora no Hihou 1bc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2014sGameTDB00539na  a2200109   4500001000500000245002400005264002700029300002300056500028800079542003100367655003100398JDZD00aMystic Quest Legend 1bSquare Enixc2010-9-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aReturn to a time of classic action and adventure. Young Benjamin embarks on a quest to reclaim the stolen crystals that are the key to balancing the four elements of the world. Experience this treasured game from the Super Nintendo Entertainment System, and save the world once more!  i2010kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00547na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003100005264002800036300002300064500028800087542003100375655003100406JDZE00aFinal Fantasy Mystic Quest 1bSquare Enixc2010-10-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aReturn to a time of classic action and adventure. Young Benjamin embarks on a quest to reclaim the stolen crystals that are the key to balancing the four elements of the world. Experience this treasured game from the Super Nintendo Entertainment System, and save the world once more!  i2010kSquare EnixsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00546na  a2200109   4500001000500000245003100005264002700036300002300063500028800086542003100374655003100405JDZF00aFinal Fantasy Mystic Quest 1bSquare Enixc2010-9-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aReturn to a time of classic action and adventure. Young Benjamin embarks on a quest to reclaim the stolen crystals that are the key to