d round robin matches!  i2011kNatsumesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00556na  a2200133   4500001000500000245003500005264002500040300002300065500022200088542003200310655002500342655002700367655002800394JEAJ00aNatsume Championship Wrestling 1bNatsume Inc.c2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aStep into the ring! Choose from 12 outrageous wrestlers and bring it on! Wield the massive power of Asteroid, the lightning-fast strikes of Viper, the underhanded attacks of Phantom, and many more mad men of the ring!  i2014kNatsume Inc.sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00559na  a2200133   4500001000500000245003500005264002800040300002300068500022200091542003200313655002500345655002700370655002800397JEAM00aNatsume Championship Wrestling 1bNatsume Inc.c2011-2-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aStep into the ring! Choose from 12 outrageous wrestlers and bring it on! Wield the massive power of Asteroid, the lightning-fast strikes of Viper, the underhanded attacks of Phantom, and many more mad men of the ring!  i2011kNatsume Inc.sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00559na  a2200133   4500001000500000245003500005264002800040300002300068500022200091542003200313655002500345655002700370655002800397JEAP00aNatsume Championship Wrestling 1bNatsume Inc.c2011-2-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aStep into the ring! Choose from 12 outrageous wrestlers and bring it on! Wield the massive power of Asteroid, the lightning-fast strikes of Viper, the underhanded attacks of Phantom, and many more mad men of the ring!  i2011kNatsume Inc.sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00877na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001500005264002200020300002300042500057500065542002600640655002500666655002500691655002700716JEBE00aMega Man X 1bCapcomc2011-4-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe future of Mega Man has arrived! Hundreds of years after his death, Dr. Light's final creation is discovered. Released from his capsule by Dr. Cain, X is born into the world of the future where robot rebellions are a thing of the past. But when Dr. Cain tries to implement Dr. Light's designs into a new series of Reploids, something goes horribly wrong. Now, the future lies on the brink of destruction and X must use all of his newfound powers and abilities to hunt down the maverick Reploids and their leader, Sigma, before the human race is wiped from the planet!  i2011kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00875na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001400005264002100019300002300040500057500063542002600638655002500664655002500689655002700714JEBJ00aRockman X 1bCapcomc2014-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe future of Mega Man has arrived! Hundreds of years after his death, Dr. Light's final creation is discovered. Released from his capsule by Dr. Cain, X is born into the world of the future where robot rebellions are a thing of the past. But when Dr. Cain tries to implement Dr. Light's designs into a new series of Reploids, something goes horribly wrong. Now, the future lies on the brink of destruction and X must use all of his newfound powers and abilities to hunt down the maverick Reploids and their leader, Sigma, before the human race is wiped from the planet!  i2014kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00876na  a2200133   4500001000500000245001500005264002100020300002300041500057500064542002600639655002500665655002500690655002700715JEBP00aMega Man X 1bCapcomc2012-3-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe future of Mega Man has arrived! Hundreds of years after his death, Dr. Light's final creation is discovered. Released from his capsule by Dr. Cain, X is born into the world of the future where robot rebellions are a thing of the past. But when Dr. Cain tries to imp