 4500001000500000245001000005264002000015300002300035500079000058542002400848655002500872E73E00aMappy 1bNBGIc2009-3-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay as Mappy the police mouse to collect items that were stolen by Goro and his gang. Collect all of the stolen goods in the mansion to advance to the next round. If you come into contact with an enemy or fall into a pit, you'll lose a life. Once you lose all of your lives, the game is over. Extra lives will be awarded upon reaching certain point intervals. Jump on the trampolines to move up and down. Their color will change with each continuous bounce; if you jump on a red trampoline, it will break. Press the 1 Button or 2 Button to open or close a nearby door. Doors will open in the direction that the doorknob is facing. Open power doors to release an impact wave that'll knock any enemy in its path out of the mansion. The impact wave can only be fired once per power door.  i2009kNBGIsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext01032na  a2200109   4500001000500000245001000005264003100015300002300046500079000069542003800859655002500897E73J00aMappy 1bNAMCO BANDAI Gamesc2014--  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay as Mappy the police mouse to collect items that were stolen by Goro and his gang. Collect all of the stolen goods in the mansion to advance to the next round. If you come into contact with an enemy or fall into a pit, you'll lose a life. Once you lose all of your lives, the game is over. Extra lives will be awarded upon reaching certain point intervals. Jump on the trampolines to move up and down. Their color will change with each continuous bounce; if you jump on a red trampoline, it will break. Press the 1 Button or 2 Button to open or close a nearby door. Doors will open in the direction that the doorknob is facing. Open power doors to release an impact wave that'll knock any enemy in its path out of the mansion. The impact wave can only be fired once per power door.  i2014kNAMCO BANDAI GamessGameTDB 7aAc