 of Time & Master Quest 1bNintendoc2003-2-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aOriginally released as a bonus disk for those who pre-ordered The Legend of Zelda: Wind Waker, The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time / Master Quest contains GCN versions of Ocarina of Time and the never-released 64DD Ura Zelda (a remixed version of Ocarina of Time with harder dungeons ... Only true heroes will make it through this quest alive!).  i2003kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00811na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004200007264002500049300002300074500051100097542002800608655002500636655002800661D43J0100aZelda no Densetsu: Toki no Ocarina GC 1bNintendoc2002-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time Master Quest is a special version of Ocarina of Time that wasn't released for the N64 in North America. Both games were exclusively available for the Nintendo GameCube to those who preordered The Legend of Zelda: The Wind Waker at a participating retailer. The Master Quest version of Ocarina of Time contains the same overall storyline as the original Ocarina of Time adventure. However, the dungeons have been upgraded to be truly challenging, even to a Zelda master.  i2002kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00823na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005600007264002300063300002300086500051100109542002800620655002500648655002800673D43P0104aThe Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time & Master Quest 1bNintendoc2003-3-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time Master Quest is a special version of Ocarina of Time that wasn't released for the N64 in North America. Both games were exclusively available for the Nintendo GameCube to those who preordered The Legend of Zelda: The Wind Waker at a participating retailer. The Master Quest version of Ocarina of Time contains the same overall storyline as the original Ocarina of Time adventure. However, the dungeons have been upgraded to be truly challenging, even to a Zelda master.  i2003kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00823na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005600007264002300063300002300086500051100109542002800620655002500648655002800673D43U0104aThe Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time & Master Quest 1bNintendoc2003-3-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time Master Quest is a special version of Ocarina of Time that wasn't released for the N64 in North America. Both games were exclusively available for the Nintendo GameCube to those who preordered The Legend of Zelda: The Wind Waker at a participating retailer. The Master Quest version of Ocarina of Time contains the same overall storyline as the original Ocarina of Time adventure. However, the dungeons have been upgraded to be truly challenging, even to a Zelda master.  i2003kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00664na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005600007264002400063300002300087500035100110542002800461655002500489655002800514D43W0104aThe Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time & Master Quest 1bNintendoc2003-2-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aOriginally released as a bonus disk for those who pre-ordered The Legend of Zelda: Wind Waker, The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time / Master Quest contains GCN versions of Ocarina of Time and the never-released 64DD Ura Zelda (a remixed version of Ocarina of Time with harder dungeons ... Only true heroes will make it through this quest alive!).  i2003kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00206na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004200007264001300049300002300062500000500085542001800090D44J0100aGekkan Nintendo Tentou Demo 2002.12.1 1bc2022--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2022sGameTDB00224na  a2200097   4500001000700000245005000007264001700057300002300074500000500097542002400102D46J0100aGekkan Nintendo Tentou Demo 2003.1.1 (Disc B) 1bNintendoc-