emies and collect fruit until they are ready to hatch, and then crack the suckers open to bring a small, friendly animal into this world. Billy can hatch penguins, seals, and other creatures and command them to help him on his quest. This is a DEMO version of the game.  i2003kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00241na  a2200097   4500001000700000245006300007264001900070300002300089500000500112542002600117DGAJB200aKidou Senshi Gundam: Senshi-tachi no Kiseki (Special Disc) 1bBandaic2004--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2004kBandaisGameTDB00359na  a2200109   4500001000700000245007900007264004000086300002300126500003200149542004300181655002500224DLSE6400aStar Wars: Rogue Squadron III: Rebel Strike (Limited Edition Preview Disc) 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2003-10-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis preview disc includes:  i2003kLucasArts EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00339na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005500007264004000062300002300102500003600125542004300161655002500204DLSP6400aStar Wars: Rogue Squadron III: Rebel Strike (Demo) 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2003-10-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aSpecial Bonus Features Include:  i2003kLucasArts EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00214na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003600007264001900043300002300062500000500085542002600090DM2J8P00aSuper Monkey Ball 2 (Taikenban) 1bSega Japanc--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  ikSega JapansGameTDB00725na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264002000043300002300063500047800086542002400564655002700588DNUEDA00aNaruto: Clash of Ninja 2 (Demo) 1bTomyc2006-9-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aNARUTO: Clash of Ninja 2, developed exclusively for Nintendo GameCube, will offer non-stop ninja style combat action for 1-4 players where gamers choose to play as one of 23 total available characters. All-new multi-player modes will engage players in frantic simultaneous four player battles and single-player modes will offer more gameplay choices than before with survival and timed attack modes that allow players to showcase their taijutsu and special jutsu abilities.  i2006kTomysGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00206na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003200007264001700039300002300056500000500079542002400084DPIJ0100aPikmin (Jitsuen-you Sample) 1bNintendoc--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  ikNintendosGameTDB00862na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002200026300002300048500059000071542002600661655002500687655002800712DPNP0800aP.N. 03 (Demo) 1bCapcomc2003-8-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aThird-person action shooter from Capcom, featuring robot hunter heroine Vanessa Z. Schneider. This beautiful mercenary for hire with a mysterious past is called in to take care of an off-world colony overrun by a Computer Arms Management System (or CAMS) gone completely haywire. Gameplay exists of run-and-stop shooting action with a rhythm twist, as Vanessa explores 11 linear levels. She can shoot single blasts from her hands or take on multiple enemies at once utilizing a number of combos, which are tied to the nine upgradable suits found in the game. Produced by Shinji Mikami.  i2003kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00245na  a2200097   4500001000700000245006700007264001900074300002300093500000500116542002600121DPOJ8P00aPhantasy Star Online Episode I & II: Trial Edition (Taikenban) 1bSega Japanc--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  ikSega JapansGameTDB00251na  a2200097   4500001000700000245007300007264001900080300002300099500000500122542002600127DPSJ8P00aPhantasy Star Online Episode III: C.A.R.D. Revolution: Trial Edition 1bSega Japanc--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  ikSega JapansGameTDB00236na  a2200097   4500001000700000245005200007264002200059300002300081500000500104542002900109DR2JCQ00aRune II: Koruten no Kagi no Himitsu (Taikenban) 1bFrom Softwarec--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  ikFrom SoftwaresGameTDB00579na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002600007264001400033300002300047500027900070542002100349655002700370655003000397655001800427DRSEAF00aSoulcalibur II (Demo) 1bNamcoc--  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe quest for the all-powerful sword known as Soul Edge continues in Soulcalibur II, as old favorites and exciting new characters compete for the right to wield its power. Featuring seven game modes including Arcade, Time Attack, Survival Mode, Versus Mode, and Team Battle.  ikNamcosGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext 7aDemos2wiiext00254na  a2200097   4500001000700000245005400007264003000061300002300091500000500114542003700119DSWJ1300aStar Wars: Rogue Squadron II (Jitsuen-you Sample) 1bElectronic Arts Japanc--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  ikElectronic Arts JapansGameTDB00525na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002300033300002300056500024600079542002600325655002500351655002700376DVJP0800aViewtiful Joe (Promo) 1bCapcomc2003-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aFighting action game from Capcom Studio 4's Atsushi Inaba. Joe was just your average, well, Joe until he was transported into his favorite action movie. In his new environment, Joe discovers he has all the abilities of Hollywood action-hero.  i2003kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00205na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004100007264001300048300002300061500000500084542001800089E23J0100aGekkan Nintendo Tentou Demo 2005.9.1 1bc2022--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2022sGameTDB00206na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004200007264001300049300002300062500000500085542001800090E24J0100aGekkan Nintendo Tentou Demo 2005.10.1 1bc2022--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2022sGameTDB00206na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004200007264001300049300002300062500000500085542001800090E25J0100aGekkan Nintendo Tentou Demo 2005.11.1 1bc2022--  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2022sGam