 4500001000700000245001200007264002700019300002300046500011200069542003000181655002500211655002900236655002500265G2KE8P00aNHL 2K3 1bSega Japanc2002-12-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aNHL 2K3 is an Ice Hockey Sim game, developed by Treyarch and published by Sega, which was released in 2002.  i2002kSega JapansGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHockey games2wiiext00324na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001200007264003400019300002300053500003800076542003800114655002500152655002500177G2KP8P00aNHL 2K3 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2003-3-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aNHL 2K3 is an Ice Hockey Sim game  i2003kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aHockey games2wiiext00965na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002800007264002500035300002300060500058700083542002800670655002500698655003100723655002600754655003900780G2ME0100aMetroid Prime 2: Echoes 1bNintendoc2004-11-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn this highly anticipated sequel to Metroid Prime, become the bounty hunter behind the visor once more and travel to a planet torn into light and darkness. Hunted by a mysterious entity and a warring race called the Ing, Samus Aran must explore the light and dark worlds of this doomed planet to discover secrets and augment her suit's weapons and abilities. And now, for the first time in the history of the celebrated Metroid franchise, up to four players can battle each other as they search for weapons, grapple across ceilings, and turn into Morph Balls to make their escapes.  i2004kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00411na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003300007264002400040300002300064500003200087542002800119655002500147655002800172655002600200655003900226G2MJ0100aMetroid Prime 2: Dark Echoes 1bNintendoc2005-5-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aA War of Light and Darkness  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00367na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002800007264002500035300002300060500003200083542002800115655002500143655002600168655003900194G2MP0100aMetroid Prime 2: Echoes 1bNintendoc2004-11-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aA War of Light and Darkness  i2004kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00246na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003400007264003800041300002300079500000500102542004100107G2NJ1300aNeed for Speed: Underground 2 1bElectronic Arts Japanc2004-12-22  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2004kElectronic Arts JapansGameTDB01018na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264003800044300002300082500069700105542004100802655002500843655002800868G2OE4100aPrince of Persia: Warrior Within 1bUbisoft Entertainmentc2004-11-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Old Man said to the Prince, "Your fate has been written. You will die." Enter the dark underworld of Prince of Persia: Warrior Within, the sword-slashing sequel to the critically acclaimed Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time. Hunted by Dahaka, an immortal incarnation of Fate seeking divine retribution, the Prince embarks upon a path of both carnage and mystery to defy his preordained death. His journey leads to the infernal core of a cursed island stronghold harboring mankind's greatest fears. Only through grim resolve, bitter defiance and the mastery of deadly new combat arts can the Prince rise to a new level of warriorship — and emerge from this ultimate trial with his life.  i2004kUbisoft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01017na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264003700044300002300081500069700104542004100801655002500842655002800867G2OP4100aPrince of Persia: Warrior Within 1bUbisoft Entertainmentc2004-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Old Man said to the Prince, "Your fate has been written. You will die." Enter the dark underworld of Prince of Persia: Warrior Within, the sword-slashing sequel to the critically acclaimed Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time. Hunted by Dahaka, an immortal incarnation of Fate seeking divine retribution, the Prince embarks upon a path of both carnage and mystery to defy his preordained death. His journey leads to the infernal core of a cursed island stronghold harboring mankind's greatest fears. Only through grim resolve, bitter defiance and the mastery of deadly new combat arts can the Prince rise to a new level of warriorship — and emerge from this ultimate trial with his life.  i2004kUbisoft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00802na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264002800028300002300056500051600079542003200595655002500627655002800652G2PE6U00aSpirits & Spells 1bDreamCatcherc2003-9-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Spirits & Spells, you can choose to play the role of Alicia, a girl disguised as a witch, or Greg, a boy disguised as a devil, as they attempt to rescue their friends from a mad scientist. You can alternate between the two characters at any time during the game and discover their varying abilities. Explore creepy environments such as a haunted house, a dark cemetery, eerie forests, and an abandoned laboratory. To survive this Halloween world, you must solve puzzles and fight a variety of evil creatures.  i2003kDreamCatchersGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00613na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264002700028300002300055500037000078542003000448655002500478G2RE5200aShrek: SuperSlam 1bActivisionc2005-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou can battle characters from the Shrek movies in Shrek SuperSlam. The game lets you play as one of 20 characters, such as the heroic Shrek or villainous Prince Charming. Use weapons, potions, or a character's signature special move to fight through 16 fully-destructible arenas. Then, battle with up to four of your friends or play through more than 30 minigames.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00300na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002900033300002300062500001000085542003200095655002500127655002600152G2SJGE00aShikigami no Shiro II 1bKids Stationc2003-10-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aStory  i2003kKids StationsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00836na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002600037300002300063500054100086542003000627655002500657655003200682G2TE5200aTony Hawk's Underground 2 1bActivisionc2004-10-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou've been chosen by Tony Hawk to compete against Bam Margera's team in the World Destruction Tour. In an all-new storyline, Tony Hawk's Underground 2 takes you to skateparks around the world, where you can spray your custom tag, slap stickers, and even create new skate lines. Now you can play as yourself, as your teammates, or as more than 20 special skaters. If you're feeling nostalgic for older Tony Hawk games, you can try Classic mode, which challenges you to accomplish your favorite goals, such as Secret Tape and High Score.  i2004kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSkateboarding games2wiiext00836na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002600037300002300063500054100086542003000627655002500657655003200682G2TP5200aTony Hawk's Underground 2 1bActivisionc2004-10-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aYou've been chosen by Tony Hawk to compete against Bam Margera's team in the World Destruction Tour. In an all-new storyline, Tony Hawk's Underground 2 takes you to skateparks around the world, where you can spray your custom tag, slap stickers, and even create new skate lines. Now you can play as yourself, as your teammates, or as more than 20 special skaters. If you're feeling nostalgic for older Tony Hawk games, you can try Classic mode, which challenges you to accomplish your favorite goals, such as Secret Tape and High Score.  i2004kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSkateboarding games2wiiext00742na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002000007264002300027300002300050500042700073542002600500655002500526655002700551655003000578G2VE0800aViewtiful Joe 2 1bCapcomc2004-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoe and Silvia are back in this sequel to Viewtiful Joe. This time you have more style, new special moves, and more than 40 new enemies to defeat. Now Joe's trusty aircraft transforms into various shapes to support his activities throughout the game's many stages. In addition to Joe, you can play as Silva, Joe's girlfriend. Call upon the powers of Joe and Silvia, and get ready to both solve new puzzles and save the day  i2004kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00762na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004000007264002300047300002300070500042700093542002600520655002500546655002700571655003000598G2VJ0800aViewtiful Joe 2: Black Film no Nazo 1bCapcomc2004-12-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoe and Silvia are back in this sequel to Viewtiful Joe. This time you have more style, new special moves, and more than 40 new enemies to defeat. Now Joe's trusty aircraft transforms into various shapes to support his activities throughout the game's many stages. In addition to Joe, you can play as Silva, Joe's girlfriend. Call upon the powers of Joe and Silvia, and get ready to both solve new puzzles and save the day  i2004kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00742na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002000007264002200027300002300049500042800072542002600500655002500526655002700551655003000578G2VP0800aViewtiful Joe 2 1bCapcomc2005-3-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoe and Silvia are back in this sequel to Viewtiful Joe. This time you have more style, new special moves, and more than 40 new enemies to defeat. Now Joe's trusty aircraft transforms into various shapes to support his activities throughout the game's many stages. In addition to Joe, you can play as Silva, Joe's girlfriend. Call upon the powers of Joe and Silvia, and get ready to both solve new puzzles and save the day!  i2005kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00503na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002700033300002300060500021800083542003000301655002500331655002500356G2XE8P00aSonic Gems Collection 1bSega Japanc2005-10-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aA second collection of classic Sonic The Hedgehog games, with nine total games (and some secret games) which include Sonic CD, Sonic R, Sonic the Fighters and more. Also included is a Museum Mode of Sonic history.  i2005kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00486na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002600007264002600033300002300059500011800082542003000200655002500230655002800255655002700283655003000310G2XJ8P00aSonic Gems Collection 1bSega Japanc2005-8-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aSonic Gems Collection is a compilation of games not included with Sonic Mega Collection, including the following:  i2005kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext00662na  a2200169   4500001000700000245002600007264002600033300002300059500021800082542003000300655002500330655002500355655002700380655003000407655003000437655002500467G2XP8P00aSonic Gems Collection 1bSega Japanc2005-9-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aA second collection of classic Sonic The Hedgehog games, with nine total games (and some secret games) which include Sonic CD, Sonic R, Sonic the Fighters and more. Also included is a Museum Mode of Sonic history.  i2005kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a2D platform games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00843na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004500007264003100052300002300083500056100106542003500667655003100702G3AD6900aDe Herr der Ringer: Das dritte Zeitalter 1bElectronic Artsc2004-11-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn The Lord of the Rings: The Third Age, you can travel in the wake of the Fellowship while exploring your own path and periodically intersecting the major events of the film trilogy. Through both familiar and new locations, you must fight to save or destroy Middle-earth in an epic adventure. Encounter the demonic Balrog in the Mines of Moria, defend the fallen city of Osgiliath, or try to destroy Helm's Deep. These choices and many more will confront you as you align yourself with the people of Middle-earth or undertake missions on behalf of Sauron.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00839na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264003100048300002300079500056100102542003500663655003100698G3AE6904aThe Lord of the Rings: The Third Age 1bElectronic Artsc2004-11-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn The Lord of the Rings: The Third Age, you can travel in the wake of the Fellowship while exploring your own path and periodically intersecting the major events of the film trilogy. Through both familiar and new locations, you must fight to save or destroy Middle-earth in an epic adventure. Encounter the demonic Balrog in the Mines of Moria, defend the fallen city of Osgiliath, or try to destroy Helm's Deep. These choices and many more will confront you as you align yourself with the people of Middle-earth or undertake missions on behalf of Sauron.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00840na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004200007264003100049300002300080500056100103542003500664655003100699G3AF6900aLe Seigneur des Anneaux: Le Tiers Age 1bElectronic Artsc2004-11-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn The Lord of the Rings: The Third Age, you can travel in the wake of the Fellowship while exploring your own path and periodically intersecting the major events of the film trilogy. Through both familiar and new locations, you must fight to save or destroy Middle-earth in an epic adventure. Encounter the demonic Balrog in the Mines of Moria, defend the fallen city of Osgiliath, or try to destroy Helm's Deep. These choices and many more will confront you as you align yourself with the people of Middle-earth or undertake missions on behalf of Sauron.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00257na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004500007264003800052300002300090500000500113542004100118G3AJ1300aLord of the Rings: Nakatsu Kuni Daisanki 1bElectronic Arts Japanc2004-12-22  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2004kElectronic Arts JapansGameTDB00839na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264003100048300002300079500056100102542003500663655003100698G3AP6904aThe Lord of the Rings: The Third Age 1bElectronic Artsc2004-11-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn The Lord of the Rings: The Third Age, you can travel in the wake of the Fellowship while exploring your own path and periodically intersecting the major events of the film trilogy. Through both familiar and new locations, you must fight to save or destroy Middle-earth in an epic adventure. Encounter the demonic Balrog in the Mines of Moria, defend the fallen city of Osgiliath, or try to destroy Helm's Deep. These choices and many more will confront you as you align yourself with the people of Middle-earth or undertake missions on behalf of Sauron.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00843na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004500007264003100052300002300083500056100106542003500667655003100702G3AS6900aEl Senor de los Anillos: La Tercera Edad 1bElectronic Artsc2004-11-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn The Lord of the Rings: The Third Age, you can travel in the wake of the Fellowship while exploring your own path and periodically intersecting the major events of the film trilogy. Through both familiar and new locations, you must fight to save or destroy Middle-earth in an epic adventure. Encounter the demonic Balrog in the Mines of Moria, defend the fallen city of Osgiliath, or try to destroy Helm's Deep. These choices and many more will confront you as you align yourself with the people of Middle-earth or undertake missions on behalf of Sauron.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00598na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264004300039300002300082500027300105542004700378655002500425655002600450G3BE9G00aSerious Sam: Next Encounter 1bTake2 / Den'Z / Global Starc2004-4-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aAn abandoned mothership of Sirian origin is sending strange signals from the past, and there's only one man with the guns big enough to investigate: Sam "Serious" Stone. If Mental's forces beat Sam to this powerful time-traveling artifact, it's last call for humanity!  i2004kTake2 / Den'Z / Global StarsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00584na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264003600039300002300075500027300098542004000371655002500411655002600436G3BP9G00aSerious Sam: Next Encounter 1bGlobal Star Softwarec2004-4-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aAn abandoned mothership of Sirian origin is sending strange signals from the past, and there's only one man with the guns big enough to investigate: Sam "Serious" Stone. If Mental's forces beat Sam to this powerful time-traveling artifact, it's last call for humanity!  i2004kGlobal Star SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00946na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005200007264003300059300002300092500061800115542003800733655002500771655002800796G3DE6L00aCarmen Sandiego: The Secret of the Stolen Drums 1bBAM! Entertainmentc2004-9-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe last descendant of an African King reveals an ancient secret with his dying words: Deep in the jungles of Rwanda lies a hidden temple containing a great diamond which possesses the knowledge of all nations. The map to the temple has been etched onto the skins of eight drums scattered throughout the world. All eight drums must be re-united to open the temple. But beware, the drums are protected by mysterious powers, and legend has it that elemental spirits guard the treasure. Players travel through nine exotic locations, learning their history and geography, and solving challenging puzzles on their way.  i2004kBAM! EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00946na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005200007264003300059300002300092500061800115542003800733655002500771655002800796G3DP6L00aCarmen Sandiego: The Secret of the Stolen Drums 1bBAM! Entertainmentc2004-3-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe last descendant of an African King reveals an ancient secret with his dying words: Deep in the jungles of Rwanda lies a hidden temple containing a great diamond which possesses the knowledge of all nations. The map to the temple has been etched onto the skins of eight drums scattered throughout the world. All eight drums must be re-united to open the temple. But beware, the drums are protected by mysterious powers, and legend has it that elemental spirits guard the treasure. Players travel through nine exotic locations, learning their history and geography, and solving challenging puzzles on their way.  i2004kBAM! EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00946na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005200007264003300059300002300092500061800115542003800733655002500771655002800796G3DX6L00aCarmen Sandiego: The Secret of the Stolen Drums 1bBAM! Entertainmentc2004-3-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe last descendant of an African King reveals an ancient secret with his dying words: Deep in the jungles of Rwanda lies a hidden temple containing a great diamond which possesses the knowledge of all nations. The map to the temple has been etched onto the skins of eight drums scattered throughout the world. All eight drums must be re-united to open the temple. But beware, the drums are protected by mysterious powers, and legend has it that elemental spirits guard the treasure. Players travel through nine exotic locations, learning their history and geography, and solving challenging puzzles on their way.  i2004kBAM! EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00570na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002400035300002300059500027800082542002700360655002500387655003600412G3EE5100aXGIII: Extreme G Racing 1bAcclaimc2001-11-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aHigh-speed motorcycle racing and high-stakes futuristic combat collide in X63--an intoxicating, highly addictive arcade experience. Feel every razor sharp turn and roller-coaster drop in the pit of your stomach as you smash through the sound barrier at speeds over 750 mph.  i2001kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aFuturistic racing games2wiiext00581na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002900035300002300064500027800087542003300365655002500398655003600423G3EJB000aXGIII: Extreme G Racing 1bAcclaim Japanc2002-5-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aHigh-speed motorcycle racing and high-stakes futuristic combat collide in X63--an intoxicating, highly addictive arcade experience. Feel every razor sharp turn and roller-coaster drop in the pit of your stomach as you smash through the sound barrier at speeds over 750 mph.  i2002kAcclaim JapansGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aFuturistic racing games2wiiext00568na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002200035300002300057500027800080542002700358655002500385655003600410G3EP5100aXGIII: Extreme G Racing 1bAcclaimc2002-5-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aHigh-speed motorcycle racing and high-stakes futuristic combat collide in X63--an intoxicating, highly addictive arcade experience. Feel every razor sharp turn and roller-coaster drop in the pit of your stomach as you smash through the sound barrier at speeds over 750 mph.  i2002kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aFuturistic racing games2wiiext00879na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003400007264003100041300002300072500052500095542003500620655002500655655002600680655003900706G3FD6900aTimeSplitters: Future Perfect 1bElectronic Artsc2005-3-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn TimeSplitters: Future Perfect, humanity is on the brink of destruction by the evil TimeSplitters. With the help of some familiar faces, Cortez--the tough hero from previous installments--must chase a mystery foe across different time periods to trace the origins of the TimeSplitters. As Cortez, you'll have access to weapons, gadgets, characters, and environments that are unique to each time period. You can also correct the mistakes made in the past or team up with past and future versions of yourself in battles.  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00879na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003400007264003100041300002300072500052500095542003500620655002500655655002600680655003900706G3FE6900aTimeSplitters: Future Perfect 1bElectronic Artsc2005-3-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn TimeSplitters: Future Perfect, humanity is on the brink of destruction by the evil TimeSplitters. With the help of some familiar faces, Cortez--the tough hero from previous installments--must chase a mystery foe across different time periods to trace the origins of the TimeSplitters. As Cortez, you'll have access to weapons, gadgets, characters, and environments that are unique to each time period. You can also correct the mistakes made in the past or team up with past and future versions of yourself in battles.  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00879na  