isc for the Nintendo GameCube system.  i2002kNintendosGameTDB 7aSamplers2wiiext00324na  a2200109   4500001000700000245005100007264002500058300002300083500005900106542002800165655002100193G99E0100aInteractive Multi-Game Demo Disc: October 2001 1bNintendoc2001-10-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aA playable demo disc for the Nintendo GameCube system.  i2001kNintendosGameTDB 7aSamplers2wiiext00320na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004900007264002300056300002300079500005900102542002800161655002100189G99P0100aInteractive Multi-Game Demo Disk: March 2002 1bNintendoc2002-3-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aA playable demo disc for the Nintendo GameCube system.  i2002kNintendosGameTDB 7aSamplers2wiiext00453na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003400007264002300041300002300064500012500087542002700212655002500239655002900264655002600293G9BEE900aMark Davis Pro Bass Challenge 1bNatsumec2005-9-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aMark Davis Pro Bass Challenge is a Fishing game, developed by Sims and published by Natsume, which was released in 2005.  i2005kNatsumesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFishing games2wiiext00285na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004500007264005200052300002300104500000500127542005500132G9KJCM00aJikkyou Powerful Pro Yakyuu 9: Ketteiban 1bKonami Computer Entertainment Osakac2002-12-19  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2002kKonami Computer Entertainment OsakasGameTDB00930na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264005300033300002300086500062900109542005700738655002500795G9RD7D00aCrash Tag Team Racing 1bSierra, Vivendi Universal Interactivec2005-11-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time ever in a racing game, players will be able to fuse two cars together on the fly to form a super vehicle with the all-new "clashing" technology. In Crash Tag Team Racing, players can combine their car with an opponent's mid-race to make a super-car equipped with a powerful turret gun. When clashed, players can either get behind the wheel and drive or fire an onboard weapon. Each character has his or her own uniquely deadly 360˚ rotating turret. Players can continue the action out of the car where they can explore the entire world on foot and collect upgrades for their cars and unlock bonus tracks.  i2005kSierra, Vivendi Universal InteractivesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00917na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264004700033300002300080500062900103542005000732655002500782G9RE7D00aCrash Tag Team Racing 1bSierra / Universal Interactivec2005-10-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time ever in a racing game, players will be able to fuse two cars together on the fly to form a super vehicle with the all-new "clashing" technology. In Crash Tag Team Racing, players can combine their car with an opponent's mid-race to make a super-car equipped with a powerful turret gun. When clashed, players can either get behind the wheel and drive or fire an onboard weapon. Each character has his or her own uniquely deadly 360˚ rotating turret. Players can continue the action out of the car where they can explore the entire world on foot and collect upgrades for their cars and unlock bonus tracks.  i2005kSierra / Universal InteractivesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00868na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264002200033300002300055500062900078542002600707655002500733G9RF7D00aCrash Tag Team Racing 1bSierrac2005-11-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time ever in a racing game, players will be able to fuse two cars together on the fly to form a super vehicle with the all-new "clashing" technology. In Crash Tag Team Racing, players can combine their car with an opponent's mid-race to make a super-car equipped with a powerful turret gun. When clashed, players can either get behind the wheel and drive or fire an onboard weapon. Each character has his or her own uniquely deadly 360˚ rotating turret. Players can continue the action out of the car where they can explore the entire world on foot and collect upgrades for their cars and unlock bonus tracks.  i2005kSierrasGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00913na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264004300033300002300076500062900099542005000728655002500778G9RH7D00aCrash Tag Team Racing 1bSierra / Universal Interactivec2005--  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time ever in a racing game, players will be able to fuse two cars together on the fly to form a super vehicle with the all-new "clashing" technology. In Crash Tag Team Racing, players can combine their car with an opponent's mid-race to make a super-car equipped with a powerful turret gun. When clashed, players can either get behind the wheel and drive or fire an onboard weapon. Each character has his or her own uniquely deadly 360˚ rotating turret. Players can continue the action out of the car where they can explore the entire world on foot and collect upgrades for their cars and unlock bonus tracks.  i2005kSierra / Universal InteractivesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00335na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003700007264003900044300002300083500005100106542004300157655002500200G9RJ7D00aCrash Bandicoot: Gatchanko World 1bVivendi Universal Gamesc2005-12-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Japanese release of Crash Tag Team Racing.  i2005kVivendi Universal GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00918na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264004700033300002300080500062900103542005100732655002500783G9RP7D00aCrash Tag Team Racing 1bSierra, Vivendi Universal Gamesc2005-11-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time ever in a racing game, players will be able to fuse two cars together on the fly to form a super vehicle with the all-new "clashing" technology. In Crash Tag Team Racing, players can combine their car with an opponent's mid-race to make a super-car equipped with a powerful turret gun. When clashed, players can either get behind the wheel and drive or fire an onboard weapon. Each character has his or her own uniquely deadly 360˚ rotating turret. Players can continue the action out of the car where they can explore the entire world on foot and collect upgrades for their cars and unlock bonus tracks.  i2005kSierra, Vivendi Universal GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00889na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264002500024300002300049500061300072542003000685655002500715655002700740G9SE8P00aSonic Heroes 1bSega Japanc2004-1-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aSonic teams up with Knuckles, Tails and nine other characters from Sega's classic Sonic universe in a new take on platforming action in Sonic Heroes for PlayStation 2, GameCube, and Xbox. Utilize the abilities of three different characters in order to complete levels by switching on the fly. Four teams of three characters: Team Sonic, Team Dark, Team Chaotix, and Team Rose race through specially designed levels that require logical character switching. Level designs promote replay value by adding multiple paths and missions. New Sonic story is told through cinematic pre-rendered movies between levels.  i2004kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00891na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264002700024300002300051500061300074542003000687655002500717655002700742G9SJ8P00aSonic Heroes 1bSega Japanc2003-12-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aSonic teams up with Knuckles, Tails and nine other characters from Sega's classic Sonic universe in a new take on platforming action in Sonic Heroes for PlayStation 2, GameCube, and Xbox. Utilize the abilities of three different characters in order to complete levels by switching on the fly. Four teams of three characters: Team Sonic, Team Dark, Team Chaotix, and Team Rose race through specially designed levels that require logical character switching. Level designs promote replay value by adding multiple paths and missions. New Sonic story is told through cinematic pre-rendered movies between levels.  i2003kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00889na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001700007264002500024300002300049500061300072542003000685655002500715655002700740G9SP8P00aSonic Heroes 1bSega Japanc2004-2-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aSonic teams up with Knuckles, Tails and nine other characters from Sega's classic Sonic universe in a new take on platforming action in Sonic Heroes for PlayStation 2, GameCube, and Xbox. Utilize the abilities of three different characters in order to complete levels by switching on the fly. Four teams of three characters: Team Sonic, Team Dark, Team Chaotix, and Team Rose race through specially designed levels that require logical character switching. Level designs promote replay value by adding multiple paths and missions. New Sonic story is told through cinematic pre-rendered movies between levels.  i2004kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00786na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002600038300002300064500049400087542003000581655002500611655002800636G9TD5200aGrosse Haie: Kleine Fische 1bActivisionc2004-10-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the murky depths of the ocean, the fate of Reef City lies in the fins of one little fish--at least that's what he wants you to think. Dive into the underwater metropolis of Shark Tale and play as Oscar, a fast-talking fish whose little fib gets him into big trouble. Based on DreamWorks' animated film, Shark Tale features 25 missions that will have you exploring Reef City, racing through the coral, fighting Fish Fu and great white sharks, and dancing to the sounds of hip-hop tracks.  i2004kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00730na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001500007264002600022300002300048500049400071542003000565655002500595G9TE5200aShark Tale 1bActivisionc2004-9-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the murky depths of the ocean, the fate of Reef City lies in the fins of one little fish--at least that's what he wants you to think. Dive into the underwater metropolis of Shark Tale and play as Oscar, a fast-talking fish whose little fib gets him into big trouble. Based on DreamWorks' animated film, Shark Tale features 25 missions that will have you exploring Reef City, racing through the coral, fighting Fish Fu and great white sharks, and dancing to the sounds of hip-hop tracks.  i2004kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00775na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002600027300002300053500049400076542003000570655002500600655002800625G9TF5200aGang de Requins 1bActivisionc2004-10-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the murky depths of the ocean, the fate of Reef City lies in the fins of one little fish--at least that's what he wants you to think. Dive into the underwater metropolis of Shark Tale and play as Oscar, a fast-talking fish whose little fib gets him into big trouble. Based on DreamWorks' animated film, Shark Tale features 25 missions that will have you exploring Reef City, racing through the coral, fighting Fish Fu and great white sharks, and dancing to the sounds of hip-hop tracks.  i2004kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00770na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002600022300002300048500049400071542003000565655002500595655002800620G9TI5200aShark Tale 1bActivisionc2004-10-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the murky depths of the ocean, the fate of Reef City lies in the fins of one little fish--at least that's what he wants you to think. Dive into the underwater metropolis of Shark Tale and play as Oscar, a fast-talking fish whose little fib gets him into big trouble. Based on DreamWorks' animated film, Shark Tale features 25 missions that will have you exploring Reef City, racing through the coral, fighting Fish Fu and great white sharks, and dancing to the sounds of hip-hop tracks.  i2004kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00280na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002500022300002300047500000500070542003000075655002500105655002800130G9TJC000aShark Tale 1bActivisionc2005-3-3  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00770na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264002600022300002300048500049400071542003000565655002500595655002800620G9TP5200aShark Tale 1bActivisionc2004-10-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn the murky depths of the ocean, the fate of Reef City lies in the fins of one little fish--at least that's what he wants you to think. Dive into the underwater metropolis of Shark Tale and play as Oscar, a fast-talking fish whose little fib gets him into big trouble. Based on DreamWorks' animated film, Shark Tale features 25 missions that will have you exploring Reef City, racing through the coral, fighting Fish Fu and great white sharks, and dancing to the sounds of hip-hop tracks.  i2004kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00639na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264002400034300002300058500035700081542002700438655002500465655002700490GA2E5100aAll-Star Baseball 2002 1bAcclaimc2001-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aMarketed behind 4-Time World Series Champion and New York Yankee Shortstop, Derek Jeter, All-Star Baseball 2002 brings to the Gamecube its fantastic double play combination of superior game-play and outstanding graphics. In fact, the All-Star Baseball franchise is so strong, it has the distinction of being selected twice as Baseball Game Of The Year!  i2001kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00611na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004900007264002300056300002300079500030800102542002700410655002500437655002700462GA3E5100aAll-Star Baseball 2003 featuring Derek Jeter 1bAcclaimc2002-2-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aAll-Star Baseball 2003 combines true-to-life graphics with superior gameplay to create the most exciting baseball experience for any fan. Featuring Derek Jeter, four-time World Series Champion, All-Star Baseball 2003 is the only baseball game available this year on all next generation hardware systems.  i2002kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00610na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004900007264002200056300002300078500030800101542002700409655002500436655002700461GA3J5100aAll-Star Baseball 2003 featuring Derek Jeter 1bAcclaimc2002-8-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aAll-Star Baseball 2003 combines true-to-life graphics with superior gameplay to create the most exciting baseball experience for any fan. Featuring Derek Jeter, four-time World Series Champion, All-Star Baseball 2003 is the only baseball game available this year on all next generation hardware systems.  i2002kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext01008na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004900007264002300056300002300079500070500102542002700807655002500834655002700859GA4E5100aAll-Star Baseball 2004 featuring Derek Jeter 1bAcclaimc2003-2-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe 2004 installment in Acclaim's long-running baseball series. The game features more than 80 new features and improvements, including a deeper, more customizable franchise mode. The biggest change comes in the interface. You still hit the same buttons to swing, bunt, steal, and field, but the batting cursor has been visually altered. It's still the same triangle shape as before, just with a different outline. Bunting is more unique, though. Instead of aiming the cursor when you go to bunt, a large arrow points on the ground. Aim your bunt in the desired direction and hope for the best. Fielding has also received a slight change, with the ball cursor changing color. Four up to four players.  i2003kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00804na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264003300042300002300075500049400098542003800592655002500630655002700655GA7E7000aBackyard Sports: Baseball 2007 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2010-4-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aBackyard Baseball 2007 is the fifth iteration of the best selling youth baseball video game of all time and the only kid's game to hold the coveted Major League Baseball (MLB) and Major League Baseball Players Association (MLBPA) licenses. Backyard Baseball 2007 features a roster full of top MLB pros as kids and includes all 30 MLB teams, uniforms, and logos. In addition, the game's kid-friendly, non-violent format, and high level of diversity makes it especially popular with parents.  i2010kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00830na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500054200087542002600629655002500655655002800680GAAJ0800aMickey to Minnie Trick & Chase 1bCapcomc2003-12-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aMinnie Mouse has been kidnapped by mysterious flying creatures, and it's up to Mickey to rescue her. Now, as either Mickey or Minnie, you must fight your way through three different stages, including a warehouse, museum, and ruins, and master special tricks and combinations. In each area, you'll solve puzzles, run, jump, and hide from enemies. Mickey can also hang onto ropes, climb onto containers, and use stealth maneuvers to evade foes. Disney's Hide and Sneak features more than 30 animated sequences for both playable characters.  i2003kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00759na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002800007264002200035300002300057500043800080542002500518655002500543655002700568655003000595GABEAF00aZatch Bell! Mamodo Fury 1bNamcoc2006-12-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlayers join Zatch, Kiyo and other characters from the hit manga and TV series ZATCHBELL! as they battle to become the mighty mamodo king. This time, up to four players can choose from more than 20 different playable teams. With three gameplay modes including Story Mode, VS mode and Arcade Mode, players can experience all the action in environments faithful to the TV series. All voice acting is even done by the U.S. TV show cast.  i2006kNamcosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext00231na  a2200097   4500001000700000245004900007264002300056300002300079500000500102542002600107GABJB200aKonjiki no Gashbell!! Go! Go! Mamono Fight!! 1bBandaic2005-12-15  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2005kBandaisGameTDB00867na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004500007264001900052300002300071500057600094542002300670655002500693655002700718GACE5H00aArmy Men: Air Combat: The Elite Missions 1b3DOc2003-3-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aArmy Men: Air Combat - The Elite Missions is a fast and furious game of toy helicopter-based combat set in the Army Men universe. It combines the trigger-twitching action of shooter-style gameplay with more strategic environment interaction via the winch mechanic. Continuing the classic struggle between the Green and Tan Armies, the heroic Captain Blade and his Alpha Wolf Squadron once again take to the skies with an onslaught of missions, incredible helicopter physics, deep gameplay, stunning cinematics and exciting character interaction. Real Combat. Plastic Men.  i2003k3DOsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00296na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002400031300002300055500000500078542002800083655002900111655003400140GAEJ0100aDoubutsu no Mori e+ 1bNintendoc2003-6-27  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2003kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aLife simulation games2wiiext00665na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002000007264002400027300002300051500033500074542002800409655002900437655003100466655003400497GAFE0100aAnimal Crossing 1bNintendoc2002-9-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aOccasionally strange but completely addictive, Nintendo's Animal Crossing for the GameCube is not so much a game as a simulation of life on a small town. Players begin the game by setting out to live life on their own in a colorful town, where they are greeted by a seemingly endless supply of things to do and characters to meet.  i2002kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aLife simulation games2wiiext00580na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264002500030300002300055500033500078542002800413655002900441GAFJ0100aDoubutsu no Mori + 1bNintendoc2001-12-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aOccasionally strange but completely addictive, Nintendo's Animal Crossing for the GameCube is not so much a game as a simulation of life on a small town. Players begin the game by setting out to live life on their own in a colorful town, where they are greeted by a seemingly endless supply of things to do and characters to meet.  i2001kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00576na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264002400027300002300051500033500074542002800409655002900437GAFP0100aAnimal Crossing 1bNintendoc2004-9-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aOccasionally strange but completely addictive, Nintendo's Animal Crossing for the GameCube is not so much a game as a simulation of life on a small town. Players begin the game by setting out to live life on their own in a colorful town, where they are greeted by a seemingly endless supply of things to do and characters to meet.  i2004kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00577na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264002500027300002300052500033500075542002800410655002900438GAFU0100aAnimal Crossing 1bNintendoc2003-10-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aOccasionally strange but completely addictive, Nintendo's Animal Crossing for the GameCube is not so much a game as a simulation of life on a small town. Players begin the game by setting out to live life on their own in a colorful town, where they are greeted by a seemingly endless supply of things to do and characters to meet.  i2003kNintendosGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext00723na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002500007264003400032300002300066500046100089542003800550655002500588GAGP7000aAsterix & Obelix XXL 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2004-6-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aCaesar and his elite troops have pulled off the impossible! Taking advantage of a sudden spring storm and the absence of our two heroes, the Romans invaded the indomitable Gaulish village. Everybody is now Ceasar’s prisoner! The Romans have also seized a cauldron full of Magic Potion that Getafix was busy brewing. While the cauldron is on its way to Rome, the Gaulish prisoners have been split up and scattered across the provinces of the Roman Empire.  i2004kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00417na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001800007264003300025300002300058500008500081542003600166655002500202655002600227655003000253GAHEGG00aAlien Hominid 1bO3 Entertainmentc2004-11-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aYour UFO has crash landed, and the FBI is out to get you! Time to take them out!  i2004kO3 EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aRun and gun games2wiiext01005na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264003500035300002300070500073900093542003800832655002500870GAKE5D00aMidway Arcade Treasures 1bMidway / Tradewestc2003-12-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aArcade classics collection, featuring the best Midway classics for hundreds of hours of timeless entertainment. Midway Arcade Treasures includes fully emulated versions of SpyHunter, DefenderII, Gauntlet, Joust, Paperboy, Rampage, Marble Madness, Robotron: 2084, Smash TV, Joust 2, Bubbles, RoadBlasters, Blaster, Rampart, Sinistar, Super Sprint, 720°, Toobin', KLAX, SPLAT!, Satan's Hollow, Vindicators, and more. In addition to the games, the developers also included DVD Content, such as interviews with the creators and game histories. Purists will be happy to hear that games designed around multiplayer gameplay, such as Joust, Rampage, Gauntlet, and Championship Sprint, feature their two, three, or four-player modes as well.  i2003kMidway / TradewestsGameTDB 7aCompilations2wiiext00669na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264002400035300002300059500042200082542002800504655002700532GALE0100aSuper Smash Bros. Melee 1bNintendoc2001-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aFrantic multiplayer fighting returns with Super Smash Bros. Melee on the Nintendo GameCube. More than just a minor upgrade to the popular N64 game, the GameCube Smash Bros. is chock full of so many options and features it will make your head spin. Players can pummel each other with 25 classic Nintendo characters, and fight in 18 various game-themed arenas (not to mention an assortment of unlockable secret arenas).  i2001kNintendosGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00674na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264002500039300002300064500042200087542002800509655002700537GALJ0100aDairantou Smash Brothers DX 1bNintendoc2001-11-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aFrantic multiplayer fighting returns with Super Smash Bros. Melee on the Nintendo GameCube. More than just a minor upgrade to the popular N64 game, the GameCube Smash Bros. is chock full of so many options and features it will make your head spin. Players can pummel each other with 25 classic Nintendo characters, and fight in 18 various game-themed arenas (not to mention an assortment of unlockable secret arenas).  i2001kNintendosGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00706na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002400035300002300059500042200082542002800504655002500532655002700557GALP0100aSuper Smash Bros. Melee 1bNintendoc2002-5-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aFrantic multiplayer fighting returns with Super Smash Bros. Melee on the Nintendo GameCube. More than just a minor upgrade to the popular N64 game, the GameCube Smash Bros. is chock full of so many options and features it will make your head spin. Players can pummel each other with 25 classic Nintendo characters, and fight in 18 various game-themed arenas (not to mention an assortment of unlockable secret arenas).  i2002kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext01591na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002600007264003600033300002300069500123500092542004001327655002501367655002601392655003901418GAME5H00aArmy Men: Sarge's War 1bGlobal Star Softwarec2004-8-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aGlobal Star Software, who picked up the license to the popular ARMY MEN series from 3DO, brings fans of the little plastic soldiers ARMY MEN: Sarge's War for the Gamecube. Following the character of Sarge, a war-scarred veteran, gamers must stop a renegade sect of the Tan Army before they can derail the signing of a peace treaty between the Green and Tan armies. A third-person perspective shooter game, Sarge's War is an easy game to pick up but a difficult one to master. The levels get progressively harder, with Sarge facing waves of enemies at a time. Fortunately, the game has a target lock feature, so Sarge can pick off his enemies one at a time. Some levels require Sarge to destroy walls, fences, or enemy artillery, and in other levels, he takes command of turret gun to wreak some major damage. In addition to the single-player campaign, ARMY MEN: Sarge's War contains several multiplayer modes, including death match, capture the flag, and team advance. Fans of the ARMY MEN series will be glad to see it continued with ARMY MEN: Sarge's War. Players who have fond memories of waging war with the little plastic army men or enjoy third-person shooters will also find Sarge's War a fun, entertaining game to pick up.  i2004kGlobal Star SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aThird-person shooter games2wiiext01050na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003700007264003900044300002300083500076400106542004200870655002800912GANE7U00aAnimaniacs: The Great Edgar Hunt 1bIgnition Entertainmentc2005-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on the multiple Emmy Award-winning animated series from Warner Bros. Animation and Amblin Entertainment, and featuring the actual voice actors from the series. Animaniacs: The Great Edgar Hunt is a third-person action adventure, which brings the colourful and hysterical world of the Animaniacs wonderfully to life. Players must guide the Warner brothers - and the Warner sister - through six levels in a quest to locate the hidden Edgar trophies. Wakko, Yakko and Dot each have their own special abilities, and each must be used in order to fully explore the luscious landscapes. Five 'Pinky & The Brain mini-games vary the pace of the adventure, as they explore the huge Animaniacs world, which is populated with dozens of characters from the cartoon.  i2005kIgnition EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext01048na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003700007264003700044300002300081500076400104542004200868655002800910GANP7U00aAnimaniacs: The Great Edgar Hunt 1bIgnition Entertainmentc2005-8-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on the multiple Emmy Award-winning animated series from Warner Bros. Animation and Amblin Entertainment, and featuring the actual voice actors from the series. Animaniacs: The Great Edgar Hunt is a third-person action adventure, which brings the colourful and hysterical world of the Animaniacs wonderfully to life. Players must guide the Warner brothers - and the Warner sister - through six levels in a quest to locate the hidden Edgar trophies. Wakko, Yakko and Dot each have their own special abilities, and each must be used in order to fully explore the luscious landscapes. Five 'Pinky & The Brain mini-games vary the pace of the adventure, as they explore the huge Animaniacs world, which is populated with dozens of characters from the cartoon.  i2005kIgnition EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00732na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002700045300002300072500042400095542003000519655002500549655003600574GAPE5200aAmerican Chopper 2: Full Throttle 1bActivisionc2005-11-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aA motorcycle enthusiast's game based on Discovery Channel's hit TV series. Gamers take on the role of Paul Sr., Paulie, Mikey or Vinnie and are challenged to build four choppers for an upcoming motorcycle competition. All the while, gamers must compete in family battles, races and other biker challenges in order to earn bike parts and the respect of Paul Sr. Players test their custom creations at the final showdown.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00412na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264003000040300002300070500015000093542003400243655002500277GAQE6S00aAquaman: Battle for Atlantis 1bTDK Mediactivec2003-7-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aRumbles of revolt star amongst the populace. Old enemies resurface, umted in one goal: the complete destruction and ruin of Atlantis and Aquaman.  i2003kTDK MediactivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00824na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264002000025300002300045500059600068542002300664655002700687GARE5H00aArmy Men: RTS 1b3DOc2004-11-10  a1 Wii optical disc  a3DO's famous green plastic soldiers move into the realm of real-time strategy in Army Men RTS. On a mission to defeat a colonel who has defected to the enemy, you command a number of units including infantry and several types of vehicles. Guide your elite corps of plastic troops across toy-proportioned battlefields such as a house's front yard, living room, and attic. Collect plastic and electricity resources to build structures and additional units. Use your radio call unit to bring death from above in the form of paratroopers or the dreaded magnifying glass which melts enemy forces.  i2004k3DOsGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext00252na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264002600030300002300056500000500079542003000084655002800114GASJ8P00aSonic Adventure DX 1bSega Japanc2003-6-19  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2003kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00507na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002300036300002300059500026300082542002700345655002500372GATE5100aATV: Quad Power Racing 2 1bAcclaimc2003-1-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aATV: Quad Power Racing 2 is all about big tricks, big boots to the face and big finishes. It's arcade ATV racing. ATV Quad Power Racing 2 combines 10 of the top pro riders in the world and 40+ real-life sponsors with fast, edge of your seat, arcade gameplay.  i2003kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00507na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002300036300002300059500026300082542002700345655002500372GATP5100aATV: Quad Power Racing 2 1bAcclaimc2003-1-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aATV: Quad Power Racing 2 is all about big tricks, big boots to the face and big finishes. It's arcade ATV racing. ATV Quad Power Racing 2 combines 10 of the top pro riders in the world and 40+ real-life sponsors with fast, edge of your seat, arcade gameplay.  i2003kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00904na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264002200027300002300049500067100072542002600743655002500769GAUE0800aAuto Modellista 1bCapcomc2003-10-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aFaithful port of Capcom's cel-shaded PlayStation 2 racer, sans online support. The game features nine tracks in all, eight normal and one hidden, and 69 real-world, licensed vehicles -- presented anime-style thanks to the toon-shading technique. Players can choose from arcade mode, a standard enter and race scenario, garage life, which is the career mode of the game, and VJ and Theater, an arena enabling players to watch, edit and direct race replays of their choice. Cars can be fully customized down to the tires, brakes, suspension, turbine kits, mufflers, transmissions and more with hundreds of parts to choose from. Supports two-player split-screen racing.  i2003kCapcomsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00915na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264002100039300002300060500067100083542002600754655002500780GAUJ0800aAuto Modellista: U.S.-tuned 1bCapcomc2003-7-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aFaithful port of Capcom's cel-shaded PlayStation 2 racer, sans online support. The game features nine tracks in all, eight normal and one hidden, and 69 real-world, licensed vehicles -- presented anime-style thanks to the toon-shading technique. Players can choose from arcade mode, a standard enter and race scenario, garage life, which is the career mode of the game, and VJ and Theater, an arena enabling players to watch, edit and direct race replays of their choice. Cars can be fully customized down to the tires, brakes, suspension, turbine kits, mufflers, transmissions and more with hundreds of parts to choose from. Supports two-player split-screen racing.  i2003kCapcomsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00539na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002000038300002300058500026000081542002300341655002500364655002800389GAVE7800aAvatar: The Last Airbender 1bTHQc2006-10-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on Nickelodeon's show, fans will play as Aang, Katara, Sokka and Haru as they grow into an unstoppable team utilizing the kung fu-inspired bending arts through the Avatar universe. Players will explore the four Avatar nations and battle new enemies.  i2006kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00539na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002000038300002300058500026000081542002300341655002500364655002800389GAVY7800aAvatar: The Legend of Aang 1bTHQc2006-10-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on Nickelodeon's show, fans will play as Aang, Katara, Sokka and Haru as they grow into an unstoppable team utilizing the kung fu-inspired bending arts through the Avatar universe. Players will explore the four Avatar nations and battle new enemies.  i2006kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00830na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264003400025300002300059500057500082542003800657655002500695GAXE5D04aThe Ant Bully 1bMidway / Tradewestc2006-7-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aGo pick on someone your own size! After bullying an innocent ant colony, a young boy named Lucas is magically shrunk down to ant size and embarks on a remarkable adventure. Play as Lucas, experiencing the dangerous and thrilling life of an ant as you battle, explore and forge new friendships with natives and other species in his new ant world. Help Lucas evolve from recluse to hero in his quest to save the colony from extermination. Based on the exciting moments from Warner Bros CG animated movie directed by John A. Davis (of the Jimmy Neutron: Boy Genius series.)  i2006kMidway / TradewestsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext01004na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264003400037300002300071500073700094542003800831655002500869GAYE5D00aMidway Arcade Treasures 2 1bMidway / Tradewestc2004-9-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aArcade classics collection, featuring the best Midway classics for hundreds of hours of timeless entertainment. The second edition of the series includes fully emulated versions of A.P.B., Arch Rivals, Championship Sprint, Cyberball 2072, Gauntlet 2, Hard Drivin’, Mortal Kombat, Mortal Kombat II, Mortal Kombat III, NARC, Pit Fighter, Primal Rage, Rampage World Tour, Spy Hunter 2, Steel Talons, STUN Runner, Timber, Total Carnage, Wizard of Wor, Xenophobe, and Xybots. In addition to the games, the developers also included as part of the DVD content, such as interviews with the creators and game histories. Purists will be happy to hear that games designed around multiplayer gameplay feature their multi-player modes as well.  i2004kMidway / TradewestsGameTDB 7aCompilations2wiiext00909na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004700007264003100054300002300085500059100108542003500699655002500734655002800759GAZD6900aHarry Potter und der Gefangene von Askaban 1bElectronic Artsc2004-5-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Dementors are coming, and this time Harry needs his friends. From the opening scene on the Hogwarts Express to the climatic finale on the shore of the great lake at Hogwarts, Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban immerses you in the world of Harry Potter. As Harry, Ron, and Hermione, you'll face the dreaded Azkaban guards, fly the Hippogriff around towers, and explore Hogwarts with the Marauder's Map. Learn spells that allow you to freeze creatures, control dragons, and conjure a Patronus. New two-player minigames include Flying Seahorse Fishing and Dueling Club minigames.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00906na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004500007264003000052300002300082500059100105542003500696655002500731655002800756GAZE6900aHarry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban 1bElectronic Artsc2004-6-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Dementors are coming, and this time Harry needs his friends. From the opening scene on the Hogwarts Express to the climatic finale on the shore of the great lake at Hogwarts, Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban immerses you in the world of Harry Potter. As Harry, Ron, and Hermione, you'll face the dreaded Azkaban guards, fly the Hippogriff around towers, and explore Hogwarts with the Marauder's Map. Learn spells that allow you to freeze creatures, control dragons, and conjure a Patronus. New two-player minigames include Flying Seahorse Fishing and Dueling Club minigames.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00905na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004400007264003000051300002300081500059100104542003500695655002500730655002800755GAZF6900aHarry Potter et le Prisonnier d