. As you search for clues, you must avoid classic Scooby-Doo monsters, use wacky inventions, eat Scooby Snacks, and gather power-ups. Do you have what it takes to foil the Mastermind's plan to rid the world of Mystery Inc?  i2002kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00249na  a2200097   4500001000700000245005800007264002700065300002300092500000500115542003100120GIIJ1800aMomotarou Dentetsu 11: Black Bonby Shutsugen! no Maki 1bHudson Softc2002-12-5  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2002kHudson SoftsGameTDB00813na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002300025300002300048500054200071542002700613655002500640655002600665GIJEFP00aSpace Raiders 1bMastiffc2004-4-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aNothing bites like a sky filled with invading alien space craft busily destroying civilization. And it gets really personal when the invaders drop hordes of ground troops to kill you and the people you love. Ask Justin the street gang leader hoping to find and rescue his friend alive, Ashley the fashion photographer searching desperately for her boyfriend and Naji, a cop who wants his partner back. They're all playable characters fighting for their lives, to avenge those who have died and in the hope of finding disappeared friends.  i2004kMastiffsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00808na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002000025300002300045500054200068542002500610655002500635655002600660GIJJC000aSpace Raiders 1bTaitoc2003-1-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aNothing bites like a sky filled with invading alien space craft busily destroying civilization. And it gets really personal when the invaders drop hordes of ground troops to kill you and the people you love. Ask Justin the street gang leader hoping to find and rescue his friend alive, Ashley the fashion photographer searching desperately for her boyfriend and Naji, a cop who wants his partner back. They're all playable characters fighting for their lives, to avenge those who have died and in the hope of finding disappeared friends.  i2003kTaitosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00812na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002200025300002300047500054200070542002700612655002500639655002600664GIJKC000aSpace Raiders 1bM Dreamc2003-1-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aNothing bites like a sky filled with invading alien space craft busily destroying civilization. And it gets really personal when the invaders drop hordes of ground troops to kill you and the people you love. Ask Justin the street gang leader hoping to find and rescue his friend alive, Ashley the fashion photographer searching desperately for her boyfriend and Naji, a cop who wants his partner back. They're all playable characters fighting for their lives, to avenge those who have died and in the hope of finding disappeared friends.  i2003kM DreamsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00971na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001200007264003400019300002300053500067900076542003800755655002500793655003100818GIKE7000aIkaruga 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2003-4-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs pilot Shinra, players must battle their way through 18 stages, move swiftly and act rationally in a new war, a space crusade of frighteningly intense firepower and hypnotic beauty. Take control of the ship Ikaruga -- alter your energy field, evade epic maelstroms of fire and terminate enemies with a nearly limitless arsenal -- all to protect an aging, exiled people. Find calm amid the chaos and reap the rewards, in this perfect combination of beautiful, manga-style storytelling and refined, ultra-challenging arcade heroics. Developed by Treasure, Ikaruga is quick-paced shooter with strong strategy elements. Features a slow-mo training mode and co-op play for two.  i2003kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShoot 'em up games2wiiext00983na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001200007264002100019300002300040500067900063542002500742655002500767655002600792655003100818GIKJ7000aIkaruga 1bAtaric2003-1-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs pilot Shinra, players must battle their way through 18 stages, move swiftly and act rationally in a new war, a space crusade of frighteningly intense firepower and hypnotic beauty. Take control of the ship Ikaruga -- alter your energy field, evade epic maelstroms of fire and terminate enemies with a nearly limitless arsenal -- all to protect an aging, exiled people. Find calm amid the chaos and reap the rewards, in this perfect combination of beautiful, manga-style storytelling and refined, ultra-challenging arcade heroics. Developed by Treasure, Ikaruga is quick-paced shooter with strong strategy elements. Features a slow-mo training mode and co-op play for two.  i2003kAtarisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aShoot 'em up games2wiiext01009na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001200007264003400019300002300053500067900076542003800755655002500793655002600818655003100844GIKP7000aIkaruga 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2003-5-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs pilot Shinra, players must battle their way through 18 stages, move swiftly and act rationally in a new war, a space crusade of frighteningly intense firepower and hypnotic beauty. Take control of the ship Ikaruga -- alter your energy field, evade epic maelstroms of fire and terminate enemies with a nearly limitless arsenal -- all to protect an aging, exiled people. Find calm amid the chaos and reap the rewards, in this perfect combination of beautiful, manga-style storytelling and refined, ultra-challenging arcade heroics. Developed by Treasure, Ikaruga is quick-paced shooter with strong strategy elements. Features a slow-mo training mode and co-op play for two.  i2003kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aShoot 'em up games2wiiext00739na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002200029300002300051500045900074542002700533655002500560655003200585GILE5100aAggressive Inline 1bAcclaimc2002-8-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aChris Edwards Aggressive Inline is a trick-based action sports game featuring extreme sports legend Chris Edwards, the founding father of aggressive inline skating, as well as other high-profile skaters such Taig Kris, Jaren Grob and Shane Yost. Gamers can play as one of their favorite inline stars, as they master and explore an array of fully-interactive levels, each filled with pedestrians, traffic systems and outrageous gravity-defying challenges.  i2002kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSkateboarding games2wiiext00739na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264002200029300002300051500045900074542002700533655002500560655003200585GILP5100aAggressive Inline 1bAcclaimc2002-9-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aChris Edwards Aggressive Inline is a trick-based action sports game featuring extreme sports legend Chris Edwards, the founding father of aggressive inline skating, as well as other high-profile skaters such Taig Kris, Jaren Grob and Shane Yost. Gamers can play as one of their favorite inline stars, as they master and explore an array of fully-interactive levels, each filled with pedestrians, traffic systems and outrageous gravity-defying challenges.  i2002kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSkateboarding games2wiiext00872na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264003100025300002300056500062300079542003500702655002500737GINE6900aBatman Begins 1bElectronic Artsc2005-6-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aTo be released on the same day as the highly-anticipated movie, Batman Begins follows the film as it explores the origins of the Batman legend and the Dark Knight's emergence as a force for good in Gotham. In the wake of his parents' murder, disillusioned industrial heir Bruce Wayne travels the world seeking the means to fight injustice and turn fear against those who prey on the fearful. He returns to Gotham and unveils his alter-ego: Batman, a masked crusader who uses his strength, intellect and an array of high tech deceptions to fight the sinister forces that threaten the city across 14 Gotham City locales.  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00872na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264003100025300002300056500062300079542003500702655002500737GINX6900aBatman Begins 1bElectronic Artsc2005-6-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aTo be released on the same day as the highly-anticipated movie, Batman Begins follows the film as it explores the origins of the Batman legend and the Dark Knight's emergence as a force for good in Gotham. In the wake of his parents' murder, disillusioned industrial heir Bruce Wayne travels the world seeking the means to fight injustice and turn fear against those who prey on the fearful. He returns to Gotham and unveils his alter-ego: Batman, a masked crusader who uses his strength, intellect and an array of high tech deceptions to fight the sinister forces that threaten the city across 14 Gotham City locales.  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00305na  a2200097   4500001000700000245006500007264005200072300002300124500000500147542005500152GIOJCM00aJikkyou Powerful Pro Yakyuu 10 Chou Ketteiban: 2003 Memorial 1bKonami Computer Entertainment Osakac2003-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2003kKonami Computer Entertainment OsakasGameTDB00700na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004700007264003400054300002300088500038000111542003800491655002500529655002400554GIPEAF00aShonen Jump's One Piece: Pirates' Carnival 1bNamco Bandai Gamesc2006-9-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aDifferent from the previous One Piece games, Pirates Carnival is a party game featuring over forty mini games. The mini games feature simple controls and promise to recreate well-known scenes from the original One Piece body of work. The game features support for four players, with some games featuring split screen play and others placing all four players in the same area.  i2006kNamco Bandai GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00674na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264002900039300002300068500038000091542003200471655002500503655002400528GIPJB200aOne Piece: Pirates Carnival 1bBandai Gamesc2005-11-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aDifferent from the previous One Piece games, Pirates Carnival is a party game featuring over forty mini games. The mini games feature simple controls and promise to recreate well-known scenes from the original One Piece body of work. The game features support for four players, with some games featuring split screen play and others placing all four players in the same area.  i2005kBandai GamessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00709na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004400007264001900051300002300070500045800093542002300551655002500574GIQE7804aThe Incredibles: Rise of the Underminer 1bTHQc2005-11-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aFollowing The Incredibles' defeat of Syndrome in the Walt Disney Pictures presentation of the Pixar Animation Studios film, a new threat emerges beneath the ground with a diabolical plot to pollute the major cities of the world and rule over humanity from below. Fans will be able to pick up from where the film left off and relive the glory days as Mr. Incredible and Frozone, superhero best friends who team up to tackle a new villain, The Underminer.  i2005kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00713na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004700007264001900054300002300073500045800096542002400554655002500578GIQJ8P00aMr. Incredible: Kyouteki Underminer Toujou 1bSegac2006-2-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aFollowing The Incredibles' defeat of Syndrome in the Walt Disney Pictures presentation of the Pixar Animation Studios film, a new threat emerges beneath the ground with a diabolical plot to pollute the major cities of the world and rule