tronic Artsc2003-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aReturn to Middle-earth in a game based on the epic final chapter of the The Lord of the Rings movie trilogy. Developed using the same digital assets as the films, The Return of the King recreates in stunning detail the final events of the War of the Ring. Become the heroes who determine the fate of Middle-earth as you traverse the haunted Paths of the Dead, defend Minas Tirith, and even play co-op multiplayer with a friend as you march against the impenetrable Black Gates of Mordor. The fate of Middle-earth is in your hands.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00895na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003800007264003800045300002300083500053300106542004200639655002500681655002800706655002700734GKME4100aPrince of Persia: The Two Thrones 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2005-12-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Prince of Persia returns to his kingdom to find it decimated by war and turned against him in Prince of Persia: The Two Thrones. You can play as the time-bending prince or his evil alter-ego as he tries to return to the throne that is rightfully his. Now there are two distinct characters, each with their own abilities and backgrounds, as you explore the urban setting of Babylon. Prince of Persia: The Two Thrones adds new Sands of Time abilities and an all-new setting for the third chapter in the Prince of Persia story.  i2005kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00937na  a2200145   4500001000700000245003800007264003800045300002300083500053300106542004200639655002500681655002800706655002700734655003000761GKMP4100aPrince of Persia: The Two Thrones 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2005-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Prince of Persia returns to his kingdom to find it decimated by war and turned against him in Prince of Persia: The Two Thrones. You can play as the time-bending prince or his evil alter-ego as he tries to return to the throne that is rightfully his. Now there are two distinct characters, each with their own abilities and backgrounds, as you explore the urban setting of Babylon. Prince of Persia: The Two Thrones adds new Sands of Time abilities and an all-new setting for the third chapter in the Prince of Persia story.  i2005kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00875na  a2200145   4500001000700000245004800007264002100055300002300076500049900099542002600598655002500624655002500649655002700674655002800701GKNEB200aUltimate Muscle: Legends vs. New Generation 1bBandaic2003-6-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs evil villains return to take over the world, a battle ensues between old and new superheroes. The wise trainer of both generations, Meat, has decided to pit the two generations against each other to decide which generation is the strongest of all time. In this epic battle, you can play as 20 different characters, each with different wrestling skills and signature finishing moves. Customize your character and play in Story mode or Versus and Tournament mode against three of your friends.  i2003kBandaisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00890na  a2200145   4500001000700000245006100007264002300068300002300091500049900114542002600613655002500639655002500664655002700689655002800716GKNJB200aKinnikuman Nisei: Shinsedai Choujin vs. Densetsu Choujin 1bBandaic2002-11-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aAs evil villains return to take over the world, a battle ensues between old and new superheroes. The wise trainer of both generations, Meat, has decided to pit the two generations against each other to decide which generation is the strongest of all time. In this epic battle, you can play as 20 different characters, each with different wrestling skills and signature finishing moves. Customize your character and play in Story mode or Versus and Tournament mode against three of your friends.  i2002kBandaisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00867na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003000007264002100037300002300058500054500081542002500626655002500651655002700676655003000703GKOE7000aKao the Kangaroo: Round 2 1bAtaric2006-3-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aKao the kangaroo is on the run - he has to stop the evil hunter Barnaba, who has captured most of his friends. Starting deep in the forests of the beavers, your journey will bring you to fascinating locations like the thunder mountain, the sea land and even the lost treasure island. Lots of adventures are waiting - use a snowboard to cross the frozen "gap of no return", win a breath-taking speed boat race and fly on the back of your pelican friend across the sea until you reach the legendary treasure island and the hideout of Barnaba.  i2006kAtarisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00869na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003000007264002200037300002300059500054500082542002600627655002500653655002700678655003000705GKOP6V00aKao the Kangaroo: Round 2 1bJoWoodc2005-4-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aKao the kangaroo is on the run - he has to stop the evil hunter Barnaba, who has captured most of his friends. Starting deep in the forests of the beavers, your journey will bring you to fascinating locations like the thunder mountain, the sea land and even the lost treasure island. Lots of adventures are waiting - use a snowboard to cross the frozen "gap of no return", win a breath-taking speed boat race and fly on the back of your pelican friend across the sea until you reach the legendary treasure island and the hideout of Barnaba.  i2005kJoWoodsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00279na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264002200032300002300054500000500077542002500082655002500107655002500132GKPJ6E00aMario Kart Arcade GP 1bNamcoc2005-10-10  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2005kNamcosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00292na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500000500087542002600092655002500118655002700143GKPJA400aJikkyou Powerful Pro Yakyuu 12 1bKonamic2005-7-14  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2005kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00376na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264002500027300002300052500013800075542002800213655002500241GKQJ0100aKururin Squash! 1bNintendoc2004-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aPilot the slowly rotating helicopter "Helirin" through mazes and reach the goal without bumping into any walls, obstacles or enemies.  i2004kNintendosGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00817na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003500007264002100042300002300063500049800086542002600584655002500610655002500635655002300660GKREB200aRibbit King Plus! (Bonus Disc) 1bBandaic2004-6-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Ribbit King, the fate of the planet rests on your ability to get frogs into holes. This is the game of Frolf, and, as Scooter, you must play it across 20 different courses on five different worlds. Power supplies are running out, and to save them, you must win the coveted Super Ribbinite. Choose from 13 odd characters and more than 10 frogs to collect items and points through Frolfing matches. Become the Frolfing Champion in Story mode or Versus mode, which supports up to four players.  i2004kBandaisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00805na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002200007264002200029300002300051500049800074542002600572655002500598655002500623655002300648GKRJB200aKero Kero King DX 1bBandaic2003-7-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Ribbit King, the fate of the planet rests on your ability to get frogs into holes. This is the game of Frolf, and, as Scooter, you must play it across 20 different courses on five different worlds. Power supplies are running out, and to save them, you must win the coveted Super Ribbinite. Choose from 13 odd characters and more than 10 frogs to collect items and points through Frolfing matches. Become the Frolfing Champion in Story mode or Versus mode, which supports up to four players.  i2003kBandaisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00798na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001600007264002100023300002300044500049800067542002600565655002500591655002300616655002500639GKRPB200aRibbit King 1bBandaic2004-9-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Ribbit King, the fate of the planet rests on your ability to get frogs into holes. This is the game of Frolf, and, as Scooter, you must play it across 20 different courses on five different worlds. Power supplies are running out, and to save them, you must win the coveted Super Ribbinite. Choose from 13 odd characters and more than 10 frogs to collect items and points through Frolfing matches. Become the Frolfing Champion in Story mode or Versus mode, which supports up to four players.  i2004kBandaisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00804na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002600037300002300063500051500086542003000601655002500631655002600656GKSE5200aKelly Slater's Pro Surfer 1bActivisionc2002-9-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience the rush of big-wave surfing and the surfer lifestyle as you search the globe for the world's best breaks. In Kelly Slater's Pro Surfer, you'll play Kelly Slater, or one of eight other surfers, in exotic locations with more than 30 challenging levels to explore. Drop down huge waves, ride barreling tubes, and pull off exciting trick combinations and signature pro moves. The game features multiple gameplay modes, including a Surf Trip where you choose your own path in search of the perfect wave.  i2002kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSurfing games2wiiext00805na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002700037300002300064500051500087542003000602655002500632655002600657GKSP5200aKelly Slater's Pro Surfer 1bActivisionc2002-10-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience the rush of big-wave surfing and the surfer lifestyle as you search the globe for the world's best breaks. In Kelly Slater's Pro Surfer, you'll play Kelly Slater, or one of eight other surfers, in exotic locations with more than 30 challenging levels to explore. Drop down huge waves, ride barreling tubes, and pull off exciting trick combinations and signature pro moves. The game features multiple gameplay modes, including a Surf Trip where you choose your own path in search of the perfect wave.  i2002kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSurfing games2wiiext00805na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002700037300002300064500051500087542003000602655002500632655002600657GKSX5200aKelly Slater's Pro Surfer 1bActivisionc2002-10-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience the rush of big-wave surfing and the surfer lifestyle as you search the globe for the world's best breaks. In Kelly Slater's Pro Surfer, you'll play Kelly Slater, or one of eight other surfers, in exotic locations with more than 30 challenging levels to explore. Drop down huge waves, ride barreling tubes, and pull off exciting trick combinations and signature pro moves. The game features multiple gameplay modes, including a Surf Trip where you choose your own path in search of the perfect wave.  i2002kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSurfing games2wiiext00338na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004400007264002200051300002300073500000500096542002600101655002500127655002700152655002500179GKTJA400aCaptain Tsubasa: Ougon Sedai no Chousen 1bKonamic2002-9-12  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2002kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00735na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001100007264003700018300002300055500048200078542004000560655002500600GKUE9G00aScaler 1bGlobal Star Softwarec2004-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aBobby "Scaler" Johnson gets more than he bargained for when he stumbles upon his next-door neighbor's evil plot to take over the world--by stealing all the lizards and training them to become his mutant army. As Bobby, you can take on your enemies by transforming into one of them. Work your way through the worlds by shape-shifting, vine-surfing, and using camouflage. In levels filled with exotic plants and creatures, this unexpected hero encounters many strange situations.  i2004kGlobal Star SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00622na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264002800040300002300068500032100091542003100412655002700443655003000470GKWJ1800aDream Mix TV: World Fighters 1bHudson Softc2003-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aDreamMix TV World Fighters is a 4 player mascot fighting game featuring characters from Konami, Hudson and Takara. There are more than 20 playable characters from several game series: Bomberman, Momotarou, Power Pro Baseball, Twinbee, Adventure Island, Transformers, Castlevania, Bloody Roar, Beyblade and many more.  i2003kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a2D fighting games2wiiext00237na  a2200097   4500001000700000245005700007264002100064300002300085500000500108542002600113GKXJE700aKiwame Mahjong DX II: The 4th MONDO21Cup Competition 1bAthenac2002-8-9  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2002kAthenasGameTDB01056na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002500026300002300051500078200074542002800856655002500884655002500909GKYE0100aKirby Air Ride 1bNintendoc2003-10-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aKirby arrives on the Nintendo GameCube at warp speed in his first-ever racing game. Based on the same principles as games like Super Smash Brothers and past Kirby titles, Kirby Air Ride offers an entirely new approach to the racing genre. The ultra-easy controls give Kirby Air Ride instant playability no matter how skilled the players may be. You control Kirby with the analog stick and the A button -- that's it. The stick steers the character left and right (he accelerates perpetually) and the A button when pressed slows him down and when released delivers a temporary speed boost. The idea is to hold the button down around corners, drift them, and then shoot out with a burst of speed. The game features a four-player split-screen mode and LAN support for link-up play.  i2003kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext01051na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002400027300002300051500077700074542002800851655002500879655002500904GKYJ0100aKirby's Airride 1bNintendoc2003-7-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aKirby arrives on Nintendo GameCube at warp speed in his first-ever racing game. Based on the same principles as games like Super Smash Brothers and past Kirby titles, Kirby Air Ride offers an entirely new approach to the racing genre. The ultra-easy controls give Kirby Air Ride instant playability no matter how skilled the players may be. You control Kirby with the analog stick and the A button -- that's it. The stick steers the character left and right (he accelerates perpetually) and the A button when pressed slows him down and when released delivers a temporary speed boost. The idea is to hold the button down around corners, drift them, and then shoot out with a burst of speed. The game features a four-player split-screen mode and LAN support for link-up play  i2003kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00516na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002400026300002300050500024300073542002800316655002500344655002500369GKYP0100aKirby Air Ride 1bNintendoc2004-2-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aKirby arrives on the Nintendo GameCube at warp speed in his first-ever racing game. Based on the same principles as games like Super Smash Brothers and past Kirby titles, Kirby Air Ride offers an entirely new approach to the racing genre.  i2004kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00918na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006200007264003700069300002300106500057200129542004000701655002500741655003000766GKZD5400aCodename: Kids Next Door: Operation: V.I.D.E.O.S.P.I.E.L. 1bGlobal Star Softwarec2005-10-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay as your favorite Kids Next Door operative on 14 diverse levels, each with a different style, in this action-packed game. Utilize each Kids Next Door member’s unique strengths and special skills as you dive, dodge, jump and attack to complete your mission. Engage in intense battles with Stickybeard, Knightbrace, The Toiletnator and other notorious and nasty villains from the show. And when Father masterminds an Arctic Prison break to free the villains, gather "Powuh Ups," collect and build your weapons, and get ready for an epic showdown on the Moon Base.  i2005kGlobal Star SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00874na  a2200109   4500001000700000245006000007264003700067300002300104500057200127542004000699655002500739GKZE9G00aCodename: Kids Next Door: Operation: V.I.D.E.O.G.A.M.E. 1bGlobal Star Softwarec2005-10-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay as your favorite Kids Next Door operative on 14 diverse levels, each with a different style, in this action-packed game. Utilize each Kids Next Door member’s unique strengths and special skills as you dive, dodge, jump and attack to complete your mission. Engage in intense battles with Stickybeard, Knightbrace, The Toiletnator and other notorious and nasty villains from the show. And when Father masterminds an Arctic Prison break to free the villains, gather "Powuh Ups," collect and build your weapons, and get ready for an epic showdown on the Moon Base.  i2005kGlobal Star SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00915na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006000007264003600067300002300103500057200126542004000698655002500738655003000763GKZP5400aCodename: Kids Next Door: Operation: V.I.D.E.O.G.A.M.E. 1bGlobal Star Softwarec2005-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay as your favorite Kids Next Door operative on 14 diverse levels, each with a different style, in this action-packed game. Utilize each Kids Next Door member’s unique strengths and special skills as you dive, dodge, jump and attack to complete your mission. Engage in intense battles with Stickybeard, Knightbrace, The Toiletnator and other notorious and nasty villains from the show. And when Father masterminds an Arctic Prison break to free the villains, gather "Powuh Ups," collect and build your weapons, and get ready for an epic showdown on the Moon Base.  i2005kGlobal Star SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00897na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002800007264002400035300002300059500053700082542002700619655002500646655002500671655002700696655002800723GL2E5100aLegends of Wrestling II 1bAcclaimc2002-11-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aLegends of Wrestling II takes you through the wrestling hall of fame with the top grapplers that are battling for squared-circle supremacy. Play as your favorite wrestler--including Hulk Hogan, Andre "The Giant," and Bret "Hitman" Hart--each with signature entrances, taunts, and moves. A new storyline and career mode let you battle for the respect of promoters and fans while fighting for the heavyweight championship crown. The game also features tag-team tournaments, a $15,000 Body Slam Challenge, and a variety of match types.  i2002kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00819na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002200035300002300057500053700080542002700617655002500644655002800669GL2P5100aLegends of Wrestling II 1bAcclaimc2003-2-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aLegends of Wrestling II takes you through the wrestling hall of fame with the top grapplers that are battling for squared-circle supremacy. Play as your favorite wrestler--including Hulk Hogan, Andre "The Giant," and Bret "Hitman" Hart--each with signature entrances, taunts, and moves. A new storyline and career mode let you battle for the respect of promoters and fans while fighting for the heavyweight championship crown. The game also features tag-team tournaments, a $15,000 Body Slam Challenge, and a variety of match types.  i2003kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00370na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003400007264003900041300002300080500000500103542004300108655002500151655002800176655003200204GL3JE800aLupin III: Umi ni Kieta Hihou 1bAsmik Ace Entertainmentc2003-7-31  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2003kAsmik Ace EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aInteractive fiction2wiiext00869na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500058200087542002500669655002500694655002800719GL5E4F00aLEGO Star Wars: The Video Game 1bEidosc2005-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aLego Star Wars blends Lego toys with the characters, stories, and vehicles from the prequel eras of the Star Wars universe. Now you can experience scenes from The Phantom Menace, Attack of the Clones, and Revenge of the Sith while controlling characters such as Obi-Wan Kenobi, Yoda, and Anakin Skywalker. Use the Jedi "force" to solve puzzles and manipulate environments. During your journey, you'll do everything from pod racing on Mos Espa to repelling the droid onslaught in the Genosian arena. Your friend can even join the action to help you at any time during your game.  i2005kEidossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00869na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500058200087542002500669655002500694655002800719GL5P4F00aLEGO Star Wars: The Video Game 1bEidosc2005-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aLego Star Wars blends Lego toys with the characters, stories, and vehicles from the prequel eras of the Star Wars universe. Now you can experience scenes from The Phantom Menace, Attack of the Clones, and Revenge of the Sith while controlling characters such as Obi-Wan Kenobi, Yoda, and Anakin Skywalker. Use the Jedi "force" to solve puzzles and manipulate environments. During your journey, you'll do everything from pod racing on Mos Espa to repelling the droid onslaught in the Genosian arena. Your friend can even join the action to help you at any time during your game.  i2005kEidossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00869na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500058200087542002500669655002500694655002800719GL5X4F00aLEGO Star Wars: The Video Game 1bEidosc2005-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aLego Star Wars blends Lego toys with the characters, stories, and vehicles from the prequel eras of the Star Wars universe. Now you can experience scenes from The Phantom Menace, Attack of the Clones, and Revenge of the Sith while controlling characters such as Obi-Wan Kenobi, Yoda, and Anakin Skywalker. Use the Jedi "force" to solve puzzles and manipulate environments. During your journey, you'll do everything from pod racing on Mos Espa to repelling the droid onslaught in the Genosian arena. Your friend can even join the action to help you at any time during your game.  i2005kEidossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01257na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004400007264003900051300002300090500092600113542004301039655002501082655002801107GL7E6400aLEGO Star Wars II: The Original Trilogy 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2006-9-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Empire strikes back in this sequel to the endearing Star Wars game made all of LEGOs. LEGO Star Wars II follows the Rebel Alliance's battle to dismantle the Galactic Empire and rebuild a galaxy in pieces. From Darth Vader's pursuit of Princess Leia aboard her blockade runner to a showdown on the reconstructed Death Star, the game includes even more of the family-friendly LEGO action. The sequel finally allows you to build with your LEGO blocks, as a new Free Play mode allows gamers to customize the vehicles for new ship designs, as well as Free Play all of the playable characters (over 100 in total) by mixing and matching body parts, forming the likes of "Stormbacca", "Chew Vader" and "Leia Wan Kenobi." Other additions include cool new character-specific attacks and maneuvers, Power Brick items, playable mini-kit vehicles, an improved two-player camera, a greater challenge for advanced players, and more.  i2006kLucasArts EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01257na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004400007264003900051300002300090500092600113542004301039655002501082655002801107GL7P6400aLEGO Star Wars II: The Original Trilogy 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2006-9-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Empire strikes back in this sequel to the endearing Star Wars game made all of LEGOs. LEGO Star Wars II follows the Rebel Alliance's battle to dismantle the Galactic Empire and rebuild a galaxy in pieces. From Darth Vader's pursuit of Princess Leia aboard her blockade runner to a showdown on the reconstructed Death Star, the game includes even more of the family-friendly LEGO action. The sequel finally allows you to build with your LEGO blocks, as a new Free Play mode allows gamers to customize the vehicles for new ship designs, as well as Free Play all of the playable characters (over 100 in total) by mixing and matching body parts, forming the likes of "Stormbacca", "Chew Vader" and "Leia Wan Kenobi." Other additions include cool new character-specific attacks and maneuvers, Power Brick items, playable mini-kit vehicles, an improved two-player camera, a greater challenge for advanced players, and more.  i2006kLucasArts EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01255na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002100042300002300063500096900086542002501055655002501080655002801105GL8D4F00aLara Croft Tomb Raider: Legend 1bEidosc2006-12-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aTomb Raider: Legend revives the athletic, intelligent and entertaining adventurer who won the hearts and minds of gamers worldwide. Lara comes alive with intricately animated expressions, moves and abilities. An arsenal of modern equipment, such as a magnetic grappling device, binoculars, frag grenades, personal lighting device and communications equipment, allows gamers to experience tomb raiding as never before. Eidos and Crystal Dynamics shaped Lara's look and movements to be an inherent extension of her skills, motivation and personality. Lara's character model features natural structure, realistic textures, detailed facial features, reactive eyes and fluid motion, all of which make her part of a living environment. New character animations and controls allow her to move through stunning environments with grace and precision, while an understanding of the game's original appeal reinvigorates the fundamental explore-and-solve adventure experience.  i2006kEidossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01256na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500096900087542002501056655002501081655002801106GL8E4F00aLara Croft Tomb Raider: Legend 1bEidosc2006-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aTomb Raider: Legend revives the athletic, intelligent and entertaining adventurer who won the hearts and minds of gamers worldwide. Lara comes alive with intricately animated expressions, moves and abilities. An arsenal of modern equipment, such as a magne