ameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01025na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264002700039300002300066500073300089542003000822655002500852655002600877GQCS5200aCall of Duty 2: Big Red One 1bActivisionc2005-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aCall of Duty 2: Big Red One offers cinematic intensity as never before on consoles. The hallmark cinematic intensity of Call of Duty returns with a more complete gameplay experience of World War II combat. Experience a wide variety of missions on land, sea, and in the air, with the aid of over three dozen authentic American, Italian, French, and German weapons. Charge into battle together as Allied and Axis planes duel overhead, artillery explosions shake the ground and choke the air, and bullets and shrapnel streak past you and your squadmates. Experience war-torn Europe and Africa, from the blistering desert expanses of Tunisia and Libya to the beautiful yet deadly countrysides of Italy, France, Belgium, and Germany.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00285na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264003200046300002300078500000500101542003600106655003300142GQFFFK00aFranklin: Un anniversaire surprise 1bThe Game Factoryc2006-6-16  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2006kThe Game FactorysGameTDB 7aEducational software2wiiext01226na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006100007264003700068300002300105500087500128542004001003655002801043655003301071GQLE9G00aNick Jr. Dora the Explorer: Journey to the Purple Planet 1bGlobal Star Softwarec2005-10-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aDora the Explorer: Journey to the Purple Planet is an interactive adventure for kids that closely models the TV show. Dora and Boots are about to embark on an adventure like never before. Join them as they blast off into outer space and travel far into the great unknown. They’ve met five new friends who just happen to be lost space creatures. Now Dora and Boots are going to take an intergalactic-journey to try and help these lost friends find their way back home to the Purple Planet. Play through six unique planetary locations, all offering a familiar Dora playground experience and hunt for lost items such as Turtles, the Ten Little Green Aliens and little robots. The game features meteors, tunnels, jet-packs and collectible space gems and a variety of locations including the Cosmic Canyons, the Dark Bubble Cavern, the Space Satellite and the Glitter Maze.  i2005kGlobal Star SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext01225na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006100007264003600068300002300104500087500127542004001002655002801042655003301070GQLP5400aNick Jr. Dora the Explorer: Journey to the Purple Planet 1bGlobal Star Softwarec2005-12-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aDora the Explorer: Journey to the Purple Planet is an interactive adventure for kids that closely models the TV show. Dora and Boots are about to embark on an adventure like never before. Join them as they blast off into outer space and travel far into the great unknown. They’ve met five new friends who just happen to be lost space creatures. Now Dora and Boots are going to take an intergalactic-journey to try and help these lost friends find their way back home to the Purple Planet. Play through six unique planetary locations, all offering a familiar Dora playground experience and hunt for lost items such as Turtles, the Ten Little Green Aliens and little robots. The game features meteors, tunnels, jet-packs and collectible space gems and a variety of locations including the Cosmic Canyons, the Dark Bubble Cavern, the Space Satellite and the Glitter Maze.  i2005kGlobal Star SoftwaresGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aEducational software2wiiext00805na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264003400036300002300070500053700093542003800630655002700668GQNE5D00aMortal Kombat: Deception 1bMidway / Tradewestc2005-2-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe sixth episode of the violent and visceral fighting series from Midway pounces on the success of MK: Deadly Alliance to tear even more pain and gameplay pleasure out of the Mortal Kombat beast. Destructible environments and break-through walls that lead to other arenas or fatality zones hearken back to the glory days of the series' surprise smash-through stages, while favorite characters from the series such as Scorpion, Sub-Zero, Mileena and the returning Baraka all vie for the chance to choose the fate of the world again.  i2005kMidway / TradewestsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00903na  a2200133   4500001000700000245005200007264002000059300002300079500056100102542002300663655002500686655002800711655003000739GQPE7800aSpongeBob SquarePants: Battle for Bikini Bottom 1bTHQc2003-10-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn an effort to cause the kind of global mayhem he has always dreamed of, the evil Plankton has set in motion his most diabolical plot ever to take over the world and the fate of Bikini Bottom has been put in the hands (or small tentacles) of three unsuspecting heroes. Put your platform skills to the ultimate test as SpongeBob, Patrick or Sandy Cheeks with an array of insane new maneuvers and power-ups at your disposal! Explore a huge 3D world, comprised of five huge worlds, encounter familiar friends and finally put an end to Plankton's evil scheme!  i2003kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00902na  a2200133   4500001000700000245005200007264002000059300002300079500056100102542002300663655002500686655002700711655003000738GQPP7800aSpongeBob SquarePants: Battle for Bikini Bottom 1bTHQc2003-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn an effort to cause the kind of global mayhem he has always dreamed of, the evil Plankton has set in motion his most diabolical plot ever to take over the world and the fate of Bikini Bottom has been put in the hands (or small tentacles) of three unsuspecting heroes. Put your platform skills to the ultimate test as SpongeBob, Patrick or Sandy Cheeks with an array of insane new maneuvers and power-ups at your disposal! Explore a huge 3D world, comprised of five huge worlds, encounter familiar friends and finally put an end to Plankton's evil scheme!  i2003kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00619na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264002000043300002300063500033900086542002300425655002500448655002400473GQQD7800aSpongeBob Schwammkopf: Film ab! 1bTHQc2005-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first multiplayer SpongeBob game, this collection of 30 party-style games allows players to compete for a role in a Bikini Bottom TV show, "The Adventures of Mermaidman & Barnacleboy." Up to four players will "audition" using both competitive and co-operative game play elements to earn roles in a 15-minute, full-fledged episode.  i2005kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00632na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005000007264001900057300002300076500033900099542002300438655002500461655002400486GQQE7800aSpongeBob SquarePants: Lights, Camera, Pants! 1bTHQc2005-9-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first multiplayer SpongeBob game, this collection of 30 party-style games allows players to compete for a role in a Bikini Bottom TV show, "The Adventures of Mermaidman & Barnacleboy." Up to four players will "audition" using both competitive and co-operative game play elements to earn roles in a 15-minute, full-fledged episode.  i2005kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00621na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002000045300002300065500033900088542002300427655002500450655002400475GQQF7800aBob L'eponge: Silence on Tourne ! 1bTHQc2005-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first multiplayer SpongeBob game, this collection of 30 party-style games allows players to compete for a role in a Bikini Bottom TV show, "The Adventures of Mermaidman & Barnacleboy." Up to four players will "audition" using both competitive and co-operative game play elements to earn roles in a 15-minute, full-fledged episode.  i2005kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00633na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005000007264002000057300002300077500033900100542002300439655002500462655002400487GQQH7800aSpongeBob SquarePants: Licht uit, Camera aan! 1bTHQc2005-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first multiplayer SpongeBob game, this collection of 30 party-style games allows players to compete for a role in a Bikini Bottom TV show, "The Adventures of Mermaidman & Barnacleboy." Up to four players will "audition" using both competitive and co-operative game play elements to earn roles in a 15-minute, full-fledged episode.  i2005kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00633na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005000007264002000057300002300077500033900100542002300439655002500462655002400487GQQP7800aSpongeBob SquarePants: Lights, Camera, Pants! 1bTHQc2005-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe first multiplayer SpongeBob game, this collection of 30 party-style games allows players to compete for a role in a Bikini Bottom TV show, "The Adventures of Mermaidman & Barnacleboy." Up to four players will "audition" using both competitive and co-operative game play elements to earn roles in a 15-minute, full-fledged episode.  i2005kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aParty games2wiiext00430na  a2200133   4500001000700000245004700007264002700054300002300081500008600104542003100190655002500221655002500246655002500271GQRJ1800aHudson Selection Vol. 1: Cubic Lode Runner 1bHudson Softc2003-7-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aPC Genjin completely remade with 3D graphics! A hilarious caveman rampage awaits!  i2003kHudson SoftsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00780na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264002200030300002300052500053900075542002500614655003100639GQSDAF00aTales of Symphonia 1bNamcoc2004-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn a dying village on Sylvarant, legend has it that a Chosen One will one day appear from among the people, and the land will be reborn. Now, you must enter a cel-shaded world in which you command real-time battles. Execute and combine hundreds of special attacks, magic spells, and combos. Each character grows to suit your fighting style, and the storyline changes based on the characters' relationships. The line between good and evil blurs in this immersive adventure where the fate of two interlocked worlds hangs in the balance.  i2004kNamcosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00779na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264002100030300002300051500053900074542002500613655003100638GQSEAF00aTales of Symphonia 1bNamcoc2004-7-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn a dying village on Sylvarant, legend has it that a Chosen One will one day appear from among the people, and the land will be reborn. Now, you must enter a cel-shaded world in which you command real-time battles. Execute and combine hundreds of special attacks, magic spells, and combos. Each character grows to suit your fighting style, and the storyline changes based on the characters' relationships. The line between good and evil blurs in this immersive adventure where the fate of two interlocked worlds hangs in the balance.  i2004kNamcosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00780na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264002200030300002300052500053900075542002500614655003100639GQSFAF00aTales of Symphonia 1bNamcoc2004-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn a dying village on Sylvarant, legend has it that a Chosen One will one day appear from among the people, and the land will be reborn. Now, you must enter a cel-shaded world in which you command real-time battles. Execute and combine hundreds of special attacks, magic spells, and combos. Each character grows to suit your fighting style, and the storyline changes based on the characters' relationships. The line between good and evil blurs in this immersive adventure where the fate of two interlocked worlds hangs in the balance.  i2004kNamcosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00780na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264002200030300002300052500053900075542002500614655003100639GQSIAF00aTales of Symphonia 1bNamcoc2004-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn a dying village on Sylvarant, legend has it that a Chosen One will one day appear from among the people, and the land will be reborn. Now, you must enter a cel-shaded world in which you command real-time battles. Execute and combine hundreds of special attacks, magic spells, and combos. Each character grows to suit your fighting style, and the storyline changes based on the characters' relationships. The line between good and evil blurs in this immersive adventure where the fate of two interlocked worlds hangs in the balance.  i2004kNamcosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00780na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264002200030300002300052500053900075542002500614655003100639GQSPAF00aTales of Symphonia 1bNamcoc2004-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn a dying village on Sylvarant, legend has it that a Chosen One will one day appear from among the people, and the land will be reborn. Now, you must enter a cel-shaded world in which you command real-time battles. Execute and combine hundreds of special attacks, magic spells, and combos. Each character grows to suit your fighting style, and the storyline changes based on the characters' relationships. The line between good and evil blurs in this immersive adventure where the fate of two interlocked worlds hangs in the balance.  i2004kNamcosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00780na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002300007264002200030300002300052500053900075542002500614655003100639GQSSAF00aTales of Symphonia 1bNamcoc2004-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn a dying village on Sylvarant, legend has it that a Chosen One will one day appear from among the people, and the land will be reborn. Now, you must enter a cel-shaded world in which you command real-time battles. Execute and combine hundreds of special attacks, magic spells, and combos. Each character grows to suit your fighting style, and the storyline changes based on the characters' relationships. The line between good and evil blurs in this immersive adventure where the fate of two interlocked worlds hangs in the balance.  i2004kNamcosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00853na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264003400030300002300064500055300087542003800640655002500678655002800703GQTE4Q00aMeet the Robinsons 1bDisney Interactivec2007-3-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhen it comes to licensed games based on popular movies, television shows, or toys, we - along with the rest of the sane gaming community - know pretty much what to expect. The game will borrow from its license, either following the main story directly or taking an "other world" approach to it, and offer the licensed characters in a tried and true gameplay design. So it should go without saying that while Meet the Robinsons is a solid overall attempt at the "movie game" sub-genre, there isn't anything that's really going to blow players away.  i2007kDisney InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00978na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264003200045300002300077500067100100542003500771655002500806655002500831GQWE6900aHarry Potter: Quidditch World Cup 1bElectronic Artsc2003-10-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aAdaptation of the airborne wizard soccer game featured in the Harry Potter books. Two teams comprised of seven players compete on broomsticks in the air. The quaffle, a floating sphere, acts as the equivalent to a soccer ball. Three "chasers" on each team offensively move the quaffle up and down the airborne stadium and attempt to hurl it through one of three existing goals. One "keeper," or goalie, on each end tries to block and return those attempts. Players must also watch out for "bludgers," or hard spheres with minds of their own that try to knock wizards off of their broomsticks, and the "snitch," a tiny golden sphere that pretty much guarantees a win.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext00978na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264003200045300002300077500067100100542003500771655002500806655002500831GQWJ1300aHarry Potter: Quidditch World Cup 1bElectronic Artsc2003-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aAdaptation of the airborne wizard soccer game featured in the Harry Potter books. Two teams comprised of seven players compete on broomsticks in the air. The quaffle, a floating sphere, acts as the equivalent to a soccer ball. Three "chasers" on each team offensively move the quaffle up and down the airborne stadium and attempt to hurl it through one of three existing goals. One "keeper," or goalie, on each end tries to block and return those attempts. Players must also watch out for "bludgers," or hard spheres with minds of their own that try to knock wizards off of their broomsticks, and the "snitch," a tiny golden sphere that pretty much guarantees a win.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext00977na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264003100045300002300076500067100099542003500770655002500805655002500830GQWP6900aHarry Potter: Quidditch World Cup 1bElectronic Artsc2003-11-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aAdaptation of the airborne wizard soccer game featured in the Harry Potter books. Two teams comprised of seven players compete on broomsticks in the air. The quaffle, a floating sphere, acts as the equivalent to a soccer ball. Three "chasers" on each team offensively move the quaffle up and down the airborne stadium and attempt to hurl it through one of three existing goals. One "keeper," or goalie, on each end tries to block and return those attempts. Players must also watch out for "bludgers," or hard spheres with minds of their own that try to knock wizards off of their broomsticks, and the "snitch," a tiny golden sphere that pretty much guarantees a win.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext00977na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264003100045300002300076500067100099542003500770655002500805655002500830GQWX6900aHarry Potter: Quidditch World Cup 1bElectronic Artsc2003-11-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aAdaptation of the airborne wizard soccer game featured in the Harry Potter books. Two teams comprised of seven players compete on broomsticks in the air. The quaffle, a floating sphere, acts as the equivalent to a soccer ball. Three "chasers" on each team offensively move the quaffle up and down the airborne stadium and attempt to hurl it through one of three existing goals. One "keeper," or goalie, on each end tries to block and return those attempts. Players must also watch out for "bludgers," or hard spheres with minds of their own that try to knock wizards off of their broomsticks, and the "snitch," a tiny golden sphere that pretty much guarantees a win.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext00502na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264003100027300002300058500021200081542003500293655002500328655002700353GQXE6900aMadden NFL 2004 1bElectronic Artsc2003-9-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe 2004 edition of Madden NFL Football includes several changes from the previous year. The new Playmaker Control allows players to quickly change, defensive coverage, and routes before and during the play.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00502na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264003100027300002300058500021200081542003500293655002500328655002700353GQXP6900aMadden NFL 2004 1bElectronic Artsc2003-9-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe 2004 edition of Madden NFL Football includes several changes from the previous year. The new Playmaker Control allows players to quickly change, defensive coverage, and routes before and during the play.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00256na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264002400042300002300066500000500089542002800094655002400122GQZJ0100aDensetsu no Quiz-ou Kettei-sen 1bNintendoc2005-12-8  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aBoard games2wiiext00324na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264002600028300002300054500007600077542003000153655003100183GR2E5200aLost Kingdoms II 1bActivisionc2003-5-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aSequel to 2002's lone GameCube card battle RPG, known as Rune in Japan.  i2003kActivisionsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00347na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004000007264002800047300002300075500007600098542003200174655003100206GR2JCQ00aRune II: Koruten no Kagi no Himitsu 1bFromSoftwarec2003-5-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aSequel to 2002's lone GameCube card battle RPG, known as Rune in Japan.  i2003kFromSoftwaresGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00323na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002100007264002500028300002300053500007600076542003000152655003100182GR2P5200aLost Kingdoms II 1bActivisionc2003-6-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aSequel to 2002's lone GameCube card battle RPG, known as Rune in Japan.  i2003kActivisionsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00808na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002200025300002300047500054000070542002600610655002500636655002500661GR3E5D00aRedCard 20-03 1bMidwayc2002-6-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aWith the huge glut of sports titles to choose from out there, it's getting harder and harder to find one that fits ones personal playing tastes. While FIFA reigns supreme as king of the football simulators year in and year out in terms of sales, and Konami's ISS remakes still claim the hardcore crown, less technical fans looking to try their gumption have been begging for a Blitz-style soccer piece for years. Who better to deliver the mustard than the creators of Blitz themselves? Hot of the presses at Midway comes RedCard 20-03.  i2002kMidwaysGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00808na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002600007264002500033300002300058500049200081542002800573655002400601655002400625655002500649GR4EMZ00aMC Groovz Dance Craze 1bMad Catsc2004-11-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis game lets you show off your dance moves on the included Mad Catz Beat Pad. Arrows passing across the screen indicate when and where you must step on the pad, but you'll need quick thinking and footwork to achieve success. Become a better dancer, exercise, or just show off your talent in both single-player and multiplayer modes. MC Groovz Dance Craze features songs by a variety of artists, including Jessica Simpson, DJ Jazzy Jeff & the Fresh Prince, and KC and the Sunshine Band.  i2004kMad CatssGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00807na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002600007264002400033300002300057500049200080542002800572655002400600655002400624655002500648GR4PMZ00aMC Groovz Dance Craze 1bMad Catsc2005-6-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis game lets you show off your dance moves on the included Mad Catz Beat Pad. Arrows passing across the screen indicate when and where you must step on the pad, but you'll need quick thinking and footwork to achieve success. Become a better dancer, exercise, or just show off your talent in both single-player and multiplayer modes. MC Groovz Dance Craze features songs by a variety of artists, including Jessica Simpson, DJ Jazzy Jeff & the Fresh Prince, and KC and the Sunshine Band.  i2005kMad CatssGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00784na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264003000035300002300065500047500088542003500563655002500598655003900623GR5J1K00aRoboCop: Aratanaru Kiki 1bMGM Interactivec2004-3-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aStep into the shoes of the half-man, half-human hybrid known as Robocop. Your mission is to uncover a sinister plot involving OCP, local gangsters dealing a deadly new synthetic drug and a powerful cyborg known only as MIND. As the police force's last hope, you must capture, destroy, or arrest hostile characters in a desperate search for clues and evidence. Protect the innocent using six different weapons, various power-ups, and Robocop's multitarget locking system.  i2004kMGM InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext01050na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264001900030300002300049500077600072542002300848655002800871655002900899GR6D7800aBratz: Rock Angelz 1bTHQc2005-11-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aBratz Rock Angelz will empower fans of the wildly popular line of fashion dolls to explore their own "passion for fashion" in a unique interactive adventure game. Fans will be immersed in the Bratz World as they embark on a series of voyages in search of intriguing stories to inspire and create their very own fashion magazine. Bratz Rock Angelz lets you slip into the shes of any of the four Bratz Girls. You can customize all of the Bratz girls hair, make-up, and outfits as you shop for the latest fashions and travel to exotic International locations to investigate the hottest stories to create your own fashion magazine. Bratz Rock Angelz literally brings the toy franchise to life by letting players chat face-to-face with the Bratz characters in their own world.  i2005kTHQsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aSimulation games2wiiext01050na  a2200121   450000100070000024500230000726400