fter you. Are you up for the challenge?  i2002kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00882na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003000007264002600037300002300063500063100086542003000717655002500747GSNE8P00aSonic Adventure 2: Battle 1bSega Japanc2002-2-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aSonic and company are back and better than ever in Sonic Adventure 2: Battle. Dr. Eggman is causing trouble once again, and it's up to Sonic, Tails, and Knuckles to stop him. Experience faster action, all-new two-player games, and a branching storyline that lets you choose to save the world as the Hero side, or conquer it as the Dark side. In the single-player mode, you'll go through more than 30 unique stages, which include a forgotten pyramid, an abandoned military base, and a giant space station. And then there's the expanded two-player mode, which features 12 playable characters competing in new head-to-head games.  i2002kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00920na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264002500037300002300062500063100085542003000716655002500746655002700771GSNP8P00aSonic Adventure 2: Battle 1bSega Japanc2002-5-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aSonic and company are back and better than ever in Sonic Adventure 2: Battle. Dr. Eggman is causing trouble once again, and it's up to Sonic, Tails, and Knuckles to stop him. Experience faster action, all-new two-player games, and a branching storyline that lets you choose to save the world as the Hero side, or conquer it as the Dark side. In the single-player mode, you'll go through more than 30 unique stages, which include a forgotten pyramid, an abandoned military base, and a giant space station. And then there's the expanded two-player mode, which features 12 playable characters competing in new head-to-head games.  i2002kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00398na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002700033300002300060500011100083542003000194655002500224655002700249GSOE8P00aSonic Mega Collection 1bSega Japanc2002-11-14  a1 Wii optical disc  a7 Sonic HIts, Unlockable games & Secrets, Bonus material includes comic book covers, rare artwork, & more.  i2002kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00398na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002700033300002300060500011100083542003000194655002500224655002700249GSOJ8P00aSonic Mega Collection 1bSega Japanc2002-12-19  a1 Wii optical disc  a7 Sonic HIts, Unlockable games & Secrets, Bonus material includes comic book covers, rare artwork, & more.  i2002kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00851na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002600007264002600033300002300059500049100082542003000573655002500603655002500628655002700653655002500680GSOP8P00aSonic Mega Collection 1bSega Japanc2003-3-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aSonic has appeared in many games in the last decade, and now you can relive seven of them from Sonic Mega Collection. This compilation includes the first three Sonic the Hedgehog titles, plus Sonic & Knuckles, Sonic 3D Flickies' Island, Sonic the Hedgehog Spinball, and Dr. Robotnik's Mean Bean Machine. With additional content such as character illustrations, movies, and comic-book covers, this game celebrates Sonic's long career and introduces his world to new generation of gamers.  i2003kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7aCompilations2wiiext00824na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264003200035300002300067500052700090542003500617655002500652655002500677GSPE6904aThe Simpsons: Road Rage 1bElectronic Artsc2001-12-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aMr. Burns is up to his greedy ways in Simpsons Road Rage, purchasing Springfield's busses and jacking up the fares. Now, Springfield residents must turn their cars into cabs and work the streets. Hopefully, making enough money to buy back the busses before the clock runs out. Choose from over 30 of your favorite Simpsons characters and brave the jam-packed streets of six huge levels, performing big-air and powerslide stunts. Compete for passengers in two-player, split screen action. Go on a road rage, Simpsons-style.  i2001kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00786na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264003100035300002300066500052700089542003500616655002500651GSPP6904aThe Simpsons: Road Rage 1bElectronic Artsc2002-5-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aMr. Burns is up to his greedy ways in Simpsons Road Rage, purchasing Springfield's busses and jacking up the fares. Now, Springfield residents must turn their cars into cabs and work the streets. Hopefully, making enough money to buy back the busses before the clock runs out. Choose from over 30 of your favorite Simpsons characters and brave the jam-packed streets of six huge levels, performing big-air and powerslide stunts. Compete for passengers in two-player, split screen action. Go on a road rage, Simpsons-style.  i2002kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00997na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005800007264002000065300002300085500068900108542002300797655002500820655003000845GSQE7800aSpongeBob SquarePants: Revenge of the Flying Dutchman 1bTHQc2002-12-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aJumping Jellyfish! It's SpongeBob vs. The Flying Dutchman. While cruising through Bikini Bottom, SpongeBob discovers a series of treasure chests covered with WARNING signs. Ignoring the signs, SpongeBob opens the chests, only to discover he has released the imprisoned Flying Dutchman! The Dutchman is furious that he was disturbed, and now wants to make SpongeBob and his friends part of his ghostly crew, so he flies away to cause mischief throughout Bikini Bottom. SpongeBob must now seek advice from Squidward, who owns a book about ghostly lore. SpongeBob learns that the only way to stop the Dutchman's wicked plans is to find the lost treasures hidden throughout Bikini Bottom.  i2002kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00996na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005800007264001900065300002300084500068900107542002300796655002500819655003000844GSQP7800aSpongeBob SquarePants: Revenge of the Flying Dutchman 1bTHQc2003-3-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aJumping Jellyfish! It?s SpongeBob vs. The Flying Dutchman. While cruising through Bikini Bottom, SpongeBob discovers a series of treasure chests covered with WARNING signs. Ignoring the signs, SpongeBob opens the chests, only to discover he has released the imprisoned Flying Dutchman! The Dutchman is furious that he was disturbed, and now wants to make SpongeBob and his friends part of his ghostly crew, so he flies away to cause mischief throughout Bikini Bottom. SpongeBob must now seek advice from Squidward, who owns a book about ghostly lore. SpongeBob learns that the only way to stop the Dutchman?s wicked plans is to find the lost treasures hidden throughout Bikini Bottom.  i2003kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00757na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002900036300002300065500050000088542003400588655002500622GSRE7S00aSmuggler's Run: Warzones 1bRockstar Gamesc2002-8-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aExotic Imports, an international delivery service, calls you back for another round of brutal courier action in Smuggler's Run: Warzones. This entry in the Smuggler's Run series lets you work for an elite band of smugglers. The game boasts a vehicle update--with the new hoverbike--plus new levels, new four-player multiplayer modes, and new countermeasures to thwart would-be pursuers and enemies. Now, make the drop, hit the nitro boost, and get across the border before all hell breaks loose.  i2002kRockstar GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00759na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264003100036300002300067500050000090542003400590655002500624GSRP7S00aSmuggler's Run: Warzones 1bRockstar Gamesc2002-10-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aExotic Imports, an international delivery service, calls you back for another round of brutal courier action in Smuggler's Run: Warzones. This entry in the Smuggler's Run series lets you work for an elite band of smugglers. The game boasts a vehicle update--with the new hoverbike--plus new levels, new four-player multiplayer modes, and new countermeasures to thwart would-be pursuers and enemies. Now, make the drop, hit the nitro boost, and get across the border before all hell breaks loose.  i2002kRockstar GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00668na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264002600028300002300054500038900077542003000466655002500496655002500521GSSE8P00aSega Soccer Slam 1bSega Japanc2002-3-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aHidden away in underground leagues and counter-culture clubs, Sega introduces a brutal new brand of soccer. Played by thugs who kick ass on and off the field, participants opt to watch their backs and let the crowds watch the game. Since nastiness supplants sportsmanship in this 3-on-3 hybrid of the world's most popular sport, the rulebook is only good as a splint for broken bones.  i2002kSega JapansGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00668na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264002600028300002300054500038900077542003000466655002500496655002500521GSSJ8P00aSega Soccer Slam 1bSega Japanc2002-9-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aHidden away in underground leagues and counter-culture clubs, Sega introduces a brutal new brand of soccer. Played by thugs who kick ass on and off the field, participants opt to watch their backs and let the crowds watch the game. Since nastiness supplants sportsmanship in this 3-on-3 hybrid of the world's most popular sport, the rulebook is only good as a splint for broken bones.  i2002kSega JapansGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext