rops to catch big air and pull off Uber tricks.  i2001kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00735na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264003100022300002300053500044600076542003500522655002500557655003100582GSTP6900aSSX Tricky 1bElectronic Artsc2002-7-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aSSX Tricky launches you into a world of monster air, intense tracks, and death-defying tricks. Six all-new competitors plus six riders from the original SSX make up the circuit. Compete in the World Circuit, go head-to-head in the Showoff versions of nine courses on the World Circuit, or just practice in Free Ride. With all-new Garibaldi and Valdez courses, you'll have plenty of huge cliff drops to catch big air and pull off Uber tricks.  i2002kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00809na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264003400041300002300075500053800098542003800636655002500674GSUE7000aSuperman: Shadow of Apokolips 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2003-3-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe man of steel faces his greatest challenge yet in Superman: Shadow of Apokolips. Darkseid, the most evil being in the galaxy, has enlisted the aid of Lex Luthor in his quest to destroy Superman and take over the world. As Superman, you must stop Luthor's army of Inter-Bot robots and the fearsome Metallo, who is fresh out of Strykers Island Prison. Use all of Superman's powers through 14 enormous levels, featuring epic battles with legendary villains, including Livewire and Parasite. The fate of the planet lies in your hands.  i2003kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00808na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264003300041300002300074500053800097542003800635655002500673GSUP7000aSuperman: Shadow of Apokolips 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2003-5-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe man of steel faces his greatest challenge yet in Superman: Shadow of Apokolips. Darkseid, the most evil being in the galaxy, has enlisted the aid of Lex Luthor in his quest to destroy Superman and take over the world. As Superman, you must stop Luthor's army of Inter-Bot robots and the fearsome Metallo, who is fresh out of Strykers Island Prison. Use all of Superman's powers through 14 enormous levels, featuring epic battles with legendary villains, including Livewire and Parasite. The fate of the planet lies in your hands.  i2003kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00480na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264001900023300002300042500020900065542002300274655002500297655003600322GSVE7800aMX SuperFly 1bTHQc2002-6-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aWith professional riders to choose from and authentic courses modeled using actual satellite data players will be able to race, pull amazing tricks, and compete for fame in freestyle mode or open terrain.  i2002kTHQsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext00479na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264001800023300002300041500020900064542002300273655002500296655003600321GSVP7800aMX SuperFly 1bTHQc2002-9-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aWith professional riders to choose from and authentic courses modeled using actual satellite data players will be able to race, pull amazing tricks, and compete for fame in freestyle mode or open terrain.  i2002kTHQsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aMotorcycle racing games2wiiext01105na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004700007264003800054300002300092500077400115542004300889655002500932655002600957GSWD6400aStar Wars: Rogue Squadron II: Rogue Leader 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2002-5-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Star Wars Rogue Squadron II you get the chance to jump into the cockpit of an X-wing and join Luke Skywalker and the Star Wars galaxy's most daring pilots as they return to face off against the Empire. As in the original hit game for N64, you'll relive favorite Star Wars battles including the perilous Death Star trench run, a daring space attack on a Star Destroyer and the legendary battle on the ice planet Hoth. Rogue Leader features stunning, movie like visuals and immerses players in an intense action-arcade experience. Aerial conflict takes place in a variety of craft such as the legendary X-wing, A-wing, and B-wing. For the first time, the game also features on-foot ground combat in missions directly based on or inspired by the original movie trilogy.  i2002kLucasArts EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01093na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004700007264002600054300002300080500078800103542002900891655002500920655002600945GSWE6400aStar Wars: Rogue Squadron II: Rogue Leader 1bLucasArtsc2001-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Star Wars Rogue Squadron II: Rogue Leader you get the chance to jump into the cockpit of an X-wing and join Luke Skywalker and the Star Wars galaxy's most daring pilots as they return to face off against the Empire. As in the original hit game for N64, you'll relive favorite Star Wars battles including the perilous Death Star trench run, a daring space attack on a Star Destroyer and the legendary battle on the ice planet Hoth. Rogue Leader features stunning, movie like visuals and immerses players in an intense action-arcade experience. Aerial conflict takes place in a variety of craft such as the legendary X-wing, A-wing, and B-wing. For the first time, the game also features on-foot ground combat in missions directly based on or inspired by the original movie trilogy.  i2001kLucasArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext01105na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004700007264003800054300002300092500077400115542004300889655002500932655002600957GSWF6400aStar Wars: Rogue Squadron II: Rogue Leader 1bLucasArts Entertainmentc2002-5-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Star Wars Rogue Squadron II you get the chance to jump into the cockpit of an X-wing and join Luke Skywalker