ub, or explore the subway to earn new skills and items.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aLife simulation games2wiiext00809na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264003700038300002300075500048500098542004100583655002900624655003400653GUBJ1304aThe Urbz: Sims in the City 1bElectronic Arts Japanc2005-1-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Sims have moved to the City where there's always action and where reputation means everything. In the Urbz: Sims in the City, you can go to work at such locations as the Sushi Bar, Chop Shop, or Bootleg Fireworks, Inc. Success at work brings promotions, access to new power socials, and gear to influence your new lifestyle. Flaunt your attitude by styling your Urbz, and then cross the velvet ropes of an uptown night club, or explore the subway to earn new skills and items.  i2005kElectronic Arts JapansGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aLife simulation games2wiiext00889na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264003200038300002300070500057600093542003500669655002900704655003400733GUBP6904aThe Urbz: Sims in the City 1bElectronic Artsc2004-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Sims have moved to the City where there's always action and where reputation means everything. In the Urbz: Sims in the City, you can go to work at such locations as the Sushi Bar, Chop Shop, or Bootleg Fireworks, Inc. Success at work brings promotions, access to new power socials, and gear to influence your new lifestyle. Flaunt your attitude by styling your Urbz, and then cross the velvet ropes of an uptown night club, or explore the subway to earn new skills and items. *NOTE- This game requires a larger than standard memory card and takes 107 blocks to save*  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aLife simulation games2wiiext00308na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264003000043300002300073500000500096542003500101655002500136655002500161GUCD6900aUEFA Champions League 2004-2005 1bElectronic Artsc2005-2-3  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00308na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264003000043300002300073500000500096542003500101655002500136655002500161GUCF6900aUEFA Champions League 2004-2005 1bElectronic Artsc2005-2-3  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00308na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264003000043300002300073500000500096542003500101655002500136655002500161GUCP6900aUEFA Champions League 2004-2005 1bElectronic Artsc2005-2-3  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00891na  a2200145   4500001000700000245001900007264003500026300002300061500051400084542003900598655002500637655002500662655002700687655003100714GUFE4Z00aUFC: Throwdown 1bCrave Entertainmentc2002-7-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aBuild the best, and destroy the rest in UFC: Throwdown, a fighting game that lets you use all the mixed martial arts moves of UFC champions. In the Octagon, you can develop your own offensive and defensive strategies while stringing combos together and exploiting various fighting techniques to suit your personal style. Choose from more than 25 actual UFC fighters, or customize your own fighter in Create-a-Fighter mode. In Tournament mode, you can set up single elimination matches for up to eight players.  i2002kCrave EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aMartial arts games2wiiext00242na  a2200097   4500001000700000245006200007264002100069300002300090500000500113542002600118GUFJ0800aUFC: Ultimate Fighting Championship 2: Tapout: Final Spec 1bCapcomc2002-9-5  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2002kCapcomsGameTDB00774na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001900007264003500026300002300061500051400084542003900598655002700637GUFP4Z00aUFC: Throwdown 1bCrave Entertainmentc2002-9-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aBuild the best, and destroy the rest in UFC: Throwdown, a fighting game that lets you use all the mixed martial arts moves of UFC champions. In the Octagon, you can develop your own offensive and defensive strategies while stringing combos together and exploiting various fighting techniques to suit your personal style. Choose from more than 25 actual UFC fighters, or customize your own fighter in Create-a-Fighter mode. In Tournament mode, you can set up single elimination matches for up to eight players.  i2002kCrave EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00936na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264003200041300002300073500067000096542003500766655002500801GUGD6900aNeed for Speed: Underground 2 1bElectronic Artsc2004-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aNeed for Speed: Underground 2 will challenge gamers to immerse themselves in the tuner culture, exploring an expansive, free-roaming city divided into five distinct neighborhoods. Gamers will encounter rival racers who will initiate events, tip players off to the hottest racing spots, and show them where to buy the most sought-after licensed aftermarket upgrades. The game will feature new game modes, deep new performance customization and tuning, and more than 30 licensed cars. The game also delivers twice the visual customization upgrades as the original game, providing a staggering 70 billion possible car combinations for total automotive self-expression.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00936na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264003200041300002300073500067000096542003500766655002500801GUGE6900aNeed for Speed: Underground 2 1bElectronic Artsc2004-11-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aNeed for Speed: Underground 2 will challenge gamers to immerse themselves in the tuner culture, exploring an expansive, free-roaming city divided into five distinct neighborhoods. Gamers will encounter rival racers who will initiate events, tip players off to the hottest racing spots, and show them where to buy the most sought-after licensed aftermarket upgrades. The game will feature new game modes, deep new performance customization and tuning, and more than 30 licensed cars. The game also delivers twice the visual customization upgrades as the original game, providing a staggering 70 billion possible car combinations for total automotive self-expression.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00936na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264003200041300002300073500067000096542003500766655002500801GUGF6900aNeed for Speed: Underground 2 1bElectronic Artsc2004-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aNeed for Speed: Underground 2 will challenge gamers to immerse themselves in the tuner culture, exploring an expansive, free-roaming city divided into five distinct neighborhoods. Gamers will encounter rival racers who will initiate events, tip players off to the hottest racing spots, and show them where to buy the most sought-after licensed aftermarket upgrades. The game will feature new game modes, deep new performance customization and tuning, and more than 30 licensed cars. The game also delivers twice the visual customization upgrades as the original game, providing a staggering 70 billion possible car combinations for total automotive self-expression.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00450na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003400007264003200041300002300073500018400096542003500280655002500315GUGP6900aNeed for Speed: Underground 2 1bElectronic Artsc2004-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aNeed for Speed: Underground 2 will challenge gamers to immerse themselves in the tuner culture, exploring an expansive, free-roaming city divided into five distinct neighborhoods.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00780na  a2200121   4500001000700000245000800007264002700015300002300042500051200065542003000577655002500607655002600632GUMD5200aGun 1bActivisionc2005-11-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience the brutality, lawlessness, greed, and lust, that was the West. When life robs Colton White of all that matters, the only thing left he can trust is his GUN. From award-winning developer, Neversoft, and accomplished screenwriter, Randall Jahnson (The Mask of Zorro, The Doors), GUN follows Colton on his quest for discovery as he seeks to exact vengeful justice on those who have wronged him. GUN is a realistic epic action/adventure that lets gamers experience the brutality of the lawless West.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00779na  a2200121   4500001000700000245000800007264002600015300002300041500051200064542003000576655002500606655002600631GUME5200aGun 1bActivisionc2005-11-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience the brutality, lawlessness, greed, and lust, that was the West. When life robs Colton White of all that matters, the only thing left he can trust is his GUN. From award-winning developer, Neversoft, and accomplished screenwriter, Randall Jahnson (The Mask of Zorro, The Doors), GUN follows Colton on his quest for discovery as he seeks to exact vengeful justice on those who have wronged him. GUN is a realistic epic action/adventure that lets gamers experience the brutality of the lawless West.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00780na  a2200121   4500001000700000245000800007264002700015300002300042500051200065542003000577655002500607655002600632GUMP5200aGun 1bActivisionc2005-11-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aExperience the brutality, lawlessness, greed, and lust, that was the West. When life robs Colton White of all that matters, the only thing left he can trust is his GUN. From award-winning developer, Neversoft, and accomplished screenwriter, Randall Jahnson (The Mask of Zorro, The Doors), GUN follows Colton on his quest for discovery as he seeks to exact vengeful justice on those who have wronged him. GUN is a realistic epic action/adventure that lets gamers experience the brutality of the lawless West.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00683na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264003300033300002300066500042100089542003800510655002500548GUNE5D00aGauntlet: Dark Legacy 1bMidway / Tradewestc2002-3-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aGauntlet Dark Legacy is the all-new 3D iteration in the time-honored "hack'n'slash" classic Gauntlet franchise. The revolutionary Gauntlet game design allows you to work in a team and venture through eight dangerous worlds. One to four players can select one of eight different characters. Using force of arms and exotic magical powers, you vanquish creatures, search for treasure, evade traps, and embark on quests.  i2002kMidway / TradewestsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00683na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002600007264003300033300002300066500042100089542003800510655002500548GUNP5D00aGauntlet: Dark Legacy 1bMidway / Tradewestc2002-3-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aGauntlet Dark Legacy is the all-new 3D iteration in the time-honored "hack'n'slash" classic Gauntlet franchise. The revolutionary Gauntlet game design allows you to work in a team and venture through eight dangerous worlds. One to four players can select one of eight different characters. Using force of arms and exotic magical powers, you vanquish creatures, search for treasure, evade traps, and embark on quests.  i2002kMidway / TradewestsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00558na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264002700031300002300058500031200081542003000393655002500423GUPE8P00aShadow the Hedgehog 1bSega Japanc2005-11-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe world is in peril as forces, both good and evil, make a play for the powerful Chaos Emeralds. In Shadow the Hedgehog, you can control Shadow and choose which side to fight for. This 3D platformer lets you use weapons, vehicles, environmental objects, and time and space manipulation to combat your foes.  i2005kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00558na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264002700031300002300058500031200081542003000393655002500423GUPJ8P00aShadow the Hedgehog 1bSega Japanc2005-12-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe world is in peril as forces, both good and evil, make a play for the powerful Chaos Emeralds. In Shadow the Hedgehog, you can control Shadow and choose which side to fight for. This 3D platformer lets you use weapons, vehicles, environmental objects, and time and space manipulation to combat your foes.  i2005kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00558na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002400007264002700031300002300058500031200081542003000393655002500423GUPP8P00aShadow the Hedgehog 1bSega Japanc2005-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe world is in peril as forces, both good and evil, make a play for the powerful Chaos Emeralds. In Shadow the Hedgehog, you can control Shadow and choose which side to fight for. This 3D platformer lets you use weapons, vehicles, environmental objects, and time and space manipulation to combat your foes.  i2005kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00607na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004300007264002200050300002300072500035300095542002500448655002400473GUSE7F00aUniversal Studios Theme Park Adventure 1bKemcoc2001-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aLights... Camera... PLAY! You're not just a visitor, you're the star in Kemco's Universal Studios™ Theme Park Adventure, a magical 3-D journey beyond the theme park rides and into an amazing realm of games based upon the most successful movies produced in Hollywood. You'll love this virtual gaming lark through the world's best movie theme park!  i2001kKemcosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00229na  a2200097   450000100070000024500380000726400270004530000230007250