00245002400007264002700031300002300058500034200081542003000423655002500453655002700478GUTP5200aUltimate Spider-Man 1bActivisionc2005-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on the comic book of the same name, Ultimate Spider-Man lets you play as either the hero Spider-Man or his arch-nemesis, Venom. Use the unique combat techniques of either Spider-Man or Venom to battle a host of Spider-Man characters. Artistic contributions by the creators of the series make for an authentic Spider-Man experience.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00627na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002700031300002300058500034200081542003000423655002500453655002700478GUTS5200aUltimate Spider-Man 1bActivisionc2005-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on the comic book of the same name, Ultimate Spider-Man lets you play as either the hero Spider-Man or his arch-nemesis, Venom. Use the unique combat techniques of either Spider-Man or Venom to battle a host of Spider-Man characters. Artistic contributions by the creators of the series make for an authentic Spider-Man experience.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00786na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002300035300002300058500050600081542002700587655002500614655002500639GUVE5100aFreestyle Street Soccer 1bAcclaimc2004-2-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aFreestyle Street Soccer focuses on 10 individual gangs--all based on the different styles, fashions, and cultures found in the concrete jungle. These teams fiercely compete for each other's turf with the ultimate goal to gain control of the whole city. You'll join the battle as one of 40 players with individual catchphrases, plus trick, combo, and special moves. As you conquer the challenges in five game modes, remember--on the streets, it's just as important to look cool as it is to score goals.  i2004kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00785na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264002200034300002300056500050500079542002700584655002500611655002700636GUVP5100aUrban Freestyle Soccer 1bAcclaimc2004-3-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aUrban Freestyle Soccer focuses on 10 individual gangs--all based on the different styles, fashions, and cultures found in the concrete jungle. These teams fiercely compete for each other's turf with the ultimate goal to gain control of the whole city. You'll join the battle as one of 40 players with individual catchphrases, plus trick, combo, and special moves. As you conquer the challenges in five game modes, remember--on the streets, it's just as important to look cool as it is to score goals.  i2004kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00994na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002800007264003900035300002300074500063900097542004200736655002500778655002700803655003000830GUZE4100aBatman: Rise of Sin Tzu 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2003-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aSin Tzu, cunning master of strategy and martial arts, makes history as the first Batman character to debut in a video game. To commemorate this event, DC Comics and Warner Bros. have showcased the talents of veteran scriptwriter Flint Dille and reknown comic book artist, Jim Lee as Sin Tzu's co-creators and character designers. The third-person action game lets up to two players join forces as Batman and Robin or Nightwing and Batgirl and take on the scum of Gotham City. Utilizing 35 different attacks and plenty of Bat-gadgets, players fight their way through 12 levels, from the Gotham City Docks to the infamous Arkham Asylum.  i2003kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00993na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002800007264003800035300002300073500063900096542004200735655002500777655002700802655003000829GUZP4100aBatman: Rise of Sin Tzu 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2003-12-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aSin Tzu, cunning master of strategy and martial arts, makes history as the first Batman character to debut in a video game. To commemorate this event, DC Comics and Warner Bros. have showcased the talents of veteran scriptwriter Flint Dille and reknown comic book artist, Jim Lee as Sin Tzu's co-creators and character designers. The third-person action game lets up to two players join forces as Batman and Robin or Nightwing and Batgirl and take on the scum of Gotham City. Utilizing 35 different attacks and plenty of Bat-gadgets, players fight their way through 12 levels, from the Gotham City Docks to the infamous Arkham Asylum.  i2003kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00771na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001400007264002100021300002300042500054600065542002500611655002500636GV3J7000aV-Rally 3 1bAtaric2003-7-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aV-Rally evolves in its third installment with more detailed cars, customizable rally cars, and scurrying spectators. The world's top rally cars--including Subaru Impreza, Mitsubishi Lancer Evolution 7, Citroen Xsara, and Ford Focus--are included in V-Rally 3. Choose one, and then overcome spectators, deformed car parts, and extreme driving conditions as you race in six real-world locations and various gameplay modes. The life of a professional rally driver is rough--it's up to you to strategize your career and race your way to the top.  i2003kAtarisGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00771na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001400007264002100021300002300042500054600065542002500611655002500636GV3P7000aV-Rally 3 1bAtaric2003-6-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aV-Rally evolves in its third installment with more detailed cars, customizable rally cars, and scurrying spectators. The world's top rally cars--including Subaru Impreza, Mitsubishi Lancer Evolution 7, Citroen Xsara, and Ford Focus--are included in V-Rally 3. Choose one, and then overcome spectators, deformed car parts, and extreme driving conditions as you race in six real-world locations and various gameplay modes. The life of a professional rally driver is rough--it's up to you to strategize your career and race your way to the top.  i2003kAtarisGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext01217na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264003100029300002300060500092500083542003501008655002501043655002701068GV4E6900aMVP Baseball 2005 1bElectronic Artsc2005-2-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing the EA Sports Hitter's Eye, MVP Baseball 2005 gives players more control of their at-bat including the power to read the pitch and the ability to move in the batter's box. A visual indicator allows hitters to pick up the pitch the moment it leaves the pitcher's hand. In addition, players can use the Pitch/Swing Analysis to review the timing and location of their swings and adjust accordingly. An all-new Owner Mode enables players to control all aspects of an organization including concession stand prices, promotional days, hiring and firing coaches as well as building their field of dreams. In Create Ballpark, players can customize their stadium by selecting a ballpark name, location, field dimensions and much more. The game features 30 Single-A minor league teams (90 minor leagues teams overall), three new mini-games, an improved Dynasty Mode and all-new unlockable legends, stadiums and uniforms.  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00522na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003400007264002200041300002300063500019400086542002600280655002500306655002700331655003000358GVCE0800aViewtiful Joe: Red Hot Rumble 1bCapcomc2005-11-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aCaptain Blue is casting for the lead in his new action movie and the competition is RED HOT! Fight head-to-head against your friends - whoever is the most kick-butt lands the starring role!  i2005kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00523na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003500007264002200042300002300064500019400087542002600281655002500307655002700332655003000359GVCJ0800aViewtiful Joe: Battle Carnival 1bCapcomc2005-9-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aCaptain Blue is casting for the lead in his new action movie and the competition is RED HOT! Fight head-to-head against your friends - whoever is the most kick-butt lands the starring role!  i2005kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00522na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003400007264002200041300002300063500019400086542002600280655002500306655002700331655003000358GVCP0800aViewtiful Joe: Red Hot Rumble 1bCapcomc2006-3-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aCaptain Blue is casting for the lead in his new action movie and the competition is RED HOT! Fight head-to-head against your friends - whoever is the most kick-butt lands the starring role!  i2006kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00737na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264001800035300002300053500050000076542002300576655002800599GVDE7800aBratz: Forever Diamondz 1bTHQc2006-9-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aYasmin, Cloe, Sasha, and Jade are back for a brand new adventure sending them across the country in search of the hottest fashion designer. Players will experience unique adventures through the eyes of the four playable characters, in detailed open world environments, as they compete for a spot in "America Rocks Fashion" TV show. Fans will discover new features that include a figure skating competition and the ability to adopt a pet to train, dress, accessorize and showcase in competitions.  i2006kTHQsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00738na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002800007264001900035300002300054500050000077542002300577655002800600GVDP7800aBratz: Forever Diamondz 1bTHQc2006-11-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aYasmin, Cloe, Sasha, and Jade are back for a brand new adventure sending them across the country in search of the hottest fashion designer. Players will experience unique adventures through the eyes of the four playable characters, in detailed open world environments, as they compete for a spot in "America Rocks Fashion" TV show. Fans will discover new features that include a figure skating competition and the ability to adopt a pet to train, dress, accessorize and showcase in competitions.  i2006kTHQsGameTDB 7aAdventure games2wiiext00208na  a2200097   4500001000700000245002600007264002300033300002300056500000500079542002600084GVFJ0800aViewtiful Joe Revival 1bCapcomc2003-12-18  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2003kCapcomsGameTDB00687na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002000027300002300047500041700070542002500487655002500512655002800537GVHE4F00aBionicle Heroes 1bEidosc2006-4-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aBionicle Heroes brings to life the most powerful and exciting LEGO characters ever seen in one game, in an action-packed world of adventure and discovery. Take control of a young hero as he steps out of the real world and into the strange and dangerous universe of Bionicle. Only by mastering the powers and special abilities of the greatest Bionicle heroes will he be able to overcome the many challenges ahead.  i2006kEidossGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00558na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001800007264002200025300002300047500024600070542002600316655002700342655003000369655002500399GVJE0800aViewtiful Joe 1bCapcomc2003-10-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aFighting action game from Capcom Studio 4's Atsushi Inaba. Joe was just your average, well, Joe until he was transported into his favorite action movie. In his new environment, Joe discovers he has all the abilities of Hollywood action-hero.  i2003kCapcomsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00516na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002200025300002300047500024600070542002600316655002500342655002700367GVJJ0800aViewtiful Joe 1bCapcomc2003-6-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aFighting action game from Capcom Studio 4's Atsushi Inaba. Joe was just your average, well, Joe until he was transported into his favorite action movie. In his new environment, Joe discovers he has all the abilities of Hollywood action-hero.  i2003kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00517na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001800007264002300025300002300048500024600071542002600317655002500343655002700368GVJP0800aViewtiful Joe 1bCapcomc2003-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aFighting action game from Capcom Studio 4's Atsushi Inaba. Joe was just your average, well, Joe until he was transported into his favorite action movie. In his new environment, Joe discovers he has all the abilities of Hollywood action-hero.  i2003kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext01704na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002700038300002300065500140900088542003001497655002901527655002601556GVKE5200aCabela's Dangerous Hunts 2 1bActivisionc2005-11-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aActivision's popular CABELA series is great for hunters in the off-season, and the 2006 entry in the series, CABELAS DANGEROUS HUNTS 2 for the Game Cube, offers yet another great adventure in the outdoors. As usual, players will be traveling the world looking for the biggest and most dangerous game, which includes wolves, cougars, bears, and even polar bears. This time, the game takes players through Australia, Africa, Alaska, and even to the frozen tundra of Siberia as they stalk the most wanted game. Players will have several options when it comes to choosing guns, bullets, and other accessories. Animal calls, traps, decoys, and bait are all available for sell and use in the wild. As players move through the single player missions, however, they will be given tasks other than just hunting down specific game. Some levels require players to keep wild animals away from a camp, save lost hikers from grizzly bears, or help an injured forest ranger get back to town. One of the most interesting additions to the game is the inclusion of slow motion time. Players can slow down time to line up that perfect shot. Slow motion time only lasts for a few seconds, however, so players still have to be quick on aiming and firing. CABELAS hunting games are always great, and CABELAS DANGEROUS HUNTS 2 is no exception. Gamers looking for the next big challenge in virtual hunting won't be disappointed.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aHunting games2wiiext00626na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264003200050300002300082500030700105542003500412655002700447655003000474GVLD6900aMarvel Nemesis: Rise of the Imperfects 1bElectronic Artsc2005-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aCreated by Electronic Arts in association with Marvel's brand-new game production division, this fighting franchise will pit well-known Marvel heroes against a brand-new band of characters developed by EA. Marvel's Greg Pak, Mark Paniccia and are on-board in collaboration with EA's creative designers.  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00625na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264003100050300002300081500030700104542003500411655002700446655003000473GVLE6900aMarvel Nemesis: Rise of the Imperfects 1bElectronic Artsc2005-9-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aCreated by Electronic Arts in association with Marvel's brand-new game production division, this fighting franchise will pit well-known Marvel heroes against a brand-new band of characters developed by EA. Marvel's Greg Pak, Mark Paniccia and are on-board in collaboration with EA's creative designers.  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00630na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004700007264003200054300002300086500030700109542003500416655002700451655003000478GVLF6900aMarvel Nemesis: L'Avenement des Imparfaits 1bElectronic Artsc2005-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aCreated by Electronic Arts in association with Marvel's brand-new game production division, this fighting franchise will pit well-known Marvel heroes against a brand-new band of characters developed by EA. Marvel's Greg Pak, Mark Paniccia and are on-board in collaboration with EA's creative designers.  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00626na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264003200050300002300082500030700105542003500412655002700447655003000474GVLP6900aMarvel Nemesis: Rise of the Imperfects 1bElectronic Artsc2005-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aCreated by Electronic Arts in association with Marvel's brand-new game production division, this fighting franchise will pit well-known Marvel heroes against a brand-new band of characters developed by EA. Marvel's Greg Pak, Mark Paniccia and are on-board in collaboration with EA's creative designers.  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aBeat 'em up games2wiiext00520na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003200007264003700039300002300076500024400099542004200343655002500385GVMP4100aSuper Bust-A-Move All Stars 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2003-9-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aEverybody's favorite bubble-bustin' puzzle game is in the house for the Nintendo GameCube! Launch your bubbles and pop as many as you can before they reach the deadline. Score high by matching 3 bubbles or more to trigger a chain reaction.  i2003kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00909na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001300007264003200020300002300052500066400075542003500739655002500774GVOE6900aBionicle 1bElectronic Artsc2003-10-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aThere's turmoil in the island of Mata Nui. The dark spirit Makuta has infected the Rahi throughout the island -- using his control of the Bohrok, Bohrok-Kal, and Rahkshi to kidnap the Matoran villagers throughout the various Wahi. It's up to the guardians of each Wahi, the Toa warriors Tahi, Lewa, Kopaka, Gali, Pohatu, and Onua, to rescue the Matorans and find the Toa of Light, who is the only one strong enough to stop Makuta. Players control the six Toa heroes in this blend of platform action, combat and racing. Use elemental powers to defeat enemies, then snowboard down mountains, surf through lava fields, ride mine carts and grind along tree limbs.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00697na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001300007264003200020300002300052500045200075542003500527655002500562GVOP6900aBionicle 1bElectronic Artsc2003-10-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aLive the legend! There's turmoil in the island of Mata Nui. The dark spirit Makuta has infected the Rahi throughout the island -- using his control of the Bohrok, Bohrok-Kal, and Rahkshi to kidnap the Matoran villagers throughout the various Wahi. It's up to the guardians of each Wahi, the Toa warriors Tahi, Lewa, Kopaka, Gali, Pohatu, and Onua, to rescue the Matorans and find the Toa of Light, who is the only one strong enough to stop Makuta.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00909na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002200007264003000029300002300059500061800082542003500700655002500735655002700760GVPE6900aMVP Baseball 2004 1bElectronic Artsc2004-3-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aStep up to the plate and master the true art of hitting with MVP Baseball 2004. An all-new hitting model allows for complete user control over all swing types as well as signature cuts from the game's best sluggers. Players can take full control of their franchise on all the levels -- from the minors to the pros -- and play, sim, or manage each game all the way to the World Series. Featuring rich new presentation, realistic player models, and enhanced animations. Other new features include an improved fielding model, added front office options, full EA Sports Bio compatibility, and competitive multiplayer.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00827na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002200041300002300063500054300086542002600629655002500655655002500680GVRE7H00aGrooverider: Slot Car Thunder 1bEncorec2003-9-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aSlot car racing isn't just for kids anymore. Set in a fantasy penthouse, Grooverider: Slot Car Thunder lets you experience quick lane changes, 360-degree loops, and crazy twists and turns on 20 slot car tracks. If you're a smart racer, you'll be sure to grab extra power-ups for a boost or blasting power. If you're not, then the tracks' spikes, mines, and other booby traps will surely be your downfall. In single- or multiplayer modes, you can get behind the wheel of any racecar, ranging from 1920s British cars to American stock cars.  i2003kEncoresGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00721na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002600031300002300057500043900080542003000519655002500549655002500574GVSE8P00aVirtua Striker 2002 1bSega Japanc2002-5-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Virtua Striker series returns with 64 national football teams from around the world. Whether you play as France, Brazil, or Argentina, you can take your team to the final of the International Cup for a chance to win the trophy. On the road to the International Cup, you'll encounter more than 1,400 different players with their own stats and play in 13 stadiums. Virtua Striker 2002 also includes player edit and replay functions.  i2002kSega JapansGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00728na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002600038300002300064500043900087542003000526655002500556655002500581GVSJ8P00aVirtua Striker 3 Ver. 2002 1bSega Japanc2002-2-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Virtua Striker series returns with 64 national football teams from around the world. Whether you play as France, Brazil, or Argentina, you can take your team to the final of the International Cup for a chance to win the trophy. On the road to the International Cup, you'll encounter more than 1,400 different players with their own stats and play in 13 stadiums. Virtua Striker 2002 also includes player edit and replay functions.  i2002kSega JapansGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00730na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002600038300002300064500043900087542003000526655002500556655002700581GVSP8P00aVirtua Striker 3 Ver. 2002 1bSega Japanc2002-5-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe Virtua Striker series returns with 64 national football teams from around the world. Whether you play as France, Brazil, or Argentina, you can take your team to the final of the International Cup for a chance to win the trophy. On the road to the International Cup, you'll encounter more than 1,400 different players with their own stats and play in 13 stadiums. Virtua Striker 2002 also includes player edit and replay functions.  i2002kSega JapansGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00228na  a2200097   4500001000700000245003300007264002900040300002300069500000500092542003300097GVWJDQ00aGakuen Toshi Varanoir: Roses 1bCompile Heartc2004-1-23  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2004kCompile HeartsGameTDB00871na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264001900034300002300053500059700076542002300673655002500696655002800721GW2E7800aWWE Day of Reckoning 2 1bTHQc2005-8-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aPublishing giant THQ readily admits that Nintendo fans have proven to be a dedicated bunch, snapping up its various wrestling games over the years. Back on Nintendo 64, the Aki-developed WCW and WrestleMania titles hooked a legion of followers and many of these same players continue to enjoy the company's wrestling titles on GameCube today, despite a few notable missteps. Some fans, for instance, were shocked and disappointed several years ago when Aki left the Nintendo side to develop for other platforms and others felt cheated when the WrestleMania franchise eventually followed suit.  i2005kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00871na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264001900034300002300053500059700076542002300673655002500696655002800721GW2P7800aWWE Day of Reckoning 2 1bTHQc2005-9-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aPublishing giant THQ readily admits that Nintendo fans have proven to be a dedicated bunch, snapping up its various wrestling games over the years. Back on Nintendo 64, the Aki-developed WCW and WrestleMania titles hooked a legion of followers and many of these same players continue to enjoy the company's wrestling titles on GameCube today, despite a few notable missteps. Some fans, for instance, were shocked and disappointed several years ago when Aki left the Nintendo side to develop for other platforms and others felt cheated when the WrestleMania franchise eventually followed suit.  i2005kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00941na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002400007264001800031300002300049500059500072542002300667655002500690655002500715655002700740655002800767GW3E7800aWWE WrestleMania X8 1bTHQc2002-6-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aLegendary battles and intense drama are packed into one event--WrestleMania, where the baddest men on the planet meet to become champions of wrestling. An updated 2002 roster features superstars and newcomers Rob Van Dam, Booker T, The Hurricane, and nWo members Scott Hall, Kevin Nash, and Hulk Hogan. Master each superstar's unique wrestling style and turn the tide of the match through a combination of counters, reversals, and brutal finishing moves. Now you can start from the beginning and take your rookie wrestler up through the ranks in quest for the Heavyweight Championship Belt.  i2002kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00979na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002400007264003700031300002300068500059500091542004200686655002500728655002500753655002700778655002800805GW3JG200aWWE WrestleMania X8 1bYuke's Media Creationsc2002-9-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aLegendary battles and intense drama are packed into one event--WrestleMania, where the baddest men on the planet meet to become champions of wrestling. An updated 2002 roster features superstars and newcomers Rob Van Dam, Booker T, The Hurricane, and nWo members Scott Hall, Kevin Nash, and Hulk Hogan. Master each superstar's unique wrestling style and turn the tide of the match through a combination of counters, reversals, and brutal finishing moves. Now you can start from the beginning and take your rookie wrestler up through the ranks in quest for the Heavyweight Championship Belt.  i2002kYuke's Media CreationssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00942na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002400007264001900031300002300050500059500073542002300668655002500691655002500716655002700741655002800768GW3P7800aWWE WrestleMania X8 1bTHQc2002-9-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aLegendary battles and intense drama are packed into one event--WrestleMania, where the baddest men on the planet meet to become champions of wrestling. An updated 2002 roster features superstars and newcomers Rob Van Dam, Booker T, The Hurricane, and nWo members Scott Hall, Kevin Nash, and Hulk Hogan. Master each superstar's unique wrestling style and turn the tide of the match through a combination of counters, reversals, and brutal finishing moves. Now you can start from the beginning and take your rookie wrestler up through the ranks in quest for the Heavyweight Championship Belt.  i2002kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00905na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264003100037300002300068500060900091542003500700655002500735655002300760GW4E6900aTiger Woods PGA Tour 2004 1bElectronic Artsc2003-9-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhile professional golfer Tiger Woods has no equal on the PGA Tour, you now have the chance to build a golfer that's even better. Take your custom golfer through the trials and tribulations of all the courses in Tiger Woods PGA Tour 2004, earning cash to spend on new digs and advanced equipment. Use the analog stick to shape any shot type such as the flop or punch. Go head-to-head against the computer, a friend, or an online player with PS2's network adapter. With all the top competition on some of the most famous fairways and greens ever, this is the one of the most complete golf experiences yet.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00905na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003000007264003100037300002300068500060900091542003500700655002500735655002300760GW4P6900aTiger Woods PGA Tour 2004 1bElectronic Artsc2003-9-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aWhile professional golfer Tiger Woods has no equal on the PGA Tour, you now have the chance to build a golfer that's even better. Take your custom golfer through the trials and tribulations of all the courses in Tiger Woods PGA Tour 2004, earning cash to spend on new digs and advanced equipment. Use the analog stick to shape any shot type such as the flop or punch. Go head-to-head against the computer, a friend, or an online player with PS2's network adapter. With all the top competition on some of the most famous fairways and greens ever, this is the one of the most complete golf experiences yet.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext01190na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264003100034300002300065500093200088542003501020655002501055GW5D6900aNeed for Speed: Carbon 1bElectronic Artsc2006-11-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aNeed for Speed: Carbon delivers the next generation of adrenaline-filled street racing as players face the ultimate test of driving skill on treacherous canyon roads. What starts in the city is settled in the canyons as Need for Speed Carbon immerses you into the world's most dangerous and adrenaline-filled form of street racing. You and your crew must race in an all-out war for the city, risking everything to take over your rivals' neighborhoods one block at a time. As the police turn up the heat, the battle ultimately shifts to Carbon Canyon, where territories and reputations can be lost on every perilous curve. Need for Speed Carbon delivers the next generation of customization giving you the power to design and tweak your crew's cars in every way using the ground-breaking new Autosculpt technology. Represent your car class, your crew, and your turf in Need for Speed Carbon, the next revolution in racing games.  i2006kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext01191na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264003200034300002300066500093200089542003501021655002501056GW5E6900aNeed for Speed: Carbon 1bElectronic Artsc2006-10-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aNeed for Speed: Carbon delivers the next generation of adrenaline-filled street racing as players face the ultimate test of driving skill on treacherous canyon roads. What starts in the city is settled in the canyons as Need for Speed Carbon immerses you into the world's most dangerous and adrenaline-filled form of street racing. You and your crew must race in an all-out war for the city, risking everything to take over your rivals' neighborhoods one block at a time. As the police turn up the heat, the battle ultimately shifts to Carbon Canyon, where territories and reputations can be lost on every perilous curve. Need for Speed Carbon delivers the next generation of customization giving you the power to design and tweak your crew's cars in every way using the ground-breaking new Autosculpt technology. Represent your car class, your crew, and your turf in Need for Speed Carbon, the next revolution in racing games.  i2006kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext01190na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264003100034300002300065500093200088542003501020655002501055GW5F6900aNeed for Speed: Carbon 1bElectronic Artsc2006-11-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aNeed for Speed: Carbon delivers the next generation of adrenaline-filled street racing as players face the ultimate test of driving skill on treacherous canyon roads. What starts in the city is settled in the canyons as Need for Speed Carbon immerses you into the world's most dangerous and adrenaline-filled form of street racing. You and your crew must race in an all-out war for the city, risking everything to take over your rivals' neighborhoods one block at a time. As the police turn up the heat, the battle ultimately shifts to Carbon Canyon, where territories and reputations can be lost on every perilous curve. Need for Speed Carbon delivers the next generation of customization giving you the power to design and tweak your crew's cars in every way using the ground-breaking new Autosculpt technology. Represent your car class, your crew, and your turf in Need for Speed Carbon, the next revolution in racing games.  i2006kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext01189na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264003000034300002300064500093200087542003501019655002501054GW5P6900aNeed for Speed: Carbon 1bElectronic Artsc2006-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aNeed for Speed: Carbon delivers the next generation of adrenaline-filled street racing as players face the ultimate test of driving skill on treacherous canyon roads. What starts in the city is settled in the canyons as Need for Speed Carbon immerses you into the world's most dangerous and adrenaline-filled form of street racing. You and your crew must race in an all-out war for the city, risking everything to take over your rivals' neighborhoods one block at a time. As the police turn up the heat, the battle ultimately shifts to Carbon Canyon, where territories and reputations can be lost on every perilous curve. Need for Speed Carbon delivers the next generation of customization giving you the power to design and tweak your crew's cars in every way using the ground-breaking new Autosculpt technology. Represent your car class, your crew, and your turf in Need for Speed Carbon, the next revolution in racing games.  i2006kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00562na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005100007264005100058300002300109500020300132542005500335655002500390655002500415GW6JEM00aWorld Soccer Winning Eleven 6: Final Evolution 1bKonami Computer Entertainment Tokyoc2003-1-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aPro Evolution Soccer 2 (known as Winning Eleven 6 in Japan and World Soccer: Winning Eleven 6 in North America) is the second installment of Konami's Pro Evolution Soccer football video game series.  i2003kKonami Computer Entertainment TokyosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00929na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002900007264003100036300002300067500057800090542003500668655002500703655002800728655003900756GW7D6900a007: Agent im Kreuzfeuer 1bElectronic Artsc2002-6-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aDriven by a completely new and original storyline, James Bond 007: Agent Under Fire is a first-person action game that balances furious action and stealth tactics. An evil world organization has been replacing world leaders with their more docile clones and it's up to you to put a stop to it. As Bond, you'll encounter villains and allies, both new and familiar, detailed 3D environments, and spy-packed, fast-action gameplay. And don't worry, Q will provide you with all the innovative weapons, sophisticated spy-craft, and state-of-the-art gadgets that Bond fans expect.  i2002kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00926na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002600007264003100033300002300064500057800087542003500665655002500700655002800725655003900753GW7E6900a007: Agent Under Fire 1bElectronic Artsc2002-3-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aDriven by a completely new and original storyline, James Bond 007: Agent Under Fire is a first-person action game that balances furious action and stealth tactics. An evil world organization has been replacing world leaders with their more docile clones and it's up to you to put a stop to it. As Bond, you'll encounter villains and allies, both new and familiar, detailed 3D environments, and spy-packed, fast-action gameplay. And don't worry, Q will provide you with all the innovative weapons, sophisticated spy-craft, and state-of-the-art gadgets that Bond fans expect.  i2002kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00927na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002700007264003100034300002300065500057800088542003500666655002500701655002800726655003900754GW7F6900a007: Espion pour Cible 1bElectronic Artsc2002-6-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aDriven by a completely new and original storyline, James Bond 007: Agent Under Fire is a first-person action game that balances furious action and stealth tactics. An evil world organization has been replacing world leaders with their more docile clones and it's up to you to put a stop to it. As Bond, you'll encounter villains and allies, both new and familiar, detailed 3D environments, and spy-packed, fast-action gameplay. And don't worry, Q will provide you with all the innovative weapons, sophisticated spy-craft, and state-of-the-art gadgets that Bond fans expect.  i2002kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00885na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264003000033300002300063500057800086542003500664655002500699655003900724GW7P6900a007: Agent Under Fire 1bElectronic Artsc2010-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aDriven by a completely new and original storyline, James Bond 007: Agent Under Fire is a first-person action game that balances furious action and stealth tactics. An evil world organization has been replacing world leaders with their more docile clones and it's up to you to put a stop to it. As Bond, you'll encounter villains and allies, both new and familiar, detailed 3D environments, and spy-packed, fast-action gameplay. And don't worry, Q will provide you with all the innovative weapons, sophisticated spy-craft, and state-of-the-art gadgets that Bond fans expect.  i2010kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext01002na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002600033300002300059500071500082542003000797655002900827655002400856GW8E5200aWorld Series of Poker 1bActivisionc2005-9-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aWorld Series of Poker features the likenesses of poker professionals participating in the 2005 WSOP Tournament. The game offers players a truly unique experience unlike any other poker video game on the market today. For the first time ever, the 2005 WSOP Tournament will be held at Harrah's Rio Suites in Las Vegas, the same location simulated in the video game and the location of the 2005 Lifestyle Show. All the sanctioned poker various of the World Series of Poker are available, including Texas Hold 'Em, 7 Card Stud, Omaha, and 5 Card Draw. With the flexible character creator, the player can create his or her own poker face, wear Vegas-style threads and upgrade looks/clothes as he or she gains money.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aBoard games2wiiext00728na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264001800032300002300050500045700073542002300530655002500553655002800578GW9E7800aWWE WrestleMania XIX 1bTHQc2003-9-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe legacy continues with WrestleMania XIX, which features deeper move sets and a more strategic reversal system. Choose among an updated list of top WWE superstars, each with realistic abilities, including strength, speed, and stamina. You can become a legend by battling your way through five stages and more than 25 missions in an effort to destroy Vince's empire. Team up with Stephanie McMahon along the way as you win back your status in the WWE.  i2003kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00729na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264001900032300002300051500045700074542002300531655002500554655002800579GW9JG200aWWE WrestleMania XIX 1bTHQc2003-11-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe legacy continues with WrestleMania XIX, which features deeper move sets and a more strategic reversal system. Choose among an updated list of top WWE superstars, each with realistic abilities, including strength, speed, and stamina. You can become a legend by battling your way through five stages and more than 25 missions in an effort to destroy Vince's empire. Team up with Stephanie McMahon along the way as you win back your status in the WWE.  i2003kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00729na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264001900032300002300051500045700074542002300531655002500554655002800579GW9P7800aWWE WrestleMania XIX 1bTHQc2003-9-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe legacy continues with WrestleMania XIX, which features deeper move sets and a more strategic reversal system. Choose among an updated list of top WWE superstars, each with realistic abilities, including strength, speed, and stamina. You can become a legend by battling your way through five stages and more than 25 missions in an effort to destroy Vince's empire. Team up with Stephanie McMahon along the way as you win back your status in the WWE.  i2003kTHQsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00532na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264002600034300002300060500028400083542003000367655002500397GWAD8P00aSpartan: Total Warrior 1bSega Japanc2005-10-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis action epic lets players fight within massive cinematic battles as a fighter known only as The Spartan. Spartan: Total Warrior runs on proprietary software technology that makes it possible to present more than 170 detailed warriors simultaneously engaged in pitched combat.  i2005kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00533na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264002700034300002300061500028400084542003000368655002500398GWAE8P00aSpartan: Total Warrior 1bSega Japanc2005-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis action epic lets players fight within massive cinematic battles as a fighter known only as The Spartan. Spartan: Total Warrior runs on proprietary software technology that makes it possible to present more than 170 detailed warriors simultaneously engaged in pitched combat.  i2005kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00532na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264002600034300002300060500028400083542003000367655002500397GWAF8P00aSpartan: Total Warrior 1bSega Japanc2005-10-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis action epic lets players fight within massive cinematic battles as a fighter known only as The Spartan. Spartan: Total Warrior runs on proprietary software technology that makes it possible to present more than 170 detailed warriors simultaneously engaged in pitched combat.  i2005kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00532na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002700007264002600034300002300060500028400083542003000367655002500397GWAP8P00aSpartan: Total Warrior 1bSega Japanc2005-10-7  a1 Wii optical disc  aThis action epic lets players fight within massive cinematic battles as a fighter known only as The Spartan. Spartan: Total Warrior runs on proprietary software technology that makes it possible to present more than 170 detailed warriors simultaneously engaged in pitched combat.  i2005kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00805na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003900023300002300062500049100085542004200576655002700618655003800645GWBE4100aWorms Blast 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2002-10-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet ready for intense firefights in Worms Blast, a new puzzle game featuring wacky weaponry and power-ups. Your mission is to launch your worm into hostile waters and then attack your opponent with shotguns, bazookas, mines, laser beams, and sea monsters, while collecting various power-ups. Brave the high seas by facing rain, wind, solar eclipses, and even cosmic showers. Worms Blast includes eight head-to-head modes that challenge you to crush your opponents before they crush you.  i2002kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aTurn-based strategy games2wiiext00803na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003700023300002300060500049100083542004200574655002700616655003800643GWBP4100aWorms Blast 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2010-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aGet ready for intense firefights in Worms Blast, a new puzzle game featuring wacky weaponry and power-ups. Your mission is to launch your worm into hostile waters and then attack your opponent with shotguns, bazookas, mines, laser beams, and sea monsters, while collecting various power-ups. Brave the high seas by facing rain, wind, solar eclipses, and even cosmic showers. Worms Blast includes eight head-to-head modes that challenge you to crush your opponents before they crush you.  i2010kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aTurn-based strategy games2wiiext00728na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264002900024300002300053500048300076542003400559655002500593GWDP6S00aWorld Racing 1bTDK Mediactivec2004-4-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aWorld Racing gives you total control over your race. Stay on track, search for shortcuts, or simply free roam--you're in control as you take your Mercedes-Benz on a romp around the world. In one of 110 original cars, you'll take on 120 different tracks in seven expansive landscapes, ranging from Nevada and Japan to the Alps and Mercedes' own Test Center. Defeat your rivals with powerslides, burnouts, and wild stunt driving en route to becoming the world's number one driver.  i2004kTDK MediactivesGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00694na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002300044300002300067500039900090542002700489655002500516655003100541GWEE5100a18 Wheeler: American Pro Trucker 1bAcclaimc2002-2-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the convoy! AM2's off the wall arcade smash, 18-Wheeler American Pro Trucker is rambling to the PlayStation2 computer entertainment system for one heck'uva pit stop! Get behind the wheel of a 60 foot long, 20 ton, 18-wheeled beast and buckle up as you haul tail from New York to California and everywhere in between in the most intense joyride of your life! 10-4 good buddy - Over and out!  i2002kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aTruck racing games2wiiext00694na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002300044300002300067500039900090542002700489655002500516655003100541GWEJB000a18 Wheeler: American Pro Trucker 1bAcclaimc2002-9-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the convoy! AM2's off the wall arcade smash, 18-Wheeler American Pro Trucker is rambling to the PlayStation2 computer entertainment system for one heck'uva pit stop! Get behind the wheel of a 60 foot long, 20 ton, 18-wheeled beast and buckle up as you haul tail from New York to California and everywhere in between in the most intense joyride of your life! 10-4 good buddy - Over and out!  i2002kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aTruck racing games2wiiext00700na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002600044300002300070500039900093542003000492655002500522655003100547GWEP8P00a18 Wheeler: American Pro Trucker 1bSega Japanc2002-5-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the convoy! AM2's off the wall arcade smash, 18-Wheeler American Pro Trucker is rambling to the PlayStation2 computer entertainment system for one heck'uva pit stop! Get behind the wheel of a 60 foot long, 20 ton, 18-wheeled beast and buckle up as you haul tail from New York to California and everywhere in between in the most intense joyride of your life! 10-4 good buddy - Over and out!  i2002kSega JapansGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aTruck racing games2wiiext00823na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001800007264002200025300002300047500052100070542002500591655002500616655002300641655002500664GWGE4F00aSwingerz Golf 1bEidosc2002-10-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your clubs and hit the links in Swingerz Golf. You'll tee up on six courses featuring diverse terrains, from a cactus-filled desert to a classic English course. Play as or against 14 offbeat golfers, each with distinct personalities and golfing abilities. You can battle three of your friends in various gameplay modes, including Tournament, Stroke, Match, and Short Course. With challenging weather conditions, minigames, and intense tournaments, Swingerz Golf gives you a realistic and fun golfing experience.  i2002kEidossGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00822na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001700007264002200024300002300046500052100069542002500590655002500615655002300640655002500663GWGJ4F00aWai Wai Golf 1bEidosc2002-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your clubs and hit the links in Swingerz Golf. You'll tee up on six courses featuring diverse terrains, from a cactus-filled desert to a classic English course. Play as or against 14 offbeat golfers, each with distinct personalities and golfing abilities. You can battle three of your friends in various gameplay modes, including Tournament, Stroke, Match, and Short Course. With challenging weather conditions, minigames, and intense tournaments, Swingerz Golf gives you a realistic and fun golfing experience.  i2002kEidossGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext 7aArcade games2wiiext00780na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001300007264002100020300002300041500052100064542002500585655002500610655002300635GWGP4F00aAce Golf 1bEidosc2002-12-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aGrab your clubs and hit the links in Swingerz Golf. You'll tee up on six courses featuring diverse terrains, from a cactus-filled desert to a classic English course. Play as or against 14 offbeat golfers, each with distinct personalities and golfing abilities. You can battle three of your friends in various gameplay modes, including Tournament, Stroke, Match, and Short Course. With challenging weather conditions, minigames, and intense tournaments, Swingerz Golf gives you a realistic and fun golfing experience.  i2002kEidossGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aGolf games2wiiext00758na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004600007264003700053300002300090500046800113542004200581655002500623GWHE4100aWinnie the Pooh's Rumbly Tumbly Adventure 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2005-2-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin Winnie the Pooh and his friends on five birthday-themed adventures. In Winnie the Pooh Rumbly Tumbly Adventures, you can play as Tigger, Piglet, Eeyore, and Winnie the Pooh. Find as many honey pots as you can, but beware of the mischievous Heffalumps and Woozles, who steal honey. Whether you're finding a new house for Eeyore or helping Tigger out of a sticky situation, you'll experience all the adventures of Pooh and his friends in the Hundred Acre Wood.  i2005kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00799na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004600007264003800053300002300091500046800114542004200582655002500624655002800649GWHP4100aWinnie the Pooh's Rumbly Tumbly Adventure 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2005-3-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin Winnie the Pooh and his friends on five birthday-themed adventures. In Winnie the Pooh Rumbly Tumbly Adventures, you can play as Tigger, Piglet, Eeyore, and Winnie the Pooh. Find as many honey pots as you can, but beware of the mischievous Heffalumps and Woozles, who steal honey. Whether you're finding a new house for Eeyore or helping Tigger out of a sticky situation, you'll experience all the adventures of Pooh and his friends in the Hundred Acre Wood.  i2005kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00817na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002700042300002300069500051600092542003000608655002500638655003200663GWJE5200aTony Hawk's American Wasteland 1bActivisionc2005-10-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aNow you can cruise through LA without loading levels or stopping gameplay in Tony Hawk's American Wasteland. You can skate or BMX through a new story mode that takes you through all-new skate areas using tricks that have never appeared in previous Tony Hawk games. The cash that you earn can be used to customize your equipment and your skater by going to tattoo parlors and skate shops. Tony Hawk's American Wasteland also includes a classic mode that features classic Tony Hawk Pro Skater maps and objectives.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSkateboarding games2wiiext00799na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006200007264003900069300002300108500045100131542004200582655002500624655002800649GWKE4100aPeter Jackson's King Kong: The Official Game of the Movie 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2005-11-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay as man or beast in Peter Jackson's King Kong: The Official Game of the Movie. You can be King Kong or Jack Driscoll as you follow a story based on the movie. Peter Jackson, the director of the 2005 movie, also took an active role in developing the game, which expands upon the movie's storyline, adding new creatures and locations. The game employs a cinematic style that makes the game more immersive and less like a traditional video game.  i2005kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00799na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006200007264003900069300002300108500045100131542004200582655002500624655002800649GWKP4100aPeter Jackson's King Kong: The Official Game of the Movie 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2005-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aPlay as man or beast in Peter Jackson's King Kong: The Official Game of the Movie. You can be King Kong or Jack Driscoll as you follow a story based on the movie. Peter Jackson, the director of the 2005 movie, also took an active role in developing the game, which expands upon the movie's storyline, adding new creatures and locations. The game employs a cinematic style that makes the game more immersive and less like a traditional video game.  i2005kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00772na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264003500043300002300078500049800101542003800599655002500637GWLE6L00aWallace & Gromit in Project Zoo 1bBAM! Entertainmentc2003-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe diabolical penguin, Feathers, has imprisoned all the baby animals in a zoo, and it's up to Wallace and Gromit to rescue them. Charge through the gates as the resourceful and adventurous Gromit, and receive helpful hints from Wallace. This indomitable duo has an array of new inventions such as the Porridge Gun and the Banana Launcher, plus interesting contraptions built by Wallace himself. Gromit's break dancing, backflips, and sneaking moves will also prove valuable in your adventure.  i2003kBAM! EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00770na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264003300043300002300076500049800099542003800597655002500635GWLP6L00aWallace & Gromit in Project Zoo 1bBAM! Entertainmentc2012-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe diabolical penguin, Feathers, has imprisoned all the baby animals in a zoo, and it's up to Wallace and Gromit to rescue them. Charge through the gates as the resourceful and adventurous Gromit, and receive helpful hints from Wallace. This indomitable duo has an array of new inventions such as the Porridge Gun and the Banana Launcher, plus interesting contraptions built by Wallace himself. Gromit's break dancing, backflips, and sneaking moves will also prove valuable in your adventure.  i2012kBAM! EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00772na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003600007264003500043300002300078500049800101542003800599655002500637GWLX6L00aWallace & Gromit in Project Zoo 1bBAM! Entertainmentc2003-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe diabolical penguin, Feathers, has imprisoned all the baby animals in a zoo, and it's up to Wallace and Gromit to rescue them. Charge through the gates as the resourceful and adventurous Gromit, and receive helpful hints from Wallace. This indomitable duo has an array of new inventions such as the Porridge Gun and the Banana Launcher, plus interesting contraptions built by Wallace himself. Gromit's break dancing, backflips, and sneaking moves will also prove valuable in your adventure.  i2003kBAM! EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00734na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001300007264002300020300002300043500050400066542002700570655002700597GWME5100aWorms 3D 1bAcclaimc2004-3-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the party as worm battles ensue across 3D worlds. Worms 3D pits four players--each with a customizable team of worms--against one another in fully deformable landscapes. All the bizarre weapons from the Worms series--including Banana Bomb, flying Super Sheep, Earthquakes, Air Strikes, and Holy Hand Grenade--appear for your destructive pleasure. Wreak havoc in turn-based multiplayer action or unlock landscapes, sound sets, challenges, and secret missions in the immersive single-player mode.  i2004kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext00741na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001300007264002700020300002300047500050400070542003000574655002700604GWMP8P00aWorms 3D 1bSega Japanc2003-10-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aJoin the party as worm battles ensue across 3D worlds. Worms 3D pits four players--each with a customizable team of worms--against one another in fully deformable landscapes. All the bizarre weapons from the Worms series--including Banana Bomb, flying Super Sheep, Earthquakes, Air Strikes, and Holy Hand Grenade--appear for your destructive pleasure. Wreak havoc in turn-based multiplayer action or unlock landscapes, sound sets, challenges, and secret missions in the immersive single-player mode.  i2003kSega JapansGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext00974na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001200007264003300019300002300052500072500075542003700800655002700837GWOE5G00aBlowout 1bMajesco Sales Incc2004-3-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aBudget-priced shooter ported by Terminal Reality. The title, which features 2D-style play mechanics and 3D graphics, is also available for PlayStation 2 and Xbox. In BlowOut, players assume the role of John "Dutch" Cane, a TransFed Marshall assigned to suppress a clone uprising before it gains momentum. Unbeknownst to Cane, though, the clones have been infected by a Xeno genome virus, turning them into grotesque and highly dangerous aliens. It's up to gamers to eliminate the threat using whatever means necessary. Cane's arsenal includes 20mm Pump-Action Shotgun, 8-meter Flamethrower, Plasma Rifle, Machine Gun, 8'' NailGun as well as a variety of gadgets, like Jetpacks, bounce-shields, and sonic-impulse cannons.  i2004kMajesco Sales IncsGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00821na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002500007264001900032300002300051500047300074542002300547655002500570655002500595655002700620655002800647GWPE7800aWWE Day of Reckoning 1bTHQc2004-8-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aHit the ropes against WWE's top superstars in WWE Day of Reckoning, which features an all-new story mode filled with deception and betrayal. As your own created wrestler, you can rise up the ranks from the "minor leagues" of sports entertainment all the way to prime-time WWE programming. You can choose your favorite WWE Divas and go head-to-head in a Bra & Panties match. Each wrestling star, including Legends, can target specific body parts to wear down opponents.  i2004kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00859na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002500007264003800032300002300070500047300093542004200566655002500608655002500633655002700658655002800685GWPJG200aWWE Day of Reckoning 1bYuke's Media Creationsc2005-1-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aHit the ropes against WWE's top superstars in WWE Day of Reckoning, which features an all-new story mode filled with deception and betrayal. As your own created wrestler, you can rise up the ranks from the "minor leagues" of sports entertainment all the way to prime-time WWE programming. You can choose your favorite WWE Divas and go head-to-head in a Bra & Panties match. Each wrestling star, including Legends, can target specific body parts to wear down opponents.  i2005kYuke's Media CreationssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00821na  a2200145   4500001000700000245002500007264001900032300002300051500047300074542002300547655002500570655002500595655002700620655002800647GWPP7800aWWE Day of Reckoning 1bTHQc2004-9-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aHit the ropes against WWE's top superstars in WWE Day of Reckoning, which features an all-new story mode filled with deception and betrayal. As your own created wrestler, you can rise up the ranks from the "minor leagues" of sports entertainment all the way to prime-time WWE programming. You can choose your favorite WWE Divas and go head-to-head in a Bra & Panties match. Each wrestling star, including Legends, can target specific body parts to wear down opponents.  i2004kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7aWrestling games2wiiext00835na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002700042300002300069500054100092542003000633655002500663655002500688GWQE5200aWreckless: The Yakuza Missions 1bActivisionc2002-11-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Hong Kong, where mystery and intrigue, money and power, and East and West intermingle. As the Yakuza terrorizes citizens, you arrive on the scene to answer the call of the city. You'll command an elite police unit called the Dragons, or you can play as a couple of spies hired to defeat Tiger Takagi--the head of the Hong Kong Yakuza. In 40 wild missions, you'll fire at moving targets with car-mounted rocket launchers, maneuver through the destructive environments, and experience real-time crashes and vehicle deformation.  i2002kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00835na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003500007264002700042300002300069500054100092542003000633655002500663655002500688GWQP5200aWreckless: The Yakuza Missions 1bActivisionc2002-11-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aWelcome to Hong Kong, where mystery and intrigue, money and power, and East and West intermingle. As the Yakuza terrorizes citizens, you arrive on the scene to answer the call of the city. You'll command an elite police unit called the Dragons, or you can play as a couple of spies hired to defeat Tiger Takagi--the head of the Hong Kong Yakuza. In 40 wild missions, you'll fire at moving targets with car-mounted rocket launchers, maneuver through the destructive environments, and experience real-time crashes and vehicle deformation.  i2002kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00311na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002500033300002300058500001900081542002800100655002500128655003600153GWRE0100aWave Race: Blue Storm 1bNintendoc2001-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aStorm Warning!  i2001kNintendosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aWatercraft racing games2wiiext00310na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002400033300002300057500001900080542002800099655002500127655003600152GWRJ0100aWave Race: Blue Storm 1bNintendoc2001-9-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aStorm Warning!  i2001kNintendosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aWatercraft racing games2wiiext00404na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002300033300002300056500011400079542002800193655002500221655003600246GWRP0100aWave Race: Blue Storm 1bNintendoc2002-5-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aStorm Warning! Prepare for the wettest, wildest racing ever as Wave Race splashes onto the Nintendo GameCube!  i2002kNintendosGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aWatercraft racing games2wiiext00564na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004200007264002100049300002300070500031000093542002600403655002500429GWSEA400aESPN International Winter Sports 2002 1bKonamic2002-2-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aESPN International Winter Sports 2002 is basically a winter sports version of Konami's very popular Track and Field games with ten fast paced events and vivid graphics. Feel the spray of snow in the alpine slalom or the shimmer of the ice in the treacherous Bobsled run as it brings winter sports to life.  i2002kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00552na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264002200036300002300058500031000081542002600391655002500417GWSJA400aHyper Sports 2002 Winter 1bKonamic2002-1-31  a1 Wii optical disc  aESPN International Winter Sports 2002 is basically a winter sports version of Konami's very popular Track and Field games with ten fast paced events and vivid graphics. Feel the spray of snow in the alpine slalom or the shimmer of the ice in the treacherous Bobsled run as it brings winter sports to life.  i2002kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00559na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003700007264002100044300002300065500031000088542002600398655002500424GWSPA400aESPN International Winter Sports 1bKonamic2002-5-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aESPN International Winter Sports 2002 is basically a winter sports version of Konami's very popular Track and Field games with ten fast paced events and vivid graphics. Feel the spray of snow in the alpine slalom or the shimmer of the ice in the treacherous Bobsled run as it brings winter sports to life.  i2002kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext00756na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002000007264002200027300002300049500048600072542002600558655002500584655002500609GWTEA400aWTA Tour Tennis 1bKonamic2002-9-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake to the court and experience the realism and authenticity of WTA Tour Tennis. First, choose one of 20 professional tennis players such as Serena Williams, Martina Hingis, and Jelina Dokic--each with lifelike facial expressions and movements. Then, engage in fast-paced competition on grass, clay, and hard surfaces. With simple controls, multiple levels of difficulty, and AI based on actual player attributes, WTA Tour Tennis challenges both newcomers and seasoned pros alike.  i2002kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aTennis games2wiiext00770na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002200041300002300063500048600086542002600572655002500598655002500623GWTJA400aWTA Tour Tennis Pro Evolution 1bKonamic2002-8-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake to the court and experience the realism and authenticity of WTA Tour Tennis. First, choose one of 20 professional tennis players such as Serena Williams, Martina Hingis, and Jelina Dokic--each with lifelike facial expressions and movements. Then, engage in fast-paced competition on grass, clay, and hard surfaces. With simple controls, multiple levels of difficulty, and AI based on actual player attributes, WTA Tour Tennis challenges both newcomers and seasoned pros alike.  i2002kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aTennis games2wiiext00760na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002400007264002200031300002300053500048600076542002600562655002500588655002500613GWTPA400aPro Tennis WTA Tour 1bKonamic2002-9-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aTake to the court and experience the realism and authenticity of WTA Tour Tennis. First, choose one of 20 professional tennis players such as Serena Williams, Martina Hingis, and Jelina Dokic--each with lifelike facial expressions and movements. Then, engage in fast-paced competition on grass, clay, and hard surfaces. With simple controls, multiple levels of difficulty, and AI based on actual player attributes, WTA Tour Tennis challenges both newcomers and seasoned pros alike.  i2002kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aTennis games2wiiext00771na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001500007264004700022300002300069500041500092542005000507655002500557655002500582655003000607GWUE7D00aWhirl Tour 1bSierra / Universal Interactivec2002-11-12  a1 Wii optical disc  a'Flipside' is giving a stunning performance at Castle Coliseum. Suddenly in the middle of the band's finale an audible power surge occurs, and lightning strikes each of the 6 band members. One after another they are vacuumed into the sky. The band's roadie shakes his head in disbelief. "I have to find them!!!" He jumps through a color-shifting portal, grabs his scooter and rides off to search for his idols.  i2002kSierra / Universal InteractivesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aBike racing games2wiiext00710na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001500007264003700022300002300059500041500082542004100497655002500538655002500563GWUP7D00aWhirl Tour 1bUniversal Interactivec2003-3-21  a1 Wii optical disc  a'Flipside' is giving a stunning performance at Castle Coliseum. Suddenly in the middle of the band's finale an audible power surge occurs, and lightning strikes each of the 6 band members. One after another they are vacuumed into the sky. The band's roadie shakes his head in disbelief. "I have to find them!!!" He jumps through a color-shifting portal, grabs his scooter and rides off to search for his idols.  i2003kUniversal InteractivesGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aRacing games2wiiext00803na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002600035300002300061500051400084542003000598655002500628655002800653GWVE5200aX2: Wolverine's Revenge 1bActivisionc2003-4-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aX-Men's most dangerous weapon is out for vengeance. In X2 Wolverine's Revenge, you play as Wolverine as he rushes to find the antidote to a virus that was implanted into his body. Unsheathe your razor-sharp claws, unleash lethal combo attacks, and use accelerated healing powers as you tear into intense action and stealth scenarios. Face off with Sabretooth, Wendigo, Juggernaut, and Magneto, while Professor X and Beast help you search for a cure. As Wolverine, you can become the ultimate fighting machine.  i2003kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00808na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264002600040300002300066500051400089542003000603655002500633655002800658GWVP5200aX-Men 2: Wolverine's Revenge 1bActivisionc2003-4-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aX-Men's most dangerous weapon is out for vengeance. In X2 Wolverine's Revenge, you play as Wolverine as he rushes to find the antidote to a virus that was implanted into his body. Unsheathe your razor-sharp claws, unleash lethal combo attacks, and use accelerated healing powers as you tear into intense action and stealth scenarios. Face off with Sabretooth, Wendigo, Juggernaut, and Magneto, while Professor X and Beast help you search for a cure. As Wolverine, you can become the ultimate fighting machine.  i2003kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00808na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003300007264002600040300002300066500051400089542003000603655002500633655002800658GWVX5200aX-Men 2: Wolverine's Revenge 1bActivisionc2003-4-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aX-Men's most dangerous weapon is out for vengeance. In X2 Wolverine's Revenge, you play as Wolverine as he rushes to find the antidote to a virus that was implanted into his body. Unsheathe your razor-sharp claws, unleash lethal combo attacks, and use accelerated healing powers as you tear into intense action and stealth scenarios. Face off with Sabretooth, Wendigo, Juggernaut, and Magneto, while Professor X and Beast help you search for a cure. As Wolverine, you can become the ultimate fighting machine.  i2003kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00998na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264002400023300002300047500072600070542002800796655002500824655002700849GWWE0100aWario World 1bNintendoc2003-6-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aHe's the good, the bad and the ugly all rolled into one, and now he's 3D. Wario, Mario's jealous rival, plays the hero -- well, kind of -- in his first console adventure. In the depths of Wario's castle lies the plunder of his many adventures on the Game Boy, Game Boy Advance and elsewhere. While Wario kicks back in his crib, enjoying the videogame equivalent of bling-bling, a mysterious black jewel in his trove transforms gems into monsters. His wealth, which was once a source of pride, becomes his greatest foe. Now, Wario must scramble to recover his riches. Developed by Treasure, the game takes the form of a fixed-perspective 3D brawler/platform game, with combo-based attacks and lots of creatures to beat up.  i2003kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00998na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264002400023300002300047500072600070542002800796655002500824655002700849GWWJ0100aWario World 1bNintendoc2004-5-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aHe's the good, the bad and the ugly all rolled into one, and now he's 3D. Wario, Mario's jealous rival, plays the hero -- well, kind of -- in his first console adventure. In the depths of Wario's castle lies the plunder of his many adventures on the Game Boy, Game Boy Advance and elsewhere. While Wario kicks back in his crib, enjoying the videogame equivalent of bling-bling, a mysterious black jewel in his trove transforms gems into monsters. His wealth, which was once a source of pride, becomes his greatest foe. Now, Wario must scramble to recover his riches. Developed by Treasure, the game takes the form of a fixed-perspective 3D brawler/platform game, with combo-based attacks and lots of creatures to beat up.  i2004kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00998na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264002400023300002300047500072600070542002800796655002500824655002700849GWWP0100aWario World 1bNintendoc2003-6-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aHe's the good, the bad and the ugly all rolled into one, and now he's 3D. Wario, Mario's jealous rival, plays the hero -- well, kind of -- in his first console adventure. In the depths of Wario's castle lies the plunder of his many adventures on the Game Boy, Game Boy Advance and elsewhere. While Wario kicks back in his crib, enjoying the videogame equivalent of bling-bling, a mysterious black jewel in his trove transforms gems into monsters. His wealth, which was once a source of pride, becomes his greatest foe. Now, Wario must scramble to recover his riches. Developed by Treasure, the game takes the form of a fixed-perspective 3D brawler/platform game, with combo-based attacks and lots of creatures to beat up.  i2003kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00929na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264003200041300002300073500062500096542003500721655002500756655002600781GWXJ1300aStar Wars: Rogue Squadron III 1bElectronic Artsc2003-11-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aFactor 5's follow-up to the successful Star Wars launch title recreates battles from the first three movies both in the air and on the ground. Pilot your favorite vehicles from the movies such as AT-Sts, B-wings, A-wings, and speederbikes, and navigate them through various places in the Star Wars universe. Participate in multiplayer modes including co-op mode, capture-the-base, endurance mode, and dogfighting. Star Wars Rogue Squadron III: Rebel Strike takes full advantage of the technical capabilities of the Nintendo GameCube supporting HDTV Progressive Scan, and vivid 5-channel Dolby Pro Logic 2 surround sound.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext00934na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004500007264003900052300002300091500060300114542004200717655002500759655002800784GWYE4100aTom Clancy's Splinter Cell: Double Agent 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2006-10-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aVeteran agent Sam Fisher is back. But he's never faced an enemy like this before. To stop a devastating terrorist attack, he must infiltrate a vicious terrorist group and destroy it from within. For the first time ever, experience the relentless tension and gut-wrenching dilemmas of life as a double agent. As you infiltrate a terrorist organization in its American headquarters, you must carefully weigh the consequences of your actions. Kill too many criminals and you'll blow your cover. Hesitate too long and millions will die. Do whatever it takes to complete your mission, but get out alive.  i2006kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00934na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004500007264003900052300002300091500060300114542004200717655002500759655002800784GWYX4100aTom Clancy's Splinter Cell: Double Agent 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2006-10-26  a1 Wii optical disc  aVeteran agent Sam Fisher is back. But he's never faced an enemy like this before. To stop a devastating terrorist attack, he must infiltrate a vicious terrorist group and destroy it from within. For the first time ever, experience the relentless tension and gut-wrenching dilemmas of life as a double agent. As you infiltrate a terrorist organization in its American headquarters, you must carefully weigh the consequences of your actions. Kill too many criminals and you'll blow your cover. Hesitate too long and millions will die. Do whatever it takes to complete your mission, but get out alive.  i2006kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01151na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002500045300002300070500086000093542002800953655002400981655002401005GWZE0100aDance Dance Revolution: Mario Mix 1bNintendoc2005-10-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aBoogie down with Mario, DDR-style. Players shake their things to more than 25 dance-flavored songs, from classic Nintendo themes to familiar favorites. With five difficulty levels, dancers of all abilities will be able to get into the groove. Have fun getting in shape! The special "Workout" feature tracks the calories burned while playing. Someone has stolen the Music Keys and released the music they held. Without the Music Keys, the unstable power of the music is wreaking havoc on the land. Mario must recover them before the chaos destroys the entire Mushroom Kingdom! The path to the keys is simple: Left, Right, Up, Down, Right, Down... In Dance Dance Revolution: Mario Mix, players clear levels by performing the correct steps. Once they clear all the levels in a particular world, they'll collect a Music Key. Collect all the Music Keys to win.  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext01150na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003800007264002400045300002300069500086000092542002800952655002400980655002401004GWZJ0100aDance Dance Revolution with Mario 1bNintendoc2005-7-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aBoogie down with Mario, DDR-style. Players shake their things to more than 25 dance-flavored songs, from classic Nintendo themes to familiar favorites. With five difficulty levels, dancers of all abilities will be able to get into the groove. Have fun getting in shape! The special "Workout" feature tracks the calories burned while playing. Someone has stolen the Music Keys and released the music they held. Without the Music Keys, the unstable power of the music is wreaking havoc on the land. Mario must recover them before the chaos destroys the entire Mushroom Kingdom! The path to the keys is simple: Left, Right, Up, Down, Right, Down... In Dance Dance Revolution: Mario Mix, players clear levels by performing the correct steps. Once they clear all the levels in a particular world, they'll collect a Music Key. Collect all the Music Keys to win.  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext01141na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002500035300002300060500086000083542002800943655002400971655002400995GWZP0100aDancing Stage Mario Mix 1bNintendoc2005-10-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aBoogie down with Mario, DDR-style. Players shake their things to more than 25 dance-flavored songs, from classic Nintendo themes to familiar favorites. With five difficulty levels, dancers of all abilities will be able to get into the groove. Have fun getting in shape! The special "Workout" feature tracks the calories burned while playing. Someone has stolen the Music Keys and released the music they held. Without the Music Keys, the unstable power of the music is wreaking havoc on the land. Mario must recover them before the chaos destroys the entire Mushroom Kingdom! The path to the keys is simple: Left, Right, Up, Down, Right, Down... In Dance Dance Revolution: Mario Mix, players clear levels by performing the correct steps. Once they clear all the levels in a particular world, they'll collect a Music Key. Collect all the Music Keys to win.  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aDance games2wiiext00736na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264002700048300002300075500047300098542003000571655002500601GX2D5200aX-Men Legends II: Rise of Apocalypse 1bActivisionc2005-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn X-Men Legends II, the X-Men must join their enemy the Brotherhood to fight a greater menace--Apocalypse. The sequel to the team-based role-playing game X-Men Legends lets you play as one of many X-Men, and use and combine his or her unique abilities to defeat enemies. Rise of Apocalypse includes new mutant powers, playable characters, and environments. Also new to X-Men Legends II is online play, which lets you work cooperatively against other teams of mutants.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00735na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264002600048300002300074500047300097542003000570655002500600GX2E5200aX-Men Legends II: Rise of Apocalypse 1bActivisionc2005-9-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn X-Men Legends II, the X-Men must join their enemy the Brotherhood to fight a greater menace--Apocalypse. The sequel to the team-based role-playing game X-Men Legends lets you play as one of many X-Men, and use and combine his or her unique abilities to defeat enemies. Rise of Apocalypse includes new mutant powers, playable characters, and environments. Also new to X-Men Legends II is online play, which lets you work cooperatively against other teams of mutants.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00736na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004100007264002700048300002300075500047300098542003000571655002500601GX2P5200aX-Men Legends II: Rise of Apocalypse 1bActivisionc2005-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn X-Men Legends II, the X-Men must join their enemy the Brotherhood to fight a greater menace--Apocalypse. The sequel to the team-based role-playing game X-Men Legends lets you play as one of many X-Men, and use and combine his or her unique abilities to defeat enemies. Rise of Apocalypse includes new mutant powers, playable characters, and environments. Also new to X-Men Legends II is online play, which lets you work cooperatively against other teams of mutants.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00743na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004800007264002700055300002300082500047300105542003000578655002500608GX2S5200aX-Men Legends II: El Ascenso de Apocalipsis 1bActivisionc2005-10-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn X-Men Legends II, the X-Men must join their enemy the Brotherhood to fight a greater menace--Apocalypse. The sequel to the team-based role-playing game X-Men Legends lets you play as one of many X-Men, and use and combine his or her unique abilities to defeat enemies. Rise of Apocalypse includes new mutant powers, playable characters, and environments. Also new to X-Men Legends II is online play, which lets you work cooperatively against other teams of mutants.  i2005kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00920na  a2200133   4500001000700000245000900007264003900016300002300055500057600078542004200654655002500696655002600721655003900747GX3E4100aXIII 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2003-11-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe president of the United States of America has been assassinated and you are the prime suspect. In XIII, you must unravel a conspiracy that left your memory erased, the President dead, and a bullet wound in your head. Evade assailants eager to end your life or use them as human shields. Select from a deadly arsenal of weapons including silent crossbows, furious automatic weapons, and ashtrays. Face off against other players in multiplayer modes such as Barfight or go co-op in Cover Me mode. Uncover both your shadowy past and America's darkest corridors of power.  i2003kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00882na  a2200121   4500001000700000245000900007264003900016300002300055500057600078542004200654655002500696655003900721GX3P4100aXIII 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2003-11-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe president of the United States of America has been assassinated and you are the prime suspect. In XIII, you must unravel a conspiracy that left your memory erased, the President dead, and a bullet wound in your head. Evade assailants eager to end your life or use them as human shields. Select from a deadly arsenal of weapons including silent crossbows, furious automatic weapons, and ashtrays. Face off against other players in multiplayer modes such as Barfight or go co-op in Cover Me mode. Uncover both your shadowy past and America's darkest corridors of power.  i2003kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00882na  a2200121   4500001000700000245000900007264003900016300002300055500057600078542004200654655002500696655003900721GX3X4100aXIII 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2003-11-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe president of the United States of America has been assassinated and you are the prime suspect. In XIII, you must unravel a conspiracy that left your memory erased, the President dead, and a bullet wound in your head. Evade assailants eager to end your life or use them as human shields. Select from a deadly arsenal of weapons including silent crossbows, furious automatic weapons, and ashtrays. Face off against other players in multiplayer modes such as Barfight or go co-op in Cover Me mode. Uncover both your shadowy past and America's darkest corridors of power.  i2003kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFirst-person shooter games2wiiext00867na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264002400046300002300070500056400093542002700657655002500684655003600709GXAE5100aXGRA: Extreme G Racing Association 1bAcclaimc2003-11-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aPull a few more Gs in the next installment of the Extreme-G series, XGRA: Extreme-G Racing Association. This futuristic racing game features all-new gameplay modes, features, weapons, bikes, controls, and unlockable content. Choose from unique characters on eight different teams and build your career through variable missions and storylines. Unlock new game modes, tracks, faster bikes, and character-enhancing cybernetic implants. Race in a variety of race tracks with destructible objects including bridges and spectators. Experience the future of racing.  i2003kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aFuturistic racing games2wiiext00865na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264002200046300002300068500056400091542002700655655002500682655003600707GXAP5100aXGRA: Extreme G Racing Association 1bAcclaimc2004-3-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aPull a few more Gs in the next installment of the Extreme-G series, XGRA: Extreme-G Racing Association. This futuristic racing game features all-new gameplay modes, features, weapons, bikes, controls, and unlockable content. Choose from unique characters on eight different teams and build your career through variable missions and storylines. Unlock new game modes, tracks, faster bikes, and character-enhancing cybernetic implants. Race in a variety of race tracks with destructible objects including bridges and spectators. Experience the future of racing.  i2004kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext 7aFuturistic racing games2wiiext00780na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001000007264003200017300002300049500049500072542003500567655002500602655003100627GXBE6900aSSX 3 1bElectronic Artsc2003-10-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aDrop in and conquer the massive, living mountain rife with ego-crushing challenges and gravity-bending thrills. SSX 3 returns with more slopes and all-new hazards to overcome including lightning storms, vertical drops, serpentine slopestyle courses and avalanches. Customize your rider's clothes, abilities, and moves. Pull off three levels of awesome "Uber tricks." Dominate the mountain, and then test your skills online. It's a long way down, so make sure you're ready for the challenge.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00222na  a2200097   4500001000700000245001000007264003800017300002300055500000500078542004100083GXBJ1300aSSX 3 1bElectronic Arts Japanc2003-12-12  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2003kElectronic Arts JapansGameTDB00780na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001000007264003200017300002300049500049500072542003500567655002500602655003100627GXBP6900aSSX 3 1bElectronic Artsc2003-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aDrop in and conquer the massive, living mountain rife with ego-crushing challenges and gravity-bending thrills. SSX 3 returns with more slopes and all-new hazards to overcome including lightning storms, vertical drops, serpentine slopestyle courses and avalanches. Customize your rider's clothes, abilities, and moves. Pull off three levels of awesome "Uber tricks." Dominate the mountain, and then test your skills online. It's a long way down, so make sure you're ready for the challenge.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00953na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001600007264002400023300002300047500072000070542002800790655002500818GXCE0100aCustom Robo 1bNintendoc2004-5-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aGameCube sequel to the Japan-only N64 mech battle titles. Players customize and build up their own mech soldiers by choosing from 200 different parts and weapons, then send them into battle in one of 30 different arenas. Arenas range from the canyon and warehouse stages found in the original game to all-new VR arenas. Each battle starts off with a casting of the dice -- only that these dice are the Robos in their undeployed state. They will then literally unfold Origami-style into the full-blown fighting machines. That's when the weaponry comes in. Using lasers, homing missiles, bombs, special attacks, tackles, and the all-important sentry drones, players blow each other sky-high in the battle for the cup.  i2004kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00971na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264002300042300002300065500072000088542002800808655002500836GXCJ0100aCustom Robo: Battle Revolution 1bNintendoc2004-3-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aGameCube sequel to the Japan-only N64 mech battle titles. Players customize and build up their own mech soldiers by choosing from 200 different parts and weapons, then send them into battle in one of 30 different arenas. Arenas range from the canyon and warehouse stages found in the original game to all-new VR arenas. Each battle starts off with a casting of the dice -- only that these dice are the Robos in their undeployed state. They will then literally unfold Origami-style into the full-blown fighting machines. That's when the weaponry comes in. Using lasers, homing missiles, bombs, special attacks, tackles, and the all-important sentry drones, players blow each other sky-high in the battle for the cup.  i2004kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00644na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264002600024300002300050500040600073542003000479655002500509GXEE8P00aSonic Riders 1bSega Japanc2006-2-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Sonic Riders, Dr. Eggman challenges Sonic and his friends to a Worldwide Grand Prix, and the prize for coming out on top is an ultra-rare Chaos Emerald! Gliding on air boards – which are performance-oriented for each playable character – gamers will experience a heightened sense of sports-style racing tension as Sonic and his pals perform tricks and stunts over treacherous wide-open terrain.  i2006kSega JapansGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00644na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264002600024300002300050500040600073542003000479655002500509GXEJ8P00aSonic Riders 1bSega Japanc2006-2-23  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Sonic Riders, Dr. Eggman challenges Sonic and his friends to a Worldwide Grand Prix, and the prize for coming out on top is an ultra-rare Chaos Emerald! Gliding on air boards – which are performance-oriented for each playable character – gamers will experience a heightened sense of sports-style racing tension as Sonic and his pals perform tricks and stunts over treacherous wide-open terrain.  i2006kSega JapansGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00644na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001700007264002600024300002300050500040600073542003000479655002500509GXEP8P00aSonic Riders 1bSega Japanc2006-3-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Sonic Riders, Dr. Eggman challenges Sonic and his friends to a Worldwide Grand Prix, and the prize for coming out on top is an ultra-rare Chaos Emerald! Gliding on air boards – which are performance-oriented for each playable character – gamers will experience a heightened sense of sports-style racing tension as Sonic and his pals perform tricks and stunts over treacherous wide-open terrain.  i2006kSega JapansGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00879na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264003200030300002300062500058500085542003500670655002500705655002700730GXFD6900aFIFA Football 2004 1bElectronic Artsc2003-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aFIFA 2004 its game up a few notches with new installment, FIFA Soccer 2004. This year's action features more advanced levels of player detail and responsiveness. Play as one of the best players from 16 leagues and 350 teams, from Europe's super leagues to the Americas. Plus, a new Career Mode gives you the chance to take a team from the lower divisions, battle through ranks, sign new players, and turn them into champions. With immersive atmospheres, total realism with the world's premier clubs, and improved gameplay, FIFA Soccer 2004 looks to reach the goals of soccer fans.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00882na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002100007264003100028300002300059500059300082542003500675655002500710655002500735GXFE6900aFIFA Soccer 2004 1bElectronic Artsc2003-4-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aFIFA Soccer kicks its game up a few notches with new installment, FIFA Soccer 2004. This year's action features more advanced levels of player detail and responsiveness. Play as one of the best players from 16 leagues and 350 teams, from Europe's super leagues to the Americas. Plus, a new Career Mode gives you the chance to take a team from the lower divisions, battle through ranks, sign new players, and turn them into champions. With immersive atmospheres, total realism with the world's premier clubs, and improved gameplay, FIFA Soccer 2004 looks to reach the goals of soccer fans.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSoccer games2wiiext00879na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264003200030300002300062500058500085542003500670655002500705655002700730GXFF6900aFIFA Football 2004 1bElectronic Artsc2003-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aFIFA 2004 its game up a few notches with new installment, FIFA Soccer 2004. This year's action features more advanced levels of player detail and responsiveness. Play as one of the best players from 16 leagues and 350 teams, from Europe's super leagues to the Americas. Plus, a new Career Mode gives you the chance to take a team from the lower divisions, battle through ranks, sign new players, and turn them into champions. With immersive atmospheres, total realism with the world's premier clubs, and improved gameplay, FIFA Soccer 2004 looks to reach the goals of soccer fans.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00879na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264003200030300002300062500058500085542003500670655002500705655002700730GXFI6900aFIFA Football 2004 1bElectronic Artsc2003-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aFIFA 2004 its game up a few notches with new installment, FIFA Soccer 2004. This year's action features more advanced levels of player detail and responsiveness. Play as one of the best players from 16 leagues and 350 teams, from Europe's super leagues to the Americas. Plus, a new Career Mode gives you the chance to take a team from the lower divisions, battle through ranks, sign new players, and turn them into champions. With immersive atmospheres, total realism with the world's premier clubs, and improved gameplay, FIFA Soccer 2004 looks to reach the goals of soccer fans.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00879na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264003200030300002300062500058500085542003500670655002500705655002700730GXFP6900aFIFA Football 2004 1bElectronic Artsc2003-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aFIFA 2004 its game up a few notches with new installment, FIFA Soccer 2004. This year's action features more advanced levels of player detail and responsiveness. Play as one of the best players from 16 leagues and 350 teams, from Europe's super leagues to the Americas. Plus, a new Career Mode gives you the chance to take a team from the lower divisions, battle through ranks, sign new players, and turn them into champions. With immersive atmospheres, total realism with the world's premier clubs, and improved gameplay, FIFA Soccer 2004 looks to reach the goals of soccer fans.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext00879na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002300007264003200030300002300062500058500085542003500670655002500705655002700730GXFS6900aFIFA Football 2004 1bElectronic Artsc2003-10-30  a1 Wii optical disc  aFIFA 2004 its game up a few notches with new installment, FIFA Soccer 2004. This year's action features more advanced levels of player detail and responsiveness. Play as one of the best players from 16 leagues and 350 teams, from Europe's super leagues to the Americas. Plus, a new Career Mode gives you the chance to take a team from the lower divisions, battle through ranks, sign new players, and turn them into champions. With immersive atmospheres, total realism with the world's premier clubs, and improved gameplay, FIFA Soccer 2004 looks to reach the goals of soccer fans.  i2003kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aFootball games2wiiext01665na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002600007264002200033300002300055500134500078542002601423655002501449655002701474655003001501GXGE0800aMega Man X Collection 1bCapcomc2006-1-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aCapcom's MEGA MAN has been one of the most beloved heroes ever since his debut on the original Nintendo. Now Game Cube gamers can relive all of the action and adventure of six of the greatest MEGA MAN titles in the MEGA MAN X COLLECTION. The first game in the collection is MEGA MAN X, which debuted on the Super Nintendo. This game introduces gamers to Mega Man X, a new version of Mega Man, and the world he lives in, which is significantly different from the world of the original Mega Man. Dr. Light and Mega Man must protect their world from Sigma, an evil organization that is bend on corrupting the robot Reploids and using them to take over the world. In addition to the first six MEGA MAN X games, the collection also includes the US premiere of MEGA MAN BATTLE & CHASE, an exciting racing game that pits Mega Man against a number of his enemies in a racing game. Of course, no one's going to play fair in their fight to the finish line, which means players will have to be on guard against attacks. Finally, the collection also includes a number of original and sketch art and remixed cuts from the original soundtracks from each game. Mega Man fans can't pass up the MEGA MAN X COLLECTION, and new gamers will find the anthology a bargain. Six MEGA MAN X games, a racing game, and tons of extras make the collection irresistible.  i2006kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a2D platform games2wiiext00742na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264002600025300002300051500050300074542003000577655002500607GXLE5200aX-Men Legends 1bActivisionc2004-9-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aX-Men enter the realm of role-playing games with an intense story, superhero action, and multiplayer modes. The story in X-Men Legends begins when the X-Men learn that Magneto has devised a plan to give mutants the power to reign supreme over humans. To save the human race from imprisonment, you compose a four-person team from a roster of X-Men characters, including Storm, Gambit, and Wolverine. Complete each mission to strengthen your team, and unlock more characters, costumes, and treasures.  i2004kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00743na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264002700025300002300052500050300075542003000578655002500608GXLP5200aX-Men Legends 1bActivisionc2004-10-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aX-Men enter the realm of role-playing games with an intense story, superhero action, and multiplayer modes. The story in X-Men Legends begins when the X-Men learn that Magneto has devised a plan to give mutants the power to reign supreme over humans. To save the human race from imprisonment, you compose a four-person team from a roster of X-Men characters, including Storm, Gambit, and Wolverine. Complete each mission to strengthen your team, and unlock more characters, costumes, and treasures.  i2004kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00743na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264002700025300002300052500050300075542003000578655002500608GXLX5200aX-Men Legends 1bActivisionc2004-10-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aX-Men enter the realm of role-playing games with an intense story, superhero action, and multiplayer modes. The story in X-Men Legends begins when the X-Men learn that Magneto has devised a plan to give mutants the power to reign supreme over humans. To save the human race from imprisonment, you compose a four-person team from a roster of X-Men characters, including Storm, Gambit, and Wolverine. Complete each mission to strengthen your team, and unlock more characters, costumes, and treasures.  i2004kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00726na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002700033300002300060500043900083542003000522655002500552655002700577GXME5200aX-Men: Next Dimension 1bActivisionc2002-10-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aFight in epic superhero showdowns against 24 of your favorite X-Men characters. In X-Men: The Next Dimension, a powerful enemy plots to rid the world of mutants, and only the X-Men can stop him. Choose from traditional or new X-Men--each with his or her own special fighting abilities and objects to interact with--and battle through destructible environments. Your mission to save the future will uncover secrets about your own past.  i2002kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00726na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002600007264002700033300002300060500043900083542003000522655002500552655002700577GXMP5200aX-Men: Next Dimension 1bActivisionc2002-11-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aFight in epic superhero showdowns against 24 of your favorite X-Men characters. In X-Men: The Next Dimension, a powerful enemy plots to rid the world of mutants, and only the X-Men can stop him. Choose from traditional or new X-Men--each with his or her own special fighting abilities and objects to interact with--and battle through destructible environments. Your mission to save the future will uncover secrets about your own past.  i2002kActivisionsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00864na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264003400038300002300072500059600095542003800691655002500729GXNE5D00aRampage: Total Destruction 1bMidway / Tradewestc2006-4-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aRampage: Total Destruction offers a fresh take on an arcade classic complete with everyone's favorite monsters: George, Lizzie, and Ralph, along with a variety of new monsters to collect and play. Virtually everything in the environment can be damaged, broken, and utterly destroyed with plenty of hilarious results. Aided by power-ups, the Rampage: Total Destruction monsters are capable of acquiring a number of upgrades throughout the course of a single campaign. Players can annihilate cities all over the world in either one or two player mode in this reinvention of the Midway classic.  i2006kMidway / TradewestsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00826na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003200023300002300055500053500078542003500613655002500648655003100673GXOE6900aSSX on Tour 1bElectronic Artsc2005-10-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aReach breakneck speeds, catch huge air, and become an icon with SSX On Tour. Create a rider or skier and build a career as you progress from a slope-side wannabe to a black-diamond dominating rockstar. Compete for medals or just tear up the massive new mountain, but make sure you look good doing it because your reputation is always on the line. Pull off jaw-dropping monster tricks to out-style your competitors while hurtling down the slopes at supersonic speeds. You create the hype - the hype creates a legend in SSX On Tour.  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00837na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002700007264003200034300002300066500053500089542003500624655002500659655003100684GXOJ1300aSSX on Tour with Mario 1bElectronic Artsc2005-11-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aReach breakneck speeds, catch huge air, and become an icon with SSX On Tour. Create a rider or skier and build a career as you progress from a slope-side wannabe to a black-diamond dominating rockstar. Compete for medals or just tear up the massive new mountain, but make sure you look good doing it because your reputation is always on the line. Pull off jaw-dropping monster tricks to out-style your competitors while hurtling down the slopes at supersonic speeds. You create the hype - the hype creates a legend in SSX On Tour.  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00826na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003200023300002300055500053500078542003500613655002500648655003100673GXOP6900aSSX on Tour 1bElectronic Artsc2005-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aReach breakneck speeds, catch huge air, and become an icon with SSX On Tour. Create a rider or skier and build a career as you progress from a slope-side wannabe to a black-diamond dominating rockstar. Compete for medals or just tear up the massive new mountain, but make sure you look good doing it because your reputation is always on the line. Pull off jaw-dropping monster tricks to out-style your competitors while hurtling down the slopes at supersonic speeds. You create the hype - the hype creates a legend in SSX On Tour.  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00826na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001600007264003200023300002300055500053500078542003500613655002500648655003100673GXOX6900aSSX on Tour 1bElectronic Artsc2005-10-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aReach breakneck speeds, catch huge air, and become an icon with SSX On Tour. Create a rider or skier and build a career as you progress from a slope-side wannabe to a black-diamond dominating rockstar. Compete for medals or just tear up the massive new mountain, but make sure you look good doing it because your reputation is always on the line. Pull off jaw-dropping monster tricks to out-style your competitors while hurtling down the slopes at supersonic speeds. You create the hype - the hype creates a legend in SSX On Tour.  i2005kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aSnowboarding games2wiiext00875na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264002000039300002300059500059500082542002300677655002500700655002800725GXPE7800aSphinx and the Cursed Mummy 1bTHQc2003-11-10  a1 Wii optical disc  aEurocom Entertainment, developers of the popular Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets and James Bond: 007 Nightfire take gamers on a mythological adventure through Egypt in Sphinx and the Cursed Mummy for Xbox, GameCube and PlayStation 2. Switch between two different characters, Sphinx and the Mummy, for a mix of exciting action, as well as stealth and puzzle solving elements. The worlds the character explores are huge and rich with detail and color; they overflow with fluid character model animation, advanced lighting and particle effects, massive geometry and crisp texture work.  i2003kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00874na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264001900039300002300058500059500081542002300676655002500699655002800724GXPP7800aSphinx and the Cursed Mummy 1bTHQc2004-2-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aEurocom Entertainment, developers of the popular Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets and James Bond: 007 Nightfire take gamers on a mythological adventure through Egypt in Sphinx and the Cursed Mummy for Xbox, GameCube and PlayStation 2. Switch between two different characters, Sphinx and the Mummy, for a mix of exciting action, as well as stealth and puzzle solving elements. The worlds the character explores are huge and rich with detail and color; they overflow with fluid character model animation, advanced lighting and particle effects, massive geometry and crisp texture work.  i2004kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00403na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002000007264003800027300002300065500013800088542004200226655002500268GXQF4100aTaxi 3 : Le Jeu 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2003-8-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aTaxi 3 is a mission-based driving game, developed by Ubisoft Montreal and published by Ubisoft, which was released in Europe in 2003.  i2003kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext01153na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264002200039300002300061500086500084542002600949655002500975655003101000GXRE0800aMega Man X: Command Mission 1bCapcomc2004-9-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aMega Man must infiltrate Giga City Island to thwart the evil plans of the Liberion Army who have initiated a riot in this RPG. By choosing from a selection of seven different playable characters, gamers construct a three-member attack force using Mega Man, Zero, Axl, and more, to help bring peace to the region once and for all. The game includes a revolutionary "Cross Order System" that allows flawless execution of special and finishing attack moves on enemies, such as Party Hookup, Action Trigger, Hyper Mode, or the linked main and sub-weapon Final Strike finishing move. Additionally, by using a super energy metal called Force Metal, players can upgrade weapons, abilities, and attack moves, greatly improving their character's capabilities. The GameCube version has Game Boy Advance connectivity in the form of a device that aids in treasure-hunting.  i2004kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext01152na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264002200038300002300060500086500083542002600948655002500974655003100999GXRJ0800aRockman X: Command Mission 1bCapcomc2004-7-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aMega Man must infiltrate Giga City Island to thwart the evil plans of the Liberion Army who have initiated a riot in this RPG. By choosing from a selection of seven different playable characters, gamers construct a three-member attack force using Mega Man, Zero, Axl, and more, to help bring peace to the region once and for all. The game includes a revolutionary "Cross Order System" that allows flawless execution of special and finishing attack moves on enemies, such as Party Hookup, Action Trigger, Hyper Mode, or the linked main and sub-weapon Final Strike finishing move. Additionally, by using a super energy metal called Force Metal, players can upgrade weapons, abilities, and attack moves, greatly improving their character's capabilities. The GameCube version has Game Boy Advance connectivity in the form of a device that aids in treasure-hunting.  i2004kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext01154na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003200007264002300039300002300062500086500085542002600950655002500976655003101001GXRP0800aMega Man X: Command Mission 1bCapcomc2004-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aMega Man must infiltrate Giga City Island to thwart the evil plans of the Liberion Army who have initiated a riot in this RPG. By choosing from a selection of seven different playable characters, gamers construct a three-member attack force using Mega Man, Zero, Axl, and more, to help bring peace to the region once and for all. The game includes a revolutionary "Cross Order System" that allows flawless execution of special and finishing attack moves on enemies, such as Party Hookup, Action Trigger, Hyper Mode, or the linked main and sub-weapon Final Strike finishing move. Additionally, by using a super energy metal called Force Metal, players can upgrade weapons, abilities, and attack moves, greatly improving their character's capabilities. The GameCube version has Game Boy Advance connectivity in the form of a device that aids in treasure-hunting.  i2004kCapcomsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext01050na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264002600046300002300072500075100095542003000846655002500876655002700901GXSE8P00aSonic Adventure DX: Director's Cut 1bSega Japanc2003-6-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aDr. Eggman is up to his old tricks again, but in this special Director's Cut version, there are a whole lot more of them to trip up Sonic and his pals. Get ready to go on 50 new adventures in the all-new Mission Mode as you strive to dismantle the evil genius' plans to rule the world. There are 12 exciting Bonus Games to unlock in the form of classic Sonic Game Gear titles. Whether you play as Sonic, Tails, Knuckles, Amy Rose, Big the Cat, or E102 Gamma, you'll get a unique adventure every time as each character has their own deep storyline and unique type of gameplay. Don't forget to visit your favorite Chao in the Chao Garden where you can take a break from saving the world and pit your Chao against others in a variety of tournaments.  i2003kSega JapansGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext01078na  a2200133   4500001000700000245003900007264002000046300002300066500075100089542002400840655002500864655002800889655002700917GXSP8P00aSonic Adventure DX: Director's Cut 1bSegac2003-6-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aDr. Eggman is up to his old tricks again, but in this special Director's Cut version, there are a whole lot more of them to trip up Sonic and his pals. Get ready to go on 50 new adventures in the all-new Mission Mode as you strive to dismantle the evil genius' plans to rule the world. There are 12 exciting Bonus Games to unlock in the form of classic Sonic Game Gear titles. Whether you play as Sonic, Tails, Knuckles, Amy Rose, Big the Cat, or E102 Gamma, you'll get a unique adventure every time as each character has their own deep storyline and unique type of gameplay. Don't forget to visit your favorite Chao in the Chao Garden where you can take a break from saving the world and pit your Chao against others in a variety of tournaments.  i2003kSegasGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00679na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001400007264003800021300002300059500042000082542004200502655002500544GXUE4100aSurf's Up 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-5-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aSurf's Up is a surfing game set at the annual "Reggie Belafonte Big Z Memorial Surf Off." Players choose from one of 10 characters from the film "Surf's Up" to play as, including Cody, the young challenger from Shiverpool; Tank, the merciless champion; or Big Z, the surfing legend from the past. Only by mastering and understanding the waves can the player become not only the new champion, but a true surf legend.  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00745na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264002400040300002300064500048900087542002800576655003100604GXXE0100aPokemon XD: Gale of Darkness 1bNintendoc2005-9-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aPokémon XD is a sequel to the role-playing game Pokémon Coliseum. You'll play as Michael, a Pokémon trainer who is trying to thwart the evil Cipher. Cipher plans to control the world by using the powerful, but unpredictable, shadow Pokémon. Now you must fight back by collecting your own shadow Pokémon and beating Cipher's goons in battle. Pokémon XD also lets you import Pokémon from Game Boy Advance Pokémon games and participate in head-to-head battles with other players.  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00783na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004000007264002300047300002300070500048900093542002800582655003100610655002000641GXXJ0100aPokemon XD: Yami no Kaze Dark Lugia 1bNintendoc2005-8-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aPokémon XD is a sequel to the role-playing game Pokémon Coliseum. You'll play as Michael, a Pokémon trainer who is trying to thwart the evil Cipher. Cipher plans to control the world by using the powerful, but unpredictable, shadow Pokémon. Now you must fight back by collecting your own shadow Pokémon and beating Cipher's goons in battle. Pokémon XD also lets you import Pokémon from Game Boy Advance Pokémon games and participate in head-to-head battles with other players.  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext 7aFantasy2wiiext00746na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003300007264002500040300002300065500048900088542002800577655003100605GXXP0100aPokemon XD: Gale of Darkness 1bNintendoc2005-11-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aPokémon XD is a sequel to the role-playing game Pokémon Coliseum. You'll play as Michael, a Pokémon trainer who is trying to thwart the evil Cipher. Cipher plans to control the world by using the powerful, but unpredictable, shadow Pokémon. Now you must fight back by collecting your own shadow Pokémon and beating Cipher's goons in battle. Pokémon XD also lets you import Pokémon from Game Boy Advance Pokémon games and participate in head-to-head battles with other players.  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00604na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002300026300002300049500033300072542002800405655002400433655002500457GY2E0100aDonkey Konga 2 1bNintendoc2005-5-9  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing a fresh choice of new music tracks, this is the second edition of Nintendo's rhythm and beat game starring characters from the Donkey Kong series of videogames. The game is controlled via the included conga controller and has up to four players hitting the two drums and clapping their hands to the rhythm of the beat.  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00621na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264002300043300002300066500033300089542002800422655002400450655002500474GY2J0100aDonkey Konga 2: Hit Song Parade 1bNintendoc2004-7-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing a fresh choice of new music tracks, this is the second edition of Nintendo's rhythm and beat game starring characters from the Donkey Kong series of videogames. The game is controlled via the included conga controller and has up to four players hitting the two drums and clapping their hands to the rhythm of the beat.  i2004kNintendosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00604na  a2200121   4500001000700000245001900007264002300026300002300049500033300072542002800405655002400433655002500457GY2P0100aDonkey Konga 2 1bNintendoc2005-6-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aFeaturing a fresh choice of new music tracks, this is the second edition of Nintendo's rhythm and beat game starring characters from the Donkey Kong series of videogames. The game is controlled via the included conga controller and has up to four players hitting the two drums and clapping their hands to the rhythm of the beat.  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00671na  a2200121   4500001000700000245005500007264002400062300002300086500036300109542002800472655002400500655002500524GY3J0100aDonkey Konga 3: Tabehoudai! Haru Mogitate 50-kyoku 1bNintendoc2005-3-17  a1 Wii optical disc  aonkey Konga 3: All You Can Eat! Spring 50 Song Mix) is a music video game in the Donkey Kong series by Nintendo and Namco. Before the second installment was released in North America, Nintendo and Namco had already started plans for the third game in the series, which was eventually released in Japan in early 2005. It features all new songs and mini-games.  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aMusic games2wiiext 7aRhythm games2wiiext00539na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264001900045300002300064500029400087542002300381655002500404GYAD7800aDe Tierisch verrueckte Bauernhofr 1bTHQc2007-2-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aBring the Barnyard movie to life! Battle the coyote invaders, tee up for a game of golf, target the bulls eye with your flying chicken and race downhill on your speedy bike. Explore a fully interactive, 3D world and prove they have what it takes to be the biggest party animal of them all.  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00513na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001300007264001800020300002300038500029400061542002300355655002500378GYAE7800aBarnyard 1bTHQc2006-8-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aBring the Barnyard movie to life! Battle the coyote invaders, tee up for a game of golf, target the bulls eye with your flying chicken and race downhill on your speedy bike. Explore a fully interactive, 3D world and prove they have what it takes to be the biggest party animal of them all.  i2006kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00515na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001300007264002000020300002300040500029400063542002300357655002500380GYAP7800aBarnyard 1bTHQc2006-10-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aBring the Barnyard movie to life! Battle the coyote invaders, tee up for a game of golf, target the bulls eye with your flying chicken and race downhill on your speedy bike. Explore a fully interactive, 3D world and prove they have what it takes to be the biggest party animal of them all.  i2006kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00514na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001300007264001900020300002300039500029400062542002300356655002500379GYAX7800aBarnyard 1bTHQc2007-2-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aBring the Barnyard movie to life! Battle the coyote invaders, tee up for a game of golf, target the bulls eye with your flying chicken and race downhill on your speedy bike. Explore a fully interactive, 3D world and prove they have what it takes to be the biggest party animal of them all.  i2007kTHQsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext01069na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002400035300002300059500078800082542002800870655002500898655002400923GYBE0100aDonkey Kong Jungle Beat 1bNintendoc2005-3-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe big ape is drumming up a new beat for platformers with this unique action game played entirely with the DK Bongo controller. Grab a set of DK Bongo controllers and use them to guide Donkey Kong through wild jungle environments brimming with ravenous enemies and challenging obstacles. Tap the bongos, do a drum roll or clap to control Donkey Kong on the screen! Right conga makes DK go right, left conga makes him go left -- hit them both to jump or clap (or hit the rim) to trigger a wave that knocks over enemies or attracts bananas. As you "drum" your way through diverse stages ranging from lush jungles to floating jelly in the sky, you will battle enormous beasts, collect bananas, get in boxing matches with rivals and even ride animals and vehicles in a jungle gone wild!  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aMusic games2wiiext01070na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002500035300002300060500078800083542002800871655002500899655002400924GYBJ0100aDonkey Kong Jungle Beat 1bNintendoc2004-12-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe big ape is drumming up a new beat for platformers with this unique action game played entirely with the DK Bongo controller. Grab a set of DK Bongo controllers and use them to guide Donkey Kong through wild jungle environments brimming with ravenous enemies and challenging obstacles. Tap the bongos, do a drum roll or clap to control Donkey Kong on the screen! Right conga makes DK go right, left conga makes him go left -- hit them both to jump or clap (or hit the rim) to trigger a wave that knocks over enemies or attracts bananas. As you "drum" your way through diverse stages ranging from lush jungles to floating jelly in the sky, you will battle enormous beasts, collect bananas, get in boxing matches with rivals and even ride animals and vehicles in a jungle gone wild!  i2004kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aMusic games2wiiext01068na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002800007264002300035300002300058500078800081542002800869655002500897655002400922GYBP0100aDonkey Kong Jungle Beat 1bNintendoc2005-2-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe big ape is drumming up a new beat for platformers with this unique action game played entirely with the DK Bongo controller. Grab a set of DK Bongo controllers and use them to guide Donkey Kong through wild jungle environments brimming with ravenous enemies and challenging obstacles. Tap the bongos, do a drum roll or clap to control Donkey Kong on the screen! Right conga makes DK go right, left conga makes him go left -- hit them both to jump or clap (or hit the rim) to trigger a wave that knocks over enemies or attracts bananas. As you "drum" your way through diverse stages ranging from lush jungles to floating jelly in the sky, you will battle enormous beasts, collect bananas, get in boxing matches with rivals and even ride animals and vehicles in a jungle gone wild!  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aMusic games2wiiext00796na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002200044300002300066500049400089542002600583655002700609655003800636GYFEA400aYu-Gi-Oh! The Falsebound Kingdom 1bKonamic2003-11-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aYugi and his friends are trapped in a virtual reality world gone crazy. As Yugi or Kaiba, you must form a team of three monsters to occupy towns across two different scenarios and take part in strategic team battles. Delegate commands to your team to conquer each mission. During battle, your team can perform devastating group attacks and combos. Over 175 monsters from the Yu-Gi-Oh! animated TV series appear in the game--and all of them will fight to the finish for control of each map.  i2003kKonamisGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aTurn-based strategy games2wiiext00821na  a2200121   4500001000700000245006200007264002200069300002300091500049400114542002600608655002700634655003800661GYFJA400aYu-Gi-Oh! Falsebound Kingdom: Kyokou ni Tozasareta Oukoku 1bKonamic2002-12-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aYugi and his friends are trapped in a virtual reality world gone crazy. As Yugi or Kaiba, you must form a team of three monsters to occupy towns across two different scenarios and take part in strategic team battles. Delegate commands to your team to conquer each mission. During battle, your team can perform devastating group attacks and combos. Over 175 monsters from the Yu-Gi-Oh! animated TV series appear in the game--and all of them will fight to the finish for control of each map.  i2002kKonamisGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aTurn-based strategy games2wiiext00797na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003700007264002300044300002300067500049400090542002600584655002700610655003800637GYFPA400aYu-Gi-Oh! The Falsebound Kingdom 1bKonamic2004-11-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aYugi and his friends are trapped in a virtual reality world gone crazy. As Yugi or Kaiba, you must form a team of three monsters to occupy towns across two different scenarios and take part in strategic team battles. Delegate commands to your team to conquer each mission. During battle, your team can perform devastating group attacks and combos. Over 175 monsters from the Yu-Gi-Oh! animated TV series appear in the game--and all of them will fight to the finish for control of each map.  i2004kKonamisGameTDB 7aStrategy games2wiiext 7aTurn-based strategy games2wiiext00529na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003100007264002300038300002300061500028400084542002600368655002500394GYKEB200aZatch Bell! Mamodo Battles 1bBandaic2005-10-19  a1 Wii optical disc  aEvery one thousand years, one hundred mamodo descend upon the earth to conduct the ultimate battle for the mamodo throne! But to unlock the power of their spell books, the mamodo must find their human partners! Grab your spell book, choose your team and let the battles commence!  i2005kBandaisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00543na  a2200109   4500001000700000245004600007264002200053300002300075500028400098542002600382655002500408GYKJB200aKonjiki no Gashbell!! Yuujou Tag Battle 2 1bBandaic2005-3-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aEvery one thousand years, one hundred mamodo descend upon the earth to conduct the ultimate battle for the mamodo throne! But to unlock the power of their spell books, the mamodo must find their human partners! Grab your spell book, choose your team and let the battles commence!  i2005kBandaisGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00360na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003400007264002200041300002300063500007400086542002600160655002500186655002700211GYMJA400aJikkyou Powerful Major League 1bKonamic2006-5-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aA variation of the Power Pro series with Major League Baseball teams.  i2006kKonamisGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext01169na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002900007264002500036300002300061500084600084542002800930655002500958655002500983655002701008GYQE0100aMario Superstar Baseball 1bNintendoc2005-10-29  a1 Wii optical disc  aContinuing the tradition started by such games as Mario Power Tennis and Mario Golf: Toadstool Tour, Mario Superstar Baseball brings a new brand of fun to the world of baseball. The game combines an intuitive hitting system with easy-to-learn fielding and pitching controls – making it an arcade-like experience that will appeal to baseball novices and hard-core fans alike. Players can try their hands at Challenge Mode, where they must wander the land clearing baseball-related trials. Or they can sit down for a game in the Toy Field, where they hit balls at circles in the outfield to earn coins and other prizes. With multiplayer options for up to four players, wild, character-specific power moves, crazy mini-games and more than 50 characters from the Mario universe, Mario Superstar Baseball is sure to be the new favorite pastime.  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext01144na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004200007264002400049300002300073500084600096542002800942655002500970655002700995GYQJ0100aSuper Mario Stadium: Miracle Baseball 1bNintendoc2005-7-21  a1 Wii optical disc  aContinuing the tradition started by such games as Mario Power Tennis and Mario Golf: Toadstool Tour, Mario Superstar Baseball brings a new brand of fun to the world of baseball. The game combines an intuitive hitting system with easy-to-learn fielding and pitching controls – making it an arcade-like experience that will appeal to baseball novices and hard-core fans alike. Players can try their hands at Challenge Mode, where they must wander the land clearing baseball-related trials. Or they can sit down for a game in the Toy Field, where they hit balls at circles in the outfield to earn coins and other prizes. With multiplayer options for up to four players, wild, character-specific power moves, crazy mini-games and more than 50 characters from the Mario universe, Mario Superstar Baseball is sure to be the new favorite pastime.  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext01169na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002900007264002500036300002300061500084600084542002800930655002500958655002500983655002701008GYQP0100aMario Superstar Baseball 1bNintendoc2005-11-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aContinuing the tradition started by such games as Mario Power Tennis and Mario Golf: Toadstool Tour, Mario Superstar Baseball brings a new brand of fun to the world of baseball. The game combines an intuitive hitting system with easy-to-learn fielding and pitching controls – making it an arcade-like experience that will appeal to baseball novices and hard-core fans alike. Players can try their hands at Challenge Mode, where they must wander the land clearing baseball-related trials. Or they can sit down for a game in the Toy Field, where they hit balls at circles in the outfield to earn coins and other prizes. With multiplayer options for up to four players, wild, character-specific power moves, crazy mini-games and more than 50 characters from the Mario universe, Mario Superstar Baseball is sure to be the new favorite pastime.  i2005kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aSports games2wiiext 7aBaseball games2wiiext00815na  a2200121   4500001000700000245000900007264003800016300002300054500052100077542004200598655002500640655002800665GYRE4100aTMNT 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-3-20  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe new NT video game uses the same dark and dangerous environments and adventurous themes featured in the new NT CGI film being developed by Imagi Animation Studios and Mirage Licensing. The NT movie takes place in a New York City plagued by secretive villains and strange, otherworldly creatures. Faced with these perils, the Turtles will experience their most trying time as heroes and as a family, as Raphael, Donatello and Michelangelo lose their focus and struggle to maintain their unity and ninja discipline.  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00815na  a2200121   4500001000700000245000900007264003800016300002300054500052100077542004200598655002500640655002800665GYRP4100aTMNT 1bUbi Soft Entertainmentc2007-3-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe new NT video game uses the same dark and dangerous environments and adventurous themes featured in the new NT CGI film being developed by Imagi Animation Studios and Mirage Licensing. The NT movie takes place in a New York City plagued by secretive villains and strange, otherworldly creatures. Faced with these perils, the Turtles will experience their most trying time as heroes and as a family, as Raphael, Donatello and Michelangelo lose their focus and struggle to maintain their unity and ninja discipline.  i2007kUbi Soft EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00815na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004200007264003200049300002300081500050200104542003500606655002500641655002700666GYTE6900aTY the Tasmanian Tiger 2: Bush Rescue 1bElectronic Artsc2004-10-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe tiger returns to take back the Outback in Ty the Tasmanian Tiger 2. The evil Boss Cass has broken out of Currawong Jail and has hatched a plan to take over the world with an army of Uber Reptiles. Now it's up to Ty, the boomerang-wielding hero, and his newly formed team of Burramudgee Bush Rescue mates to stop him. As Ty, you can explore an expansive open environment on foot or in a vehicle. You'll also have access to more boomerangs and mech units, each with special powers and abilities.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00815na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004200007264003200049300002300081500050200104542003500606655002500641655002700666GYTP6900aTY the Tasmanian Tiger 2: Bush Rescue 1bElectronic Artsc2004-10-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe tiger returns to take back the Outback in Ty the Tasmanian Tiger 2. The evil Boss Cass has broken out of Currawong Jail and has hatched a plan to take over the world with an army of Uber Reptiles. Now it's up to Ty, the boomerang-wielding hero, and his newly formed team of Burramudgee Bush Rescue mates to stop him. As Ty, you can explore an expansive open environment on foot or in a vehicle. You'll also have access to more boomerangs and mech units, each with special powers and abilities.  i2004kElectronic ArtssGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext00846na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264002300042300002300065500059000088542002700678655003100705GYWDE900aHarvest Moon: A Wonderful Life 1bUbisoftc2004-6-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe latest in the Harvest Moon series, a Wonderful Life pits gamers in a real-life simulation that spans the equivalent of 30 years. As you blossom from a young man into a mature adult you will be able to date, get married, and have a child that will eventually become a huge part of your life. For instance, you might have a boy who will grow to work side-by-side with you helping to farm your crops. So, having a child will have a huge affect on your life. The third-person roleplaying simulation features more than 40 characters to interact with as well as Game Boy Advance link-up.  i2004kUbisoftsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00878na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264003900042300002300081500059000104542004300694655003100737GYWEE900aHarvest Moon: A Wonderful Life 1bMarvelous Entertainmentc2004-3-16  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe latest in the Harvest Moon series, a Wonderful Life pits gamers in a real-life simulation that spans the equivalent of 30 years. As you blossom from a young man into a mature adult you will be able to date, get married, and have a child that will eventually become a huge part of your life. For instance, you might have a boy who will grow to work side-by-side with you helping to farm your crops. So, having a child will have a huge affect on your life. The third-person roleplaying simulation features more than 40 characters to interact with as well as Game Boy Advance link-up.  i2004kMarvelous EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00923na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003900007264003900046300002300085500059000108542004300698655002900741655003100770GYWJ9900aBokujou Monogatari: Wonderful Life 1bMarvelous Entertainmentc2003-9-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe latest in the Harvest Moon series, a Wonderful Life pits gamers in a real-life simulation that spans the equivalent of 30 years. As you blossom from a young man into a mature adult you will be able to date, get married, and have a child that will eventually become a huge part of your life. For instance, you might have a boy who will grow to work side-by-side with you helping to farm your crops. So, having a child will have a huge affect on your life. The third-person roleplaying simulation features more than 40 characters to interact with as well as Game Boy Advance link-up.  i2003kMarvelous EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aRole-playing games2wiiext00951na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003500007264002300042300002300065500069500088542002700783655003100810GYWPE900aHarvest Moon: A Wonderful Life 1bUbisoftc2004-6-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aThe latest in the Harvest Moon series, a Wonderful Life pits gamers in a real-life simulation that spans the equivalent of 30 years. As you blossom from a young man into a mature adult you will be able to date, get married, and have a child that will eventually become a huge part of your life. For instance, you might have a boy who will grow to work side-by-side with you helping to farm your crops. So, having a child will have a huge affect on your life. The third-person roleplaying simulation features more than 40 characters to interact with as well as Game Boy Advance link-up. *NOTE- This game requires 47 blocks on a memory card to save, a standard memory card has only 59 blocks*  i2004kUbisoftsGameTDB 7aRole-playing games2wiiext01212na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264002500050300002300075500091100098542002801009655002501037655002801062GZ2E0104aThe Legend of Zelda: Twilight Princess 1bNintendoc2006-12-11  a1 Wii optical disc  aLink, a young man raised as a wrangler in a small, rural village, is ordered by the mayor to attend the Hyrule Summit. He sets off, oblivious to the dark fate that has descended upon the kingdom. When he enters the Twilight Realm that has covered Hyrule, he transforms into a wolf and is captured. A mysterious figure named Midna helps him break free, and with the aid of her magic, they set off to free the land from the shadows. Link must explore the vast land of Hyrule and uncover the mystery behind its plunge into darkness. As he does, he'll have to enlist the aid of friendly folk, solve puzzles and battle his way through dangerous dungeons. In the Twilight Realm, he’ll have to use his wolf abilities and Midna’s magic to bring light to the land. Besides his trusty sword and shield, Link will use his bow and arrows, fight while on horseback and use a wealth of other items, both new and old.  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01209na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264002400048300002300072500091100095542002801006655002501034655002801059GZ2J0100aZelda no Densetsu: Twilight Princess 1bNintendoc2006-12-2  a1 Wii optical disc  aLink, a young man raised as a wrangler in a small, rural village, is ordered by the mayor to attend the Hyrule Summit. He sets off, oblivious to the dark fate that has descended upon the kingdom. When he enters the Twilight Realm that has covered Hyrule, he transforms into a wolf and is captured. A mysterious figure named Midna helps him break free, and with the aid of her magic, they set off to free the land from the shadows. Link must explore the vast land of Hyrule and uncover the mystery behind its plunge into darkness. As he does, he'll have to enlist the aid of friendly folk, solve puzzles and battle his way through dangerous dungeons. In the Twilight Realm, he’ll have to use his wolf abilities and Midna’s magic to bring light to the land. Besides his trusty sword and shield, Link will use his bow and arrows, fight while on horseback and use a wealth of other items, both new and old.  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext01212na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004300007264002500050300002300075500091100098542002801009655002501037655002801062GZ2P0104aThe Legend of Zelda: Twilight Princess 1bNintendoc2006-12-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aLink, a young man raised as a wrangler in a small, rural village, is ordered by the mayor to attend the Hyrule Summit. He sets off, oblivious to the dark fate that has descended upon the kingdom. When he enters the Twilight Realm that has covered Hyrule, he transforms into a wolf and is captured. A mysterious figure named Midna helps him break free, and with the aid of her magic, they set off to free the land from the shadows. Link must explore the vast land of Hyrule and uncover the mystery behind its plunge into darkness. As he does, he'll have to enlist the aid of friendly folk, solve puzzles and battle his way through dangerous dungeons. In the Twilight Realm, he’ll have to use his wolf abilities and Midna’s magic to bring light to the land. Besides his trusty sword and shield, Link will use his bow and arrows, fight while on horseback and use a wealth of other items, both new and old.  i2006kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00774na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002900007264003500036300002300071500046800094542003800562655002500600655002700625GZ3E7000aDragon Ball Z: Budokai 2 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2004-12-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aGo to the next level in the Dragon Ball Z saga. Dragon Ball Z: Budokai 2 improves upon the first installment by adding an all-new single player mode, new characters and explosive attacks. Experience the new match-ups, character cameos and challenging missions in "Dragon World." Pick your favorite DBZ hero or enemy and take on a friend in "Vs." and "Tournament" modes. If you're really good, you will soon come face-to-face with Buu, the most lethal DBZ villain.  i2004kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00736na  a2200109   4500001000700000245002900007264003400036300002300070500046800093542003800561655002700599GZ3PB200aDragon Ball Z: Budokai 2 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2005-3-18  a1 Wii optical disc  aGo to the next level in the Dragon Ball Z saga. Dragon Ball Z: Budokai 2 improves upon the first installment by adding an all-new single player mode, new characters and explosive attacks. Experience the new match-ups, character cameos and challenging missions in "Dragon World." Pick your favorite DBZ hero or enemy and take on a friend in "Vs." and "Tournament" modes. If you're really good, you will soon come face-to-face with Buu, the most lethal DBZ villain.  i2005kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00292na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001800007264002300025300002300048500005800071542002600129655002700155GZBJB200aDragon Ball Z 1bBandaic2003-11-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aGameCube version of Atari's best-selling DBZ brawler.  i2003kBandaisGameTDB 7aFighting games2wiiext00667na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001200007264002200019300002300041500044100064542002700505655002500532GZCE5100aZooCube 1bAcclaimc2002-5-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aZooCube tests your reflexes with fast-paced puzzle action. Simple to learn, but tough to master, ZooCube features a variety of 3D puzzles that you can solve by yourself or cooperatively with a friend. You can even challenge your friend in head-to-head multiplayer mode or try out 11 other different modes. In this intense puzzle experience, you must rotate the puzzles and collect special power-ups and bonuses to keep the action going.  i2002kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00669na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001200007264002400019300002300043500044100066542002700507655002500534GZCJB000aZooCube 1bAcclaimc2002-10-25  a1 Wii optical disc  aZooCube tests your reflexes with fast-paced puzzle action. Simple to learn, but tough to master, ZooCube features a variety of 3D puzzles that you can solve by yourself or cooperatively with a friend. You can even challenge your friend in head-to-head multiplayer mode or try out 11 other different modes. In this intense puzzle experience, you must rotate the puzzles and collect special power-ups and bonuses to keep the action going.  i2002kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00667na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001200007264002200019300002300041500044100064542002700505655002500532GZCP5100aZooCube 1bAcclaimc2010-1-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aZooCube tests your reflexes with fast-paced puzzle action. Simple to learn, but tough to master, ZooCube features a variety of 3D puzzles that you can solve by yourself or cooperatively with a friend. You can even challenge your friend in head-to-head multiplayer mode or try out 11 other different modes. In this intense puzzle experience, you must rotate the puzzles and collect special power-ups and bonuses to keep the action going.  i2010kAcclaimsGameTDB 7aPuzzle games2wiiext00844na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264003400048300002300082500052700105542003800632655002500670655002700695GZDE7000aGodzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2002-10-8  a1 Wii optical disc  aLegendary monsters battle among Earth's cities to determine the planet's fate. In Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee, you can play as Godzilla or any of his longtime rivals as they fight hand-to-hand, at close range, and with special moves. Each massive beast has different physical attributes and special projectile weapons. You'll fight in cities such as Tokyo and San Francisco--all featuring real building destruction and physics. For multiplayer fighting mayhem, you can bring three of your friends into the battle.  i2002kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00835na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264003500038300002300073500052700096542003800623655002500661655002700686GZDJ7000aGodzilla: Kaijuu Dairantou 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2002-12-12  a1 Wii optical disc  aLegendary monsters battle among Earth's cities to determine the planet's fate. In Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee, you can play as Godzilla or any of his longtime rivals as they fight hand-to-hand, at close range, and with special moves. Each massive beast has different physical attributes and special projectile weapons. You'll fight in cities such as Tokyo and San Francisco--all featuring real building destruction and physics. For multiplayer fighting mayhem, you can bring three of your friends into the battle.  i2002kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00845na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004100007264003500048300002300083500052700106542003800633655002500671655002700696GZDP7000aGodzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2002-11-15  a1 Wii optical disc  aLegendary monsters battle among Earth's cities to determine the planet's fate. In Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee, you can play as Godzilla or any of his longtime rivals as they fight hand-to-hand, at close range, and with special moves. Each massive beast has different physical attributes and special projectile weapons. You'll fight in cities such as Tokyo and San Francisco--all featuring real building destruction and physics. For multiplayer fighting mayhem, you can bring three of your friends into the battle.  i2002kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext00984na  a2200121   4500001000700000245002500007264003400032300002300066500068200089542003800771655002500809655002800834GZEE7000aDragon Ball Z: Sagas 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2005-3-22  a1 Wii optical disc  aFor the first time in Atari's Dragon Ball Z series, console gamers get to explore DBZ as they wish in this action-adventure title with RPG elements that spans the storylines from the Saiyan Saga through the Cell Games Saga. Players will journey from Earth to Namek and beyond in a 3-D action-adventure featuring melee, ranged attacks and destructible environments. Play as many of the greatest Z-Warriors, including Goku, Piccolo or even Gohan, complete with Super Saiyan forms. Battle through six different story arcs that pit you against infamous enemies, such as Nappa, Captain Ginyu, Raditz, Frieza, and Cell. Explore never-before-seen elements of the Dragon Ball Z series.  i2005kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00502na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003100007264003700038300002300075500017500098542004200273655002900315655003600344GZFJBP00aRei Fighter Gekitsui Senki 1bGlobal A Entertainmentc2003-3-6  a1 Wii optical disc  aZero Fighter is a flight shooting game similar to Namco's Ace Combat series. The game features 33 playable aircraft models and 3 play modes: Mission, Training and Versus.  i2003kGlobal A EntertainmentsGameTDB 7aSimulation games2wiiext 7aFlight simulation games2wiiext00480na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002800007264002100035300002300056500016100079542002400240655002500264655002700289655003000316GZHJDA00aZoids: Full Metal Crash 1bTomyc2005-10-27  a1 Wii optical disc  aZoids Full Metal Crash was the first Zoids game to be released on the Gamecube. The game includes a story mode which loosely followes the television series.  i2005kTomysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aFighting games2wiiext 7a3D fighting games2wiiext00905na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004000007264002400047300002300071500060800094542002800702655002500730655002800755GZLE0104aThe Legend of Zelda: The Wind Waker 1bNintendoc2003-3-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aNintendo's thematic action-adventure sequel to Ocarina of Time takes the series back to its more cartoonish roots. Utilizing a completely new look with cel-shaded graphics, the game casts players in the role of a familiar young boy, who sets out to save his kidnapped sister. Gameplay is vintage Zelda, only that the game's overworld is covered by water. Players have to control the direction of the wind to sail across the ocean and find dungeons, towns, and plenty of secrets. A special Game Boy Advance link-up option lets another player join the quest and give hints and assistance via the handheld.  i2003kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00902na  a2200121   4500001000700000245003600007264002500043300002300068500060800091542002800699655002500727655002800752GZLJ0100aZelda no Densetsu: Kaze no Takt 1bNintendoc2002-12-13  a1 Wii optical disc  aNintendo's thematic action-adventure sequel to Ocarina of Time takes the series back to its more cartoonish roots. Utilizing a completely new look with cel-shaded graphics, the game casts players in the role of a familiar young boy, who sets out to save his kidnapped sister. Gameplay is vintage Zelda, only that the game's overworld is covered by water. Players have to control the direction of the wind to sail across the ocean and find dungeons, towns, and plenty of secrets. A special Game Boy Advance link-up option lets another player join the quest and give hints and assistance via the handheld.  i2002kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00904na  a2200121   4500001000700000245004000007264002300047300002300070500060800093542002800701655002500729655002800754GZLP0104aThe Legend of Zelda: The Wind Waker 1bNintendoc2003-5-3  a1 Wii optical disc  aNintendo's thematic action-adventure sequel to Ocarina of Time takes the series back to its more cartoonish roots. Utilizing a completely new look with cel-shaded graphics, the game casts players in the role of a familiar young boy, who sets out to save his kidnapped sister. Gameplay is vintage Zelda, only that the game's overworld is covered by water. Players have to control the direction of the wind to sail across the ocean and find dungeons, towns, and plenty of secrets. A special Game Boy Advance link-up option lets another player join the quest and give hints and assistance via the handheld.  i2003kNintendosGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aAdventure games2wiiext00560na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003800007264005100045300002300096500025100119542005500370655002500425GZMP7D00aButt-Ugly Martians: Zoom or Doom! 1bCrave Entertainment / Vivendi Gamesc2002-12-6  a1 Wii optical disc  a•Race the fastest; most futuristic vehicles in the universe; race across 9 intergalactic alien landscapes; fight off enemy attacks at every turn; fastest racers win the Martian Conqueror's Cup; a heart-pounding, interstellar racing championship  i2002kCrave Entertainment / Vivendi GamessGameTDB 7aRacing games2wiiext00316na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001400007264001900021300002300040500000500063542002400068655002500092655002600117655003900143GZOJDA00aZoids Vs. 1bTomyc2002-9-6  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2002kTomysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aThird-person shooter games2wiiext00818na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001100007264003400018300002300052500048900075542003800564655002500602655002700627655003000654GZPE7000aZapper 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2002-11-6  a1 Wii optical disc  an Zapper, you play a small creature that embarks on a great quest. Zapper is a cricket in search of brother Zipper, who was kidnapped by the evil Maggie the Magpie. Through 18 twisted levels, you'll evade bizarre enemies and deadly hazards using your electrified antennae and springy reflexes. Zap your foes, explore your surroundings, and find and destroy eggs before they hatch. Zapper's intense action continues as you unlock hidden areas, bonus levels, and play multiplayer games.  i2002kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00803na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001100007264002600018300002300044500049000067542003000557655002500587655002700612655003000639GZPP7000aZapper 1bInfogramesc2003-3-14  a1 Wii optical disc  aIn Zapper, you play a small creature that embarks on a great quest. Zapper is a cricket in search of brother Zipper, who was kidnapped by the evil Maggie the Magpie. Through 18 twisted levels, you'll evade bizarre enemies and deadly hazards using your electrified antennae and springy reflexes. Zap your foes, explore your surroundings, and find and destroy eggs before they hatch. Zapper's intense action continues as you unlock hidden areas, bonus levels, and play multiplayer games.  i2003kInfogramessGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aPlatform games2wiiext 7a3D platform games2wiiext00727na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001100007264004600018300002300064500045500087542005000542655002500592GZQE7D00aRobots 1bSierra / Universal Interactivec2005-2-24  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on the animated feature film of the same name, Robots brings you to a world where human-like machines walk the earth. You play as Rodney Copperbottom--a genius inventor robot who uncovers a villain's plot to take over the city. With the help of your friends, you must overcome challenging obstacles to realize your dreams. The game lets you ride fast robot vehicles, upgrade your arsenal of gadgets, battle evil robots, solve puzzles, and more.  i2005kSierra / Universal InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00701na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001100007264003300018300002300051500045500074542003700529655002500566GZQJ7D00aRobots 1bVivendi Universalc2005-7-28  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on the animated feature film of the same name, Robots brings you to a world where human-like machines walk the earth. You play as Rodney Copperbottom--a genius inventor robot who uncovers a villain's plot to take over the city. With the help of your friends, you must overcome challenging obstacles to realize your dreams. The game lets you ride fast robot vehicles, upgrade your arsenal of gadgets, battle evil robots, solve puzzles, and more.  i2005kVivendi UniversalsGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00726na  a2200109   4500001000700000245001100007264004500018300002300063500045500086542005000541655002500591GZQP7D00aRobots 1bSierra / Universal Interactivec2005-4-1  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on the animated feature film of the same name, Robots brings you to a world where human-like machines walk the earth. You play as Rodney Copperbottom--a genius inventor robot who uncovers a villain's plot to take over the city. With the help of your friends, you must overcome challenging obstacles to realize your dreams. The game lets you ride fast robot vehicles, upgrade your arsenal of gadgets, battle evil robots, solve puzzles, and more.  i2005kSierra / Universal InteractivesGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext00482na  a2200133   4500001000700000245002600007264003300033300002300066500013100089542003800220655002500258655002600283655003900309GZSE7000aZoids: Battle Legends 1bAtari (Infogrames)c2004-9-4  a1 Wii optical disc  aZoids: Battle Legends is a Beat-'Em-Up game, developed by Tomy Corporation and published by Atari, which was released in 2004.  i2004kAtari (Infogrames)sGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aThird-person shooter games2wiiext00634na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001700007264001900024300002300043500032000066542002400386655002500410655002600435655003900461GZSJDA00aZoids Vs. II 1bTomyc2003-9-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aBased on the Zoids anime cartoons Tomy brings a sequel of Zoids Versus to the Nintendo GameCube in Japan. Zoids Versus, released in Japan a year ago, is a simulation of actually piloting a Zoid. You can face off against various computer opponents advancing in rank or face your friend in the two player battle mode.  i2003kTomysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aThird-person shooter games2wiiext00321na  a2200133   4500001000700000245001800007264002000025300002300045500000500068542002400073655002500097655002600122655003900148GZVJDA00aZoids Vs. III 1bTomyc2004-9-30  a1 Wii optical disc  a  i2004kTomysGameTDB 7aAction games2wiiext 7aShooter games2wiiext 7aThird-person shooter games2wiiext00625na  a2200109   4500001000700000245003900007264002300046300002300069500037100092542002800463655002400491GZWE0100aWarioWare, Inc.: Mega Party Game$! 1bNintendoc2004-4-5  a1 Wii optical disc  aWario is back in the video game biz, and this time the tightfisted microgame master is servin' up some insane party games on Nintendo GameCube. The 200+ hysterical microgames from Wario Ware, Inc.: Mega Microgame$ are making a triumphant return on the big screen, supported by wildly creative multiplayer matches starring Wario's crazy crew of video game developers.  i2004kNintendosGameTDB 7aParty games2wiiext00654na  a2200121   45000010007000002450029000072640025000363000023000615000371000845420028004